msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar module enhances the <a href=\":toolbar\">Toolbar</a> "
"module by providing fast access to all the administrative links at the "
"top of your site. Admin Toolbar remains a very \"lightweight\" module "
"by closely integrating with all Toolbar functionality. It can be used "
"in conjunction with all the sub modules included on Admin Toolbar, for "
"quick access to system commands such as Flush all caches, <a "
"href=\":automated_cron\">Run cron</a>, Run Updates, etc."
msgstr ""
"Modul Admin Toolbar nambahake modul <a href=\":toolbar\">Toolbar</a> "
"kanthi menehi akses cepet menyang kabeh pranala administratif ing "
"sisih ndhuwur situs sampeyan. Admin Toolbar tetep dadi modul sing "
"\"lightweight\" banget kanthi integrasi rapet karo kabeh fungsi "
"Toolbar. Modul iki bisa digunakake bebarengan karo kabeh sub modul "
"sing klebu ing Admin Toolbar, kanggo akses cepet menyang perintah "
"sistem kaya Flush all caches, <a href=\":automated_cron\">Run "
"cron</a>, Run Updates, lsp."

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar greatly improves the user experience for those who "
"regularly interact with the site Toolbar by providing fast, full "
"access to all links in the site Toolbar without having to click to get "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Toolbar Admin banget nambah pengalaman pangguna kanggo sing kerep "
"sesambungan karo Toolbar situs kanthi nyedhiyakake akses cepet lan "
"lengkap kanggo kabeh pranala ing Toolbar situs tanpa kudu ngeklik "
"kanggo mlebu."

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter module provides a workaround for "
"the common problem that users with <em>Use the administration pages "
"and help</em> permission see menu links they done not have access "
"permission for."
msgstr ""
"Modul Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter nyedhiyakake solusi kanggo "
"masalah umum sing dialami pangguna kanthi wewenang <em>Use the "
"administration pages and help</em> sing bisa ndeleng pranala menu sing "
"sejatine ora nduweni ijin akses."

msgid ""
"To use Admin Toolbar Extra Tools just install it like any other "
"module. There is no other configuration required."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nggunakake Admin Toolbar Extra Tools, cukup pasang kaya modul "
"liyane. Ora ana konfigurasi liyane sing dibutuhake."

