msgid "Admin Toolbar Search"
msgstr "Panelusuran Toolbar Admin"

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar Extra Tools module comes packaged with the <a "
"href=\":admin-toolbar\">Admin Toolbar</a> module and adds "
"functionality to it. The additional functionality is accessed through "
"extra links on the main administration Toolbar. Some links to Admin "
"Toolbar Extra Tools administration pages are located at the bottom of "
"this page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Modul Admin Toolbar Extra Tools teka bebarengan karo modul <a "
"href=\":admin-toolbar\">Admin Toolbar</a> lan nambah fungsi tambahan "
"kanggo modul kasebut. Fungsi tambahan iki bisa diakses liwat pranala "
"tambahan ing Toolbar administrasi utama. Sawetara pranala menyang kaca "
"administrasi Admin Toolbar Extra Tools ana ing ngisor kaca iki.</a>"

