msgid ""
"<p><strong>Backup and Migrate</strong> makes the task of backing up "
"your Drupal database and migrating data from one Drupal install to "
"another easier. It provides a function to backup the entire database "
"to file or download, and to restore from a previous backup. You can "
"also schedule the backup operation. Compression of backup files is "
"also supported. The database backup files created with this module can "
"be imported into this or any other Drupal installation with the "
"@restore, or you can use a database tool such as @phpmyadmin or the "
"mysql command line command. Access for backup migrate is controlled by "
"module permissions, contact the administrator or any privileged user "
"to get access to full module features.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Backup and Migrate</strong> nggawe tugas kanggo mbukak "
"serep basis data Drupal sampeyan lan migrasi data saka siji instalasi "
"Drupal menyang liyane dadi luwih gampang. Iki nyedhiyakake fungsi "
"kanggo mbukak serep kabeh basis data menyang file utawa undhuh, lan "
"mbalekake saka serep sadurunge. Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel jadwal "
"operasi serep. Kompresi file serep uga didhukung. File serep basis "
"data sing digawe nganggo modul iki bisa diimpor menyang instalasi "
"Drupal iki utawa liyane nganggo @restore, utawa sampeyan bisa "
"nggunakake piranti basis data kaya @phpmyadmin utawa perintah garis "
"perintah mysql. Akses kanggo backup migrate dikontrol dening ijin "
"modul, hubungi administrator utawa pangguna sing nduweni hak istimewa "
"kanggo entuk akses fitur lengkap modul iki.</p>"

msgid "phpMyAdmin"
msgstr "phpMyAdmin"

msgid ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Use this form to run simple @manual of your "
"database. Visit the @documentation for more help using this "
"module.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Gunakake formulir iki kanggo mbukak @manual sing "
"gampang saka database sampeyan. Bukak @documentation kanggo bantuan "
"luwih lengkap nggunakake modul iki.</p>"

msgid "Backup Tab - Quick Backup"
msgstr "Tab Backup - Backup Cepet"

msgid ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Use this form to run manual backups of your database "
"with more advanced options. If you have any @profile saved you can "
"load those settings. You can save any of the changes you make to these "
"settings as a new settings profile.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Gunakake formulir iki kanggo mbukak serep manual "
"saka database panjenengan kanthi opsi luwih maju. Yen sampeyan duwe "
"@profile sing wis disimpen, sampeyan bisa mbukak setelan kasebut. "
"Sampeyan bisa nyimpen sembarang owah-owahan sing digawe ing setelan "
"iki minangka profil setelan anyar.</p>"

msgid "Backup Tab - Advanced Backup"
msgstr "Tab Cadangan - Cadangan Lanjutan"

msgid ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Upload a backup and migrate backup file. The restore "
"function will not work with database dumps from other sources such as "
"@phpmyadmin.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Unggah serep lan migrasi berkas serep. Fungsi "
"mulihake ora bakal bisa digunakake kanggo dump basis data saka sumber "
"liya kaya @phpmyadmin.</p>"

msgid ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Backups are the places you can save your backup "
"files to or them load from.</p><p>Files can be saved to a directory on "
"your web server, downloaded to your desktop or emailed to a specified "
"email account. From the @destination tab you can create, delete and "
"edit destinations or list the files which have already been backed up "
"to the available destinations.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Cadangan iku panggonan sing bisa digunakake kanggo "
"nyimpen file cadangan utawa kanggo ngundhuh file saka kana.</p><p>File "
"bisa disimpen ing direktori ing server web panjenengan, diundhuh "
"menyang desktop utawa dikirim liwat email menyang akun email sing wis "
"ditemtokake. Saka tab @destination panjenengan bisa nggawe, mbusak lan "
"ngowahi tujuan utawa ndeleng dhaptar file sing wis dicadangkan menyang "
"tujuan sing kasedhiya.</p>"

msgid ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Settings are profile. Settings store your table "
"exclusion settings as well as your backup file name, compression and "
"timestamp settings. You can use profiles in @schedules and for "
"@manual.</p><p>You can create new profiles using the add profiles tab "
"or by checking the 'Save these settings' button on the advanced backup "
"page.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>@title</h3><p>Setelan iku profil. Setelan nyimpen setelan "
"pengecualian tabel sampeyan uga jeneng file cadangan, setelan kompresi "
"lan timestamp. Sampeyan bisa nggunakake profil ing @schedules lan "
"kanggo @manual.</p><p>Sampeyan bisa nggawe profil anyar kanthi "
"nggunakake tab tambah profil utawa kanthi mriksa tombol 'Simpen "
"setelan iki' ing kaca cadangan luwih lanjut.</p>"

