msgstr "Indikator kemajuan: @progress_indicator"

msgid ""
"The %filter filter is missing, and will be removed once this format is "
"saved."
msgstr ""
"Filter %filter ora kasedhiya, lan bakal dibusak nalika format iki "
"disimpen."

msgid ""
"Lines and paragraphs are automatically recognized. The &lt;br /&gt; "
"line break, &lt;p&gt; paragraph and &lt;/p&gt; close paragraph tags "
"are inserted automatically. If paragraphs are not recognized simply "
"add a couple of blank lines."
msgstr ""
"Baris lan paragraf bakal dikenali kanthi otomatis. Tag &lt;br /&gt; "
"kanggo break baris, tag &lt;p&gt; paragraf lan &lt;/p&gt; kanggo nutup "
"paragraf bakal disisipake kanthi otomatis. Yen paragraf ora dikenali, "
"cukup tambahake sawetara baris kosong."

msgid "Missing filter. All text is removed"
msgstr "Filter ilang. Kabeh teks wis dibusak"

msgid "Missing filter plugin: %filter."
msgstr "Plugin filter ilang: %filter."

msgid "Provides a fallback for missing filters. Do not use."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake fallback kanggo filter sing ilang. Aja digunakake."

msgid "Add image style"
msgstr "Tambah gaya gambar"

msgid "Preview image style: @style"
msgstr "Gaya pratampil gambar: @style"

msgid ""
"Deleting a language will remove all interface translations associated "
"with it, and content in this language will be set to be language "
"neutral. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Mbusak basa bakal mbusak kabeh terjemahan antarmuka sing gegandhengan "
"karo basa kasebut, lan isi ing basa iki bakal disetel dadi netral "
"basa. Tumindak iki ora bisa dibalèkaké."

