msgstr "Title placeholder: @placeholder_title"

msgid "URL placeholder: @placeholder_url"
msgstr "URL placeholder: @placeholder_url"

msgid "Note that importing large .po files may take several minutes."
msgstr "Elinga yen ngimpor file .po sing gedhe bisa njupuk sawetara menit."

msgid ""
"Content items can be edited using different form modes. Here, you can "
"define which fields are shown and hidden when %type content is edited "
"in each form mode, and define how the field form widgets are displayed "
"in each form mode."
msgstr ""
"Item konten bisa diedit nganggo macem-macem mode formulir. Ing kene, "
"sampeyan bisa nemtokake kolom-kolom sing ditampilake lan sing "
"didhelikake nalika konten %type diedit ing saben mode formulir, uga "
"nemtokake cara tampilan widget formulir kolom ing saben mode formulir."

msgid "Edit %label content type"
msgstr "Sunting jinis isi %label"

msgid ""
"The content has either been modified by another user, or you have "
"already submitted modifications. As a result, your changes cannot be "
"saved."
msgstr ""
"Isiné wis diowahi déning panganggo liyané, utawa kowé wis ngirim "
"owah-owahan mau. Amarga kuwi, owah-owahanmu ora bisa disimpen."

msgid "Use field label: @display_label"
msgstr "Gunakake label lapangan: @display_label"

msgid "Provides a row plugin to display search results."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake plugin baris kanggo nampilake asil panelusuran."

msgid ""
"A local file system path where public files will be stored. This "
"directory must exist and be writable by Drupal. This directory must be "
"relative to the Drupal installation directory and be accessible over "
"the web. This must be changed in settings.php"
msgstr ""
"Path sistem file lokal ing ngendi file publik bakal disimpen. "
"Direktori iki kudu ana lan bisa ditulis déning Drupal. Direktori iki "
"kudu relatif marang direktori instalasi Drupal lan bisa diakses liwat "
"web. Iki kudu diganti ing settings.php"

