msgid "Summary rows"
msgstr "Baris ringkesan"

msgid ""
"This form lets administrators add and edit fields for storing user "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Form iki ngidini administrator kanggo nambah lan nyunting kolom kanggo "
"nyimpen data pangguna."

msgid ""
"This form lets administrators configure how form fields should be "
"displayed when editing a user profile."
msgstr ""
"Formulir iki ngidini para administrator kanggo nyetel carane kolom "
"formulir kudu ditampilake nalika nyunting profil pangguna."

msgid ""
"Alter the HTTP response status code used by this view, mostly helpful "
"for empty results."
msgstr ""
"Ganti kode status tanggapan HTTP sing digunakake déning tampilan iki, "
"biasané migunani kanggo asil kosong."

msgid "HTTP status code"
msgstr "Kode status HTTP"

msgid "Always display the more link"
msgstr "Tansah tampilkna pranala luwih akeh"

msgid ""
"Check this to display the more link even if there are no more items to "
"display."
msgstr ""
"Tandhani iki kanggo nampilake pranala luwih akeh sanajan ora ana "
"barang liyane kanggo ditampilake."

msgid "Make entity label a link to entity page."
msgstr "Gawe label entitas dadi pranala menyang kaca entitas."

msgid ""
"You must add some additional fields to this display before using this "
"field. These fields may be marked as <em>Exclude from display</em> if "
"you prefer. Note that due to rendering order, you cannot use fields "
"that come after this field; if you need a field not listed here, "
"rearrange your fields."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan kudu nambah sawetara kolom tambahan menyang tampilan iki "
"sadurunge nggunakake kolom iki. Kolom-kolom kasebut bisa diwenehi "
"tandha <em>Exclude from display</em> yen sampeyan luwih seneng. "
"Elinga, amarga urutan rendering, sampeyan ora bisa nggunakake "
"kolom-kolom sing ana sawise kolom iki; yen sampeyan butuh kolom sing "
"ora kadhaptar ing kene, atur ulang posisi kolom-kolom sampeyan."

msgid "Automatic width"
msgstr "Amba otomatis"

msgid ""
"The width of each column will be calculated automatically based on the "
"number of columns provided. If additional classes are entered or a "
"theme injects classes based on a grid system, disabling this option "
"may prove beneficial."
msgstr ""
"Ambane saben kolom bakal diitung kanthi otomatis adhedhasar jumlah "
"kolom sing diwenehake. Yen kelas tambahan dilebokake utawa tema nambah "
"kelas adhedhasar sistem grid, mateni pilihan iki bisa dadi migunani."

msgid "Default column classes"
msgstr "Kelas kolom bawaan"

msgid ""
"Add the default views column classes like views-col, col-1 and "
"clearfix to the output. You can use this to quickly reduce the amount "
"of markup the view provides by default, at the cost of making it more "
"difficult to apply CSS."
msgstr ""
"Tambahna kelas kolom tampilan standar kaya views-col, col-1 lan "
"clearfix menyang output. Sampeyan bisa nggunakake iki kanggo kanthi "
"cepet nyuda jumlah markup sing diwenehake tampilan sacara standar, "
"kanthi biaya nggawe luwih angel kanggo nerapake CSS."

msgid "Custom column class"
msgstr "Kelas kolom khusus"

msgid "Additional classes to provide on each column. Separated by a space."
msgstr ""
"Kelas tambahan kanggo diwenehake ing saben kolom. Dipisah kanthi "
"spasi."

msgid "Default row classes"
msgstr "Kelas baris standar"

msgid ""
"Adds the default views row classes like views-row, row-1 and clearfix "
"to the output. You can use this to quickly reduce the amount of markup "
"the view provides by default, at the cost of making it more difficult "
"to apply CSS."
msgstr ""
"Nambah kelas baris views default kaya views-row, row-1 lan clearfix "
"menyang output. Sampeyan bisa nggunakake iki kanggo cepet ngurangi "
"jumlah markup sing diwenehake view sacara default, nanging regane dadi "
"luwih angel kanggo nerapake CSS."

msgid "Custom row class"
msgstr "Kelas baris khusus"

msgid "Additional classes to provide on each row. Separated by a space."
msgstr ""
"Kelas tambahan sing diwenehake ing saben baris. Dipisahake nganggo "
"spasi."

msgid "Default wizard"
msgstr "Pandhuan bawaan"

msgid ""
"All Views-generated queries will include the name of the views and "
"display 'view-name:display-name' as a string at the end of the SELECT "
"clause. This makes identifying Views queries in database server logs "
"simpler, but should only be used when troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"Kabeh query sing digawé Views bakal nyakup jeneng views lan tampilan "
"'view-name:display-name' minangka string ing pungkasan klausa SELECT. "
"Iki nggawe ngenali query Views ing log server basis data dadi luwih "
"gampang, nanging kudu digunakake mung nalika nindakake "
"troubleshooting."

