msgid "Right"
msgstr "Bener"

msgid "State label"
msgstr "Label status"

msgid "%name: may not be longer than @max characters."
msgstr "%name: ora kena luwih saka @max aksara."

msgid ""
"A breakpoint separates the height or width of viewports (screens, "
"printers, and other media output types) into steps. For instance, a "
"width breakpoint of 40em creates two steps: one for widths up to 40em "
"and one for widths above 40em. Breakpoints can be used to define when "
"layouts should shift from one form to another, when images should be "
"resized, and other changes that need to respond to changes in viewport "
"height or width."
msgstr ""
"Breakpoint misahake dhuwur utawa ambane viewport (layar, printer, lan "
"jinis output media liyane) dadi langkah-langkah. Contone, breakpoint "
"ambane 40em nggawe loro langkah: siji kanggo ambane nganti 40em lan "
"siji maneh kanggo ambane luwih saka 40em. Breakpoint bisa digunakake "
"kanggo nemtokake kapan tata letak kudu pindhah saka sawijining bentuk "
"menyang liyane, kapan gambar kudu diresize, lan owah-owahan liyane "
"sing kudu nanggapi owah-owahan dhuwur utawa ambane viewport."

msgid "Resolution multiplier"
msgstr "Multiplier resolusi"

msgid ""
"Resolution multipliers are a measure of the viewport's device "
"resolution, defined to be the ratio between the physical pixel size of "
"the active device and the <a "
"href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Device_independent_pixel\">device-independent "
"pixel</a> size. The Breakpoint module defines multipliers of 1, 1.5, "
"and 2; when defining breakpoints, modules and themes can define which "
"multipliers apply to each breakpoint."
msgstr ""
"Multiplier resolusi iku ukuran saka resolusi piranti tampilan, sing "
"ditemtokake minangka perbandingan antarane ukuran piksel fisik saka "
"piranti aktif lan ukuran <a "
"href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Device_independent_pixel\">piksel "
"bebas piranti</a>. Modul Breakpoint nemtokake multiplier 1, 1.5, lan "
"2; nalika nemtokake breakpoint, modul lan tema bisa nemtokake "
"multiplier sing ditrapake kanggo saben breakpoint."

msgid "Defining breakpoints and breakpoint groups"
msgstr "Nemtokake breakpoints lan grup breakpoint"

msgid ""
"Modules and themes can use the API provided by the Breakpoint module "
"to define breakpoints and breakpoint groups, and to assign resolution "
"multipliers to breakpoints."
msgstr ""
"Modul lan tema bisa nggunakake API sing disedhiyakake dening modul "
"Breakpoint kanggo nemtokake breakpoint lan kelompok breakpoint, lan "
"kanggo menehi multiplier resolusi marang breakpoint."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Comment author name"
msgstr "Jeneng pangarang komentar"

msgid ""
"Changing the text format to %text_format will permanently remove "
"content that is not allowed in that text format.<br><br>Save your "
"changes before switching the text format to avoid losing data."
msgstr ""
"Ngowahi format teks dadi %text_format bakal mbusak isi sing ora "
"diijini ing format teks kasebut kanthi permanen.<br><br>Simpen owahan "
"sampeyan sadurunge ngganti format teks supaya ora kelangan data."

msgid "Entity view display"
msgstr "Tampilan tampilan entitas"

msgid "Managing and displaying entity reference fields"
msgstr "Ngatur lan nampilake kolom referensi entitas"

msgid "Selecting reference type"
msgstr "Milih jinis referensi"

msgid ""
"In the field settings you can select which entity type you want to "
"create a reference to."
msgstr ""
"Ing setelan lapangan, sampeyan bisa milih jinis entitas sing pengin "
"digawe referensi."

msgid "Filtering and sorting reference fields"
msgstr "Nyaring lan nyusun lapangan referensi"

msgid ""
"Depending on the chosen entity type, additional filtering and sorting "
"options are available for the list of entities that can be referred "
"to, in the field settings. For example, the list of users can be "
"filtered by role and sorted by name or ID."
msgstr ""
"Miturut jinis entitas sing dipilih, opsi panyaringan lan penyortiran "
"tambahan kasedhiya kanggo dhaptar entitas sing bisa dirujuk, ing "
"setelan lapangan. Contone, dhaptar pangguna bisa disaring miturut "
"peran lan disortir miturut jeneng utawa ID."

msgid "Displaying a reference"
msgstr "Nampilaké referensi"

msgid ""
"An entity reference can be displayed as a simple label with or without "
"a link to the entity. Alternatively, the referenced entity can be "
"displayed as a teaser (or any other available view mode) inside the "
"referencing entity."
msgstr ""
"Referensi entitas isa ditampilake minangka label prasaja karo utawa "
"tanpa pranala menyang entitas kasebut. Alternatifé, entitas sing "
"direferensi bisa ditampilake minangka teaser (utawa mode tampilan "
"liyane sing kasedhiya) ing jero entitas sing nindakake referensi."

msgid "Managing text formats"
msgstr "Ngatur format teks"

msgid "Assigning roles to text formats"
msgstr "Menehi peran marang format teks"

msgid "Selecting filters"
msgstr "Milih saringan"

msgid ""
"Each filter can have additional configuration options. For example, "
"for the \"Limit allowed HTML tags\" filter you need to define the list "
"of HTML tags that the filter leaves in the text."
msgstr ""
"Saben filter bisa nduwèni pilihan konfigurasi tambahan. Contone, "
"kanggo filter \"Watesi tag HTML sing diijini\" sampeyan perlu "
"nemtokake dhaptar tag HTML sing bakal ditinggalake déning filter ing "
"teks."

msgid ""
"When creating or editing data in a field that has text formats "
"enabled, users can select the format under the field from the Text "
"format select list."
msgstr ""
"Nalika nggawe utawa nyunting data ing kolom sing nduwé format teks "
"sing diaktifaké, pangguna bisa milih format ing ngisor kolom saka "
"dhaptar Pilihan format Teks."

msgid "Import behavior"
msgstr "Tindakan impor"

msgid "The keywords to search for."
msgstr "Tembung kunci kanggo digoleki."

msgid "Managing and displaying list fields"
msgstr "Ngatur lan nampilake kolom daftar"

msgid "Defining option keys and labels"
msgstr "Nemtokake tombol opsi lan label"

msgid ""
"When you define the list options you can define a key and a label for "
"each option in the list. The label will be shown to the users while "
"the key gets stored in the database."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan nemtokake opsi dhaptar, sampeyan bisa nemtokake tombol "
"lan label kanggo saben opsi ing dhaptar kasebut. Label kasebut bakal "
"ditampilake kanggo pangguna nalika tombol kasebut disimpen ing basis "
"data."

msgid "Choosing list field type"
msgstr "Milih jinis kolom daftar"

msgid ""
"There are three types of list fields, which store different types of "
"data: <em>float</em>, <em>integer</em> or, <em>text</em>. The "
"<em>float</em> type allows storing approximate decimal values. The "
"<em>integer</em> type allows storing whole numbers, such as years (for "
"example, 2012) or values (for example, 1, 2, 5, 305). The "
"<em>text</em> list field type allows storing text values. No matter "
"which type of list field you choose, you can define whatever labels "
"you wish for data entry."
msgstr ""
"Ana tigang jinis lapangan daftar, sing nyimpen jinis data sing beda: "
"<em>float</em>, <em>integer</em>, utawa <em>text</em>. Jinis "
"<em>float</em> ngidini nyimpen nilai desimal sing kira-kira. Jinis "
"<em>integer</em> ngidini nyimpen nomer bulat, kaya ta taun (umpamane, "
"2012) utawa nilai (umpamane, 1, 2, 5, 305). Jinis lapangan daftar "
"<em>text</em> ngidini nyimpen nilai teks. Ora preduli jinis lapangan "
"daftar endi sing sampeyan pilih, sampeyan bisa nemtokake label apa wae "
"sing dikarepake kanggo entri data."

msgid "Dependency of required module @module"
msgstr "Ketergantungan modul sing dibutuhake @module"

msgid ""
