"Kesalahan nalika ngirim email (saka %from menyang %to kanthi reply-to "
"%reply)."

msgid "The label for this display variant."
msgstr "Label kanggo varian tampilan iki."

msgid "%name: the email address can not be longer than @max characters."
msgstr "%name: alamat email ora kena luwih saka @max karakter."

msgid ""
"Automated emails, such as registration information, will be sent from "
"this address. Use an address ending in your site's domain to help "
"prevent these emails from being flagged as spam."
msgstr ""
"Email otomatis, kaya informasi registrasi, bakal dikirim saka alamat "
"iki. Gunakake alamat sing pungkasané nganggo domain situs sampeyan "
"supaya email iki ora kena tandha spam."

msgid "Receive email notifications"
msgstr "Nampa kabar liwat email"

msgid "Send email configuration"
msgstr "Ngatur konfigurasi email"

msgid ""
"Enter a valid email address or use a token email address such as "
"%author."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna alamat email sing bener utawa gunakna alamat email token kaya "
"ta %author."

msgid "Show for the listed pages"
msgstr "Tampilake kanggo kaca-kaca sing kacathet"

msgid "Hide for the listed pages"
msgstr "Ndhelikake kanggo kaca sing kacathet"

msgid "Duplicate @display_title"
msgstr "Duplikat @display_title"

msgid "The field name from which the comment originated."
msgstr "Jeneng lapangan saka ngendi komentar asalé."

msgid "Overriding default settings"
msgstr "Ngganti setelan standar"

msgid "Approving and managing comments"
msgstr "Nyetujoni lan ngatur komentar"

msgid ""
"This page provides a list of all comment types on the site and allows "
"you to manage the fields, form and display settings for each."
msgstr ""
"Kaca iki nyedhiyakake dhaftar kabeh jinis komentar ing situs lan "
"ngidini sampeyan ngatur kolom, formulir, lan setelan tampilan kanggo "
"saben jinis."

msgid "Administer comment types and settings"
msgstr "Ngatur jinis komentar lan setelan"

msgid "Comment types"
msgstr "Jinis koméntar"

msgid "Comment type settings"
msgstr "Setelan jinis komentar"

msgid "Target Entity Type ID"
msgstr "ID Tipe Entitas Tujuan"

msgid "Comment type %label has been updated."
msgstr "Tipe komentar %label wis dianyari."

msgid "Comment type %label has been added."
msgstr "Tipe komentar %label wis ditambahake."

msgid "The comment author's email address."
msgstr "Alamat email saka penulis komentar."

msgid "Comment Type"
msgstr "Jinis Komentar"

msgid "The comment type."
msgstr "Tipe komentar."

msgid ""
"%label is used by the %field field on your site. You can not remove "
"this comment type until you have removed the field."
msgstr ""
"%label digunakake dening lapangan %field ing situs sampeyan. Sampeyan "
"ora bisa mbusak jinis komentar iki nganti sampeyan mbusak lapangan "
"kasebut."

msgid ""
"%label is used by 1 comment on your site. You can not remove this "
"comment type until you have removed all of the %label comments."
msgid_plural ""
"%label is used by @count comments on your site. You may not remove "
"%label until you have removed all of the %label comments."
msgstr[0] ""
"%label digunakake dening 1 komentar ing situs sampeyan. Sampeyan ora "
"bisa mbusak jinis komentar iki nganti sampeyan wis mbusak kabeh "
"komentar %label.  \n"
"%label digunakake dening @count komentar ing "
"situs sampeyan. Sampeyan ora bisa mbusak %label nganti sampeyan wis "
"mbusak kabeh komentar %label."

msgid "Translating configuration text"
msgstr "Nerjemahaké teks konfigurasi"

msgid "Translating date formats"
msgstr "Nerjemahaké format tanggal"

msgid ""
"This page lists all configuration items on your site that have "
"translatable text, like your site name, role names, etc."
msgstr ""
"Kaca iki ngetokake kabeh item konfigurasi ing situs sampeyan sing "
"nduwé teks sing bisa ditranslate, kaya jeneng situs, jeneng peran, "
"lan liya-liyane."

msgid ""
"Allow other users to contact you via a personal contact form which "
"keeps your email address hidden. Note that some privileged users such "
"as site administrators are still able to contact you even if you "
"choose to disable this feature."
msgstr ""
"Wenehana pangguna liyane kanggo ngubungi sampeyan liwat formulir "
"kontak pribadi sing njaga alamat email sampeyan supaya tetep "
"didhelikake. Elinga yen sawetara pangguna kanthi hak istimewa kaya "
"administrator situs isih bisa ngubungi sampeyan sanajan sampeyan milih "
"mateni fitur iki."

msgid ""
"Example: 'webmaster@example.com' or "
"'sales@example.com,support@example.com' . To specify multiple "
"recipients, separate each email address with a comma."
msgstr ""
"Conto: 'webmaster@example.com' utawa "
"'sales@example.com,support@example.com'. Kanggo nemtokake luwih saka "
"siji panampa, pisahna saben alamat email nganggo koma."

msgid "%recipient is an invalid email address."
msgstr "%recipient iku alamat email sing ora sah."

msgid "%sender-name (@sender-from) sent %recipient-name an email."
msgstr "%sender-name (@sender-from) ngirim email kanggo %recipient-name."

msgid "Enabling field translation"
msgstr "Ngaktifake terjemahan kolom"

msgid ""
"You can define which fields of a content entity can be translated. For "
"example, you might want to translate the title and body field while "
"leaving the image field untranslated. If you exclude a field from "
"being translated, it will still show up in the content editing form, "
"but any changes made to that field will be applied to <em>all</em> "
"translations of that content."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nemtokake lapangan endi saka entitas isi sing bisa "
"diterjemahake. Contone, sampeyan bisa pengin nerjemahake lapangan "
"judhul lan isi nalika ninggalake lapangan gambar tanpa diterjemahake. "
"Yen sampeyan ora kalebu lapangan supaya ora diterjemahake, lapangan "
"kuwi isih bakal muncul ing formulir suntingan isi, nanging saben "
"owah-owahan sing digawe ing lapangan kuwi bakal ditrapake kanggo "
"<em>kabeh</em> terjemahan isi kuwi."

msgid ""
"If translation is enabled you can translate a content entity via the "
"Translate tab (or Translate link). The Translations page of a content "
"entity gives an overview of the translation status for the current "
"content and lets you add, edit, and delete its translations. This "
"process is similar for every translatable content entity on your site."
msgstr ""
"Yen terjemahan diaktikake, sampeyan bisa nerjemahake entitas isi liwat "
"tab Translate (utawa link Translate). Kaca Terjemahan saka entitas isi "
"menehi gambaran status terjemahan kanggo isi saiki lan ngidini "
"sampeyan nambah, nyunting, lan mbusak terjemahane. Proses iki padha "
"kanggo saben entitas isi sing bisa diterjemahake ing situs sampeyan."

msgid "Changing the source language for a translation"
msgstr "Ngganti basa sumber kanggo terjemahan"

msgid ""
"When you add a new translation, the original text you are translating "
"is displayed in the edit form as the <em>source</em>. If at least one "
"translation of the original content already exists when you add a new "
"translation, you can choose either the original content (default) or "
"one of the other translations as the source, using the select list in "
"the Source language section. After saving the translation, the chosen "
"source language is then listed on the Translate tab of the content."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan nambah terjemahan anyar, teks asli sing sampeyan "
"terjemahake ditampilake ing formulir sunting minangka <em>sumber</em>. "
"Yen paling ora siji terjemahan saka isi asli wis ana nalika sampeyan "
"nambah terjemahan anyar, sampeyan bisa milih isi asli (default) utawa "
"salah siji terjemahan liyane minangka sumber, nggunakake dhaptar "
"pilihan ing bagean Basa Sumber. Sawise nyimpen terjemahan, basa sumber "
"sing dipilih banjur bakal kadhaptar ing tab Terjemah saka isi kasebut."

msgid "Setting status of translations"
msgstr "Nyetel status terjemahan"

msgid ""
"If you edit a translation in one language you may want to set the "
"status of the other translations as <em>out-of-date</em>. You can set "
"this status by selecting the <em>Flag other translations as "
"outdated</em> checkbox in the Translation section of the content "
"editing form. The status will be visible on the Translations page."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan ngowahi terjemahan ing siji basa, sampeyan bisa uga "
"pengin nyetel status terjemahan liyane dadi <em>kadaluarsa</em>. "
"Sampeyan bisa nyetel status iki kanthi milih kothak <em>Flag other "
"translations as outdated</em> ing bagean Terjemahan saka formulir "
"panyuntingan konten. Status iki bakal katon ing kaca Terjemahan."

