msgid "Adding languages"
msgstr "Nambah basa"

msgid "Adding custom languages"
msgstr "Nambahake basa kustom"

msgid ""
"You can add a language that is not provided in the drop-down list by "
"choosing <em>Custom language</em> at the end of the list. You then "
"have to configure its language code, name, and direction in the form "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nambah basa sing ora kasedhiya ing dhaptar drop-down "
"kanthi milih <em>Custom language</em> ing pungkasan dhaptar. Banjur "
"sampeyan kudu nyetel kode basa, jeneng, lan arah basa ing formulir "
"sing disedhiyakake."

msgid "Configuring content languages"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi basa isi"

msgid "Adding a language switcher block"
msgstr "Nambahaké blok pengganti basa"

msgid "Making a block visible per language"
msgstr "Gawe blok katon saben basa"

msgid "Choosing user languages"
msgstr "Milih basa panganggo"

msgid ""
"Users can choose a <em>Site language</em> on their profile page. This "
"language is used for email messages, and can be used by modules to "
"determine a user's language. It can also be used for interface text, "
"if the <em>User</em> method is enabled as a <em>Detection and "
"selection</em> method (see below). Administrative users can choose a "
"separate <em>Administration pages language</em> for the interface text "
"on administration pages. This configuration is only available on the "
"user's profile page if the <em>Account administration pages</em> "
"method is enabled (see below)."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna bisa milih <em>Basa Situs</em> ing kaca profilé. Basa iki "
"digunakaké kanggo pesen email, lan bisa digunakaké déning modul "
"kanggo nemtokaké basa pangguna. Basa iki uga bisa digunakaké kanggo "
"tèks antarmuka, yen cara <em>Pangguna</em> diaktifaké minangka cara "
"<em>Deteksi lan pilihan</em> (deleng ing ngisor). Pangguna "
"administratif bisa milih basa <em>Kaca administrasi</em> sing béda "
"kanggo tèks antarmuka ing kaca administrasi. Konfigurasi iki mung "
"kasedhiya ing kaca profil pangguna yen cara <em>Kaca administrasi "
"akun</em> diaktifaké (deleng ing ngisor)."

msgid ""
"<em>URL</em> sets the interface language based on a path prefix or "
"domain (for example specifying <em>de</em> for German would result in "
"URLs like <em>example.com/de/contact</em>). The default language does "
"not require a path prefix, but can have one assigned as well. If the "
"language detection is done by domain name, a domain needs to be "
"specified for each language."
msgstr ""
"<em>URL</em> nyetel basa antarmuka adhedhasar awalan path utawa domain "
"(contone, nemtokake <em>de</em> kanggo basa Jerman bakal ngasilake URL "
"kaya <em>example.com/de/contact</em>). Basa standar ora mbutuhake "
"awalan path, nanging uga bisa diwènèhi awalan. Yen deteksi basa "
"dilakokaké miturut jeneng domain, domain kudu ditemtokake kanggo "
"saben basa."

msgid ""
"<em>Session</em> determines the interface language from a request or "
"session parameter (for example <em>example.com?language=de</em> would "
"set the interface language to German based on the use of <em>de</em> "
"as the <em>language</em> parameter)."
msgstr ""
"<em>Session</em> nemtokake basa antarmuka saka panjalukan utawa "
"parameter sesi (umpamane <em>example.com?language=de</em> bakal nyetel "
"basa antarmuka dadi basa Jerman adhedhasar panggunaan <em>de</em> "
"minangka parameter <em>language</em>)."

msgid ""
"<em>User</em> follows the language configuration set on the user's "
"profile page."
msgstr ""
"<em>User</em> ngetutake konfigurasi basa sing disetel ing kaca profil "
"pangguna."

msgid ""
"<em>Account administration pages</em> follows the configuration set as "
"<em>Administration pages language</em> on the profile page of an "
"administrative user. This method is similar to the <em>User</em> "
"method, but only sets the interface text language on administration "
"pages, independent of the interface text language on other pages."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kaca administrasi akun</em> miturut konfigurasi sing disetel "
"minangka <em>Basabasa kaca administrasi</em> ing kaca profil pangguna "
"administratif. Cara iki padha karo cara <em>Pangguna</em>, nanging "
"mung nyetel basa teks antarmuka ing kaca administrasi, mandiri saka "
"basa teks antarmuka ing kaca-kaca liyane."

msgid ""
"<em>Selected language</em> allows you to specify the site's default "
"language or a specific language as the fall-back language. This method "
"should be listed last."
msgstr ""
"<em>Basah sing dipilih</em> ngidini sampeyan nemtokake basa standar "
"situs utawa basa tartamtu minangka basa cadangan. Cara iki kudune "
"dilebokake ing pungkasan."

msgid ""
"The comment author's email address from the comment form, if user is "
"anonymous, and the 'Anonymous users may/must leave their contact "
"information' setting is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Alamat email panganggit komentar saka formulir komentar, yen pangguna "
"anonim, lan setelan 'Pangguna anonim bisa/kudu ninggalake informasi "
"kontak' wis diuripake."

msgid "Comma-separated list of recipient email addresses."
msgstr "Dhaptar alamat email panrima sing pisah nganggo koma."

msgid ""
"Promote, change ownership, edit revisions, and perform other tasks "
"across all content types."
msgstr ""
"Promosikna, ganti duweke, sunting revisi, lan lakonana tugas liyane "
"ing kabeh jinis konten."

msgid "Syndicate block"
msgstr "Sindikat blok"

msgid "Use shortcuts"
msgstr "Gunakake pintasan"

msgid "Diff settings"
msgstr "Setelan Diff"

msgid "Number of leading lines in a diff"
msgstr "Jumlah baris utama ing sawijining diff"

msgid "Number of trailing lines in a diff"
msgstr "Jumlah baris sing nyeret ing diff"

msgid "Branding block"
msgstr "Blok pambentukan merek"

msgid "Use site logo"
msgstr "Gunakake logo situs"

msgid "The current theme is not @theme"
msgstr "Tema saiki dudu @theme"

msgid "The current theme is @theme"
msgstr "Tema saiki yaiku @theme"

msgid "Do not return true on the following pages: @pages"
msgstr "Aja mbalekake true ing kaca-kaca ing ngisor iki: @pages"

msgid "Return true on the following pages: @pages"
msgstr "Baliya true ing kaca-kaca ing ngisor iki: @pages"

msgid "Request Path"
msgstr "Jalur Panjalukan"

msgid "Username or email address"
msgstr "Jeneng pangguna utawa alamat email"

msgid "Email addresses to notify when updates are available"
msgstr "Alamat email kanggo ngabari nalika ana pembaruan kasedhiya"

msgid "Email notification threshold"
msgstr "Ambang wates notifikasi email"

msgid ""
"Whenever your site checks for available updates and finds new "
"releases, it can notify a list of users via email. Put each address on "
"a separate line. If blank, no emails will be sent."
msgstr ""
"Nalika situs sampeyan mriksa update sing kasedhiya lan nemokake rilis "
"anyar, situs bisa ngabari daftar pangguna liwat email. Lebokake saben "
"alamat ing baris sing kapisah. Yen kosong, ora bakal dikirim email."

msgid "%emails are not valid email addresses."
msgstr "%emails dudu alamat email sing sah."

msgid "Configuring user roles"
msgstr "Nglampahi konfigurasi peran pangguna"

msgid "Setting permissions"
msgstr "Nyetel ijin akses"

msgid "Managing account settings"
msgstr "Ngatur setelan akun"

msgid ""
"This web page allows administrators to register new users. Users' "
"email addresses and usernames must be unique."
msgstr ""
"Kaca web iki ngidini para administrator kanggo ndhaptar pangguna "
"anyar. Alamat email lan jeneng pangguna kudu unik."

msgid "This account's preferred language for emails and site presentation."
msgstr "Basa sing dipilih akun iki kanggo email lan tampilan situs."

msgid "This account's preferred language for emails."
msgstr "Basa sing dipilih akun iki kanggo email."

msgid ""
"New users will be required to validate their email address prior to "
"logging into the site, and will be assigned a system-generated "
"password. With this setting disabled, users will be logged in "
"immediately upon registering, and may select their own passwords "
"during registration."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna anyar bakal dijaluk kanggo mriksa alamat email sadurunge "
"mlebu menyang situs, lan bakal diwenehi sandhi sing digawe sistem. Yen "
"setelan iki dipateni, pangguna bakal langsung mlebu sawise ndhaptar, "
"lan bisa milih sandhi dhewe nalika ndhaptar."

msgid "Notification email address"
msgstr "Alamat email béwara"

msgid ""
"The email address to be used as the 'from' address for all account "
"notifications listed below. If <em>'Visitors, but administrator "
"approval is required'</em> is selected above, a notification email "
"will also be sent to this address for any new registrations. Leave "
"empty to use the default system email address <em>(%site-email).</em>"
msgstr ""
"Alamat email sing bakal digunakake minangka alamat 'saka' kanggo kabar "
"akun kabeh sing kasebut ing ngisor iki. Yen <em>'Pengunjung, nanging "
"butuh persetujuan administrator'</em> dipilih ing ndhuwur, email kabar "
"uga bakal dikirim menyang alamat iki kanggo registrasi anyar. Wenehana "
"kosong kanggo nggunakake alamat email sistem default "
"<em>(%site-email).</em>"

msgid ""
"Edit the welcome email messages sent to new member accounts created by "
"an administrator."
msgstr ""
"Sunting pesen email sambutan sing dikirim menyang akun anggota anyar "
"sing digawe déning administrator."

msgid ""
"Edit the welcome email messages sent to new members upon registering, "
"when administrative approval is required."
msgstr ""
"Sunting pesen email sambutan sing dikirimake marang anggota anyar "
"nalika ndhaptar, nalika dibutuhake persetujuan administratif."

msgid ""
"Edit the email notifying the site administrator that there are new "
"members awaiting administrative approval."
msgstr ""
"Sunting email sing ngabari administrator situs yen ana anggota anyar "
"sing nunggu persetujuan administrasi."

msgid ""
"Edit the welcome email messages sent to new members upon registering, "
"when no administrator approval is required."
msgstr ""
"Sunting pesen email sambutan sing dikirimake marang anggota anyar "
"nalika ndhaptar, nalika ora perlu persetujuan administrator."

msgid "Edit the email messages sent to users who request a new password."
msgstr ""
"Sunting pesen email sing dikirim menyang pangguna sing njaluk sandhi "
"anyar."

msgid ""
"Enable and edit email messages sent to users upon account activation "
"(when an administrator activates an account of a user who has already "
"registered, on a site where administrative approval is required)."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake lan sunting pesen email sing dikirim menyang pangguna nalika "
"aktivasi akun (nalika administrator ngaktifake akun pangguna sing wis "
"ndaftar, ing situs sing mbutuhake persetujuan administratif)."

msgid ""
"Enable and edit email messages sent to users when their accounts are "
"blocked."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake lan sunting pesen email sing dikirim menyang pangguna nalika "
"akunné diblokir."

msgid ""
"Edit the email messages sent to users when they attempt to cancel "
"their accounts."
msgstr ""
"Sunting pesen email sing dikirim menyang pangguna nalika padha nyoba "
"mbatalake akuné."

msgid ""
"Enable and edit email messages sent to users when their accounts are "
"canceled."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake lan sunting pesen email sing dikirim marang pangguna nalika "
"akun dheweke dibatalake."

msgid ""
"A welcome message with further instructions has been sent to your "
"email address."
msgstr ""
"Pesen sugeng rawuh karo pandhuan luwih lanjut wis dikirim menyang "
"alamat email sampeyan."

msgid ""
"When enabled, the user must confirm the account cancellation via "
"email."
msgstr ""
"Nalika diaktifake, panganggo kudu konfirmasi pembatalan akun liwat "
"email."

msgid ""
"When enabled, the user will receive an email notification after the "
"account has been canceled."
msgstr ""
"Nalika diaktifake, panganggo bakal nampa kabar liwat email sawisé "
"akun kasebut dibatalake."

msgid ""
"A confirmation request to cancel your account has been sent to your "
"email address."
msgstr ""
"Panjaluk konfirmasi kanggo mbatalake akun sampeyan wis dikirim menyang "
"alamat email sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Password reset instructions will be mailed to %email. You must log out "
"to use the password reset link in the email."
msgstr ""
"Instruksi ngreset sandhi bakal dikirim menyang %email. Sampeyan kudu "
"metu dhisik kanggo nggunakake tautan ngreset sandhi ing email kasebut."

msgid "When the user has the following roles"
msgstr "Nalika pangguna nduwèni peran-peran ing ngisor iki"

msgid ""
