"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li>Nyelarasake gambar menyang kiwa: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  <li>Nyelarasake gambar "
"menyang tengah: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  <li>Nyelarasake gambar menyang tengen: "
"<code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  "
"<li>… lan sampeyan bisa nerapake iki kanggo unsur liyane uga: "
