msgid "Entities and entity types"
msgstr "Entitas lan jinis entitas"

msgid "Entity sub-types"
msgstr "Sub-tipe entitas"

msgid ""
"Some content entity types are further grouped into sub-types (for "
"example, you could have article and page content types within the main "
"site content entity type, and tag and category vocabularies within the "
"taxonomy term entity type); other entity types, such as user accounts, "
"do not have sub-types. Programmers use the term <em>bundle</em> for "
"entity sub-types."
msgstr ""
"Sawetara jinis entitas konten luwih dikelompokaké manèh dadi "
"sub-jinis (contone, kowe bisa duwe jinis konten artikel lan kaca ing "
"jero jinis entitas konten situs utama, lan vocabulari tag lan kategori "
"ing jero jinis entitas istilah taksonomi); jinis entitas liyane, kaya "
"akun pangguna, ora nduwèni sub-jinis. Para pangembang nggunakake "
"istilah <em>bundle</em> kanggo sub-jinis entitas."

msgid "Fields and field types"
msgstr "Lapangan lan jinis lapangan"

msgid ""
"Content entity types and sub-types store most of their text, file, and "
"other information in <em>fields</em>. Fields are grouped by <em>field "
"type</em>; field types define what type of data can be stored in that "
"field, such as text, images, or taxonomy term references."
msgstr ""
"Jinis lan sub-jinis entitas isi nyimpen mayoritas teks, berkas, lan "
"informasi liyane ing <em>fields</em>. Fields dikelompokaké miturut "
"<em>field type</em>; jinis field nemtokaké jinis data apa sing bisa "
"disimpen ing field kuwi, kaya teks, gambar, utawa referensi istilah "
"taksonomi."

msgid "Formatters and view modes"
msgstr "Formatter lan mode tampilan"

msgid ""
"Content entity types and sub-types can have one or more <em>view "
"modes</em>, used for displaying the entity items. For instance, a "
"content item could be viewed in full content mode on its own page, "
"teaser mode in a list, or RSS mode in a feed. In each view mode, each "
"field can be hidden or displayed, and if it is displayed, you can "
"choose and configure the <em>formatter</em> that is used to display "
"the field. For instance, a long text field can be displayed trimmed or "
"full-length, and taxonomy term reference fields can be displayed in "
"plain text or linked to the taxonomy term page."
msgstr ""
"Jinis lan sub-jinis entitas konten bisa nduwé siji utawa luwih "
"<em>mode tampilan</em>, sing digunakaké kanggo nampilaké item "
"entitas. Contoné, sawijining item konten bisa ditampilaké ing mode "
"isi lengkap ing kaca dhéwé, mode teaser ing dhaptar, utawa mode RSS "
"ing feed. Ing saben mode tampilan, saben kolom bisa didhelikaké utawa "
"ditampilaké, lan yèn ditampilaké, kowé bisa milih lan nyetel "
"<em>formatter</em> sing digunakaké kanggo nampilaké kolom kasebut. "
"Contoné, kolom teks dawa bisa ditampilaké kanthi dipotong utawa "
"lengkap, lan kolom referensi istilah taksonomi bisa ditampilaké ing "
"teks polos utawa disambungaké menyang kaca istilah taksonomi."

msgid "Widgets and form modes"
msgstr "Widget lan mode formulir"

msgid ""
"Content entity types and sub-types can have one or more <em>form "
"modes</em>, used for editing. For instance, a content item could be "
"edited in a compact format with only some fields editable, or a full "
"format that allows all fields to be edited. In each form mode, each "
"field can be hidden or displayed, and if it is displayed, you can "
"choose and configure the <em>widget</em> that is used to edit the "
"field. For instance, a taxonomy term reference field can be edited "
"using a select list, radio buttons, or an autocomplete widget."
msgstr ""
"Jinis entitas isi lan sub-jenisé bisa nduwèni siji utawa luwih "
"<em>form modes</em>, sing digunakaké kanggo nyunting. Contoné, "
"sawijining item isi bisa disunting nganggo format sing ringkes kanthi "
"mung sawetara kolom sing bisa disunting, utawa format lengkap sing "
"ngidini kabèh kolom bisa disunting. Ing saben <em>form mode</em>, "
"saben kolom bisa didhelikaké utawa ditampilaké, lan yen "
"ditampilaké, kowé bisa milih lan ngonfigurasi <em>widget</em> sing "
"digunakaké kanggo nyunting kolom kasebut. Contoné, kolom referensi "
"istilah taksonomi bisa disunting nganggo dhaptar pilihan, tombol "
"radio, utawa <em>autocomplete widget</em>."

msgid "Enabling field types, widgets, and formatters"
msgstr "Ngaktifake jinis lapangan, widget, lan formatter"

msgid "Views entity field handler"
msgstr "Pengolah lapangan entitas Views"

msgid "Creating a field"
msgstr "Nglampahi lapangan"

msgid ""
"On the <em>Manage fields</em> page for your entity type or sub-type, "
"you can add, configure, and delete fields for that entity type or "
"sub-type. Each field has a <em>machine name</em>, which is used "
"internally to identify the field and must be unique across an entity "
"type; once a field is created, you cannot change the machine name. "
"Most fields have two types of settings. The field-level settings "
"depend on the field type, and affect how the data in the field is "
"stored. Once they are set, they can no longer be changed; examples "
"include how many data values are allowed for the field and where files "
"are stored. The sub-type-level settings are specific to each entity "
"sub-type the field is used on, and they can be changed later; examples "
"include the field label, help text, default value, and whether the "
"field is required or not. You can return to these settings by choosing "
"the <em>Edit</em> link for the field from the <em>Manage fields</em> "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca <em>Manage fields</em> kanggo jinis entitas utawa sub-jinis "
"sampeyan, sampeyan bisa nambah, nyetel, lan mbusak kolom kanggo jinis "
"entitas utawa sub-jinis kasebut. Saben kolom nduweni <em>machine "
"name</em>, sing digunakake sacara internal kanggo ngenali kolom lan "
"kudu unik ing sak jinis entitas; sakwise kolom digawe, sampeyan ora "
"bisa ngganti machine name. Kasebake kolom nduweni rong jinis setelan. "
"Setelan ing tingkat kolom gumantung marang jinis kolom, lan mengaruhi "
"carane data ing kolom disimpen. Sawise disetel, setelan iki ora bisa "
"diganti; contone kalebu pinten nilai data sing diijini kanggo kolom "
"lan ing endi file disimpen. Setelan ing tingkat sub-jinis khusus "
"kanggo saben sub-jinis entitas sing nggunakake kolom kasebut, lan "
"setelan iki bisa diganti mengko; contone kalebu label kolom, teks "
"pitulung, nilai standar, lan apa kolom iku wajib utawa ora. Sampeyan "
"bisa bali menyang setelan iki kanthi milih pranala <em>Edit</em> "
"kanggo kolom kasebut saka kaca <em>Manage fields</em>."

msgid "Re-using fields"
msgstr "Nggunakake maneh kolom-kolom"

msgid "Configuring field editing"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi panyuntingan lapangan"

msgid ""
"On the <em>Manage form display</em> page of your entity type or "
"sub-type, you can configure how the field data is edited by default "
"and in each form mode. If your entity type has multiple form modes (on "
"most sites, most entities do not), you can toggle between the form "
"modes at the top of the page, and you can toggle whether each form "
"mode uses the default settings or custom settings in the <em>Custom "
"display settings</em> section. For each field in each form mode, you "
"can select the widget to use for editing; some widgets have additional "
"configuration options, such as the size for a text field, and these "
"can be edited using the Edit button (which looks like a wheel). You "
"can also change the order of the fields on the form. You can exclude a "
"field from a form by choosing <em>Hidden</em> from the widget "
"drop-down list, or by dragging it into the <em>Disabled</em> section."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca <em>Manage form display</em> saka jinis entitas utawa "
"sub-jinisé, sampeyan bisa ngatur carane data lapangan (field) diedit "
"kanthi default lan ing saben mode formulir. Yen jinis entitas sampeyan "
"nduwèni pirang-pirang mode formulir (ing akèh situs, akèh entitas "
"ora nduwèni), sampeyan bisa ngalih antarane mode formulir ing ndhuwur "
"kaca, lan sampeyan uga bisa milih apa saben mode formulir nganggo "
"setelan default utawa setelan khusus ing bagean <em>Custom display "
"settings</em>. Kanggo saben field ing saben mode formulir, sampeyan "
"bisa milih widget sing arep digunakake kanggo ngedit; sawetara widget "
"nduwèni pilihan konfigurasi tambahan, kaya ukuran kanggo bidang teks, "
"lan iki bisa diedit nganggo tombol Edit (sing katon kaya roda). "
"Sampeyan uga bisa ngganti urutan field ing formulir. Sampeyan bisa "
"ngilangi field saka formulir kanthi milih <em>Hidden</em> saka dhaptar "
"widget sing amba, utawa kanthi narik menyang bagean <em>Disabled</em>."

msgid "Configuring field display"
msgstr "Ngatur tampilan kolom"

msgid ""
"On the <em>Manage display</em> page of your entity type or sub-type, "
"you can configure how each field is displayed by default and in each "
"view mode. If your entity type has multiple view modes, you can toggle "
"between the view modes at the top of the page, and you can toggle "
"whether each view mode uses the default settings or custom settings in "
"the <em>Custom display settings</em> section. For each field in each "
"view mode, you can choose whether and how to display the label of the "
"field from the <em>Label</em> drop-down list. You can also select the "
"formatter to use for display; some formatters have configuration "
"options, which you can edit using the Edit button (which looks like a "
"wheel). You can also change the display order of fields. You can "
"exclude a field from a specific view mode by choosing <em>Hidden</em> "
"from the formatter drop-down list, or by dragging it into the "
"<em>Disabled</em> section."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca <em>Manage display</em> saka jinis entitas utawa sub-jinis "
"sampeyan, sampeyan bisa nyetel carane saben kolom ditampilake sacara "
"default lan ing saben mode tampilan. Yen jinis entitas sampeyan "
"nduweni pirang-pirang mode tampilan, sampeyan bisa ngalih antarane "
"mode tampilan ing sisih ndhuwur kaca, lan sampeyan bisa milih apa "
"saben mode tampilan nggunakake setelan default utawa setelan khusus "
"ing bagean <em>Custom display settings</em>. Kanggo saben kolom ing "
"saben mode tampilan, sampeyan bisa milih apa lan kepiye kanggo "
"nampilake label kolom saka dhaptar turunan <em>Label</em>. Sampeyan "
"uga bisa milih formatter sing bakal digunakake kanggo tampilan; "
"sawetara formatter duwe opsi konfigurasi, sing bisa sampeyan sunting "
"nganggo tombol Edit (sing katon kaya roda). Sampeyan uga bisa ngganti "
"urutan tampilan kolom. Sampeyan bisa ngeculake kolom saka mode "
"tampilan tartamtu kanthi milih <em>Hidden</em> saka dhaptar formatter, "
"utawa kanthi nransfer menyang bagean <em>Disabled</em>."

msgid "Configuring view and form modes"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi mode tampilan lan mode formulir"

