msgstr "Disedhiyakake déning modul"

msgid "Provided by Drupal core"
msgstr "Disedhiyakake dening inti Drupal"

msgid ""
"As mentioned previously, some field types, widgets, and formatters are "
"provided by Drupal core. Here are some notes on how to use some of "
"these:"
msgstr ""
"Kaya sing wis kasebut sadurunge, sawetara jinis lapangan, widget, lan "
"formatter disedhiyakake dening inti Drupal. Ing ngisor iki sawetara "
"cathetan babagan cara nggunakake sawetara saka iki:"

msgid ""
"<strong>Number fields</strong>: When you add a number field you can "
"choose from three types: <em>decimal</em>, <em>float</em>, and "
"<em>integer</em>. The <em>decimal</em> number field type allows users "
"to enter exact decimal values, with fixed numbers of decimal places. "
"The <em>float</em> number field type allows users to enter approximate "
"decimal values. The <em>integer</em> number field type allows users to "
"enter whole numbers, such as years (for example, 2012) or values (for "
"example, 1, 2, 5, 305). It does not allow decimals."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Lapangan nomer</strong>: Nalika sampeyan nambah lapangan "
"nomer, sampeyan bisa milih saka telung jinis: <em>desimal</em>, "
"<em>float</em>, lan <em>integer</em>. Jinis lapangan nomer "
"<em>desimal</em> ngidini pangguna mlebu nilai desimal sing tepat, "
"kanthi jumlah panggonan desimal sing tetep. Jinis lapangan nomer "
"<em>float</em> ngidini pangguna mlebu nilai desimal sing kira-kira. "
"Jinis lapangan nomer <em>integer</em> ngidini pangguna mlebu nomer "
"bulat, kaya taun (umpamane, 2012) utawa nilai (umpamane, 1, 2, 5, "
"305). Iki ora ngidini nilai desimal."

msgid "Defining image styles"
msgstr "Nemtokake gaya gambar"

msgid "Naming image styles"
msgstr "Nami gaya gambar"

msgid ""
"When you define an image style, you will need to choose a displayed "
"name and a machine name. The displayed name is shown in administrative "
"pages, and the machine name is used to generate the URL for accessing "
"an image processed in that style. There are two common approaches to "
"naming image styles: either based on the effects being applied (for "
"example, <em>Square 85x85</em>), or based on where you plan to use it "
"(for example, <em>Profile picture</em>)."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan nemtokake gaya gambar, sampeyan kudu milih jeneng sing "
"ditampilake lan jeneng mesin. Jeneng sing ditampilake bakal katon ing "
"kaca administratif, lan jeneng mesin digunakake kanggo nggawe URL "
"kanggo ngakses gambar sing wis diproses nganggo gaya kasebut. Ana rong "
"cara umum kanggo menehi jeneng gaya gambar: adhedhasar efek sing "
"diterapake (umpamane, <em>Square 85x85</em>), utawa adhedhasar "
"panggonan panggunaan (umpamane, <em>Profile picture</em>)."

msgid "Configuring image fields"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi kolom gambar"

msgid ""
"The maximum file size that can be uploaded is limited by PHP settings "
"of the server, but you can restrict it further by configuring a "
"<em>Maximum upload size</em> in the field settings (this setting can "
"be changed later). The maximum file size, either from PHP server "
"settings or field configuration, is automatically displayed to users "
"in the help text of the image field."
msgstr ""
"Ukuran file maksimal sing bisa diunggah diwatesi dening setelan PHP "
"ing server, nanging sampeyan bisa mbatesi luwih lanjut kanthi nyetel "
"<em>Ukuran unggahan maksimal</em> ing setelan kolom (setelan iki bisa "
"diganti mengko). Ukuran file maksimal, saka setelan server PHP utawa "
"setelan kolom, bakal langsung ditampilake marang pangguna ing teks "
"bantuan kolom gambar."

msgid ""
"You can also configure a default image that will be used if no image "
"is uploaded in an image field. This default can be defined for all "
"instances of the field in the field storage settings when you create a "
"field, and the setting can be overridden for each entity sub-type that "
"uses the field."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel gambar standar sing bakal digunakake yen ora "
"ana gambar sing diunggahake ing kolom gambar. Gambar standar iki bisa "
"ditemtokake kanggo kabeh instansi saka kolom kasebut ing setelan "
"panyimpenan kolom nalika nggawe kolom, lan setelan kasebut bisa "
"diganti kanggo saben sub-tipe entitas sing nggunakake kolom kasebut."

msgid "Configuring displays and form displays"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi tampilan lan tampilan formulir"

msgid ""
"On the <em>Manage display</em> page, you can choose the image "
"formatter, which determines the image style used to display the image "
"in each display mode and whether or not to display the image as a "
"link. On the <em>Manage form display</em> page, you can configure the "
"image upload widget, including setting the preview image style shown "
"on the entity edit form."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca <em>Manage display</em>, sampeyan bisa milih formatter "
"gambar, sing nemtokake gaya gambar sing digunakake kanggo nampilake "
"gambar ing saben mode tampilan lan apa gambar kasebut bakal "
"ditampilake minangka tautan utawa ora. Ing kaca <em>Manage form "
"display</em>, sampeyan bisa nyetel widget unggah gambar, kalebu nyetel "
"gaya gambar pratinjau sing ditampilake ing formulir sunting entitas."

msgid "Selected language configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi basa sing dipilih"

msgid "Selected default language no longer exists."
msgstr "Basa standar sing dipilih ora ana maneh."

msgid "Language detection configuration saved."
msgstr "Konfigurasi deteksi basa wis disimpen."

msgid ""
"Language codes or other custom text to use as a path prefix for URL "
"language detection. For the selected fallback language, this value may "
"be left blank. <strong>Modifying this value may break existing URLs. "
"Use with caution in a production environment.</strong> Example: "
"Specifying \"deutsch\" as the path prefix code for German results in "
"URLs like \"example.com/deutsch/contact\"."
msgstr ""
"Kode basa utawa teks khusus liyane sing digunakake minangka prefiks "
"path kanggo deteksi basa URL. Kanggo basa fallback sing dipilih, nilai "
"iki bisa dikosongake. <strong>Ngowahi nilai iki bisa nggawe URL sing "
"wis ana dadi rusak. Gunakake kanthi ati-ati ing lingkungan "
"produksi.</strong> Conto: Nemtokake \"deutsch\" minangka kode prefiks "
"path kanggo basa Jerman bakal ngasilake URL kaya "
"\"example.com/deutsch/contact\"."

