msgstr "Setelan lapangan (@on_label / @off_label)"

msgid "@on_label / @off_label"
msgstr "@on_label / @off_label"

msgid "Displayed in native language"
msgstr "Ditampilake nganggo basa asli"

msgid "Submitted by @username on @datetime"
msgstr "Dikirimaké déning @username ing @datetime"

msgid ""
"With multiple languages configured, registered users can select their "
"preferred language and authors can assign a specific language to "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Kanthi sawetara basa sing wis disetel, pangguna sing wis ndaftar bisa "
"milih basa sing disenengi lan panganggit bisa nemtokake basa tartamtu "
"kanggo isi."

msgid ""
"This page also provides an overview of how much of the site's "
"interface has been translated for each configured language."
msgstr ""
"Kaca iki uga nyedhiyakake gambaran babagan sepira akeh antarmuka situs "
"sing wis diterjemahake kanggo saben basa sing wis dikonfigurasi."

msgid "This must be an external URL such as %url."
msgstr "Iki kudu dadi URL eksternal kaya %url."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "No dangerous external protocols"
msgstr "Ora ana protokol eksternal sing mbebayani"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "No broken internal links"
msgstr "Ora ana pranala internal sing rusak"

msgid "Submitted by @author_name on @date"
msgstr "Dikirim déning @author_name ing @date"

msgid ""
"Search looks for exact, case-insensitive keywords; keywords shorter "
"than a minimum length are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Telusuran nggoleki tembung kunci sing pas, ora mbedakake huruf gedhe "
"utawa cilik; tembung kunci sing luwih cendhek saka dawa minimal bakal "
"diilangi."

msgid ""
"Use upper-case OR to get more results. Example: cat OR dog (content "
"contains either \"cat\" or \"dog\")."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake huruf gedhe OR kanggo entuk asil luwih akeh. Tuladha: cat OR "
"dog (isi ngemot \"cat\" utawa \"dog\")."

msgid ""
"You can use upper-case AND to require all words, but this is the same "
"as the default behavior. Example: cat AND dog (same as cat dog, "
"content must contain both \"cat\" and \"dog\")."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nggunakake huruf gedhe AND kanggo mbutuhake kabeh "
"tembung, nanging iki padha karo prilaku bawaan. Conto: cat AND dog "
"(padha karo cat dog, isi kudu ngemot loro \"cat\" lan \"dog\")."

msgid "Use quotes to search for a phrase. Example: \"the cat eats mice\"."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake tanda petik kanggo nggoleki frase. Conto: \"the cat eats "
"mice\"."

msgid ""
"You can precede keywords by - to exclude them; you must still have at "
"least one \"positive\" keyword. Example: cat -dog (content must "
"contain cat and cannot contain dog)."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nambah tanda - ing ngarep tembung kunci kanggo mbusak "
"saka asil; sampeyan tetep kudu duwe paling ora siji tembung kunci "
"\"positif\". Tuladha: cat -dog (isis kudu ngemot tembung cat lan ora "
"kena ngemot tembung dog)."

msgid "User is admin"
msgstr "Pangguna iku admin"

msgid "Include the anonymous user in the matched entities."
msgstr "Kalebu panganggo anonim ing entitas sing cocog."

msgid "Include the anonymous user."
msgstr "Kalebu pangguna anonim."

msgid ""
"User search looks for user names and partial user names. Example: mar "
"would match usernames mar, delmar, and maryjane."
msgstr ""
"Panelusuran pangguna nggoleki jeneng pangguna lan bagean saka jeneng "
"pangguna. Conto: mar bakal cocog karo jeneng pangguna mar, delmar, lan "
"maryjane."

msgid ""
"You can use * as a wildcard within your keyword. Example: m*r would "
"match user names mar, delmar, and elementary."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nggunakake * minangka wildcard ing sajeroning tembung "
"kunci sampeyan. Tuladha: m*r bakal cocog karo jeneng pangguna mar, "
"delmar, lan elementary."

msgid "No eligible views were found."
msgstr "Ora ketemu views sing layak."

msgid ""
"The view is not based on a translatable entity type or the site is not "
"multilingual."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan iki ora adhedhasar jinis entitas sing bisa diterjemahake "
"utawa situs iki ora multibasa."

msgid ""
"Display \"@display\" uses a \"more\" link but there are no displays it "
"can link to. You need to specify a custom URL."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan \"@display\" nggunakake pranala \"more\" nanging ora ana "
"tampilan sing bisa dipasangake pranala. Sampeyan kudu nemtokake URL "
"khusus."

msgid ""
"Disabling SQL rewriting will omit all query tags, i. e. disable node "
"access checks as well as override hook_query_alter() implementations "
"in other modules."
msgstr ""
"Mateni rewriting SQL bakal ngilangi kabeh tag query, yaiku mateni cek "
"akses node uga nglewati implementasi hook_query_alter() ing modul "
"liyane."

msgid "@count second"
msgid_plural "@count seconds"
msgstr[0] "@count detik"
msgstr[1] "@count detik"

msgid "Account's permissions"
msgstr "Idin akun"

msgid "The hashed password"
msgstr "Sandi sing wis di-hash"

msgid "Existing password"
msgstr "Sandi sing wis ana"

msgid "Display the author name."
msgstr "Tampilaké jeneng panulis."

msgid "Are you sure you want to create a new %name @type?"
msgstr "Apa sampeyan yakin arep nggawe %name anyar @type?"

msgid "Using the personal contact form"
msgstr "Nggunakake formulir kontak pribadi"

msgid ""
"Site visitors can email registered users on your site by using the "
"personal contact form, without knowing or learning the email address "
"of the recipient. When a site visitor is viewing a user profile, the "
"viewer will see a <em>Contact</em> tab or link, which leads to the "
"personal contact form. The personal contact link is not shown when you "
"are viewing your own profile, and users must have both <em>View user "
"information</em> (to see user profiles) and <em>Use users' personal "
"contact forms</em> permission to see the link. The user whose profile "
"is being viewed must also have their personal contact form enabled "
"(this is a user account setting); viewers with <em>Administer "
"users</em> permission can bypass this setting."
msgstr ""
"Pengunjung situs bisa ngirim email marang panganggo sing wis kadhaptar "
"ing situs sampeyan nganggo formulir kontak pribadi, tanpa ngerti utawa "
"ngerti alamat email pangrima. Nalika pengunjung situs ndeleng profil "
"panganggo, pangunjung bakal weruh tab utawa pranala <em>Contact</em>, "
"sing ngarahake menyang formulir kontak pribadi. Pranala kontak pribadi "
"ora ditampilake nalika sampeyan ndeleng profil sampeyan dhewe, lan "
"panganggo kudu nduwe ijin <em>View user information</em> (kanggo "
"ndeleng profil panganggo) lan <em>Use users' personal contact "
"forms</em> supaya bisa ndeleng pranala kasebut. Panganggo sing "
"profiline dideleng uga kudu wis ngaktifake formulir kontak pribadine "
"(iki minangka setelan akun panganggo); pengunjung sing nduwe ijin "
"<em>Administer users</em> bisa ngliwati setelan iki."

msgid "Configuring contact forms"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi formulir kontak"

msgid "Linking to contact forms"
msgstr "Nyambung menyang formulir kontak"

msgid "Adding content to contact forms"
msgstr "Nambahake isi menyang formulir kontak"

msgid "@label (Translation is not supported)."
msgstr "@label (Terjemahan ora didhukung)."

msgid "@entity using @field_name"
msgstr "@entity nggunakake @field_name"

msgid "Relate each @entity with a @field_name set to the @label."
msgstr "Hubungaké saben @entity karo @field_name sing disetel dadi @label."

msgid "Configuring form displays"
msgstr "Nyetel tampilan formulir"

msgid ""
"Reference fields have several widgets available on the <em>Manage form "
"display</em> page:"
msgstr ""
"Lapangan referensi nduwèni pirang-pirang widget sing kasedhiya ing "
"kaca <em>Manage form display</em>:"

msgid ""
"The <em>Check boxes/radio buttons</em> widget displays the existing "
"entities for the entity type as check boxes or radio buttons based on "
"the <em>Allowed number of values</em> set for the field."
msgstr ""
"Widget <em>Check boxes/radio buttons</em> nampilake entitas sing wis "
"ana kanggo jinis entitas minangka kothak centhang utawa tombol radio "
"adhedhasar <em>Allowed number of values</em> sing wis disetel kanggo "
"kolom kasebut."

msgid ""
"The <em>Select list</em> widget displays the existing entities in a "
"drop-down list or scrolling list box based on the <em>Allowed number "
"of values</em> setting for the field."
msgstr ""
"Widget <em>Select list</em> nampilake entitas sing wis ana ing dhaptar "
"gulung mudhun utawa kothak dhaptar sing bisa digulung adhedhasar "
"setelan <em>Allowed number of values</em> kanggo kolom kasebut."

msgid ""
"The <em>Autocomplete</em> widget displays text fields in which users "
"can type entity labels based on the <em>Allowed number of values</em>. "
"The widget can be configured to display all entities that contain the "
"typed characters or restricted to those starting with those "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Widget <em>Autocomplete</em> nampilake kolom teks ing ngendi pangguna "
"bisa ngetik label entitas adhedhasar <em>Allowed number of "
"values</em>. Widget iki bisa dikonfigurasi kanggo nampilake kabeh "
"entitas sing ngemot karakter sing wis diketik utawa diwatesi mung "
"kanggo sing diwiwiti nganggo karakter kasebut."

msgid ""
"The <em>Autocomplete (Tags style)</em> widget displays a multi-text "
"field in which users can type in a comma-separated list of entity "
"labels."
msgstr ""
"Widget <em>Autocomplete (Tags style)</em> nampilake lapangan teks siji "
"sing bisa dienggo pangguna kanggo ngetik dhaftar label entitas sing "
"dipisah nganggo koma."

msgid ""
"Your server is not capable of displaying file upload progress. File "
"upload progress requires an Apache server running PHP with mod_php or "
"Nginx with PHP-FPM."
msgstr ""
"Server panjenengan ora bisa nampilake kemajuan unggah berkas. Kemajuan "
"unggah berkas mbutuhake server Apache sing mlaku PHP nganggo mod_php "
"utawa Nginx nganggo PHP-FPM."

msgid ""
"Your server is not capable of displaying file upload progress. File "
"upload progress requires PHP be run with mod_php or PHP-FPM and not as "
"FastCGI."
msgstr ""
"Server sampeyan ora bisa nampilake kemajuan unggahan file. Kemajuan "
"unggahan file mbutuhake PHP sing dijalankan nganggo mod_php utawa "
"PHP-FPM lan ora nganggo FastCGI."

msgid "Display download path"
msgstr "Tampilake jalur undhuhan"

msgid "Display the filemime as icon"
msgstr "Tampilaké filemime minangka ikon"

msgid "Detect tar"
msgstr "Ndeteksi tar"

msgid "Link this field to the file download URL"
msgstr "Tautna lapangan iki menyang URL undhuhan berkas"

msgid "File link"
msgstr "Tautan file"

msgid "Include tar in extension"
msgstr "Kalebu tar ing ekstensi"

msgid ""
"If the part of the filename just before the extension is '.tar', "
"include this in the extension output."
msgstr ""
"Yen bagean saka jeneng file sakdurunge ekstensi iku '.tar', lebokna "
"iki ing output ekstensi."

msgid "Display the file download URI"
msgstr "Tampilaké URI undhuhan berkas"

msgid "Display an icon"
msgstr "Tampilake ikon"

msgid ""
"The icon is representing the file type, instead of the MIME text (such "
"as \"image/jpeg\")"
msgstr "Ikon iku makili jinis file, tinimbang teks MIME (kaya \"image/jpeg\")"

msgid "Using text fields with text formats"
msgstr "Nggunakake kolom teks karo format teks"

msgid ""
"Text fields that allow text formats are those with \"formatted\" in "
"the description. These are <em>Text (formatted, long, with "
"summary)</em>, <em>Text (formatted)</em>, and <em>Text (formatted, "
"long)</em>. You cannot change the type of field once a field has been "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Lapangan teks sing ngidini format teks yaiku sing ana tembung "
"\"formatted\" ing gambarané. Iki kalebu <em>Text (formatted, long, "
"with summary)</em>, <em>Text (formatted)</em>, lan <em>Text "
"(formatted, long)</em>. Sampeyan ora bisa ngganti jinis lapangan "
"sawisé lapangan iku wis digawe."

msgid "Setting the allowed link type"
msgstr "Nyetel jinis pranala sing diidini"

msgid ""
"In the field settings you can define the allowed link type to be "
"<em>internal links only</em>, <em>external links only</em>, or "
"<em>both internal and external links</em>. <em>Internal links "
"only</em> and <em>both internal and external links</em> options enable "
"an autocomplete widget for internal links, so a user does not have to "
"copy or remember a URL."
msgstr ""
"Ing setelan lapangan, sampeyan bisa nemtokake jinis pranala sing "
"diijini dadi <em>pranala internal wae</em>, <em>pranala eksternal "
"wae</em>, utawa <em>pranala internal lan eksternal</em>. Pilihan "
"<em>pranala internal wae</em> lan <em>pranala internal lan "
"eksternal</em> ngaktifake widget autocomplete kanggo pranala internal, "
"supaya pangguna ora kudu nyalin utawa ngelingi URL."

msgid ""
"Revisions allow you to track differences between multiple versions of "
"your content, and revert to older versions."
msgstr ""
"Revisi ngidini sampeyan nglacak bedane antarane versi-versi isi "
"sampeyan sing beda, lan mbalekake menyang versi lawas."

msgid "@type %title has been reverted to the revision from %revision-date."
msgstr "@type %title wis dibalekake menyang revisi saka %revision-date."

msgid "Speeding up your site"
msgstr "Nggancangake situs sampeyan"

msgid "Site default language code"
msgstr "Kode basa standar situs"

msgid "Page caching"
msgstr "Caching kaca"

msgid ""
"Allowing users to add new terms gradually builds a vocabulary as "
"content is added and edited. Users can add new terms if either of the "
"two <em>Autocomplete</em> widgets is chosen for the Taxonomy term "
"reference field in the <em>Manage form display</em> page for the "
"field. You will also need to enable the <em>Create referenced entities "
"if they don't already exist</em> option, and restrict the field to one "
"vocabulary."
msgstr ""
"Ngidini pangguna kanggo nambah istilah anyar kanthi bertahap mbangun "
"kosakata nalika konten ditambahake lan diedit. Pangguna bisa nambah "
"istilah anyar yen salah siji saka loro widget <em>Autocomplete</em> "
"dipilih kanggo kolom referensi istilah Taksonomi ing kaca <em>Manage "
"form display</em> kanggo kolom kasebut. Sampeyan uga kudu ngaktifake "
"pilihan <em>Create referenced entities if they don't already "
"exist</em>, lan mbatesi kolom kasebut mung kanggo siji kosakata."

msgid ""
"If you choose <em>Text (plain)</em> or <em>Text (formatted)</em> as "
"the field type on the <em>Manage fields</em> page, then a field with a "
"single row is displayed. You can change the maximum text length in the "
"<em>Field settings</em> when you set up the field."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan milih <em>Text (plain)</em> utawa <em>Text "
"(formatted)</em> minangka jinis kolom ing kaca <em>Manage fields</em>, "
"mula bakal ditampilake kolom kanthi siji baris. Sampeyan bisa ngganti "
"dawa maksimum teks ing <em>Field settings</em> nalika nyetel kolom "
"kasebut."

msgid ""
"If you choose <em>Text (plain, long)</em>, <em>Text (formatted, "
"long)</em>, or <em>Text (formatted, long, with summary)</em> on the "
"<em>Manage fields</em> page, then users can insert text of unlimited "
"length. On the <em>Manage form display</em> page, you can set the "
"number of rows that are displayed to users."
msgstr ""
"Yen panjenengan milih <em>Text (plain, long)</em>, <em>Text "
"(formatted, long)</em>, utawa <em>Text (formatted, long, with "
"summary)</em> ing kaca <em>Manage fields</em>, mula panganggo bisa "
"ngetik teks kanthi dawa tanpa wates. Ing kaca <em>Manage form "
"display</em>, panjenengan bisa nyetel jumlah baris sing ditampilake "
"marang panganggo."

msgid ""
"As an alternative to using a trimmed version of the text, you can "
"enter a separate summary by choosing the <em>Text (formatted, long, "
"with summary)</em> field type on the <em>Manage fields</em> page. Even "
"when <em>Summary input</em> is enabled, and summaries are provided, "
"you can display <em>trimmed</em> text nonetheless by choosing the "
"appropriate format on the <em>Manage display</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Minangka alternatif kanggo nggunakake versi teks sing dipotong, "
"sampeyan bisa ngetik ringkesan kapisah kanthi milih jinis kolom "
"<em>Text (formatted, long, with summary)</em> ing kaca <em>Manage "
"fields</em>. Sanajan <em>Summary input</em> diaktifake, lan ringkesan "
"wis diwenehake, sampeyan isih bisa nampilake teks sing "
"<em>dipotong</em> kanthi milih format sing cocog ing kaca <em>Manage "
"display</em>."

msgid "Link to the user"
msgstr "Tautan menyang pangguna"

msgid "Display the user or author name."
msgstr "Tampilna jeneng pangguna utawa pangripta."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Password required for protected field change"
msgstr "Sandi dibutuhake kanggo ngganti kolom sing dilindhungi"

msgid "Text to use for this variant, @count will be replaced with the value."
msgstr ""
"Tèks sing bakal digunakké kanggo varian iki, @count bakal diganti "
"karo nilaine."

msgid ""
"Text to use for the singular form, @count will be replaced with the "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Tèkst sing digunakake kanggo wangun tunggal, @count bakal diganti "
"nganggo nilé."

msgid "Contains US ASCII characters only"
msgstr "Mung ngemot karakter US ASCII saja"

msgid "Checkout complete! Thank you for your purchase."
msgstr ""
"Pembayaran wis rampung! Matur nuwun sanget kanggo panjenenganipun "
"tumbas."

msgid "Resolving missing content"
msgstr "Nglampahi isi sing ilang"

msgid "The following @entity-type translations will be deleted:"
msgstr "Terjemahan @entity-type ing ngisor iki bakal dihapus:"

msgid "Delete @language translation"
msgstr "Mbusak terjemahan @language"

msgid "The @entity-type %label @language translation has been deleted."
msgstr "Terjemahan @entity-type %label @language wis dibusak."

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete the @language translation of the "
"@entity-type %label?"
msgstr ""
"Apa sampeyan yakin pengin mbusak terjemahan @language saka "
"@entity-type %label?"

msgid "The core.extension configuration does not exist."
msgstr "Konfigurasi core.extension ora ana."

msgid "Unable to install the %module module since it does not exist."
msgstr "Ora bisa nginstal modul %module amarga modul kasebut ora ana."

msgid ""
"Unable to uninstall the %module module since the %dependent_module "
"module is installed."
msgstr ""
"Ora bisa mbusak modul %module amarga modul %dependent_module isih "
"dipasang."

msgid "Unable to install the %theme theme since it does not exist."
msgstr "Ora bisa masang tema %theme amarga tema iki ora ana."

msgid ""
"Unable to install the %theme theme since it requires the "
"%required_theme theme."
msgstr "Ora bisa masang tema %theme amarga butuh tema %required_theme."

msgid ""
"Unable to uninstall the %theme theme since the %dependent_theme theme "
"is installed."
msgstr ""
"Ora bisa mbusak tema %theme amarga tema %dependent_theme isih "
"dipasang."

msgid ""
"Configuration %name depends on the %owner module that will not be "
"installed after import."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang modul %owner sing ora bakal "
"diinstal sawise impor."

msgid ""
"Configuration %name depends on the %owner theme that will not be "
"installed after import."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang tema %owner sing ora bakal diinstal "
"sawise impor."

msgid ""
"Configuration %name depends on the %owner extension that will not be "
"installed after import."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang ekstensi %owner sing ora bakal "
"dipasang sawise import."

msgid ""
"Unable to install the %module module since it requires the "
"%required_module module."
msgid_plural ""
"Unable to install the %module module since it requires the "
"%required_module modules."
msgstr[0] ""
"Ora bisa masang modul %module amarga mbutuhake modul %required_module. "
" \n"
"Ora bisa masang modul %module amarga mbutuhake modul-modul "
"%required_module."

msgid ""
"Configuration %name depends on the %module module that will not be "
"installed after import."
msgid_plural ""
"Configuration %name depends on modules (%module) that will not be "
"installed after import."
msgstr[0] ""
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang modul %module sing ora bakal "
"dipasang sawise impor.  \n"
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang "
"modul-modul (%module) sing ora bakal dipasang sawise impor."

msgid ""
"Configuration %name depends on the %theme theme that will not be "
"installed after import."
msgid_plural ""
"Configuration %name depends on themes (%theme) that will not be "
"installed after import."
msgstr[0] ""
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang tema %theme sing ora bakal dipasang "
"sawise impor.  \n"
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang tema-tema "
"(%theme) sing ora bakal dipasang sawise impor."

msgid ""
"Configuration %name depends on the %config configuration that will not "
"exist after import."
msgid_plural ""
"Configuration %name depends on configuration (%config) that will not "
"exist after import."
msgstr[0] ""
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang konfigurasi %config sing ora bakal "
"ana sawise impor.  \n"
"Konfigurasi %name gumantung marang konfigurasi "
"(%config) sing ora bakal ana sawise impor."

msgid "Interface text"
msgstr "Tèks Antarmuka"

msgid ""
"Order of language detection methods for interface text. If a "
"translation of interface text is available in the detected language, "
"it will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Urutan metode deteksi basa kanggo teks antarmuka. Yen terjemahan teks "
"antarmuka ana ing basa sing dideteksi, bakal ditampilake."

msgid "Inaccessible"
msgstr "Ora bisa diakses"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "NotNull"
msgstr "OraNull"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Null"
msgstr "Null"

msgid "Link to translate @entity_type_label"
msgstr "Tautan kanggo nerjemahake @entity_type_label"

msgid "Provide a translation link to the @entity_type_label."
msgstr "Wenehi pranala terjemahan menyang @entity_type_label."

msgid "Interface text language selected for page"
msgstr "Basa teks antarmuka sing dipilih kanggo kaca"

msgid ""
"Customize %language_name language detection to differ from Interface "
"text language detection settings"
msgstr ""
"Sesuaikan deteksi basa %language_name supaya béda saka setelan "
"deteksi basa teks Antar Muka"

msgid ""
"The domain for %language may only contain the domain name, not a "
"trailing slash, protocol and/or port."
msgstr ""
"Domain kanggo %language mung bisa ngandhut jeneng domain, ora kalebu "
"slash mburi, protokol lan/utawa port."

msgid "@language translation of the @type %label has been deleted."
msgstr "Terjemahan @language saka @type %label wis dibusak."

msgid "Xdebug settings"
msgstr "Setelan Xdebug"

msgid "xdebug.max_nesting_level is set to %value."
msgstr "xdebug.max_nesting_level disetel dadi %value."

msgid ""
"Set <code>xdebug.max_nesting_level=@level</code> in your PHP "
"configuration as some pages in your Drupal site will not work when "
"this setting is too low."
msgstr ""
"Setel <code>xdebug.max_nesting_level=@level</code> ing konfigurasi PHP "
"panjenengan amarga sawetara kaca ing situs Drupal panjenengan ora "
"bakal bisa digunakake yen setelan iki kakehan endhek."

msgid "Trimmed limit"
msgstr "Watesan sing dipotong"

msgid ""
"If the summary is not set, the trimmed %label field will end at the "
"last full sentence before this character limit."
msgstr ""
"Yen ringkesan ora disetel, lapangan %label sing dipotong bakal rampung "
"ing ukara lengkap pungkasan sadurunge wates karakter iki."

msgid "Trimmed limit: @trim_length characters"
msgstr "Watesan dipotong: @trim_length karakter"

msgid "Working with multilingual views"
msgstr "Kerja karo views multilingual"

msgid ""
"If your site has multiple languages and translated entities, each "
"result row in a view will contain one translation of each involved "
"entity (a view can involve multiple entities if it uses "
"relationships). You can use a filter to restrict your view to one "
"language: without filtering, if an entity has three translations it "
"will add three rows to the results; if you filter by language, at most "
"one result will appear (it could be zero if that particular entity "
"does not have a translation matching your language filter choice). If "
"a view uses relationships, each entity in the relationship needs to be "
"filtered separately. You can filter a view to a fixed language choice, "
"such as English or Spanish, or to the language selected by the page "
"the view is displayed on (the language that is selected for the page "
"by the language detection settings either for Content or User "
"interface)."
msgstr ""
"Yen situs sampeyan duwe pirang-pirang basa lan entitas sing wis "
"diterjemahake, saben baris asil ing view bakal ngemot siji terjemahan "
"saka saben entitas sing melu (view bisa melu pirang-pirang entitas yen "
"nggunakake hubungan). Sampeyan bisa nggunakake filter kanggo matesi "
"view supaya mung nganggo siji basa: tanpa filter, yen siji entitas "
"nduweni telung terjemahan, bakal nambah telung baris menyang asil; yen "
"sampeyan filter miturut basa, paling akeh siji asil sing bakal katon "
"(bisa uga nol yen entitas tartamtu ora duwe terjemahan sing cocog karo "
"pilihan filter basa sampeyan). Yen view nggunakake hubungan, saben "
"entitas ing hubungan kasebut kudu difilter kanthi kapisah. Sampeyan "
"bisa nyetel filter view kanggo pilihan basa tetep, kayata Inggris "
"utawa Spanyol, utawa kanggo basa sing dipilih dening kaca sing "
"nampilake view kasebut (basa sing dipilih kanggo kaca kasebut miturut "
"setelan deteksi basa, bisa kanggo Konten utawa Antarmuka Pengguna)."

msgid ""
"Because each result row contains a specific translation of each "
"entity, field-level filters are also relative to these entity "
"translations. For example, if your view has a filter that specifies "
"that the entity title should contain a particular English word, you "
"will presumably filter out all rows containing Chinese translations, "
"since they will not contain the English word. If your view also has a "
"second filter specifying that the title should contain a particular "
"Chinese word, and if you are using \"And\" logic for filtering, you "
"will presumably end up with no results in the view, because there are "
"probably not any entity translations containing both the English and "
"Chinese words in the title."
msgstr ""
"Amarga saben baris asil ngemot terjemahan khusus saka saben entitas, "
"filter tingkat lapangan uga ana gandhengane karo terjemahan entitas "
"iki. Contone, yen tampilanmu duwe filter sing netepake yen judhul "
"entitas kudu ngemot tembung Inggris tartamtu, sampeyan mesthine bakal "
"nyaring metu kabeh baris sing ngemot terjemahan Cina, amarga ora bakal "
"ngemot tembung Inggris kasebut. Yen tampilanmu uga nduweni filter "
"kapindho sing netepake yen judhul kudu ngemot tembung Cina tartamtu, "
"lan yen sampeyan nggunakake logika \"Lan\" kanggo nyaring, sampeyan "
"mesthine ora bakal entuk asil apa-apa ing tampilan, amarga kemungkinan "
"ora ana terjemahan entitas sing ngemot tembung Inggris lan Cina "
"bebarengan ing judhul."

msgid ""
"Independent of filtering, you can choose the display language (the "
"language used to display the entities and their fields) via a setting "
"on the display. Your language choices are the same as the filter "
"language choices, with an additional choice of \"Content language of "
"view row\" and \"Original language of content in view row\", which "
"means to display each entity in the result row using the language that "
"entity has or in which it was originally created. In theory, this "
"would give you the flexibility to filter to French translations, for "
"instance, and then display the results in Spanish. The more usual "
"choices would be to use the same language choices for the display "
"language and each entity filter in the view, or to use the Row "
"language setting for the display."
msgstr ""
"Mèkatan saring, kowé isa milih basa tampilan (basa sing digunakaké "
"kanggo nampilaké entitas lan kolom-kolomé) liwat setelan ing "
"tampilan. Pilihan basamu padha karo pilihan basa saringan, kanthi "
"pilihan tambahan \"Basa kontèn saka baris tampilan\" lan \"Basa asli "
"kontèn ing baris tampilan\", sing artiné nampilaké saben entitas "
"ing baris asil nganggo basa sing diduwèni utawa basa asli nalika "
"digawe. Sacara teori, iki maringi kowé kebebasan kanggo nyaring "
"terjemahan menyang basa Prancis, contoné, banjur nampilaké asilé "
"nganggo basa Spanyol. Pilihan sing luwih umum yaiku nggunakake pilihan "
"basa sing padha kanggo basa tampilan lan saben saringan entitas ing "
"tampilan, utawa nggunakake setelan basa Baris kanggo tampilan."

