"nyedhiyakake pitulungan babagan iki lan topik liyane."

msgid ""
"The @drupal installer requires write permissions to %file during the "
"installation process. The <a href=\":handbook_url\">webhosting "
"issues</a> documentation section offers help on this and other topics."
msgstr ""
"Pemasang @drupal perlu ijin nulis menyang %file sajrone proses "
"instalasi. Bagéan dokumentasi <a href=\":handbook_url\">masalah "
"webhosting</a> nyedhiyakake pitulung babagan iki lan topik liyane."

msgid ""
"The @drupal installer failed to create a %file file with proper file "
"ownership. Log on to your web server, remove the existing %file file, "
"and create a new one by copying the %default_file file to %file. More "
"details about installing Drupal are available in <a "
"href=\":install_txt\">INSTALL.txt</a>. The <a "
"href=\":handbook_url\">webhosting issues</a> documentation section "
"offers help on this and other topics."
msgstr ""
"Penginstal @drupal gagal nggawe file %file kanthi kepemilikan file "
"sing bener. Login menyang server web sampeyan, hapus file %file sing "
"wis ana, lan nggawe sing anyar kanthi nyalin file %default_file "
"menyang %file. Informasi luwih lengkap babagan nginstal Drupal "
"kasedhiya ing <a href=\":install_txt\">INSTALL.txt</a>. Bagian "
"dokumentasi <a href=\":handbook_url\">masalah webhosting</a> nawakake "
"pitulung babagan iki lan topik liyane."

msgid ""
"Check the messages and <a href=\":retry\">retry</a>, or you may choose "
"to <a href=\":cont\">continue anyway</a>."
msgstr ""
"Priksa pesen-pesen lan <a href=\":retry\">coba maneh</a>, utawa "
"sampeyan bisa milih <a href=\":cont\">nerusake wae</a>."

msgid "Check the messages and <a href=\":url\">try again</a>."
msgstr "Priksa pesen-pesen lan <a href=\":url\">coba maneh</a>."

msgid ""
"The following modules are required but were not found. Move them into "
"the appropriate modules subdirectory, such as <em>/modules</em>. "
"Missing modules: @modules"
msgstr ""
"Modul-modul ing ngisor iki dibutuhake nanging ora ditemokake. "
"Pindhahake menyang subdirektori modul sing cocog, kaya ta "
"<em>/modules</em>. Modul sing ora ana: @modules"

msgid "Updating @module"
msgstr "Nganyari @module"

msgid ""
"Entity type mismatch on rename. @old_type not equal to @new_type for "
"existing configuration @old_name and staged configuration @new_name."
msgstr ""
"Mismatch jinis entitas nalika ganti jeneng. @old_type ora padha karo "
"@new_type kanggo konfigurasi sing wis ana @old_name lan konfigurasi "
"sing disiapake @new_name."

msgid ""
"Rename operation for simple configuration. Existing configuration "
"@old_name and staged configuration @new_name."
msgstr ""
"Operasi ganti jeneng kanggo konfigurasi sederhana. Konfigurasi sing "
"wis ana @old_name lan konfigurasi sing wis disiapake @new_name."

msgid ""
"The %driver database must use %encoding encoding to work with Drupal. "
"Recreate the database with %encoding encoding. See <a "
"href=\"INSTALL.pgsql.txt\">INSTALL.pgsql.txt</a> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Database %driver kudu nggunakake encoding %encoding supaya bisa "
"digunakake karo Drupal. Gawe maneh database nganggo encoding "
"%encoding. Delengen <a "
"href=\"INSTALL.pgsql.txt\">INSTALL.pgsql.txt</a> kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"The %setting setting is currently set to '%current_value', but needs "
"to be '%needed_value'. Change this by running the following query: "
"<code>@query</code>"
msgstr ""
"Setelan %setting saiki wis disetel dadi '%current_value', nanging kudu "
"dadi '%needed_value'. Owahi iki kanthi mbukak pitakonan ing ngisor "
"iki: <code>@query</code>"

msgid "@uri"
msgstr "@uri"

msgid "Operating in maintenance mode. <a href=\":url\">Go online.</a>"
msgstr "Mbukak ing mode pangopènan. <a href=\":url\">Mlebu online.</a>"

msgid "Textfield size: @size"
msgstr "Ukuran Textfield: @size"

msgid "Number of rows: @rows"
msgstr "Jumlah baris: @rows"

msgid "URI field size: @size"
msgstr "Ukuran field URI: @size"

msgid ""
"WARNING: You are not using an encrypted connection, so your password "
"will be sent in plain text. <a href=\":https-link\">Learn more</a>."
msgstr ""
"WARNING: Sampeyan ora nggunakake sambungan sing dienkripsi, mula "
"sandhi sampeyan bakal dikirim kanthi teks polos. <a "
"href=\":https-link\">Sinau luwih lengkap</a>."

msgid ""
"@name cannot be longer than %max characters but is currently %length "
"characters long."
msgstr ""
"@name ora kena luwih saka %max aksara nanging saiki dawane %length "
"aksara."

msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li>To start over, you must empty your existing database and "
"copy <em>default.settings.php</em> over "
"<em>settings.php</em>.</li>\n"
"<li>To upgrade an existing installation, "
"proceed to the <a href=\":update-url\">update "
"script</a>.</li>\n"
"<li>View your <a href=\":base-url\">existing "
"site</a>.</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Kanggo miwiti maneh, sampeyan kudu ngresiki database sing "
"wis ana lan nyalin <em>default.settings.php</em> menyang "
"<em>settings.php</em>.</li>\n"
"<li>Kanggo nganyari instalasi sing wis "
"ana, terusake menyang <a href=\":update-url\">script "
"update</a>.</li>\n"
"<li>Ndeleng <a href=\":base-url\">situs sampeyan "
"sing wis ana</a>.</li>\n"
"</ul>"

msgid ""
"All necessary changes to %dir and %file have been made, so you should "
"remove write permissions to them now in order to avoid security risks. "
"If you are unsure how to do so, consult the <a "
"href=\":handbook_url\">online handbook</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kabeh owah-owahan sing perlu ing %dir lan %file wis rampung, mula "
"saiki sampeyan kudu mbusak ijin nulis kanggo supaya ora ana risiko "
"keamanan. Yen sampeyan ora yakin cara nindakake, delengen <a "
"href=\":handbook_url\">buku pandhuan online</a>."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Unique field constraint"
msgstr "Watesan lapangan unik"

msgid "A @entity_type with @field_name %value already exists."
msgstr "A @entity_type kanthi @field_name %value wis ana."

msgid ""
"The message that should be sent. You may include placeholders like "
"[node:title], [user:account-name], [user:display-name] and "
"[comment:body] to represent data that will be different each time "
"message is sent. Not all placeholders will be available in all "
"contexts."
msgstr ""
"Pesen sing kudu dikirim. Sampeyan bisa nyakup placeholder kaya "
"[node:title], [user:account-name], [user:display-name], lan "
"[comment:body] kanggo ngganteni data sing bakal beda saben pesen "
"dikirim. Ora kabeh placeholder bakal kasedhiya ing kabeh konteks."

msgid ""
"The message to be displayed to the current user. You may include "
"placeholders like [node:title], [user:account-name], "
"[user:display-name] and [comment:body] to represent data that will be "
"different each time message is sent. Not all placeholders will be "
"available in all contexts."
msgstr ""
"Pesen sing bakal ditampilake kanggo pangguna saiki. Sampeyan bisa "
"nyakup placeholder kaya [node:title], [user:account-name], "
"[user:display-name], lan [comment:body] kanggo nggambarake data sing "
"bakal beda-beda saben pesen dikirim. Ora kabeh placeholder bakal "
"kasedhiya ing kabeh konteks."

msgid ""
"The Ban module allows administrators to ban visits to their site from "
"individual IP addresses. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":url\">online documentation for the Ban module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Ban ngidini administrator kanggo mlarang kunjungan menyang situs "
"saka alamat IP individu. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":url\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Ban</a>."

msgid ""
"Administrators can enter IP addresses to ban on the <a "
"href=\":bans\">IP address bans</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Administrator bisa mlebu alamat IP kanggo dilarang ing kaca <a "
"href=\":bans\">larangan alamat IP</a>."

msgid ""
"The HTTP Basic Authentication module supplies an <a "
"href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basic_access_authentication\">HTTP "
"Basic authentication</a> provider for web service requests. This "
"authentication provider authenticates requests using the HTTP Basic "
"Authentication username and password, as an alternative to using "
"Drupal's standard cookie-based authentication system. It is only "
"useful if your site provides web services configured to use this type "
"of authentication (for instance, the <a href=\":rest_help\">RESTful "
"Web Services module</a>). For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":hba_do\">online documentation for the HTTP Basic "
"Authentication module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul HTTP Basic Authentication nyedhiyakake <a "
"href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basic_access_authentication\">HTTP "
"Basic authentication</a> minangka panyedhiya kanggo panjalukan layanan "
"web. Panyedhiya autentikasi iki ngautentikasi panjalukan kanthi "
"nggunakake jeneng pangguna lan sandhi HTTP Basic Authentication, "
"minangka alternatif saka sistem autentikasi adhedhasar cookie standar "
"Drupal. Iki mung migunani yen situs sampeyan nyedhiyakake layanan web "
"sing dikonfigurasi nggunakake jinis autentikasi iki (umpamane, <a "
"href=\":rest_help\">modul RESTful Web Services</a>). Kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap, deleng <a href=\":hba_do\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul HTTP Basic Authentication</a>."

msgid ""
"The Block module allows you to place blocks in regions of your "
"installed themes, and configure block settings. For more information, "
"see the <a href=\":blocks-documentation\">online documentation for the "
"Block module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Block ngidini sampeyan nyelehake blok ing wilayah tema sing wis "
"diinstal, lan nyetel setelan blok. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":blocks-documentation\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul Block</a>."

msgid ""
"You can see where the regions are for the current theme by clicking "
"the <em>Demonstrate block regions</em> link on the <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>. Regions are specific to each "
"theme."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa ndeleng ing ngendi wilayah-wilayah kanggo tema saiki "
"kanthi ngeklik pranala <em>Demonstrate block regions</em> ing <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Kaca tata letak blok</a>. Wilayah-wilayah iku khusus "
"kanggo saben tema."

msgid ""
"To change the settings of an individual block click on the "
"<em>Configure</em> link on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout "
"page</a>. The available options vary depending on the module that "
"provides the block. For all blocks you can change the block title and "
"toggle whether to display it."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngganti setelan saka blok individu, klik pranala "
"<em>Configure</em> ing kaca <a href=\":blocks\">Tata letak Blok</a>. "
"Pilihan sing kasedhiya beda-beda gumantung saka modul sing "
"nyedhiyakake blok kasebut. Kanggo kabeh blok, sampeyan bisa ngganti "
"judhul blok lan nguripake utawa mateni tampilan judhul kasebut."

msgid ""
"The Breakpoint module keeps track of the height, width, and resolution "
"breakpoints where a responsive design needs to change in order to "
"respond to different devices being used to view the site. This module "
"does not have a user interface. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":docs\">online documentation for the Breakpoint module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Breakpoint nyathet titik pemisah dhuwur, ambane, lan resolusi "
"ing ngendi desain responsif kudu diganti kanggo nanggapi piranti sing "
"beda sing digunakake kanggo ndeleng situs. Modul iki ora duwe "
"antarmuka pangguna. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":docs\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Breakpoint</a>."

msgid ""
"<a href=\":w3\">Media  queries</a> are a formal way to encode "
"breakpoints. For instance, a width breakpoint at 40em would be written "
"as the media query \"(min-width: 40em)\". Breakpoints are really just "
"media queries with some additional meta-data, such as a name and "
"multiplier information."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":w3\">Media queries</a> iku cara resmi kanggo nyandhi "
"breakpoint. Contone, breakpoint ambane 40em bakal ditulis dadi media "
"query \"(min-width: 40em)\". Breakpoint sejatiné iku mung media "
"queries sing duwe tambahan meta-data, kaya jeneng lan informasi "
"multiplier."

msgid ""
"The Comment module allows users to comment on site content, set "
"commenting defaults and permissions, and moderate comments. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":comment\">online documentation for the "
"Comment module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Comment ngidini pangguna menehi komentar ing isi situs, nyetel "
"setelan lan ijin komentar, uga mrodhuksi komentar. Kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":comment\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul Comment</a>."

msgid "Enabling commenting"
msgstr "Ngidini komentar"

msgid "Configuring commenting settings"
msgstr "Ngatur setelan komentar"

msgid ""
"Users with the appropriate permissions can override the default "
"commenting settings of an entity type when they create an item of that "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni ijin sing cocog bisa ngowahi setelan komentar "
"standar saka jinis entitas nalika nggawe item saka jinis kasebut."

msgid ""
"Comments from users who have the <em>Skip comment approval</em> "
"permission are published immediately. All other comments are placed in "
"the <a href=\":comment-approval\">Unapproved comments</a> queue, until "
"a user who has permission to <em>Administer comments and comment "
"settings</em> publishes or deletes them. Published comments can be "
"bulk managed on the <a href=\":admin-comment\">Published comments</a> "
"administration page. When a comment has no replies, it remains "
"editable by its author, as long as the author has <em>Edit own "
"comments</em> permission."
msgstr ""
"Komentar saka pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>Skip comment approval</em> "
"langsung diterbitaké. Kabeh komentar liyané disimpen ing antrian <a "
"href=\":comment-approval\">Unapproved comments</a>, nganti ana "
"pangguna sing nduwé ijin kanggo <em>Administer comments and comment "
"settings</em> nerbitaké utawa mbusak komentar kasebut. Komentar sing "
"wis diterbitaké bisa diatur barengan ing kaca administrasi <a "
"href=\":admin-comment\">Published comments</a>. Nalika komentar durung "
"ana balasan, komentar iku isih bisa diowahi déning panganggité, asal "
"panganggit nduwé ijin <em>Edit own comments</em>."

msgid "In reply to @parent_title by @parent_username"
msgstr "Mbalas marang @parent_title déning @parent_username"

msgid "Name for @anonymous"
msgstr "Jeneng kanggo @anonymous"

msgid ""
"<a href=\":login\">Log in</a> or <a href=\":register\">register</a> to "
"post comments"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":login\">Mlebu</a> utawa <a href=\":register\">ndaftar</a> "
"kanggo ngirim komentar"

msgid "<a href=\":login\">Log in</a> to post comments"
msgstr "<a href=\":login\">Mlebu</a> kanggo ngirim komentar"

msgid ""
"Select the Comment type to use for this comment field. Manage the "
"comment types from the <a href=\":url\">administration overview "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pilih jinis Komentar sing arep digunakake kanggo kolom komentar iki. "
"Kelola jinis komentar saka <a href=\":url\">kaca ringkesan "
"administrasi</a>."

msgid ""
"The Configuration Manager module provides a user interface for "
"importing and exporting configuration changes between installations of "
"your website in different environments. Configuration is stored in "
"YAML format. For more information, see the <a href=\":url\">online "
"documentation for the Configuration Manager module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Configuration Manager nyedhiyakake antarmuka panganggo kanggo "
"ngimpor lan ngekspor owah-owahan konfigurasi antarane instalasi situs "
"web sampeyan ing lingkungan sing beda-beda. Konfigurasi disimpen ing "
"format YAML. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":url\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Configuration "
"Manager</a>."

msgid ""
"You can create and download an archive consisting of all your site's "
"configuration exported as <em>*.yml</em> files on the <a "
"href=\":url\">Export</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nggawe lan ndownload arsip sing ngemot kabeh konfigurasi "
"situs sampeyan sing diekspor minangka <em>*.yml</em> file ing kaca <a "
"href=\":url\">Export</a>."

msgid ""
"You can upload a full site configuration from an archive file on the "
"<a href=\":url\">Import</a> page. When importing data from a different "
"environment, the site and import files must have matching "
"configuration values for UUID in the <em>system.site</em> "
"configuration item. That means that your other environments should "
"initially be set up as clones of the target site. Migrations are not "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa ngunggah konfigurasi situs lengkap saka file arsip ing "
"kaca <a href=\":url\">Import</a>. Nalika ngimpor data saka lingkungan "
"sing beda, situs lan file import kudu duwe nilai konfigurasi UUID sing "
"cocog ing item konfigurasi <em>system.site</em>. Iki artine lingkungan "
"liyane kudu disetel wiwitané minangka kloning saka situs target. "
"Migrasi ora didhukung."

msgid ""
"You can review differences between the active configuration and an "
"imported configuration archive on the <a "
"href=\":synchronize\">Synchronize</a> page to ensure that the changes "
"are as expected, before finalizing the import. The Synchronize page "
"also shows configuration items that would be added or removed."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa mriksa prabédan antara konfigurasi aktif lan arsip "
"konfigurasi sing diimpor ing kaca <a "
"href=\":synchronize\">Sinkronisasi</a> kanggo mesthèkake manawa "
"owah-owahan kasebut cocog karo sing diarep-arep, sadurunge "
"ngrampungake proses impor. Kaca Sinkronisasi uga nampilake item "
"konfigurasi sing bakal ditambahaké utawa dibusak."

msgid ""
"You can export a single configuration item by selecting a "
"<em>Configuration type</em> and <em>Configuration name</em> on the <a "
"href=\":single-export\">Single export</a> page. The configuration and "
"its corresponding <em>*.yml file name</em> are then displayed on the "
"page for you to copy."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa ngekspor siji item konfigurasi kanthi milih <em>Jenis "
"Konfigurasi</em> lan <em>Jeneng Konfigurasi</em> ing kaca <a "
"href=\":single-export\">Ekspor Tunggal</a>. Konfigurasi lan <em>jeneng "
"berkas *.yml</em> sing cocog banjur bakal ditampilake ing kaca kanggo "
"sampeyan salin."

msgid ""
"You can import a single configuration item by pasting it in YAML "
"format into the form on the <a href=\":single-import\">Single "
"import</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa ngimpor siji item konfigurasi kanthi nempelake ing "
"format YAML menyang formulir ing kaca <a href=\":single-import\">Impor "
"siji</a>."

msgid ""
"Export and download the full configuration of this site as a gzipped "
"tar file."
msgstr ""
"Ekspor lan undhuh konfigurasi lengkap saka situs iki minangka berkas "
"tar sing wis dikompres nganggo gzip."

msgid "Choose a configuration item to display its YAML structure."
msgstr "Pilih item konfigurasi kanggo nampilake struktur YAML-e."

msgid ""
"Import a single configuration item by pasting its YAML structure into "
"the text field."
msgstr ""
"Impor siji item konfigurasi kanthi nempelake struktur YAML-e menyang "
"kolom teks."

msgid "Full archive"
msgstr "Arsip lengkap"

msgid "Single item"
msgstr "Barang tunggal"

msgid ""
"The following items in your active configuration have changes since "
"the last import that may be lost on the next import."
msgstr ""
"Barang-barang ing konfigurasi aktif sampeyan sing ana owah-owahan "
"wiwit impor pungkasan bisa ilang ing impor sabanjure."

msgid ""
"The Configuration Translation module allows you to translate "
"configuration text; for example, the site name, vocabularies, menus, "
"or date formats. Together with the modules <a "
"href=\":language\">Language</a>, <a "
"href=\":content-translation\">Content Translation</a>, and <a "
"href=\":locale\">Interface Translation</a>, it allows you to build "
"multilingual websites. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">online documentation for the Configuration "
"Translation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Configuration Translation ngidini kowé nerjemahaké téks "
"konfigurasi; contoné, jeneng situs, kosakata, menu, utawa format "
"tanggal. Bareng karo modul <a href=\":language\">Language</a>, <a "
"href=\":content-translation\">Content Translation</a>, lan <a "
"href=\":locale\">Interface Translation</a>, modul iki ngidini kowé "
"mbangun situs web multibahasa. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delok "
"<a href=\":doc_url\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Configuration "
"Translation</a>."

msgid ""
"In order to translate configuration, the website must have at least "
"two <a href=\":url\">languages</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nerjemahake konfigurasi, situs web kudu nduweni paling ora loro "
"<a href=\":url\">basa</a>."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Translate user edited configuration</em> permission "
"can access the configuration translation overview, and manage "
"translations for specific languages. The <a "
"href=\":translation-page\">Configuration translation</a> page shows a "
"list of all configuration text that can be translated, either as "
"individual items or as lists. After you click on <em>Translate</em>, "
"you are provided with a list of all languages. You can <em>add</em> or "
"<em>edit</em> a translation for a specific language. Users with "
"specific configuration permissions can also <em>edit</em> the text for "
"the site's default language. For some configuration text items (for "
"example for the site information), the specific translation pages can "
"also be accessed directly from their configuration pages."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni idin <em>Translate user edited "
"configuration</em> bisa ngakses ringkesan terjemahan konfigurasi, lan "
"ngatur terjemahan kanggo basa tartamtu. Kaca <a "
"href=\":translation-page\">Configuration translation</a> nuduhaké "
"dhaptar kabeh teks konfigurasi sing bisa diterjemahaké, bisa minangka "
"item individu utawa minangka dhaptar. Sawisé sampeyan ngeklik "
"<em>Translate</em>, sampeyan bakal diwènèhi dhaptar kabeh basa. "
"Sampeyan bisa <em>nambah</em> utawa <em>ngowahi</em> terjemahan kanggo "
"basa tartamtu. Pangguna sing nduwèni idin konfigurasi tartamtu uga "
"bisa <em>ngowahi</em> teks kanggo basa bawaan situs. Kanggo sawetara "
"item teks konfigurasi (umpamane kanggo informasi situs), kaca "
"terjemahan tartamtu uga bisa diakses langsung saka kaca konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"You can choose to translate date formats on the <a "
"href=\":translation-page\">Configuration translation</a> page. This "
"allows you not only to translate the label text, but also to set a "
"language-specific <em>PHP date format</em>."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa milih kanggo nerjemahake format tanggal ing kaca <a "
"href=\":translation-page\">Terjemahan konfigurasi</a>. Iki ora mung "
"ngidini sampeyan nerjemahake teks label, nanging uga nyetel <em>format "
"tanggal PHP</em> sing khusus kanggo basa tartamtu."

msgid "@label <span class=\"visually-hidden\">(@source_language)</span>"
msgstr "@label <span class=\"visually-hidden\">(@source_language)</span>"

msgid ""
"The Contact module allows visitors to contact registered users on your "
"site, using the personal contact form, and also allows you to set up "
"site-wide contact forms. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":contact\">online documentation for the Contact module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Contact ngidini para pengunjung ngubungi pangguna sing wis "
"kadhaptar ing situs sampeyan, nggunakake formulir kontak pribadi, lan "
"uga ngidini sampeyan nyetel formulir kontak kanggo sakabehe situs. "
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":contact\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Contact</a>."

msgid ""
"On the <a href=\":contact_admin\">Contact forms page</a>, you can "
"configure the fields and display of the personal contact form, and you "
"can set up one or more site-wide contact forms. Each site-wide contact "
"form has a machine name, a label, and one or more defined recipients; "
"when a site visitor submits the form, the field values are sent to "
"those recipients."
msgstr ""
"Ing <a href=\":contact_admin\">Kaca formulir Kontak</a>, sampeyan bisa "
"nyetel kolom lan tampilan formulir kontak pribadi, lan sampeyan uga "
"bisa nyiyapake siji utawa luwih formulir kontak kanggo sakabehing "
"situs. Saben formulir kontak sakabehing situs nduweni jeneng mesin, "
"label, lan siji utawa luwih panampa sing wis ditemtokake; nalika "
"pengunjung situs ngirim formulir kasebut, nilai kolom bakal dikirim "
"menyang panampa-panampa mau."

msgid ""
"One site-wide contact form can be designated as the default contact "
"form. If you choose to designate a default form, the <em>Contact</em> "
"menu link in the <em>Footer</em> menu will link to it. You can modify "
"this link from the <a href=\":menu-settings\">Menus page</a> if you "
"have the Menu UI module installed. You can also create links to other "
"contact forms; the URL for each form you have set up has format "
"<em>contact/machine_name_of_form</em>."
msgstr ""
"Salah siji formulir kontak sak situs bisa ditetepake minangka formulir "
"kontak standar. Yen sampeyan milih kanggo nemtokake formulir standar, "
"pranala menu <em>Contact</em> ing menu <em>Footer</em> bakal nyambung "
"menyang iku. Sampeyan bisa ngowahi pranala iki saka <a "
"href=\":menu-settings\">kaca Menus</a> yen sampeyan wis masang modul "
"Menu UI. Sampeyan uga bisa nggawe pranala menyang formulir kontak "
"liyane; URL kanggo saben formulir sing wis sampeyan atur nduweni "
"format <em>contact/machine_name_of_form</em>."

msgid ""
"From the <a href=\":contact_admin\">Contact forms page</a>, you can "
"configure the fields to be shown on contact forms, including their "
"labels and help text. If you would like other content (such as text or "
"images) to appear on a contact form, use a block. You can create and "
"edit blocks on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>, if the "
"Block module is installed."
msgstr ""
"Saka <a href=\":contact_admin\">Kaca formulir kontak</a>, sampeyan "
"bisa nyetel lapangan sing bakal ditampilake ing formulir kontak, "
"kalebu label lan teks pitulung. Yen sampeyan pengin isi liyane (kaya "
"teks utawa gambar) metu ing formulir kontak, gunakake blok. Sampeyan "
"bisa nggawe lan nyunting blok ing <a href=\":blocks\">Kaca tata letak "
"blok</a>, yen modul Blok wis diinstal."

msgid "[@form] @subject"
msgstr "[@form] @subject"

msgid ""
"@sender-name (@sender-url) sent a message using the contact form at "
"@form-url."
msgstr ""
"@sender-name (@sender-url) ngirim pesen nganggo formulir kontak ing "
"@form-url."

msgid "[@site-name] @subject"
msgstr "[@site-name] @subject"

msgid "Hello @recipient-name,"
msgstr "Halo @recipient-name,"

msgid ""
"@sender-name (@sender-url) has sent you a message via your contact "
"form at @site-name."
msgstr ""
"@sender-name (@sender-url) wis ngirim pesen kanggo sampeyan liwat "
"formulir kontak ing @site-name."

msgid "@name (not verified)"
msgstr "@name (durung diverifikasi)"

msgid ""
"The contact form has not been configured. <a href=\":add\">Add one or "
"more forms</a> ."
msgstr ""
"Form kontak durung disetel. <a href=\":add\">Tambah siji utawa luwih "
"formulir</a> ."

msgid ""
"In order to translate content, the website must have at least two <a "
"href=\":url\">languages</a>. When that is the case, you can enable "
"translation for the desired content entities on the <a "
"href=\":translation-entity\">Content language</a> page. When enabling "
"translation you can choose the default language for content and decide "
"whether to show the language selection field on the content editing "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nerjemahake isi, situs web kudu nduwe paling ora loro <a "
"href=\":url\">basa</a>. Nalika kahanan kuwi wis ana, sampeyan bisa "
"ngaktifake terjemahan kanggo entitas isi sing dikarepake ing kaca <a "
"href=\":translation-entity\">Basa konten</a>. Nalika ngaktifake "
"terjemahan, sampeyan bisa milih basa standar kanggo isi lan mutusake "
"apa arep nampilake kolom pilihan basa ing formulir sunting isi."

msgid ""
"Before you can translate content, there must be at least two languages "
"added on the <a href=\":url\">languages administration</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Sadurunge sampeyan bisa nerjemahake isi, kudu ana paling ora loro basa "
"sing wis ditambahake ing kaca <a href=\":url\">administrasi basa</a>."

msgid ""
"To configure translation for this field, <a "
"href=\":language-settings-url\">enable language support</a> for this "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nyetel terjemahan kanggo lapangan iki, <a "
"href=\":language-settings-url\">aktifake dhukungan basa</a> kanggo "
"jinis iki."

msgid ""
"<a href=\":settings_url\">Enable translation</a> for <em>content "
"types</em>, <em>taxonomy vocabularies</em>, <em>accounts</em>, or any "
"other element you wish to translate."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":settings_url\">Ngaktifake terjemahan</a> kanggo <em>jinis "
"isi</em>, <em>vokabuler taksonomi</em>, <em>akun</em>, utawa unsur "
"liya sing pengin sampeyan terjemahake."

msgid ""
"The Contextual links module gives users with the <em>Use contextual "
"links</em> permission quick access to tasks associated with certain "
"areas of pages on your site. For example, a menu displayed as a block "
"has links to edit the menu and configure the block. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":contextual\">online documentation for "
"the Contextual Links module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Tautan Kontekstual menehi pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>Gunakake "
"tautan kontekstual</em> akses cepet menyang tugas-tugas sing "
"gegandhengan karo bagean-bagean tartamtu ing kaca situs sampeyan. "
"Contone, menu sing ditampilake minangka blok nduwé tautan kanggo "
"ngowahi menu lan nyetel blok kasebut. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":contextual\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Tautan Kontekstual</a>."

msgid ""
"Hovering over the area of interest will temporarily make the "
"contextual links button visible (which looks like a pencil in most "
"themes, and is normally displayed in the upper right corner of the "
"area). The icon typically looks like this: @picture"
msgstr ""
"Nglayangake mouse ing area sing dadi perhatian bakal nggawe tombol "
"pranala kontekstual katon sakwentara (sing biasane katon kaya pensil "
"ing umume tema, lan biasane ditampilake ing pojok ndhuwur tengen area "
"kasebut). Ikon iki biyasané katon kaya iki: @picture"

msgid ""
"The Datetime module provides a Date field that stores dates and times. "
"It also provides the Form API elements <em>datetime</em> and "
"<em>datelist</em> for use in programming modules. See the <a "
"href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">Field UI module help</a> pages for general "
"information on fields and how to create and manage them. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":datetime_do\">online documentation for "
"the Datetime module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Datetime nyedhiyakake lapangan Tanggal sing nyimpen tanggal lan "
"wektu. Uga nyedhiyakake elemen Form API <em>datetime</em> lan "
"<em>datelist</em> kanggo digunakake ing modul pemrograman. Delengen "
"kaca <a href=\":field\">bantuan modul Field</a> lan <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">bantuan modul Field UI</a> kanggo informasi umum "
"babagan lapangan lan cara nggawe lan ngatur. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":datetime_do\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul Datetime</a>."

msgid ""
"The <em>settings</em> and the <em>display</em> of the Date field can "
"be configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI "
"help</a> for more information on how to manage fields and their "
"display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Setelan</em> lan <em>tampilan</em> saka kolom Tanggal bisa diatur "
"kanthi kapisah. Delengen <a href=\":field_ui\">Bantuan UI Kolom</a> "
"kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan cara ngatur kolom lan "
"tampilané."

msgid ""
"Dates can be displayed using the <em>Plain</em> or the "
"<em>Default</em> formatter. The <em>Plain</em> formatter displays the "
"date in the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601\">ISO "
"8601</a> format. If you choose the <em>Default</em> formatter, you can "
"choose a format from a predefined list that can be managed on the <a "
"href=\":date_format_list\">Date and time formats</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal bisa ditampilake nganggo <em>Plain</em> utawa <em>Default</em> "
"formatter. <em>Plain</em> formatter bakal nampilake tanggal nganggo "
"format <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601\">ISO 8601</a>. "
"Yen sampeyan milih <em>Default</em> formatter, sampeyan bisa milih "
"format saka dhaptar sing wis ditemtokake sing bisa diatur ing kaca <a "
"href=\":date_format_list\">Date and time formats</a>."

msgid "Date part order: @order"
msgstr "Urutan bagean tanggal: @order"

msgid "Time type: @time_type"
msgstr "Tipe wektu: @time_type"

msgid "Time increments: @increment"
msgstr "Inkremen wektu: @increment"

msgid ""
"The Database Logging module logs system events in the Drupal database. "
"For more information, see the <a href=\":dblog\">online documentation "
"for the Database Logging module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Logging Database nyatet kedadean sistem ing database Drupal. "
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":dblog\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Logging Database</a>."

msgid ""
"The Database Logging module allows you to view an event log on the <a "
"href=\":dblog\">Recent log messages</a> page. The log is a "
"chronological list of recorded events containing usage data, "
"performance data, errors, warnings and operational information. "
"Administrators should check the log on a regular basis to ensure their "
"site is working properly."
msgstr ""
"Modul Database Logging ngidini sampeyan ndeleng log acara ing kaca <a "
"href=\":dblog\">Pesan log paling anyar</a>. Log iki minangka dhaptar "
"kronologis saka acara-acara sing direkam sing ngemot data panggunaan, "
"data performa, kesalahan, peringatan, lan informasi operasional. "
"Administrator kudu mriksa log kasebut kanthi rutin kanggo mesthekake "
"situsé bisa mlaku kanthi bener."

msgid ""
"In case of errors or problems with the site, the <a "
"href=\":dblog\">Recent log messages</a> page can be useful for "
"debugging, since it shows the sequence of events. The log messages "
"include usage information, warnings, and errors."
msgstr ""
"Yen ana kesalahan utawa masalah karo situs, kaca <a "
"href=\":dblog\">Pesan log paling anyar</a> bisa migunani kanggo "
"debugging, amarga nuduhake urutan kedadeyan. Pesan log kalebu "
"informasi panggunaan, peringatan, lan kesalahan."

msgid ""
"Pages which are suitable for caching are cached the first time they "
"are requested, then the cached version is served for all later "
"requests. Dynamic content is handled automatically so that both cache "
"correctness and hit ratio is maintained."
msgstr ""
"Kaca-kaca sing cocog kanggo caching bakal dicache nalika pisanan "
"dijaluk, banjur versi cache kasebut bakal digunakake kanggo kabeh "
"panjalukan sabanjure. Konten dinamis diatur kanthi otomatis supaya "
"loro kasunyatan cache lan rasio hit tetep terjaga."

msgid "Internal Dynamic Page Cache"
msgstr "Cache Kaca Dinamis Internal"

msgid ""
"On the <a href=\":formats\">Text formats and editors page</a> you can "
"see which text editor is associated with each text format. You can "
"change this by clicking on the <em>Configure</em> link, and then "
"choosing a text editor or <em>none</em> from the <em>Text editor</em> "
"drop-down list. The text editor will then be displayed with any text "
"field for which this text format is chosen."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca <a href=\":formats\">Format teks lan editor</a>, sampeyan "
"bisa ndeleng editor teks sing gegandhengan karo saben format teks. "
"Sampeyan bisa ngganti iki kanthi ngeklik pranala <em>Konfigurasi</em>, "
"banjur milih editor teks utawa <em>ora ana</em> saka daftar gulung "
"mudhun <em>Editor teks</em>. Editor teks banjur bakal ditampilake ing "
"sembarang kolom teks sing milih format teks iki."

msgid ""
"The <em>settings</em> and the <em>display</em> of the entity reference "
"field can be configured separately. See the <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> for more information on how to "
"manage fields and their display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Setelan</em> lan <em>tampilan</em> saka bidang referensi entitas "
"bisa diatur kanthi kapisah. Delengen <a href=\":field_ui\">bantuan "
"Field UI</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan cara ngatur bidang "
"lan tampilané."

msgid ""
"No eligible views were found. <a href=\":create\">Create a view</a> "
"with an <em>Entity Reference</em> display, or add such a display to an "
"<a href=\":existing\">existing view</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana tampilan sing pantes ditemokake. <a href=\":create\">Gawé "
"tampilan</a> kanthi tampilan <em>Entity Reference</em>, utawa "
"tambahaké tampilan kaya ngono menyang <a href=\":existing\">tampilan "
"sing wis ana</a>."

msgid ""
"The Field module allows custom data fields to be defined for "
"<em>entity</em> types (see below). The Field module takes care of "
"storing, loading, editing, and rendering field data. Most users will "
"not interact with the Field module directly, but will instead use the "
"<a href=\":field-ui-help\">Field UI module</a> user interface. Module "
"developers can use the Field API to make new entity types "
"\"fieldable\" and thus allow fields to be attached to them. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":field\">online documentation for the "
"Field module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Field maringi kabisan kanggo netepake lapangan data khusus "
"kanggo jinis <em>entity</em> (delengen ngisor). Modul Field ngurus "
"panyimpenan, mbukak, nyunting, lan nampilake data lapangan. Kabeh "
"pangguna biasane ora langsung sesambungan karo modul Field, nanging "
"nggunakake antarmuka panganggo <a href=\":field-ui-help\">Modul UI "
"Field</a>. Pangembang modul bisa nggunakake API Field kanggo nggawe "
"jinis entity anyar supaya bisa \"fieldable\" lan ngidini lapangan bisa "
"ditempelake marang iku. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":field\">dokumentasi online modul Field</a>."

msgid ""
"You can add, edit, and delete view modes for entities on the <a "
"href=\":view_modes\">View modes page</a>, and you can add, edit, and "
"delete form modes for entities on the <a href=\":form_modes\">Form "
"modes page</a>. Once you have defined a view mode or form mode for an "
"entity type, it will be available on the Manage display or Manage form "
"display page for each sub-type of that entity."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nambah, ngowahi, lan mbusak mode tampilan kanggo entitas "
"ing <a href=\":view_modes\">Kaca mode tampilan</a>, lan sampeyan uga "
"bisa nambah, ngowahi, lan mbusak mode formulir kanggo entitas ing <a "
"href=\":form_modes\">Kaca mode formulir</a>. Sawise sampeyan nentokake "
"mode tampilan utawa mode formulir kanggo jinis entitas, mode kasebut "
"bakal kasedhiya ing kaca Kelola tampilan utawa Kelola tampilan "
"formulir kanggo saben sub-jinis entitas kasebut."

msgid ""
"There are no fields yet added. You can add new fields on the <a "
"href=\":link\">Manage fields</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Durung ana kolom sing ditambahake. Sampeyan bisa nambah kolom anyar "
"ing kaca <a href=\":link\">Manage fields</a>."

msgid ""
"The %display_mode mode now uses custom display settings. You might "
"want to <a href=\":url\">configure them</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mode %display_mode saiki nggunakake setelan tampilan khusus. Sampeyan "
"bisa <a href=\":url\">ngatur</a> setelan kasebut."

msgid "@size limit."
msgstr "@wates ukuran."

msgid "file from @field_name"
msgstr "file saka @field_name"

msgid ""
"The File module allows you to create fields that contain files. See "
"the <a href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for general information on "
"fields and how to create and manage them. For more information, see "
"the <a href=\":file_documentation\">online documentation for the File "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul File ngidini sampeyan nggawe kolom sing ngemot file. Delengen <a "
"href=\":field\">bantuan Modul Kolom</a> lan <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">bantuan UI Kolom</a> kanggo informasi umum babagan "
"kolom lan cara nggawe lan ngatur. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":file_documentation\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"Modul File</a>."

msgid ""
"The <em>settings</em> and the <em>display</em> of the file field can "
"be configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI "
"help</a> for more information on how to manage fields and their "
"display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Setelan</em> lan <em>tampilan</em> saka kolom file bisa diatur "
"kanthi misah. Delengen <a href=\":field_ui\">bantuan Field UI</a> "
"kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan carane ngatur kolom lan "
"tampilané."

msgid ""
"Uploaded files can either be stored as <em>public</em> or "
"<em>private</em>, depending on the <a href=\":file-system\">File "
"system settings</a>. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":system-help\">System module help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Berkas sing diunggah bisa disimpen minangka <em>public</em> utawa "
"<em>private</em>, gumantung saka <a href=\":file-system\">setelan "
"Sistem Berkas</a>. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":system-help\">kaca pitulungan modul Sistem</a>."

msgid "The file used in the @name field may not be referenced."
msgstr "Berkas sing digunakake ing lapangan @name bisa uga ora dirujuk."

msgid "The file referenced by the @name field does not exist."
msgstr "Berkas sing dirujuk dening kolom @name ora ana."

msgid "Use the <a href=\":url\">@label</a> text format"
msgstr "Gunakake format teks <a href=\":url\">@label</a>"

msgid ""
"If you do encounter problems, try using HTML character entities. A "
"common example looks like &amp;amp; for an ampersand &amp; character. "
"For a full list of entities see HTML's <a "
"href=\":html-entities\">entities</a> page. Some of the available "
"characters include:"
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan nemoni masalah, coba gunakake entitas karakter HTML. "
"Conto sing umum katon kaya &amp;amp; kanggo karakter ampersand &amp;. "
"Kanggo dhaptar lengkap entitas delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":html-entities\">entities</a> ing HTML. Sawetara karakter sing "
"kasedhiya antara liya:"

msgid "Limit allowed HTML tags and correct faulty HTML"
msgstr "Watesi tag HTML sing diijini lan benake HTML sing salah"

msgid ""
"<strong>Configure your website</strong> Once logged in, visit the <a "
"href=\":admin\">Administration page</a>, where you may <a "
"href=\":config\">customize and configure</a> all aspects of your "
"website."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Atur situs web sampeyan</strong> Sawise mlebu, bukak <a "
"href=\":admin\">Kaca Administrasi</a>, ing kono sampeyan bisa <a "
"href=\":config\">ngatur lan nyetel</a> kabeh aspek saka situs web "
"sampeyan."

msgid ""
"<strong>Customize your website design</strong> To change the \"look "
"and feel\" of your website, visit the <a href=\":themes\">Appearance "
"page</a>. You may choose from one of the included themes or download "
"additional themes from the <a href=\":download_themes\">Drupal.org "
"themes page</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Kustomisasi desain situs web sampeyan</strong> Kanggo ngganti "
"\"tampilane lan raos\" situs web sampeyan, bukak <a "
"href=\":themes\">Kaca Penampilan</a>. Sampeyan bisa milih saka salah "
"siji tema sing wis kasedhiya utawa ngundhuh tema tambahan saka <a "
"href=\":download_themes\">kaca tema Drupal.org</a>."

msgid ""
"<strong>Start posting content</strong> Finally, you may <a "
"href=\":content\">add new content</a> to your website."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Miwiwiti ngirim isi</strong> Pungkasanipun, sampeyan saged <a "
"href=\":content\">nambah isi anyar</a> menyang situs web sampeyan."

msgid ""
"The Help module displays explanations for using each module listed on "
"the main <a href=\":help\">Help reference page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Bantuan nampilake panjelasan kanggo nggunakake saben modul sing "
"kacathet ing kaca <a href=\":help\">Referensi Bantuan</a> utama."

msgid ""
"Page-specific help text provided by modules is displayed in the Help "
"block. This block can be placed and configured on the <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tèks pitulungan sing khusus kanggo kaca sing disedhiyakake déning "
"modul ditampilaké ing blok Pitulungan. Blok iki bisa dipasangaké lan "
"diatur ing kaca <a href=\":blocks\">Tata Letak Blok</a>."

msgid ""
"The History module keeps track of which content a user has read. It "
"marks content as <em>new</em> or <em>updated</em> depending on the "
"last time the user viewed it. History records that are older than one "
"month are removed during cron, which means that content older than one "
"month is always considered <em>read</em>. The History module does not "
"have a user interface but it provides a filter to <a "
"href=\":views-help\">Views</a> to show new or updated content. For "
"more information, see the <a href=\":url\">online documentation for "
"the History module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul History njaga rekaman isi sing wis diwaca dening pangguna. Modul "
"iki nandhani isi minangka <em>anyar</em> utawa <em>diupdate</em> "
"gumantung saka wektu pungkasan pangguna ndelok isi kasebut. Rekaman "
"History sing luwih lawas saka sewulan bakal dihapus nalika cron mlaku, "
"sing tegese isi sing luwih lawas saka sewulan mesthi dianggep <em>wis "
"diwaca</em>. Modul History ora duwe antarmuka pangguna nanging "
"nyedhiyakake filter kanggo <a href=\":views-help\">Views</a> kanggo "
"nuduhake isi anyar utawa sing diupdate. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":url\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"History</a>."

msgid "image from @field_name"
msgstr "gambar saka @field_name"

msgid ""
"The Image module allows you to create fields that contain image files "
"and to configure <a href=\":image_styles\">Image styles</a> that can "
"be used to manipulate the display of images. See the <a "
"href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for terminology and general "
"information on entities, fields, and how to create and manage fields. "
"For more information, see the <a href=\":image_documentation\">online "
"documentation for the Image module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Image ngidini sampeyan nggawe kolom sing ngemot file gambar lan "
"nyetel <a href=\":image_styles\">Gaya gambar</a> sing bisa digunakake "
"kanggo ngatur tampilan gambar. Delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":field\">bantuan modul Field</a> lan <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">bantuan UI Field</a> kanggo istilah lan informasi "
"umum babagan entitas, kolom, lan cara nggawe lan ngatur kolom. Kanggo "
"info luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":image_documentation\">dokumentasi online modul Image</a>."

msgid ""
"The concept of image styles is that you can upload a single image but "
"display it in several ways; each display variation, or <em>image "
"style</em>, is the result of applying one or more <em>effects</em> to "
"the original image. As an example, you might upload a high-resolution "
"image with a 4:3 aspect ratio, and display it scaled down, square "
"cropped, or black-and-white (or any combination of these effects). The "
"Image module provides a way to do this efficiently: you configure an "
"image style with the desired effects on the <a href=\":image\">Image "
"styles page</a>, and the first time a particular image is requested in "
"that style, the effects are applied. The resulting image is saved, and "
"the next time that same style is requested, the saved image is "
"retrieved without the need to recalculate the effects. Drupal core "
"provides several effects that you can use to define styles; others may "
"be provided by contributed modules."
msgstr ""
"Konsep saka image styles yaiku sampeyan bisa ngunggah siji gambar "
"nanging nampilake kanthi pirang-pirang cara; saben variasi tampilan, "
"utawa <em>image style</em>, iku asil saka nerapake siji utawa luwih "
"<em>effects</em> marang gambar asli. Contone, sampeyan bisa ngunggah "
"gambar resolusi dhuwur kanthi rasio aspek 4:3, lan nampilake kanthi "
"skala cilik, potong dadi bentuk persegi, utawa ireng-putih (utawa "
"kombinasi saka efek-efek kasebut). Modul Image nyedhiyakake cara "
"kanggo nindakake iki kanthi efisien: sampeyan nyetel image style "
"kanthi efek sing dikarepake ing <a href=\":image\">Image styles "
"page</a>, lan kaping pisan gambar tartamtu dijaluk nganggo style "
"kasebut, efek kasebut bakal diterapake. Gambar asil bakal disimpen, "
"lan kaping sabanjure gaya sing padha dijaluk, gambar sing wis disimpen "
"bakal dijupuk tanpa perlu ngitung maneh efek-efek kasebut. Drupal core "
"nyedhiyakake pirang-pirang efek sing bisa digunakake kanggo nemtokake "
"gaya; efek liyane bisa uga disedhiyakake dening modul kontribusi."

msgid ""
"When you create an image field, you will need to choose whether the "
"uploaded images will be stored in the public or private file directory "
"defined in your settings.php file and shown on the <a "
"href=\":file-system\">File system page</a>. This choice cannot be "
"changed later. You can also configure your field to store files in a "
"subdirectory of the public or private directory; this setting can be "
"changed later and can be different for each entity sub-type using the "
"field. For more information on file storage, see the <a "
"href=\":system-help\">System module help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan nggawe lapangan gambar, sampeyan kudu milih apa gambar "
"sing diunggah bakal disimpen ing direktori file umum utawa pribadi "
"sing wis ditemtokake ing file settings.php sampeyan lan ditampilake "
"ing kaca <a href=\":file-system\">Sistem File</a>. Pilihan iki ora "
"bisa diganti mengko. Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel lapangan kanggo nyimpen "
"file ing subdirektori saka direktori umum utawa pribadi; setelan iki "
"bisa diganti mengko lan bisa beda kanggo saben sub-tipe entitas sing "
"nggunakake lapangan iki. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan "
"panyimpenan file, delengen kaca <a href=\":system-help\">bantuan modul "
"Sistem</a>."

msgid "There are currently no styles. <a href=\":url\">Add a new one</a>."
msgstr "Saiki durung ana gaya. <a href=\":url\">Tambah gaya anyar</a>."

msgid "Both a height and width value must be specified in the @name field."
msgstr "Loro nilai dhuwur lan ambane kudu ditemtokake ing kolom @name."

msgid "The primary identifier for an image style."
msgstr "Pangidentifikasi utama kanggo gaya gambar."

msgid "The style machine name."
msgstr "Jeneng mesin gaya."

msgid "The style administrative name."
msgstr "Jeneng administratif gaya."

msgid ""
"By default, content is created in the site's default language and no "
"language selector is displayed on content creation pages. On the <a "
"href=\":content_language\">Content language</a> page you can customize "
"the language configuration for any supported content entity on your "
"site (for example for content types or menu links). After choosing an "
"entity, you are provided with a drop-down menu to set the default "
"language and a check-box to display language selectors."
msgstr ""
"Miturut standar, isi digawe nganggo basa baku situs lan ora ana "
"pilihan basa sing ditampilake ing kaca nggawe isi. Ing kaca <a "
"href=\":content_language\">Content language</a>, sampeyan bisa ngatur "
"konfigurasi basa kanggo entitas isi sing didhukung ing situs sampeyan "
"(umpamane kanggo jinis isi utawa pranala menu). Sawise milih entitas, "
"sampeyan bakal diwenehi menu drop-down kanggo nyetel basa baku lan "
"kothak centhang kanggo nampilake pilihan basa."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":detection\">Detection and selection</a> page provides "
"several methods for deciding which language is used for displaying "
"interface text. When a method detects and selects an interface "
"language, then the following methods in the list are not applied. You "
"can order them by importance, with your preferred method at the top of "
"the list, followed by one or several fall-back methods."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <a href=\":detection\">Deteksi lan pilihan</a> nyedhiyakake "
"sawetara cara kanggo netepake basa sing digunakake kanggo nampilake "
"teks antarmuka. Nalika sawijining cara ndeteksi lan milih basa "
"antarmuka, banjur cara-cara sabanjure ing daftar ora bakal ditrapake. "
"Sampeyan bisa nyusun miturut pentingé, kanthi cara sing dadi pilihan "
"utama ana ing ndhuwur daftar, banjur diikuti dening siji utawa luwih "
"cara cadangan."

msgid ""
"<em>Browser</em> sets the interface language based on the browser's "
"language settings. Since browsers use different language codes to "
"refer to the same languages, you can add and edit languages codes to "
"map the browser language codes to the <a "
"href=\":language_list\">language codes</a> used on your site."
msgstr ""
"<em>Browser</em> nyetel basa antarmuka adhedhasar setelan basa "
"browser. Amarga browser nggunakake kode basa sing beda-beda kanggo "
"nuduhaké basa sing padha, sampeyan bisa nambah lan nyunting kode basa "
"kanggo nyocokaké kode basa browser karo <a "
"href=\":language_list\">kode basa</a> sing digunakaké ing situs "
"sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Reorder the configured languages to set their order in the language "
"switcher block and, when editing content, in the list of selectable "
"languages. This ordering does not impact <a "
"href=\":detection\">detection and selection</a>."
msgstr ""
"Atur maneh basa sing wis dikonfigurasi kanggo nemtokake urutane ing "
"blok switcher basa lan, nalika nyunting isi, ing dhaptar basa sing "
"bisa dipilih. Urutan iki ora mengaruhi <a href=\":detection\">deteksi "
"lan pilihan</a>."

msgid ""
"The site default language can also be set. It is not recommended to "
"change the default language on a working site. <a "
"href=\":language-detection\">Configure the Selected language</a> "
"setting on the detection and selection page to change the fallback "
"language for language selection."
msgstr ""
"Basa standar situs uga bisa disetel. Ora dianjurake kanggo ngganti "
"basa standar ing situs sing wis digunakake. <a "
"href=\":language-detection\">Konfigurasi Basa sing Dipilih</a> ing "
"kaca deteksi lan pilihan kanggo ngganti basa cadangan kanggo pilihan "
"basa."

msgid ""
"Define how to decide which language is used to display page elements "
"(primarily text provided by modules, such as field labels and help "
"text). This decision is made by evaluating a series of detection "
"methods for languages; the first detection method that gets a result "
"will determine which language is used for that type of text. Be aware "
"that some language detection methods are unreliable under certain "
"conditions, such as browser detection when page-caching is enabled and "
"a user is not currently logged in. Define the order of evaluation of "
"language detection methods on this page. The default language can be "
"changed in the <a href=\":admin-change-language\">list of "
"languages</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan carane mutusake basa sing digunakake kanggo nampilake elemen "
"kaca (utamane teks sing disedhiyakake dening modul, kaya label "
"lapangan lan teks pitulungan). Keputusan iki digawe kanthi ngevaluasi "
"serangkaian metode deteksi basa; metode deteksi pisanan sing entuk "
"asil bakal nemtokake basa sing digunakake kanggo jinis teks kasebut. "
"Waspada yen sawetara metode deteksi basa ora dipercaya ing kahanan "
"tartamtu, kayata deteksi browser nalika caching kaca diaktifake lan "
"pangguna saiki ora mlebu. Tentokake urutan evaluasi metode deteksi "
"basa ing kaca iki. Basa bawaan bisa diganti ing <a "
"href=\":admin-change-language\">dhaptar basa</a>."

msgid ""
"Browsers use different language codes to refer to the same languages. "
"Internally, a best effort is made to determine the correct language "
"based on the code that the browser sends. You can add and edit "
"additional mappings from browser language codes to <a "
"href=\":configure-languages\">site languages</a>."
msgstr ""
"Para panyungging nggunakake kode basa sing beda-beda kanggo "
"njlèntrèhaké basa sing padha. Sacara internal, usaha paling apik "
"dilakoni kanggo nemtokake basa sing bener adhedhasar kode sing dikirim "
"panyungging. Sampeyan bisa nambah lan nyunting peta tambahan saka kode "
"basa panyungging menyang <a href=\":configure-languages\">basa "
"situs</a>."

msgid ""
"Changing the selected language here (and leaving this option as the "
"last among the detection and selection options) is the easiest way to "
"change the fallback language for the website, if you need to change "
"how your site works by default (e.g., when using an empty path prefix "
"or using the default domain). <a "
"href=\":admin-change-language\">Changing the site's default "
"language</a> itself might have other undesired side effects."
msgstr ""
"Ngowahi basa sing dipilih ing kene (lan ninggalake pilihan iki "
"minangka sing pungkasan ing antarane opsi deteksi lan pilihan) iku "
"cara sing paling gampang kanggo ngowahi basa fallback kanggo situs "
"web, yen sampeyan perlu ngowahi cara situs sampeyan digunakake sacara "
"default (contone, nalika nggunakake path prefix kosong utawa "
"nggunakake domain default). <a href=\":admin-change-language\">Ngowahi "
"basa default situs</a> dhewe bisa uga duwe efek samping liyane sing "
"ora dikarepake."

msgid ""
"Explanation of the language options is found on the <a "
"href=\":languages_list_page\">languages list page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Panjelasan babagan opsi basa bisa ditemokake ing <a "
"href=\":languages_list_page\">kaca dhaptar basa</a>."

msgid "Site's default language (@language)"
msgstr "Basa standar situs (@language)"

msgid ""
"Use one of the language switcher blocks to allow site visitors to "
"switch between languages. You can enable these blocks on the <a "
"href=\":block-admin\">block administration page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake salah siji saka blok pengalih basa kanggo ngidini pengunjung "
"situs ngalih antarane basa. Sampeyan bisa ngaktifake blok-blok iki ing "
"<a href=\":block-admin\">kaca administrasi blok</a>."

msgid ""
"Use language codes as <a href=\":w3ctags\">defined by the W3C</a> for "
"interoperability. <em>Examples: \"en\", \"en-gb\" and "
"\"zh-hant\".</em>"
msgstr ""
"Gunakake kode basa minangka <a href=\":w3ctags\">sing ditemtokake "
"dening W3C</a> kanggo interoperabilitas. <em>Conto: \"en\", \"en-gb\" "
"lan \"zh-hant\".</em>"

msgid ""
"%field must be a valid language tag as <a href=\":url\">defined by the "
"W3C</a>."
msgstr ""
"%field kudu dadi tag basa sing sah kaya <a href=\":url\">sing "
"ditemtokake dening W3C</a>."

msgid ""
"The prefix may only be left blank for the <a href=\":url\">selected "
"detection fallback language.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Prefix mung bisa dikosongake kanggo <a href=\":url\">basa fallback "
"deteksi sing dipilih.</a>"

msgid ""
"The Link module allows you to create fields that contain internal or "
"external URLs and optional link text. See the <a href=\":field\">Field "
"module help</a> and the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages "
"for general information on fields and how to create and manage them. "
"For more information, see the <a href=\":link_documentation\">online "
"documentation for the Link module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Link ngidini sampeyan nggawe lapangan sing ngemot URL internal "
"utawa eksternal lan teks pranala pilihan. Delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":field\">bantuan modul Lapangan</a> lan <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">bantuan UI Lapangan</a> kanggo informasi umum "
"babagan lapangan lan cara nggawe uga ngatur. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":link_documentation\">dokumentasi online "
"kanggo modul Link</a>."

msgid ""
"The <em>settings</em> and the <em>display</em> of the link field can "
"be configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI "
"help</a> for more information on how to manage fields and their "
"display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Setelan</em> lan <em>tampilan</em> saka kolom pranala bisa diatur "
"kanthi kapisah. Delengen <a href=\":field_ui\">bantuan UI Kolom</a> "
"kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan cara ngatur kolom lan "
"tampilané."

msgid ""
"One translation file could not be checked. <a href=\":url\">See the "
"log</a> for details."
msgid_plural ""
"@count translation files could not be checked. <a href=\":url\">See "
"the log</a> for details."
msgstr[0] ""
"Siji file terjemahan ora bisa dipriksa. <a href=\":url\">Delengen "
"log</a> kanggo rincian.  \n"
"@count file terjemahan ora bisa dipriksa. "
"<a href=\":url\">Delengen log</a> kanggo rincian."

msgid "@message (@percent%)."
msgstr "@message (@percent%)."

msgid ""
"One translation file could not be imported. <a href=\":url\">See the "
"log</a> for details."
msgid_plural ""
"@count translation files could not be imported. <a href=\":url\">See "
"the log</a> for details."
msgstr[0] ""
"Siji berkas terjemahan ora bisa diimpor. <a href=\":url\">Deleng "
"log</a> kanggo rincian.  \n"
"@count berkas terjemahan ora bisa diimpor. "
"<a href=\":url\">Deleng log</a> kanggo rincian."

msgid ""
"One translation string was skipped because of disallowed or malformed "
"HTML. <a href=\":url\">See the log</a> for details."
msgid_plural ""
"@count translation strings were skipped because of disallowed or "
"malformed HTML. <a href=\":url\">See the log</a> for details."
msgstr[0] ""
"Siji string terjemahan dilewati amarga HTML sing ora diidini utawa ora "
"bener. <a href=\":url\">Deleng log</a> kanggo rincian.  \n"
"@count "
"string terjemahan dilewati amarga HTML sing ora diidini utawa ora "
"bener. <a href=\":url\">Deleng log</a> kanggo rincian."

msgid ""
"The Interface Translation module allows you to translate interface "
"text (<em>strings</em>) into different languages, and to switch "
"between them for the display of interface text. It uses the "
"functionality provided by the <a href=\":language\">Language "
"module</a>. For more information, see the <a href=\":doc-url\">online "
"documentation for the Interface Translation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modhul Interface Translation ngidini sampeyan nerjemahake teks "
"antarmuka (<em>strings</em>) menyang basa sing beda-beda, lan kanggo "
"ngganti antarane basa-basa kasebut kanggo tampilan teks antarmuka. "
"Modhul iki nggunakake fungsi sing disedhiyakake dening <a "
"href=\":language\">Modhul Bahasa</a>. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":doc-url\">dokumentasi online kanggo modhul "
"Interface Translation</a>."

msgid ""
"You can check how much of the interface on your site is translated "
"into which language on the <a href=\":languages\">Languages</a> page. "
"On the <a href=\":translation-updates\">Available translation "
"updates</a> page, you can check whether interface translation updates "
"are available on the <a href=\":server\">Drupal translation "
"server</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa mriksa pira bagean antarmuka ing situs sampeyan sing wis "
"diterjemahake menyang basa apa wae ing kaca <a "
"href=\":languages\">Languages</a>. Ing kaca <a "
"href=\":translation-updates\">Available translation updates</a>, "
"sampeyan bisa mriksa apa ana pembaruan terjemahan antarmuka sing "
"kasedhiya ing <a href=\":server\">Drupal translation server</a>."

msgid ""
"You can translate individual strings directly on the <a "
"href=\":translate\">User interface translation</a> page, or download "
"the currently-used translation file for a specific language on the <a "
"href=\":export\">Interface translation export</a> page. Once you have "
"edited the translation file, you can then import it again on the <a "
"href=\":import\">Interface translation import</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nerjemahake string individu langsung ing kaca <a "
"href=\":translate\">Terjemahan antarmuka panganggo</a>, utawa unduh "
"file terjemahan sing saiki digunakake kanggo basa tartamtu ing kaca <a "
"href=\":export\">Ekspor terjemahan antarmuka</a>. Sawise sampeyan "
"ngedit file terjemahan, sampeyan bisa ngimpor maneh ing kaca <a "
"href=\":import\">Impor terjemahan antarmuka</a>."

msgid ""
"This page allows a translator to search for specific translated and "
"untranslated strings, and is used when creating or editing "
"translations. (Note: Because translation tasks involve many strings, "
"it may be more convenient to <a title=\"User interface translation "
"export\" href=\":export\">export</a> strings for offline editing in a "
"desktop Gettext translation editor.) Searches may be limited to "
"strings in a specific language."
msgstr ""
"Kaca iki ngidini penerjemah kanggo nggoleki string sing wis "
"diterjemahake utawa durung diterjemahake kanthi spesifik, lan "
"digunakake nalika nggawe utawa ngowahi terjemahan. (Cathetan: Amarga "
"tugas terjemahan melu akeh string, bisa luwih praktis kanggo <a "
"title=\"User interface translation export\" "
"href=\":export\">ngeksport</a> string kanggo nyunting offline ing "
"editor terjemahan Gettext desktop.) Pencarian bisa diwatesi mung "
"kanggo string sing ana ing basa tartamtu."

msgid ""
"This page allows translators to manually import translated strings "
"contained in a Gettext Portable Object (.po) file. Manual import may "
"be used for customized translations or for the translation of custom "
"modules and themes. To customize translations you can download a "
"translation file from the <a href=\":url\">Drupal translation "
"server</a> or <a title=\"User interface translation export\" "
"href=\":export\">export</a> translations from the site, customize the "
"translations using a Gettext translation editor, and import the result "
"using this page."
msgstr ""
"Kaca iki ngidini penerjemah kanggo ngimpor kanthi manual string sing "
"wis diterjemahake sing ana ing file Gettext Portable Object (.po). "
"Impor manual bisa digunakake kanggo terjemahan sing dikustomisasi "
"utawa kanggo terjemahan modul lan tema kustom. Kanggo ngustomisasi "
"terjemahan, sampeyan bisa ngundhuh file terjemahan saka <a "
"href=\":url\">server terjemahan Drupal</a> utawa <a title=\"User "
"interface translation export\" href=\":export\">ngeksport</a> "
"terjemahan saka situs, ngustomisasi terjemahan nganggo editor "
"terjemahan Gettext, lan ngimpor asilé nggunakake kaca iki."

msgid ""
"Updates available for: @languages. See the <a "
"href=\":updates\">Available translation updates</a> page for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ana pembaruan kanggo: @languages. Delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":updates\">Pembaruan terjemahan sing kasedhiya</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"Missing translations for: @languages. See the <a "
"href=\":updates\">Available translation updates</a> page for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Terjemahan sing ilang kanggo: @languages. Delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":updates\">Update Terjemahan Sing Kasedhiya</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"No translation status is available. See the <a "
"href=\":updates\">Available translation updates</a> page for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana status terjemahan sing kasedhiya. Delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":updates\">Pembaruan terjemahan sing tersedia</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "Interface translation settings"
msgstr "Setelan terjemahan antarmuka"

msgid "Interface translation import"
msgstr "Impor terjemahan antarmuka"

msgid "Interface translation export"
msgstr "Ekspor terjemahan antarmuka"

msgid ""
"Select how frequently you want to check for new interface translations "
"for your currently installed modules and themes. <a "
"href=\":url\">Check updates now</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sepira kerepe sampeyan pengin mriksa terjemahan antarmuka anyar "
"kanggo modul lan tema sing saiki wis dipasang. <a href=\":url\">Priksa "
"pembaruan saiki</a>."

msgid ""
"Translation files are stored locally in the  %path directory. You can "
"change this directory on the <a href=\":url\">File system</a> "
"configuration page."
msgstr ""
"Berkas terjemahan disimpen ing lokal ing direktori %path. Sampeyan "
"bisa ngganti direktori iki ing kaca konfigurasi <a href=\":url\">File "
"system</a>."

msgid ""
"Translation files will not be stored locally. Change the Interface "
"translation directory on the <a href=\":url\">File system "
"configuration</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Berkas terjemahan ora bakal disimpen sacara lokal. Ganti direktori "
"terjemahan Antarmuka ing kaca <a href=\":url\">Konfigurasi sistem "
"berkas</a>."

msgid ""
"You have selected local translation source, but no <a "
"href=\":url\">Interface translation directory</a> was configured."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan wis milih sumber translasi lokal, nanging ora ana <a "
"href=\":url\">direktori translasi Antarmuka</a> sing wis "
"dikonfigurasi."

msgid ""
"No translatable languages available. <a href=\":add_language\">Add a "
"language</a> first."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana basa sing bisa ditranslate. <a href=\":add_language\">Tambah "
"basa</a> dhisik."

msgid ""
"No translation status available. <a href=\":check\">Check "
"manually</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ora kasedhiya status terjemahan. <a href=\":check\">Priksa kanthi "
"manual</a>."

msgid ""
"It is required by the Menu UI module, which provides an interface for "
"managing menus and menu links. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":menu-help\">Menu UI module help page</a> and the <a "
"href=\":drupal-org-help\">online documentation for the Custom Menu "
"Links module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Dibutuhake dening modul Menu UI, sing nyedhiyakake antarmuka kanggo "
"ngatur menu lan pranala menu. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen "
"<a href=\":menu-help\">kaca pitulungan modul Menu UI</a> lan <a "
"href=\":drupal-org-help\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Custom Menu "
"Links</a>."

msgid ""
"The Menu UI module provides an interface for managing menus. A menu is "
"a hierarchical collection of links, which can be within or external to "
"the site, generally used for navigation. For more information, see the "
"<a href=\":menu\">online documentation for the Menu UI module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Menu UI nyedhiyakake antarmuka kanggo ngatur menu. Menu iku "
"kumpulan tautan kanthi struktur hirarkis, sing bisa ana ing situs "
"utawa saka njaba situs, umume digunakake kanggo navigasi. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":menu\">dokumentasi online "
"kanggo modul Menu UI</a>."

msgid ""
"You can enable the newly-created block for this menu on the <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa ngaktifake blok sing anyar digawe kanggo menu iki ing <a "
"href=\":blocks\">kaca Tata Letak Blok</a>."

msgid ""
"Each menu has a corresponding block that is managed on the <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Saben menu nduwèni blok sing cocog sing diatur ing <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Kaca Tata Letak Blok</a>."

msgid "There are no menu links yet. <a href=\":url\">Add link</a>."
msgstr "Durung ana pranala menu. <a href=\":url\">Tambah pranala</a>."

msgid ""
"The Migrate module provides a framework for migrating data, usually "
"from an external source into your site. It does not provide a user "
"interface. For more information, see the <a href=\":migrate\">online "
"documentation for the Migrate module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Migrate nyedhiyakake kerangka kerja kanggo migrasi data, biasane "
"saka sumber eksternal menyang situs sampeyan. Modul iki ora "
"nyedhiyakake antarmuka pangguna. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":migrate\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Migrate</a>."

msgid ""
"The Migrate Drupal module provides a framework based on the <a "
"href=\":migrate\">Migrate module</a> to facilitate migration from a "
"Drupal (6, 7, or 8) site to your website. It does not provide a user "
"interface. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":migrate_drupal\">online documentation for the Migrate Drupal "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Migrate Drupal nyedhiyakake kerangka adhedhasar <a "
"href=\":migrate\">modul Migrate</a> kanggo nggatekake migrasi saka "
"situs Drupal (6, 7, utawa 8) menyang situs web sampeyan. Modul iki ora "
"nyedhiyakake antarmuka pangguna. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":migrate_drupal\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Migrate Drupal</a>."

msgid ""
"The content access permissions need to be rebuilt. <a "
"href=\":node_access_rebuild\">Rebuild permissions</a>."
msgstr ""
"Izin akses isi perlu dibangun maneh. <a "
"href=\":node_access_rebuild\">Bangun maneh izin</a>."

msgid ""
"The Node module manages the creation, editing, deletion, settings, and "
"display of the main site content. Content items managed by the Node "
"module are typically displayed as pages on your site, and include a "
"title, some meta-data (author, creation time, content type, etc.), and "
"optional fields containing text or other data (fields are managed by "
"the <a href=\":field\">Field module</a>). For more information, see "
"the <a href=\":node\">online documentation for the Node module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Node ngatur pembuatan, panyuntingan, pambusakan, setelan, lan "
"tampilan isi utama situs. Item isi sing diatur dening modul Node "
"biasane ditampilake minangka kaca ing situs sampeyan, lan kalebu "
"judhul, sawetara meta-data (penulis, wektu pembuatan, jinis isi, "
"lsp.), lan kolom pilihan sing ngemot teks utawa data liyane (kolom "
"dikontrol dening <a href=\":field\">modul Field</a>). Kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":node\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul Node</a>."

msgid ""
"When new content is created, the Node module records basic information "
"about the content, including the author, date of creation, and the <a "
"href=\":content-type\">Content type</a>. It also manages the "
"<em>publishing options</em>, which define whether or not the content "
"is published, promoted to the front page of the site, and/or sticky at "
"the top of content lists. Default settings can be configured for each "
"<a href=\":content-type\">type of content</a> on your site."
msgstr ""
"Nalika konten anyar digawe, modul Node nyathet informasi dhasar "
"babagan konten kasebut, kalebu panganggit, tanggal digawe, lan <a "
"href=\":content-type\">Jinis Konten</a>. Modul iki uga ngatur "
"<em>pilihan publikasi</em>, sing nemtokake apa konten kasebut "
"diterbitake, dipromosekake ing kaca ngarep situs, lan/utawa "
"ditempelake ing ndhuwur dhaptar konten. Setelan standar bisa disetel "
"kanggo saben <a href=\":content-type\">jinis konten</a> ing situs "
"sampeyan."

msgid ""
"The Node module gives users with the <em>Administer content types</em> "
"permission the ability to <a href=\":content-new\">create new content "
"types</a> in addition to the default ones already configured. Creating "
"custom content types gives you the flexibility to add <a "
"href=\":field\">fields</a> and configure default settings that suit "
"the differing needs of various site content."
msgstr ""
"Modul Node menehi pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>Administer content "
"types</em> kemampuan kanggo <a href=\":content-new\">nggawe jinis isi "
"anyar</a> saliyané saka sing wis dadi bawaan. Nggawe jinis isi kustom "
"menehi sampeyan fleksibilitas kanggo nambah <a "
"href=\":field\">lapangan</a> lan nyetel setelan bawaan sing cocog karo "
"kabutuhan sing béda saka konten situs sing béda-béda."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":content\">Content</a> page lists your content, allowing "
"you add new content, filter, edit or delete existing content, or "
"perform bulk operations on existing content."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <a href=\":content\">Isi</a> nampilake isi sampeyan, menehi "
"sampeyan kemampuan kanggo nambah isi anyar, nyaring, ngowahi utawa "
"mbusak isi sing wis ana, utawa nindakake operasi massal marang isi "
"sing wis ana."

msgid ""
"The Node module makes a number of permissions available for each "
"content type, which can be set by role on the <a "
"href=\":permissions\">permissions page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Node nggawe sawetara ijin sing kasedhiya kanggo saben jinis "
"konten, sing bisa diatur miturut peran ing <a "
"href=\":permissions\">kaca ijin</a>."

msgid ""
"If the site is experiencing problems with permissions to content, you "
"may have to rebuild the permissions cache. Rebuilding will remove all "
"privileges to content and replace them with permissions based on the "
"current modules and settings. Rebuilding may take some time if there "
"is a lot of content or complex permission settings. After rebuilding "
"has completed, content will automatically use the new permissions. <a "
"href=\":rebuild\">Rebuild permissions</a>"
msgstr ""
"Yen situs ngalami masalah karo ijin kanggo konten, sampeyan bisa uga "
"kudu mbangun maneh cache ijin. Mbangun maneh bakal mbusak kabeh hak "
"istimewa kanggo konten lan ngganti karo ijin adhedhasar modul lan "
"setelan saiki. Mbangun maneh bisa njupuk wektu yen ana akeh konten "
"utawa setelan ijin sing rumit. Sawise mbangun maneh rampung, konten "
"bakal otomatis nggunakake ijin anyar. <a href=\":rebuild\">Mbangun "
"maneh ijin</a>"

msgid ""
"Maintain the types of content available and the fields that are "
"associated with those types."
msgstr ""
"Njaga jinis-jinis isi sing kasedhiya lan kolom-kolom sing gegandhengan "
"karo jinis-jinis kasebut."

msgid "No content types available. <a href=\":link\">Add content type</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana jinis isi sing kasedhiya. <a href=\":link\">Tambah jinis "
"isi</a>."

msgid "Node from URL"
msgstr "Node saka URL"

msgid ""
"The Options module allows you to create fields where data values are "
"selected from a fixed list of options. Usually these items are entered "
"through a select list, checkboxes, or radio buttons. See the <a "
"href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for general information on "
"fields and how to create and manage them. For more information, see "
"the <a href=\":options_do\">online documentation for the Options "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Options ngidini sampeyan nggawe kolom sing nilai datane dipilih "
"saka daftar pilihan sing wis ditemtokake. Biasane barang-barang iki "
"dilebokake liwat dhaptar pilihan, kothak centhang, utawa tombol radio. "
"Delengen kaca <a href=\":field\">bantuan Modul Field</a> lan <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">bantuan UI Field</a> kanggo informasi umum babagan "
"kolom lan carane nggawe lan ngatur. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":options_do\">dokumentasi online kanggo Modul "
"Options</a>."

msgid ""
"The <em>settings</em> and the <em>display</em> of the list fields can "
"be configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI "
"help</a> for more information on how to manage fields and their "
"display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Setelan</em> lan <em>tampilan</em> saka kolom dhaptar bisa disetel "
"kanthi kapisah. Delengen <a href=\":field_ui\">bantuan UI Kolom</a> "
"kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan cara ngatur kolom lan "
"tampilané."

msgid ""
"The Internal Page Cache module caches pages for anonymous users in the "
"database. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":pagecache-documentation\">online documentation for the "
"Internal Page Cache module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Internal Page Cache nyimpen kaca kanggo pangguna anonim ing "
"basis data. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":pagecache-documentation\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Internal Page Cache</a>."

msgid ""
"Pages are usually identical for all anonymous users, while they can be "
"personalized for each authenticated user. This is why entire pages can "
"be cached for anonymous users, whereas they will have to be rebuilt "
"for every authenticated user."
msgstr ""
"Kaca biasane padha kanggo kabeh pangguna anonim, nalika bisa "
"dipersonalisasi kanggo saben pangguna sing wis mlebu. Iki sebabe kaca "
"sakabèhé bisa disimpen ing cache kanggo pangguna anonim, dene kudu "
"dibangun maneh kanggo saben pangguna sing wis mlebu."

msgid ""
"To speed up your site for authenticated users, see the <a "
"href=\":dynamic_page_cache-help\">Dynamic Page Cache module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mempercepat situs panjenengan kanggo pangguna sing wis mlebu, "
"delengen <a href=\":dynamic_page_cache-help\">modul Dynamic Page "
"Cache</a>."

msgid ""
"The Path module allows you to specify an alias, or custom URL, for any "
"existing internal system path. Aliases should not be confused with URL "
"redirects, which allow you to forward a changed or inactive URL to a "
"new URL. In addition to making URLs more readable, aliases also help "
"search engines index content more effectively. Multiple aliases may be "
"used for a single internal system path. To automate the aliasing of "
"paths, you can install the contributed module <a "
"href=\":pathauto\">Pathauto</a>. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":path\">online documentation for the Path module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Path ngidini sampeyan nemtokake alias, utawa URL kustom, kanggo "
"path internal sistem sing wis ana. Alias ora kena disamakake karo "
"redirect URL, sing ngidini sampeyan nerusake URL sing diganti utawa "
"ora aktif menyang URL anyar. Saliyane nggawe URL luwih gampang diwaca, "
"alias uga mbantu mesin telusur ngindeks konten luwih efektif. Akeh "
"alias bisa digunakake kanggo siji path internal sistem. Kanggo "
"ngotomatisasi aliasing path, sampeyan bisa nginstal modul kontribusi "
"<a href=\":pathauto\">Pathauto</a>. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":path\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Path</a>."

msgid ""
"If you create or edit a taxonomy term you can add an alias (for "
"example <em>music/jazz</em>) in the field \"URL alias\". When creating "
"or editing content you can add an alias (for example "
"<em>about-us/team</em>) under the section \"URL path settings\" in the "
"field \"URL alias\". Aliases for any other path can be added through "
"the page <a href=\":aliases\">URL aliases</a>. To add aliases a user "
"needs the permission <a href=\":permissions\">Create and edit URL "
"aliases</a>."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan nggawe utawa ngowahi istilah taksonomi, sampeyan bisa "
"nambah alias (umpamane <em>music/jazz</em>) ing kolom \"URL alias\". "
"Nalika nggawe utawa ngowahi isi, sampeyan bisa nambah alias (umpamane "
"<em>about-us/team</em>) ing bagean \"URL path settings\" ing kolom "
"\"URL alias\". Alias kanggo path liyane isa ditambahake liwat kaca <a "
"href=\":aliases\">URL aliases</a>. Kanggo nambah alias, pangguna kudu "
"nduweni ijin <a href=\":permissions\">Create and edit URL aliases</a>."

msgid ""
"The Path module provides a way to search and view a <a "
"href=\":aliases\">list of all aliases</a> that are in use on your "
"website. Aliases can be added, edited and deleted through this list."
msgstr ""
"Modhul Path nyedhiyakake cara kanggo nggoleki lan ndeleng <a "
"href=\":aliases\">daftar kabeh alias</a> sing digunakake ing situs web "
"sampeyan. Alias bisa ditambah, diedit, lan dihapus liwat daftar iki."

msgid "The internal system path."
msgstr "Path sistem internal."

msgid "The path alias."
msgstr "Alias path."

msgid ""
"The Responsive Image module provides an image formatter that allows "
"browsers to select which image file to display based on media queries "
"or which image file types the browser supports, using the HTML 5 "
"picture and source elements and/or the sizes, srcset and type "
"attributes. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":responsive_image\">online documentation for the Responsive "
"Image module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Responsive Image nyedhiyakake formatter gambar sing ngidini "
"browser milih file gambar sing arep ditampilake adhedhasar query media "
"utawa jinis file gambar sing didhukung browser, nggunakake elemen "
"picture lan source HTML 5 lan/utawa atribut sizes, srcset, lan type. "
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":responsive_image\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Responsive "
"Image</a>."

msgid ""
"By creating responsive image styles you define which options the "
"browser has in selecting which image file to display. In most cases "
"this means providing different image sizes based on the viewport size. "
"On the <a href=\":responsive_image_style\">Responsive image styles</a> "
"page, click <em>Add responsive image style</em> to create a new style. "
"First choose a label, a fallback image style and a breakpoint group "
"and click Save."
msgstr ""
"Kanthi nggawe gaya gambar responsif, sampeyan nemtokake pilihan apa "
"sing diduweni browser kanggo milih file gambar sing bakal ditampilake. "
"Ing umume kasus, iki tegese nyedhiyakake ukuran gambar sing beda-beda "
"adhedhasar ukuran viewport. Ing kaca <a "
"href=\":responsive_image_style\">Gaya gambar responsif</a>, klik "
"<em>Tambah gaya gambar responsif</em> kanggo nggawe gaya anyar. Kaping "
"pisan, pilih label, gaya gambar cadangan, lan grup breakpoint banjur "
"klik Simpen."

msgid ""
"Below the Sizes field you can choose multiple image styles so the "
"browser can choose the best image file size to fill the space defined "
"in the Sizes field. Typically you will want to use image styles that "
"resize your image to have options that range from the smallest px "
"width possible for the space the image will appear in to the largest "
"px width possible, with a variety of widths in between. You may want "
"to provide image styles with widths that are 1.5x to 2x the space "
"available in the layout to account for high resolution screens. Image "
"styles can be defined on the <a href=\":image_styles\">Image styles "
"page</a> that is provided by the <a href=\":image_help\">Image "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor kolom Sizes sampeyan bisa milih sawetara gaya gambar supaya "
"browser bisa milih ukuran file gambar sing paling apik kanggo ngisi "
"ruang sing wis ditemtokake ing kolom Sizes. Biasane sampeyan pengin "
"nggunakake gaya gambar sing ngatur ukuran gambarmu supaya duwe opsi "
"wiwit saka ambane px paling cilik sing bisa kanggo ruang panggonan "
"gambar bakal muncul nganti ambane px paling gedhe sing bisa, kanthi "
"macem-macem ukuran ing antarane. Sampeyan bisa uga pengin nyedhiyakake "
"gaya gambar kanthi ambane 1,5x nganti 2x saka ruang sing kasedhiya ing "
"tata letak kanggo nyocogake layar resolusi dhuwur. Gaya gambar bisa "
"ditemtokake ing <a href=\":image_styles\">halaman Gaya gambar</a> sing "
"disedhiyakake dening <a href=\":image_help\">modul Gambar</a>."

msgid ""
"After defining responsive image styles, you can use them in the "
"display settings for your Image fields, so that the site displays "
"responsive images using the HTML5 picture tag. Open the Manage display "
"page for the entity type (content type, taxonomy vocabulary, etc.) "
"that the Image field is attached to. Choose the format <em>Responsive "
"image</em>, click the Edit icon, and select one of the responsive "
"image styles that you have created. For general information on how to "
"manage fields and their display see the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI "
"module help page</a>. For background information about entities and "
"fields see the <a href=\":field_help\">Field module help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sawise nemtokake gaya gambar responsif, sampeyan bisa nggunakake gaya "
"kasebut ing setelan tampilan kanggo kolom Gambar, supaya situs "
"nuduhake gambar responsif nggunakake tag picture HTML5. Bukak kaca "
"Manage display kanggo jinis entitas (jinis isi, kosakata taksonomi, "
"lsp.) sing kolom Gambar digandhengake. Pilih format <em>Responsive "
"image</em>, klik ikon Edit, lan pilih salah siji saka gaya gambar "
"responsif sing wis sampeyan gawe. Kanggo informasi umum babagan cara "
"ngatur kolom lan tampilané, delengen <a href=\":field_ui\">kaca "
"pitulungan modul Field UI</a>. Kanggo informasi latar mburi babagan "
"entitas lan kolom, delengen <a href=\":field_help\">kaca pitulungan "
"modul Field</a>."

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\":responsive_image_help\">Responsive Image help "
"page</a> for information on the sizes attribute."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <a href=\":responsive_image_help\">kaca pitulungan Responsive "
"Image</a> kanggo informasi babagan atribut sizes."

msgid ""
"The Search module provides the ability to set up search pages based on "
"plugins provided by other modules. In Drupal core, there are two "
"page-type plugins: the Content page type provides keyword searching "
"for content managed by the Node module, and the Users page type "
"provides keyword searching for registered users. Contributed modules "
"may provide other page-type plugins. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":search-module\">online documentation for the Search "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Search nyedhiyakake kemampuan kanggo nyetel kaca panelusuran "
"adhedhasar plugin sing diwenehake dening modul liyane. Ing inti "
"Drupal, ana loro plugin jinis kaca: jinis kaca Konten nyedhiyakake "
"panelusuran tembung kunci kanggo konten sing dikelola dening modul "
"Node, lan jinis kaca Panganggo nyedhiyakake panelusuran tembung kunci "
"kanggo pangguna sing wis ndaftar. Modul sing disumbangake bisa "
"nyedhiyakake plugin jinis kaca liyane. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"waca <a href=\":search-module\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Search</a>."

msgid ""
"To configure search pages, visit the <a "
"href=\":search-settings\">Search pages page</a>. In the Search pages "
"section, you can add a new search page, edit the configuration of "
"existing search pages, enable and disable search pages, and choose the "
"default search page. Each enabled search page has a URL path starting "
"with <em>search</em>, and each will appear as a tab or local task link "
"on the <a href=\":search-url\">search page</a>; you can configure the "
"text that is shown in the tab. In addition, some search page plugins "
"have additional settings that you can configure for each search page."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nyetel kaca panelusuran, bukak <a "
"href=\":search-settings\">kaca Panelusuran</a>. Ing bagean Kaca "
"Panelusuran, sampeyan bisa nambah kaca panelusuran anyar, nyunting "
"konfigurasi kaca panelusuran sing wis ana, ngaktifake lan mateni kaca "
"panelusuran, lan milih kaca panelusuran standar. Saben kaca "
"panelusuran sing diaktifake nduwé dalan URL sing diwiwiti karo "
"<em>search</em>, lan saben bakal ditampilaké minangka tab utawa "
"pranala tugas lokal ing <a href=\":search-url\">kaca panelusuran</a>; "
"sampeyan bisa nyetel teks sing ditampilaké ing tab kasebut. Saliyane, "
"sawetara plugin kaca panelusuran nduwé setelan tambahan sing bisa "
"sampeyan konfigurasi kanggo saben kaca panelusuran."

msgid ""
"Some search page plugins, such as the core Content search page, index "
"searchable text using the Drupal core search index, and will not work "
"unless content is indexed. Indexing is done during <em>cron</em> runs, "
"so it requires a <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a> to be set "
"up. There are also several settings affecting indexing that can be "
"configured on the <a href=\":search-settings\">Search pages page</a>: "
"the number of items to index per cron run, the minimum word length to "
"index, and how to handle Chinese, Japanese, and Korean characters."
msgstr ""
"Sawetara plugin kaca panelusuran, kaya panelusuran isi inti Drupal, "
"ngindeks teks sing bisa digoleki nggunakake indeks panelusuran inti "
"Drupal, lan ora bakal bisa digunakake kajaba isi wis diindeks. "
"Indeksasi ditindakake nalika <em>cron</em> mlaku, mula mbutuhake <a "
"href=\":cron\">tugas pangopènan cron</a> kanggo disetel. Ana uga "
"sawetara setelan sing mengaruhi indeksasi sing bisa dikonfigurasi ing "
"<a href=\":search-settings\">kaca halaman panelusuran</a>: jumlahe "
"item sing kudu diindeks saben mlaku cron, dawa tembung minimal kanggo "
"diindeks, lan cara nangani aksara Cina, Jepang, lan Korea."

msgid ""
"Users with <a href=\":search_permission\">Use search</a> permission "
"can use the Search block and <a href=\":search\">Search page</a>. "
"Users with the <a href=\":node_permission\">View published content</a> "
"permission can use configured search pages of type <em>Content</em> to "
"search for content containing exact keywords; in addition, users with "
"<a href=\":search_permission\">Use advanced search</a> permission can "
"use more complex search filtering. Users with the <a "
"href=\":user_permission\">View user information</a> permission can use "
"configured search pages of type <em>Users</em> to search for active "
"users containing the keyword anywhere in the username, and users with "
"the <a href=\":user_permission\">Administer users</a> permission can "
"search for active and blocked users, by email address or username "
"keyword."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé <a href=\":search_permission\">Ijin nggunakake "
"panelusuran</a> bisa nggunakake blok Panelusuran lan <a "
"href=\":search\">Kaca Panelusuran</a>. Pangguna sing nduwé ijin <a "
"href=\":node_permission\">Ndelok isi sing wis diterbitaké</a> bisa "
"nganggo kaca panelusuran sing wis dikonfigurasi jinis <em>Isi</em> "
"kanggo nggoleki isi sing ngemot tembung kunci sing pas; saliyané "
"kuwi, pangguna sing nduwé <a href=\":search_permission\">Ijin "
"nggunakake panelusuran majeng</a> bisa nggunakake panyaringan "
"panelusuran sing luwih rumit. Pangguna sing nduwé ijin <a "
"href=\":user_permission\">Ndelok informasi pangguna</a> bisa "
"nggunakake kaca panelusuran sing wis dikonfigurasi jinis "
"<em>Pangguna</em> kanggo nggoleki pangguna aktif sing ngemot tembung "
"kunci ing ngendi waé ing jeneng pangguna, lan pangguna sing nduwé "
"ijin <a href=\":user_permission\">Nglola pangguna</a> bisa nggoleki "
"pangguna aktif lan sing diblokir, kanthi alamat email utawa tembung "
"kunci jeneng pangguna."

msgid ""
"By default, the Search module only supports exact keyword matching in "
"content searches. You can modify this behavior by installing a "
"language-specific stemming module for your language (such as <a "
"href=\":porterstemmer_url\">Porter Stemmer</a> for American English), "
"which allows words such as walk, walking, and walked to be matched in "
"the Search module. Another approach is to use a third-party search "
"technology with stemming or partial word matching features built in, "
"such as <a href=\":solr_url\">Apache Solr</a> or <a "
"href=\":sphinx_url\">Sphinx</a>. There are also contributed modules "
"that provide additional search pages. These and other <a "
"href=\":contrib-search\">search-related contributed modules</a> can be "
"downloaded by visiting Drupal.org."
msgstr ""
"Secara default, modul Search mung ndhukung cocog tembung kunci sing "
"persis ing panelusuran isi. Sampeyan bisa ngowahi prilaku iki kanthi "
"masang modul stemming basa sing khusus kanggo basa sampeyan (kaya <a "
"href=\":porterstemmer_url\">Porter Stemmer</a> kanggo basa Inggris "
"Amerika), sing ngidini tembung kaya walk, walking, lan walked cocog "
"ing modul Search. Pendekatan liyane yaiku nggunakake teknologi "
"panelusuran pihak katelu kanthi fitur stemming utawa cocog tembung "
"parsial sing wis dibangun, kaya <a href=\":solr_url\">Apache Solr</a> "
"utawa <a href=\":sphinx_url\">Sphinx</a>. Ana uga modul kontribusi "
"sing nyedhiyakake kaca panelusuran tambahan. Iki lan modul kontribusi "
"liyane sing gegandhengan karo <a "
"href=\":contrib-search\">panelusuran</a> bisa didownload kanthi "
"ngunjungi Drupal.org."

msgid "… @excerpt … @excerpt …"
msgstr "… @excerpt … @excerpt …"

msgid ""
"This module does not have a user interface. It is used by other "
"modules which need to serialize data, such as <a "
"href=\":rest\">REST</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul iki ora duwe antarmuka pangguna. Iki digunakake dening modul "
"liyane sing butuh kanggo nyerialisasi data, kaya <a "
"href=\":rest\">REST</a>."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":doc_url\">online "
"documentation for the Serialization module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Serialisasi</a>."

msgid ""
"The Shortcut module allows users to create sets of <em>shortcut</em> "
"links to commonly-visited pages of the site. Shortcuts are contained "
"within <em>sets</em>. Each user with <em>Select any shortcut set</em> "
"permission can select a shortcut set created by anyone at the site. "
"For more information, see the <a href=\":shortcut\">online "
"documentation for the Shortcut module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Shortcut ngidini pangguna nggawe set tautan <em>shortcut</em> "
"menyang kaca-kaca sing asring dilalekake ing situs. Shortcut kasebut "
"diklumpukake ing njero <em>set</em>. Saben pangguna sing nduweni ijin "
"<em>Pilih sembarang set shortcut</em> bisa milih set shortcut sing "
"digawe dening sapa wae ing situs kasebut. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":shortcut\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul Shortcut</a>."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Administer shortcuts</em> permission can manage "
"shortcut sets and edit the shortcuts within sets from the <a "
"href=\":shortcuts\">Shortcuts administration page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni ijin <em>Administer shortcuts</em> bisa ngatur "
"set shortcut lan nyunting shortcut ing njero set saka <a "
"href=\":shortcuts\">Kaca administrasi Shortcuts</a>."

msgid ""
"Define which shortcut set you are using on the <a "
"href=\":shortcut-link\">Shortcuts tab</a> of your account page."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan set pintasan sing digunakake ing <a "
"href=\":shortcut-link\">tab Pintasan</a> halaman akun sampeyan."

msgid "No shortcuts available. <a href=\":link\">Add a shortcut</a>"
msgstr "Ora ana jalan pintas. <a href=\":link\">Tambahake jalan pintas</a>"

msgid ""
"You are now using the new %set_name shortcut set. You can edit it from "
"this page or <a href=\":switch-url\">switch back to a different "
"one.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan saiki nggunakake set pintasan anyar %set_name. Sampeyan bisa "
"ngowahi saka kaca iki utawa <a href=\":switch-url\">mblokir bali "
"menyang set liyane.</a>"

msgid "The link for this shortcut."
msgstr "Tautan kanggo pintasan iki."

msgid "The title for this shortcut."
msgstr "Judhul kanggo shortcut iki."

msgid "The weight for this shortcut"
msgstr "Bobot kanggo shortcut iki"

msgid "The name under which the set's links are stored."
msgstr "Jeneng sing digunakake kanggo nyimpen pranala-pranala saka set iki."

msgid "The title of the set."
msgstr "Judhul saka set."

msgid "The users.uid for this set."
msgstr "users.uid kanggo set iki."

msgid "The shortcut_set.set_name that will be displayed for this user."
msgstr "shortcut_set.set_name sing bakal ditampilake kanggo pangguna iki."

msgid "Version: @module-version"
msgstr "Versi: @module-version"

msgid "Requires: @module-list"
msgstr "Mbutuhake: @module-list"

msgid "Required by: @module-list"
msgstr "Diperlukan déning: @module-list"

msgid ""
"This theme requires PHP version @php_required and is incompatible with "
"PHP version @php_version."
msgstr ""
"Tema iki mbutuhake versi PHP @php_required lan ora cocog karo versi "
"PHP @php_version."

msgid ""
"The System module is integral to the site: it provides user interfaces "
"for many core systems and settings, as well as the basic "
"administrative menu structure. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":system\">online documentation for the System module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Sistem iku bagean penting saka situs: modul iki nyedhiyakake "
"antarmuka panganggo kanggo akeh sistem inti lan setelan, uga struktur "
"menu administrasi dasar. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":system\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Sistem</a>."

msgid ""
"Users with appropriate permission can install and uninstall modules "
"from the <a href=\":modules\">Extend page</a>. Depending on which "
"distribution or installation profile you choose when you install your "
"site, several modules are installed and others are provided but not "
"installed. Each module provides a discrete set of features; modules "
"may be installed or uninstalled depending on the needs of the site. "
"Many additional modules contributed by members of the Drupal community "
"are available for download from the <a "
"href=\":drupal-modules\">Drupal.org module page</a>. Note that "
"uninstalling a module is a destructive action: when you uninstall a "
"module, you will permanently lose all data connected to the module."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni ijin sing cocog bisa masang lan mbusak modul "
"saka <a href=\":modules\">Kaca Extend</a>. Gumantung saka distribusi "
"utawa profil instalasi sing dipilih nalika masang situs, sawetara "
"modul wis diinstal lan liyane disedhiyakake nanging durung diinstal. "
"Saben modul nyedhiyakake fitur sing kapisah; modul bisa diinstal utawa "
"dibusak manut kabutuhan situs. Akeh modul tambahan sing disumbangaké "
"déning anggota komunitas Drupal bisa diundhuh saka <a "
"href=\":drupal-modules\">kaca modul Drupal.org</a>. Cathetan, mbusak "
"modul iku tumindak sing ngrusak: nalika kowe mbusak modul, kowe bakal "
"permanently ilang kabèh data sing gegandhengan karo modul kasebut."

msgid ""
"Users with appropriate permission can install and uninstall themes on "
"the <a href=\":themes\">Appearance page</a>. Themes determine the "
"design and presentation of your site. Depending on which distribution "
"or installation profile you choose when you install your site, a "
"default theme is installed, and possibly a different theme for "
"administration pages. Other themes are provided but not installed, and "
"additional contributed themes are available at the <a "
"href=\":drupal-themes\">Drupal.org theme page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé idin sing cocok bisa masang lan mbusak tema ing "
"<a href=\":themes\">Kaca Tampilan</a>. Tema ngatur rancangan lan "
"tampilan situs sampeyan. Gumantung saka distribusi utawa profil "
"instalasi sing sampeyan pilih nalika masang situs, tema standar bakal "
"dipasang, lan bisa uga ana tema sing béda kanggo kaca administrasi. "
"Tema liyane disedhiyakake nanging ora dipasang, lan tema tambahan saka "
"kontributor kasedhiya ing <a href=\":drupal-themes\">kaca tema "
"Drupal.org</a>."

msgid ""
"When you are performing site maintenance, you can prevent "
"non-administrative users (including anonymous visitors) from viewing "
"your site by putting it in <a href=\":maintenance-mode\">Maintenance "
"mode</a>. This will prevent unauthorized users from making changes to "
"the site while you are performing maintenance, or from seeing a broken "
"site while updates are in progress."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan lagi nindakake pangopènan situs, sampeyan bisa nyegah "
"pangguna sing dudu administrator (kalebu pengunjung anonim) saka "
"ndeleng situs sampeyan kanthi mlebu menyang <a "
"href=\":maintenance-mode\">Mode Pangopènan</a>. Iki bakal nyegah "
"pangguna sing ora sah nggawe owah-owahan ing situs nalika sampeyan "
"lagi nindakake pangopènan, utawa supaya ora ndeleng situs sing rusak "
"nalika pembaruan lagi berlangsung."

msgid ""
"On the <a href=\":performance-page\">Performance page</a>, the site "
"can be configured to aggregate CSS and JavaScript files, making the "
"total request size smaller. Note that, for small- to medium-sized "
"websites, the <a href=\":page-cache\">Internal Page Cache module</a> "
"should be installed so that pages are efficiently cached and reused "
"for anonymous users. Finally, for websites of all sizes, the <a "
"href=\":dynamic-page-cache\">Dynamic Page Cache module</a> should also "
"be installed so that the non-personalized parts of pages are "
"efficiently cached (for all users)."
msgstr ""
"Ing <a href=\":performance-page\">Kaca Kinerja</a>, situs bisa "
"dikonfigurasi kanggo nggabungake berkas CSS lan JavaScript, supaya "
"ukuran total panjalukan dadi luwih cilik. Elinga yen, kanggo situs "
"cilik nganti ukuran medium, <a href=\":page-cache\">modul Cache Kaca "
"Internal</a> kudu dipasang supaya kaca-kaca bisa dicache kanthi "
"efisien lan digunakake maneh kanggo pangguna anonim. Pungkasan, kanggo "
"situs saka kabeh ukuran, <a href=\":dynamic-page-cache\">modul Cache "
"Kaca Dinamis</a> uga kudu dipasang supaya bagean kaca sing ora "
"dipersonalisasi bisa dicache kanthi efisien (kanggo kabeh pangguna)."

msgid ""
"Your site has several file directories, which are used to store and "
"process uploaded and generated files. The <em>public</em> file "
"directory, which is configured in your settings.php file, is the "
"default place for storing uploaded files. Links to files in this "
"directory contain the direct file URL, so when the files are "
"requested, the web server will send them directly without invoking "
"your site code. This means that the files can be downloaded by anyone "
"with the file URL, so requests are not access-controlled but they are "
"efficient. The <em>private</em> file directory, also configured in "
"your settings.php file and ideally located outside the site web root, "
"is access controlled. Links to files in this directory are not direct, "
"so requests to these files are mediated by your site code. This means "
"that your site can check file access permission for each file before "
"deciding to fulfill the request, so the requests are more secure, but "
"less efficient. You should only use the private storage for files that "
"need access control, not for files like your site logo and background "
"images used on every page. The <em>temporary</em> file directory is "
"used internally by your site code for various operations, and is "
"configured on the <a href=\":file-system\">File system settings</a> "
"page. You can also see the configured public and private file "
"directories on this page, and choose whether public or private should "
"be the default for uploaded files."
msgstr ""
"Situs sampeyan nduwé sawetara direktori file, sing digunakaké kanggo "
"nyimpen lan ngolah file-file sing diunggah lan digawe. Direktori file "
"<em>public</em>, sing dikonfigurasi ing file settings.php sampeyan, "
"iku panggonan baku kanggo nyimpen file-file sing diunggah. Tautan "
"menyang file ing direktori iki ngemot URL file langsung, dadi nalika "
"file-file dijaluk, server web bakal ngirim file kasebut langsung tanpa "
"ngetokake kode situs sampeyan. Iki tegese file-file bisa diunduh "
"déning sapa waé sing nduwé URL file, dadi panjalukan ora dikontrol "
"akses, nanging luwih efisien. Direktori file <em>private</em>, uga "
"dikonfigurasi ing file settings.php sampeyan lan paling apik ana ing "
"njaba web root situs, iku dikontrol aksesé. Tautan menyang file ing "
"direktori iki ora langsung, dadi panjalukan kanggo file kasebut "
"dimediasi déning kode situs sampeyan. Iki tegese situs sampeyan bisa "
"mriksa idin akses file kanggo saben file sadurunge mènèhi "
"panjalukan, dadi panjalukan luwih aman, nanging kurang efisien. "
"Sampeyan mung kudu nggunakake panyimpenan pribadi kanggo file sing "
"butuh kontrol akses, ora kanggo file kaya logo situs lan gambar latar "
"sing digunakaké ing saben kaca. Direktori file <em>temporary</em> "
"digunakaké sacara internal déning kode situs sampeyan kanggo "
"macem-macem operasi, lan dikonfigurasi ing kaca <a "
"href=\":file-system\">Setelan sistem file</a>. Sampeyan uga bisa "
"ndeleng direktori file public lan private sing wis dikonfigurasi ing "
"kaca iki, lan milih apa public utawa private kudu dadi panggonan baku "
"kanggo file sing diunggah."

msgid ""
"On the <a href=\":toolkit\">Image toolkit page</a>, you can select and "
"configure the PHP toolkit used to manipulate images. Depending on "
"which distribution or installation profile you choose when you install "
"your site, the GD2 toolkit and possibly others are included; other "
"toolkits may be provided by contributed modules."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca <a href=\":toolkit\">Image toolkit</a>, sampeyan bisa milih "
"lan nyetel toolkit PHP sing digunakake kanggo ngolah gambar. Gumantung "
"saka distribusi utawa profil instalasi sing sampeyan pilih nalika "
"nginstal situs, toolkit GD2 lan bisa uga liyane kalebu; toolkit liyane "
"bisa disedhiyakake dening modul sumbangan."

msgid ""
"Set and configure the default theme for your website.  Alternative <a "
"href=\":themes\">themes</a> are available."
msgstr ""
"Atur lan konfigurasi tema default kanggo situs web sampeyan. Tema <a "
"href=\":themes\">alternatif</a> uga kasedhiya."

msgid ""
"You can place blocks for each theme on the <a href=\":blocks\">block "
"layout</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nempatake blok kanggo saben tema ing kaca <a "
"href=\":blocks\">tata letak blok</a>."

msgid ""
"Here you can find a short overview of your site's parameters as well "
"as any problems detected with your installation. It may be useful to "
"copy and paste this information into support requests filed on "
"Drupal.org's support forums and project issue queues. Before filing a "
"support request, ensure that your web server meets the <a "
"href=\":system-requirements\">system requirements.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Mene kene sampeyan bisa nemokake ringkesan cekak babagan parameter "
"situs sampeyan uga masalah apa wae sing dideteksi ing instalasi "
"sampeyan. Iki bisa migunani kanggo nyalin lan nempel informasi iki "
"menyang permintaan dhukungan sing diajokake ing forum dhukungan "
"Drupal.org lan antrian isu proyek. Sadurunge ngajokake permintaan "
"dhukungan, priksa manawa server web sampeyan nyukupi <a "
"href=\":system-requirements\">syarat sistem.</a>"

msgid "Configure your <a href=\":user-edit\">account time zone setting</a>."
msgstr "Atur <a href=\":user-edit\">setelan zona wektu akun sampeyan</a>."

msgid ""
"The minimum version of Apache needed to run Drupal without mod_rewrite "
"enabled is 2.2.16. See the <a href=\":link\">enabling clean URLs</a> "
"page for more information on mod_rewrite."
msgstr ""
"Versi minimal Apache sing dibutuhake kanggo mbukak Drupal tanpa "
"mod_rewrite diaktifake yaiku 2.2.16. Delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":link\">ngaktifake URL resik</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap "
"babagan mod_rewrite."

msgid ""
"Your server is capable of using clean URLs, but it is not enabled. "
"Using clean URLs gives an improved user experience and is recommended. "
"<a href=\":link\">Enable clean URLs</a>"
msgstr ""
"Server sampeyan bisa nggunakake URL sing resik, nanging durung "
"diaktifake. Nggunakake URL sing resik menehi pengalaman panganggo sing "
"luwih apik lan disaranake. <a href=\":link\">Aktifake URL sing "
"resik</a>"

msgid "@phpversion (<a href=\":url\">more information</a>)"
msgstr "@phpversion (<a href=\":url\">informasi luwih lengkap</a>)"

msgid ""
"Drupal requires you to enable the PHP extensions in the following list "
"(see the <a href=\":system_requirements\">system requirements page</a> "
"for more information):"
msgstr ""
"Drupal mbutuhake sampeyan kanggo ngaktifake ekstensi PHP sing ana ing "
"dhaptar ing ngisor iki (delengen <a href=\":system_requirements\">kaca "
"syarat sistem</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap):"

msgid "PHP OPcode caching"
msgstr "Caching OPcode PHP"

msgid ""
"Your web server does not appear to support PDO (PHP Data Objects). Ask "
"your hosting provider if they support the native PDO extension. See "
"the <a href=\":link\">system requirements</a> page for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Server web panjenengan katon ora ndhukung PDO (PHP Data Objects). "
"Takon marang panyedhiya hosting panjenengan apa padha ndhukung "
"ekstensi PDO asli. Delengen kaca <a href=\":link\">persyaratan "
"sistem</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"Your web server does not appear to support any common PDO database "
"extensions. Check with your hosting provider to see if they support "
"PDO (PHP Data Objects) and offer any databases that <a "
"href=\":drupal-databases\">Drupal supports</a>."
msgstr ""
"Server web sampeyan ketoke ora ndhukung ekstensi database PDO umum apa "
"wae. Priksa karo panyedhiya hosting sampeyan kanggo mriksa apa dheweke "
"ndhukung PDO (PHP Data Objects) lan nawakake database sing <a "
"href=\":drupal-databases\">didhukung Drupal</a>."

msgid ""
"Your web server seems to have the wrong version of PDO installed. "
"Drupal requires the PDO extension from PHP core. This system has the "
"older PECL version. See the <a href=\":link\">system requirements</a> "
"page for more information."
msgstr ""
"Server web sampeyan kayane wis nginstal versi PDO sing salah. Drupal "
"mbutuhake ekstensi PDO saka inti PHP. Sistem iki nggunakake versi PECL "
"sing luwih lawas. Waca kaca <a href=\":link\">syarat sistem</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the online handbook entry for <a "
"href=\":memory-limit\">increasing the PHP memory limit</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen entri buku pandhuan online "
"kanggo <a href=\":memory-limit\">nambah wates memori PHP</a>."

msgid ""
"See <a href=\":url\">@url</a> for information about the recommended "
".htaccess file which should be added to the %directory directory to "
"help protect against arbitrary code execution."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <a href=\":url\">@url</a> kanggo informasi babagan file "
".htaccess sing disaranake sing kudu ditambahake ing direktori "
"%directory kanggo mbantu nglindhungi saka eksekusi kode sembarangan."

msgid "Last run @time ago"
msgstr "Mburi mlaku @time kepungkur"

msgid ""
"For more information, see the online handbook entry for <a "
"href=\":cron-handbook\">configuring cron jobs</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen entri handbook online kanggo "
"<a href=\":cron-handbook\">ngonfigurasi tugas cron</a>."

msgid ""
"You may need to set the correct directory at the <a "
"href=\":admin-file-system\">file system settings page</a> or change "
"the current directory's permissions so that it is writable."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa uga kudu nyetel direktori sing bener ing <a "
"href=\":admin-file-system\">kaca setelan sistem file</a> utawa ngganti "
"ijin direktori saiki supaya bisa ditulis."

msgid ""
"An automated attempt to create this directory failed, possibly due to "
"a permissions problem. To proceed with the installation, either create "
"the directory and modify its permissions manually or ensure that the "
"installer has the permissions to create it automatically. For more "
"information, see INSTALL.txt or the <a href=\":handbook_url\">online "
"handbook</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nyoba nggawe direktori iki kanthi otomatis gagal, bisa uga amarga "
"masalah hak akses. Kanggo nerusake instalasi, gawe direktori kasebut "
"kanthi manual lan ubah hak aksesé utawa priksa manawa installer "
"nduwèni hak akses kanggo nggawe direktori iki kanthi otomatis. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap, delengen INSTALL.txt utawa <a "
"href=\":handbook_url\">pandhuan online</a>."

msgid ""
"Some modules have database schema updates to install. You should run "
"the <a href=\":update\">database update script</a> immediately."
msgstr ""
"Sawetara modul nduweni update skema basis data sing kudu diinstal. "
"Sampeyan kudu langsung mbukak <a href=\":update\">skrip update basis "
"data</a>."

msgid ""
"The trusted_host_patterns setting is not configured in settings.php. "
"This can lead to security vulnerabilities. It is <strong>highly "
"recommended</strong> that you configure this. See <a "
"href=\":url\">Protecting against HTTP HOST Header attacks</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Setelan trusted_host_patterns durung dikonfigurasi ing settings.php. "
"Iki bisa nyebabake kerentanan keamanan. Disaranake <strong>kanggé "
"banget</strong> supaya sampeyan ngatur iki. Delengen <a "
"href=\":url\">Nglindhungi saka serangan HTTP HOST Header</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "Put your site into <a href=\":url\">maintenance mode</a>."
msgstr "Pasang situs sampeyan menyang <a href=\":url\">mode pangopènan</a>."

msgid "All errors have been <a href=\":url\">logged</a>."
msgstr "Kabeh kesalahan wis <a href=\":url\">dicathet</a>."

msgid ""
"Updates were attempted. If you see no failures below, you may proceed "
"happily back to your <a href=\":url\">site</a>. Otherwise, you may "
"need to update your database manually."
msgstr ""
"Pembaharuan wis dicoba. Yen sampeyan ora weruh kegagalan ing ngisor "
"iki, sampeyan bisa nerusake kanthi seneng bali menyang <a "
"href=\":url\">situs</a> sampeyan. Yen ora, sampeyan bisa uga kudu "
"nganyari basis data sampeyan kanthi manual."

msgid ""
