msgid ""
"The Taxonomy module allows users who have permission to create and "
"edit content to categorize (tag) content of that type. Users who have "
"the <em>Administer vocabularies and terms</em> <a "
"href=\":permissions\" title=\"Taxonomy module "
"permissions\">permission</a> can add <em>vocabularies</em> that "
"contain a set of related <em>terms</em>. The terms in a vocabulary can "
"either be pre-set by an administrator or built gradually as content is "
"added and edited. Terms may be organized hierarchically if desired."
msgstr ""
"Modul Taxonomy ngidini pangguna sing nduweni ijin kanggo nggawe lan "
"nyunting isi supaya bisa ngategorikake (tag) isi saka jinis kasebut. "
"Pangguna sing nduweni <em>Administer vocabularies and terms</em> <a "
"href=\":permissions\" title=\"Taxonomy module permissions\">ijin</a> "
"bisa nambah <em>vocabularies</em> sing ngemot set <em>terms</em> sing "
"gegandhengan. Terms ing vocabulary bisa ditemtokake saka awal dening "
"admin utawa dibangun kanthi bertahap nalika isi ditambahake lan "
"disunting. Terms bisa diatur kanthi hierarkis yen dikarepake."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":taxonomy\">online "
"documentation for the Taxonomy module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":taxonomy\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Taksonomi</a>."

msgid ""
"Users who have the <em>Administer vocabularies and terms</em> "
"permission can add and edit vocabularies from the <a "
"href=\":taxonomy_admin\">Taxonomy administration page</a>. "
"Vocabularies can be deleted from their <em>Edit vocabulary</em> page. "
"Users with the <em>Taxonomy term: Administer fields</em> permission "
"may add additional fields for terms in that vocabulary using the <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">Field UI module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>Administer vocabularies and terms</em> "
"bisa nambah lan nyunting vocabularies saka <a "
"href=\":taxonomy_admin\"> kaca administrasi Taksonomi</a>. "
"Vocabularies bisa dihapus saka kaca <em>Edit vocabulary</em>. Pangguna "
"sing nduwé ijin <em>Taxonomy term: Administer fields</em> bisa nambah "
"lapangan tambahan kanggo istilah ing vocabulary kuwi nganggo <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">modul Antarmuka Lapangan</a>."

msgid ""
"Users who have the <em>Administer vocabularies and terms</em> "
"permission or the <em>Edit terms</em> permission for a particular "
"vocabulary can add, edit, and organize the terms in a vocabulary from "
"a vocabulary's term listing page, which can be accessed by going to "
"the <a href=\":taxonomy_admin\">Taxonomy administration page</a> and "
"clicking <em>List terms</em> in the <em>Operations</em> column. Users "
"must have the <em>Administer vocabularies and terms</em> permission or "
"the <em>Delete terms</em> permission for a particular vocabulary to "
"delete terms."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>Administer vocabularies and terms</em> "
"utawa ijin <em>Edit terms</em> kanggo sawijining kosa kata tartamtu "
"bisa nambah, nyunting, lan ngatur istilah-istilah ing kosa kata saka "
"kaca dhaptar istilah kosa kata, sing bisa diakses kanthi mlebu menyang "
"<a href=\":taxonomy_admin\">Kaca administrasi Taksonomi</a> lan "
"ngeklik <em>List terms</em> ing kolom <em>Operations</em>. Pangguna "
"kudu nduwé ijin <em>Administer vocabularies and terms</em> utawa ijin "
"<em>Delete terms</em> kanggo sawijining kosa kata tartamtu kanggo "
"mbusak istilah."

msgid ""
"A user with the <em>Administer fields</em> permission for a certain "
"entity type may add <em>Taxonomy term</em> reference fields to the "
"entity type, which will allow entities to be classified using taxonomy "
"terms. See the <a href=\":entity_reference\">Entity Reference help</a> "
"for more information about reference fields. See the <a "
"href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for general information on "
"fields and how to create and manage them."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni ijin <em>Administer fields</em> kanggo jinis "
"entitas tartamtu bisa nambah lapangan referensi <em>Taxonomy term</em> "
"menyang jinis entitas kasebut, sing bakal ngidini entitas "
"diklasifikasèkaké nganggo istilah taksonomi. Delengen <a "
"href=\":entity_reference\">Bantuan Referensi Entitas</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan lapangan referensi. Delengen uga kaca "
"<a href=\":field\">Bantuan modul Lapangan</a> lan <a "
"href=\":field_ui\">Bantuan UI Lapangan</a> kanggo informasi umum "
"babagan lapangan lan carane nggawe lan ngatur lapangan kasebut."

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\":entity_reference\">Entity Reference help</a> page "
"for the field widgets and formatters that can be configured for any "
"reference field on the <em>Manage display</em> and <em>Manage form "
"display</em> pages. Taxonomy additionally provides an <em>RSS "
"category</em> formatter that displays nothing when the entity item is "
"displayed as HTML, but displays an RSS category instead of a list when "
"the entity item is displayed in an RSS feed."
msgstr ""
"Delengen kaca <a href=\":entity_reference\">Bantuan Referensi "
"Entitas</a> kanggo widget lapangan lan formatter sing bisa disetel "
"kanggo sembarang lapangan referensi ing kaca <em>Manage display</em> "
"lan <em>Manage form display</em>. Taxonomy uga nyedhiyakake formatter "
"<em>RSS category</em> sing ora nuduhake apa-apa nalika item entitas "
"ditampilake minangka HTML, nanging nuduhake kategori RSS tinimbang "
"dhaptar nalika item entitas ditampilake ing feed RSS."

msgid "No vocabularies available. <a href=\":link\">Add vocabulary</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana kosakata sing kasedhiya. <a href=\":link\">Tambah "
"kosakata</a>."

msgid "No terms available. <a href=\":link\">Add term</a>."
msgstr "Ora ana istilah sing kasedhiya. <a href=\":link\">Tambah istilah</a>."

msgid "Format of the term description."
msgstr "Format saka katrangan istilah."

msgid "Module responsible for the vocabulary."
msgstr "Modul sing tanggung jawab kanggo kosa kata."

msgid ""
"The Telephone module allows you to create fields that contain "
"telephone numbers. See the <a href=\":field\">Field module help</a> "
"and the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for general "
"information on fields and how to create and manage them. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":telephone_documentation\">online "
"documentation for the Telephone module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Telephone ngidini sampeyan nggawe kolom sing ngemot nomer "
"telpon. Delengen kaca <a href=\":field\">Bantuan modul Kolom</a> lan "
"<a href=\":field_ui\">Bantuan UI Kolom</a> kanggo informasi umum "
"babagan kolom lan cara nggawe serta ngatur kolom kasebut. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":telephone_documentation\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Telephone</a>."

msgid ""
"The <em>settings</em> and the <em>display</em> of the telephone field "
"can be configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI "
"help</a> for more information on how to manage fields and their "
"display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Setelan</em> lan <em>tampilan</em> saka lapangan telpon bisa "
"diatur kanthi kapisah. Delengen <a href=\":field_ui\">bantuan Field "
"UI</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan carane ngatur lapangan "
"lan tampilane."

msgid ""
"The Text module allows you to create short and long text fields with "
"optional summaries. See the <a href=\":field\">Field module help</a> "
"and the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for general "
"information on fields and how to create and manage them. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":text_documentation\">online "
"documentation for the Text module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Text ngidini sampeyan nggawe kolom teks cekak lan dawa kanthi "
"ringkesan opsional. Delengen kaca <a href=\":field\">bantuan modul "
"Field</a> lan <a href=\":field_ui\">bantuan Field UI</a> kanggo "
"informasi umum babagan kolom lan cara nggawe lan ngatur. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":text_documentation\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Text</a>."

msgid ""
"The <em>settings</em> and <em>display</em> of the text field can be "
"configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> "
"for more information on how to manage fields and their display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Setelan</em> lan <em>tampilan</em> saka lapangan teks bisa diatur "
"kanthi kapisah. Delengen <a href=\":field_ui\">bantuan UI Lapangan</a> "
"kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan carane ngatur lapangan lan "
"tampilané."

msgid ""
"If you choose <em>Text (plain)</em> or <em>Text (plain, long)</em> you "
"restrict the input to <em>Plain text</em> only. If you choose <em>Text "
"(formatted)</em>, <em>Text (formatted, long)</em>, or <em>Text "
"(formatted, long with summary)</em> you allow users to write formatted "
"text. Which options are available to individual users depends on the "
"settings on the <a href=\":formats\">Text formats and editors "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan milih <em>Text (plain)</em> utawa <em>Text (plain, "
"long)</em> sampeyan matesi input mung kanggo <em>Plain text</em>. Yen "
"sampeyan milih <em>Text (formatted)</em>, <em>Text (formatted, "
"long)</em>, utawa <em>Text (formatted, long with summary)</em> "
"sampeyan ngidini pangguna kanggo nulis teks sing terformat. Pilihan "
"sing kasedhiya kanggo saben pangguna gumantung saka setelan ing <a "
"href=\":formats\">kaca Text formats and editors</a>."

msgid "Number of summary rows: @rows"
msgstr "Jumlah baris ringkesan: @rows"

msgid ""
"The Toolbar module provides a toolbar for site administrators, which "
"displays tabs and trays provided by the Toolbar module itself and "
"other modules. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":toolbar_docs\">online documentation for the Toolbar "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Toolbar nyedhiyakake toolbar kanggo administrator situs, sing "
"nampilake tab lan tray sing disedhiyakake dening modul Toolbar dhewe "
"lan modul liyane. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":toolbar_docs\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Toolbar</a>."

msgid "Uninstalled modules"
msgstr "Modhul sing wis dibusak"

msgid "Uninstalled themes"
msgstr "Tema sing durung diinstal"

msgid ""
"No update information available. <a href=\":run_cron\">Run cron</a> or "
"<a href=\":check_manually\">check manually</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana informasi pembaruan sing kasedhiya. <a "
"href=\":run_cron\">Jalankan cron</a> utawa <a "
"href=\":check_manually\">priksa kanthi manual</a>."

