"Your site is currently configured to send these emails when any "
"updates are available. To get notified only for security updates, "
"@url."
msgstr ""
"Situs sampeyan saiki wis disetel kanggo ngirim email iki nalika ana "
"pembaruan apa wae sing kasedhiya. Kanggo entuk kabar mung babagan "
"pembaruan keamanan, @url."

msgid ""
"Your site is currently configured to send these emails only when "
"security updates are available. To get notified for any available "
"updates, @url."
msgstr ""
"Situs sampeyan saiki dikonfigurasi kanggo ngirim email iki mung nalika "
"ana pembaruan keamanan sing kasedhiya. Kanggo nampa kabar babagan "
"pembaruan sing kasedhiya, @url."

msgid ""
"There was a problem checking <a href=\":update-report\">available "
"updates</a> for Drupal."
msgstr ""
"Ana masalah nalika mriksa <a href=\":update-report\">pembaruan sing "
"kasedhiya</a> kanggo Drupal."

msgid ""
"There was a problem checking <a href=\":update-report\">available "
"updates</a> for your modules or themes."
msgstr ""
"Ana masalah nalika mriksa <a href=\":update-report\">pembaruan sing "
"kasedhiya</a> kanggo modul utawa tema sampeyan."

msgid ""
"%archive_file contains a version of %names that is not compatible with "
"Drupal @version."
msgid_plural ""
"%archive_file contains versions of modules or themes that are not "
"compatible with Drupal @version: %names"
msgstr[0] ""
"%archive_file ngemot versi saka %names sing ora cocog karo Drupal "
"@version.  \n"
"%archive_file ngemot versi modul utawa tema sing ora "
"cocog karo Drupal @version: %names"

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\":available_updates\">available updates</a> page for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Delengen kaca <a href=\":available_updates\">pembaruan sing "
"kasedhiya</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "Check for updates of uninstalled modules and themes"
msgstr "Priksa pembaruan modul lan tema sing durung diinstal"

msgid "Deprecated: User Name"
msgstr "Deprecated: Jeneng Panganggo"

msgid "The display name of the user account."
msgstr "Jeneng tampilan saka akun pangguna."

msgid ""
"The User module allows users to register, log in, and log out. It also "
"allows users with proper permissions to manage user roles and "
"permissions. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":user_docs\">online documentation for the User module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Panganggo ngidini panganggo kanggo ndhaptar, mlebu, lan metu. "
"Modul iki uga ngidini panganggo sing nduwéni ijin sing pas kanggo "
"ngatur peran lan ijin panganggo. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":user_docs\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Panganggo</a>."

msgid ""
"Through the <a href=\":people\">People administration page</a> you can "
"add and cancel user accounts and assign users to roles. By editing one "
"particular user you can change their username, email address, "
"password, and information in other fields."
msgstr ""
"Lumantar <a href=\":people\">Kaca administrasi Wong</a> sampeyan bisa "
"nambah lan mbatalake akun pangguna uga ngetokake pangguna menyang "
"peran. Kanthi nyunting siji pangguna tartamtu sampeyan bisa ngganti "
"jeneng pangguna, alamat email, sandhi, lan informasi ing kolom liyane."

msgid ""
"After creating roles, you can set permissions for each role on the <a "
"href=\":permissions_user\">Permissions page</a>. Granting a permission "
"allows users who have been assigned a particular role to perform an "
"action on the site, such as viewing content, editing or creating  a "
"particular type of content, administering settings for a particular "
"module, or using a particular function of the site (such as search)."
msgstr ""
"Sawise nggawe peran, sampeyan bisa nyetel ijin kanggo saben peran ing "
"<a href=\":permissions_user\">Kaca Ijin</a>. Menehi ijin ngidini "
"pangguna sing wis diwenehi peran tartamtu kanggo nindakake tumindak "
"ing situs, kaya ndeleng isi, nyunting utawa nggawe jinis isi tartamtu, "
"ngatur setelan kanggo modul tartamtu, utawa nggunakake fungsi tartamtu "
"saka situs (kaya panelusuran)."

msgid ""
"Because User accounts are an entity type, you can extend them by "
"adding fields through the Manage fields tab on the <a "
"href=\":accounts\">Account settings page</a>. By adding fields for "
"e.g., a picture, a biography, or address, you can a create a custom "
"profile for the users of the website. For background information on "
"entities and fields, see the <a href=\":field_help\">Field module help "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Amarga akun Pangguna iku jinis entitas, sampeyan bisa ngembangake "
"kanthi nambahake kolom liwat tab Manage fields ing <a "
"href=\":accounts\"> kaca Setelan Akun</a>. Kanthi nambahake kolom "
"kayata gambar, biografi, utawa alamat, sampeyan bisa nggawe profil "
"kustom kanggo para pangguna situs web. Kanggo informasi latar mburi "
"babagan entitas lan kolom, delengen <a href=\":field_help\"> kaca "
"bantuan modul Field</a>."

msgid ""
"A role defines a group of users that have certain privileges. These "
"privileges are defined on the <a href=\":permissions\">Permissions "
"page</a>. Here, you can define the names and the display sort order of "
"the roles on your site. It is recommended to order roles from least "
"permissive (for example, Anonymous user) to most permissive (for "
"example, Administrator user). Users who are not logged in have the "
"Anonymous user role. Users who are logged in have the Authenticated "
"user role, plus any other roles granted to their user account."
msgstr ""
"Peran nemtokake klompok pangguna sing nduweni hak istimewa tartamtu. "
"Hak istimewa iki ditemtokake ing <a href=\":permissions\">Kaca Hak "
"Istimewa</a>. Ing kene, sampeyan bisa nemtokake jeneng lan urutan "
"tampilan peran ing situs sampeyan. Disaranake supaya peran diurutake "
"saka sing paling ora duwe hak istimewa (umpamane, Pangguna Anonim) "
"nganti sing paling nduweni hak istimewa (umpamane, Pangguna "
"Administrator). Pangguna sing durung mlebu nduweni peran Pangguna "
"Anonim. Pangguna sing wis mlebu nduweni peran Pangguna Otentikasi, lan "
"uga peran liyane sing diwenehake kanggo akun pangguna kasebut."

msgid "Make it at least 12 characters"
msgstr "Gawe paling ora 12 karakter"

msgid ""
"Configure site-wide settings and behavior for user accounts and "
"registration. This includes account cancellation methods, the content "
"of user emails and fields attached to users."
msgstr ""
"Ngonfigurasi setelan lan prilaku situs sacara umum kanggo akun "
"pangguna lan registrasi. Iki kalebu cara mbatalake akun, isi email "
"pangguna, lan kolom sing gegandhengan karo pangguna."

msgid ""
"Manage all user accounts. This includes editing all user information, "
"changes of email addresses and passwords, issuing emails to users and "
"blocking and deleting user accounts."
msgstr ""
"Ngatur kabeh akun pangguna. Iki kalebu ngowahi kabeh informasi "
"pangguna, ngganti alamat email lan sandhi, ngirim email marang "
"pangguna, sarta mblokir lan mbusak akun pangguna."

msgid ""
"Users with the %select-cancel-method or %administer-users <a "
"href=\":permissions-url\">permissions</a> can override this default "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni %select-cancel-method utawa %administer-users "
"<a href=\":permissions-url\">idzin</a> bisa ngowahi cara bawaan iki."

msgid ""
"Available variables are: [site:name], [site:url], [user:display-name], "
"[user:account-name], [user:mail], [site:login-url], [site:url-brief], "
"[user:edit-url], [user:one-time-login-url], [user:cancel-url]."
msgstr ""
"Variabel sing kasedhiya yaiku: [site:name], [site:url], "
"[user:display-name], [user:account-name], [user:mail], "
"[site:login-url], [site:url-brief], [user:edit-url], "
"[user:one-time-login-url], [user:cancel-url]."

msgid ""
"Created a new user account for <a href=\":url\">%name</a>. No email "
"has been sent."
msgstr ""
"Nggawe akun pangguna anyar kanggo <a href=\":url\">%name</a>. Ora ana "
"email sing dikirim."

msgid ""
"The new user <a href=\":url\">%name</a> was created without an email "
"address, so no welcome message was sent."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna anyar <a href=\":url\">%name</a> digawe tanpa alamat email, "
"mula ora ana pesen sambutan sing dikirim."

msgid ""
"A welcome message with further instructions has been emailed to the "
"new user <a href=\":url\">%name</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pesen sambutan karo pandhuan luwih lanjut wis dikirim liwat email "
"menyang pangguna anyar <a href=\":url\">%name</a>."

msgid ""
"Password reset instructions will be sent to your registered email "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Pandhuan mbalèkaké sandhi bakal dikirim menyang alamat email sing "
"wis kadhaptar."

msgid "Send password reset instructions via email."
msgstr "Kirim pandhuan reset sandhi liwat email."

msgid "Also known as:"
msgstr "Uga dikenal minangka:"

