"For more information, see the <a href=\":views\">online documentation "
"for the Views module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":views\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Views</a>."

msgid ""
"Contributed projects that support the Views module can be found in the "
"<a href=\":node\">online documentation for Views-related contributed "
"modules</a>."
msgstr ""
"Proyèk kontribusi sing ndhukung modul Views bisa ditemokaké ing <a "
"href=\":node\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul kontribusi sing "
"gegandhèngan karo Views</a>."

msgid ""
"Changing the title here means it cannot be dynamically altered "
"anymore. (Try changing it directly in <a href=\":url\">@name</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"Ngganti judhul ing kene tegesé ora bisa diowahi sacara dinamis maneh. "
"(Coba ganti langsung ing <a href=\":url\">@name</a>.)"

msgid ""
"This link is provided by the Views module. The path can be changed by "
"editing the view <a href=\":url\">@label</a>"
msgstr ""
"Tautan iki disedhiyakake dening modul Views. Jalur bisa diganti kanthi "
"nyunting tampilan <a href=\":url\">@label</a>"

msgid "@type language selected for page"
msgstr "@type basa sing dipilih kanggo kaca"

msgid "@code (@title)"
msgstr "@code (@title)"

msgid ""
"The following tokens are available. You may use Twig syntax in this "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Token ing ngisor iki kasedhiya. Sampeyan bisa nggunakake sintaks Twig "
"ing lapangan iki."

msgid ""
"Override the view and other argument titles. You may use Twig syntax "
"in this field as well as the \"arguments\" and \"raw_arguments\" "
"arrays."
msgstr ""
"Ngganti tampilan lan judhul argument liyane. Sampeyan uga bisa "
"nggunakake sintaksis Twig ing kolom iki uga ing array \"arguments\" "
"lan \"raw_arguments\"."

msgid ""
"Override the view and other argument titles. You may use Twig syntax "
"in this field."
msgstr ""
"Ngalih judhul view lan argument liyane. Sampeyan bisa nggunakake "
"sintaks Twig ing kolom iki."

msgid "The following replacement tokens are available for this argument."
msgstr "Token panggantos ing ngisor iki kasedhiya kanggo argumen iki."

msgid ""
"The category this block will appear under on the <a "
"href=\":href\">blocks placement page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kategori sing bakal ditampilake blok iki ana ing <a href=\":href\"> "
"kaca panggonan blok</a>."

msgid "Separate multiple classes by spaces."
msgstr "Pisahaké pirang-pirang kelas nganggo spasi."

msgid ""
"You may also adjust the @settings for the currently selected access "
"restriction."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel @settings kanggo watesan akses sing saiki "
"dipilih."

msgid ""
"You may also adjust the @settings for the currently selected cache "
"mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel @settings kanggo mekanisme cache sing lagi "
"dipilih."

msgid "You may also adjust the @settings for the currently selected style."
msgstr "Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel @settings kanggo gaya sing saiki dipilih."

msgid ""
"You may also adjust the @settings for the currently selected row "
"style."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel @settings kanggo gaya baris sing saiki "
"dipilih."

msgid ""
"The following tokens are available for this link. You may use Twig "
"syntax in this field."
msgstr ""
"Token ing ngisor iki kasedhiya kanggo pranala iki. Sampeyan bisa "
"nggunakake sintaks Twig ing kolom iki."

msgid "You may also adjust the @settings for the currently selected pager."
msgstr "Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel @settings kanggo pager sing saiki dipilih."

msgid "An offset from the current time such as \"@example1\" or \"@example2\""
msgstr "Offset saka wektu saiki kaya \"@example1\" utawa \"@example2\""

msgid ""
"The Views UI module provides an interface for managing views for the "
"<a href=\":views\">Views module</a>. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":handbook\">online documentation for the Views UI module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Views UI nyedhiyakake antarmuka kanggo ngatur views kanggo <a "
"href=\":views\">modul Views</a>. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":handbook\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Views "
"UI</a>."

msgid ""
"Views can be enabled or disabled from the <a href=\":list\">Views list "
"page</a>. To enable a view, find the view within the \"Disabled\" list "
"and select the \"Enable\" operation. To disable a view find the view "
"within the \"Enabled\" list and select the \"Disable\" operation."
msgstr ""
"Views bisa diaktifake utawa dinonaktifake saka <a href=\":list\">kaca "
"dhaptar Views</a>. Kanggo ngaktifake view, goleki view ing dhaftar "
"\"Dinonaktifake\" banjur pilih operasi \"Aktifake\". Kanggo mateni "
"view, goleki view ing dhaftar \"Aktif\" banjur pilih operasi "
"\"Mateni\"."

msgid ""
"Views can be exported and imported as configuration files by using the "
"<a href=\":config\">Configuration Manager module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Views bisa diekspor lan diimpor minangka file konfigurasi kanthi "
"nggunakake <a href=\":config\">modul Manajer Konfigurasi</a>."

msgid "Advanced Views settings"
msgstr "Setelan Views Majeng"

msgid "View @display_title"
msgstr "Delengen @display_title"

msgid "Duplicate as @type"
msgstr "Duplikat minangka @type"

msgid "Add @display"
msgstr "Tambahna @display"

msgid "By breaking this lock, any unsaved changes made by @user will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Kanthi ngrusak kunci iki, sembarang owah-owahan sing durung disimpen "
"dening @user bakal ilang."

msgid "Account cancellation request for [user:display-name] at [site:name]"
msgstr "Panjaluk pembatalan akun kanggo [user:display-name] ing [site:name]"

msgid "Replacement login information for [user:display-name] at [site:name]"
msgstr "Informasi mlebu gantian kanggo [user:display-name] ing [site:name]"

msgid "Account details for [user:display-name] at [site:name]"
msgstr "Rincian akun kanggo [user:display-name] ing [site:name]"

msgid ""
"Account details for [user:display-name] at [site:name] (pending admin "
"approval)"
msgstr ""
"Rincian akun kanggo [user:display-name] ing [site:name] (ngenteni "
"persetujuan admin)"

msgid ""
"[user:display-name] has applied for an account.\n"
"\n"
"[user:edit-url]"
msgstr ""
"[user:display-name] wis ndhaptar kanggo akun.\n"
"\n"
"[user:edit-url]"

