msgid "Account details for [user:display-name] at [site:name] (approved)"
msgstr "Rincian akun kanggo [user:display-name] ing [site:name] (disetujoni)"

msgid "Account details for [user:display-name] at [site:name] (blocked)"
msgstr "Rincian akun kanggo [user:display-name] ing [site:name] (diblokir)"

msgid ""
"[user:display-name],\n"
"\n"
"Your account on [site:name] has been "
"canceled.\n"
"\n"
"--  [site:name] team"
msgstr ""
"[user:display-name],\n"
"\n"
"Akun sampeyan ing [site:name] wis "
"dibatalake.\n"
"\n"
"--  Tim [site:name]"

msgid "Account details for [user:display-name] at [site:name] (canceled)"
msgstr "Rincian akun kanggo [user:display-name] ing [site:name] (dibatalake)"

msgid "Hide logo"
msgstr "Sembunyèkaké logo"

msgid ""
"@display '@id': Component '@name' was disabled because its settings "
"depend on removed dependencies."
msgstr ""
"@display '@id': Komponèn '@name' dipatèni amarga setelané gumantung "
"marang afhensi sing wis dilebokaké."

msgid "No widget available for: %type."
msgstr "Ora ana widget sing kasedhiya kanggo: %type."

msgid ""
"Several special characters are allowed, including space, period (.), "
"hyphen (-), apostrophe ('), underscore (_), and the @ sign."
msgstr ""
"Sawetara karakter khusus diijini, kalebu spasi, titik (.), tanda "
"hubung (-), apostrof ('), garis ngisor (_), lan tanda @."

msgid ""
"The URL to which the user should be redirected. This can be an "
"internal URL like /node/1234 or an external URL like @url."
msgstr ""
"URL sing dadi panggonan pangguna kudu dialihake. Iki bisa dadi URL "
"internal kaya /node/1234 utawa URL eksternal kaya @url."

msgid ""
"The Automated Cron module runs cron operations for your site using "
"normal browser/page requests instead of having to set up a separate "
"cron job. The Automated Cron module checks at the end of each server "
"response when cron operation was last ran and, if it has been too long "
"since last run, it executes the cron tasks after sending a server "
"response. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":automated_cron-documentation\">online documentation for the "
"Automated Cron module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Automated Cron mlakuake operasi cron kanggo situs sampeyan "
"kanthi nggunakake panjalukan browser/ kaca biasa tinimbang kudu nyetel "
"kerja cron sing kapisah. Modul Automated Cron mriksa ing pungkasan "
"saben wangsulan server nalika operasi cron pungkasan mlaku, lan yen "
"wis kelakon suwe banget saka wektu mlaku pungkasan, modul iki bakal "
"mbukak tugas cron sawisé ngirim wangsulan server. Kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":automated_cron-documentation\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Automated Cron</a>."

msgid "Configuring Automated Cron"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi Cron Otomatis"

msgid ""
"On the <a href=\":cron-settings\">Cron page</a>, you can set the "
"frequency (time interval) for running cron jobs."
msgstr ""
"Ing <a href=\":cron-settings\">Kaca Cron</a>, sampeyan bisa nyetel "
"frekuensi (interval wektu) kanggo mbukak tugas cron."

msgid "Disabling Automated Cron"
msgstr "Matiake Cron Otomatis"

msgid ""
"To disable automated cron, the recommended method is to uninstall the "
"module, to reduce site overhead. If you only want to disable it "
"temporarily, you can set the frequency to Never on the Cron page, and "
"then change the frequency back when you want to start it up again."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mateni cron otomatis, cara sing dianjurake yaiku kanthi "
"uninstall modul, supaya kinerja situs luwih entheng. Yen sampeyan mung "
"pengin mateni sementara, sampeyan bisa nyetel frekuensi dadi Never ing "
"kaca Cron, banjur ganti maneh frekuensi kasebut nalika sampeyan pengin "
"miwiti maneh."

msgid "Automated Cron"
msgstr "Cron Otomatis"

msgid ""
"Provides an automated way to run cron jobs, by executing them at the "
"end of a server response."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake cara otomatis kanggo mbukak cron jobs, kanthi nindakake "
"ing pungkasan tanggapan server."

msgid "Automated cron settings"
msgstr "Setelan cron otomatis"

msgid "Ban visits from specific IP addresses."
msgstr "Mblokir kunjungan saka alamat IP tartamtu."

msgid ""
"You can place a new block in a region by selecting <em>Place "
"block</em> on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>. Once a "
"block is placed, it can be moved to a different region by "
"drag-and-drop or by using the <em>Region</em> drop-down list, and then "
"clicking <em>Save blocks</em>."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nyelehake blok anyar ing sawijining wilayah kanthi milih "
"<em>Place block</em> ing <a href=\":blocks\">Kaca Tata Letak Blok</a>. "
"Sawise blok diselehake, blok kasebut bisa dipindhah menyang wilayah "
"liyane kanthi cara seret lan selehake utawa nggunakake dhaptar gulung "
"mudhun <em>Region</em>, banjur klik <em>Save blocks</em>."

msgid ""
"Block placement is specific to each theme on your site. Changes will "
"not be saved until you click <em>Save blocks</em> at the bottom of the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Panggonan blok iki khusus kanggo saben tema ing situs sampeyan. "
"Owah-owahan ora bakal disimpen nganti sampeyan ngeklik <em>Save "
"blocks</em> ing ngisor kaca."

msgid "Adding comment types"
msgstr "Nambah jinis komentar"

msgid ""
"Additional <em>comment types</em> can be created per entity sub-type "
"and added on the <a href=\":field\">Comment types page</a>. If there "
"are multiple comment types available you can select the appropriate "
"one after adding a <em>Comments field</em>."
msgstr ""
"Jenis <em>komentar</em> tambahan bisa digawe kanggo saben sub-jenis "
"entitas lan ditambahake ing <a href=\":field\">kaca Jenis "
"Komentar</a>. Yen ana pirang-pirang jinis komentar sing kasedhiya, "
"sampeyan bisa milih sing cocog sawise nambah <em>lapangan "
"Komentar</em>."

msgid ""
"Compare the configuration uploaded to your sync directory with the "
"active configuration before completing the import."
msgstr ""
"Bandhingna konfigurasi sing diunggah menyang direktori sinkronisasi "
"sampeyan karo konfigurasi aktif sadurunge ngrampungake impor."

msgid ""
"Upload a full site configuration archive to the sync directory. It can "
"then be compared and imported on the Synchronize page."
msgstr ""
"Unggah arsip konfigurasi situs lengkap menyang direktori sinkronisasi. "
"Biso dibandhingake lan diimpor ing kaca Sinkronisasi."

msgid ""
"The Database Logging module logs system events in the Drupal database. "
"Monitor your site or debug site problems on this page."
msgstr ""
"Modul Database Logging nyatet acara sistem ing database Drupal. Pantau "
"situs sampeyan utawa debug masalah situs ing kaca iki."

msgid ""
"The Internal Dynamic Page Cache module caches pages for all users in "
"the database, handling dynamic content correctly. For more "
"information, see the <a "
"href=\":dynamic_page_cache-documentation\">online documentation for "
"the Internal Dynamic Page Cache module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Internal Dynamic Page Cache nyimpen kaca kanggo sakabehe "
"pangguna ing basis data, nangani isi dinamis kanthi bener. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap, waca <a "
"href=\":dynamic_page_cache-documentation\">dokumentasi online modul "
"Internal Dynamic Page Cache</a>."

msgid ""
"The module requires no configuration. Every part of the page contains "
"metadata that allows Internal Dynamic Page Cache to figure this out on "
"its own."
msgstr ""
"Modul iki ora mbutuhake konfigurasi. Saben bagean saka kaca ngemot "
"metadata sing ngidini Internal Dynamic Page Cache kanggo mangerteni "
"iki kanthi otomatis."

msgid ""
"<strong>Entity Reference</strong> fields allow you to create fields "
"that contain links to other entities (such as content items, taxonomy "
"terms, etc.) within the site. This allows you, for example, to include "
"a link to a user within a content item. For more information, see <a "
"href=\":er_do\">the online documentation for the Entity Reference "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Lapangan Referensi Entitas</strong> ngidini sampeyan nggawe "
"lapangan sing ngemot pranala menyang entitas liyane (kayata item "
"konten, istilah taksonomi, lsp.) ing sajroning situs. Iki ngidini "
"sampeyan, contone, kanggo nambah pranala menyang pangguna sajroning "
"item konten. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":er_do\">dokumentasi online modul Referensi Entitas</a>."

msgid "Enable custom storage"
msgstr "Aktifake panyimpenan khusus"

msgid "An instance-specific widget type"
msgstr "Jinis widget sing khusus kanggo sawijining instansi"

msgid ""
"Widget types @types are used in Drupal 6 field instances: widget type "
"@selected_type applied to the Drupal 8 base field"
msgstr ""
"Jinis widget @types digunakake ing instansi lapangan Drupal 6: jinis "
"widget @selected_type diterapake ing lapangan dasar Drupal 8"

msgid ""
"You can define which users will be able to use each text format by "
"selecting roles. To ensure security, anonymous and untrusted users "
"should only have access to text formats that restrict them to either "
"plain text or a safe set of HTML tags. This is because HTML tags can "
"allow embedding malicious links or scripts in text. More trusted "
"registered users may be granted permission to use less restrictive "
"text formats in order to create rich text. <strong>Improper text "
"format configuration is a security risk.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nemtokake pangguna sing bisa nggunakake saben format "
"teks kanthi milih peran. Kanggo njamin keamanan, pangguna anonim lan "
"sing ora dipercaya kudu diwenehi akses mung menyang format teks sing "
"matesi mung teks polos utawa set tag HTML sing aman. Iki amarga tag "
"HTML bisa ngidini nyelipake pranala utawa skrip mbebayani ing teks. "
"Pangguna terdaftar sing luwih dipercaya bisa diwenehi izin kanggo "
"nggunakake format teks sing luwih longgar supaya bisa nggawe teks sing "
"luwih sugih. <strong>Konfigurasi format teks sing ora bener iku risiko "
"keamanan.</strong>"

msgid ""
"Each text format uses filters that add, remove, or transform elements "
"within user-entered text. For example, one filter removes unapproved "
"HTML tags, while another transforms URLs into clickable links. Filters "
"are applied in a specific order. They do not change the "
"<em>stored</em> content: they define how it is processed and "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"Saben format teks nggunakake filter sing nambah, mbusak, utawa ngrubah "
"unsur-unsur ing teks sing dienggo pangguna. Contone, siji filter "
"mbusak tag HTML sing ora disetujoni, nalika filter liyane ngrubah URL "
"dadi pranala sing bisa diklik. Filter-filter kasebut ditrapake miturut "
"urutan tartamtu. Filter iki ora ngganti <em>isi sing disimpen</em>: "
"nanging nemtokake cara isi kasebut diproses lan ditampilake."

msgid ""
"Text formats define how text is filtered for output and how HTML tags "
"and other text is displayed, replaced, or removed. <strong>Improper "
"text format configuration is a security risk.</strong> Learn more on "
"the <a href=\":filter_help\">Filter module help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Format teks nemtokake carane teks disaring kanggo output lan carane "
"tag HTML lan teks liyane ditampilake, diganti, utawa dibusak. "
"<strong>Konfigurasi format teks sing ora bener iku risiko "
"keamanan.</strong> Sinau luwih lengkap ing <a "
"href=\":filter_help\">kaca bantuan modul Filter</a>."

msgid ""
"A text format contains filters that change the display of user input; "
"for example, stripping out malicious HTML or making URLs clickable. "
"Filters are executed from top to bottom and the order is important, "
"since one filter may prevent another filter from doing its job. For "
"example, when URLs are converted into links before disallowed HTML "
"tags are removed, all links may be removed. When this happens, the "
"order of filters may need to be rearranged."
msgstr ""
"Format teks ngemot filter sing ngowahi tampilan input pangguna; "
"contone, nyopot HTML sing mbebayani utawa nggawe URL bisa diklik. "
"Filter dieksekusi saka ndhuwur menyang ngisor lan urutane penting, "
"amarga siji filter bisa nyegah filter liyane supaya ora bisa kerja. "
"Contone, nalika URL diowahi dadi pranala dhisik sadurunge tag HTML "
"sing ora diijini dibusak, kabeh pranala bisa dibusak. Nalika iki "
"kedadeyan, urutane filter bisa uga perlu diatur maneh."

msgid ""
"Configure how content is filtered when displayed, including which HTML "
"tags are rendered, and enable module-provided filters."
msgstr ""
"Ngatur carane isi disaring nalika ditampilake, kalebu tag HTML sing "
"dirender, lan ngaktifake saringan sing disedhiyakake modul."

msgid ""
"A list of HTML tags that can be used. By default only the "
"<em>lang</em> and <em>dir</em> attributes are allowed for all HTML "
"tags. Each HTML tag may have attributes which are treated as allowed "
"attribute names for that HTML tag. Each attribute may allow all "
"values, or only allow specific values. Attribute names or values may "
"be written as a prefix and wildcard like <em>jump-*</em>. JavaScript "
"event attributes, JavaScript URLs, and CSS are always stripped."
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar tag HTML sing bisa digunakake. Secara default mung atribut "
"<em>lang</em> lan <em>dir</em> sing diijini kanggo kabeh tag HTML. "
"Saben tag HTML bisa nduweni atribut sing dianggep minangka jeneng "
"atribut sing diijini kanggo tag HTML kuwi. Saben atribut bisa ngidini "
"kabeh nilai, utawa mung ngidini nilai tartamtu waé. Jeneng utawa "
"nilai atribut bisa ditulis nganggo prefiks lan wildcard kaya "
"<em>jump-*</em>. Atribut acara JavaScript, URL JavaScript, lan CSS "
"bakal tansah dibusak."

msgid "Configure languages for content, interface, and configuration."
msgstr "Konfigurasikna basa kanggo isi, antarmuka, lan konfigurasi."

msgid "Overriding default English strings"
msgstr "Ngalihake string basa Inggris bawaan"

msgid ""
"If translation is enabled for English, you can <em>override</em> the "
"default English interface text strings in your site with other English "
"text strings on the <a href=\":translate\">User interface "
"translation</a> page. Translation is off by default for English, but "
"you can turn it on by visiting the <em>Edit language</em> page for "
"<em>English</em> from the <a href=\":languages\">Languages</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Yen terjemahan diaktifake kanggo basa Inggris, sampeyan bisa "
"<em>ngganteni</em> string teks antarmuka basa Inggris standar ing "
"situs sampeyan nganggo string teks basa Inggris liyane ing kaca <a "
"href=\":translate\">Terjemahan antarmuka pengguna</a>. Terjemahan iku "
"mati sacara standar kanggo basa Inggris, nanging sampeyan bisa "
"nguripake kanthi ngunjungi kaca <em>Sunting basa</em> kanggo <em>Basa "
"Inggris</em> saka kaca <a href=\":languages\">Basa-basa</a>."

msgid ""
"Configure the import of translation files, and add or customize "
"interface translations."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikna impor file terjemahan, lan tambahana utawa sesuaikna "
"terjemahan antarmuka."

msgid "Manage menus and menu links."
msgstr "Ngatur menu lan pranala menu."

msgid "<q>Log in</q> for anonymous users"
msgstr "<q>Login</q> kanggo pangguna anonim"

msgid "Revert to earlier revision of a translation"
msgstr "Mbalik menyang revisi sadurunge saka terjemahan"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to revert @language translation to the revision "
"from %revision-date?"
msgstr ""
"Apa sampeyan yakin arep mbalekake terjemahan @language menyang revisi "
"saka %revision-date?"

msgid "Revert content shared among translations"
msgstr "Batalna isi sing dienggo bareng antarane terjemahan"

msgid "Add custom URLs to existing paths."
msgstr "Tambahaké URL kustom ing jalur sing wis ana."

msgid "- None (original image) -"
msgstr "- Ora Ana (gambar asli) -"

msgid ""
"Only items in the index will appear in search results. To build and "
"maintain the index, a correctly configured <a href=\":cron\">cron "
"maintenance task</a> is required."
msgstr ""
"Mung barang sing ana ing indeks sing bakal muncul ing asil "
"panelusuran. Kanggo mbangun lan njaga indeks, dibutuhake <a "
"href=\":cron\">tugas pangopènan cron</a> sing wis dikonfigurasi "
"kanthi bener."

msgid ""
"The minimum character length for a word to be added to the index. "
"Searches must include a keyword of at least this length."
msgstr ""
"Dawa huruf minimal kanggo tembung supaya bisa ditambahake menyang "
"indeks. Panelusuran kudu kalebu tembung kunci sing paling ora dawa "
"tekan iki."

msgid "Checking site status"
msgstr "Mriksa status situs"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":status\">Status report</a> provides an overview of the "
"configuration, status, and health of your site. Review this report to "
"make sure there are not any problems to address, and to find "
"information about the software your site and web server are using."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":status\">Laporan Status</a> nyedhiyakake ringkesan babagan "
"konfigurasi, status, lan kahanan situs sampeyan. Priksa laporan iki "
"kanggo mesthekake ora ana masalah sing kudu dirampungake, lan kanggo "
"nemokake informasi babagan piranti lunak sing digunakake situs lan "
"server web sampeyan."

msgid ""
"In order for the site and its modules to continue to operate well, a "
"set of routine administrative operations must run on a regular basis; "
"these operations are known as <em>cron</em> tasks. On the <a "
"href=\":cron\">Cron page</a>, you can configure cron to run "
"periodically as part of server responses by installing the "
"<em>Automated Cron</em> module, or you can turn this off and trigger "
"cron from an outside process on your web server. You can verify the "
"status of cron tasks by visiting the <a href=\":status\">Status report "
