msgstr ""
"Karakteristik lapangan iki disetel dadi @cardinality lan ora bisa "
"dikonfigurasi."

msgid "Controls if unused files should be marked temporary"
msgstr "Ngatur apa file sing ora digunakake kudu ditandhani minangka sementara"

msgid ""
"Could not apply @style image style to @uri because the style does not "
"support it."
msgstr ""
"Ora bisa nerapake gaya gambar @style menyang @uri amarga gaya kasebut "
"ora ndhukung."

msgid ""
"The Inline Form Errors module makes it easier for users to identify "
"which errors need to be resolved by providing a summary of all errors "
"and by placing the individual error messages next to the form elements "
"themselves. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":inline_form_error\">online documentation for the Inline Form "
"Errors module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Inline Form Errors nggawe luwih gampang kanggo pangguna ngenali "
"kesalahan sing kudu dirampungake kanthi nyedhiyakake ringkesan kabeh "
"kesalahan lan kanthi nyelehake pesen kesalahan individu ing jejere "
"unsur formulir kasebut. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":inline_form_error\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Inline "
"Form Errors</a>."

msgid "Displaying error messages"
msgstr "Nampilake pesen kesalahan"

msgid ""
"When a form is not filled in correctly (for example, if a required "
"field is left blank), a warning message is displayed at the top of the "
"form. This message links to the affected form elements, and individual "
"error messages are displayed next to each form element."
msgstr ""
"Nalika formulir ora diisi kanthi bener (contone, yen kolom sing wajib "
"diisi ditinggal kosong), pesen peringatan bakal ditampilake ing pucuk "
"formulir. Pesen iki nyambung menyang unsur formulir sing kena "
"pengaruh, lan pesen kesalahan saben-saben ditampilake ing jejere saben "
"unsur formulir."

msgid "Displaying error messages in browsers with HTML5 form validation"
msgstr "Nampilkan pesen kesalahan ing browser nganggo validasi formulir HTML5"

msgid ""
"In browsers that support HTML5 form validation, users will first see "
"the error messages generated by their browser. In this case, the "
"inline form error messages are only displayed after the HTML5 "
"validation errors have been resolved."
msgstr ""
"Ing panyungging sing ndhukung validasi formulir HTML5, pangguna bakal "
"luwih dhisik weruh pesen kesalahan sing digawe dening panyungging. Ing "
"kahanan iki, pesen kesalahan formulir ing jero baris mung ditampilake "
"sawisé kesalahan validasi HTML5 wis dirampungake."

msgid ""
"Places error messages adjacent to form inputs, for improved usability "
"and accessibility."
msgstr ""
"Nempatake pesen kesalahan jejere input formulir, kanggo nambah kagunan "
"lan aksèsibilitas."

msgid "Language format settings"
msgstr "Setelan format basa"

msgid "Include locked languages"
msgstr "Kalebu basa sing dikunci"

msgid "Creating media items"
msgstr "Gawe barang media"

msgid ""
"When a new media item is created, the Media module records basic "
"information about it, including the author, date of creation, and the "
"<a href=\":media-type\">media type</a>. It also manages the "
"<em>publishing options</em>, which define whether or not the item is "
"published. Default settings can be configured for each type of media "
"on your site."
msgstr ""
"Nalika barang media anyar digawe, modul Media nyatet informasi dhasar "
"babagan iku, kalebu pangripta, tanggal pembuatan, lan <a "
"href=\":media-type\">tipe media</a>. Modul iki uga ngatur <em>pilihan "
"nerbitake</em>, sing nemtokake apa barang kasebut diterbitake utawa "
"ora. Setelan standar bisa dikonfigurasi kanggo saben tipe media ing "
"situs sampeyan."

msgid "Creating custom media types"
msgstr "Gawe jinis media khusus"

msgid ""
"The Media module gives users with the <em>Administer media types</em> "
"permission the ability to <a href=\":media-new\">create new media "
"types</a> in addition to the default ones already configured. Each "
"media type has an associated media source (such as the image source) "
"which support thumbnail generation and metadata extraction. Fields "
"managed by the <a href=\":field\">Field module</a> may be added for "
"storing that metadata, such as width and height, as well as any other "
"associated values."
msgstr ""
"Modul Media menehi pangguna sing nduweni ijin <em>Administer media "
"types</em> kemampuan kanggo <a href=\":media-new\">nggawe jinis media "
"anyar</a> saliyané jinis-jinis standar sing wis disetel. Saben jinis "
"media nduwèni sumber media sing gegandhengan (kaya sumber gambar) "
"sing ndhukung pambentukan thumbnail lan ekstraksi metadata. "
"Kolom-kolom sing dikelola déning <a href=\":field\">modul Field</a> "
"bisa ditambahaké kanggo nyimpen metadata kasebut, kaya jembar lan "
"dhuwur, uga nilai-nilai liyane sing gegandhengan."

msgid ""
"The Media module also enables you to create multiple versions of any "
"media item, and revert to older versions using the <em>Revision "
"information</em> settings."
msgstr ""
"Modul Media uga ngidini sampeyan nggawe versi kaping pirang-pirang "
"saka sembarang item media, lan bali menyang versi lawas nggunakake "
"setelan <em>Revision information</em>."

msgid ""
"The Media module makes a number of permissions available, which can be "
"set by role on the <a href=\":permissions\">permissions page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Media nggawe sawetara hak akses sing kasedhiya, sing bisa "
"disetel miturut peran ing <a href=\":permissions\"> kaca hak "
"akses</a>."

msgid "Manage media types."
msgstr "Ngatur jinis media."

msgid "Administer media types"
msgstr "Nglola jinis media"

msgid "Update own media"
msgstr "Nganyari media dhewe"

msgid "Delete own media"
msgstr "Mbusak media dhewe"

msgid "View all media revisions"
msgstr "Delengen kabeh revisi media"

msgid "To view a revision, you also need permission to view the media item."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ndeleng revisi, sampeyan uga butuh idin kanggo ndeleng item "
"media."

msgid "Full URI to a folder where the media icons will be installed"
msgstr "URI lengkap menyang folder ngendi ikon media bakal dipasang"

msgid "Whether the thumbnail downloads should be queued"
msgstr "Apa undhuhan thumbnail kudu antri"

msgid "Media source settings"
msgstr "Setelan sumber media"

msgid "\"File\" media source configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi sumber media \"File\""

msgid "\"Image\" media source configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi sumber media \"Image\""

msgid "Edit %type_label @label"
msgstr "Sunting %type_label @label"

