msgstr "@type: nambahaké %label."

msgid "@type: updated %label."
msgstr "@type: dianyari %label."

msgid "- Create -"
msgstr "- Gawé -"

msgid ""
"Select the field that will store essential information about the media "
"item. If \"Create\" is selected a new field will be automatically "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Pilih kolom sing bakal nyimpen informasi penting babagan item media. "
"Yen \"Create\" dipilih, kolom anyar bakal digawe kanthi otomatis."

msgid ""
"%field_type field will be automatically created on this type to store "
"the essential information about the media item."
msgstr ""
"%field_type lapangan bakal digawe kanthi otomatis ing jinis iki kanggo "
"nyimpen informasi penting babagan barang media kasebut."

msgid ""
"%field_name field is used to store the essential information about the "
"media item."
msgstr ""
"%field_name lapangan digunakake kanggo nyimpen informasi penting "
"babagan item media."

msgid ""
"Media source that is responsible for additional logic related to this "
"media type."
msgstr ""
"Sumber media sing tanggung jawab kanggo logika tambahan sing gegayutan "
"karo jinis media iki."

msgid "Media source configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi sumber media"

msgid ""
"Media sources can provide metadata fields such as title, caption, size "
"information, credits, etc. Media can automatically save this metadata "
"information to entity fields, which can be configured below. "
"Information will only be mapped if the entity field is empty."
msgstr ""
"Sumber media bisa nyedhiyakake lapangan metadata kaya judhul, caption, "
"informasi ukuran, kredit, lan liya-liyane. Media bisa sacara otomatis "
"nyimpen informasi metadata iki menyang lapangan entitas, sing bisa "
"dikonfigurasi ing ngisor iki. Informasi mung bakal dipetakan yen "
"lapangan entitas isih kosong."

msgid "Media will be automatically published when created."
msgstr "Media bakal diterbitaké kanthi otomatis nalika digawe."

msgid ""
"Automatically create new revisions. Users with the \"Administer "
"media\" permission will be able to override this option."
msgstr ""
"Gawe revisi anyar kanthi otomatis. Pangguna sing nduweni ijin \"Ngatur "
"media\" bisa mbatalake pilihan iki."

msgid ""
"Download thumbnails via a queue. When using remote media sources, the "
"thumbnail generation could be a slow process. Using a queue allows for "
"this process to be handled in the background."
msgstr ""
"Download thumbnails liwat antrian. Nalika nggunakake sumber media "
"jarak jauh, proses nggawe thumbnail bisa dadi alon. Nggunakake antrian "
"ngidini proses iki ditangani ing latar mburi."

msgid "The media type %name has been updated."
msgstr "Jinis media %name wis dianyari."

msgid "The media type %name has been added."
msgstr "Jinis media %name wis ditambahake."

msgid "Added media type %name."
msgstr "Nambah jinis media %name."

msgid "No media types available. <a href=\":url\">Add media type</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana jinis media sing kasedhiya. <a href=\":url\">Tambah jinis "
"media</a>."

msgid "The thumbnail of the media item."
msgstr "Gambar cilik saka barang media."

msgid "The time the media item was created."
msgstr "Wektu barang media digawe."

msgid "The time the media item was last edited."
msgstr "Wektu item media pungkasan diowahi."

msgid "media type"
msgstr "jinis media"

msgid "media types"
msgstr "jinis media"

msgid ""
"%type is used by @count media item on your site. You can not remove "
"this media type until you have removed all of the %type media items."
msgid_plural ""
"%type is used by @count media items on your site. You can not remove "
"this media type until you have removed all of the %type media items."
msgstr[0] ""
"%type digunakake déning @count item media ing situs panjenengan. "
"Panjenengan ora bisa mbusak jinis media iki nganti kabeh item media "
"%type wis dibusak.  \n"
"%type digunakake déning @count item media ing "
"situs panjenengan. Panjenengan ora bisa mbusak jinis media iki nganti "
"kabeh item media %type wis dibusak."

