msgstr "Kaiket karo barang media"

msgid "Use local files for reusable media."
msgstr "Gunakake file lokal kanggo media sing bisa digunakake maneh."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Menu settings."
msgstr "Setelan menu."

msgid ""
"You can only change the menu settings for the <em>published</em> "
"version of this content."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan mung bisa ngganti setelan menu kanggo versi <em>sing wis "
"diterbitake</em> saka konten iki."

msgid "To view a revision, you also need permission to view the content item."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ndeleng revisi, sampeyan uga butuh ijin kanggo ndeleng item "
"konten."

msgid ""
"To revert a revision, you also need permission to edit the content "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mbalekaké revisi, sampeyan uga butuh ijin kanggo ngowahi item "
"isi kasebut."

msgid ""
"To delete a revision, you also need permission to delete the content "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mbusak revisi, sampeyan uga butuh ijin kanggo mbusak item "
"konten."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Path alias."
msgstr "Alias path."

msgid ""
"You can only change the URL alias for the <em>published</em> version "
"of this content."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan mung bisa ngowahi alias URL kanggo versi <em>sing wis "
"diterbitake</em> saka isi iki."

msgid ""
"REST support for content types (provided by the <a "
"href=\":node\">Node</a> module) is enabled by default. To enable "
"support for other content entity types, you can use a <a "
"href=\":config\" target=\"blank\">process based on configuration "
"editing</a> or the contributed <a href=\":restui\">REST UI module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Dhukungan REST kanggo jinis konten (sing disedhiyakake dening modul <a "
"href=\":node\">Node</a>) wis diaktifake sacara standar. Kanggo "
"ngaktifake dhukungan kanggo jinis entitas konten liyane, sampeyan bisa "
"nggunakake <a href=\":config\" target=\"blank\">proses adhedhasar "
"suntingan konfigurasi</a> utawa modul <a href=\":restui\">REST UI sing "
"disumbangake</a>."

msgid "Limited date range"
msgstr "Watesan rentang tanggal"

msgid "Your PHP installation has a limited date range."
msgstr "Instalasi PHP panjenengan duwe wates wektu sing winates."

msgid ""
"You are running on a system where PHP is compiled or limited to using "
"32-bit integers. This will limit the range of dates and timestamps to "
"the years 1901-2038. Read about the <a href=\":url\">limitations of "
"32-bit PHP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan lagi mlaku ing sistem sing PHP-e dikompilasi utawa diwatesi "
"nggunakake angka 32-bit. Iki bakal matesi rentang tanggal lan cap "
"wektu nganti taun 1901-2038. Wacan babagan <a href=\":url\">watesan "
"PHP 32-bit</a>."

msgid "A client error happened"
msgstr "Kasalahan klien kedadeyan"

msgid ""
"To run cron from outside the site, go to <a href=\":cron\" "
"class=\"system-cron-settings__link\">@cron</a>"
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mbukak cron saka njaba situs, bukak <a href=\":cron\" "
"class=\"system-cron-settings__link\">@cron</a>"

msgid "Run times of individual cron jobs will be written to watchdog"
msgstr "Wektu eksekusi saka saben job cron bakal ditulis menyang watchdog"

msgid "Delete temporary files after"
msgstr "Mbusak file sementara sawisé"

msgid ""
"Temporary files are not referenced, but are in the file system and "
"therefore may show up in administrative lists. "
"<strong>Warning:</strong> If enabled, temporary files will be "
"permanently deleted and may not be recoverable."
msgstr ""
"Berkas sementara ora dirujuk, nanging ana ing sistem berkas lan mula "
"bisa muncul ing daftar administratif. <strong>Pringatan:</strong> Yen "
"diaktifake, berkas sementara bakal dihapus kanthi permanen lan bisa "
"uga ora bisa dipulihake maneh."

msgid "Add the @label role to the selected user(s)"
msgstr "Tambahaké peran @label menyang pangguna sing dipilih"

msgid "Remove the @label role from the selected user(s)"
msgstr "Copot peran @label saka pangguna sing dipilih"

msgid ""
"This workflow is in use. You cannot remove this workflow until you "
"have removed all content using it."
msgstr ""
"Workflow iki saiki digunakake. Sampeyan ora bisa mbusak workflow iki "
"nganti sampeyan wis mbusak kabeh isi sing nggunakake workflow iki."

msgid "Edit %label workflow"
msgstr "Sunting workflow %label"

msgid ""
"This workflow state is in use. You cannot remove this workflow state "
"until you have removed all content using it."
msgstr ""
"Status alur kerja iki isih digunakake. Sampeyan ora bisa mbusak status "
"alur kerja iki nganti sampeyan mbusak kabeh isi sing nggunakake status "
"iki."

msgid "Find and manage comments."
msgstr "Golek lan ngatur komentar."

