msgid ""
"Make sure that <strong>access to the database</strong> for the old "
"site is available from this new site."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa <strong>akses menyang database</strong> kanggo situs "
"lawas kasedhiya saka situs anyar iki."

msgid ""
"<strong>If the old site has private files</strong>, a copy of its "
"files directory must also be accessible on the host of this new site."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Yen situs lawas nduwé file privat</strong>, salinan direktori "
"file kasebut uga kudu bisa diakses ing host situs anyar iki."

msgid ""
"<strong>Do not add any content to the new site</strong> before "
"upgrading. Any existing content is likely to be overwritten by the "
"upgrade process. See <a href=\":url\">the upgrade preparation "
"guide</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Aja nambah konten apa wae ing situs anyar</strong> sadurunge "
"nganyari. Sembarang konten sing wis ana bisa uga bakal ditindhes "
"dening proses nganyari. Delengen <a href=\":url\">pandhuan persiapan "
"nganyari</a>."

msgid ""
"The upgrade can take a long time. It is better to upgrade from a local "
"copy of your site instead of directly from your live site."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade bisa njupuk wektu sing suwe. Luwih becik kanggo nglakuake "
"upgrade saka salinan lokal situsmu tinimbang langsung saka situs sing "
"lagi aktif."

