msgid ""
"The Media module manages the creation, editing, deletion, settings, "
"and display of media. Items are typically images, documents, "
"slideshows, YouTube videos, tweets, Instagram photos, etc. You can "
"reference media items from any other content on your site. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":media\">online documentation for the "
"Media module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Media ngatur nggawe, nyunting, mbusak, setelan, lan tampilan "
"media. Barang-barang biasane gambar, dokumen, slideshow, video "
"YouTube, tweet, foto Instagram, lan liya-liyane. Sampeyan bisa ngrujuk "
"barang media saka konten liyane ing situs sampeyan. Kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap, waca <a href=\":media\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Media</a>."

msgid "Listing media items"
msgstr "Ndhaptar barang media"

msgid ""
"Media items are listed at the <a href=\":media-collection\">media "
"administration page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Item media kacathet ing <a href=\":media-collection\">kaca "
"administrasi media</a>."

msgid "Adding media to other content"
msgstr "Nambahaké media menyang isi liyané"

msgid ""
"Users with permission to administer content types can add media "
"support by adding a media reference field to the content type on the "
"content type administration page. (The same is true of block types, "
"taxonomy terms, user profiles, and other content that supports "
"fields.) A media reference field can refer to any configured media "
"type. It is possible to allow multiple media types in the same field."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing duwe idin kanggo ngatur jinis isi bisa nambah dhukungan "
"media kanthi nambah lapangan referensi media menyang jinis isi ing "
"kaca administrasi jinis isi. (Kahanan iki uga padha kanggo jinis blok, "
"istilah taksonomi, profil pangguna, lan isi liyane sing ndhukung "
"lapangan.) Lapangan referensi media bisa nuduhaké jinis media apa wae "
"sing wis dikonfigurasi. Bisa uga ngidini pirang-pirang jinis media ing "
"lapangan sing padha."

msgid "Differences between Media, File, and Image reference fields"
msgstr "Bentenipun antawisipun Media, File, lan Image reference fields"

msgid ""
"<em>Media</em> reference fields offer several advantages over basic "
"<em>File</em> and <em>Image</em> references:"
msgstr ""
"<em>Media</em> reference fields nawakake sawetara keuntungan tinimbang "
"referensi <em>File</em> lan <em>Image</em> sing dhasar:"

msgid ""
"Media reference fields can reference multiple media types in the same "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Kolom referensi media bisa nyebutake pirang-pirang jinis media ing "
"kolom sing padha."

msgid ""
"Fields can also be added to media types themselves, which means that "
"custom metadata like descriptions and taxonomy tags can be added for "
"the referenced media. (Basic file and image fields do not support "
"this.)"
msgstr ""
"Kolom uga bisa ditambahake ing jinis media dhewe, sing tegese metadata "
"khusus kaya katrangan lan tag taksonomi bisa ditambahake kanggo media "
"sing dirujuk. (Kolom file lan gambar dasar ora ndhukung iki.)"

msgid ""
"Media types for audio and video files are provided by default, so "
"there is no need for additional configuration to upload these media."
msgstr ""
"Tipe media kanggo file audio lan video wis disedhiyakake kanthi "
"default, dadi ora perlu konfigurasi tambahan kanggo ngunggah media "
"kasebut."

msgid ""
"Contributed or custom projects can provide additional media sources "
"(such as third-party websites, Twitter, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Proyèk kontribusi utawa khusus bisa nyedhiyakake sumber media "
"tambahan (kaya situs web pihak katelu, Twitter, lsp.)."

msgid ""
"Existing media items can be reused on any other content items with a "
"media reference field."
msgstr ""
"Item media sing wis ana bisa digunakake maneh ing item konten liyane "
"sing nduweni kolom referensi media."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\"@help_url\">Media help "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\"@help_url\">kaca "
"bantuan Media</a>."

msgid "Media Name"
msgstr "Asma Media"

