msgid ""
"On the <a href=\":cache-settings\">Performance page</a>, you can "
"configure how long browsers and proxies may cache pages based on the "
"Cache-Control header; this setting is ignored by the Internal Page "
"Cache module, which caches pages permanently until invalidation, "
"unless they carry an Expires header. There is no other configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ing <a href=\":cache-settings\">Kaca Kinerja</a>, sampeyan bisa nyetel "
"suwene browser lan proxy bisa nyimpen kaca-kaca adhedhasar header "
"Cache-Control; setelan iki ora digatekake dening modul Internal Page "
"Cache, sing nyimpen kaca kanthi permanen nganti dibatalake, kajaba yen "
"ana header Expires. Ora ana setelan liyane."

msgid ""
"The Settings Tray module allows users with the <a "
"href=\":administer_block_permission\">Administer blocks</a> and <a "
"href=\":contextual_permission\">Use contextual links</a> permissions "
"to edit blocks without visiting a separate page. For more information, "
"see the <a href=\":handbook_url\">online documentation for the "
"Settings Tray module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Settings Tray ngidini pangguna sing nduwé <a "
"href=\":administer_block_permission\">hak Administer blocks</a> lan <a "
"href=\":contextual_permission\">hak Use contextual links</a> kanggo "
"nyunting blok tanpa kudu mbukak kaca kapisah. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":handbook_url\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul Settings Tray</a>."

msgid "Editing blocks in place"
msgstr "Nyunting blok langsung ing panggonan"

msgid ""
"To edit blocks in place, either click the <strong>Edit</strong> button "
"in the toolbar and then click on the block, or choose \"Quick edit\" "
"from the block's contextual link. (See the <a "
"href=\":contextual\">Contextual Links module help</a> for more "
"information about how to use contextual links.)"
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngowahi blok langsung ing panggonan, klik tombol "
"<strong>Edit</strong> ing toolbar banjur klik ing blok, utawa pilih "
"\"Quick edit\" saka pranala kontekstual blok. (Delengen <a "
"href=\":contextual\">bantuan modul Pranala Kontekstual</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan cara nggunakake pranala kontekstual.)"

msgid ""
"The Settings Tray for the block will open in a sidebar, with a compact "
"form for configuring what the block shows."
msgstr ""
"Settings Tray kanggo blok bakal mbukak ing sidebar, kanthi formulir "
"ringkes kanggo nyetel apa sing bakal ditampilake blok kasebut."

msgid "Save the form and the changes will be immediately visible on the page."
msgstr "Simpen formulir lan owah-owahan bakal langsung katon ing kaca."

msgid ""
"Specify the format of the syslog entry. Available variables are: "
"<dl><dt><code>!base_url</code></dt><dd>Base URL of the "
"site.</dd><dt><code>!timestamp</code></dt><dd>Unix timestamp of the "
"log entry.</dd><dt><code>!type</code></dt><dd>The category to which "
"this message belongs.</dd><dt><code>!ip</code></dt><dd>IP address of "
"the user triggering the "
"message.</dd><dt><code>!request_uri</code></dt><dd>The requested "
"URI.</dd><dt><code>!referer</code></dt><dd>HTTP Referer if "
"available.</dd><dt><code>!severity</code></dt><dd>The severity level "
"of the event; ranges from 0 (Emergency) to 7 "
"(Debug).</dd><dt><code>!uid</code></dt><dd>User "
"ID.</dd><dt><code>!link</code></dt><dd>A link to associate with the "
"message.</dd><dt><code>!message</code></dt><dd>The message to store in "
"the log.</dd></dl>"
msgstr ""
"Tentukan format saka entri syslog. Variabel sing kasedhiya yaiku: "
"<dl><dt><code>!base_url</code></dt><dd>Base URL saka "
"situs.</dd><dt><code>!timestamp</code></dt><dd>Unix timestamp saka "
"entri log.</dd><dt><code>!type</code></dt><dd>Kategori sing dadi "
"panggonan pesen iki.</dd><dt><code>!ip</code></dt><dd>Alamat IP "
"pangguna sing nimbulake "
"pesen.</dd><dt><code>!request_uri</code></dt><dd>URI sing "
"dijaluk.</dd><dt><code>!referer</code></dt><dd>HTTP Referer yen "
"ana.</dd><dt><code>!severity</code></dt><dd>Tingkat severity saka "
"acara; saka 0 (Darurat) nganti 7 "
"(Debug).</dd><dt><code>!uid</code></dt><dd>ID "
"pangguna.</dd><dt><code>!link</code></dt><dd>Tautan kanggo nggabungake "
"karo pesen.</dd><dt><code>!message</code></dt><dd>Pesen sing bakal "
"disimpen ing log.</dd></dl>"

