msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Entity untranslatable fields"
msgstr "Ladang entitas sing ora bisa ditranslate"

msgid ""
"The Content Moderation module allows you to expand on Drupal's "
"\"unpublished\" and \"published\" states for content. It allows you to "
"have a published version that is live, but have a separate working "
"copy that is undergoing review before it is published. This is "
"achieved by using <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> to apply "
"different states and transitions to entities as needed. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":content_moderation\">online "
"documentation for the Content Moderation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Content Moderation ngidini sampeyan ngembangake status \"durung "
"diterbitake\" lan \"wis diterbitake\" ing Drupal kanggo isi konten. "
"Modul iki ngidini sampeyan duwe versi sing wis diterbitake lan aktif, "
"nanging uga duwe salinan kerja sing kapisah sing lagi direvisi "
"sadurunge diterbitake. Iki bisa dilakukan kanthi nggunakake <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> kanggo nerapake status lan transisi "
"sing beda-beda marang entitas sesuai kebutuhan. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":content_moderation\">dokumentasi online "
"modul Content Moderation</a>."

msgid "Applying workflows"
msgstr "Nerapake workflows"

msgid "Moderating content"
msgstr "Moderasi isi"

msgid ""
"You can view a list of content awaiting moderation on the <a "
"href=\":moderated\">moderated content page</a>. This will show any "
"content in an unpublished state, such as Draft or Archived, to help "
"surface content that requires more work from content editors."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa ndeleng daftar isi sing lagi nunggu moderasi ing <a "
"href=\":moderated\">kaca isi sing dimoderasi</a>. Iki bakal nampilake "
"isi sing durung dipublikasi, kaya Draft utawa Arsip, kanggo mbantu "
"nggoleki isi sing butuh luwih akeh pangaturan saka editor isi."

msgid ""
"Each transition is exposed as a permission. If a user has the "
"permission for a transition, they can use the transition to change the "
"state of the content item, from Draft to Published."
msgstr ""
"Saben transisi diwenehake minangka hak akses. Yen pangguna duwe hak "
"akses kanggo transisi kasebut, dheweke bisa nggunakake transisi kanggo "
"ngganti status item konten, saka Draf menyang Diterbitake."

