msgid ""
"Displaying media assets from third-party services, such as YouTube or "
"Twitter, can be risky. This is because many of these services return "
"arbitrary HTML to represent those assets, and that HTML may contain "
"executable JavaScript code. If handled improperly, this can increase "
"the risk of your site being compromised."
msgstr ""
"Nampilake aset media saka layanan pihak katelu, kaya YouTube utawa "
"Twitter, bisa dadi resiko. Iki amarga akeh layanan kuwi mbalekake HTML "
"sembarangan kanggo nggambarake aset-aset kasebut, lan HTML kuwi bisa "
"ngemot kode JavaScript sing bisa dieksekusi. Yen ditangani kanthi ora "
"bener, iki bisa nambah resiko situs sampeyan kena kompromi."

msgid ""
"In order to mitigate the risks, third-party assets are displayed in an "
"iFrame, which effectively sandboxes any executable code running inside "
"it. For even more security, the iFrame can be served from an alternate "
"domain (that also points to your Drupal site), which you can configure "
"on this page. This helps safeguard cookies and other sensitive "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngurangi risiko, aset pihak katelu ditampilake ing iFrame, sing "
"kanthi efektif misahake kode eksekusi sing mlaku ing jerone. Kanggo "
"keamanan sing luwih, iFrame bisa disajikake saka domain alternatif "
"(sing uga nuduhake menyang situs Drupal sampeyan), sing bisa sampeyan "
"atur ing kaca iki. Iki mbantu njaga cookie lan informasi sensitif "
"liyane."

