"nganyari mode tampilan sing kudu digunakake kanggo nampilake item "
"media sing wis disisipake sawise disisipake. Yen kurang saka loro mode "
"tampilan sing dipilih, media bakal disisipake nganggo mode tampilan "
"standar lan ora bakal ana pilihan mode tampilan sing muncul sawise "
"item media disisipake."

msgid "The referenced media source is missing and needs to be re-embedded."
msgstr "Sumber media sing dirujuk ora ketemu lan perlu dilebokake maneh."

msgid ""
"\n"
"      <p>You can embed media items:</p>\n"
"      <ul>\n"
"        "
"<li>Choose which media item to embed: <code>&lt;drupal-media "
"data-entity-uuid=\"07bf3a2e-1941-4a44-9b02-2d1d7a41ec0e\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"        <li>Optionally also choose a view mode: "
"<code>data-view-mode=\"tiny_embed\"</code>, otherwise the default view "
"mode is used.</li>\n"
"        <li>The "
"<code>data-entity-type=\"media\"</code> attribute is required for "
"consistency.</li>\n"
"      </ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kowe bisa nyelipaké item media:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  <li>Pilih item "
"media sing arep diselipaké: <code>&lt;drupal-media "
"data-entity-uuid=\"07bf3a2e-1941-4a44-9b02-2d1d7a41ec0e\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  <li>Yen perlu, pilih uga mode tampilan: "
"<code>data-view-mode=\"tiny_embed\"</code>, yen ora, mode tampilan "
"bawaan sing bakal digunakaké.</li>\n"
"  <li>Atribut "
"<code>data-entity-type=\"media\"</code> dibutuhaké supaya tetep "
"konsisten.</li>\n"
"</ul>"

msgid ""
"During rendering of embedded media: recursive rendering detected for "
"%entity_id. Aborting rendering."
msgstr ""
"Sajrone proses rendering media sing diselipake: dideteksi rendering "
"rekursif kanggo %entity_id. Proses rendering dihentikan."

msgid ""
"During rendering of embedded media: the media item with UUID \"@uuid\" "
"does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Sajrone proses render media sing disisipake: item media kanthi UUID "
"\"@uuid\" ora ana."

msgid ""
"During rendering of embedded media: the view mode \"@view-mode-id\" "
"does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Sakwisé ngolah media sing diselipaké: mode tampilan "
"\"@view-mode-id\" ora ana."

msgid ""
"Embeds media items using a custom tag, "
"<code>&lt;drupal-media&gt;</code>. If used in conjunction with the "
"'Align/Caption' filters, make sure this filter is configured to run "
"after them."
msgstr ""
"Nggabungake item media nganggo tag khusus, "
"<code>&lt;drupal-media&gt;</code>. Yen digunakake bareng karo filter "
"'Align/Caption', priksa manawa filter iki dikonfigurasi supaya mlaku "
"sawise filter kuwi."

msgid ""
"The Media Library module provides a rich, visual interface for "
"managing media, and allows media to be reused in entity reference "
"fields or embedded into text content. It overrides the <a "
"href=\":media-collection\">media administration page</a>, allowing "
"users to toggle between the existing table-style interface and a new "
"grid-style interface for browsing and performing administrative "
"operations on media."
msgstr ""
"Modul Media Library nyedhiyakake antarmuka visual sing sugih kanggo "
"ngatur media, lan ngidini media digunakake maneh ing kolom referensi "
"entitas utawa diselipake ing isi teks. Modul iki ngganti <a "
"href=\":media-collection\">kaca administrasi media</a>, sing ngidini "
"pangguna kanggo ngalih antarane antarmuka gaya tabel sing wis ana lan "
"antarmuka gaya grid anyar kanggo nyelusuri lan nindakake operasi "
"administrasi ing media."

msgid ""
"To learn more about media management, begin by reviewing the <a "
"href=\":media-help\">documentation for the Media module</a>. For more "
"information about the media library and related functionality, see the "
"<a href=\":media-library-handbook\">online documentation for the Media "
"Library module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo sinau luwih lengkap babagan manajemen media, wiwiti kanthi "
"mriksa <a href=\":media-help\">dokumentasi kanggo modul Media</a>. "
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan perpustakaan media lan fungsi "
"sing gegandhengan, deleng <a "
"href=\":media-library-handbook\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Perpustakaan Media</a>."

msgid "Selection dialog"
msgstr "Dialog pilihan"

msgid ""
"When selecting media for an entity reference field or a text editor, "
"Media Library opens a modal dialog to help users easily find and "
"select media. The modal dialog can toggle between a grid-style and "
"table-style interface, and new media items can be uploaded directly "
"into it."
msgstr ""
"Nalika milih media kanggo lapangan referensi entitas utawa editor "
"teks, Media Library mbukak dialog modal kanggo mbantu pangguna kanthi "
"gampang nemokake lan milih media. Dialog modal bisa ngalih antarane "
"antarmuka gaya grid lan gaya tabel, lan item media anyar bisa diunggah "
"langsung menyang kono."

msgid ""
"Within the dialog, media items are divided up by type. If more than "
"one media type can be selected by the user, the available types will "
"be displayed as a set of vertical tabs. To users who have appropriate "
"permissions, each media type may also present a short form allowing "
"you to upload or create new media items of that type."
msgstr ""
"Ing jero dialog, item media dipérang miturut jinis. Yen luwih saka "
"siji jinis media bisa dipilih déning pangguna, jinis sing kasedhiya "
"bakal dipérang dadi tab vertikal. Kanggo pangguna sing nduwèni hak "
"akses sing tepat, saben jinis media uga bisa nampilake formulir "
"cendhak sing ngidini sampeyan ngunggah utawa nggawe item media anyar "
"saka jinis kuwi."

msgid "Grid-style vs. table-style interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka gaya grid vs. gaya tabel"

msgid ""
"The Media Library module provides a new grid-style interface for the "
"media administration page that displays media as thumbnails, with "
"minimal textual information, allowing users to visually browse media "
"in their site. The existing table-style interface is better suited to "
"displaying additional information about media items, in addition to "
"being more accessible to users with assistive technology."
msgstr ""
"Modul Media Library nyedhiyakake antarmuka gaya grid anyar kanggo kaca "
"administrasi media sing nampilake media minangka thumbnail, kanthi "
"informasi teks minimal, supaya pangguna bisa njelajah media kanthi "
"visual ing situsé. Antarmuka gaya tabel sing wis ana luwih cocog "
"kanggo nampilake informasi tambahan babagan item media, saliyané uga "
"luwih bisa diakses dening pangguna sing nganggo teknologi bantu."

msgid "Reusing media in entity reference fields"
msgstr "Nganggo maneh media ing kolom referensi entitas"

msgid ""
"Any entity reference field that references media can use the media "
"library. To enable, configure the form display for the field to use "
"the \"Media library\" widget."
msgstr ""
"Saben kolom referensi entitas sing ngrujuk media bisa nggunakake "
"perpustakaan media. Kanggo ngaktifake, atur tampilan formulir kanggo "
"kolom kasebut supaya nggunakake widget \"Perpustakaan media\"."

msgid "Embedding media in text content"
msgstr "Nggabungaké media ing isi teks"

msgid ""
"To use the media library within CKEditor, you must add the \"Insert "
"from Media Library\" button to the CKEditor toolbar, and enable the "
"\"Embed media\" filter in the text format associated with the text "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nggunakake perpustakaan media ing jero CKEditor, sampeyan kudu "
"nambah tombol \"Sisipake saka Perpustakaan Media\" menyang toolbar "
"CKEditor, lan ngaktifake filter \"Semat media\" ing format teks sing "
"gegandhengan karo editor teks."

msgid ""
"Both the table-style and grid-style interfaces are regular views and "
"can be customized via the Views UI, including sorting and filtering. "
"This is the case for both the administration page and the modal "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kaloro antarmuka gaya tabel lan gaya grid iku pemandangan biasa lan "
"bisa disesuaikan liwat Views UI, kalebu ngurutake lan nyaring. Iki "
"kedadeyan kanggo kaca administrasi lan dialog modal."

msgid "Media Library settings"
msgstr "Setelan Perpustakaan Media"

msgid "Manage Media Library settings."
msgstr "Ngatur setelan Perpustakaan Media."

msgid "Media library settings"
msgstr "Setelan perpustakaan media"

msgid "Enable advanced UI"
msgstr "Ngaktifake UI majeng"

msgid ""
"A path alias set for a specific language will always be used when "
"displaying this page in that language, and takes precedence over path "
"aliases set as <em>- Not specified -</em>."
msgstr ""
"Alias path sing disetel kanggo basa tartamtu bakal tansah digunakake "
"nalika nampilake kaca iki ing basa kasebut, lan nduweni prioritas "
"luwih dhuwur tinimbang alias path sing disetel minangka <em>- Ora "
"ditemtokake -</em>."

msgid "No path aliases available. <a href=\":link\">Add URL alias</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana alias path sing kasedhiya. <a href=\":link\">Tambah alias "
"URL</a>."

msgid ""
"The search page that the form submits to, or Default for the default "
"search page."
msgstr ""
"Kaca panelusuran sing dikirim formulir kasebut, utawa Default kanggo "
"kaca panelusuran standar."

msgid ""
"Experimental themes found: %theme_list. Experimental themes are "
"provided for testing purposes only. Use at your own risk."
msgstr ""
"Tema eksperimental sing ditemokake: %theme_list. Tema eksperimental "
"diwenehake kanggo tujuan nyoba wae. Gunakake kanthi resiko sampeyan "
"dhewe."

msgid "Configuration sync directory"
msgstr "Direktori sinkronisasi konfigurasi"

msgid ""
"Your %file file must define the %setting setting as a string "
"containing the directory in which configuration files can be found."
msgstr ""
"File %file panjenengan kudu nemtokake setelan %setting minangka string "
"sing ngemot direktori ing ngendi file konfigurasi bisa ditemokake."

msgid "experimental theme"
msgstr "tema eksperimental"

msgid ""
"A local file system path where temporary files will be stored. This "
"directory should not be accessible over the web. This must be changed "
"in settings.php."
msgstr ""
"Sistem jalur file lokal ing ngendi file sementara bakal disimpen. "
"Direktori iki ora kudu bisa diakses liwat web. Iki kudu diganti ing "
"settings.php."

msgid "Are you sure you wish to install an experimental theme?"
msgstr "Apa sampeyan yakin pengin nginstal tema eksprimèn?"

msgid ""
"Experimental themes are provided for testing purposes only. Use at "
"your own risk."
msgstr ""
"Tema eksperimental diwenehake mung kanggo tujuan nyoba. Gunakake "
"kanthi risiko sampeyan dhewe."

msgid "The following themes are experimental: @themes"
msgstr "Tema ing ngisor iki lagi eksperimen: @themes"

msgid "Internationalization mode."
msgstr "Mode internasionalisasi."

msgid "Language from the taxonomy_vocabulary table."
msgstr "Basa saka tabel taxonomy_vocabulary."

msgid "Translation of either the name or the description."
msgstr "Terjemahan saka jeneng utawa gambaran."

msgid "Language code from locales_target table"
msgstr "Kode basa saka tabel locales_target"

msgid "Require summary"
msgstr "Mbutuhake ringkesan"

msgid "Always show summary"
msgstr "Tansah tampilaké ringkesan"

msgid "The summary will also be visible when marked as required."
msgstr "Ringkesan uga bakal katon nalika diparingi tandha minangka wajib."

msgid "The summary field is required for @name"
msgstr "Lapangan ringkesan iku wajib kanggo @name"

msgid "Always show the summary field"
msgstr "Tindakake tansah nampilake kolom ringkesan"

msgid "Summary field will always be visible"
msgstr "Lapangan ringkesan bakal tansah katon"

msgid ""
"Too many password recovery requests from your IP address. It is "
"temporarily blocked. Try again later or contact the site "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"Telu banget panyuwunan pulih sandhi saka alamat IP panjenengan. Saiki "
"lagi diblokir sementara. Coba maneh mengko utawa hubungi administrator "
"situs."

msgid "Limit the available operators"
msgstr "Watesi operator sing kasedhiya"

msgid "List of available operators"
msgstr "Dhaptar operator sing kasedhiya"

msgid "Limit the available operators to be shown on the exposed filter."
msgstr ""
"Watesi operator sing kasedhiya kanggo ditampilake ing filter sing "
"dipaparake."

msgid "Restrict operators to"
msgstr "Watesi operator menyang"

msgid "Selecting none will make all of them available."
msgstr "Milih ora ana bakal nggawe kabeh dadi kasedhiya."

msgid ""
"You selected the \"@operator\" operator as the default value but is "
"not included in the list of limited operators."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan milih operator \"@operator\" minangka nilai standar nanging "
"ora kalebu ing daftar operator sing diwatesi."

msgid ""
"Provides an interface to create workflows with transitions between "
"different states (for example publication or user status) provided by "
"other modules."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake antarmuka kanggo nggawe workflow kanthi transisi antarane "
"status sing beda-beda (contone publikasi utawa status pangguna) sing "
"diwenehake dening modul liyane."

msgid "Indicates the workspace that this revision belongs to."
msgstr "Nuduhake workspace sing dadi papan panggonan revisi iki."

msgid "Switch to Live"
msgstr "Pindhah menyang Live"

msgid "Would you like to switch to the live version of the site?"
msgstr "Apa sampeyan kepengin ngalih menyang versi situs sing langsung?"

msgid "Switch to the live version of the site."
msgstr "Pindhah menyang versi langsung saka situs kasebut."

msgid "You are now viewing the live version of the site."
msgstr "Sampeyan saiki lagi ndeleng versi situs sing langsung."

msgid "Media Library thumbnail (220×220)"
msgstr "Gambar cilik ing Media Library (220×220)"

msgid "Delete {{ name }}"
msgstr "Busak {{ name }}"

msgid "Viewing help topics"
msgstr "Ndelok topik pitulungan"

msgid ""
"The top-level help topics are listed on the main <a "
"href=\":help_page\">Help page</a>. Links to other topics, including "
"non-top-level help topics, can be found under the \"Related\" heading "
"when viewing a topic page."
msgstr ""
"Topik bantuan tingkat paling ndhuwur kadhaptar ing kaca utama <a "
"href=\":help_page\">Bantuan</a>. Tautan menyang topik liyane, kalebu "
"topik bantuan sing ora ana ing tingkat paling ndhuwur, bisa ditemokake "
"ing ngisor irah-irahan \"Kaitane\" nalika ndeleng kaca topik."

msgid "Providing help topics"
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake topik pitulungan"

msgid "Translating help topics"
msgstr "Nerjemahaké topik bantuan"

msgid ""
"The title and body text of help topics provided by contributed modules "
"and themes are translatable using the <a "
"href=\":locale_help\">Interface Translation module</a>. Topics "
"provided by custom modules and themes are also translatable if they "
"have been viewed at least once in a non-English language, which "
"triggers putting their translatable text into the translation "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Judhul lan isi teks saka topik bantuan sing disedhiyakake dening modul "
"lan tema kontribusi bisa diterjemahake nggunakake <a "
"href=\":locale_help\">modul Terjemahan Antarmuka</a>. Topik sing "
"disedhiyakake dening modul lan tema kustom uga bisa diterjemahake yen "
"wis tau dideleng paling ora sepisan nganggo basa non-Inggris, sing "
"nyebabake teks sing bisa diterjemahake mlebu menyang basis data "
"terjemahan."

msgid "Configuring help search"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi panelusuran pitulung"

msgid "See the <a href=\":help_page\">Help page</a> for more topics."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <a href=\":help_page\">Kaca Pitulungan</a> kanggo topik "
"liyane."

msgid "Help search"
msgstr "Bantuan golek"

msgid ""
"Configure the settings of a block that was previously placed in a "
"region of a theme."
msgstr ""
"Ngatur setelan saka blok sing wis dipasang ing sawijining wilayah saka "
"tema."

msgid "Click the name of the theme that contains the block."
msgstr "Klik jeneng tema sing ngemot blok kasebut."

msgid ""
"Optionally, click <em>Demonstrate block regions</em> to see the "
"regions of the theme."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan, klik <em>Demonstrate block regions</em> kanggo ndeleng "
"wilayah-wilayah saka tema."

msgid ""
"If you only want to change the region where a block is located, or the "
"ordering of blocks within a region, drag blocks to their desired "
"positions and click <em>Save blocks</em>."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan mung pengin ngganti wilayah panggonan blok, utawa urutan "
"blok ing sak wilayah, seret blok menyang posisi sing dikarepake banjur "
"klik <em>Save blocks</em>."

msgid ""
"If you want to change additional settings, find the region where the "
"block you want to update is currently located, and click "
"<em>Configure</em> in the line of the block description."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan pengin ngganti setelan tambahan, golek wilayah ing ngendi "
"blok sing pengin sampeyan update saiki dumunung, banjur klik "
"<em>Configure</em> ing garis katrangan blok kasebut."

msgid ""
"Edit the block's settings. The available settings vary depending on "
"the module that provides the block, but for all blocks you can change:"
msgstr ""
"Sunting setelan blok. Setelan sing kasedhiya beda-beda gumantung saka "
"modul sing nyedhiyakake blok, nanging kanggo kabeh blok sampeyan bisa "
"ngganti:"

msgid ""
"<em>Block title</em>: The heading for the block on your site -- for "
"some blocks, you will need to check the <em>Override title</em> "
"checkbox in order to enter a title"
msgstr ""
"<em>Judhul blok</em>: Pambuka kanggo blok ing situs sampeyan -- kanggo "
"sawetara blok, sampeyan kudu mriksa kothak <em>Override title</em> "
"supaya bisa ngetik judhul"

msgid "<em>Display title</em>: Check the box if you want the title displayed"
msgstr ""
"<em>Display title</em>: Centhang kothak yen sampeyan pengin judhul "
"ditampilake"

msgid ""
"<em>Visibility</em>: Add conditions for when the block should be "
"displayed"
msgstr "<em>Visibility</em>: Tambahaké syarat kapan blok kudu ditampilaké"

msgid "<em>Region</em>: Change the theme region the block is displayed in"
msgstr "<em>Region</em>: Ganti region tema ngendi blok ditampilake"

msgid "Click <em>Save block</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Simpen blok</em>."

msgid "What are blocks?"
msgstr "Apa iku blok?"

msgid ""
"Blocks are boxes of content rendered into an area, or region, of a web "
"page of your site. Blocks are placed and configured specifically for "
"each theme."
msgstr ""
"Blok yaiku kothak isi sing ditampilake ing sawijining area, utawa "
"wilayah, saka kaca web situs sampeyan. Blok diatur lan disetel kanthi "
"khusus kanggo saben tema."

msgid "What is the block description?"
msgstr "Apa iku katrangan blok?"

msgid ""
"The block description is an identification name for a block, which is "
"shown in the administrative interface. It is not displayed on the "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Deskripsi blok yaiku jeneng identifikasi kanggo blok, sing ditampilake "
"ing antarmuka administrasi. Iku ora ditampilake ing situs."

msgid "What is the block title?"
msgstr "Apa jeneng bloké?"

msgid ""
"The block title is the heading that is optionally shown to site "
"visitors when the block is placed in a region."
msgstr ""
"Judhul blok iku dadi pranala sing bisa ditampilake kanggo para "
"pengunjung situs nalika blok kasebut dipasang ing sawijining wilayah."

msgid "Place a block into a theme's region."
msgstr "Lebokake blok menyang wilayah tema."

msgid "Click the name of the theme that you want to place the block in."
msgstr "Klik jeneng tema sing pengin sampeyan pasang blok ing kono."

msgid ""
"Find the region where you want the block, and click <em>Place "
"block</em> in that region. A modal dialog will pop up."
msgstr ""
"Golek wilayah ngendi sampeyan pengin blok kasebut, banjur klik "
"<em>Place block</em> ing wilayah kasebut. Dialog modal bakal muncul."

msgid ""
"Find the block you want to place and click <em>Place block</em>. A "
"<em>Configure block</em> modal dialog will pop up."
msgstr ""
"Goleki blok sing arep sampeyan pasang lan klik <em>Place block</em>. "
"Dialog modal <em>Configure block</em> bakal metu."

msgid ""
"Enter a description of your block (to be shown to administrators) and "
"the body text for your block."
msgstr ""
"Lebokake katrangan babagan blok sampeyan (kanggo ditampilake marang "
"administrator) lan teks isi kanggo blok sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Enter a label for this block type (shown in the administrative "
"interface). Optionally, edit the automatically-generated machine name "
"or the description."
msgstr ""
"Lebokake label kanggo jinis blok iki (sing ditampilake ing antarmuka "
"administrasi). Pilihan, sunting jeneng mesin sing digawe otomatis "
"utawa katrangan."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the <em>Block types</em> "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save</em>. Sampeyan bakal bali menyang kaca <em>Block "
"types</em>."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Manage fields</em> in the row of your new block type, and "
"add the desired fields to your block type."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Manage fields</em> ing baris jinis blok anyar sampeyan, lan "
"tambahaké kolom sing dikarepake kanggo jinis blok sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Optionally, click <em>Manage form display</em> or <em>Manage "
"display</em> to change the editing form or field display for your "
"block type."
msgstr ""
"Sakliyane, klik <em>Manage form display</em> utawa <em>Manage "
"display</em> kanggo ngganti formulir suntingan utawa tampilan field "
"kanggo jinis blok sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Use contextual links to access administrative tasks without navigating "
"the administrative menu."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake pranala kontekstual kanggo ngakses tugas administrasi tanpa "
"kudu mlebu menu administrasi."

msgid "What are contextual links?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi pranala kontekstual?"

msgid ""
"<em>Contextual links</em> give users with the <em>Use contextual "
"links</em> permission quick access to administrative tasks related to "
"areas of non-administrative pages. For example, if a page on your site "
"displays a block, the block would have a contextual link that would "
"allow users with permission to configure the block. If the block "
"contains a menu or a view, it would also have a contextual link for "
"editing the menu links or the view. Clicking a contextual link takes "
"you to the related administrative page directly, without needing to "
"navigate through the administrative menu system."
msgstr ""
"<em>Link kontekstual</em> menehi pangguna sing duwe ijin <em>Gunakake "
"link kontekstual</em> akses cepet kanggo tugas administratif sing "
"gegandhengan karo area kaca non-administratif. Contone, yen ana kaca "
"ing situs sampeyan sing nampilake blok, blok kasebut bakal duwe link "
"kontekstual sing ngidini pangguna sing duwe ijin kanggo nyetel blok. "
"Yen blok kasebut ngemot menu utawa tampilan, uga bakal duwe link "
"kontekstual kanggo ngedit tautan menu utawa tampilan kasebut. Klik "
"link kontekstual bakal nggawa sampeyan langsung menyang kaca "
"administratif sing gegandhengan, tanpa kudu navigasi liwat sistem menu "
"administratif."

msgid ""
"Make sure that the core Contextual Links module is installed, and that "
"you have a role with the <em>Use contextual links</em> permission. "
"Optionally, make sure that a toolbar module is installed (either the "
"core Toolbar module or a contributed module replacement)."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa modul Contextual Links inti wis dipasang, lan manawa "
"sampeyan duwe peran kanthi idin <em>Gunakake pranala kontekstual</em>. "
"Pilihan liya, priksa manawa modul toolbar wis dipasang (bisa modul "
"Toolbar inti utawa modul pengganti sumbangan)."

msgid "Visit a non-administrative page on your site, such as the home page."
msgstr ""
"Bukak kaca sing ora administratif ing situs sampeyan, kaya kaca "
"ngarep."

msgid ""
"Locate a block or another area on the page that you want to edit or "
"configure."
msgstr ""
"Temokake blok utawa area liyane ing kaca sing pengin sampeyan sunting "
"utawa konfigurasikake."

msgid ""
"Make the contextual links button visible by hovering your mouse over "
"that area in the page. In most themes, this button looks like a pencil "
"and is placed in the upper right corner of the page area (upper left "
"for right-to-left languages), and hovering will also temporarily "
"outline the affected area. Alternatively, click the contextual links "
"toggle button on the right end of the toolbar (left end for "
"right-to-left languages), which will make all contextual link buttons "
"on the page visible until it is clicked again."
msgstr ""
"Gawe tombol pranala kontekstual katon kanthi ngetokake mouse ing "
"wilayah kasebut ing kaca. Ing pirang-pirang tema, tombol iki katon "
"kaya pensil lan dipasang ing pojok ndhuwur tengen wilayah kaca "
"(ndhuwur kiwa kanggo basa sing nulis saka tengen menyang kiwa), lan "
"ngetokake mouse uga bakal sementara nyorot wilayah sing kena. "
"Alternatifé, klik tombol toggle pranala kontekstual sing ana ing "
"pucuk tengen toolbar (pucuk kiwa kanggo basa sing nulis saka tengen "
"menyang kiwa), sing bakal nggawe kabeh tombol pranala kontekstual ing "
"kaca katon nganti tombol iki diklik maneh."

msgid ""
"While the contextual links button for the area of interest is visible, "
"click the button to display the list of links for that area. Click a "
"link in the list to visit the corresponding administrative page."
msgstr ""
"Nalika tombol tautan kontekstual kanggo wilayah sing dadi perhatian "
"katon, klik tombol kasebut kanggo nampilake dhaptar tautan kanggo "
"wilayah kasebut. Klik salah siji tautan ing dhaptar kanggo ngunjungi "
"kaca administrasi sing cocog."

msgid ""
"Complete your administrative task and save your settings, or cancel "
"the action. You should be returned to the page you started from."
msgstr ""
"Rampungna tugasmupTanggal administrasimu lan simpen pangaturanmu, "
"utawa batalake tindakan kasebut. Kowé kudu dibalikaké menyang kaca "
"sing wis kowé mulai."

msgid "What are security updates?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi pembaruan keamanan?"

msgid ""
"Any software occasionally has bugs, and sometimes these bugs have "
"security implications. When security bugs are fixed in the core "
"software, modules, or themes that your site uses, they are released in "
"a <em>security update</em>. You will need to apply security updates in "
"order to keep your site secure."
msgstr ""
"Saben piranti lunak kadhangkala nduwèni bug, lan kadhangkala bug iki "
"nduwèni implikasi keamanan. Nalika bug keamanan didandani ing piranti "
"lunak inti, modul, utawa tema sing digunakaké situs panjenengan, iku "
"dirilis ing <em>update keamanan</em>. Panjenengan kudu nerapaké "
"update keamanan supaya situs tetep aman."

msgid "Security tasks"
msgstr "Tugas keamanan"

msgid ""
"Keeping track of updates, updating the core software, and updating "
"contributed modules and/or themes are all part of keeping your site "
"secure. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Nglacak pembaruan, nganyari piranti lunak inti, lan nganyari modul "
"modul lan/utawa tema sing disumbangaké iku kabèh bagéan saka njaga "
"keamanan situs panjenengan. Delengen topik-topik sing gegandhengan "
"sing kadhaptar ing ngisor iki kanggo tugas-tugas sing luwih spesifik."

msgid "Overview of accessibility"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum babagan aksesibilitas"

msgid ""
"The default drag-and-drop user interface for ordering tables in the "
"administrative interface presents a challenge for some users, "
"including keyboard-only users and users of screen readers and other "
"assistive technology. The drag-and-drop interface can be disabled in a "
"table by clicking a link labeled <em>Show row weights</em> above the "
"table. The replacement interface allows users to order the table by "
"choosing numerical weights (with increasing numbers) instead of "
"dragging table rows."
msgstr ""
"Antarmuka panganggo drag-and-drop bawaan kanggo ngatur urutan tabel "
"ing antarmuka administrasi nggawe sawetara pangguna ngalami tantangan, "
"kalebu pangguna sing mung nggunakake keyboard lan pangguna pembaca "
"layar lan teknologi bantu liyane. Antarmuka drag-and-drop bisa "
"dipatèni ing sawijining tabel kanthi ngeklik pranala sing dijenengi "
"<em>Show row weights</em> ing ndhuwur tabel kasebut. Antarmuka gantine "
"ngidinaké pangguna kanggo ngatur tabel kanthi milih bobot angka "
"(kanthi nomer sing tambah) tinimbang narik baris tabel."

msgid "Administrative interface overview"
msgstr "Ringkesan antarmuka administratif"

msgid ""
"A menu system, which you can navigate to find pages for administrative "
"tasks. The core Toolbar module displays this menu on the top or left "
"side of the page (right side in right-to-left languages). There are "
"also contributed module replacements for the core Toolbar module, with "
"additional features, such as the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/admin_toolbar\">Admin Toolbar "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sistem menu, sing bisa sampeyan telusuri kanggo nemokake kaca kanggo "
"tugas administratif. Modul Toolbar inti nampilake menu iki ing sisih "
"ndhuwur utawa kiwa kaca (sisih tengen ing basa sing arah tulisane saka "
"tengen menyang kiwa). Ana uga modul pengganti sing disumbangake kanggo "
"modul Toolbar inti, kanthi fitur tambahan, kaya <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/admin_toolbar\">modul Admin "
"Toolbar</a>."

msgid ""
"The core Shortcuts module enhances the toolbar with a configurable "
"list of links to commonly-used tasks."
msgstr ""
"Modul Shortcuts inti nambahake toolbar kanthi dhaftar pranala sing "
"bisa dikonfigurasi menyang tugas-tugas sing kerep digunakake."

msgid ""
"If you install the core Contextual Links module, non-administrative "
"pages will contain links leading to related administrative tasks."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan nginstal modul inti Contextual Links, kaca "
"non-administratif bakal ngemot pranala sing ngarahake menyang tugas "
"administratif sing gegandhengan."

msgid ""
"The core Help module displays help topics, and provides a Help block "
"that can be placed on administrative pages to provide an overview of "
"their functionality."
msgstr ""
"Modul Help inti nampilake topik bantuan, lan nyedhiyakake blok Help "
"sing bisa dipasang ing kaca administratif kanggo menehi gambaran "
"babagan fungsine."

msgid "See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Delengen topik-topik terkait sing kacathet ing ngisor iki kanggo "
"tugas-tugas sing spesifik."

msgid "Set up your site so that users can search for help."
msgstr "Atur situsmu supaya pangguna bisa nggoleki pitulungan."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Search and metadata</em> &gt; "
"<em>Search pages</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Search and metadata</em> &gt; "
"<em>Search pages</em>."

msgid ""
"Verify that a Help search page is listed in the <em>Search pages</em> "
"section. If not, add a new page of type <em>Help</em>."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa kaca panelusuran Bantuan kapacak ing bagean <em>Search "
"pages</em>. Yen durung ana, tambahna kaca anyar kanthi jinis "
"<em>Help</em>."

msgid ""
"Create, view, and use a set of shortcuts to access administrative "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"Gawé, deleng, lan gunakake sakumpulan pintasan kanggo ngakses kaca "
"administrasi."

msgid "What are shortcuts?"
msgstr "Apa iku shortcuts?"

msgid ""
"<em>Shortcuts</em> are quick links to administrative pages; they are "
"managed by the core Shortcut module. A site can have one or more "
"<em>shortcut sets</em>, which can be shared by one or more users (by "
"default, there is only one set shared by all users); each set contains "
"a limited number of shortcuts. Users need <em>Use shortcuts</em> "
"permission to view shortcuts; <em>Edit current shortcut set</em> "
"permission to add, delete, or edit the shortcuts in the set assigned "
"to them; and <em>Select any shortcut set</em> permission to select a "
"different shortcut set when editing their user profile. There is also "
"an <em>Administer shortcuts</em> permission, which allows an "
"administrator to do any of these actions, as well as select shortcut "
"sets for other users."
msgstr ""
"<em>Shortcuts</em> yaiku pranala cepet menyang kaca administratif; iki "
"dikelola dening modul inti Shortcut. Siji situs bisa duwe siji utawa "
"luwih <em>kumpulan shortcut</em>, sing bisa dibagi dening siji utawa "
"luwih pangguna (kaya biasane, mung ana siji kumpulan sing dibagi "
"dening kabeh pangguna); saben kumpulan ngemot jumlah shortcut sing "
"winates. Pangguna butuh ijin <em>Gunakake shortcuts</em> kanggo "
"ndeleng shortcuts; ijin <em>Sunting kumpulan shortcut saiki</em> "
"kanggo nambah, mbusak, utawa nyunting shortcuts ing kumpulan sing "
"ditugasake kanggo dheweke; lan ijin <em>Pilih kumpulan shortcut apa "
"wae</em> kanggo milih kumpulan shortcut sing beda nalika nyunting "
"profil pangguna. Uga ana ijin <em>Ngatur shortcuts</em>, sing ngidini "
"administrator kanggo nindakake tindakan-tindakan iki, uga milih "
"kumpulan shortcut kanggo pangguna liyane."

msgid ""
"Navigate to an administrative page that you want in your shortcut "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Mlebu menyang kaca administratif sing pengin sampeyan lebokake ing "
"dhaptar shortcut sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Repeat until all the desired links have been added to your shortcut "
"set."
msgstr ""
"Baleni nganti kabeh pranala sing dikarepake wis ditambahake menyang "
"set pintasan sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Shortcuts</em> in the toolbar to display your shortcuts, and "
"verify that the list is complete."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Shortcuts</em> ing toolbar kanggo nampilake shortcuts "
"panjenengan, lan priksa manawa daftar kasebut wis lengkap."

msgid ""
"Optionally, click <em>Edit shortcuts</em> at the right end of the "
"shortcut list (left end in right-to-left languages), to remove links "
"or change their order."
msgstr ""
"Sakjane, klik <em>Edit shortcuts</em> ing pucuk tengen dhaptar "
"shortcut (pucuk kiwa ing basa sing saka tengen menyang kiwa), kanggo "
"mbusak pranala utawa ngganti urutane."

msgid ""
"Click any link in the shortcut bar to go directly to the "
"administrative page."
msgstr ""
"Klik tautan apa wae ing bilah pintasan kanggo langsung menyang kaca "
"administratif."

msgid ""
"Configure the basic settings of your site, including the site name, "
"slogan, main email address, default time zone, default country, and "
"the date formats to use."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi setelan dhasar situs sampeyan, kalebu jeneng situs, "
"slogan, alamat email utama, zona wektu baku, negara baku, lan format "
"tanggal sing arep digunakake."

msgid "Enter the site name, slogan, and main email address for your site."
msgstr ""
"Lebokake jeneng situs, slogan, lan alamat email utama kanggo situs "
"sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save configuration</em>. You should see a message indicating "
"that the settings were saved."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save configuration</em>. Kowé kudu weruh pesen sing "
"nuduhaké yèn setelan wis kasimpen."

msgid "Select the default country and default time zone for your site."
msgstr "Pilih negara standar lan zona wektu standar kanggo situs sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Look at the <em>Patterns</em> for the Default long, medium, and short "
"date formats. If any of them does not match the date format you want "
"to use on your site, click <em>Edit</em> in that row to edit the "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <em>Patterns</em> kanggo format tanggal Default sing dawa, "
"medium, lan cekak. Yen ana sing ora cocog karo format tanggal sing "
"arep sampeyan gunakake ing situs sampeyan, klik <em>Edit</em> ing "
"baris kasebut kanggo ngowahi format kasebut."

msgid ""
"Adjust the <em>Format string</em> until the <em>Displayed</em> format "
"matches what you want. (Date format strings are composed of PHP date "
"format codes.)"
msgstr ""
"Sesuaikan <em>Format string</em> nganti <em>Displayed</em> format "
"cocog karo sing sampeyan pengin. (String format tanggal kasusun saka "
"kode format tanggal PHP.)"

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save format</em>. You should see a message indicating that "
"the format was saved."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save format</em>. Sampeyan kudu weruh pesen sing nuduhake "
"yèn format wis kasimpen."

msgid ""
"Repeat the previous three steps for any other date formats that need "
"to be changed."
msgstr ""
"Baleni telung langkah sadurunge kanggo format tanggal liyane sing kudu "
"diganti."

msgid ""
"Set up your site to respond appropriately to site errors, including "
"403 and 404 page responses."
msgstr ""
"Atur situs sampeyan supaya bisa nanggapi kanthi tepat marang kesalahan "
"situs, kalebu tanggapan kaca 403 lan 404."

msgid "What are 403 and 404 responses?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi tanggapan 403 lan 404?"

msgid ""
"When a user visits a web page, the web server sends a response code in "
"addition to the page content. A normal, non-error response has code "
"200. If the page does not exist on the site, the response code is 404. "
"If the page exists, but the user is not authorized to visit the page, "
"the response code is 403. The core software provides default responses "
"for both 403 and 404 codes, but if you prefer, you can create your own "
"pages for each."
msgstr ""
"Nalika pangguna ngunjungi kaca web, server web ngirim kode respon "
"saliyané isi kaca. Respon sing normal lan ora error nduwèni kode "
"200. Yen kaca ora ana ing situs, kode respon yaiku 404. Yen kaca ana, "
"nanging pangguna ora nduwèni ijin kanggo ngakses kaca kasebut, kode "
"respon yaiku 403. Piranti lunak inti nyedhiyakake respon bawaan kanggo "
"kode 403 lan 404, nanging yen sampeyan kepengin, sampeyan bisa nggawe "
"kaca dhewe kanggo saben kode kasebut."

msgid "What other errors can occur?"
msgstr "Kesalahan apa liyane sing bisa kedadeyan?"

msgid ""
"Under some situations, your site can generate error messages. These "
"can be due to user errors (such as entering invalid values in a form, "
"or incorrect configuration), PHP runtime errors, or software bugs. "
"Some errors may result in a <em>white screen of death</em> (a totally "
"blank web page response); less drastic errors will generate error "
"messages. You can configure what happens when an error message is "
"generated."
msgstr ""
"Ing sawijing kahanan, situs panjenengan bisa ngasilake pesen "
"kesalahan. Iki bisa disebabake dening kesalahan pangguna (kaya mlebu "
"nilai sing ora bener ing formulir, utawa konfigurasi sing salah), "
"kesalahan runtime PHP, utawa bug perangkat lunak. Sawetara kesalahan "
"bisa nyebabake <em>layar putih pati</em> (tanggapan kaca web sing "
"kosong sakabehe); kesalahan sing ora pati parah bakal ngasilake pesen "
"kesalahan. Panjenengan bisa ngatur apa sing kedadeyan nalika pesen "
"kesalahan digawe."

msgid ""
"If desired, create pages to use for 403 and 404 responses. Note the "
"URLs for these pages."
msgstr ""
"Yen dikarepake, gawe kaca kanggo digunakake kanggo tanggapan 403 lan "
"404. Catet URL kanggo kaca-kaca iki."

msgid ""
"For a production site, select <em>None</em> under <em>Error messages "
"to display</em>. For a site that is in development, select one of the "
"other options, so that you are more aware of the errors the site is "
"generating."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo situs produksi, pilih <em>None</em> ing ngisor <em>Error "
"messages to display</em>. Kanggo situs sing isih dikembangake, pilih "
"salah siji saka opsi liyane, supaya sampeyan luwih waspada marang "
"kesalahan-kesalahan sing diasilake situs kasebut."

msgid ""
"Configure settings related to how user accounts are created and "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikna setelan sing gegandhengan karo cara nggawe lan mbusak "
"akun pangguna."

msgid "What are the settings related to user account creation and deletion?"
msgstr "Apa wae setelan sing gegayutan karo nggawe lan mbusak akun pangguna?"

msgid ""
"You can make it possible for new users to register themselves for "
"accounts, with or without email verification or administrative "
"approval. Or, you can make it so only administrators with "
"<em>Administer users</em> permission can register new users."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nggawe supaya pangguna anyar bisa ndhaptar akun dhewe, "
"kanthi utawa tanpa verifikasi email utawa persetujuan administratif. "
"Utawa, sampeyan bisa nggawe supaya mung administratur kanthi ijin "
"<em>Administer users</em> sing bisa ndhaptar pangguna anyar."

msgid ""
"You can configure what happens to content that a user created, if "
"their account is <em>canceled</em> (deleted)."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nyetel apa sing kedadeyan karo isi sing digawe pangguna, "
"yen akuné <em>dibatalake</em> (didhapus)."

msgid ""
"You can edit the email messages that are sent to users when their "
"accounts are pending, approved, created, blocked, or canceled, or when "
"they request a password reset."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nyunting pesen email sing dikirim menyang pangguna "
"nalika akuné lagi ana ing status pending, disetujoni, digawe, "
"diblokir, utawa dibatalaké, utawa nalika padha njaluk reset sandhi."

msgid "What are variables in email message text?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi variabel ing teks pesen email?"

msgid ""
"<em>Variables</em> are short text strings, enclosed in square brackets "
"[], that you can insert into configured email message text. When an "
"individual message is generated, data from your site is substituted "
"for the variables. Some commonly-used variables are:"
msgstr ""
"<em>Variabel</em> iku string teks cekak, sing diklumpukake ing kurung "
"kotak [], sing bisa sampeyan lebokake ing teks pesen email sing wis "
"dikonfigurasi. Nalika pesen individu digawe, data saka situs sampeyan "
"bakal diganti kanggo variabel kasebut. Sawetara variabel sing asring "
"digunakake yaiku:"

msgid "[site:login-url]: The URL where users can log in to your site."
msgstr ""
"[site:login-url]: URL ing ngendi pangguna bisa mlebu menyang situs "
"sampeyan."

msgid "[user:display-name]: The user's displayed name."
msgstr "[user:display-name]: Asma sing ditampilake pangguna."

msgid "[user:mail]: The user's email alias."
msgstr "[user:mail]: Alamat email alias pangguna."

msgid ""
"[user:one-time-login-url]: An expiring URL that a user can use to log "
"in once, if they need to reset their password."
msgstr ""
"[user:one-time-login-url]: URL sing mung bisa dipigunakaké sakkali "
"lan bakal kadaluwarsa, sing bisa digunakaké déning pangguna kanggo "
"mlebu, yen kudu mbalèkaké sandhi."

msgid ""
"Select the method you want to use for creating user accounts, and "
"check or uncheck the box that requires email verification, to match "
"the settings you want for your site."
msgstr ""
"Pilih metode sing pengin sampeyan gunakake kanggo nggawe akun "
"pangguna, lan centhang utawa copot centhang kothak sing mbutuhake "
"verifikasi email, supaya cocog karo setelan sing pengin sampeyan atur "
"kanggo situs sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Select the desired option for what happens to content that a user "
"created if their account is canceled."
msgstr ""
"Pilih opsi sing dikarepake kanggo apa sing kedadeyan karo isi sing "
"digawe pangguna yen akuné dibatalake."

msgid "Optionally, edit the text of email messages related to user accounts."
msgstr ""
"Sakliyane, sunting teks pesen email sing gegandhengan karo akun "
"panganggo."

msgid "Verify that the other settings are correct."
msgstr "Priksa manawa setelan liyane wis bener."

msgid ""
"Topics can be provided by modules or themes. Top-level help topics on "
"your site:"
msgstr ""
"Topik-topik bisa diwènèhaké déning modul utawa tema. Topik "
"pitulungan tingkat ndhuwur ing situs panjenengan:"

msgid ""
"Both the table-style and grid-style interfaces are regular views and "
"can be customized via the <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI</a>, "
"including sorting and filtering. This is the case for both the "
"administration page and the modal dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kaloro antarmuka gaya tabel lan gaya grid iku tampilan biasa lan bisa "
"disesuaikan liwat <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI</a>, kalebu ngurutake "
"lan nyaring. Iki padha kedadeyan kanggo kaca administrasi lan dialog "
"modal."

msgid ""
"In the grid-style interface, the fields that are displayed (including "
"which image style is used for images) can be customized by configuring "
"the \"Media library\" view mode for each of your <a "
"href=\":media-types\">media types</a>. The thumbnail images in the "
"grid-style interface can be customized by configuring the \"Media "
"Library thumbnail (220×220)\" image style."
msgstr ""
"Ing antarmuka gaya grid, lapangan sing ditampilake (kalebu gaya gambar "
"sing digunakake kanggo gambar) bisa disesuaikan kanthi nyetel mode "
"tampilan \"Media library\" kanggo saben <a href=\":media-types\">jenis "
"media</a> sampeyan. Gambar thumbnail ing antarmuka gaya grid bisa "
"disesuaikan kanthi nyetel gaya gambar \"Media Library thumbnail "
"(220×220)\"."

msgid ""
"When adding new media items within the modal dialog, the fields that "
"are displayed can be customized by configuring the \"Media library\" "
"form mode for each of your <a href=\":media-types\">media types</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nalika nambahake item media anyar ing jero dialog modal, lapangan sing "
"ditampilake bisa disesuaikan kanthi ngatur mode formulir "
"\"Perpustakaan media\" kanggo saben <a href=\":media-types\">jenis "
"media</a> sampeyan."

msgid "Provides the API allowing to rename URLs."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake API sing ngidini ngganti jeneng URL."

msgid "The parent workspace."
msgstr "Workspace induk."

msgid "Merge workspace"
msgstr "Gabung workspace"

msgid "Only top-level workspaces can be published."
msgstr "Mung workspace tingkat ndhuwur sing bisa diterbitake."

msgid "Merge into @target_label"
msgstr "Gabung menyang @target_label"

msgid ""
"The %label workspace can not be deleted because it has child "
"workspaces."
msgstr "Workspace %label ora bisa dihapus amarga nduwé workspace anak."

msgid ""
"There are no changes that can be merged from %source_label to "
"%target_label."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana owah-owahan sing bisa digabung saka %source_label menyang "
"%target_label."

msgid ""
"Would you like to merge the contents of the %source_label workspace "
"into %target_label?"
msgstr ""
"Apa sampeyan pengin nggabungake isi saka workspace %source_label "
"menyang %target_label?"

msgid "Merge workspace contents."
msgstr "Gabung isi workspace."

msgid ""
"The contents of the %source_label workspace have been merged into "
"%target_label."
msgstr "Isi saka workspace %source_label wis digabung menyang %target_label."

msgid ""
"There is @count item that can be merged from %source_label to "
"%target_label"
msgid_plural ""
"There are @count items that can be merged from %source_label to "
"%target_label"
msgstr[0] ""
"Ana @count barang sing bisa digabung saka %source_label menyang "
"%target_label  \n"
"Ana @count barang sing bisa digabung saka "
"%source_label menyang %target_label"

msgid "Workspace selection"
msgstr "Pamilihan Workspace"

msgid "Medium 8:7"
msgstr "Medium 8:7"

msgid "Responsive 3x2"
msgstr "Responsive 3x2"

msgid ""
"The field that is going to be used as the RSS item link for each row. "
"This must either be an internal unprocessed path like \"node/123\" or "
"a processed, root-relative URL as produced by fields like \"Link to "
"content\"."
msgstr ""
"Lapangan sing bakal digunakake minangka pranala item RSS kanggo saben "
"baris. Iki kudu dadi path internal sing durung diproses kaya "
"\"node/123\" utawa URL relatif-root sing wis diproses kaya sing digawe "
"dening lapangan kaya \"Link to content\"."

msgid ""
"Recursive rendering detected when rendering entity %entity_type: "
"%entity_id, using the %field_name field on the "
"%parent_entity_type:%parent_bundle %parent_entity_id entity. Aborting "
"rendering."
msgstr ""
