msgid "What types of data does a site have?"
msgstr "Apa jinis data sing ana ing situs?"

msgid "What is a content entity?"
msgstr "Apa iku entitas isi?"

msgid "What is a field?"
msgstr "Apa iku field?"

msgid ""
"Within entity items, the data is stored in individual <em>fields</em>, "
"each of which holds one type of data, such as formatted or plain text, "
"images or other files, or dates. Fields can be added by an "
"administrator on entity sub-types, so that all entity items of a given "
"entity sub-type have the same collection of fields available, and they "
"can be single-valued or multiple-valued. When you create or edit "
"entity items, you are specifying the values for the fields on the "
"entity item."
msgstr ""
"Ing sajroning item entitas, data disimpen ing <em>fields</em> "
"individu, saben-saben nduwèni siji jinis data, kaya teks sing "
"diformat utawa polos, gambar utawa file liyane, utawa tanggal. Fields "
"bisa ditambahaké déning administrator ing sub-tipe entitas, supaya "
"kabèh item entitas saka sub-tipe entitas sing padha nduwèni kumpulan "
"fields sing padha, lan fields bisa nduwèni nilai siji utawa "
"pirang-pirang nilai. Nalika sampeyan nggawe utawa nyunting item "
"entitas, sampeyan nemtokaké nilai-nilai kanggo fields ing item "
"entitas kasebut."

msgid "What is a reference field?"
msgstr "Apa iku kolom referensi?"

msgid ""
"A <em>reference field</em> is a field that stores a relationship "
"between an entity and one or more other entities, which may belong to "
"the same or different entity type. For example, a <em>Content "
"reference</em> field on a content type stores a relationship between "
"one content item and one or more other content items."
msgstr ""
"A <em>reference field</em> iku sawijining kolom sing nyimpen hubungan "
"antara sawijining entitas karo siji utawa luwih entitas liyane, sing "
"bisa wae saka jinis entitas sing padha utawa beda. Contone, sawijining "
"<em>Content reference</em> field ing sawijining jinis isi nyimpen "
"hubungan antara siji isi lan siji utawa luwih isi liyane."

msgid "What field types are available?"
msgstr "Apa jinis-jinis lapangan sing kasedhiya?"

msgid ""
"The following field types are provided by the core system and core "
"modules (many more are provided by contributed modules):"
msgstr ""
"Tipe lapangan ing ngisor iki disedhiyakake dening sistem inti lan "
"modul inti (akeh maneh disedhiyakake dening modul kontribusi):"

msgid ""
"Boolean, Number (provided by the core system): Stores true/false "
"values and numbers"
msgstr ""
"Boolean, Number (disedhiyakake dening sistem inti): Nyimpen nilai "
"bener/salah lan angka"

msgid ""
"Comment (provided by the core Comment module): Allows users to add "
"comments to an entity"
msgstr ""
"Komentar (sing disedhiyakake dening modul Comment inti): Nggoleki "
"pangguna kanggo nambah komentar menyang sawijining entitas"

msgid "Date, Timestamp (Datetime module): Stores dates and times"
msgstr "Tanggal, Timestamp (modul Datetime): Nyimpen tanggal lan wektu"

msgid "Email (core system): Stores email addresses"
msgstr "Email (core system): Nyimpen alamat email"

msgid "Link (Link module): Stores URLs and link text"
msgstr "Link (modul Link): Nyimpen URL lan teks pranala"

msgid "Telephone (Telephone module): Stores telephone numbers"
msgstr "Telephone (modhul Telephone): Nyimpen nomer telpon"

msgid "What is a formatter?"
msgstr "Apa iku formatter?"

msgid ""
"A <em>formatter</em> is a way to display a field; most field types "
"offer several types of formatters, and most formatters have settings "
"that further define how the field is displayed. It is also possible to "
"completely hide a field from display, and you have the option of "
"showing or hiding the field's label when it is displayed."
msgstr ""
"<em>Formatter</em> iku cara kanggo nampilake sawijining field; umume "
"jinis field menehi sawetara jinis formatter, lan umume formatter "
"nduweni setelan sing luwih nerangake carane field kasebut ditampilake. "
"Uga bisa kanggo ndhelikake field sakabehe saka tampilan, lan sampeyan "
"duwe pilihan kanggo nampilake utawa ndhelikake label field nalika "
"ditampilake."

msgid "What is a widget?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi widget?"

msgid ""
"A <em>widget</em> is a way to edit a field. Some field types, such as "
"plain text single-line fields, have only one widget available (in this "
"case, a single-line text input field). Other field types offer choices "
"for the widget; for example, single-valued <em>List</em> fields can "
"use a <em>Select</em> or <em>Radio button</em> widget for editing. "
"Many widget types have settings that further define how the field can "
"be edited."
msgstr ""
"<em>Widget</em> iku cara kanggo nyunting kolom. Sawetara jinis kolom, "
"kayata kolom teks polos siji baris, mung duwe siji <em>widget</em> "
"sing kasedhiya (ing kasus iki, kolom input teks siji baris). Jinis "
"kolom liyane menehi pilihan kanggo <em>widget</em>; contone, kolom "
"<em>List</em> sing mung nduweni siji nilai bisa nggunakake "
"<em>Select</em> utawa <em>Radio button</em> minangka <em>widget</em> "
"kanggo nyunting. Akeh jinis <em>widget</em> sing duwe setelan sing "
"luwih njlentrehake cara nyunting kolom kasebut."

msgid "Managing content structure overview"
msgstr "Ringkesan ngatur struktur isi"

msgid ""
"Besides the field modules listed in the previous section, there are "
"additional core modules that you can use to manage your content "
"structure:"
msgstr ""
"Saliyane modul lapangan sing wis kasebut ing bagean sadurunge, ana "
"modul inti tambahan sing bisa sampeyan gunakake kanggo ngatur struktur "
"konten sampeyan:"

msgid "Configure your system so that cron will run automatically."
msgstr "Atur sistemmu supaya cron bakal mlaku kanthi otomatis."

msgid "What are cron tasks?"
msgstr "Apa iku tugas cron?"

msgid ""
"To ensure that your site and its modules continue to function well, a "
"group of administrative operations should be run periodically. These "
"operations are called <em>cron</em> tasks, and running the tasks is "
"known as <em>running cron</em>. Depending on how often content is "
"updated on your site, you might need to run cron on a schedule ranging "
"from hourly to weekly to keep your site running well."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo njamin situs sampeyan lan modul-module tetep bisa digunakake "
"kanthi apik, sawetara operasi administratif perlu dijalankan kanthi "
"rutin. Operasi-operasi iki diarani tugas <em>cron</em>, lan proses "
"menjalankake tugas kasebut dikenal minangka <em>running cron</em>. "
"Gumantung saka seprapat pira konten ing situs sampeyan dianyari, "
"sampeyan bisa uga kudu menjalankan cron kanthi jadwal saka saben jam "
"nganti saben minggu supaya situs sampeyan tetep mlaku kanthi lancar."

msgid "What options are available for running cron?"
msgstr "Apa pilihan sing kasedhiya kanggo mbukak cron?"

msgid ""
"If the core Automated Cron module is installed, your site will run "
"cron periodically, on a schedule you can configure."
msgstr ""
"Yen modul Automated Cron inti wis diinstal, situs sampeyan bakal mlaku "
"cron kanthi periodik, miturut jadwal sing bisa sampeyan atur."

msgid ""
"You can set up a task on your web server to visit the <em> cron "
"URL</em>, which is unique to your site, on a schedule."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nyetel tugas ing server web kanggo ngunjungi <em> URL "
"cron</em>, sing unik kanggo situs sampeyan, kanthi jadwal."

msgid ""
"You can also run cron manually, but this is not the recommended way to "
"make sure it is run periodically."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan uga bisa mbukak cron kanthi manual, nanging iki dudu cara "
"sing disaranake supaya cron bisa mlaku kanthi rutin."

msgid ""
"If you want to run cron right now, click <em>Run cron</em> and wait "
"for cron to finish."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan pengin mbukak cron saiki uga, klik <em>Run cron</em> lan "
"enteni nganti cron rampung."

msgid ""
"If you have a way to configure tasks on your web server, copy the link "
"where it says <em>To run cron from outside the site, go to</em>. Set "
"up a task to visit that URL on your desired cron schedule, such as "
"once an hour or once a week. (On Linux-like servers, you can use the "
"<em>wget</em> command to visit a URL.) If you configure an outside "
"task, you should uninstall the Automated Cron module."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan duwe cara kanggo nyetel tugas-tugas ing server web "
"sampeyan, salin pranala ing ngendi ana tulisan <em>To run cron from "
"outside the site, go to</em>. Atur tugas kanggo ngunjungi URL kasebut "
"miturut jadwal cron sing dikarepake, kayata sapisan saben jam utawa "
"sapisan saben minggu. (Ing server kaya Linux, sampeyan bisa nggunakake "
"printah <em>wget</em> kanggo ngunjungi URL.) Yen sampeyan nyetel tugas "
"saka njaba, sampeyan kudu nge-uninstall modul Automated Cron."

msgid ""
"If you are not configuring an outside task, and you have the core "
"Automated Cron module installed, select a schedule for automated cron "
"runs in <em>Cron settings</em> &gt; <em>Run cron every</em>. Click "
"<em>Save configuration</em>."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan ora nyetel tugas saka njaba, lan sampeyan wis nginstal "
"modul Automated Cron inti, pilih jadwal kanggo mbukak cron otomatis "
"ing <em>Pengaturan Cron</em> &gt; <em>Jalankan cron saben</em>. Klik "
"<em>Simpen konfigurasi</em>."

msgid "What is a module?"
msgstr "Apa iku modul?"

msgid ""
"A <em>module</em> is a set of PHP, JavaScript, and/or CSS files that "
"extends site features and adds functionality. A set of <em>Core "
"modules</em> is distributed as part of the core software download. "
"Additional <em>Contributed modules</em> can be downloaded separately "
"from the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_module\">Download &amp; "
"Extend page on drupal.org</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Module</em> iku sawijining kumpulan file PHP, JavaScript, "
"lan/utawa CSS sing nambah fitur situs lan nambah fungsi. Kumpulan "
"<em>Core modules</em> disebarake minangka bagean saka undhuhan piranti "
"lunak inti. <em>Contributed modules</em> tambahan bisa diundhuh sacara "
"kapisah saka <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_module\">Kaca Download "
"&amp; Extend ing drupal.org</a>."

msgid "What is an Experimental module?"
msgstr "Apa iku modul Eksperimen?"

msgid ""
"An <em>Experimental</em> module is a module that is still in "
"development and is not yet stable. Using Experimental modules on "
"production sites is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"Modul <em>Experimental</em> iku modul sing isih ana ing tahap "
"pangembangan lan durung stabil. Nggunakake modul Experimental ing "
"situs produksi ora dianjurake."

msgid "What are installing and uninstalling?"
msgstr "Apa iku nginstal lan ngosongake?"

msgid ""
"Installing a core or downloaded contributed module means turning it "
"on, so that you can use its features and functionality. Uninstalling "
"means turning it off and removing all of its configuration. A module "
"cannot be uninstalled if another installed module depends on it, or if "
"you have created content on your site using the module -- you would "
"need to delete the content and uninstall dependent modules first."
msgstr ""
"Masang modul inti utawa modul kontribusi sing diunduh tegese nguripake "
"modul kasebut, supaya sampeyan bisa nggunakake fitur lan fungsi sing "
"ana. Nyopot modul tegese mateni modul kasebut lan ngilangi kabeh "
"konfigurasi. Modul ora bisa dicopot yen ana modul liyane sing wis "
"dipasang lan gumantung marang modul kasebut, utawa yen sampeyan wis "
"nggawe konten ing situs nggunakake modul kasebut -- sampeyan kudu "
"mbusak konten lan nyopot modul sing gumantung dhisik."

msgid "Extending overview"
msgstr "Ngluwihake ringkesan"

msgid ""
"See the related topics listed below for help performing tasks related "
"to extending the functionality of your site."
msgstr ""
"Delengen topik terkait sing kacathet ing ngisor iki kanggo pitulungan "
"nindakake tugas sing gegayutan karo nambahake fungsi situs sampeyan."

msgid "Maintaining and troubleshooting overview"
msgstr "Ringkesan njaga lan ngatasi masalah"

msgid ""
"Here are some tasks and hints related to maintaining your site, and "
"troubleshooting problems that may come up on your site. See the "
"related topics below for more information."
msgstr ""
"Mangkene sawetara tugas lan pitutur sing gegayutan karo njaga situs "
"sampeyan, lan ngrampungake masalah sing bisa muncul ing situs "
"sampeyan. Delengen topik-topik sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "Configure your site so that cron runs periodically."
msgstr "Konfigurasikna situs sampeyan supaya cron mlaku sacara periodik."

msgid ""
"If your site is not behaving as expected, clear the cache before "
"trying to diagnose the problem."
msgstr ""
"Yen situsmu ora tumindak kaya sing dikarepake, resiki cache luwih "
"dhisik sadurunge nyoba kanggo diagnosa masalah kasebut."

msgid ""
"There are several site reports that can help you diagnose problems "
"with your site. There are also two core modules that can be used for "
"error logging: Database Logging and Syslog."
msgstr ""
"Ana sawetara laporan situs sing bisa mbantu sampeyan diagnosa masalah "
"karo situs sampeyan. Uga ana rong modul inti sing bisa digunakake "
"kanggo logging kesalahan: Database Logging lan Syslog."

msgid ""
"Find the particular sub-type that you want to add the field to, and "
"click <em>Manage fields</em>."
msgstr ""
"Golek sub-jinis sing pengin sampeyan tambahake kolom, banjur klik "
"<em>Manage fields</em>."

msgid "Click <em>Add field</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Add field</em>."

msgid ""
"The <em>Label</em> field should now be visible; enter a label for the "
"field, which is used as the field label for both content editing and "
"content display."
msgstr ""
"Kahanan <em>Label</em> saiki kudu katon; lebokake label kanggo kahanan "
"iki, sing bakal digunakake minangka label kahanan kanggo loro "
"suntingan isi lan tampilan isi."

msgid "Click <em>Save and continue</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Simpen lan terusake</em>."

msgid ""
"On the next screen, enter a value for <em>Allowed number of "
"values</em>. You can limit the field to one value per entity item, a "
"set number of values, or set it to have unlimited values. Click "
"<em>Save field settings</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing layar sabanjure, lebokna nilai kanggo <em>Allowed number of "
"values</em>. Sampeyan bisa matesi kolom kanggo siji nilai saben item "
"entitas, jumlah nilai sing ditemtokake, utawa ngatur supaya nduweni "
"nilai tanpa wates. Klik <em>Save field settings</em>."

msgid ""
"On the next screen, optionally edit the settings for the field, which "
"vary depending on what field type you are creating. For all fields, "
"you can edit the <em>Label</em>, <em>Help text</em> (text to be "
"displayed below the field on the content editing page), and "
"<em>Required field</em> (to make it so a value must be entered in "
"order to save the content when editing). You can also configure a "
"default value for the field."
msgstr ""
"Ing layar sabanjure, sampeyan bisa milih kanggo ngowahi setelan kanggo "
"lapangan, sing beda-beda gumantung karo jinis lapangan sing digawe. "
"Kanggo kabeh lapangan, sampeyan bisa ngowahi <em>Label</em>, <em>Help "
"text</em> (teks sing bakal ditampilake ing ngisor lapangan ing kaca "
"sunting konten), lan <em>Required field</em> (supaya nilai kudu diisi "
"supaya bisa nyimpen konten nalika nyunting). Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel "
"nilai bawaan kanggo lapangan kasebut."

msgid ""
"Find the particular sub-type that you want to configure the display "
"of, and click <em>Manage display</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr ""
"Goleka sub-tipe tartamtu sing pengin sampeyan atur tampilané, banjur "
"klik <em>Manage display</em> ing dhaptar <em>Operations</em>."

msgid "Use the drag arrows to order the fields in your preferred order."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake panah seret kanggo ngatur kolom-kolom miturut urutan sing "
"sampeyan karepake."

msgid ""
"Drag any fields that you do not wish to see in the display to the "
"<em>Disabled</em> section."
msgstr ""
"Seret sembarang kolom sing sampeyan ora pengin katon ing tampilan "
"menyang bagean <em>Disabled</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Label</em> column, select the position for each field label "
"in the display, or <em>- Hidden -</em> to hide a label. You can also "
"choose <em>- Visually Hidden-</em> if you want the label's text to "
"appear in the HTML page, so that screen readers and search engines can "
"read it, but it will not be visible."
msgstr ""
"Ing kolom <em>Label</em>, pilih posisi kanggo saben label kolom ing "
"tampilan, utawa <em>- Hidden -</em> kanggo ndhelikake label. Sampeyan "
"uga bisa milih <em>- Visually Hidden -</em> yen pengin teks label "
"katon ing kaca HTML, supaya pembaca layar lan mesin panelusur bisa "
"maca, nanging ora bakal katon."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Format</em> column, select the formatter for displaying "
"each field."
msgstr ""
"Ing kolom <em>Format</em>, pilih formatter kanggo nampilake saben "
"kolom."

msgid ""
"After selecting the desired formatters, click the settings gear in "
"each row to change the settings for the formatter."
msgstr ""
"Sawise milih formatter sing dikarepake, klik lambang setelan ing saben "
"baris kanggo ngganti setelan kanggo formatter kasebut."

msgid "When you are done making changes, click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "Nalika sampeyan wis rampung nggawe owah-owahan, klik <em>Simpen</em>."

msgid ""
"Test the display for your entity sub-type by viewing an entity. If "
"needed, return to these steps to further refine the display."
msgstr ""
"Uji tampilan kanggo sub-tipe entitasmu kanthi ndeleng entitas. Yen "
"perlu, bali maneh menyang langkah iki kanggo ngasah tampilan luwih "
"lanjut."

msgid ""
"Find the particular sub-type that you want to configure the editing "
"form for, and click <em>Manage form display</em> in the "
"<em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr ""
"Golek jinis cilik sing pengin sampeyan atur formulir suntingane, "
"banjur klik <em>Manage form display</em> ing dhaptar "
"<em>Operations</em>."

msgid ""
"Drag any fields that you do not wish to see on the editing form to the "
"<em>Disabled</em> section."
msgstr ""
"Seret sembarang kolom sing ora pengin sampeyan delengi ing formulir "
"suntingan menyang bagean <em>Disabled</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Widget</em> column, select the widget for editing each "
"field."
msgstr "Ing kolom <em>Widget</em>, pilih widget kanggo ngowahi saben kolom."

msgid ""
"After selecting the desired widgets, click the settings gear in each "
"row to change the settings for the widget."
msgstr ""
"Sasampunipun milih widget ingkang dipunpengini, klik setelan gear ing "
"saben baris kanggé ngowahi setelan widget punika."

msgid ""
"Test the editing form for your entity sub-type by editing or creating "
"an entity. If needed, return to these steps to further refine the "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Uji formulir panyuntingan kanggo sub-jinis entitas sampeyan kanthi "
"nyunting utawa nggawe entitas. Yen perlu, bali maneh menyang "
"langkah-langkah iki kanggo luwih nyetel formulir kasebut."

msgid ""
"In <em>Add a new field</em>, select the type of reference field you "
"want to add. The <em>Reference</em> section of the select list shows "
"the most common types of reference field; choose <em>Other...</em> if "
"the entity type you want to reference is not listed."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Add a new field</em>, pilih jinis lapangan referensi sing "
"pengin sampeyan tambahake. Bagian <em>Reference</em> ing dhaptar "
"pilihan nuduhake jinis lapangan referensi sing paling umum; pilih "
"<em>Other...</em> yen jinis entitas sing pengin sampeyan referensi ora "
"ana ing dhaptar."

msgid ""
"On the next screen, verify that the type of entity you want to "
"reference is shown in <em>Type of item to reference</em>, or select it "
"if not. Enter a value for <em>Allowed number of values</em>. You can "
"limit the field to one value per entity item, a set number of values, "
"or set it to have unlimited values. Click <em>Save field "
"settings</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing layar sabanjure, priksa manawa jinis entitas sing pengin sampeyan "
"referensi wis ditampilake ing <em>Type of item to reference</em>, "
"utawa pilih yen durung ana. Lebokake nilai kanggo <em>Allowed number "
"of values</em>. Sampeyan bisa matesi kolom kasebut supaya mung siji "
"nilai saben item entitas, jumlah nilai tetep, utawa nyetel supaya duwe "
"nilai tanpa wates. Klik <em>Save field settings</em>."

msgid ""
"On the next screen, optionally edit the settings for <em>Label</em>, "
"<em>Help text</em> (text to be displayed below the field on the "
"content editing page), and <em>Required field</em> (to make it so a "
"value must be entered in order to save the content when editing)."
msgstr ""
"Ing layar sabanjure, sampeyan bisa ngowahi setelan kanggo "
"<em>Label</em>, <em>Tèks bantuan</em> (tèks sing bakal ditampilake "
"ing ngisor kolom nalika nyunting isi), lan <em>Kolom wajib</em> "
"(kanggo nggawe supaya nilai kudu diisi supaya isi bisa disimpen nalika "
"nyunting)."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Reference type</em> section, you will usually want to limit "
"the entity sub-types that can be referenced; for example, if you are "
"creating a <em>Content</em> reference, you can check one or two "
"<em>Content type</em> choices. The choices will be easier for content "
"editors to scan if you also choose a sort value (normally the entity "
"title or label field)."
msgstr ""
"Ing bagean <em>Reference type</em>, biasane sampeyan pengin matesi "
"sub-jinis entitas sing bisa direferensi; contone, yen sampeyan nggawe "
"referensi <em>Content</em>, sampeyan bisa milih siji utawa loro "
"pilihan <em>Content type</em>. Pilihan-pilihan iki bakal luwih gampang "
"dipriksa dening editor konten yen sampeyan uga milih nilai sort "
"(biasane judhul entitas utawa kolom label)."

msgid "Clear the data in the site cache."
msgstr "Resikna data ing cache situs."

msgid "What is the cache?"
msgstr "Apa iku cache?"

msgid ""
"Some of the calculations that are done when your site loads a page "
"take a long time to run. To save time when these calculations would "
"need to be done again, their results can be <em>cached</em> in your "
"site's database. There are internal mechanisms to <em>clear</em> "
"cached data when the conditions or assumptions that went into the "
"calculation have changed, but you can also clear cached data manually. "
"When your site is misbehaving, a good first step is to clear the cache "
"and see if the problem goes away."
msgstr ""
"Sawetara itungan sing ditindakake nalika situs sampeyan mbukak "
"sawijining kaca mbutuhake wektu sing suwe kanggo dieksekusi. Kanggo "
"ngirit wektu nalika itungan iki kudu ditindakake maneh, asil kasebut "
"bisa <em>cached</em> ing basis data situs sampeyan. Ana mekanisme "
"internal kanggo <em>clear</em> data cached nalika kahanan utawa asumsi "
"sing digunakake kanggo itungan wis owah, nanging sampeyan uga bisa "
"ngresiki data cached kanthi manual. Nalika situs sampeyan ora mlaku "
"kanthi bener, langkah pisanan sing apik yaiku ngresiki cache lan "
"ndeleng apa masalah kasebut sirna."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Clear all caches</em>. Your site's cached data will be "
"cleared."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Clear all caches</em>. Data cache situs sampeyan bakal "
"dibersihake."

msgid ""
"Put your site in maintenance mode to perform maintenance operations, "
"and then return to normal mode when finished."
msgstr ""
"Pasang situs sampeyan ing mode pangopènan kanggo nindakaké operasi "
"pangopènan, banjur bali menyang mode normal nalika wis rampung."

msgid "What is maintenance mode?"
msgstr "Apa iku mode pangopènan?"

msgid ""
"When your site is in maintenance mode, most site visitors will see a "
"simple maintenance mode message page, rather than being able to use "
"the full functionality of the site. Users with <em>Use the site in "
"maintenance mode</em> permission who are already logged in will be "
"able to use the full site, and the log in page at <em>/user</em> will "
"also be accessible to anyone."
msgstr ""
"Nalika situs sampeyan ana ing mode pangopènan, umume pengunjung situs "
"bakal weruh kaca pesen mode pangopènan sing prasaja, tinimbang bisa "
"nggunakake kabèh fungsi situs. Pangguna sing nduwèni ijin "
"<em>Gunakake situs ing mode pangopènan</em> lan wis mlebu bakal bisa "
"nggunakake situs kanthi lengkap, lan kaca mlebu ing <em>/user</em> uga "
"bakal bisa diakses dening sapa waé."

msgid ""
"Check <em>Put site into maintenance mode</em>, optionally change the "
"<em>Message to display when in maintenance mode</em>, and click "
"<em>Save configuration</em>. Your site will be in maintenance mode."
msgstr ""
"Centhang <em>Put site into maintenance mode</em>, kanthi pilihan ganti "
"<em>Message to display when in maintenance mode</em>, banjur klik "
"<em>Save configuration</em>. Situs sampeyan bakal mlebu mode "
"pangopènan."

msgid "Perform your maintenance operations."
msgstr "Lakoni operasi pangopènan sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Uncheck <em>Put site into maintenance mode</em> and click <em>Save "
"configuration</em>. Your site will be back in normal operation mode."
msgstr ""
"Copot centhang <em>Put site into maintenance mode</em> lan klik "
"<em>Save configuration</em>. Situs sampeyan bakal bali menyang mode "
"operasi normal."

msgid ""
"Install a core module, or a contributed module that has already been "
"downloaded."
msgstr "Pasang modul inti, utawa modul kontribusi sing wis diundhuh."

msgid ""
"Enter a word from the module name or description into the filter box, "
"to make the list of modules smaller. Locate the module you want to "
"install."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna tembung saka jeneng modul utawa gambaran menyang kothak "
"filter, supaya dhaptar modul dadi luwih cilik. Golek modul sing pengin "
"diinstal."

msgid ""
"Check the box next to the name of the module you want to install; you "
"can also check more than one box to install multiple modules at the "
"same time. If the checkbox is disabled for the module you are trying "
"to install, expand the information to see why -- you may need to "
"download an additional module that your module requires."
msgstr ""
"Centhang kothak jejere jeneng modul sing arep sampeyan instal; "
"sampeyan uga bisa milih luwih saka siji kothak kanggo nginstal "
"sawetara modul sekaligus. Yen kothak centhang dipatèni kanggo modul "
"sing arep sampeyan instal, bukak informasi luwih jero kanggo ndeleng "
"sebabé -- sampeyan bisa uga kudu ngundhuh modul tambahan sing "
"dibutuhake modul sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Install</em> at the bottom of the page. If you chose to "
"install a module with dependencies that were not already installed, or "
"if you chose an Experimental module, confirm your choice on the next "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Install</em> ing ngisor kaca. Yen sampeyan milih nginstal "
"modul sing nduweni ketergantungan sing durung diinstal, utawa yen "
"sampeyan milih modul Eksperimen, konfirmasi pilihan sampeyan ing kaca "
"sabanjure."

msgid ""
"Wait for the module (or modules) to be installed. You should be "
"returned to the <em>Extend</em> page with a message saying the module "
"or modules were installed."
msgstr ""
"Tunggu nganti modul (utawa modul-modul) dipasang. Sampeyan bakal "
"dibalekake menyang kaca <em>Extend</em> karo pesen sing ngomong modul "
"utawa modul-modul wis dipasang."

msgid ""
"Enter a word from the module name or description into the filter box, "
"to make the list of modules smaller. Locate the module you want to "
"uninstall."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna tembung saka jeneng modul utawa katrangan ing kothak saringan, "
"supaya dhaptar modul dadi luwih cilik. Golek modul sing pengin "
"sampeyan copot pemasangane."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Description</em> column, see if there are reasons that this "
"module cannot be uninstalled. For example, you may have created "
"content using this module (which you would need to delete first), or "
"there may be another module installed that requires this module to be "
"installed (you would need to uninstall the other module first)."
msgstr ""
"Ing kolom <em>Description</em>, priksa apa ana alesane modul iki ora "
"bisa dicopot. Contone, sampeyan bisa uga wis nggawe isi nggunakake "
"modul iki (sing kudu sampeyan hapus dhisik), utawa bisa uga ana modul "
"liyane sing wis dipasang sing mbutuhake modul iki supaya tetep "
"dipasang (sampeyan kudu nyopot modul liyane dhisik)."

msgid ""
"If there are no reasons listed, the module can be uninstalled. Check "
"the box in the <em>Uninstall</em> column, next to the module's name."
msgstr ""
"Yen ora ana alesan sing kacathet, modul bisa dicopot. Centhang kothak "
"ing kolom <em>Uninstall</em>, sacedhake jeneng modul kasebut."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Uninstall</em> at the bottom of the page. Verify the list of "
"modules to be uninstalled and configuration to be deleted on the "
"confirmation page, and click <em>Uninstall</em>."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Uninstall</em> ing ngisor kaca. Priksa dhaptar modul sing "
"bakal dicopot lan konfigurasi sing bakal dibusak ing kaca konfirmasi, "
"banjur klik <em>Uninstall</em>."

msgid ""
"Wait for the module to be uninstalled. You should be returned to the "
"<em>Uninstall</em> page with a message saying the module was "
"uninstalled."
msgstr ""
"Enteni nganti modul dicopot. Sampeyan bakal bali menyang kaca "
"<em>Uninstall</em> kanthi pesen sing ngandhani yen modul wis dicopot."

msgid "Run reports to learn about the status and health of your site."
msgstr "Mbukak laporan kanggo ngerti status lan kahanan situs sampeyan."

msgid ""
"If you have the core Database Logging module installed, in the "
"<em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Reports</em> &gt; "
"<em>Recent log messages</em> to see a report of the error and "
"informational messages your site has generated. You can filter the "
"report by <em>Severity</em> to see only the most critical messages, if "
"desired."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan wis masang modul Database Logging inti, ing menu "
"administrasi <em>Manage</em>, bukak menyang <em>Reports</em> &gt; "
"<em>Recent log messages</em> kanggo ndeleng laporan pesen kesalahan "
"lan informasi sing wis digawe situs sampeyan. Sampeyan bisa nyaring "
"laporan kanthi <em>Severity</em> kanggo mung ndeleng pesen sing paling "
"kritis, yen dikarepake."

msgid "Click <em>Add user</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah pangguna</em>."

msgid ""
"Enter the <em>Email address</em>, <em>Username</em>, and "
"<em>Password</em> (twice) for the new user."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna <em>Alamat Email</em>, <em>Jeneng panganggo</em>, lan "
"<em>Sandi</em> (kaping pindho) kanggo panganggo anyar."

msgid "Verify that the <em>Roles</em> checked for the new user are correct."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa <em>Peran</em> sing wis dipilih kanggo pangguna anyar "
"wis bener."

msgid ""
"If you want the new user to receive an email message notifying them of "
"the new account, check <em>Notify user of new account</em>."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan pengin pangguna anyar nampa pesen email sing ngabari "
"babagan akun anyar, centhang <em>Notify user of new account</em>."

msgid "Optionally, change other settings on the form."
msgstr "Sakliyane, ganti setelan liyane ing formulir."

msgid "Click <em>Create new account</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Create new account</em>."

msgid ""
"You will be left on the <em>Add user</em> page; repeat these steps if "
"you have more user accounts to create."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bakal tetep ana ing kaca <em>Add user</em>; baleni "
"langkah-langkah iki yen sampeyan duwe akun pangguna luwih akeh sing "
"kudu digawe."

msgid "Create a new role."
msgstr "Gawe peran anyar."

msgid "Click <em>Add role</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Add role</em>."

msgid ""
"Enter the desired <em>Role name</em>. If desired, click <em>Edit</em> "
"to change the <em>Machine name</em> for the role."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna <em>Jeneng Peran</em> sing dikarepake. Yen pengin, klik "
"<em>Edit</em> kanggo ngganti <em>Jeneng Mesin</em> saka peran kasebut."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. You should be returned to the <em>Roles</em> page "
"and your new role should be in the role list."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Simpen</em>. Sampeyan bakal bali menyang kaca <em>Peran</em> "
"lan peran anyar sampeyan kudu ana ing daftar peran."

msgid "What is a user?"
msgstr "Apa iku pangguna?"

msgid ""
"A user is anyone accessing or viewing your site. <em>Anonymous</em> "
"users are users who are not logged in, and <em>Authenticated</em> "
"users are users who are logged in."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna iku sapa wae sing ngakses utawa ndeleng situs sampeyan. "
"Pangguna <em>Anonim</em> iku pangguna sing durung mlebu, lan pangguna "
"<em>Terotentikasi</em> iku pangguna sing wis mlebu."

msgid "What is a role?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi peran?"

msgid ""
"<em>Roles</em> are used to group and classify users; each user can be "
"assigned one or more roles. There are also special roles for all "
"anonymous and all authenticated users."
msgstr ""
"<em>Peran</em> digunakake kanggo nglompokaké lan ngklasifikasèkaké "
"pangguna; saben pangguna bisa diwènèhi siji utawa luwih peran. Ana "
"uga peran khusus kanggo kabèh pangguna anonim lan kabèh pangguna "
"sing wis otentikasi."

msgid "What is a permission?"
msgstr "Apa iku ijin?"

msgid ""
"Granting a <em>permission</em> to a role allows users who have been "
"assigned that role to perform an action on the site, such as viewing "
"content, editing or creating  a particular type of content, "
"administering settings for a particular module, or using a particular "
"function of the site (such as search)."
msgstr ""
"Menehi <em>izin</em> marang sawijining peran ngidini pangguna sing wis "
"diwènèhi peran kuwi bisa nindakake tumindak ing situs, kaya ndeleng "
"isi, nyunting utawa nggawe jinis isi tartamtu, ngatur setelan kanggo "
"modul tartamtu, utawa nggunakake fungsi tartamtu saka situs (kaya "
"panelusuran)."

msgid "Overview of managing user accounts and visitors"
msgstr "Gambaran umum babagan ngatur akun pangguna lan pengunjung"

msgid "Modify the permissions for an existing role."
msgstr "Owah-owahan ijin kanggo peran sing wis ana."

msgid ""
"Review the permissions for the role, paying particular attention to "
"the permissions marked with <em>Warning: Give to trusted roles only; "
"this permission has security implications.</em> Uncheck permissions "
"that this role should not have, in the row of the permission and the "
"column of the role; check permissions that this role should have."
msgstr ""
"Mirsani ijin kanggo peran kasebut, kanthi mringi perhatian khusus "
"marang ijin sing ditandhani <em>Peringatan: Mung wenehake marang peran "
"sing dipercaya; ijin iki nduweni implikasi keamanan.</em> Copot "
"centhang ijin sing ora pantes kanggo peran iki, ing baris ijin lan "
"kolom peran; centhang ijin sing pantes kanggo peran iki."

msgid "Click <em>Save permissions</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Simpen hak akses</em>."

msgid "Update or delete an existing user account."
msgstr "Nganyari utawa mbusak akun pangguna sing wis ana."

msgid ""
"Enter all or part of the user name or email address of the user "
"account you want to update or delete, and click <em>Filter</em>. A "
"short list of user accounts, including the account of interest, should "
"be shown in the table; if not, modify the filter text until you can "
"find the account of interest."
msgstr ""
"Lebokake kabeh utawa bagean saka jeneng pangguna utawa alamat email "
"akun pangguna sing pengin sampeyan nganyari utawa mbusak, banjur klik "
"<em>Filter</em>. Dhaptar cekak akun pangguna, kalebu akun sing dadi "
"kapentingan, kudu ditampilake ing tabel; yen ora, owahi teks filter "
"nganti sampeyan bisa nemokake akun sing dadi kapentingan."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Edit</em> in the <em>Operations</em> area of the account of "
"interest."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Edit</em> ing area <em>Operations</em> saka akun sing "
"disenengi."

msgid ""
"To delete the user account, scroll to the bottom and click <em>Cancel "
"account</em>. Select what you want to happen to the user's content on "
"the next screen, and click <em>Cancel account</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mbusak akun pangguna, gulung mudhun menyang ngisor lan klik "
"<em>Cancel account</em>. Pilih apa sing pengin kedadeyan karo isi "
"pangguna ing layar sabanjure, banjur klik <em>Cancel account</em>."

msgid ""
"To update the user account, enter new values in the form and click "
"<em>Save</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nganyari akun pangguna, lebokake nilai anyar ing formulir lan "
"klik <em>Save</em>."

msgid "Selection handler"
msgstr "Penangani pilihan"

msgid "Selection handler settings"
msgstr "Setelan pangatur pilihan"

msgid "Programming languages"
msgstr "Basa pemrograman"

msgid "Media has been removed."
msgstr "Media wis dibusak."

msgid "Olivero Utilities"
msgstr "Olivero Utilitas"

msgid "Enable mobile menu at all widths"
msgstr "Aktifake menu seluler ing kabèh wiyar layar"

msgid "Header site branding background color"
msgstr "Werna latar mburi branding situs header"

msgid "Search by keyword or phrase."
msgstr "Telusuri miturut tembung kunci utawa frase."

msgid "Nav Medium"
msgstr "Nav Medium"

msgid "Grid Medium"
msgstr "Grid Medium"

msgid "Grid Max"
msgstr "Grid Maks"

msgid "Olivero"
msgstr "Olivero"

msgid "olivero settings"
msgstr "setelan olivero"

msgid ""
"Schema information for module %module was missing from the database. "
"You should manually review the module updates and your database to "
"check if any updates have been skipped up to, and including, "
"%last_update_hook."
msgstr ""
"Informasi skema kanggo modul %module ora ana ing basis data. Sampeyan "
"kudu mriksa kanthi manual pembaruan modul lan basis data sampeyan "
"kanggo mriksa yen ana pembaruan sing wis dilewati nganti, lan kalebu, "
"%last_update_hook."

msgid ""
"Add, remove, or rearrange the fields on personal and site-wide contact "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"Tambah, copot, utawa atur maneh kolom-kolom ing formulir kontak "
"pribadi lan situs sakabehe."

msgid "What are the fields on contact forms?"
msgstr "Apa sing dimaksud karo kolom-kolom ing formulir kontak?"

msgid ""
"Click <em>Manage fields</em> for the form you want to change the "
"fields of, and add or remove one or more fields on the form."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Manage fields</em> kanggo formulir sing pengin sampeyan ganti "
"kolom-kolomé, lan tambah utawa copot siji utawa luwih kolom ing "
"formulir kasebut."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Manage form display</em> to change the order or "
"configuration of the fields on the form."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Manage form display</em> kanggo ngganti urutan utawa "
"konfigurasi kolom-kolom ing formulir kasebut."

msgid "Configure personal contact forms for registered users on the website."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikna formulir kontak pribadi kanggo pangguna sing wis "
"ndaftar ing situs web."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Contact settings</em> section, check/uncheck the box to "
"enable/disable the contact form for new user accounts."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Contact settings</em> bagean, centhang/mbusak centhang ing "
"kothak kanggo ngaktifake/ngilangi formulir kontak kanggo akun pangguna "
"anyar."

msgid "Click <em>Save configuration</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Simpen konfigurasi</em>."

msgid ""
"Verify that permissions are correct for your site's roles, including "
"the generic <em>Anonymous user</em> and <em>Authenticated user</em>. "
"In order to use personal contact forms, users need both <em>View user "
"information</em> (in the <em>User</em> section, which enables them to "
"view user profiles) and <em>Use users' personal contact forms</em> (in "
"the <em>Contact</em> section, which enables them to use contact forms "
"if they can view user profiles)."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa ijin wis bener kanggo peran situs panjenengan, kalebu "
"<em>Anonymous user</em> lan <em>Authenticated user</em> sing umum. "
"Supaya bisa nggunakake formulir kontak pribadi, pangguna kudu duwe "
"<em>View user information</em> (ing bagean <em>User</em>, sing ngidini "
"dheweke ndeleng profil pangguna) lan <em>Use users' personal contact "
"forms</em> (ing bagean <em>Contact</em>, sing ngidini dheweke "
"nggunakake formulir kontak yen bisa ndeleng profil pangguna)."

msgid "Create a new site-wide contact form."
msgstr "Gawé formulir kontak situs kabèh anyar."

msgid "Click <em>Add contact form</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah formulir kontak</em>."

msgid ""
"Fill in the <em>Label</em> (title) for the form, <em>Recipients</em>, "
"and optionally the other settings."
msgstr ""
"Iseni <em>Label</em> (judul) kanggo formulir, <em>Recipients</em>, lan "
"pilihan liyane saka setelan."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. You should see your new contact form in the "
"table, along with a link to view it."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Simpen</em>. Sampeyan kudu weruh formulir kontak anyar ing "
"tabel, bebarengan karo pranala kanggo ndeleng."

msgid "What are contact forms?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi formulir kontak?"

msgid ""
"There are two different types of contact forms provided by the core "
"Contact module: personal contact forms, which allow users to contact "
"other users on the site, and site-wide contact forms, which allow "
"users to contact site managers or administrators. A site can have more "
"than one site-wide contact form; each has its own fields to fill out, "
"recipients, and URL; you can also change the fields that are shown on "
"personal contact forms."
msgstr ""
"Ana rong jinis formulir kontak sing beda sing disedhiyakake dening "
"modul Kontak inti: formulir kontak pribadi, sing ngidini pangguna "
"kanggo ngubungi pangguna liyane ing situs, lan formulir kontak "
"situs-umum, sing ngidini pangguna kanggo ngubungi manajer situs utawa "
"administrator. Siji situs bisa nduweni luwih saka siji formulir kontak "
"situs-umum; saben formulir nduweni kolom isian, panrima, lan URL "
"dhewe-dhewe; sampeyan uga bisa ngganti kolom sing ditampilake ing "
"formulir kontak pribadi."

msgid ""
"Site visitors can email registered users on your site by using the "
"personal contact form, without knowing or learning the email address "
"of the recipient. When a user with the correct permissions is viewing "
"another user's profile, the viewer will see a <em>Contact</em> tab or "
"link, which leads to the personal contact form if the user whose "
"profile is being viewed has their personal contact form enabled (this "
"is a user account setting)."
msgstr ""
"Pengunjung situs bisa ngirim email marang pangguna sing wis kadhaptar "
"ing situs sampeyan kanthi nggunakake formulir kontak pribadi, tanpa "
"kudu ngerti utawa sinau alamat email saka sing dituju. Nalika pangguna "
"sing duwe hak akses sing bener ndelok profil pangguna liyane, sing "
"ndelok bakal weruh tab utawa pranala <em>Contact</em>, sing bakal "
"nuntun menyang formulir kontak pribadi yen pangguna sing profilé "
"didelok wis ngaktifake formulir kontak pribadi (iki minangka setelan "
"akun pangguna)."

msgid "Contact form management tasks"
msgstr "Tugas pangelolaan formulir kontak"

msgid "See the related topics below for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Delengen topik sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki kanggo tugas-tugas "
"khusus."

msgid "Click <em>Edit</em> for the site-wide form you want to be the default."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Edit</em> kanggo formulir sak situs sing pengin sampeyan "
"jadikan standar."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save settings</em>. You should be returned to the <em>Manage "
"fields</em> page, with your new field in the list."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save settings</em>. Sampeyan bakal bali menyang kaca "
"<em>Manage fields</em>, karo lapangan anyar sampeyan ana ing daftar."

msgid ""
"Whether to force the output to be an absolute link (beginning with "
"http: or https:)"
msgstr ""
"Apa arep meksa output supaya dadi tautan absolut (diwiwiti karo http: "
"utawa https:)"

msgid ""
"Whether to force this URL to point to a secure location (beginning "
"with https:)"
msgstr ""
"Apa arep meksa URL iki kanggo nuduhake alamat sing aman (diwiwiti karo "
"https:)"

msgid "Checked %langcode translation for %project."
msgstr "Wis dipriksa terjemahan %langcode kanggo %project."

msgid "Downloaded %langcode translation for %project."
msgstr "Nggundhuh terjemahan %langcode kanggo %project."

msgid "Importing %langcode translation for %project."
msgstr "Nggimpor terjemahan %langcode kanggo %project."

msgid "Imported %langcode translation for %project."
msgstr "Terjemahan %langcode sing diimpor kanggo %project."

msgid ""
"It looks like you have content on your new site which <strong>may be "
"overwritten</strong> if you continue to run this upgrade. The upgrade "
"should be performed on a clean Drupal @version installation. For more "
"information see the <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">upgrade handbook</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kayane sampeyan nduweni isi ing situs anyar sing <strong>mbisa "
"ditindhes</strong> yen terus nerusake nglakokake peningkatan iki. "
"Peningkatan kudu dilakokake ing instalasi Drupal @version sing resik. "
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap delengen <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">pandhuan peningkatan</a>."

msgid ""
"An upgrade has already been performed on this site. To perform a new "
"migration, create a clean and empty new install of Drupal @version. "
"Rollbacks are not yet supported through the user interface. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":url\">upgrading handbook</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pembaruan wis rampung ing situs iki. Kanggo nindakake migrasi anyar, "
"gawe instalasi Drupal @version sing resik lan kosong. Rollback durung "
"didhukung liwat antarmuka pangguna. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":url\">pandhuan pembaruan</a>."

msgid ""
"Upgrade a site by importing its files and the data from its database "
"into a clean and empty new install of Drupal @version. See the <a "
"href=\":url\">Drupal site upgrades handbook</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Nganyari situs kanthi ngimpor file-file lan data saka basis data "
"menyang instalasi anyar Drupal @version sing resik lan kosong. Deleng "
"<a href=\":url\">buku pandhuan nganyari situs Drupal</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"This empty Drupal @version installation you will import the old site "
"to."
msgstr ""
"Instalasi Drupal @version kang kosong iki sing bakal sampeyan gunakake "
"kanggo ngimpor situs lawas."

msgid "The menu name (= set name) for this shortcut link."
msgstr "Jeneng menu (= jeneng set) kanggo pranala cendhak iki."

msgid ""
"There are errors with some installed themes. Visit the <a "
"href=\":link\">status report page</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ana kesalahan karo sawetara tema sing wis diinstal. Bukak <a "
"href=\":link\">kaca laporan status</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"There are errors with some installed modules. Visit the <a "
"href=\":link\">status report page</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ana kesalahan karo sawetara modul sing wis dipasang. Bukak <a "
"href=\":link\">kaca laporan status</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"Display machine name must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, or "
"underscores."
msgstr ""
"Jeneng mesin tampilan kudu mung ngemot huruf cilik, angka, utawa garis "
"ngisor."

msgid ""
"Module %name has an entry in the system.schema key/value storage, but "
"is missing from your site. <a href=\":url\">More information about "
"this error</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul %name nduwèni entri ing panyimpenan kunci/nilai system.schema, "
"nanging ora ana ing situsmu. <a href=\":url\">Informasi luwih lengkap "
"babagan kesalahan iki</a>."

msgid ""
"Module %name has an entry in the system.schema key/value storage, but "
"is not installed. <a href=\":url\">More information about this "
"error</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul %name nduwèni entri ing penyimpenan kunci/nilai system.schema, "
"nanging durung dipasang. <a href=\":url\">Informasi luwih lengkap "
"babagan kesalahan iki</a>."

msgid "Search form (narrow)"
msgstr "Formulir telusuran (sempit)"

msgid "Search form (wide)"
msgstr "Formulir panelusuran (ambané)"

msgid "What are breakpoints?"
msgstr "Apa sing diarani breakpoints?"

msgid ""
"Breakpoints are the point at which your site's content will respond to "
"provide the user with the best possible layout to consume the "
"information. A breakpoint separates the height or width of viewports "
"(screens, printers, and other media output types) into steps. For "
"instance, a width breakpoint of 40em creates two steps: one for widths "
"up to 40em and one for widths above 40em. Breakpoints can be used to "
"define when layouts should shift from one form to another, when images "
"should be resized, and other changes that need to respond to changes "
"in viewport height or width."
msgstr ""
"Breakpoints iku titik ing ngendi isi situs web sampeyan bakal nanggapi "
"supaya pangguna bisa entuk tata letak paling apik kanggo maca "
"informasi. Breakpoint misahake dhuwur utawa ambane viewport (layar, "
"printer, lan jinis output media liyane) dadi sawetara langkah. "
"Contone, breakpoint ambane 40em nggawe loro langkah: siji kanggo "
"ambane nganti 40em lan siji maneh kanggo ambane luwih saka 40em. "
"Breakpoints bisa digunakake kanggo nemtokake kapan tata letak kudu "
"pindhah saka siji wujud menyang wujud liyane, kapan gambar kudu "
"diperkecil, lan owah-owahan liyane sing kudu nanggapi perubahan ing "
"dhuwur utawa ambane viewport."

msgid "What are media queries?"
msgstr "Apa iku media queries?"

msgid ""
"Media  queries are a formal way to encode breakpoints. For instance, a "
"width breakpoint at 40em would be written as the media query "
"\"(min-width: 40em)\". Breakpoints are really just media queries with "
"some additional meta-data, such as a name and multiplier information."
msgstr ""
"Media queries iku cara resmi kanggo nulis breakpoint. Contone, "
"breakpoint ambane 40em ditulis nganggo media query \"(min-width: "
"40em)\". Breakpoint saktenane mung media queries sing nduwèni "
"meta-data tambahan, kaya jeneng lan informasi multiplier."

msgid "What are resolution multipliers?"
msgstr "Apa iku pengali resolusi?"

msgid "What is a breakpoint group?"
msgstr "Apa iku grup breakpoint?"

msgid "Managing breakpoints and breakpoint groups overview"
msgstr "Nglola breakpoint lan ringkesan grup breakpoint"

msgid ""
"The <em>Breakpoint</em> module allows you to define breakpoints and "
"breakpoint groups in YAML files. Modules and themes can use the API "
"provided by the <em>Breakpoint</em> module to define breakpoints and "
"breakpoint groups, and to assign resolution multipliers to "
"breakpoints."
msgstr ""
"Modul <em>Breakpoint</em> ngidini sampeyan nemtokake breakpoint lan "
"grup breakpoint ing file YAML. Modul lan tema bisa nggunakake API sing "
"diwenehake dening modul <em>Breakpoint</em> kanggo nemtokake "
"breakpoint lan grup breakpoint, uga kanggo menehi multiplikator "
"resolusi marang breakpoint."

msgid "W3C standards for media queries"
msgstr "Standar W3C kanggo media queries"

msgid "What is a theme?"
msgstr "Apa iku tema?"

msgid ""
"A <em>theme</em> is a set of files that define the visual look and "
"feel of your site. The core software and modules that run on your site "
"determine which content (including HTML text and other data stored in "
"the database, uploaded images, and any other asset files) is displayed "
"on the pages of your site. The theme determines the HTML markup and "
"CSS styling that wraps the content. Several basic themes are supplied "
"with the core software; additional <em>contributed themes</em> can be "
"downloaded separately from the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_theme\">Download &amp; "
"Extend page on drupal.org</a>, or you can create your own theme."
msgstr ""
"<em>Theme</em> iku sakumpulan berkas sing nemtokake tampilan visual "
"lan rasa saka situs sampeyan. Piranti lunak inti lan modul-modul sing "
"mlaku ing situs sampeyan nemtokake konten apa (kalebu teks HTML lan "
"data liyane sing disimpen ing basis data, gambar sing diunggah, lan "
"berkas aset liyane) sing ditampilake ing kaca-kaca situs sampeyan. "
"Theme nemtokake markup HTML lan gaya CSS sing mbungkus konten kuwi. "
"Sawetara theme dhasar wis kasedhiya bareng piranti lunak inti; "
"<em>theme kontribusi</em> tambahan bisa diundhuh kapisah saka <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_theme\">Kaca Download "
"&amp; Extend ing drupal.org</a>, utawa sampeyan bisa nggawe theme "
"sampeyan dhéwé."

msgid "What is a base theme?"
msgstr "Apa iku tema dhasar?"

msgid "What is a layout?"
msgstr "Apa iku layout?"

msgid "Changing site appearance overview"
msgstr "Ringkesan owah-owahan tampilan situs"

msgid ""
"The core Field UI module provides a user interface for managing fields "
"and their display on entities."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Field UI nyedhiyakake antarmuka pangguna kanggo ngatur "
"lapangan lan tampilané ing entitas."

msgid ""
"The core Layout Builder module provides a more flexible user interface "
"for configuring the display of entities."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Layout Builder nyedhiyakake antarmuka panganggo sing luwih "
"fleksibel kanggo ngonfigurasi tampilan entitas."

msgid "What is site performance?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi kinerja situs?"

msgid ""
"Site performance, in this context, refers to speed factors such as the "
"page load time and the response time after a user action on a page."
msgstr ""
"Kinerja situs, ing konteks iki, nuduhake faktor kecepatan kaya wektu "
"muat kaca lan wektu tanggapan sawise tumindak pangguna ing sawijining "
"kaca."

msgid "What is caching?"
msgstr "Apa iku caching?"

msgid ""
"Caching is saving already-rendered HTML output and other calculated "
"data for later use the first time it is needed. This saves time, "
"because the next time the same data is needed it can be quickly "
"retrieved instead of recalculated. Automatic caching systems also "
"include mechanisms to delete cached calculations or mark them as no "
"longer valid when the underlying data changes. To facilitate that, "
"cached data has a <em>lifetime</em>, which is the maximum time before "
"the data will be deleted from the cache (forcing recalculation)."
msgstr ""
"Caching iku nyimpen output HTML sing wis dirender lan data sing wis "
"diitung kanggo digunakake mengko nalika pisanan dibutuhake. Iki ngirit "
"wektu, amarga wektu sabanjuré data sing padha dibutuhake, bisa "
"langsung dijupuk kanthi cepet tinimbang kudu diitung maneh. Sistem "
"caching otomatis uga nduwèni mekanisme kanggo mbusak itungan sing "
"disimpen utawa nandhani yen wis ora valid maneh nalika data dhasar "
"owah. Kanggo mempermudah iku, data sing dicache nduweni <em>masa "
"aktif</em>, yaiku wektu maksimal sadurunge data kasebut bakal dibusak "
"saka cache (nggawe perhitungan maneh)."

msgid "What is file aggregation?"
msgstr "Apa iku agregasi file?"

msgid ""
"Aggregation is when CSS and JavaScript files are merged together and "
"compressed into a format that is much smaller than the original. This "
"allows for faster transmission and faster rendering on the other end."
msgstr ""
"Agregasi yaiku nalika file CSS lan JavaScript digabungake lan dipres "
"dadi format sing luwih cilik tinimbang asline. Iki ngidini transmisi "
"luwih cepet lan tampilan luwih cepet ing sisih liyane."

msgid "What can I do to improve my site's performance?"
msgstr "Apa sing bisa tak lakoni kanggo ningkatake kinerja situsku?"

msgid "Internal Page Cache module"
msgstr "Modul Cache Kaca Internal"

msgid ""
"Caches pages requested by users who are not logged in (anonymous "
"users). Do not use if your site needs to send different output to "
"different anonymous users."
msgstr ""
"Nggedhekake kaca sing dijaluk dening pangguna sing ora mlebu (pangguna "
"anonim). Aja digunakake yen situs sampeyan perlu ngirim output sing "
"beda kanggo pangguna anonim sing beda-beda."

msgid "Internal Dynamic Page Cache module"
msgstr "Modul Internal Dynamic Page Cache"

msgid ""
"Caches data for both authenticated and anonymous users, with "
"non-cacheable data in the page converted to placeholders and "
"calculated when the page is requested."
msgstr ""
"Nyimpen data kanggo pangguna sing wis mlebu lan sing anonim, kanthi "
"data sing ora bisa disimpen ing cache ing kaca diganti dadi panggonan "
"kosong lan diitung nalika kaca kasebut dijaluk."

msgid "Big Pipe module"
msgstr "Modul Big Pipe"

msgid ""
"Changes the way pages are sent to users, so that cacheable parts are "
"sent out first with placeholders, and the uncacheable or personalized "
"parts of the page are streamed afterwards. This allows the browser to "
"render the bulk of the page quickly and fill in the details later."
msgstr ""
"Ngganti cara kaca dikirim menyang pangguna, supaya bagean sing bisa "
"disimpen ing cache dikirim dhisik nganggo placeholder, lan bagean kaca "
"sing ora bisa disimpen ing cache utawa sing dipersonalisasi disalurkan "
"mengko. Iki ngidini browser kanggo nampilake bagean utama kaca kanthi "
"cepet lan ngisi rincian mengko."

msgid "Performance page settings"
msgstr "Setelan kaca kinerja"

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, if you navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>Performance</em>, you will find a setting for the maximum cache "
"lifetime, as well as the ability to turn on CSS and JavaScript file "
"aggregation."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, yen sampeyan navigasi menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>Performance</em>, sampeyan bakal nemokake setelan kanggo umur "
"maksimal cache, uga kemampuan kanggo nguripake agregasi file CSS lan "
"JavaScript."

msgid "Online documentation for the Internal Page Cache module"
msgstr "Dokumentasi online kanggo modul Internal Page Cache"

msgid "Online documentation for the Internal Dynamic Page Cache module"
msgstr "Dokumentasi online kanggo modul Internal Dynamic Page Cache"

msgid "Online documentation for the BigPipe module"
msgstr "Dokumentasi online kanggo modul BigPipe"

msgid "What are the parts of a layout?"
msgstr "Apa wae bagean saka tata letak?"

msgid ""
"Find the particular sub-type that you want to create a layout for, and "
"click <em>Manage display</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr ""
"Goleki sub-tipe tartamtu sing pengin sampeyan gawe tata letak kanggo, "
"banjur klik <em>Manage display</em> ing dhaptar <em>Operations</em>."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Layout options</em>, check <em>Use Layout Builder</em>. You "
"can also check the box below to allow each entity item to have its "
"layout individually customized (if it is left unchecked, the site will "
"use the same layout for all items of this entity sub-type)."
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor <em>Layout options</em>, centhang <em>Use Layout "
"Builder</em>. Sampeyan uga bisa centhang kothak ing ngisor iki kanggo "
"ngidini saben item entitas nduweni layout sing dikustomisasi sacara "
"individu (yen ora dicenthang, situs bakal nggunakake layout sing padha "
"kanggo kabeh item saka sub-tipe entitas iki)."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the <em>Manage "
"display</em> page, but you will no longer see the table of fields of "
"the classic display manager."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save</em>. Sampeyan bakal bali menyang kaca <em>Manage "
"display</em>, nanging sampeyan ora bakal maneh weruh tabel kolom saka "
"classic display manager."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Manage layout</em> to enter layout management view. A "
"default layout will be set up for you, with a single one-column "
"section containing the fields on your entity sub-type."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Manage layout</em> kanggo mlebu tampilan manajemen layout. "
"Layout standar bakal disetel kanggo sampeyan, kanthi siji bagean kolom "
"siji sing ngemot kolom-kolom ing sub-tipe entitas sampeyan."

msgid ""
"To remove the default section and start from an empty layout, find and "
"click the <em>Remove</em> button for the default section, which looks "
"like an X. Confirm by clicking <em>Remove</em> in the pop-up dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mbusak bagean standar lan miwiti saka tata letak sing kosong, "
"golek lan klik tombol <em>Remove</em> kanggo bagean standar, sing "
"katon kaya huruf X. Konfirmasi kanthi ngeklik <em>Remove</em> ing "
"dialog pop-up."

msgid ""
"Add new sections, each with one to four columns, to your layout. For "
"instance, you might want a one-column section at the top, a two-column "
"section in the middle, and then a one-column section at the bottom. To "
"add a section, click <em>Add section</em> and click the desired number "
"of columns. For multi-column sections, set the column width "
"percentages and click <em>Add section</em> in the pop-up dialog."
msgstr ""
"Tambah bagean anyar, saben bagean nganggo siji nganti papat kolom, "
"menyang tata letak sampeyan. Contone, sampeyan bisa pengin bagean siji "
"kolom ing sisih ndhuwur, bagean loro kolom ing tengah, banjur bagean "
"siji kolom maneh ing sisih ngisor. Kanggo nambah bagean, klik <em>Add "
"section</em> banjur klik jumlah kolom sing dikarepake. Kanggo bagean "
"multi-kolom, atur persentase ambane kolom lan klik <em>Add "
"section</em> ing dialog sing muncul."

msgid ""
"In each section, click <em>Add block</em> to add a block. You will see "
"a list of the blocks available on your site, plus a section called "
"<em>Content fields</em> with a block for each field on your content "
"item. Each block can be configured, if desired, with a <em>Title</em>, "
"and for content field blocks, you can also configure the field "
"formatter. Continue to add blocks to your sections until all the "
"desired blocks and fields are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ing saben bagean, klik <em>Add block</em> kanggo nambah blok. Sampeyan "
"bakal weruh daftar blok sing kasedhiya ing situs sampeyan, uga bagean "
"sing diarani <em>Content fields</em> kanthi blok kanggo saben lapangan "
"ing item konten sampeyan. Saben blok bisa dikonfigurasi, yen "
"dikarepake, nganggo <em>Title</em>, lan kanggo blok lapangan konten, "
"sampeyan uga bisa konfigurasi formatter lapangan kasebut. Terusake "
"nambah blok menyang bagean sampeyan nganti kabeh blok lan lapangan "
"sing dikarepake katon."

msgid ""
"Verify your layout. You can check <em>Show content preview</em> to "
"show a preview of what your layout will look like, or uncheck it to "
"see the names of the fields and blocks in each section."
msgstr ""
"Priksa tata letak sampeyan. Sampeyan bisa mriksa <em>Show content "
"preview</em> kanggo nuduhake pratilik saka apa sing bakal katon ing "
"tata letak sampeyan, utawa copot priksa kanggo ndeleng jeneng-jeneng "
"kolom lan blok ing saben bagean."

msgid ""
"If needed, reorder the blocks by dragging them to new locations. If "
"you hover over a block, a contextual menu will appear that will let "
"you change the configuration of the block, remove the block, or "
"<em>Move</em> blocks within the section using a more compact "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Yen perlu, atur maneh blok-blok kuwi kanthi nyeret menyang panggonan "
"anyar. Yen kowe nge-hover ing blok, bakal metu menu kontekstual sing "
"ngidini kowe ngganti konfigurasi blok, mbusak blok, utawa "
"<em>Mindhah</em> blok-blok ing sajrone seksi nganggo antarmuka sing "
"luwih ringkes."

msgid "When you are satisfied with your layout, click <em>Save layout</em>."
msgstr "Nalika sampeyan wis puas karo tata letak, klik <em>Save layout</em>."

msgid "Creating layout defaults"
msgstr "Gawe standar layout"

msgid "Building Layouts Using the Layout Builder UI"
msgstr "Mbiyantu Tata Letak Nggunakake UI Layout Builder"

msgid ""
"Install a core theme, or a contributed theme that has already been "
"downloaded. Choose the default themes to use for the site and for "
"administrative pages."
msgstr ""
"Pasang tema inti, utawa tema kontribusi sing wis diundhuh. Pilih tema "
"bawaan kanggo digunakake ing situs lan kanggo kaca administrasi."

msgid ""
"Locate the themes that you want to use as the site default theme and "
"for administrative pages."
msgstr ""
"Temokake tema-tema sing pengin sampeyan gunakake minangka tema default "
"situs lan kanggo kaca administrasi."

msgid ""
"For each of these themes, if the theme is in the <em>Uninstalled "
"themes</em> section, click the <em>Install</em> link to install the "
"theme. Wait for the theme to be installed (translations might be "
"downloaded). You should be returned to the <em>Appearance</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo saben tema iki, yen tema kasebut ana ing bagean <em>Uninstalled "
"themes</em>, klik pranala <em>Install</em> kanggo masang tema kasebut. "
"Enteni nganti tema rampung dipasang (terjemahan bisa uga bakal "
"diundhuh). Sampeyan bakal dibalekake menyang kaca <em>Appearance</em>."

msgid ""
"Locate the theme that you want to be your default theme, which should "
"now be in the <em>Installed themes</em> section. If it is not already "
"labeled as the <em>default theme</em>, click the <em>Set as "
"default</em> link."
msgstr ""
"Temokake tema sing pengin dadi tema standar sampeyan, sing saiki kudu "
"ana ing bagean <em>Installed themes</em>. Yen durung ditandhani "
"minangka <em>default theme</em>, klik pranala <em>Set as default</em>."

msgid ""
"At the bottom of the page, select the <em>Administration theme</em> "
"that you want to use on administrative pages. Click <em>Save "
"configuration</em> if you selected a new theme."
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor kaca, pilih <em>Administration theme</em> sing arep "
"sampeyan gunakake ing kaca administrasi. Klik <em>Save "
"configuration</em> yen sampeyan wis milih tema anyar."

msgid ""
"If you changed the default theme for your site, visit the site home "
"page or another page on the non-administration part of your site and "
"verify that the site is using the new theme. If you changed the "
"administration theme, verify that the new theme is used on "
"administrative pages."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan ngganti tema standar kanggo situs sampeyan, bukak kaca "
"ngarep situs utawa kaca liyane ing bagean non-administrasi situs "
"sampeyan lan priksa manawa situs nggunakake tema anyar. Yen sampeyan "
"ngganti tema administrasi, priksa manawa tema anyar digunakake ing "
"kaca administrasi."

msgid ""
"Uninstall a theme that was previously installed, but is no longer "
"being used on the site."
msgstr ""
"Copot tema sing wis tau diinstal, nanging saiki ora digunakake maneh "
"ing situs kasebut."

msgid ""
"Locate the theme that you want to uninstall, in the <em>Installed "
"themes</em> section."
msgstr ""
"Temokake tema sing arep sampeyan copot, ing bagean <em>Installed "
"themes</em>."

msgid ""
"The form has become outdated. Press the back button, copy any unsaved "
"work in the form, and then reload the page."
msgstr ""
"Formulir wis kadaluwarsa. Tutul tombol bali, salin pekerjaan sing "
"durung disimpen ing formulir, banjur muat ulang kaca kasebut."

msgid "Deployment identifier"
msgstr "Pangidentifikasi penyebaran"

msgid "Configure one or more search pages."
msgstr "Konfigurasi siji utawa luwih kaca panelusuran."

msgid ""
"Scroll down to the <em>Search pages</em> section. You will see a list "
"of the already-configured search pages on your site."
msgstr ""
"Gulung mudhun menyang bagean <em>Search pages</em>. Kowé bakal weruh "
"dhaptar kaca panelusuran sing wis dikonfigurasi ing situsmu."

msgid ""
"To configure an existing search page, click <em>Edit</em>. Or, to add "
"a new search page, select the <em>Search page type</em> and click "
"<em>Add search page</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nyetel kaca panelusuran sing wis ana, klik <em>Edit</em>. "
"Utawa, kanggo nambah kaca panelusuran anyar, pilih <em>Jinis kaca "
"panelusuran</em> lan klik <em>Tambah kaca panelusuran</em>."

msgid ""
"Enter the desired <em>Label</em> name and URL <em>Path</em> for the "
"search page."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna jeneng <em>Label</em> lan <em>Path</em> URL sing dikarepake "
"kanggo kaca panelusuran."

msgid ""
"For <em>Content</em> search pages, select the desired level of "
"influence in ranking search results of the available <em>Content "
"ranking</em> factors."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo kaca panelusuran <em>Content</em>, pilih tingkat pengaruh sing "
"dikarepake ing rangking asil panelusuran saka faktor <em>Content "
"ranking</em> sing kasedhiya."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the <em>Search pages</em> "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save</em>. Sampeyan bakal dibalekake menyang kaca <em>Search "
"pages</em>."

msgid ""
"Verify that the correct search page is listed as <em>Default</em> in "
"the <em>Status</em> column. If not, click <em>Set as default</em> in "
"the <em>Operations</em> list for the correct search page."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa kaca panelusuran sing bener wis kadhaptar minangka "
"<em>Default</em> ing kolom <em>Status</em>. Yen durung, klik <em>Set "
"as default</em> ing dhaptar <em>Operations</em> kanggo kaca "
"panelusuran sing bener."

msgid ""
"Optionally, disable or delete any search pages that you do not want to "
"have available on the site (disabling is temporary, while deleting is "
"permanent)."
msgstr ""
"Sakliyane, mateni utawa mbusak kaca telusur apa wae sing ora pengin "
"sampeyan duwe ing situs (mateni iku sementara, dene mbusak iku "
"permanen)."

msgid ""
"Manage the search index, and make sure that the site is fully indexed "
"for searching."
msgstr ""
"Ngatur indeks panelusuran, lan priksa manawa situs wis diindeks kanthi "
"lengkap kanggo panelusuran."

msgid "What is the search index?"
msgstr "Apa iku indeks panelusuran?"

msgid ""
"Under <em>Indexing throttle</em>, select the <em>Number of items to "
"index per cron run</em>. A smaller number will make cron faster and "
"reduce the possibility of timeout; a larger number will make sure more "
"of your site is indexed in fewer cron runs."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Indexing throttle</em>, pilih <em>Number of items to index per "
"cron run</em>. Nomer sing luwih cilik bakal nggawe cron luwih cepet "
"lan ngurangi kemungkinan timeout; nomer sing luwih gedhe bakal njamin "
"luwih akeh bagean situs sampeyan kang diindeks kanthi jumlah cron sing "
"luwih sithik."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Default indexing settings</em>, enter the desired "
"<em>Minimum word length to index</em>. Words smaller than this length "
"will be dropped from both keywords when searching and content when "
"indexing."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Setelan indeksi standar</em>, lebokna <em>Panjang tembung "
"minimal kanggo diindeks</em> sing dikarepake. Tembung sing cendhak "
"saka dawa iki bakal dipotong saka loro-lorone, yaiku saka tembung "
"kunci nalika nggoleki lan isi nalika ngindeks."

msgid ""
"If your site uses Chinese, Japanese, or Korean languages, optionally "
"check <em>Simple CJK handling</em> under <em>Default indexing "
"settings</em> to provide some support for these languages."
msgstr ""
"Yen situs sampeyan nggunakake basa Cina, Jepang, utawa Korea, sampeyan "
"bisa milih <em>Simple CJK handling</em> ing <em>Default indexing "
"settings</em> kanggo menehi sawetara dhukungan kanggo basa-basa "
"kasebut."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save configuration</em>, and you should be returned to the "
"<em>Search pages</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save configuration</em>, lan sampeyan kudu dibalekake menyang "
"kaca <em>Search pages</em>."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Re-index site</em> if you have changed the indexing "
"configuration, or later on, if you believe that the search index has "
"been corrupted."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Re-index site</em> yen sampeyan wis ngganti konfigurasi "
"indeksasi, utawa mengko, yen sampeyan yakin yen indeks panelusuran wis "
"rusak."

msgid ""
"After waiting for cron to run several times, verify that the content "
"has been fully indexed for searching. The overall status is listed "
"under <em>Indexing progress</em>, and the status for each search page "
"is shown in the <em>Indexing progress</em> column of the <em>Search "
"pages</em> section."
msgstr ""
"Sawise ngenteni cron mlaku kaping pirang-pirang, priksa manawa isi wis "
"wigati kabeh kanggo panelusuran. Status sakabèhé kacathet ing ngisor "
"<em>Indexing progress</em>, lan status saben kaca panelusuran "
"ditampilake ing kolom <em>Indexing progress</em> ing bagean <em>Search "
"pages</em>."

msgid "What are search pages?"
msgstr "Apa iku kaca panelusuran?"

msgid ""
"The core Search module organizes site search into <em>pages</em>. Each "
"page allows users to search a particular type of content with a "
"particular configuration. The configuration includes specifying a URL "
"that starts with <em>search</em>, a name for the page, and additional "
"options for some search page types."
msgstr ""
"Modul Search inti ngatur panelusuran situs dadi <em>kaca</em>. Saben "
"kaca ngidini pangguna kanggo nggoleki jinis isi tartamtu kanthi "
"konfigurasi tartamtu. Konfigurasi kasebut kalebu nemtokake URL sing "
"diwiwiti karo <em>search</em>, jeneng kanggo kaca, lan pilihan "
"tambahan kanggo sawetara jinis kaca panelusuran."

msgid "What modules provide site search?"
msgstr "Modul apa wae sing nyedhiyakake panelusuran situs?"

msgid ""
"The core Search module provides the ability to configure search pages; "
"search page types are provided by both core and contributed modules. "
"The core modules that provide search page types are:"
msgstr ""
"Modul Search inti nyedhiyakake kemampuan kanggo nyetel kaca telusur; "
"jinis kaca telusur disedhiyakake dening modul inti lan modul tambahan. "
"Modul inti sing nyedhiyakake jinis kaca telusur yaiku:"

msgid "The Node module, for searching content pages"
msgstr "Modul Node, kanggo nelusuri kaca konten"

msgid "The User module, for searching user profiles"
msgstr "Modul User, kanggo nggoleki profil pangguna"

msgid "The Help module, for searching help topics"
msgstr "Modul Help, kanggo nggoleki topik bantuan"

msgid ""
"As an alternative to the core Search module's system of search pages, "
"you can use contributed modules to provide site search. For example, "
"the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/apachesolr\">Apache "
"Solr</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/sphinx\">Sphinx</a> contributed "
"modules use third-party technology to provide site search."
msgstr ""
"Minangka alternatif saka sistem kaca panelusuran modul inti Search, "
"sampeyan bisa nggunakake modul kontribusi kanggo nyedhiyakake "
"panelusuran situs. Contone, modul kontribusi <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/apachesolr\">Apache Solr</a> lan "
"<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/sphinx\">Sphinx</a> "
"nggunakake teknologi pihak katelu kanggo nyedhiyakake panelusuran "
"situs."

msgid "What are the limitations of the core Search module?"
msgstr "Apa waé watesan saka modul Search inti?"

msgid ""
"There are two main limitations of the core Search module. First, it is "
"not appropriate for very large sites -- if you have a large site, look "
"into other search technologies like Apache Solr. Second, the Node "
"search page type only supports exact keyword matching, which is not "
"the behavior that most users will expect. You can improve this by "
"installing a language-specific stemming module for your language (such "
"as <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/porterstemmer\">Porter "
"Stemmer</a> for American English), which makes it so that, for "
"example, a search for the word walk would match pages containing the "
"words walk, walking, and walked."
msgstr ""
"Ana loro watesan utama saka modul Search inti. Kaping pisan, modul iki "
"ora cocog kanggo situs sing gedhé banget -- yen sampeyan nduwèni "
"situs sing gedhé, coba goleki teknologi panelusuran liyane kaya "
"Apache Solr. Kaping pindho, jinis kaca panelusuran Node mung ndhukung "
"cocog tembung kunci sing pas, sing ora dadi prilaku sing biasane "
"diarepake para pangguna. Sampeyan bisa nambah iki kanthi masang modul "
"stemming sing khusus kanggo basa sampeyan (kaya <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/porterstemmer\">Porter "
"Stemmer</a> kanggo basa Inggris Amerika), sing nggawe, contone, "
"panelusuran tembung walk bakal cocog karo kaca sing ngemot tembung "
"walk, walking, lan walked."

msgid "What are the search permissions?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi hak akses golek?"

msgid ""
"Users with <em>Use search</em> permission can use the <em>Search "
"form</em> block and <em>Search</em> page; this permission is required "
"for any search configured in the core Search module."
msgstr ""
"Panganggé sing nduwèni ijin <em>Use search</em> bisa nggunakake blok "
"<em>Search form</em> lan kaca <em>Search</em>; ijin iki dibutuhaké "
"kanggo saben panelusuran sing dikonfigurasi ing modul Search inti."

msgid ""
"In addition to <em>Use search</em>, <em>View user information</em> "
"permission is needed for searching users."
msgstr ""
"Saliyane <em>Gunakake panelusuran</em>, idin <em>Ndeleng informasi "
"pangguna</em> dibutuhake kanggo nggoleki pangguna."

msgid ""
"In addition to <em>Use search</em>, <em>View published content</em> "
"permission is needed for searching content."
msgstr ""
"Saliyane <em>Gunakake panelusuran</em>, hak <em>Ndeleng konten sing "
"wis diterbitake</em> uga dibutuhake kanggo panelusuran konten."

msgid ""
"Users with <em>Use advanced search</em> permission can use more "
"complex search filtering when performing content searches."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>Gunakake panelusuran maju</em> bisa "
"nggunakake panyaring panelusuran sing luwih kompleks nalika nindakake "
"panelusuran isi."

msgid "Configuring site search overview"
msgstr "Nglebokake konfigurasi panelusuran situs umum"

msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/documentation/modules/search\">Online "
"documentation for the Search module</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/documentation/modules/search\">Dokumentasi "
"online kanggo modul Search</a>"

msgid "Document root for files"
msgstr "Akar dokumen kanggo berkas"

msgid "Document root for public files"
msgstr "Akar dokumen kanggo file umum"

msgid "Document root for private files"
msgstr "Akar dokumen kanggo file pribadi"

msgid "Enables the mobile menu toggle at all widths."
msgstr "Ngaktifaké toggle menu seluler ing kabèh ukuran layar."

msgid "Configuring a previously-placed block"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi blok sing wis dipasang sadurunge"

msgid "Managing blocks"
msgstr "Ngatur blok"

msgid "Placing a block"
msgstr "Nempatake blok"

msgid "Managing height, width, and resolution breakpoints"
msgstr "Ngatur titik henti dhuwur, amba, lan resolusi"

msgid "Managing the fields of contact forms"
msgstr "Ngatur lapangan formulir kontak"

msgid "Configuring personal contact forms"
msgstr "Nggawé konfigurasi formulir kontak pribadi"

msgid "Creating a new contact form"
msgstr "Nggawe formulir kontak anyar"

msgid "Managing contact forms"
msgstr "Ngatur formulir kontak"

msgid "Setting a default contact form"
msgstr "Nyetel formulir kontak bawaan"

msgid "Using contextual links"
msgstr "Nganggo pranala kontekstual"

msgid "Changing the appearance of your site"
