msgid "<em>You haven’t created any frontpage content yet.</em>"
msgstr "<em>Sampeyan durung nggawe isi kaca ngarep.</em>"

msgid ""
"Drupal is an open source platform for building amazing digital "
"experiences. It’s made, used, taught, documented, and marketed by "
"the <a href=\"@drupal_community\">Drupal community</a>. Our community "
"is made up of people from around the world with a shared set of <a "
"href=\"@drupal_values\">values</a>, collaborating together in a "
"respectful manner. As we like to say:"
msgstr ""
"Drupal iku platform open source kanggo mbangun pengalaman digital sing "
"luar biasa. Iki digawe, digunakake, diajarke, didokumentasikake, lan "
"dipasarake dening <a href=\"@drupal_community\">komunitas Drupal</a>. "
"Komunitas kita dumadi saka wong-wong saka sak ndonya sing nduweni <a "
"href=\"@drupal_values\">nilai-nilai</a> sing padha, bebarengan kerjo "
"sama kanthi cara sing saling ngajeni. Kaya sing biasane kita ucapake:"

msgid "Come for the code, stay for the community."
msgstr "Mampirilah kanggo kode, tetep ana kanggo komunitas."

msgid "There are a few ways to get started with Drupal:"
msgstr "Ana sawetara cara kanggo miwiti nganggo Drupal:"

msgid ""
"<a href=\"@drupal_user_guide\">User Guide:</a> Includes installing, "
"administering, site building, and maintaining the content of a Drupal "
"website."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@drupal_user_guide\">Pandhuan Panganggo:</a> Kalebu "
"nginstal, ngatur, mbangun situs, lan njaga isi saka situs web Drupal."

msgid ""
"<a href=\"@create_content\">Create Content:</a> Want to get right to "
"work? Start adding content. <strong>Note:</strong> the information on "
"this page will go away once you add content to your site. Read on and "
"bookmark resources of interest."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@create_content\">Gawé Isi:</a> Arep langsung miwiti kerja? "
"Miwiti nambah isi. <strong>Cathetan:</strong> informasi ing kaca iki "
"bakal ilang sawise sampeyan nambah isi menyang situs sampeyan. "
"Terusake maca lan tandhani sumber sing menarik."

msgid ""
"<a href=\"@drupal_extend\">Extend Drupal:</a> Drupal’s core software "
"can be extended and customized in remarkable ways. Install additional "
"functionality and change the look of your site using addons "
"contributed by our community."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@drupal_extend\">Ngembangaké Drupal:</a> Piranti lunak inti "
"Drupal isa dikembangaké lan disesuaikaké kanthi cara sing luar "
"biasa. Pasang fungsi tambahan lan owahi tampilan situs sampeyan "
"nganggo addons sing disumbangaké dening komunitas kita."

msgid ""
"Bookmark these links to our active Drupal community groups and support "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Simpen pranala iki menyang grup komunitas Drupal aktif kita lan sumber "
"dhukungan."

msgid ""
"<a href=\"@drupal_events\">Upcoming Events:</a> Learn and connect with "
"others at conferences and events held around the world."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@drupal_events\">Acara Sing Bakal Datang:</a> Sinau lan "
"nyambung karo wong liya ing konferensi lan acara sing dianakake ing "
"saindenging jagad."

msgid ""
"<a href=\"@drupal_community\">Community Page:</a> List of key Drupal "
"community groups with their own content."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@drupal_community\">Kaca Komunitas:</a> Dhaptar kelompok "
"komunitas Drupal utama sing nduwèni kontèn dhewe."

msgid "Migration failed with source plugin exception: @e in @file line @line"
msgstr ""
"Migrasi gagal karo pengecualian plugin sumber: @e ing @file garis "
"@line"

msgid ""
"Display %display has set node/% as path. This will not produce what "
"you want. If you want to have multiple versions of the node view, use "
"Layout Builder."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan %display wis nyetel node/% minangka jalur. Iki ora bakal "
"ngasilake apa sing sampeyan karepake. Yen sampeyan pengin duwe "
"pirang-pirang versi tampilan node, gunakake Layout Builder."

msgid ""
"See <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\" "
"target=\"_blank\">the documentation for PHP date formats</a>."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\" "
"target=\"_blank\">dokumentasi kanggo format tanggal PHP</a>."

msgid ""
"A user-defined date format. See the <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\">PHP "
"manual</a> for available options."
msgstr ""
"Format tanggal sing ditemtokake dening pangguna. Delengen <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\">manual "
"PHP</a> kanggo pilihan sing kasedhiya."

msgid "Manage translations for any entity that the user can edit"
msgstr ""
"Ngatur terjemahan kanggo sembarang entitas sing bisa diedit dening "
"pangguna"

msgid ""
"The Filter module allows administrators to configure text formats. "
"Text formats change how HTML tags and other text will be <em>processed "
"and displayed</em> in the site. They are used to transform text, and "
"also help to defend your website against potentially damaging input "
"from malicious users. Visual text editors can be associated with text "
"formats by using the <a href=\":editor_help\">Text Editor module</a>. "
"For more information, see the <a href=\":filter_do\">online "
"documentation for the Filter module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Filter ngidinaké para administrator kanggo ngonfigurasi format "
"teks. Format teks ngowahi carané tag HTML lan teks liya bakal "
"<em>diproses lan ditampilaké</em> ing situs. Iki digunakaké kanggo "
"ngetransformasi teks, lan uga mbantu nglindhungi situs web saka input "
"sing mbebayani saka pangguna sing nduwèni niyat ala. Editor teks "
"visual bisa digabungaké karo format teks kanthi nggunakake <a "
"href=\":editor_help\">Modul Editor Teks</a>. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":filter_do\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul Filter</a>."

msgid ""
"There are four main types of data. <em>Content</em> is the information "
"(text, images, etc.) meant to be displayed to website visitors. "
"<em>Configuration</em> is data that defines how the content is "
"displayed; some configuration (such as field labels) may also be "
"visible to site visitors. <em>State</em> is temporary data about the "
"state of your site, such as the last time the system <em>cron</em> "
"jobs ran. <em>Session</em> is a subset of State information, related "
"to users' interactions with the site, such as site cookies and whether "
"or not they are logged in."
msgstr ""
"Ana patang jinis data utama. <em>Content</em> iku informasi (teks, "
"gambar, lan liya-liyane) sing dimaksudake kanggo ditampilake marang "
"pengunjung situs web. <em>Configuration</em> iku data sing nemtokake "
"kepiye carane konten ditampilake; sawetara konfigurasi (kaya label "
"lapangan) uga bisa katon kanggo pengunjung situs. <em>State</em> iku "
"data sementara babagan kondisi situs sampeyan, kaya wektu pungkasan "
"sistem <em>cron</em> jobs mlaku. <em>Session</em> iku bagean saka "
"informasi State, sing gegandhengan karo interaksi pangguna karo situs, "
"kaya cookie situs lan apa dheweke wis mlebu utawa durung."

msgid ""
"List (Options module): Stores values chosen from pre-defined lists, "
"where the values can be numbers or text; see section below for more on "
"list fields."
msgstr ""
"List (Options module): Nyimpen nilai sing dipilih saka dhaptar sing "
"wis ditemtokake, ing ngendi nilaine bisa angka utawa teks; delengen "
"bagean ing ngisor iki kanggo luwih lengkap babagan kolom list."

msgid "Reference (core system): Stores entity references; see section above"
msgstr ""
"Referensi (sistem inti): Nyimpen referensi entitas; delengen bagean "
"ing ndhuwur"

msgid ""
"Text (Text module): Stores formatted and unformatted text; see section "
"below for more on text fields."
msgstr ""
"Text (Text module): Nyimpen teks sing wis diformat lan sing durung "
"diformat; delengen bagean ngisor kanggo informasi luwih lengkap "
"babagan kolom teks."

msgid "What settings are available for List field types?"
msgstr "Apa setelan apa wae sing kasedhiya kanggo jinis lapangan List?"

msgid ""
"List fields associate pre-defined <em>keys</em> (or value codes) with "
"<em>labels</em> that the user sees. For example, you might define a "
"list field that shows the user the names of several locations, while "
"behind the scenes a location code is stored in the database. Each list "
"field type corresponds to one type of stored key. For example, a "
"<em>List (integer)</em> field stores integers, while the <em>List "
"(text)</em> field stores text strings. Once you have chosen the field "
"type, the main setting for a list field is the <em>Allowed values</em> "
"list, which associates the keys with the labels."
msgstr ""
"Lapangan daftar nggabungake <em>kunci</em> sing wis ditemtokake (utawa "
"kode nilai) karo <em>label</em> sing dideleng pangguna. Contone, "
"sampeyan bisa nemtokake lapangan daftar sing nuduhake jeneng "
"pirang-pirang lokasi marang pangguna, nalika mburi layar kode lokasi "
"disimpen ing basis data. Saben jinis lapangan daftar cocog karo siji "
"jinis kunci sing disimpen. Contone, lapangan <em>Daftar (integer)</em> "
"nyimpen angka integer, dene lapangan <em>Daftar (tekstual)</em> "
"nyimpen string teks. Sawise sampeyan milih jinis lapangan, setelan "
"utama kanggo lapangan daftar yaiku dhaptar <em>Nilai sing "
"diidini</em>, sing nggabungake kunci karo label."

msgid "What types of Text fields are available?"
msgstr "Apa jinis-jinis lapangan Tèks sing kasedhiya?"

msgid ""
"There are several types of text fields, with different "
"characteristics. Text fields can be either <em>plain</em> or "
"<em>formatted</em>: plain text fields do not contain HTML, while "
"formatted fields can contain HTML and are processed through <em>text "
"filters</em> (these are provided by the core Filter module; if you "
"have that module enabled, see the related topic below on filters for "
"more information). Text fields can also be regular-length (with a "
"limit of 255 characters) or <em>long</em> (with a very large character "
"limit), and long formatted text fields can include a <em>summary</em> "
"attribute. All possible combinations of these characteristics exist as "
"text field types; for example, <em>Text (plain)</em> and <em>Text "
"(formatted, long, with summary)</em> are two examples of text field "
"types."
msgstr ""
"Ana sawetara jinis kolom teks, kanthi ciri-ciri sing beda. Kolom teks "
"bisa <em>plain</em> utawa <em>formatted</em>: kolom teks plain ora "
"ngandhut HTML, dene kolom teks formatted bisa ngandhut HTML lan "
"diproses liwat <em>text filters</em> (iki disedhiyakake dening modul "
"Filter inti; yen modul kuwi diaktifake, delengen topik sing "
"gegandhengan ing ngisor iki babagan filter kanggo info luwih lengkap). "
"Kolom teks uga bisa dawa biasa (kanthi wates 255 karakter) utawa "
"<em>long</em> (kanthi wates karakter sing gedhe banget), lan kolom "
"teks formatted sing dawa bisa duwe atribut <em>summary</em>. Kabeh "
"kombinasi ciri-ciri iki ana minangka jinis kolom teks; contone, "
"<em>Text (plain)</em> lan <em>Text (formatted, long, with "
"summary)</em> iku loro conto jinis kolom teks."

msgid "What is a menu?"
msgstr "Apa iku menu?"

msgid ""
"A menu is a collection of <em>menu links</em> used to navigate a web "
"site. Menus and menu links can be provided by modules or site "
"administrators."
msgstr ""
"Menu iku kumpulan <em>tulisan menu</em> sing digunakake kanggo "
"navigasi situs web. Menu lan tulisan menu bisa disedhiyakake dening "
"modul utawa administrator situs."

msgid "Managing menus overview"
msgstr "Ringkesan ngatur menu"

msgid ""
"The core Menu UI module provides a user interface for managing menus, "
"including creating new menus, reordering menu links, and disabling "
"links provided by modules. It also provides the ability for links to "
"content items to be added to menus while editing, if configured on the "
"content type. The core Custom Menu Links module provides the ability "
"to add custom links to menus. Each menu can be displayed by placing a "
"block in a theme region; some themes also can display a menu outside "
"of the block system. See the related topics listed below for specific "
"tasks."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Menu UI nyedhiyakake antarmuka panganggo kanggo ngatur "
"menu, kalebu nggawe menu anyar, nyusun maneh pranala menu, lan mateni "
"pranala sing diwenehake modul. Uga nyedhiyakake kemampuan kanggo "
"nambah pranala menyang item isi menyang menu nalika nyunting, yen wis "
"dikonfigurasi ing jinis isi. Modul inti Custom Menu Links nyedhiyakake "
"kemampuan kanggo nambah pranala khusus menyang menu. Saben menu bisa "
"ditampilake kanthi nyelehake blok ing wilayah tema; sawetara tema uga "
"bisa nampilake menu ing njaba sistem blok. Delengen topik sing "
"gegandhengan sing kasebat ing ngisor iki kanggo tugas tartamtu."

msgid "Enabling web services"
msgstr "Ngaktifake layanan web"

msgid "What is a web service?"
msgstr "Apa iku layanan web?"

msgid ""
"A web service allows your site to provide its content and data to "
"other web sites and applications. Typically, the data is transported "
"via <a "
"href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypertext_Transfer_Protocol\">HTTP</a> "
"in a serialized machine-readable format."
msgstr ""
"Layanan web ngidini situs sampeyan nyedhiyakake isi lan data menyang "
"situs web lan aplikasi liyane. Biasane, data dikirim liwat <a "
"href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypertext_Transfer_Protocol\">HTTP</a> "
"ing format sing diserialisasi lan bisa diwaca mesin."

msgid "What is serialization?"
msgstr "Serialization iku apa?"

msgid ""
"Serialization is the process of converting complex data structures "
"into text strings, so that they can be exchanged and stored. The "
"reverse process is called <em>deserialization</em>. JSON and XML are "
"the two most-commonly-used data serialization formats for web "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Serialization iku proses ngowahi struktur data sing komplek dadi "
"string teks, supaya bisa dipertukarke lan disimpen. Proses kebalikane "
"diarani <em>deserialization</em>. JSON lan XML iku loro format "
"serialisasi data sing paling umum digunakake kanggo layanan web."

msgid "What is HTTP Basic authentication?"
msgstr "Apa iku otentikasi HTTP Basic?"

msgid ""
"<a "
"href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basic_access_authentication\">HTTP "
"Basic authentication</a> is a method for authenticating requests by "
"sending a user name and password along with the request."
msgstr ""
"<a "
"href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basic_access_authentication\">HTTP "
"Basic authentication</a> iku cara kanggo ngotentikasi panyuwunan "
"kanthi ngirim jeneng panganggo lan sandhi bebarengan karo panyuwunan "
"kasebut."

msgid "What modules provide web services?"
msgstr "Modul apa sing nyedhiyakake layanan web?"

msgid "JSON:API module"
msgstr "Modul JSON:API"

msgid "RESTful Web Services module"
msgstr "Modul Layanan Web RESTful"

msgid "Serialization module"
msgstr "Modul Serialisasi"

msgid ""
"Provides a framework for adding specific serialization formats for "
"other modules to use."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake kerangka kerja kanggo nambah format serialisasi tartamtu "
"kanggo modul liyane sing bisa digunakake."

msgid "HTTP Basic Authentication module"
msgstr "Modhul Autentikasi Dasar HTTP"

msgid "There are also contributed modules that provide web services."
msgstr "Uga ana modul kontribusi sing nyedhiyakake layanan web."

msgid "Online documentation for the JSON:API module"
msgstr "Dokumentasi online kanggo modul JSON:API"

msgid "Comparison of the RESTFul Web Services and JSON:API modules"
msgstr "Bentenan antarane modul RESTFul Web Services lan JSON:API"

msgid "Connecting text editors to text formats"
msgstr "Nyambungake editor teks menyang format teks"

msgid "What is a text editor?"
msgstr "Apa iku text editor?"

msgid "Managing text filters and text formats"
msgstr "Ngatur filter teks lan format teks"

msgid "Configure text formats on the site."
msgstr "Konfigurasi format teks ing situs."

msgid "What are text filters and text formats?"
msgstr "Apa iku saringan teks lan format teks?"

msgid ""
"A text filter is a processing step that can be applied to text, either "
"to transform it in some way (such as converting URLs in the text into "
"HTML links), or to defend against potentially-dangerous input from "
"site users. A text format is an ordered sequence of text filters. Text "
"filters are provided by modules; text formats are managed by the core "
"Filter module."
msgstr ""
"Filter teks iku sawijining langkah proses sing bisa diterapake marang "
"teks, entuk kanggo ngowahi teks kanthi cara tartamtu (kaya ngowahi URL "
"ing teks dadi link HTML), utawa kanggo nangkal input sing bisa "
"mbebayani saka pangguna situs. Format teks iku sawijining urutan "
"filter teks sing wis ditemtokake. Filter teks disedhiyakake dening "
"modul; format teks diatur dening modul inti Filter."

msgid ""
"Text fields that have \"formatted\" in the field type name, such as "
"<em>Text (formatted)</em>, use text formats. Users choose the text "
"format when editing the field text; when the field text is shown on "
"the site, it is processed by the chosen text format. Administrators "
"can configure text formats and assign permissions for who can use each "
"format. If the core Text Editor module is enabled, administrators can "
"also associate visual editors with text formats."
msgstr ""
"Lapangan teks sing duwe \"formatted\" ing jeneng jinis lapangan, kaya "
"ta <em>Text (formatted)</em>, nggunakake format teks. Panganggo milih "
"format teks nalika ngowahi teks lapangan; nalika teks lapangan "
"ditampilake ing situs, teks kasebut diproses dening format teks sing "
"dipilih. Administrator bisa ngatur format teks lan menehi ijin sapa "
"sing bisa nggunakake saben format. Yen modul inti Text Editor "
"diaktifake, administrator uga bisa nyambungake editor visual karo "
"format teks."

msgid "What text filters are available?"
msgstr "Apa wae filter teks sing kasedhiya?"

msgid "Some of the more commonly used text filters are:"
msgstr "Sawetara saringan teks sing luwih kerep digunakake yaiku:"

msgid ""
"Limits which HTML tags can be used; useful both for site security and "
"enforcing site design."
msgstr ""
"Matesi tag HTML sing bisa digunakake; migunani kanggo keamanan situs "
"lan ngetrapake desain situs."

msgid ""
"Line breaks in HTML source are displayed as horizontal spaces. This "
"filter converts line breaks into HTML paragraph and line break tags."
msgstr ""
"Pemisah baris ing sumber HTML ditampilake minangka spasi horisontal. "
"Filter iki ngowahi pemisah baris dadi tag paragraf HTML lan tag "
"pemisah baris."

msgid "Takes plain URLs in text and turns them into HTML links."
msgstr "Mbedhah URL polos ing teks lan ngowahi dadi pranala HTML."

msgid ""
"For text formats that allow HTML image tags, restricts images to URLs "
"within this site."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo format teks sing ngidini tag gambar HTML, diwatesi gambar mung "
"kanggo URL ing situs iki."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Configure</em> to configure an existing text format, or "
"<em>+ Add text format</em> to create a new text format."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Configure</em> kanggo nyetel format teks sing wis ana, utawa "
"<em>+ Add text format</em> kanggo nggawe format teks anyar."

msgid "Enter the desired <em>Name</em> for the text format."
msgstr "Lebokake <em>Jeneng</em> sing dipengini kanggo format teks."

msgid ""
"Check the <em>Roles</em> that can use this text format. Some HTML tags "
"allow users to embed malicious links or scripts in text. To ensure "
"security, anonymous and untrusted users should only have access to "
"text formats that restrict them to either plain text or a safe set of "
"HTML tags. <strong>Improper text format configuration is a security "
"risk.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Priksa <em>Peran</em> sing bisa nggunakake format teks iki. Sawetara "
"tag HTML ngidini pangguna nyelipake pranala utawa skrip jahat ing "
"teks. Kanggo njamin keamanan, pangguna anonim lan sing ora dipercaya "
"kudu mung duwe akses menyang format teks sing matesi dheweke mung "
"kanggo teks polos utawa set tag HTML sing aman. <strong>Konfigurasi "
"format teks sing ora bener iku resiko keamanan.</strong>"

msgid ""
"If the core Text Editor module is installed, see the related topic to "
"connect a text editor to this text format."
msgstr ""
"Yen modul inti Text Editor wis diinstal, delengen topik sing "
"gegandhengan kanggo nyambungake editor teks menyang format teks iki."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Enabled filters</em>, check the text filters that you want "
"to use."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Enabled filters</em>, centhang filter teks sing pengin "
"sampeyan gunakake."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Filter processing order</em>, drag the filters to the "
"correct order. Choose the order carefully; for example, if you have a "
"filter that results in a particular HTML tag being added to the text, "
"that should run after a filter that restricts HTML tags, to avoid "
"deleting the new tags the first filter added."
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor <em>Filter processing order</em>, seret filter-filter "
"kasebut menyang urutan sing bener. Pilih urutan kanthi ati-ati; "
"contone, yen sampeyan duwe filter sing ngasilake tag HTML tartamtu "
"ditambahake menyang teks, iku kudu mlaku sawisé filter sing matesi "
"tag HTML, supaya ora mbusak tag anyar sing ditambahake filter pisanan."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Filter settings</em>, verify and adjust the settings for "
"each active filter that has configuration options."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Filter settings</em>, priksa lan sesuaikan setelan kanggo "
"saben filter aktif sing nduweni opsi konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save configuration</em>, which will return you to the "
"<em>Text formats and editors</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Simpen konfigurasi</em>, sing bakal mbalekake sampeyan "
"menyang kaca <em>Format teks lan editor</em>."

msgid "Repeat these steps if you have additional text formats to configure."
msgstr ""
"Baleni langkah-langkah iki yen sampeyan duwe format teks liyane sing "
"kudu dikonfigurasi."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>Block layout</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>Block layout</em>."

msgid "Configure menu settings for a content type"
msgstr "Nggayuh setelan menu kanggo jinis isi"

msgid ""
"For an existing content type, configure the available menus that will "
"be shown as options on content editing screens; links to content items "
"of this type can be added to these menus during editing."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo jinis konten sing wis ana, atur menu-menu sing kasedhiya sing "
"bakal ditampilake minangka pilihan ing layar ngedit konten; pranala "
"menyang item konten jinis iki bisa ditambahake ing menu-menu kasebut "
"nalika ngedit."

msgid ""
"Locate the content type you want to configure, and click <em>Edit</em> "
"in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr ""
"Temokake jinis konten sing arep sampeyan konfigurasikake, lan klik "
"<em>Edit</em> ing dhaptar <em>Operations</em>."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Menu settings</em>, check the menus that you want to be "
"available when editing a content item of this type."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Menu settings</em>, centhang menu-menu sing pengin kasedhiya "
"nalika nyunting item konten saka jinis iki."

msgid ""
"Optionally, select the <em>Default parent item</em>, to put links to "
"content items under a default location in the menu structure."
msgstr ""
"Sakliyane, pilih <em>Item induk bawaan</em>, kanggo nyelehake pranala "
"menyang item isi ing ngisor lokasi bawaan ing struktur menu."

msgid "Adding a link to a menu"
msgstr "Nambahaké pranala menyang menu"

msgid ""
"Add a link to a menu. Note that you can also add a link to a menu from "
"the content edit page if menu settings have been configured for the "
"content type."
msgstr ""
"Tambahake pranala menyang menu. Wigati dimangerteni yen sampeyan uga "
"bisa nambahake pranala menyang menu saka kaca sunting isi yen setelan "
"menu wis dikonfigurasi kanggo jinis isi kasebut."

msgid ""
"Locate the desired menu and click <em>Add link</em> in the "
"<em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr ""
"Temokake menu sing dikarepake lan klik <em>Add link</em> ing daftar "
"<em>Operations</em>."

msgid "Enter the <em>Menu link title</em> to be displayed."
msgstr "Lebokake <em>Judhul pranala Menu</em> sing bakal ditampilake."

msgid "Enter the <em>Link</em>, one of the following:"
msgstr "Lebokna <em>Link</em>, salah siji saka ing ngisor iki:"

msgid "An internal path, such as <em>/node/add</em>"
msgstr "Jalur internal, kaya ta <em>/node/add</em>"

msgid "A full external URL"
msgstr "URL eksternal lengkap"

msgid ""
"Start typing the title of a content item and select it when the full "
"title comes up"
msgstr ""
"Miwiwiti ngetik judhul saka isi lan pilih nalika judhul lengkap wis "
"metu"

msgid ""
"<em>&lt;nolink&gt;</em> to display the <em>Menu link title</em> as "
"plain text without a link"
msgstr ""
"<em>&lt;nolink&gt;</em> kanggo nampilake <em>Menu link title</em> "
"minangka teks polos tanpa pranala"

msgid "<em>&lt;front&gt;</em> to link to the front page of your site"
msgstr ""
"<em>&lt;front&gt;</em> kanggo nyambungaké menyang kaca ngarep saka "
"situs sampeyan"

msgid ""
"Make sure that <em>Enabled</em> is checked; if not, the menu link will "
"not be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa <em>Enabled</em> wis dicenthang; yen ora, link menu ora "
"bakal ditampilake."

msgid ""
"Optionally, enter a <em>Description</em>, which will be displayed when "
"a user hovers over the link."
msgstr ""
"Sakliyane, lebokna <em>Gambaran</em>, sing bakal ditampilake nalika "
"pangguna nglebokake kursor ing pranala."

msgid ""
"Optionally, check <em>Show as expanded</em> to automatically show the "
"children of this link (if any) when this link is shown."
msgstr ""
"Sakliyane, priksa <em>Show as expanded</em> kanggo otomatis nampilaké "
"anak-anak saka pranala iki (yen ana) nalika pranala iki ditampilaké."

msgid ""
"Optionally, select the <em>Parent link</em>, if this menu link should "
"be a child of another menu link."
msgstr ""
"Opsional, pilih <em>Link Induk</em>, yen pranala menu iki kudu dadi "
"anak saka pranala menu liyane."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the <em>Add link</em> "
"page to add another link."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save</em>. Sampeyan bakal bali menyang kaca <em>Add link</em> "
"kanggo nambah pranala liyane."

msgid ""
"Locate the menu you just added a link to and click <em>Edit</em> in "
"the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr ""
"Temokake menu sing anyar wae sampeyan tambahake pranala lan klik "
"<em>Edit</em> ing dhaptar <em>Operations</em>."

msgid ""
"Verify that the order of links is correct. If it is not, drag menu "
"links until the order is correct, and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa urutan pranala wis bener. Yen durung, seret pranala menu "
"nganti urutane bener, banjur klik <em>Save</em>."

msgid "Creating a menu"
msgstr "Nggawé menu"

msgid "Create a new menu."
msgstr "Gawe menu anyar."

msgid "Click <em>Add menu</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah menu</em>."

msgid ""
"Enter the title for the menu, which is used as the default block title "
"if the menu is displayed as a block. If desired, also edit the machine "
"name of the menu, which is by default derived from the title."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna judhul kanggo menu, sing digunakake minangka judhul blok "
"standar yen menu ditampilake minangka blok. Yen dikarepake, uga "
"sunting jeneng mesin saka menu, sing sacara standar dijupuk saka "
"judhul."

msgid ""
"Enter an administrative summary, which is displayed on the "
"<em>Menus</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna ringkesan administratif, sing bakal ditampilake ing kaca "
"<em>Menus</em>."

msgid ""
"If your site has more than one language, choose the language for the "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Yen situs sampeyan nduwèni luwih saka siji basa, pilih basa kanggo "
"menu."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. You will be on the menu editing page, ready to "
"add links to the menu if the core Custom Menu Links module is "
"installed; see related topics for further tasks."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save</em>. Sampeyan bakal mlebu ing kaca nyunting menu, siap "
"nambah pranala menyang menu yen modul inti Custom Menu Links wis "
"diinstal; delengen topik terkait kanggo tugas luwih lanjut."

msgid "Reordering and disabling menu links"
msgstr "Ngurutake maneh lan mateni pranala menu"

msgid "Disable menu links or change the order and hierarchy of menu links."
msgstr "Mateni pranala menu utawa ngowahi urutan lan hierarki pranala menu."

msgid "Click <em>Edit menu</em> for the menu that you want to edit."
msgstr "Klik <em>Edit menu</em> kanggo menu sing arep sampeyan sunting."

msgid ""
"Drag menu links into a new order, or check/uncheck <em>Enabled</em> to "
"enable or disable menu links."
msgstr ""
"Seret pranala menu menyang urutan anyar, utawa centhang utawa copot "
"centhang <em>Enabled</em> kanggo ngaktifake utawa mateni pranala menu."

msgid "Click <em>Save</em> to save your changes."
msgstr "Klik <em>Save</em> kanggo nyimpen owah-owahan sampeyan."

msgid ""
"<a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\">PHP "
"date format codes reference</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\">Referensi "
"kode format tanggal PHP</a>"

msgid "[site:name]: The name of your website."
msgstr "[site:name]: Jeneng situs web sampeyan."

msgid "[site:url]: The URL of your website."
msgstr "[site:url]: URL saka situs web sampeyan."

msgid "Managing content listings (views)"
msgstr "Ngatur dhaptar isi (views)"

msgid "What is a view?"
msgstr "Apa iku view?"

msgid ""
"A <em>view</em> is a listing of items on your site; for example, a "
"block showing the most recent comments, a page listing news items, or "
"a list of registered users. The listings can be formatted in a table, "
"grid, list, calendar, RSS feed, and other formats (some output formats "
"may require you to install additional contributed modules)."
msgstr ""
"<em>View</em> yaiku dhaptar barang ing situs sampeyan; contone, blok "
"sing nampilake komentar paling anyar, kaca sing nampilake "
"barang-barang berita, utawa dhaptar pangguna sing wis ndaftar. Dhaptar "
"kasebut bisa diformat ing tabel, grid, daftar, kalender, RSS feed, lan "
"format liyane (sawetara format output bisa mbutuhake sampeyan kanggo "
"nginstal modul kontribusi tambahan)."

msgid "What are the components of a view?"
msgstr "Apa wae komponen saka view?"

msgid ""
"When you first create a view, you will specify what type of <em>base "
"data</em> is being displayed in the view, which cannot be changed. "
"After choosing a base data type, you can edit the following "
"components, which allow you to specify which data to output, in what "
"order, and in what format:"
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan nggawe view pisanan, sampeyan bakal nemtokake jinis "
"<em>base data</em> sing ditampilake ing view, sing ora bisa diganti. "
"Sawise milih jinis base data, sampeyan bisa nyunting komponen ing "
"ngisor iki, sing ngidini sampeyan nemtokake data apa sing bakal "
"ditampilake, kanthi urutan apa, lan ing format apa:"

msgid ""
"<em>Displays</em>: whether the output goes to a page, block, feed, "
"etc.; a single view can have multiple displays, each with different "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"<em>Displays</em>: nampilake apa asil metu menyang kaca, blok, feed, "
"lan liya-liyane; siji tampilan bisa duwe pirang-pirang displays, saben "
"duwe setelan sing beda-beda."

msgid ""
"<em>Format</em>: the output style for each display, such as content "
"item, grid, table, or HTML list."
msgstr ""
"<em>Format</em>: gaya keluaran kanggo saben tampilan, kaya item isi, "
"grid, tabel, utawa dhaptar HTML."

msgid ""
"<em>Fields</em>: if the Format allows, the particular fields to "
"display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Fields</em>: yen Format ngidini, lapangan tartamtu sing bakal "
"ditampilake."

msgid ""
"<em>Filter criteria</em>: criteria to limit the data to output, such "
"as whether the content is published, the type of content, etc. Filters "
"can be <em>exposed</em> to let users choose how to filter the data."
msgstr ""
"<em>Krétéria saring</em>: krétéria kanggo matesi data sing bakal "
"ditampilaké, kaya apa isi wis dipublikasikaké, jinis isi, lan "
"liya-liyané. Saringané isa <em>diparingi pilihan</em> supaya "
"pangguna bisa milih cara nyaring data."

msgid ""
"<em>Sort criteria</em>: how to order the data. Sorting can also be "
"exposed to users."
msgstr ""
"<em>Krriteria penyortiran</em>: carane ngurutake data. Penyortiran uga "
"bisa digawe supaya bisa diatur dening pangguna."

msgid ""
"<em>Header</em> and <em>Footer</em>: content to display at the top or "
"bottom of the view display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Header</em> lan <em>Footer</em>: isi sing ditampilake ing sisih "
"ndhuwur utawa ngisor tampilan pandeleng."

msgid ""
"<em>No results behavior</em>: what to do if the filter criteria result "
"in having no data to display."
msgstr ""
"<em>No results behavior</em>: apa sing kudu dilakoni yen kriteria "
"filter ora nduweni data kanggo ditampilake."

msgid ""
"<em>Pager</em>: how many items to display, and how to paginate if "
"there are additional items to display."
msgstr ""
"<em>Pager</em>: pira item sing arep ditampilake, lan carane nggawe "
"kaca yen isih ana item liyane sing kudu ditampilake."

msgid ""
"<em>Advanced</em> &gt; <em>Contextual filters</em>: like regular "
"filters, except the criteria come from the <em>context</em>, such as "
"the current date, page the view is displayed on, etc."
msgstr ""
"<em>Majeng</em> &gt; <em>Filter kontekstual</em>: kaya filter biasa, "
"nanging kriteriaé asalé saka <em>konteks</em>, kayata tanggal saiki, "
"kaca sing nampilaké tampilan, lsp."

msgid ""
"<em>Advanced</em> &gt; <em>Relationships</em>: additional data to pull "
"in and display, related in some way to the base data of the view (such "
"as data about the user who created the content item)."
msgstr ""
"<em>Majeng</em> &gt; <em>Hubungan</em>: data tambahan kanggo dijupuk "
"lan ditampilake, sing ana gandhengane karo data dasar saka tampilan "
"(kaya data babagan pangguna sing nggawe item isi)."

msgid ""
"<em>Advanced</em> &gt; <em>Exposed form</em>: if you have exposed "
"filters or sorts, how to display the form to the user."
msgstr ""
"<em>Majeng</em> &gt; <em>Bentuk sing ditampilake</em>: yen sampeyan "
"duwe saringan utawa urutan sing ditampilake, carane nampilake bentuk "
"kasebut marang pangguna."

msgid "Managing views overview"
msgstr "Nglola ringkesan views"

msgid ""
"The core Views module handles the display of views, and the core Views "
"UI module allows you to create, edit, and delete views in the "
"administrative interface. See the related topics listed below for "
"specific tasks (if the Views UI module is installed)."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Views nangani tampilan views, lan modul inti Views UI "
"ngidini sampeyan nggawe, sunting, lan mbusak views ing antarmuka "
"administratif. Delengen topik terkait sing kadhaptar ing ngisor iki "
"kanggo tugas khusus (yen modul Views UI wis diinstal)."

msgid "Adding a new display to an existing view"
msgstr "Nambah tampilan anyar menyang tampilan sing wis ana"

msgid ""
"Add a new display to an existing view. This will allow you to display "
"similar data to an existing view, using similar settings, in a new "
"block, page, feed, etc."
msgstr ""
"Tambah tampilan anyar menyang tampilan sing wis ana. Iki bakal ngidini "
"sampeyan nampilake data sing padha karo tampilan sing wis ana, nganggo "
"setelan sing padha, ing blok anyar, kaca, feed, lan liya-liyane."

msgid "Under <em>Displays</em>, click <em>Add</em>."
msgstr "Ing <em>Displays</em>, klik <em>Add</em>."

msgid ""
"In the pop-up list, click the link for the type of display you want to "
"add; the most common types are <em>Page</em> and <em>Block</em>. The "
"new display will be added to your view, and you will be editing that "
"display."
msgstr ""
"Ing dhaptar pop-up, klik pranala kanggo jinis tampilan sing arep "
"sampeyan tambahake; jinis sing paling umum yaiku <em>Page</em> lan "
"<em>Block</em>. Tampilan anyar bakal ditambahake menyang "
"pandelenganmu, lan sampeyan bakal ngowahi tampilan kuwi."

msgid ""
"Optionally, click the link next to <em>Display name</em> and enter a "
"new name to be shown for this display in the administrative interface."
msgstr ""
"Sak perlu, klik pranala ing jejere <em>Display name</em> lan lebokna "
"jeneng anyar sing arep ditampilake kanggo tampilan iki ing antarmuka "
"administrasi."

msgid "Creating a new view"
msgstr "Gawe tampilan anyar"

msgid "Create a new view to list content or other items on your site."
msgstr ""
"Gawe pandelengan anyar kanggo ndhaptar isi utawa barang liyane ing "
"situs sampeyan."

msgid "Click <em>Add view</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Add view</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>View name</em> field, enter a name for the view, which is "
"how it will be listed in the administrative interface."
msgstr ""
"Ing kolom <em>View name</em>, lebokna jeneng kanggo view kasebut, sing "
"bakal dadi cara view kasebut didaftarake ing antarmuka administratif."

msgid ""
"In <em>View settings</em> &gt; <em>Show</em>, select the base data "
"type to display in your view. This cannot be changed later."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Setelan Tampilan</em> &gt; <em>Tampilake</em>, pilih jinis "
"data dhasar sing arep ditampilake ing tampilanmu. Iki ora bisa diganti "
"mengko."

msgid ""
"Optionally, select or enter filtering, sorting, and page/block display "
"settings; these can be added or changed later."
msgstr ""
"Secara opsional, pilih utawa lebokna setelan panyaringan, panyortiran, "
"lan tampilan kaca/blok; iki bisa ditambahake utawa diganti mengko."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save and edit</em>. Your view will be created; edit it "
"following the steps in the related topics below."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save and edit</em>. Tampilanmu bakal digawe; sunting miturut "
"langkah-langkah ing topik sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki."

msgid "Editing an existing view display"
msgstr "Nyunting tampilan pandelengan sing wis ana"

msgid ""
"Edit an existing view display, to modify what data is displayed or how "
"it is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Sunting tampilan view sing wis ana, kanggo ngowahi data apa sing "
"ditampilake utawa carane ditampilake."

msgid "Under <em>Displays</em>, click the display you want to edit."
msgstr "Ing <em>Displays</em>, klik tampilan sing pengin sampeyan sunting."

msgid ""
"For sections containing lists (such as <em>Fields</em> and <em>Filter "
"criteria</em>), to modify or delete an existing item, click the name "
"of the item. To add a new item, click <em>Add</em> in the drop-down "
"list. To change the order of items, click <em>Rearrange</em> in the "
"drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo bagean sing ngemot dhaptar (kaya <em>Fields</em> lan <em>Filter "
"criteria</em>), kanggo ngowahi utawa mbusak item sing wis ana, klik "
"jeneng item kasebut. Kanggo nambah item anyar, klik <em>Add</em> ing "
"dhaptar gulung mudhun. Kanggo ngganti urutan item, klik "
"<em>Rearrange</em> ing dhaptar gulung mudhun."

msgid ""
"For sections containing individual settings (such as <em>Title</em> "
"and <em>Format</em>), there are often two links for each setting. The "
"first link shows the current value; click that link to change the "
"value. If there is a second link called <em>Settings</em>, click that "
"link to change the settings details. For example, if your "
"<em>Format</em> is currently shown as <em>Unformatted list</em>, click "
"<em>Unformatted list</em> to switch to using a <em>Grid</em> or "
"<em>Table</em> format. Click <em>Settings</em> next to your format "
"type to change the settings for your chosen format."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo bagean sing ngemot setelan individu (kaya <em>Title</em> lan "
"<em>Format</em>), asring ana loro tautan kanggo saben setelan. Tautan "
"sing pertama nuduhake nilai saiki; klik tautan kasebut kanggo ngowahi "
"nilaine. Yen ana tautan kaping loro sing jenenge <em>Settings</em>, "
"klik tautan kasebut kanggo ngowahi rincian setelan. Contone, yen "
"<em>Format</em> sampeyan saiki ditampilake minangka <em>Unformatted "
"list</em>, klik <em>Unformatted list</em> kanggo ganti nggunakake "
"format <em>Grid</em> utawa <em>Table</em>. Klik <em>Settings</em> sing "
"ana ing jejere jinis format kanggo ngowahi setelan format sing wis "
"sampeyan pilih."

msgid ""
"When you have finished changing all the settings, verify that the "
"display is correct by clicking <em>Update preview</em>. Return to "
"editing settings if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan wis rampung ngganti kabeh setelan, priksa manawa "
"tampilan wis bener kanthi ngeklik <em>Update preview</em>. Balik maneh "
"menyang sunting setelan yen perlu."

msgid ""
"When you have verified the display, click <em>Save</em>. "
"Alternatively, if you have made mistakes and want to discard your "
"changes, click <em>Cancel</em>."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan wis mriksa tampilan, klik <em>Save</em>. Yen sampeyan "
"nggawe kesalahan lan pengin mbatalake owah-owahan, klik "
"<em>Cancel</em>."

msgid ""
"For accessibility and search engine optimization, all images that "
"convey meaning on websites should have alternate text. Drupal also "
"allows entry of title text for images, but it can lead to confusion "
"for screen reader users and its use is not recommended. Image fields "
"can be configured so that alternate and title text fields are enabled "
"or disabled; if enabled, the fields can be set to be required. The "
"recommended setting is to enable and require alternate text and "
"disable title text."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo aksesibilitas lan optimasi mesin telusur, kabeh gambar sing "
"nyritakake makna ing situs web kudu duwe teks alternatif. Drupal uga "
"ngidini mlebu teks judhul kanggo gambar, nanging iki bisa nyebabake "
"bingung kanggo pangguna screen reader lan panggunaane ora dianjurake. "
"Kolom gambar bisa dikonfigurasi supaya kolom teks alternatif lan teks "
"judhul bisa diaktifake utawa dinonaktifake; yen diaktifake, kolom "
"kasebut bisa disetel supaya dadi wajib. Setelan sing dianjurake yaiku "
"ngaktifake lan nuntut teks alternatif lan menonaktifake teks judhul."

msgid ""
"This must be an internal path such as %add-node. You can also start "
"typing the title of a piece of content to select it. Enter %front to "
"link to the front page. Enter %nolink to display link text only. Enter "
"%button to display keyboard-accessible link text only."
msgstr ""
"Iki kudu path internal kaya %add-node. Sampeyan uga bisa miwiti ngetik "
"judhul saka isi kanggo milih. Lebokake %front kanggo nyambung menyang "
"kaca ngarep. Lebokake %nolink kanggo mung nampilake teks pranala. "
"Lebokake %button kanggo mung nampilake teks pranala sing bisa diakses "
"nganggo keyboard."

msgid ""
"Start typing the title of a piece of content to select it. You can "
"also enter an internal path such as %add-node or an external URL such "
"as %url. Enter %front to link to the front page. Enter %nolink to "
"display link text only. Enter %button to display keyboard-accessible "
"link text only."
msgstr ""
"Miwiwiti ngetik judhul isi kanggo milih. Sampeyan uga bisa mlebu path "
"internal kaya %add-node utawa URL eksternal kaya %url. Lebokake %front "
"kanggo nyambung menyang kaca ngarep. Lebokake %nolink kanggo nampilake "
"teks pranala wae. Lebokake %button kanggo nampilake teks pranala sing "
"bisa diakses nganggo keyboard wae."

msgid ""
"It is potentially insecure to display oEmbed content in a frame that "
"is served from the same domain as your main Drupal site, as this may "
"allow execution of third-party code. Refer to <a "
"href=\"https://oembed.com/#section3\">oEmbed Security "
"Considerations</a>."
msgstr ""
"Iku bisa dadi ora aman kanggo nampilake isi oEmbed ing pigura sing "
"dilayani saka domain sing padha karo situs Drupal utama sampeyan, "
"amarga iki bisa ngidini eksekusi kode pihak katelu. Delengen <a "
"href=\"https://oembed.com/#section3\">Pertimbangan Keamanan "
"oEmbed</a>."

msgid ""
"It is potentially insecure to display oEmbed content in a frame that "
"is served from the same domain as your main Drupal site, as this may "
"allow execution of third-party code. <a href=\":url\">You can specify "
"a different domain for serving oEmbed content in the Media "
"settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"Iku potensial ora aman kanggo nampilake isi oEmbed ing pigura sing "
"disajèkaké saka domain sing padha karo situs Drupal utama sampeyan, "
"amarga iki bisa ngidini eksekusi kode pihak katelu. <a "
"href=\":url\">Sampeyan bisa nemtokake domain sing beda kanggo "
"nyajèkaké isi oEmbed ing setelan Media</a>."

msgid ""
"If checked, users creating new media items in the media library will "
"see a summary of their selected media items, and they will be able to "
"insert their selection directly into the media field or text editor."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipariksa, pangguna sing nggawe item media anyar ing perpustakaan "
"media bakal weruh ringkesan saka item media sing dipilih, lan dheweke "
"bakal bisa langsung nyisipake pilihan kasebut menyang lapangan media "
"utawa editor teks."

msgid ""
"A flag for whether the link should be rendered in menus. (1 = a "
"disabled menu link that may be shown on admin screens, -1 = a menu "
"callback, 0 = a normal, visible link)"
msgstr ""
"Tandha kanggo apa pranala kudu ditampilake ing menu. (1 = pranala menu "
"sing ora aktif lan bisa ditampilake ing layar admin, -1 = callback "
"menu, 0 = pranala normal sing katon)"

msgid "Menu link language code."
msgstr "Kode basa pranala menu."

msgid "Translation set id."
msgstr "ID set terjemahan."

msgid "Menu link ID of the source language menu link."
msgstr "ID pranala menu saka pranala menu basa sumber."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Administer menus and menu links</em> permission can "
"add, edit, and delete custom menus on the <a href=\":menu\">Menus "
"page</a>. Custom menus can be special site menus, menus of external "
"links, or any combination of internal and external links. You may "
"create an unlimited number of additional menus, each of which will "
"automatically have an associated block (if you have the <a "
"href=\":block_help\">Block module</a> installed). By selecting "
"<em>Edit menu</em>, you can add, edit, or delete links for a given "
"menu. The links listing page provides a drag-and-drop interface for "
"controlling the order of links, and creating a hierarchy within the "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé idin <em>Ngatur menu lan pranala menu</em> bisa "
"nambah, ngowahi, lan mbusak menu kustom ing <a href=\":menu\"> kaca "
"Menu</a>. Menu kustom bisa dadi menu situs khusus, menu pranala "
"eksternal, utawa gabungan pranala internal lan eksternal. Sampeyan "
"bisa nggawe jumlah menu tambahan tanpa wates, saben menu bakal "
"otomatis nduwé blok sing gegandhengan (yen sampeyan wis nginstal <a "
"href=\":block_help\">modul Blok</a>). Kanthi milih <em>Ngowahi "
"menu</em>, sampeyan bisa nambah, ngowahi, utawa mbusak pranala kanggo "
"menu sing ditemtokake. Kaca daftar pranala nyedhiyakake antarmuka "
"seret lan seleh kanggo ngatur urutan pranala, lan nggawe hierarki ing "
"menu kasebut."

msgid "Default parent link"
msgstr "Tautan induk standar"

msgid ""
"Choose the menu link to be the default parent for a new link in the "
"content authoring form."
msgstr ""
"Pilih pranala menu kanggo dadi induk standar kanggo pranala anyar ing "
"formulir pembuatan konten."

msgid "The selected menu link is not under one of the selected menus."
msgstr "Tautan menu sing dipilih ora ana ing salah siji menu sing dipilih."

msgid ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> There is currently 1 menu link in %title. It "
"will be deleted (system-defined links will be reset)."
msgid_plural ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> There are currently @count menu links in "
"%title. They will be deleted (system-defined links will be reset)."
msgstr[0] ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> Saiki ana 1 pranala menu ing %title. Pranala "
"iki bakal dibusak (pranala sing ditemtokake sistem bakal direset)."
msgstr[1] ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> Saiki ana @count pranala menu ing %title. "
"Kabeh bakal dibusak (pranala sing ditemtokake sistem bakal direset)."

msgid "Drupal @version module name"
msgstr "Drupal @version jeneng modul"

msgid "Drupal @version machine name"
msgstr "Drupal @version jeneng mesin"

msgid "The human-readable name of the mapping"
msgstr "Asma sing bisa diwaca manungsa saka pemetaan kasebut"

msgid "The machine name of the mapping"
msgstr "Asma mesin saka pemetaan"

msgid "The group this mapping belongs to"
msgstr "Grup sing dadi kagungan peta iki"

msgid "The mappings linked to the breakpoints group"
msgstr "Pemetaan sing gegandhengan karo grup breakpoints"

msgid "About searching"
msgstr "Babagan panelusuran"

msgid ""
"You can display your shortcuts by enabling the <em>Shortcuts</em> "
"block on the <a href=\":blocks\">Blocks administration page</a>. "
"Certain administrative modules also display your shortcuts; for "
"example, the core <a href=\":toolbar-help\">Toolbar module</a> "
"provides a corresponding menu link."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nampilake pintasan kanthi ngaktifake blok "
"<em>Shortcuts</em> ing <a href=\":blocks\">kaca administrasi Blok</a>. "
"Sawetara modul administratif uga nampilake pintasan sampeyan; contone, "
"modul inti <a href=\":toolbar-help\">Toolbar</a> nyedhiyakake pranala "
"menu sing cocog."

msgid ""
"The new set is created by copying links from your default shortcut "
"set."
msgstr ""
"Set anyar digawe kanthi nyalin pranala saka set shortcut standar "
"sampeyan."

msgid "The new set is created by copying links from the %default set."
msgstr "Set anyar digawe kanthi nyalin pranala saka set %default."

msgid "The menu.mlid primary key for this menu link (= shortcut link)."
msgstr ""
"menu.mlid tombol kunci utama kanggo pranala menu iki (= pranala "
"pintasan)."

msgid "Administer menus and menu links"
msgstr "Ngatur menu lan pranala menu"

msgid ""
"The menu is only visible if the menu link for the current page is at "
"this level or below it. Use level 1 to always display this menu."
msgstr ""
"Menu mung katon yen pranala menu kanggo kaca saiki ana ing tingkat iki "
"utawa ing ngisoré. Gunakake tingkat 1 kanggo tansah nampilake menu "
"iki."

msgid "Menu language."
msgstr "Basa menu."

msgid "Menu i18n mode."
msgstr "Mode i18n menu."

msgid "Administer roles and permissions"
msgstr "Nglola peran lan idin akses"

msgid "Flood control blocked login attempt for uid %uid from %ip"
msgstr "Kontrol banjir ngalangi upaya mlebu kanggo uid %uid saka %ip"

msgid "Flood control blocked login attempt for uid %uid"
msgstr "Kontrol banjir ngalangi nyoba mlebu kanggo uid %uid"

msgid "Flood control blocked login attempt from %ip"
msgstr "Kontrol banjir ngalangi upaya mlebu saka %ip"

msgid "Menu link entry"
msgstr "Entri pranala menu"

msgid ""
"When providing a menu link as a tab, Drupal needs to know what the "
"parent menu link of that tab will be. Sometimes the parent will "
"already exist, but other times you will need to have one created. The "
"path of a parent link will always be the same path with the last part "
"left off. i.e, if the path to this view is <em>foo/bar/baz</em>, the "
"parent path would be <em>foo/bar</em>."
msgstr ""
"Nalika menehi pranala menu minangka tab, Drupal kudu ngerti apa "
"pranala menu induk saka tab kasebut. Kadhangkala induke wis ana, "
"nanging kadhangkala sampeyan kudu nggawe siji dhisik. Jalur saka "
"pranala induk bakal tansah padha karo jalur sing padha nanging bagean "
"pungkasan dicopot. Contone, yen jalur kanggo tampilan iki yaiku "
"<em>foo/bar/baz</em>, jalur induke yaiku <em>foo/bar</em>."

msgid "Normal menu link"
msgstr "Tautan menu biasa"

msgid "If creating a parent menu link, enter the title of the link."
msgstr "Yen nggawe pranala menu induk, lebokake judhul pranala kasebut."

msgid "If creating a parent menu link, enter the description of the link."
msgstr "Yen nggawe pranala menu induk, lebokake katrangan pranala kasebut."

msgid ""
"If the parent menu link is a tab, enter the weight of the tab. Heavier "
"tabs will sink and the lighter tabs will be positioned nearer to the "
"first menu link."
msgstr ""
"Yen pranala menu induk iku tab, lebokna bobot tab kasebut. Tab sing "
"luwih abot bakal tenggelam lan tab sing luwih entheng bakal dipasang "
"luwih cedhak karo pranala menu pisanan."

msgid "Views cannot create normal menu links for paths with a % in them."
msgstr ""
"Views ora bisa nggawe pranala menu normal kanggo jalur sing ana tandha "
"% ing njero."

msgid ""
"If \"Custom\", see <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\" "
"target=\"_blank\">the PHP docs</a> for date formats. Otherwise, enter "
"the number of different time units to display, which defaults to 2."
msgstr ""
"Yen \"Custom\", delengen <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\" "
"target=\"_blank\">dokumen PHP</a> kanggo format tanggal. Yen ora, "
"lebokake jumlah unit wektu sing beda kanggo ditampilake, sing "
"defaulté 2."

msgid "Primary Branding Color"
msgstr "Werna Branding Utama"

msgid "A clean, accessible, and flexible Drupal front-end theme."
msgstr "Tema front-end Drupal sing resik, gampang diakses, lan fleksibel."

msgid "Wide (1090)"
msgstr "Ambane (1090)"

msgid "Olivero Medium"
msgstr "Olivero Sedheng"

msgid "Content blocks"
msgstr "Blok isi"

msgid "Failed to fetch available update data:"
msgstr "Gagal njupuk data update sing kasedhiya:"

msgid ""
"See <a href=\"@url\">PHP OpenSSL requirements</a> in the Drupal.org "
"handbook for possible reasons this could happen and what you can do to "
"resolve them."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <a href=\"@url\">syarat PHP OpenSSL</a> ing handbook "
"Drupal.org kanggo alasan-alasan sing bisa nyebabake iki lan apa sing "
"bisa sampeyan lakoni kanggo ngrampungake."

msgid ""
"Check <a href=\"@url\">your local system logs</a> for additional error "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"Priksa <a href=\"@url\">log sistem lokal sampeyan</a> kanggo pesen "
"kesalahan tambahan."

msgid "Check your local system logs for additional error messages."
msgstr "Priksa log sistem lokal sampeyan kanggo pesen kesalahan tambahan."

msgid "Drupal update settings"
msgstr "Setelan nganyari Drupal"

msgid "For security reasons, your upload has been rejected."
msgstr "Amarga alasan keamanan, unggahan sampeyan wis ditolak."

msgid "Exporting your complete site configuration"
msgstr "Ngekspor konfigurasi situs lengkapmu"

msgid "Click <em>Export</em> and save the archive file."
msgstr "Klik <em>Export</em> lan simpen file arsip."

msgid ""
"Select the <em>Configuration type</em> that you want to export, and "
"then select the specific <em>Configuration name</em> to export."
msgstr ""
"Pilih <em>Jenis Konfigurasi</em> sing arep sampeyan ekspor, banjur "
"pilih <em>Jeneng Konfigurasi</em> sing spesifik kanggo diekspor."

msgid ""
"Use your browser to copy the text in the box marked <em>Here is your "
"configuration</em> to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake panyunggingmu kanggo nyalin teks ing kothak sing diwenehi "
"tanda <em>Here is your configuration</em> menyang papan klip."

msgid ""
"Paste the copied text into a plain-text editor on your computer or "
"other device, and save it using the suggested file name below the text "
"box."
msgstr ""
"Tempel teks sing wis disalin menyang editor teks polos ing komputer "
"utawa piranti liyane, lan simpen nganggo jeneng file sing disaranake "
"ing ngisor kothak teks."

msgid "Importing your complete site configuration"
msgstr "Ngimpor konfigurasi situs lengkap sampeyan"

msgid ""
"Browse to find the <em>Configuration archive</em> that you want to "
"import."
msgstr ""
"Telusuri kanggo golek <em>arsip Konfigurasi</em> sing pengin sampeyan "
"impor."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Upload</em>. Your configuration archive will be unpacked and "
"placed in the configuration synchronization directory, and you will be "
"redirected to the <em>Synchronize</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Upload</em>. Arsip konfigurasi sampeyan bakal dibukak lan "
"dilebokake ing direktori sinkronisasi konfigurasi, lan sampeyan bakal "
"dialihake menyang kaca <em>Synchronize</em>."

msgid ""
"Review the differences between your uploaded configuration and the "
"active configuration, if any, and click <em>Import all</em> to import "
"the changes."
msgstr ""
"Priksa bedane antarane konfigurasi sing wis sampeyan unggah karo "
"konfigurasi sing aktif, yen ana, banjur klik <em>Import all</em> "
"kanggo ngimpor owah-owahan kasebut."

msgid "Select the <em>Configuration type</em> that you want to import."
msgstr "Pilih <em>Jinis konfigurasi</em> sing pengin sampeyan impor."

msgid ""
"On your computer or other device, copy the YAML-format configuration "
"that you want to import to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Ing komputer utawa piranti liyane, salin konfigurasi format YAML sing "
"arep diimpor menyang clipboard."

msgid ""
"Paste the clipboard text into the box labeled <em>Paste your "
"configuration here</em>."
msgstr ""
"Tempel teks saka clipboard menyang kothak sing dijenengi <em>Paste "
"your configuration here</em>."

msgid "Click <em>Import</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Import</em>."

msgid "Managing and deploying configuration"
msgstr "Ngatur lan nglepas konfigurasi"

msgid "What is the configuration system?"
msgstr "Apa iku sistem konfigurasi?"

msgid ""
"The configuration system provides the ability for administrators to "
"customize the site, and to move and synchronize configuration changes "
"between development sites and the live site. It does this in 2 ways:"
msgstr ""
"Sistem konfigurasi nyedhiyakake kemampuan kanggo para administrator "
"supaya bisa ngatur situs kanthi pribadi, lan kanggo mindhah lan "
"nyelarasake owah-owahan konfigurasi antarane situs pangembangan lan "
"situs langsung. Iki ditindakake kanthi 2 cara:"

msgid "Providing storage for configuration"
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake panyimpenan kanggo konfigurasi"

msgid ""
"Providing a process in which configuration changes can be imported and "
"exported between instances of the same site; for example, from \"dev\" "
"to \"staging\" to \"live\""
msgstr ""
"Nyediakake proses ing ngendi owah-owahan konfigurasi bisa diimpor lan "
"diekspor antarane instansi situs sing padha; contone, saka \"dev\" "
"menyang \"staging\" banjur menyang \"live\""

msgid "What is configuration data?"
msgstr "Apa iku data konfigurasi?"

msgid ""
"Configuration data describes settings that define how your site "
"behaves or is displayed. For example, when a site administrator "
"updates settings using an administrative form, these settings are "
"stored as configuration data. Configuration data describes settings as "
"simple as a site name and as complex as a view or image style."
msgstr ""
"Data konfigurasi nerangake setelan sing nemtokake carane situs "
"sampeyan tumindak utawa ditampilake. Contone, nalika administrator "
"situs nganyari setelan nggunakake formulir administratif, setelan "
"kasebut disimpen minangka data konfigurasi. Data konfigurasi nerangake "
"setelan sing prasaja kaya jeneng situs lan sing luwih rumit kaya "
"tampilan utawa gaya gambar."

msgid "What kinds of configuration are there?"
msgstr "Apa jinis-jinis konfigurasi sing ana?"

msgid "Active configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi aktif"

msgid ""
"Active configuration is the current working configuration of a site. "
"Storage of active configuration is defined by the site, and resides in "
"the database by default."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi aktif yaiku konfigurasi situs sing saiki digunakake. "
"Penyimpanan konfigurasi aktif ditemtokake dening situs, lan sacara "
"standar disimpen ing basis data."

msgid ""
"A simple configuration item is a group of settings, such as the "
"settings for a module or theme. Each simple configuration item has its "
"own unique structure."
msgstr ""
"Item konfigurasi sing sederhana iku klompok setelan, kayata setelan "
"kanggo modul utawa tema. Saben item konfigurasi sing sederhana nduweni "
"struktur sing unik dhewe."

msgid ""
"Configuration entities are user-defined configuration items grouped by "
"type, such as views, image styles, and content types. Each "
"configuration entity within a type has a similar structure."
msgstr ""
"Entitas konfigurasi yaiku item konfigurasi sing digawe dening pangguna "
"sing diklompokaké miturut jinis, kaya views, gaya gambar, lan jinis "
"isi. Saben entitas konfigurasi ing siji jinis nduwèni struktur sing "
"padha."

msgid ""
"Default configuration can be defined by a module, theme, or "
"installation profile in its <em>config/install</em> or "
"<em>config/optional</em> directories. Configuration is provided in "
"YAML files (file extension .yml); YAML is a human-readable data "
"serialization standard that is used by the core software for several "
"purposes. Once the default configuration has been imported into the "
"site's active configuration (through installing the extension), that "
"configuration is owned by the site, not the extension. This means that "
"future updates of the extension will not override the site's active "
"configuration for that extension."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi bawaan bisa ditemtokake déning modul, tema, utawa profil "
"instalasi ing <em>config/install</em> utawa <em>config/optional</em> "
"direktori. Konfigurasi disedhiyakake ing file YAML (ekstensi file "
".yml); YAML iku standar serialisasi data sing gampang diwaca déning "
"manungsa lan digunakake déning piranti lunak inti kanggo "
"pirang-pirang tujuan. Sawise konfigurasi bawaan diimpor menyang "
"konfigurasi aktif situs (liwat instalasi ekstensi), konfigurasi kuwi "
"dadi kagungan situs, dudu ekstensi. Iki tegese nganyari ekstensi ing "
"mbesuk ora bakal ngowahi konfigurasi aktif situs kanggo ekstensi kuwi."

msgid "What is configuration synchronization?"
msgstr "Apa iku sinkronisasi konfigurasi?"

msgid ""
"Configuration synchronization is the process of exporting and "
"importing configuration to keep configuration synchronized between "
"different versions of a site; for example, between a development site "
"and the live site."
msgstr ""
"Sinkronisasi konfigurasi yaiku proses ngekspor lan ngimpor konfigurasi "
"kanggo njaga konfigurasi supaya tetep sinkron antarane versi situs "
"sing beda; contone, antarane situs pangembangan lan situs live."

msgid ""
"Each site has unique identifier, also called a <em>UUID</em>, which "
"identifies the site to the system in any instance of the site, as long "
"as the site instances have been reproduced as clones (cloning is when "
"the codebase and database are copied to create a new site instance). "
"When site instances are cloned, a \"dev\" instance of the site has the "
"same UUID as the \"live\" instance. When site instances share the same "
"UUID, configuration can be exported from one instance to another."
msgstr ""
"Saben situs duwe identifier unik, sing asring diarani <em>UUID</em>, "
"sing ngenali situs kasebut kanggo sistem ing saben instansi situs, yen "
"instansi situs kasebut wis diprodhuksi maneh minangka klon (kloning "
"iku nalika codebase lan database disalin kanggo nggawe instansi situs "
"anyar). Nalika instansi situs diklon, instansi \"dev\" saka situs "
"nduwe UUID sing padha karo instansi \"live\". Nalika instansi situs "
"nuduhake UUID sing padha, konfigurasi bisa diekspor saka siji instansi "
"menyang liyane."

msgid ""
"The following list contains terms and concepts related to "
"configuration synchronization:"
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar ing ngisor iki ngemot istilah lan konsep sing gegandhengan "
"karo sinkronisasi konfigurasi:"

msgid "Exported configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi sing diekspor"

msgid ""
"When configuration is exported, the active configuration is exported "
"as a set of files in YAML format. When using the <em>Configuration "
"synchronization</em> administrative UI, configuration can be exported "
"as a full-export or single-item archive. This archive can then be "
"imported into the destination site instance."
msgstr ""
"Nalika konfigurasi diekspor, konfigurasi aktif diekspor minangka "
"sakumpulan file ing format YAML. Nalika nggunakake <em>Configuration "
"synchronization</em> antarmuka administrasi, konfigurasi bisa diekspor "
"minangka ekspor penuh utawa arsip siji item. Arsip iki banjur bisa "
"diimpor menyang instansi situs tujuan."

msgid "Imported configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi sing diimpor"

msgid ""
"Imported configuration is configuration that has been exported from "
"another instance of the site (the \"source\") and is now being "
"imported into another site instance (the \"destination\"), thereby "
"updating its active configuration to match the imported configuration "
"data set."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi sing diimpor iku konfigurasi sing wis diekspor saka "
"instansi situs liyane (sing diarani \"sumber\") lan saiki diimpor "
"menyang instansi situs liyane (sing diarani \"tujuan\"), saengga "
"nganyari konfigurasi sing aktif supaya cocog karo data konfigurasi "
"sing diimpor."

msgid ""
"The configuration sync directory location is set in the site's "
"<em>settings.php</em> file. When configuration is exported, the active "
"configuration is exported and described in YAML files which are stored "
"in the configuration sync directory. After the first export, the "
"system compares the site's active configuration with the configuration "
"data in the sync directory and will only export active configuration "
"items that are different than their counterparts in the sync "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Panggonan direktori sinkronisasi konfigurasi disetel ing file "
"<em>settings.php</em> situs. Nalika konfigurasi diekspor, konfigurasi "
"aktif diekspor lan digambarkan ing file YAML sing disimpen ing "
"direktori sinkronisasi konfigurasi. Sawise ekspor pisanan, sistem "
"mbandhingake konfigurasi aktif situs karo data konfigurasi ing "
"direktori sinkronisasi lan mung bakal ngekspor item konfigurasi aktif "
"sing beda karo sing ana ing direktori sinkronisasi."

msgid "Managing configuration overview"
msgstr "Nglola ringkesan konfigurasi"

msgid ""
"Configuration management tasks, such as exporting or importing "
"configuration and synchronizing configuration, can be done either "
"through the administrative UI provided by the core Configuration "
"Manager module or a command-line interface (CLI) tool. Defining a "
"configuration sync directory path other than the default value "
"requires read/write access to the site's <em>settings.php</em> file."
msgstr ""
"Tugas manajemen konfigurasi, kaya ngekspor utawa ngimpor konfigurasi "
"lan nyelarasake konfigurasi, bisa ditindakake liwat antarmuka "
"administrasi sing disedhiyakake dening modul inti Configuration "
"Manager utawa alat antarmuka baris perintah (CLI). Nemtokake path "
"direktori sinkronisasi konfigurasi sing beda saka nilai default "
"mbutuhake akses maca/nulis menyang file <em>settings.php</em> situs."

msgid ""
"Most modules and themes also provide settings forms for updating the "
"configuration they provide. See the related topics listed below for "
"specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Kebanyakan modul lan tema uga nyedhiyakake formulir setelan kanggo "
"nganyari konfigurasi sing diwenehake. Delengen topik terkait sing "
"kadhaptar ing ngisor iki kanggo tugas khusus."

msgid "Managing media"
msgstr "Ngatur media"

msgid "What are media items?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi barang media?"

msgid "What is the media library?"
msgstr "Apa iku perpustakaan media?"

msgid ""
"The media library is a visual user interface for managing and reusing "
"media items. Add media items to content using Media reference fields "
"and the Media library field widget."
msgstr ""
"Pustaka media iku antarmuka panganggo visual kanggo ngatur lan "
"nggunakake maneh item media. Tambahake item media menyang isi nganggo "
"lapangan Referensi Media lan widget lapangan Pustaka Media."

msgid "What is an image style?"
msgstr "Apa iku gaya gambar?"

msgid ""
"An image style is a set of processing steps, known as "
"<em>effects</em>, that can be applied to images. Examples of effects "
"include scaling and cropping images to different sizes. Responsive "
"image styles can associate image styles with your theme's size "
"breakpoints. This allows serving images sized for the browser width."
msgstr ""
"Gaya gambar iku sawijining rangkaian langkah pangolahan, sing diarani "
"<em>efek</em>, sing bisa diterapake ing gambar. Conto efek kalebu "
"ngowahi ukuran lan motong gambar menyang ukuran sing beda-beda. Gaya "
"gambar responsif bisa nyambungake gaya gambar karo titik jeda ukuran "
"tema sampeyan. Iki ngidini nyedhiyakake gambar sing cocog karo "
"jembaré browser."

msgid "Overview of managing media"
msgstr "Ringkesan babagan ngatur media"

msgid "The following modules provide media-related functionality:"
msgstr ""
"Modhul-modhul ing ngisor iki nyedhiyakake fungsi sing gegandhengan "
"karo media:"

msgid "Media items and media types are managed by the core Media module."
msgstr "Item media lan jinis media diatur dening modul Media inti."

msgid ""
"The core Media module provides a Media reference field to add media to "
"content entities. The core File and Image modules also provide "
"reference fields. It is recommended to use the Media reference field "
"because it is more versatile."
msgstr ""
"Modhul Media inti nyedhiyakake lapangan referensi Media kanggo nambah "
"media ing entitas konten. Modhul File lan Gambar inti uga nyedhiyakake "
"lapangan referensi. Disaranake nggunakake lapangan referensi Media "
"amarga luwih fleksibel."

msgid ""
"The core Image module provides a user interface for defining image "
"styles. The core Responsive Image module provides responsive image "
"styles. Using the core Breakpoint module, and a breakpoint-enabled "
"theme, these responsive styles can serve images sized for the browser."
msgstr ""
"Modul Image inti nyedhiyakake antarmuka panganggo kanggo nemtokake "
"gaya gambar. Modul Responsive Image inti nyedhiyakake gaya gambar "
"responsif. Kanthi nggunakake modul Breakpoint inti, lan tema sing "
"ndhukung breakpoint, gaya responsif iki bisa nyedhiyani gambar kanthi "
"ukuran sing cocog kanggo browser."

msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/core/modules/media\">Media "
"module</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/core/modules/media\">Modul "
"media</a>"

msgid "Adding an image style"
msgstr "Nambahaké gaya gambar"

msgid "Click <em>Add image style</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah gaya gambar</em>."

msgid ""
"Enter a descriptive <em>Image style name</em>, and click <em>Create "
"new style</em>."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna jeneng <em>Gaya Gambar</em> sing nerangake, banjur klik "
"<em>Gawe gaya anyar</em>."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Effect</em>, choose an effect to apply and click "
"<em>Add</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Effect</em>, pilih efek sing arep ditrapake lan klik "
"<em>Add</em>."

msgid ""
"Configure the effect on the next page. Most effects require some "
"additional configuration after they are added.  For example, for the "
"<em>Crop</em> effect, enter the <em>Width</em> and <em>Height</em> to "
"crop the image to, and choose the <em>Anchor</em> point. Click <em>Add "
"effect</em>."
msgstr ""
"Atur efek ing kaca sabanjure. Kakehan efek butuh konfigurasi tambahan "
"sawisé ditambahaké. Contoné, kanggo efek <em>Crop</em>, lebokaké "
"<em>Width</em> lan <em>Height</em> kanggo motong gambar, banjur pilih "
"titik <em>Anchor</em>. Klik <em>Add effect</em>."

msgid ""
"Repeat the previous two steps until all of the effects have been "
"added."
msgstr "Baleni loro langkah sadurunge nganti kabeh efek wis ditambahake."

msgid ""
"Drag to change the order of the effects. Then click <em>Save</em> to "
"save the new order."
msgstr ""
"Seret kanggo ngganti urutan efek. Banjur klik <em>Simpen</em> kanggo "
"nyimpen urutan anyar."

msgid ""
"The image style can now be used to format a field containing an image "
"in your layouts or traditional field displays. It can also be used as "
"part of a responsive image style. See related topics below for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Gaya gambar saiki bisa digunakake kanggo format sawijining kolom sing "
"ngemot gambar ing tata letakmu utawa tampilan kolom tradisional. Gaya "
"iki uga bisa digunakake minangka bagian saka gaya gambar responsif. "
"Delengen topik sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap."

msgid "Adding a new media type"
msgstr "Nambah jinis media anyar"

msgid ""
"If there is not already a media type for the type of media you want to "
"use on your site, click <em>Add media type</em>."
msgstr ""
"Yen durung ana jinis media kanggo jinis media sing pengin sampeyan "
"gunakake ing situs sampeyan, klik <em>Tambah jinis media</em>."

msgid ""
"Enter a <em>Name</em> and <em>Description</em> for your media type, "
"and select the <em>Media source</em>."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna <em>Nama</em> lan <em>Deskripsi</em> kanggo jinis media "
"sampeyan, lan pilih <em>Sumber Media</em>."

msgid ""
"For most media sources, there is additional information that will need "
"to be stored with your media item, in a field on your media type. "
"Under <em>Media source configuration</em>, select an existing field to "
"re-use to store this information, or select <em> - Create -</em> to "
"create a new field."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo paling akèh sumber media, ana informasi tambahan sing kudu "
"disimpen bareng karo item media sampeyan, ing sawijining lapangan ing "
"jinis media sampeyan. Ing ngisor <em>Media source configuration</em>, "
"pilih lapangan sing wis ana kanggo digunakake maneh nyimpen informasi "
"iki, utawa pilih <em> - Create -</em> kanggo nggawe lapangan anyar."

msgid ""
"Note the types of metadata in the <em>Field mapping</em> section that "
"can be mapped to fields on your media type."
msgstr ""
"Wigati dipunpirsani jinis-jinis metadata ing <em>Field mapping</em> "
"kang isa dipasangake karo kolom ing jinis media panjenengan."

msgid ""
"Optionally, add additional fields for the metadata noted above or for "
"other information that you want to store to your media type by "
"clicking on <em>Manage fields</em> (see related topic below)."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan, tambahaké lapangan tambahan kanggo metadata sing kasebut ing "
"ndhuwur utawa kanggo informasi liyane sing pengin disimpen ing jinis "
"media sampeyan kanthi ngeklik <em>Manage fields</em> (deleng topik "
"sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki)."

msgid ""
"If you have added metadata fields, click <em>Edit</em>. Under "
"<em>Field mapping</em>, select the fields you added for each piece of "
"metadata information."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan wis nambahaké kolom metadata, klik <em>Edit</em>. Ing "
"ngisor <em>Field mapping</em>, pilih kolom-kolom sing wis sampeyan "
"tambahaké kanggo saben potongan informasi metadata."

msgid ""
"You can now use this media type by adding a Media reference field to "
"any content entity sub-type. See related topic below."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan saiki bisa nggunakake jinis media iki kanthi nambahake kolom "
"referensi Media menyang sub-jinis entitas isi apa wae. Waca topik sing "
"gegandhengan ing ngisor iki."

msgid "Migrating, updating, and upgrading"
msgstr "Migrasi, nganyari, lan ngupgrade"

msgid "What are updating, upgrading, and migrating?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi nganyari, nganyarke, lan migrasi?"

msgid ""
"<em>Updating</em> is the process of changing from one minor version of "
"the software to a newer version, such as from version 8.3.4 to 8.3.5, "
"or 8.3.5 to 8.4.0. Starting with version 8.x, you can also update to "
"major versions 9, 10, and beyond if your add-on modules, themes, and "
"install profiles are compatible. <em>Upgrading</em> is the process of "
"changing from an older major version of the software to a newer "
"version, such as from version 7 to 8. <em>Migrating</em> is the "
"process of importing data into a site."
msgstr ""
"<em>Nganyari</em> iku proses ngganti saka versi minor siji saka "
"piranti lunak menyang versi sing luwih anyar, kaya saka versi 8.3.4 "
"menyang 8.3.5, utawa 8.3.5 menyang 8.4.0. Wiwit versi 8.x, sampeyan "
"uga bisa nganyari menyang versi mayor 9, 10, lan sakteruse yen modul "
"tambahan, tema, lan profil instalasi sampeyan kompatibel. "
"<em>Ngupgrade</em> iku proses ngganti saka versi mayor lawas saka "
"piranti lunak menyang versi anyar, kaya saka versi 7 menyang 8. "
"<em>Migrasi</em> iku proses ngimpor data menyang situs."

msgid ""
"To upgrade a site from Drupal 6 or 7 to Drupal 8 or later, keeping the "
"content and configuration the same, you will install the new version "
"of the software and add-on modules and themes in a new site, and then "
"migrate the content and other data from your old site into the new "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nganyari situs saka Drupal 6 utawa 7 menyang Drupal 8 utawa "
"versi luwih anyar, kanthi njaga isi lan konfigurasi supaya padha, "
"sampeyan bakal masang versi anyar saka piranti lunak lan modul "
"tambahan uga tema ing situs anyar, banjur migrasi isi lan data liyane "
"saka situs lawas menyang situs anyar kasebut."

msgid "Overview of Migrating"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum Bab Migrasi"

msgid "Provides the underlying API for migrating data."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake API dhasar kanggo migrasi data."

msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/upgrading-drupal\">Upgrading "
"Drupal</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/upgrading-drupal\">Ningkataké "
"Drupal</a>"

msgid "Migrating data for an upgrade using the user interface"
msgstr "Miwiti migrasi data kanggo nganyari nganggo antarmuka panganggo"

msgid ""
"Read the introduction and follow the <em>Preparation steps</em> on the "
"page. Then click <em>Continue</em>."
msgstr ""
"Waca pambuka lan tindakna <em>Langkah-langkah Persiapan</em> ing kaca "
"kasebut. Banjur klik <em>Terusake</em>."

msgid ""
"Select the Drupal version of the source site. Also enter the database "
"credentials and public and private files directories (private file "
"directory is not available when migrating from Drupal 6). Click "
"<em>Review upgrade</em>."
msgstr ""
"Pilih versi Drupal saka situs sumber. Uga lebokake kredensial database "
"lan direktori file umum lan pribadi (direktori file pribadi ora "
"kasedhiya nalika migrasi saka Drupal 6). Klik <em>Review upgrade</em>."

msgid ""
"If the next page you see contains a message about conflicting content, "
"that means that the site where you are running the upgrade is not "
"empty. If you continue, you will lose the data in the site. If that is "
"acceptable, click the button to continue; if not, start these steps "
"over in a new, clean Drupal site."
msgstr ""
"Yen kaca sabanjure sing sampeyan deleng ngemot pesen babagan isi sing "
"bentrok, iku tegese situs sing sampeyan gunakake kanggo nglakokake "
"upgrade ora kosong. Yen sampeyan terusake, sampeyan bakal kelangan "
"data ing situs kasebut. Yen kuwi bisa ditampa, klik tombol kanggo "
"nerusake; yen ora, miwiti maneh langkah-langkah iki ing situs Drupal "
"anyar sing resik."

msgid ""
"On the <em>What will be upgraded?</em> page, review the list of "
"modules whose data will not be upgraded. If that list is not empty and "
"you want to migrate the data from those modules, you will need to "
"download contributed modules and/or install core or contributed "
"modules, and start these steps over."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca <em>What will be upgraded?</em>, priksa dhaptar modul sing "
"datane ora bakal di-upgrade. Yen dhaptar kasebut ora kosong lan "
"sampeyan pengin migrate data saka modul-modul kasebut, sampeyan kudu "
"ngundhuh modul modul sing digawe komunitas lan/utawa masang modul inti "
"utawa modul sing digawe komunitas, banjur miwiti langkah-langkah iki "
"maneh."

msgid ""
"When the list of modules that will and will not be upgraded meets your "
"expectations, click <em>Perform upgrade</em> and wait for the upgrade "
"to complete. You will see a message about the number of upgrade tasks "
"that were successful or failed, and you can review the upgrade message "
"log by clicking the link on the results page."
msgstr ""
"Nalika dhaptar modul sing bakal lan ora bakal dianyari wis cocog karo "
"pangajab sampeyan, klik <em>Perform upgrade</em> lan enteni nganti "
"proses pembaruan rampung. Sampeyan bakal weruh pesen babagan jumlah "
"tugas pembaruan sing sukses utawa gagal, lan sampeyan bisa mriksa log "
"pesen pembaruan kanthi ngeklik pranala ing kaca asil."

msgid ""
"<a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/upgrading-drupal/upgrading-from-drupal-6-or-7-to-drupal-8-and-newer\">Upgrading "
"from Drupal 6 or 7 to Drupal 8 (and newer)</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/upgrading-drupal/upgrading-from-drupal-6-or-7-to-drupal-8-and-newer\">Ngapikake "
"saka Drupal 6 utawa 7 menyang Drupal 8 (lan versi sing luwih "
"anyar)</a>"

msgid "Configuring a responsive image style"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi gaya gambar responsif"

msgid "Click <em>Add responsive image style</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Add responsive image style</em>."

msgid "Enter a descriptive <em>Label</em> for your style."
msgstr "Lebokna <em>Label</em> sing nerangake kanggo gayamu."

msgid ""
"Select a <em>Breakpoint group</em> from the groups defined by your "
"installed themes and modules."
msgstr ""
"Pilih <em>Grup Breakpoint</em> saka grup-grup sing wis ditemtokake "
"dening tema lan modul sing wis sampeyan pasang."

msgid ""
"On the next page, locate the fieldsets for the breakpoints provided by "
"the selected <em>Breakpoint group</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca sabanjure, goleki fieldsets kanggo breakpoints sing "
"diwenehake dening <em>Kelompok Breakpoint</em> sing dipilih."

msgid ""
"For each breakpoint that you want to use, expand the corresponding "
"fieldset. Select the <em>Select a single image style.</em> radio "
"button under <em>Type</em> for the breakpoint, and select the "
"<em>Image style</em> to use for images when that breakpoint is in "
"effect. Repeat this step for the rest of the breakpoints you want to "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo saben breakpoint sing pengin sampeyan gunakake, kembangaké "
"fieldset sing cocog. Pilih tombol radio <em>Select a single image "
"style.</em> ing ngisor <em>Type</em> kanggo breakpoint kuwi, lan pilih "
"<em>Image style</em> sing arep digunakake kanggo gambar nalika "
"breakpoint kuwi aktif. Baleni langkah iki kanggo kabeh breakpoint "
"liyane sing pengin sampeyan gunakake."

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>"
msgstr "Klik <em>Simpen</em>"

msgid ""
"You can now use this responsive image style to format a field "
"containing an image, in your layouts or traditional field displays. "
"See related topics below for more information."
msgstr ""
"Saiki sampeyan bisa nggunakake gaya gambar responsif iki kanggo format "
"lapangan sing ngemot gambar, ing tata letak utawa tampilan lapangan "
"tradisional. Delengen topik terkait ing ngisor iki kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap."

msgid "Entity create"
msgstr "Nggawé entitas"

msgid "Human name of the parent node type."
msgstr "Jeneng manungsa saka jinis node induk."

msgid "Machine name of the parent node type."
msgstr "Jeneng mesin saka jinis node induk."

msgid "@title sub-navigation"
msgstr "@title sub-navigasi"

msgid "Moving content between workflow states"
msgstr "Pindhah isi antarane status alur kerja"

msgid "Who can change workflow states?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa ngganti status alur kerja?"

msgid "Click <em>Edit</em> to edit the entity."
msgstr "Klik <em>Edit</em> kanggo nyunting entitas kasebut."

msgid ""
"At the bottom of the page, select the new workflow state under "
"<em>Change to:</em> and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor kaca, pilih status alur kerja anyar ing <em>Change to:</em> "
"lan klik <em>Save</em>."

msgid "Who can configure a workflow?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nyetel workflow?"

msgid "Make a plan for the new workflow:"
msgstr "Gawe rencana kanggo alur kerja anyar:"

msgid ""
"Decide which workflow states you need; for example, <em>Concept</em>, "
"<em>Review</em>, and <em>Final</em>."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan kahanan workflow sing sampeyan butuhake; contone, "
"<em>Konsep</em>, <em>Review</em>, lan <em>Final</em>."

msgid "Decide on the settings for each state:"
msgstr "Mutusaké setelan kanggo saben status:"

msgid "<em>Label</em>: the state name"
msgstr "<em>Label</em>: jeneng negara"

msgid ""
"<em>Published</em>: if checked, when content reaches this state it "
"will be made visible on the site (to users with permission)."
msgstr ""
"<em>Dipublikasi</em>: yen dipilih, nalika isi tekan kahanan iki, bakal "
"digawe katon ing situs (kanggo pangguna sing duwe ijin)."

msgid ""
"<em>Default revision</em>: if checked, when content reaches this state "
"it will become the default revision of the content; published content "
"is automatically the default revision."
msgstr ""
"<em>Revisi standar</em>: yen dipriksa, nalika isi tekan kahanan iki "
"bakal dadi revisi standar saka isi kasebut; isi sing wis diterbitake "
"otomatis dadi revisi standar."

msgid "Decide which state content should be created in."
msgstr "Mutusake ing negara endi konten kudu digawe."

msgid ""
"Decide on the list of allowed transitions between states. For example, "
"you might want a transition between <em>Concept</em> and "
"<em>Review</em>. Each transition has a label; for example, the Concept "
"to Review transition might be labeled \"Review concept\"."
msgstr ""
"Timbangna dhaptar transisi sing diidini antarane status. Contone, "
"sampeyan bisa pengin transisi antarane <em>Concept</em> lan "
"<em>Review</em>. Saben transisi nduweni label; contone, transisi saka "
"Concept menyang Review bisa duwe label \"Review concept\"."

msgid "Click <em>Add workflow</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Add workflow</em>."

msgid ""
"Enter a name in the <em>Label</em> field, select <em>Content "
"moderation</em> from the <em>Workflow type</em> field, and click "
"<em>Save</em>."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna jeneng ing lapangan <em>Label</em>, pilih <em>Content "
"moderation</em> saka lapangan <em>Workflow type</em>, banjur klik "
"<em>Save</em>."

msgid ""
"Verify that the <em>States</em> list matches your planned states. You "
"can add missing states by clicking <em>Add a new state</em>. You can "
"edit or delete states by clicking <em>Edit</em> or <em>Delete</em> "
"under <em>Operations</em> (if the <em>Delete</em> option is not "
"available, you will first need to delete any <em>Transitions</em> to "
"or from this state)."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa dhaptar <em>States</em> cocog karo negara-negara sing "
"wis direncanakake. Sampeyan bisa nambah negara sing durung ana kanthi "
"ngeklik <em>Add a new state</em>. Sampeyan uga bisa ngowahi utawa "
"mbusak negara kanthi ngeklik <em>Edit</em> utawa <em>Delete</em> ing "
"ngisor <em>Operations</em> (yen pilihan <em>Delete</em> ora kasedhiya, "
"sampeyan kudu mbusak dhisik kabeh <em>Transitions</em> menyang utawa "
"saka negara iki)."

msgid ""
"Verify that the <em>Transitions</em> list matches your plan. You can "
"add missing transitions by clicking <em>Add a new transition</em>. You "
"can edit or delete transitions by clicking <em>Edit</em> or "
"<em>Delete</em> under <em>Operations</em>."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa dhaptar <em>Transitions</em> cocog karo rencanamu. "
"Sampeyan bisa nambah transisi sing ilang kanthi ngeklik <em>Add a new "
"transition</em>. Sampeyan bisa ngowahi utawa mbusak transisi kanthi "
"ngeklik <em>Edit</em> utawa <em>Delete</em> ing ngisor "
"<em>Operations</em>."

msgid ""
"Check the entity subtypes that you want to apply the workflow to. For "
"example, you might choose to apply your workflow to the <em>Page</em> "
"content type, but not to <em>Article</em>."
msgstr ""
"Priksa jinis entitas sing pengin sampeyan terapake workflow. Contone, "
"sampeyan bisa milih kanggo nerapake workflow ing jinis konten "
"<em>Page</em>, nanging ora kanggo <em>Article</em>."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Workflow settings</em>, select the <em>Default moderation "
"state</em> for new content."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Setelan Workflow</em>, pilih <em>Status moderasi standar</em> "
"kanggo isi anyar."

msgid "Click <em>Save</em> to save your workflow."
msgstr "Klik <em>Save</em> kanggo nyimpen workflow sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Optionally (recommended), create a view for your custom workflow, to "
"provide a page for content editors to see what content needs to be "
"moderated. You can do this if the Views UI module is installed, by "
"following the steps in the related <em>Creating a new view</em> topic "
"listed below under <em>Related topics</em>. When creating the view, "
"under <em>View settings</em> &gt; <em>Show</em>, select the revision "
"data type you configured the workflow for, and be sure to display the "
"<em>Workflow State</em> field in your view."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan (disaranake), gawe sawijining tampilan kanggo alur kerja "
"kustom sampeyan, kanggo nyedhiyakake kaca supaya editor konten bisa "
"ndeleng konten apa sing kudu dimoderasi. Sampeyan bisa nindakake iki "
"yen modul Views UI wis diinstal, kanthi ngetutake langkah-langkah ing "
"topik <em>Creating a new view</em> sing ana ing ngisor <em>Related "
"topics</em>. Nalika nggawe tampilan, ing <em>View settings</em> &gt; "
"<em>Show</em>, pilih jinis data revisi sing wis sampeyan aturake "
"kanggo alur kerja, lan priksa manawa nampilake kolom <em>Workflow "
"State</em> ing tampilan sampeyan."

msgid "Managing content moderation workflows"
msgstr "Ngatur alur karya moderasi isi"

msgid "What is a content moderation workflow?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi alur kerja moderasi konten?"

msgid ""
"On some sites, new content and content revisions need to be "
"<em>moderated</em>. That is, they need to pass through several "
"<em>states</em> before becoming visible to site visitors. The "
"collection of states and the definition of the transitions between "
"states is known as a <em>workflow</em>. For example, new content might "
"start out in a <em>Draft</em> state, and then might need to pass "
"through several <em>Review</em> states before it becomes "
"<em>Published</em> on the live site."
msgstr ""
"Ing sawetara situs, isi anyar lan revisi isi perlu "
"<em>dimoderasi</em>. Tegese, isi kasebut kudu liwat sawetara "
"<em>status</em> sadurunge dadi katingal kanggo pengunjung situs. "
"Kumpulan status lan definisi transisi antar status kasebut dikenal "
"minangka <em>workflow</em>. Contone, isi anyar bisa diwiwiti ing "
"status <em>Draft</em>, banjur kudu liwat sawetara status "
"<em>Review</em> sadurunge dadi <em>Published</em> ing situs sing "
"aktif."

msgid "Overview of content moderation workflows"
msgstr "Ringkesan saka alur kerja moderasi isi"

msgid ""
"The core Content Moderation module allows you to expand on core "
"software's \"unpublished\" and \"published\" states for content. It "
"allows you to have a published version that is live, but have a "
"separate working copy that is undergoing review before it is "
"published. This is achieved by using workflows to apply different "
"states and transitions to entities as needed."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Content Moderation ngidini sampeyan ngembangake status "
"\"durung diterbitake\" lan \"wis diterbitake\" saka piranti lunak inti "
"kanggo isi. Iki ngidini sampeyan duwe versi sing wis diterbitake lan "
"aktif, nanging uga duwe salinan kerja sing kapisah sing lagi direview "
"sadurunge diterbitake. Iki dirampungake kanthi nggunakake workflow "
"kanggo nerapake status lan transisi sing beda-beda marang entitas "
"miturut kebutuhan."

msgid ""
"The core Workflows module allows you to manage workflows with states "
"and transitions."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Workflows ngidini sampeyan ngatur workflows nganggo status "
"lan transisi."

msgid ""
"See the related topics listed below for specific tasks and background "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Delengen topik-topik sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki kanggo "
"tugas-tugas tartamtu lan informasi latar."

msgid "On-line documentation about Content Moderation"
msgstr "Dokumentasi on-line babagan Moderasi Isi"

msgid ""
"If %identifier is a valid account, an email will be sent with "
"instructions to reset your password."
msgstr ""
"Yen %identifier iku akun sing sah, email bakal dikirim karo pandhuan "
"kanggo ngreset sandhi sampeyan."

msgid ""
"@language translation was not added. To add a translation, you must "
"modify the configuration."
msgstr ""
"@language terjemahan durung ditambahake. Kanggo nambah terjemahan, "
"sampeyan kudu ngowahi konfigurasi."

msgid "No page is specified"
msgstr "Ora ana kaca sing ditemtokake"

msgid "Provide markup for the area using any available text format."
msgstr ""
"Wenehana markup kanggo area kasebut nggunakake format teks sing "
"kasedhiya."

msgid "Provide markup for the area with minimal filtering."
msgstr "Wenehi markup kanggo wilayah kanthi panyaringan minimal."

msgid ""
"You may enter data from this view as per the \"Available global token "
"replacements\" above. You may include the following allowed HTML tags: "
"<code>@tags</code>"
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa mlebu data saka tampilan iki miturut \"Penggantos token "
"global sing kasedhiya\" sing ana ing ndhuwur. Sampeyan bisa nambahake "
"tag HTML sing diidini kaya ing ngisor iki: <code>@tags</code>"

msgid ""
"You may include the following allowed HTML tags with these "
"\"Replacement patterns\": <code>@tags</code>"
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nambahake tag HTML sing diidini ing ngisor iki nganggo "
"\"Pola Pangantos\" iki: <code>@tags</code>"

msgid "There are no @entity_type_plural matching \"%value\"."
msgstr "Ora ana @entity_type_plural sing cocog karo \"%value\"."

msgid ""
"Many @entity_type_plural are called %value. Specify the one you want "
"by appending the id in parentheses, like \"@value (@id)\"."
msgstr ""
"Akeh @entity_type_plural sing dijenengi %value. Wenehi tandha sing "
"dikarepake kanthi nambahake id ing jero kurung, kaya \"@value (@id)\"."

msgid ""
"Multiple @entity_type_plural match this reference; \"%multiple\". "
"Specify the one you want by appending the id in parentheses, like "
"\"@value (@id)\"."
msgstr ""
"Akeh @entity_type_plural sing cocog karo referensi iki; \"%multiple\". "
"Wenehana siji sing sampeyan karepake kanthi nambahake id ing kurung, "
"kaya \"@value (@id)\"."

msgid ""
"The module '@module_name' is providing the database driver "
"'@driver_name'."
msgstr "Modul '@module_name' nyedhiyakake driver database '@driver_name'."

msgid ""
"Failed to connect to the server. The server reports the following "
"message: <p class=\"error\">@message</p> For more help adding or "
"updating code on your server, see the <a "
"href=\":handbook_url\">handbook</a>."
msgstr ""
"Gagal nyambung menyang server. Server nglaporake pesen kaya ing ngisor "
"iki: <p class=\"error\">@message</p> Kanggo entuk pitulungan luwih "
"lengkap babagan nambah utawa nganyari kode ing server sampeyan, "
"delengen <a href=\":handbook_url\">handbook</a>."

msgid ""
"HTML tables can be created with table headers and caption/summary "
"elements."
msgstr "Tabel HTML bisa digawe nganggo header tabel lan unsur caption/summary."

msgid ""
"Alt text is required by default on images added through CKEditor (note "
"that this can be overridden)."
msgstr ""
"Tèks alt dibutuhaké sacara bawaan ing gambar sing ditambahaké liwat "
"CKEditor (cathetan manawa iki bisa diowahi)."

msgid ""
"Semantic HTML5 figure/figcaption are available to add captions to "
"images."
msgstr ""
"Figure/figcaption HTML5 semantik kasedhiya kanggo nambah caption ing "
"gambar."

msgid "This log is not persistent"
msgstr "Log iki ora permanen"

msgid ""
"The Database Logging module logs may be cleared by administrators and "
"automated cron tasks, so they should not be used for <a "
"href=\":audit_trail_wiki\">forensic logging</a>. For forensic "
"purposes, use the Syslog module."
msgstr ""
"Modul Database Logging bisa dibersihake déning para administrator lan "
"tugas cron otomatis, mula ora kudhu digunakake kanggo <a "
"href=\":audit_trail_wiki\">logging forensik</a>. Kanggo tujuan "
"forensik, gunakake modul Syslog."

msgid "Your upload has been renamed to %filename."
msgstr "Unggahanmu wis diganti jeneng dadi %filename."

msgid ""
"Separate extensions with a comma or space. Each extension can contain "
"alphanumeric characters, '.', and '_', and should start and end with "
"an alphanumeric character."
msgstr ""
"Pisahake ekstensi nganggo koma utawa spasi. Saben ekstensi bisa ngemot "
"karakter alfanumerik, '.', lan '_', lan kudu diwiwiti lan diakhiri "
"karo karakter alfanumerik."

msgid ""
"The list of allowed extensions is not valid. Allowed characters are "
"a-z, 0-9, '.', and '_'. The first and last characters cannot be '.' or "
"'_', and these two characters cannot appear next to each other. "
"Separate extensions with a comma or space."
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar ekstensi sing diijini ora sah. Karakter sing diijini yaiku "
"a-z, 0-9, '.', lan '_'. Karakter pisanan lan pungkasan ora kena '.' "
"utawa '_', lan loro karakter iki ora kena muncul bebarengan. Pisahake "
"ekstensi nganggo koma utawa spasi."

msgid ""
"Add %txt_extension to the list of allowed extensions to securely "
"upload files with a %extension extension. The %txt_extension extension "
"will then be added automatically."
msgstr ""
"Tambahna %txt_extension menyang daftar ekstensi sing diijini kanggo "
"ngunggah file kanthi ekstensi %extension kanthi aman. Ekstensi "
"%txt_extension bakal ditambahake kanthi otomatis sawisé kuwi."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; @layout_link."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; @layout_link."

msgid ""
"Configure the block and click <em>Save block</em>; see "
"@configure_topic for configuration details."
msgstr ""
"Atur block lan klik <em>Save block</em>; deleng @configure_topic "
"kanggo rincian konfigurasi."

msgid "Translating configuration"
msgstr "Menerjemahaké konfigurasi"

msgid ""
"For configuration entities, find the specific entity that you want to "
"translate on the next page, and click <em>Translate</em> under "
"<em>Operations</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo entitas konfigurasi, goleki entitas sing pengin sampeyan "
"terjemahake ing kaca sabanjure, lan klik <em>Translate</em> ing "
"ngisore <em>Operations</em>."

msgid ""
"Enter translations for the translatable text fields for the "
"configuration item, and save."
msgstr ""
"Lebokake terjemahan kanggo kolom teks sing bisa diterjemahake ing item "
"konfigurasi, banjur simpen."

msgid "Configuring content language settings and translation"
msgstr "Nggonfigurasi setelan basa isi lan terjemahan"

msgid ""
"Under <em>Custom language settings</em>, find the content entity types "
"that should have customized language settings on your site. Check the "
"box next to each one. A section will appear below the list with "
"settings for that entity type."
msgstr ""
"Under <em>Custom language settings</em>, golek jinis entitas isi sing "
"kudu nduwèni setelan basa khusus ing situs sampeyan. Centhang kothak "
"ing jejere saben entitas. Siji bagean bakal muncul ing ngisor dhaptar "
"kanthi setelan kanggo jinis entitas kasebut."

msgid ""
"For each entity type you checked, in the settings section below check "
"the boxes for each entity sub-type that should be "
"<em>Translatable</em> on your site. If the entity type does not have "
"sub-types, there is just one check box for the entity type as a whole."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo saben jinis entitas sing wis sampeyan centhang, ing bagean "
"setelan ing ngisor iki centhang kothak kanggo saben sub-jinis entitas "
"sing kudu <em>Translatable</em> ing situs sampeyan. Yen jinis entitas "
"ora duwe sub-jinis, mung ana siji kothak centhang kanggo jinis entitas "
"kasebut kanthi sakabehe."

msgid ""
"For each entity type or subtype, select the <em>Default language</em>. "
"Also, if you want to have languages other than the default available "
"when you create content, check <em>Show language selector on create "
"and edit pages</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo saben jinis utawa subtipe entitas, pilih <em>Bahasa "
"standar</em>. Uga, yen sampeyan pengin duwe basa liya saliyané basa "
"standar sing kasedhiya nalika nggawe konten, centhang <em>Tampilake "
"pilihan bahasa ing kaca nggawe lan ngedit</em>."

msgid ""
"For each <em>Translatable</em> type or sub-type, look through the list "
"of fields for the type or sub-type, and verify that only the fields "
"that should be translatable are checked. For example, you would "
"probably want to translate a <em>Title</em> field, but you might not "
"want to translate a <em>Start date</em> field."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo saben jinis utawa sub-jinis <em>Translatable</em>, delengen "
"dhaptar lapangan kanggo jinis utawa sub-jinis kasebut, lan priksa "
"manawa mung lapangan sing kudu bisa diterjemahake sing wis ditandhani. "
"Contone, sampeyan mesthi pengin nerjemahake lapangan <em>Title</em>, "
"nanging sampeyan bisa uga ora pengin nerjemahake lapangan <em>Start "
"date</em>."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save configuration</em> when all of your changes are "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Simpen konfigurasi</em> nalika kabeh pangowahanmu wis "
"rampung."

msgid "Working with languages and translations"
msgstr "Makarya karo basa lan terjemahan"

msgid "What text can be translated in your site?"
msgstr "Teks apa sing bisa diterjemahaké ing situs sampeyan?"

msgid "There are three types of text that can be translated:"
msgstr "Ana telung jinis teks sing bisa diterjemahaké:"

msgid ""
"User interface text that is provided by the core software, your "
"install profile, themes, and modules is provided in English, but can "
"be translated into other languages. You can also download translations "
"that community-members have provided."
msgstr ""
"Tèks antarmuka panganggo sing disedhiyakake déning piranti lunak "
"inti, profil instalasi, tema, lan modul sampeyan disedhiyakake ing "
"basa Inggris, nanging bisa diterjemahaké menyang basa liya. Sampeyan "
"uga bisa ndownload terjemahan sing wis disedhiyakake déning anggota "
"komunitas."

msgid "Working with languages overview"
msgstr "Mirsani gambaran umum babagan kerja karo basa-basa"

msgid "Adding a language"
msgstr "Nambahaké basa"

msgid "Add a language to your site."
msgstr "Tambahaké basa ing situs sampeyan."

msgid "Click <em>Add language</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah basa</em>."

msgid ""
"If your language is in the <em>Language name</em> list, select it and "
"click <em>Add language</em>."
msgstr ""
"Yen basa sampeyan ana ing dhaptar <em>Language name</em>, pilih lan "
"klik <em>Add language</em>."

msgid ""
"If your language is not in the list, select <em>Custom "
"language...</em> and enter the <em>Language code</em>, <em>Language "
"name</em>, and <em>Direction</em> for the language. Click <em>Add "
"custom language</em>."
msgstr ""
"Yen basa sampeyan ora ana ing dhaptar, pilih <em>Basa khusus...</em> "
"lan lebokake <em>Kode basa</em>, <em>Jeneng basa</em>, lan "
"<em>Arah</em> kanggo basa kasebut. Klik <em>Tambah basa khusus</em>."

msgid "Configuring language detection and selection"
msgstr "Nganggo konfigurasi deteksi lan pilihan basa"

msgid ""
"Configure the methods used to decide which language will be used to "
"display text on your site."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi cara-cara sing digunakake kanggo nemtokake basa sing bakal "
"digunakake kanggo nampilake teks ing situs sampeyan."

msgid "What is a language detection method?"
msgstr "Apa iku metode deteksi basa?"

msgid ""
"A language detection method is a way for your site to decide what "
"language should be used to display text. This decision is made by "
"evaluating a series of detection methods for languages; the first "
"detection method that gets a result will determine which language is "
"used. If you have more than one language on your site, you can "
"configure the detection methods that are used and the order they are "
"evaluated, for both user interface text and content text. "
"Configuration text always uses the interface text method, and most "
"sites use the same detection methods for all types of text."
msgstr ""
"Métode deteksi basa iku cara kanggo situsmu mutusaké basa apa sing "
"kudu digunakaké kanggo nampilaké téks. Keputusan iki digawé kanthi "
"ngevaluasi serangkaian metode deteksi basa; metode deteksi sing "
"pisanan entuk asil bakal nemtokaké basa sing digunakaké. Yen situsmu "
"nganggo luwih saka siji basa, kowe bisa ngonfigurasi metode deteksi "
"sing digunakaké lan urutan evaluasiné, kanggo téks antarmuka "
"pangguna lan téks isi. Téks konfigurasi tansah nganggo metode téks "
"antarmuka, lan umume situs nggunakake metode deteksi sing padha kanggo "
"kabèh jinis téks."

msgid "What language detection methods are available?"
msgstr "Apa cara-cara deteksi basa sing kasedhiya?"

msgid ""
"The available detection methods depend on what modules you have "
"installed. Some of the most commonly-used language detection methods "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"Cara deteksi sing kasedhiya gumantung saka modul sing wis kowe pasang. "
"Sawetara cara deteksi basa sing paling kerep digunakake yaiku:"

msgid ""
"Use the language from the URL, which can either be in a path prefix "
"like <em>example.com/fr/page_path</em> for French (fr) language, or in "
"a domain like <em>fr.example.com/page_path</em>."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake basa saka URL, sing bisa ana ing path prefix kaya "
"<em>example.com/fr/page_path</em> kanggo basa Prancis (fr), utawa ing "
"domain kaya <em>fr.example.com/page_path</em>."

msgid "For logged in users, use the language they have set in their profiles."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo pangguna sing wis mlebu, gunakna basa sing wis disetel ing "
"profilé."

msgid "Use the language preferences from the user's browser."
msgstr "Gunakake preferensi basa saka browser pangguna."

msgid ""
"Use the language most recently selected from a <em>Language "
"switcher</em> block."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake basa sing paling anyar dipilih saka blok <em>Language "
"switcher</em>."

msgid ""
"Use the language from a session parameter or a request parameter; for "
"example, adding <em>?language=fr</em> to the end of the URL."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake basa saka parameter sesi utawa parameter panjalukan; contone, "
"nambah <em>?language=fr</em> ing pungkasan URL."

msgid ""
"Check the boxes to enable the desired language detection methods, and "
"uncheck boxes for the methods you do not want to use."
msgstr ""
"Centhang kothak kanggo ngaktifake cara deteksi basa sing dikarepake, "
"lan copot centhang kothak kanggo cara sing ora pengin sampeyan "
"gunakake."

msgid "Drag the methods to change their order, if desired."
msgstr "Seret metode-metode kanggo ngowahi urutane, yen kersa."

msgid "Click <em>Save settings</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Simpen setelan</em>."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Configure</em> on each enabled detection method and verify "
"that its configuration is correct (or update the configuration if "
"not)."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Configure</em> ing saben cara deteksi sing diaktifake lan "
"priksa manawa konfigurasi wis bener (utawa nganyari konfigurasi yen "
"durung bener)."

msgid "Importing a translation file"
msgstr "Ngimpor berkas terjemahan"

msgid ""
"Import a file (.po extension) containing translations for user "
"interface text."
msgstr ""
"Impor file (.po extension) sing ngemot terjemahan kanggo teks "
"antarmuka pangguna."

msgid ""
"Browse to find the <em>Translation file</em> you want to import. "
"Select the language and check the desired import options."
msgstr ""
"Pilih file <em>Translation</em> sing arep sampeyan impor. Pilih basa "
"lan priksa pilihan impor sing dikarepake."

msgid "Click <em>Import</em> and wait for your file to be imported."
msgstr "Klik <em>Import</em> lan enteni file sampeyan diimpor."

msgid "Translating user interface text"
msgstr "Nerjemahaké teks antarmuka panganggo"

msgid ""
"Translate user interface text strings from English into a non-English "
"language that is configured on your site."
msgstr ""
"Terjemahaké string teks antarmuka panganggo saka Basa Inggris menyang "
"basa liyané sing wis dikonfigurasi ing situs sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Using the filters, search for a string or set of strings that you want "
"to translate; make sure to select the correct <em>Translation "
"language</em> if you have more than one non-English language on your "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Nggunakake filter, goleki string utawa kumpulan string sing arep "
"diterjemahake; priksa manawa milih <em>Basa Terjemahan</em> sing bener "
"yen sampeyan nduweni luwih saka siji basa non-Inggris ing situs "
"sampeyan."

msgid "Enter new translations and click <em>Save translations</em>."
msgstr "Lebokake terjemahan anyar lan klik <em>Save translations</em>."

msgid ""
"Repeat these steps until all of the desired user interface text is "
"translated for all languages on your site."
msgstr ""
"Baleni langkah-langkah iki nganti kabeh teks antarmuka panganggo sing "
"dikarepake wis diterjemahake kanggo kabèh basa ing situsmu."

msgid "Checking interface translation status"
msgstr "Mriksani status terjemahan antarmuka"

msgid ""
"Check the current status of interface translations, and see if there "
"are any updates available."
msgstr ""
"Priksa status saiki saka terjemahan antarmuka, lan delengen apa ana "
"update anyar sing kasedhiya."

msgid ""
"Look at the <em>Interface translation</em> column in the language "
"table, to find the percentage of user interface text that has been "
"translated for each language."
msgstr ""
"Delengen kolom <em>Interface translation</em> ing tabel basa, kanggo "
"nemokake persentase teks antarmuka pangguna sing wis diterjemahake "
"kanggo saben basa."

msgid "Optionally, click <em>Check manually</em> to update the report."
msgstr "Sukarela, klik <em>Priksa kanthi manual</em> kanggo nganyari laporan."

msgid ""
"View the report to find out if any languages have translation updates "
"that you can download."
msgstr ""
"Ndelok laporan kanggo ngerti apa ana basa sing duwe pembaruan "
"terjemahan sing bisa sampeyan undhuh."

msgid ""
"You can use the <em>Migration</em> group of modules to perform the "
"migration step of upgrading from Drupal 6 or 7 to Drupal 8 or later, "
"as well as other migrations. These modules also provide APIs that can "
"be used by programmers to write custom software for migrations. Here "
"are the functions of the core migration modules:"
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nggunakake klompok modul <em>Migration</em> kanggo "
"nindakake langkah migrasi nalika nganyari saka Drupal 6 utawa 7 "
"menyang Drupal 8 utawa luwih anyar, uga migrasi liyane. Modul-modul "
"iki uga nyedhiyakake API sing bisa digunakake dening para programmer "
"kanggo nulis piranti lunak khusus kanggo migrasi. Ing ngisor iki "
"fungsi saka modul migrasi inti:"

msgid "[user:account-name]: The user's account name."
msgstr "[user:account-name]: Asma akun pangguna."

msgid ""
"Help search is not fully indexed. Some results may be missing or "
"incorrect."
msgstr ""
"Pitulung panelusuran durung kabèh diindeks. Sawetara asil bisa uga "
"kurang utawa ora bener."

msgid "If an upgrade has been performed on this site, you will be informed."
msgstr ""
"Yen wis ana peningkatan sing wis ditindakake ing situs iki, sampeyan "
"bakal diberitahu."

msgid ""
"You need to enter the database credentials of the Drupal site that you "
"want to upgrade. You can also include its files directory in the "
"upgrade. For example local files, /var/www/docroot, or remote files "
"http://www.example.com."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan kudu mlebu kredensial database saka situs Drupal sing arep "
"dianyari. Sampeyan uga bisa nyakup direktori file ing upgrade kasebut. "
"Contone file lokal, /var/www/docroot, utawa file jarak jauh "
"http://www.example.com."

msgid ""
"If there is existing content on the site that may be overwritten by "
"this upgrade, you will be informed."
msgstr ""
"Yen ana isi sing wis ana ing situs sing bisa ditimpa déning upgrade "
"iki, sampeyan bakal diberitahu."

msgid ""
"Finally, a message is displayed about the number of upgrade tasks that "
"were successful or failed."
msgstr ""
"Pungkasan, pesen ditampilake babagan jumlah tugas upgrade sing kasil "
"utawa gagal."

msgid ""
"To import private files from your current Drupal site, enter a local "
"file directory containing your site (e.g. /var/www/docroot). Leave "
"blank to use the same value as Public files directory."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngimpor file pribadi saka situs Drupal sampeyan saiki, lebokake "
"direktori file lokal sing ngemot situs sampeyan (umpamane "
"/var/www/docroot). Isènna kosong kanggo nggunakake nilai sing padha "
"karo direktori File Umum."

msgid ""
"Add <a href=\":modules\">contributed modules</a> to extend your site's "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"Tambah <a href=\":modules\">modhul sing disumbang</a> kanggo nambah "
"fungsi situs sampeyan."

msgid "Database driver provided by module"
msgstr "Driver database sing disedhiyakake dening modul"

msgid "Error adding / updating"
msgstr "Kesalahan nambah / nganyari"

msgid "Added / updated %project_name successfully"
msgstr "Nambah / nganyari %project_name kanthi sukses"

msgid "View user email addresses"
msgstr "Delengen alamat email pangguna"

msgid ""
"Users without this permission will not have access to email addresses "
"on user pages or other places where they might be shown, such as Views "
"and JSON:API responses."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing ora nduweni ijin iki ora bakal bisa ngakses alamat email "
"ing kaca pangguna utawa panggonan liyane sing bisa ditampilake, kaya "
"Views lan tanggapan JSON:API."

msgid "The username or email address is invalid."
msgstr "Jeneng panganggo utawa alamat email ora sah."

msgid ""
"Password reset form was submitted with an unknown or inactive account: "
"%name."
msgstr ""
"Formulir reset sandhi wis dikirim nganggo akun sing ora dikenal utawa "
"ora aktif: %name."

msgid "Always show the default display"
msgstr "Tansah tampakake tampilan standar"

msgid "Publish workspace"
msgstr "Terbitake workspace"

msgid "Publish %source_label workspace"
msgstr "Terbitaké workspace %source_label"

msgid ""
"There are no changes that can be published from %source_label to "
"%target_label."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana owah-owahan sing bisa diterbitake saka %source_label menyang "
"%target_label."

msgid "Would you like to publish the contents of the %label workspace?"
msgstr "Apa kowe pengin nerbitake isi saka workspace %label?"

msgid "Publish workspace contents."
msgstr "Nerbitaké isi workspace."

msgid "Successful publication."
