"langsung menyang server, kaya sing didokumentasikake ing <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">Extending Drupal</a>."

msgid ""
"Your server does not support adding modules and themes from this "
"interface. Instead, add modules and themes by uploading them directly "
"to the server, as documented in <a href=\":doc_url\">Extending "
"Drupal</a>."
msgstr ""
"Server sampeyan ora ndhukung nambah modul lan tema saka antarmuka iki. "
"Nanging, tambahi modul lan tema kanthi ngunggah langsung menyang "
"server, kaya sing didokumentasikake ing <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">Ngembangake Drupal</a>."

msgid ""
"Updating modules and themes requires <strong>@backends access</strong> "
"to your server. See <a href=\":doc_url\">Extending Drupal</a> for "
"other update methods."
msgid_plural ""
"Updating modules and themes requires access to your server via one of "
"the following methods: <strong>@backends</strong>. See <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">Extending Drupal</a> for other update methods."
msgstr[0] ""
"Nganyari modul lan tema mbutuhake <strong>akses @backends</strong> "
"menyang server sampeyan. Delengen <a href=\":doc_url\">Ngembangake "
"Drupal</a> kanggo cara nganyari liyane.  \n"
"Nganyari modul lan tema "
"mbutuhake akses menyang server sampeyan liwat salah siji saka "
"cara-cara ing ngisor iki: <strong>@backends</strong>. Delengen <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">Ngembangake Drupal</a> kanggo cara nganyari liyane."

msgid ""
"Adding modules and themes requires <strong>@backends access</strong> "
"to your server. See <a href=\":doc_url\">Extending Drupal</a> for "
"other methods."
msgid_plural ""
"Adding modules and themes requires access to your server via one of "
"the following methods: <strong>@backends</strong>. See <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">Extending Drupal</a> for other methods."
msgstr[0] ""
"Nambah modul lan tema mbutuhake <strong>akses @backends</strong> "
"menyang server sampeyan. Delengen <a href=\":doc_url\">Extending "
"Drupal</a> kanggo cara liyane.  \n"
"Nambah modul lan tema mbutuhake "
"akses menyang server sampeyan liwat salah siji saka cara-cara ing "
"ngisor iki: <strong>@backends</strong>. Delengen <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">Extending Drupal</a> kanggo cara liyane."

msgid "Configuring comments"
msgstr "Nggonfigurasi komentar"

msgid ""
"Configure a content entity type/subtype to allow commenting, using a "
"comment type that you have configured. See @content_structure_topic "
"for more about content entities and fields, and @comment_type_topic to "
"configure a comment type."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikna jenis/subjenis entitas konten kanggo ngidini komentar, "
"nganggo jinis komentar sing wis sampeyan konfigurasi. Delengen "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan "
"entitas konten lan kolom, lan @comment_type_topic kanggo ngatur jinis "
"komentar."

msgid "Who can configure comments?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nyetel komentar?"

msgid ""
"In order to follow these steps, the Field UI module must be installed. "
"You'll need the Comment module's <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> "
"permission, in order to change comment settings for a comment field. "
"You'll also need to have the appropriate permission for adding fields "
"to the entity type or subtype that the comments are attached to. For "
"example, to add a comment field to content items provided by the Node "
"module, you would need the Node module's <em>Administer content "
"types</em> permission."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngetutake langkah-langkah iki, modul Field UI kudu dipasang. "
"Sampeyan bakal butuh ijin <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> saka "
"modul Comment, supaya bisa ngowahi setelan komentar kanggo lapangan "
"komentar. Sampeyan uga kudu duwe ijin sing cocog kanggo nambah "
"lapangan menyang jinis entitas utawa subtipe sing dikaitake karo "
"komentar-komentar kasebut. Contone, kanggo nambah lapangan komentar "
"menyang item konten sing disedhiyakake dening modul Node, sampeyan "
"bakal butuh ijin <em>Administer content types</em> saka modul Node."

msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the related <em>Adding a field to an entity "
"sub-type</em> topic to add a field of type <em>Comments</em> to the "
"desired entity type or sub-type."
msgstr ""
"Tindakake langkah-langkah ing topik <em>Adding a field to an entity "
"sub-type</em> sing gegandhengan kanggo nambahaké lapangan jinis "
"<em>Comments</em> marang jinis entitas utawa sub-jenis sing "
"dikarepake."

msgid ""
"On the first field settings page, choose the <em>Comment type</em> to "
"use for this entity type or sub-type. You'll also notice that the "
"<em>Allowed number of values</em> field cannot be changed for comment "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca setelan lapangan pisanan, pilih <em>Jenis komentar</em> sing "
"arep digunakake kanggo jinis entitas utawa sub-jinis iki. Sampeyan uga "
"bakal weruh manawa lapangan <em>Jumlah nilai sing diijini</em> ora "
"bisa diowahi kanggo lapangan komentar."

msgid ""
"On the next field settings page, enter the desired settings for the "
"comment field:"
msgstr ""
"Ing kaca setelan kolom sabanjure, lebokna setelan sing dikarepake "
"kanggo kolom komentar:"

msgid ""
"<em>Comments per page</em>: the maximum number of comments displayed "
"on one page (a pager will be added if you exceed this limit)."
msgstr ""
"<em>Comments per page</em>: jumlah maksimal komentar sing ditampilake "
"ing siji kaca (pager bakal ditambahake yen sampeyan ngluwihi wates "
"iki)."

msgid ""
"<em>Anonymous commenting</em>: whether or not anonymous commenters are "
"allowed or required to leave contact information with their comments "
"(only applies if anonymous users have permission to post comments)."
msgstr ""
"<em>Ngomentari anonim</em>: apa para pengomentar anonim diidini utawa "
"kudu ninggalake informasi kontak nalika nulis komentar (mung ditrapake "
"yen pangguna anonim duwe ijin kanggo ngirim komentar)."

msgid ""
"<em>Show reply form on the same page as comments</em>: whether the "
"comment reply form is displayed on the same page as the comments. If "
"this is not selected, clicking <em>Reply</em> will open a new page "
"with the reply form."
msgstr ""
"<em>Tampilaké formulir balesan ing kaca sing padha karo "
"komentar</em>: apa formulir balesan komentar ditampilaké ing kaca "
"sing padha karo komentar. Yen iki ora dipilih, ngeklik <em>Bales</em> "
"bakal mbukak kaca anyar sing nduwé formulir balesan."

msgid ""
"<em>Preview comments</em>: whether previewing comments before "
"submission is <em>Required</em>, <em>Optional</em>, or "
"<em>Disabled</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Preview comments</em>: apa ndeleng sekilas komentar sakdurunge "
"ngirim iku <em>Required</em>, <em>Optional</em>, utawa "
"<em>Disabled</em>."

msgid ""
"<em>Default value</em>: each individual entity has its own comment "
"settings, but here you can set defaults for the comment settings for "
"this entity type or subtype. The comment settings values are:"
msgstr ""
"<em>Nilai standar</em>: saben entitas individu nduweni setelan "
"komentar dhewe, nanging ing kene sampeyan bisa nyetel nilai standar "
"kanggo setelan komentar jinis entitas utawa subtipe iki. Nilai setelan "
"komentar yaiku:"

msgid "<em>Open</em>: comments are allowed."
msgstr "<em>Mbuka</em>: komentar diijini."

msgid ""
"<em>Closed</em>: past comments remain visible, but no new comments are "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"<em>Ditutup</em>: komentar sing wis ana tetep katon, nanging ora "
"diijini komentar anyar."

msgid ""
"<em>Hidden</em>: past comments are hidden, and no new comments are "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"<em>Didhelikake</em>: komentar-komentar sadurunge didhelikake, lan ora "
"diijini komentar anyar."

msgid "Online documentation for content comment settings"
msgstr "Dokumentasi online kanggo setelan komentar isi"

msgid "Creating a comment type"
msgstr "Nggawé jinis komentar"

msgid ""
"Create a new comment type. See @comment_overview_topic for information "
"about comments and comment types."
msgstr ""
"Gawé jinis komentar anyar. Delengen @comment_overview_topic kanggo "
"informasi babagan komentar lan jinis komentar."

msgid "Who can create a comment type?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nggawe jinis komentar?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> permission "
"(typically administrators) can create comment types."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> ijin (biasané "
"administrator) bisa nggawe jinis komentar."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@comment_types_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@comment_types_link</em>."

msgid "Click <em>Add comment type</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah jinis komentar</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Label</em> field, enter a name for the comment type, which "
"is how it will be listed in the administrative interface."
msgstr ""
"Ing kolom <em>Label</em>, lebokna jeneng kanggo jinis komentar, sing "
"bakal dadi cara tampilane ing antarmuka administratif."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Target entity type</em> field, select the entity type to be "
"commented on. See @content_structure_topic for more about content "
"entities and fields."
msgstr ""
"Ing kolom <em>Target entity type</em>, pilih jinis entitas sing arep "
"diwenehi komentar. Delengen @content_structure_topic kanggo luwih "
"lengkap babagan entitas isi lan kolom."

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. The comment type will be created."
msgstr "Klik <em>Save</em>. Jinis komentar bakal digawe."

msgid ""
"Optionally, if you have the core Field UI module installed you can "
"follow the steps in the related topics to add fields to the new "
"comment type, set up the editing form, and configure the display."
msgstr ""
"Yen kersa, yen sampeyan wis nginstal modul inti Field UI, sampeyan "
"bisa ngetutake langkah-langkah ing topik sing gegandhengan kanggo "
"nambah lapangan menyang jinis komentar anyar, nyetel formulir "
"suntingan, lan ngonfigurasi tampilan."

msgid "Disabling comments"
msgstr "Mateni komentar"

msgid ""
"Turn off commenting for a particular entity (see "
"@content_structure_topic for more about content entities and fields). "
"Note that if you want to turn off commenting for all entities of an "
"entity type or subtype, you will need to edit the field settings for "
"the comment field; see @comment_config_topic for more about "
"configuring the comment field."
msgstr ""
"Pateni komentar kanggo entitas tartamtu (delengen "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo luwih lengkap babagan entitas konten "
"lan kolom). Elinga yen sampeyan pengin mateni komentar kanggo kabeh "
"entitas saka jinis utawa subtipe entitas, sampeyan kudu ngowahi "
"setelan kolom kanggo kolom komentar; delengen @comment_config_topic "
"kanggo luwih lengkap babagan nyetel kolom komentar."

msgid "Who can disable comments?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa mateni komentar?"

msgid ""
"You will need the <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> permission in "
"order to disable commenting. You will also need permission to edit the "
"entity that the comments are on."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan perlu hak <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> supaya bisa "
"mateni komentar. Sampeyan uga perlu hak kanggo ngowahi entitas sing "
"ana komentar kasebut."

msgid ""
"Find the entity you want to disable comments for, and edit it. For "
"example, to turn off comments on a content item, you could find it by "
"navigating in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu to "
"<em>Content</em>, filtering to find the content item, and clicking "
"<em>Edit</em>."
msgstr ""
"Golek entitas sing arep sampeyan pateni komentaré, banjur sunting. "
"Contoné, kanggo mateni komentar ing sawijining item isi, sampeyan "
"bisa nemokaké kanthi njupuk dalan ing menu administratif "
"<em>Manage</em> menyang <em>Content</em>, nyaring kanggo golek item "
"isi kasebut, banjur klik <em>Edit</em>."

msgid "Under <em>Comment settings</em>, select the desired comment setting:"
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor <em>Comment settings</em>, pilih setelan komentar sing "
"dikarepake:"

msgid "Save the entity."
msgstr "Simpen entitas kasebut."

msgid "Moderating comments"
msgstr "Ngamoderasi komentar"

msgid "Decide which comments are shown on the website."
msgstr "Mutusake komentar sing bakal dituduhake ing situs web."

msgid "Who can moderate comments?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa moderasi komentar?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> permission "
"(typically administrators) can moderate comments. You will also need "
"the <em>Access the Content Overview page</em> permission from the Node "
"module (if it is installed) to navigate to the comment management "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni ijin <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> "
"(biasane administrator) bisa ngemoderasi komentar. Kowé uga perlu "
"ijin <em>Access the Content Overview page</em> saka modul Node (yen "
"wis dipasang) kanggo mlebu menyang kaca manajemen komentar."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Content</em> &gt; <em>@comment_published_link</em>. A list of all "
"comments is shown."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, bukak menyang <em>Content</em> "
"&gt; <em>@comment_published_link</em>. Dhaptar kabeh komentar bakal "
"ditampilake."

msgid ""
"To unpublish comments, select one or more comments by checking the "
"boxes on the left side (right side in right-to-left languages). Then "
"select <em>Unpublish comment</em> from the <em>Action</em> select list "
"and click <em>Apply to selected items</em>. If you select the "
"<em>Delete comment</em> action, you can instead delete the unwanted  "
"comments."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mbatalake publikasi komentar, pilih siji utawa luwih komentar "
"kanthi mriksa kothak ing sisih kiwa (sisih tengen ing basa sing nulis "
"saka tengen menyang kiwa). Banjur pilih <em>Unpublish comment</em> "
"saka dhaptar pilihan <em>Action</em> lan klik <em>Apply to selected "
"items</em>. Yen sampeyan milih aksi <em>Delete comment</em>, sampeyan "
"bisa langsung mbusak komentar sing ora dikarepake."

msgid ""
"To change the content of a comment click <em>Edit</em> from the "
"dropdown button for a particular comment."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngganti isi komentar, klik <em>Edit</em> saka tombol dropdown "
"kanggo komentar sing tartamtu."

msgid ""
"To publish comments that are not yet visible on the website, navigate "
"to the <em>@comment_unpublished_link</em> tab. Select one or more "
"comments by checking the boxes on the left side (right side in "
"right-to-left languages). Then select <em>Publish comment</em> from "
"the <em>Action</em> select list and click <em>Apply to selected "
"items</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nerbitake komentar sing durung katon ing situs web, pindhah "
"menyang tab <em>@comment_unpublished_link</em>. Pilih siji utawa luwih "
"komentar kanthi mriksa kothak ing sisi kiwa (sisi tengen kanggo basa "
"sing arah nulis saka tengen menyang kiwa). Banjur pilih <em>Publish "
"comment</em> saka dhaptar pilihan <em>Action</em> lan klik <em>Apply "
"to selected items</em>."

msgid "Online documentation for moderating comments"
msgstr "Dokumentasi online kanggo moderasi komentar"

msgid "Managing comments"
msgstr "Ngatur komentar"

msgid "What is a comment?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi komentar?"

msgid "What is a comment type?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi jinis komentar?"

msgid ""
"Comments are divided into <em>comment types</em>, which are the entity "
"sub-types for the comment entity type. Each comment type has its own "
"fields and its own form and display settings; each type can be used to "
"comment on a single entity type. You can set up different comment "
"types for different commenting purposes on your web site; for example, "
"you might set up a comment type for recipes that has fields \"How did "
"it taste?\" and \"Did the instructions work?\", and another comment "
"type for blog entries that has only a generic comment body field."
msgstr ""
"Komentar dipérang dadi <em>jenis komentar</em>, sing minangka "
"sub-jenis entitas kanggo jinis entitas komentar. Saben jinis komentar "
"nduwèni kolom-kolomé dhéwé lan setelan formulir lan tampilan "
"dhéwé; saben jinis bisa digunakaké kanggo komentar ing siji jinis "
"entitas. Kowé bisa nyetel jinis komentar sing béda kanggo tujuan "
"komentaring sing béda ing situs webmu; contoné, kowé bisa nyetel "
"jinis komentar kanggo resep sing nduwèni kolom \"Piye rasané?\" lan "
"\"Apa pandhuan bisa digunakaké?\", lan jinis komentar liya kanggo "
"tulisan blog sing mung nduwèni kolom isi komentar umum."

msgid "What is moderation?"
msgstr "Apa iku moderasi?"

msgid ""
"<em>Moderation</em> is a workflow where comments posted by some users "
"on your site are verified before being published, to prevent spam and "
"other bad behavior. The core software provides basic moderation "
"functionality: you can configure permissions so that new comments "
"posted by some user roles start as unpublished until a user with a "
"different role reviews and publishes them. Contributed modules provide "
"additional moderation and spam-reduction functionality, such as "
"requiring untrusted users pass a CAPTCHA test before submitting "
"comments and letting community members flag comments as possible spam. "
"See @users_overview_topic for more about users, permissions, and "
"roles."
msgstr ""
"<em>Moderasi</em> iku alur kerja ing ngendi komentar sing dipasang "
"déning sawetara pangguna ing situsmu diverifikasi dhisik sadurunge "
"diterbitaké, kanggo nyegah spam lan prilaku ala liyane. Piranti lunak "
"inti nyedhiyakake fungsi moderasi dhasar: kowe bisa nyetel ijin supaya "
"komentar anyar sing dipasang déning sawetara peran pangguna diwiwiti "
"minangka ora diterbitaké nganti pangguna kanthi peran liya mriksa lan "
"nerbitaké. Modul tambahan nyedhiyakake fungsi moderasi lan "
"pangurangan spam sing luwih lengkap, kayata mbutuhaké pangguna sing "
"ora dipercaya ngliwati tes CAPTCHA sadurunge ngirim komentar lan "
"ngidini anggota komunitas nandhani komentar minangka spam sing bisa "
"uga. Deleng @users_overview_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap "
"babagan pangguna, ijin, lan peran."

msgid "Overview of managing comments"
msgstr "Ringkesan babagan ngatur komentar"

msgid "The core Comment module provides the following functionality:"
msgstr "Modul Comment inti nyedhiyakake fungsi kaya ngene:"

msgid "Posting comments"
msgstr "Nglampahi komentar"

msgid ""
"Creating comment types; the core Field UI module allows you to attach "
"fields to comment types and attach comment reference fields to other "
"entities so that people can comment on them."
msgstr ""
"Nggawe jinis komentar; modul inti Field UI ngidini sampeyan nambahake "
"lapangan menyang jinis komentar lan nambahake lapangan referensi "
"komentar menyang entitas liyane supaya wong bisa menehi komentar ing "
"kono."

msgid "Configuring commenting"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi komentar"

msgid "Moderating comments as discussed above"
msgstr "Moderasi komentar kaya sing wis diterangake ing ndhuwur"

msgid "What is quick editing?"
msgstr "Apa iku suntingan cepet?"

msgid ""
"Click the contextual links <em>Edit</em> button on the toolbar (in "
"most themes, it looks like a pencil). Contextual <em>Edit</em> links "
"with the same icon will appear all over your page."
msgstr ""
"Klik tombol pranala kontekstual <em>Edit</em> ing toolbar (ing paling "
"akeh tema, katon kaya pensil). Pranala kontekstual <em>Edit</em> "
"kanthi ikon sing padha bakal muncul ing saindenging kaca sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Find the contextual link for the part of the page you want to edit. "
"For example, if you want to edit the settings for a block, the link "
"should be in the top-right corner of the block, or top-left for "
"right-to-left languages."
msgstr ""
"Golek pranala kontekstual kanggo bagean kaca sing pengin sampeyan "
"sunting. Contone, yen sampeyan pengin nyunting setelan kanggo blok, "
"pranala kasebut kudu ana ing pojok kanan ndhuwur blok, utawa pojok "
"kiwa ndhuwur kanggo basa sing nulis saka tengen menyang kiwa."

msgid "Make your edits and submit the form."
msgstr "Gawe suntinganmu lan kirim formulir kasebut."

msgid ""
"The core administrative interface has built-in compliance with many "
"accessibility standards so that most pages are accessible to most "
"users in their default state. However, certain pages become more "
"accessible to some users through the use of a non-default or improved "
"interface. These interfaces include:"
msgstr ""
"Antarmuka administratif inti wis duwe kepatuhan bawaan karo akeh "
"standar aksesibilitas supaya umume kaca bisa diakses dening mayoritas "
"pangguna ing kondisi default. Nanging, sawetara kaca dadi luwih bisa "
"diakses dening sawetara pangguna liwat panggunaan antarmuka sing ora "
"default utawa sing luwih apik. Antarmuka kasebut kalebu:"

msgid "Enabling inline form errors"
msgstr "Ngaktifake kesalahan formulir inline"

msgid ""
"Errors that occur when you submit a form, such as not filling in a "
"required field, are sometimes difficult for users to understand and "
"locate. In order to make these errors easier to find, the best "
"practice is to put a summary of the errors at the top of the form "
"page. To make them easier to understand, the best practice is to "
"display error messages with the form fields they are related to. Both "
"of these practices are implemented by the core Inline Form Errors "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Kesalahan sing kedadeyan nalika sampeyan ngirim formulir, kaya ora "
"ngisi kolom sing wajib, kadhangkala angel dingerteni lan ditemokake "
"dening pangguna. Supaya kesalahan-kesalahan iki luwih gampang "
"ditemokake, praktik sing paling apik yaiku nyelehake ringkesan "
"kesalahan ing sisih ndhuwur kaca formulir. Kanggo supaya luwih gampang "
"dingerteni, praktik sing paling apik yaiku nampilake pesen kesalahan "
"bebarengan karo kolom formulir sing terkait. Kabeh praktik iki wis "
"dileksanakake dening modul inti Inline Form Errors."

msgid "What administrative interface components are available?"
msgstr "Apa bagean antarmuka administratif sing kasedhiya?"

msgid ""
"Accessibility features, to enable all users to perform administrative "
"tasks. See @accessibility_topic for more information."
msgstr ""
"Fitur aksesibilitas, kanggo ngidini kabeh pangguna nindakake tugas "
"administratif. Delengen @accessibility_topic kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap."

msgid "What are the sections of the administrative menu?"
msgstr "Apa wae bagean-bagean saka menu administratif?"

msgid ""
"The administrative menu, which you can navigate by visiting "
"<em>@admin_link</em> on your site or by using an administrative "
"toolbar, has the following sections (some may not be available, "
"depending on which modules are currently installed on your site, and "
"your permissions):"
msgstr ""
"Menu administratif, sing bisa sampeyan navigasi kanthi ngunjungi "
"<em>@admin_link</em> ing situs sampeyan utawa nganggo toolbar "
"administratif, nduwèni bageyan-bageyan ing ngisor iki (sawetara bisa "
"uga ora kasedhiya, gumantung saka modul-modul sing saiki dipasang ing "
"situs sampeyan, lan hak akses sampeyan):"

msgid ""
"<strong>Content:</strong> Find, manage, and create new pages; manage "
"comments and files."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Content:</strong> Golek, ngatur, lan nggawe kaca anyar; ngatur "
"komentar lan berkas."

msgid ""
"<strong>Structure:</strong> Place and edit blocks, set up content "
"types and fields, configure menus, administer taxonomy, and configure "
"some contributed modules."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Struktur:</strong> Pasang lan sunting blok, atur jinis konten "
"lan kolom, konfigurasikaké menu, ngatur taksonomi, lan "
"konfigurasikaké sawetara modul sing kontribusi."

msgid ""
"<strong>Appearance:</strong> Switch between themes, install themes, "
"and update existing themes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Penampilan:</strong> Ganti antar tema, pasang tema, lan "
"nganyari tema sing wis ana."

msgid "<strong>Extend:</strong> Update, install, and uninstall modules."
msgstr "<strong>Perluas:</strong> Nganyari, masang, lan mbusak modul."

msgid ""
"<strong>Configuration:</strong> Configure the settings for various "
"site functionality, including some contributed modules."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Konfigurasi:</strong> Atur setelan kanggo macem-macem fungsi "
"situs, kalebu sawetara modul sing kontribusi."

msgid "<strong>People:</strong> Manage user accounts and permissions."
msgstr "<strong>Wong:</strong> Ngatur akun pangguna lan ijin."

msgid ""
"<strong>Reports:</strong> Display information about site security, "
"necessary updates, and site activity."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Laporan:</strong> Nampilake informasi babagan keamanan situs, "
"pembaruan sing dibutuhake, lan aktivitas situs."

msgid "<strong>Help:</strong> Get help on using the administrative interface."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bantuan:</strong> Entuk pitulungan babagan nggunakake "
"antarmuka administrasi."

msgid ""
"Install the core modules mentioned above to use the corresponding "
"aspect of the administrative interface. See the related topics listed "
"below for more details on some aspects of the administrative "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Pasang modul inti sing kasebut ing ndhuwur kanggo nggunakake aspek "
"antarmuka administrasi sing cocog. Deleng topik sing gegandhengan ing "
"ngisor iki kanggo rincian luwih lengkap babagan sawetara aspek "
"antarmuka administrasi."

msgid "Creating a content item"
msgstr "Nggawe sawijining item konten"

msgid ""
"Create and publish a content item. See @content_overview_topic for "
"more about content types and content items."
msgstr ""
"Gawé lan terbitaké sawijining isi konten. Delengen "
"@content_overview_topic kanggo luwih ngerti babagan jinis konten lan "
"isi konten."

msgid "Who can create content?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nggawe isi?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@content_permissions_link</em> permission can visit "
"the <em>Content</em> page as described in this topic. Each content "
"type has its own create permissions. For example, to create content of "
"type Article, a user would need the Article: Create new content "
"permission. In addition, users with the <em>Bypass content access "
"control</em> or <em>Administer content</em> permission can create "
"content items of all types. Some contributed modules change the "
"permission structure for creating content."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni ijin <em>@content_permissions_link</em> bisa "
"ngunjungi kaca <em>Content</em> kaya sing diterangaké ing topik iki. "
"Saben jinis konten duwé ijin nggawe dhewe. Contoné, kanggo nggawe "
"konten jinis Artikel, pangguna kudu nduwèni ijin Artikel: Create new "
"content. Saliyane, pangguna sing nduwèni ijin <em>Bypass content "
"access control</em> utawa <em>Administer content</em> bisa nggawe item "
"konten saka kabèh jinis. Sawetara modul tambahan ngganti struktur "
"ijin kanggo nggawe konten."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@content_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>@content_link</em>."

msgid "Click <em>Add content</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah isi</em>."

msgid ""
"If there is more than one content type defined on your site that you "
"have permission to create, click the name of the type of content you "
"want to create."
msgstr ""
"Yen ana luwih saka siji jinis isi sing wis ditemtokake ing situs "
"sampeyan lan sampeyan duwe idin kanggo nggawe, klik jeneng jinis isi "
"sing pengin sampeyan gawe."

msgid ""
"On the content edit form, enter the <em>Title</em> of your content, "
"which will show as the page title when the content item is displayed "
"on a page, and also as the label for the content item in "
"administration screens."
msgstr ""
"Ing formulir sunting isi, lebokna <em>Judhul</em> isi panjenengan, "
"sing bakal ditampilake minangka judhul kaca nalika isi ditampilake ing "
"kaca, lan uga minangka label kanggo isi kasebut ing layar "
"administrasi."

msgid ""
"Fill in the other fields shown on the edit form for this specific "
"content type."
msgstr ""
"Iseni kolom liyane sing katon ing formulir sunting kanggo jinis isi "
"sing spesifik iki."

msgid ""
"Leave the <em>Published</em> field checked to publish the content "
"immediately, or uncheck it to make it unpublished. Unpublished content "
"is generally not shown to non-administrative site users."
msgstr ""
"Tinggalake kolom <em>Published</em> dipilih kanggo nerbitake isi "
"kasebut langsung, utawa copot centhang kanggo nggawe isi ora "
"diterbitake. Isi sing ora diterbitake umume ora ditampilake kanggo "
"pangguna situs sing dudu administrator."

msgid "Optionally, click <em>Preview</em> to preview the content."
msgstr "Opsional, klik <em>Preview</em> kanggo ndeleng pratampil isi."

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You will see the content displayed on a page."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save</em>. Sampeyan bakal ndeleng isi sing ditampilake ing "
"kaca."

msgid "Creating a content type"
msgstr "Nggawe jinis isi"

msgid ""
"Create a new content type. See @content_overview_topic for more about "
"content types."
msgstr ""
"Gawe jinis isi anyar. Delengen @content_overview_topic kanggo luwih "
"lengkap babagan jinis isi."

msgid "Who can create a content type?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nggawe jinis isi?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@content_permissions_link</em> permission "
"(typically administrators) can create new content types."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduweni ijin <em>@content_permissions_link</em> (biasane "
"administrator) bisa nggawe jinis isi anyar."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."

msgid "Click <em>Add content type.</em>"
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah jinis isi.</em>"

msgid ""
"In the <em>Name</em> field, enter a name for the content type, which "
"is how it will be listed in the administrative interface."
msgstr ""
"Ing kolom <em>Name</em>, lebokna jeneng kanggo jinis konten, sing "
"bakal digunakake kanggo dhaptar ing antarmuka administrasi."

msgid ""
"Optionally, enter a <em>Description</em> for the content type. You may "
"also want to adjust some of the settings in the vertical tabs section "
"of the edit page."
msgstr ""
"Sak kersane, lebokna <em>Description</em> kanggo jinis konten kasebut. "
"Sampeyan uga bisa ngatur sawetara setelan ing bagean tab vertikal ing "
"kaca suntingan."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save and manage fields</em>. Your content type will be "
"created, and assuming you have the core Field UI module installed, you "
"will be taken to the <em>Manage fields</em> page for the content type. "
"(If you do not have the core Field UI module installed, the button "
"will say <em>Save</em> instead.)"
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Save and manage fields</em>. Jenis isi sampeyan bakal digawe, "
"lan yen sampeyan wis masang modul Field UI inti, sampeyan bakal "
"dijupuk menyang kaca <em>Manage fields</em> kanggo jinis isi kasebut. "
"(Yen sampeyan durung masang modul Field UI inti, tombol kasebut bakal "
"nuduhake <em>Save</em> minangka gantine.)"

msgid ""
"If you have the core Field UI module installed, follow the steps in "
"the related topics to add fields to the new content type, set up the "
"editing form, and configure the display."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan wis nginstal modul Field UI inti, tindakake "
"langkah-langkah ing topik sing gegandhengan kanggo nambah lapangan "
"menyang jinis konten anyar, nyetel formulir suntingan, lan nyetel "
"tampilan."

msgid "Editing a content item"
msgstr "Nyunting item isi"

msgid ""
"Find a content item and edit it, or update a group of content items in "
"bulk. See @node_overview_topic for more about content types and "
"content items."
msgstr ""
"Golek konten lan sunting, utawa nganyari klompok konten kanthi massal. "
"Delengen @node_overview_topic kanggo luwih ngerti babagan jinis konten "
"lan item konten."

msgid "Who can find and edit content?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nemokake lan nyunting isi?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@content_permissions_link</em> permission can use "
"the <em>Content</em> page to find content. Each content type has its "
"own edit permissions. For example, to edit content of type Article, a "
"user would need the <em>Article: Edit own content</em> permission to "
"edit an article they created, or the <em>Article: Edit any "
"content</em> permission to edit an article someone else created. In "
"addition, users with the <em>Bypass content access control</em> or "
"<em>Administer content</em> permission can edit content items of all "
"types. Some contributed modules change the permission structure for "
"editing content."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>@content_permissions_link</em> bisa "
"nggunakaké kaca <em>Content</em> kanggo nggoleki isi. Saben jinis isi "
"nduwé ijin suntingan dhéwé-dhéwé. Contoné, kanggo nyunting isi "
"jinis Artikel, pangguna kudu nduwé ijin <em>Article: Edit own "
"content</em> kanggo nyunting artikel sing digawe déwé, utawa ijin "
"<em>Article: Edit any content</em> kanggo nyunting artikel sing digawe "
"wong liya. Saliyane kuwi, pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>Bypass content "
"access control</em> utawa <em>Administer content</em> bisa nyunting "
"isi saka kabèh jinis. Sawetara modul sing dikontribusikeun ngowahi "
"struktur ijin kanggo nyunting isi."

msgid "Optionally, use filters to reduce the list of content items shown:"
msgstr ""
"Sakliyane, gunakake filter kanggo nyuda dhaptar item konten sing "
"ditampilake:"

msgid "<em>Title</em>: key word(s) from the title"
msgstr "<em>Title</em>: tembung kunci saka judhul"

msgid "<em>Content type</em>"
msgstr "<em>Jinis isi</em>"

msgid "<em>Published status</em>"
msgstr "<em>Status diterbitake</em>"

msgid "<em>Language</em>"
msgstr "<em>Basa</em>"

msgid ""
"If you enter or select filter values, click <em>Filter</em> to apply "
"the filters."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan mlebu utawa milih nilai filter, klik <em>Filter</em> "
"kanggo ngetrapake filter kasebut."

msgid ""
"Optionally, sort the list by clicking a column header. Click again to "
"reverse the order."
msgstr ""
"Sacara opsional, urutna dhaptar kanthi ngeklik header kolom. Klik "
"maneh kanggo mbalikke urutane."

msgid ""
"To edit the title or other field values for one content item, click "
"<em>Edit</em> in the row of the content item. Update the values and "
"click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngowahi judhul utawa nilai kolom liyane kanggo siji isi, klik "
"<em>Edit</em> ing baris isi kasebut. Ganti nilaine lan klik "
"<em>Save</em>."

msgid ""
"A few types of edits can be done in bulk to multiple content items. "
"For example, to publish several unpublished content items, check the "
"boxes in the left column (right column in right-to-left languages) to "
"select the desired content items. For <em>Action</em>, select the "
"<em>Publish content</em> action. Click <em>Apply to selected "
"items</em> to make the change. The other actions under <em>Action</em> "
"work in a similar manner."
msgstr ""
"Sawetara jinis suntingan bisa ditindakake sacara massal kanggo "
"pirang-pirang isi konten. Contone, kanggo nerbitake sawetara isi "
"konten sing durung diterbitake, centhang kothak ing kolom kiwa (kolom "
"tengen ing basa tengen-kiri) kanggo milih isi konten sing dikarepake. "
"Kanggo <em>Action</em>, pilih tumindak <em>Publish content</em>. Klik "
"<em>Apply to selected items</em> kanggo nggawe owah-owahan kasebut. "
"Tumindak liyane ing ngisor <em>Action</em> uga mlaku kanthi cara sing "
"padha."

msgid "What is a content item?"
msgstr "Apa iku item konten?"

msgid ""
"A <em>content item</em> is a type of content entity for page-level "
"content, which can have fields that store text, HTML markup, images, "
"attached files, and other data. See @content_structure_topic for more "
"about content entities and fields."
msgstr ""
"A <em>content item</em> iku jinis entitas konten kanggo isi tingkat "
"kaca, sing bisa nduwèni kolom-kolom kanggo nyimpen teks, markup HTML, "
"gambar, berkas sing dilampirake, lan data liyane. Delengen "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo luwih lengkap babagan entitas konten "
"lan kolom-kolom."

msgid "What is a content type?"
msgstr "Apa iku jinis konten?"

msgid ""
"Content items are divided into <em>content types</em>, which are the "
"entity sub-types for the content item entity type; each content type "
"has its own fields and display settings. For example, you might set up "
"content types for pages, articles, recipes, events, and blog entries "
"on your web site."
msgstr ""
"Item isi dipérang dadi <em>jenis isi</em>, sing minangka sub-jenis "
"entitas kanggo jinis entitas item isi; saben jenis isi nduwèni kolom "
"lan setelan tampilan dhéwé. Contoné, kowé bisa nyetel jenis isi "
"kanggo kaca, artikel, resep, acara, lan kiriman blog ing situs webmu."

msgid "Overview of managing content"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum babagan ngatur konten"

msgid ""
"The core Node module allows you to define content types, and add and "
"edit content items. The core Field UI module allows you to attach "
"fields to each content type and manage the edit form and display for "
"each content type. See the related topics listed below for specific "
"tasks. Many other core and contributed modules and installation "
"profiles provide pre-defined content types, modify the permission "
"structure for content items, and provide other functionality."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Node ngidini sampeyan nemtokake jinis isi, lan nambah lan "
"ngowahi item isi. Modul inti Field UI ngidini sampeyan nempelake "
"lapangan menyang saben jinis isi lan ngatur formulir sunting lan "
"tampilan kanggo saben jinis isi. Delengen topik sing gegandhengan sing "
"kasebat ing ngisor iki kanggo tugas tartamtu. Akeh modul inti lan "
"tambahan liyane uga profil instalasi nyedhiyakake jinis isi sing wis "
"ditemtokake, ngowahi struktur idin kanggo item isi, lan nyedhiyakake "
"fungsi liyane."

msgid "Creating a URL alias for a content item"
msgstr "Gawe alias URL kanggo isi konten"

msgid ""
"Give a content item page a human- or SEO-friendly URL alias; you can "
"follow similar steps to create an alias for a taxonomy term page. See "
"@overview_topic for more about aliases."
msgstr ""
"Wenehi kaca item konten URL alias sing ramah kanggo manungsa utawa "
"SEO; sampeyan bisa ngetutake langkah sing padha kanggo nggawe alias "
"kanggo kaca istilah taksonomi. Delengen @overview_topic kanggo luwih "
"lengkap babagan alias."

msgid "Who can create URL aliases?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nggawe alias URL?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@path_permissions_link</em> permission can create "
"aliases. To follow the steps in this topic, you will also need "
"permission to edit the content item."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing duwe ijin <em>@path_permissions_link</em> bisa nggawe "
"alias. Kanggo ngetutake langkah-langkah ing topik iki, sampeyan uga "
"butuh ijin kanggo nyunting item konten."

msgid ""
"Locate and open the content edit form for the content item, or create "
"a new content item (see related topics on creating and editing "
"content)."
msgstr ""
"Golek lan bukak formulir sunting isi kanggo item isi kasebut, utawa "
"gawe item isi anyar (delengen topik sing gegandhengan babagan nggawe "
"lan nyunting isi)."

msgid ""
"Under <em>URL alias</em> on the edit form, enter the desired alias "
"(for example, \"/about-us\"). Make sure the alias starts with a \"/\" "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor <em>URL alias</em> ing formulir suntingan, lebokna alias "
"sing dikarepake (contoh, \"/about-us\"). Priksa manawa alias diwiwiti "
"kanthi karakter \"/\"."

msgid ""
"Verify that the page can be visited with the new alias, for example "
"<em>https://example.com/about-us</em>."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa kaca bisa dikunjungi nganggo alias anyar, contone "
"<em>https://example.com/about-us</em>."

msgid "Editing a URL alias"
msgstr "Nyunting alias URL"

msgid ""
"Change an existing URL alias, to correct the path or the alias value. "
"See @path_overview_topic for more about aliases."
msgstr ""
"Ganti alias URL sing wis ana, kanggo mbenerake jalur utawa nilai "
"alias. Waca @path_overview_topic kanggo luwih lengkap babagan alias."

msgid "Who can manage URL aliases?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa ngatur alias URL?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@path_permissions_link</em> permission can edit "
"aliases."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni ijin <em>@path_permissions_link</em> bisa "
"ngowahi alias."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administration menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Search and metadata</em> &gt; "
"<em>@path_aliases_link</em>. A list of all the site's aliases will "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Search and metadata</em> &gt; "
"<em>@path_aliases_link</em>. Dhaptar kabeh alias situs bakal katon."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Edit</em> in the dropdown button for the alias that you "
"would like to change."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Edit</em> ing tombol dropdown kanggo alias sing pengin "
"sampeyan ganti."

msgid ""
"Make the required changes and click <em>Save</em>. You will be "
"returned to the URL alias list page."
msgstr ""
"Gawe owah-owahan sing dibutuhake banjur klik <em>Save</em>. Sampeyan "
"bakal dibalekake menyang kaca daftar alias URL."

msgid ""
"Note that you can also add new aliases from this page, for any path on "
"your site."
msgstr ""
"Cathetan menawa sampeyan uga bisa nambah alias anyar saka kaca iki, "
"kanggo path apa wae ing situs sampeyan."

msgid "Configuring aliases for URLs"
msgstr "Nggonfigurasi alias kanggo URL"

msgid "What is a URL?"
msgstr "Apa iku URL?"

msgid ""
"URL is the abbreviation for \"Uniform Resource Locator\", which is the "
"page's address on the web. It is the \"name\" by which a browser "
"identifies a page to display. In the example \"Visit us at "
"<em>example.com</em>.\", <em>https://example.com</em> would be the URL "
"for the home page of your website. Users use URLs to locate content on "
"the web."
msgstr ""
"URL iku singkatan saka \"Uniform Resource Locator\", yaiku alamat kaca "
"ing web. Iki \"jeneng\" sing digunakake browser kanggo ngenali kaca "
"sing bakal ditampilake. Ing conto \"Visit us at "
"<em>example.com</em>.\", <em>https://example.com</em> bakal dadi URL "
"kanggo kaca ngarep situs webmu. Panganggo nggunakake URL kanggo "
"nemokake isi ing web."

msgid "What is a path?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi path?"

msgid ""
"A path is the unique, last part of the URL for a specific function or "
"piece of content. For example, for a page whose full URL is "
"<em>https://example.com/node/7</em>, the path is <em>node/7</em>. Here "
"are some examples of paths you might find in your site:"
msgstr ""
"Path iku bagean pungkasan sing unik saka URL kanggo fungsi utawa isi "
"tartamtu. Contone, kanggo kaca sing URL lengkapé "
"<em>https://example.com/node/7</em>, path-è yaiku <em>node/7</em>. "
"Ing ngisor iki ana sawetara conto path sing bisa ditemokaké ing situs "
"panjenengan:"

msgid "node/7: Path to a particular content item."
msgstr "node/7: Dalane menyang sawijining isi tartamtu."

msgid "taxonomy/term/6: Path to a taxonomy term page."
msgstr "taxonomy/term/6: Dalane menyang kaca istilah taksonomi."

msgid "user/3: Path to a user profile page."
msgstr "user/3: Path menyang kaca profil pangguna."

msgid "What is an alias?"
msgstr "Apa iku alias?"

msgid ""
"The core software allows you to provide more understandable URLs for "
"pages on your site, which are called <em>aliases</em>. For example, if "
"you have an \"About Us\" page with the path <em>node/7</em>, you can "
"set up an alias of <em>about</em> so that your visitors will see it as "
"<em>https://www.example.com/about</em>."
msgstr ""
"Piranti lunak inti ngidini sampeyan nyedhiyakake URL sing luwih "
"gampang dimangerteni kanggo kaca-kaca ing situs sampeyan, sing diarani "
"<em>aliases</em>. Contone, yen sampeyan duwe kaca \"About Us\" kanthi "
"path <em>node/7</em>, sampeyan bisa nyetel alias <em>about</em> supaya "
"pengunjung sampeyan bisa ndeleng dadi "
"<em>https://www.example.com/about</em>."

msgid "Overview of configuring paths, aliases, and URLs"
msgstr "Ringkesan babagan nyetel path, alias, lan URL"

msgid ""
"The core Path module provides the URL aliasing functionality. The "
"contributed <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/pathauto\">Pathauto</a> module "
"allows you to configure automatically-generated URL aliases for "
"content items and other pages. See the related topics listed below for "
"specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Path nyedhiyakake fungsi alias URL. Modul <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/pathauto\">Pathauto</a> sing "
"kontribusi ngidini sampeyan nyetel alias URL sing digawe sacara "
"otomatis kanggo item konten lan kaca liyane. Delengen topik sing "
"gegandhengan ing ngisor iki kanggo tugas-tugas tartamtu."

msgid "Configuring taxonomy"
msgstr "Ngonfigurasi taksonomi"

msgid ""
"Create a taxonomy vocabulary and add a reference field for that "
"vocabulary to a content entity. See @taxonomy_overview_topic for "
"information about taxonomy and @content_structure_topic for more on "
"content entities."
msgstr ""
"Gawe vocabulary taksonomi lan tambahaké kolom referensi kanggo "
"vocabulary kuwi menyang entitas konten. Delengen "
"@taxonomy_overview_topic kanggo informasi babagan taksonomi lan "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo luwih jero babagan entitas konten."

msgid "Who can configure a taxonomy vocabulary?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nyetel vocabulary taksonomi?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@taxonomy_permissions_link</em> permission can "
"configure a vocabulary. To add a field in the administrative "
"interface, the core Field UI module must be installed, and you will "
"also need the <em>Administer fields</em> permission for the entity you "
"are adding the field to."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>@taxonomy_permissions_link</em> bisa "
"nyetel kosakata. Kanggo nambahaké kolom ing antarmuka administrasi, "
"modul inti Field UI kudu wis diinstal, lan kowé uga butuh ijin "
"<em>Administer fields</em> kanggo entitas sing bakal ditambahaké "
"kolom."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@taxonomy_admin_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@taxonomy_admin_link</em>."

msgid "Click <em>Add vocabulary</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah kosakata</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Name</em> field, enter a name for the vocabulary (for "
"example \"Ingredients\"), which is how it will be shown in the "
"administrative interface. Optionally, add a description."
msgstr ""
"Ing kolom <em>Name</em>, lebokna jeneng kanggo vocabulary (umpamane "
"\"Ingredients\"), sing bakal ditampilaké ing antarmuka administratif. "
"Pilihan liyane, tambahna gambaran."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. Your vocabulary will be created and you will see "
"the page that lists all the terms in this vocabulary."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Simpen</em>. Kamus tembungmu bakal digawe lan kowe bakal "
"weruh kaca sing ndhaptar kabeh istilah ing kamus iki."

msgid ""
"Optionally, click <em>Add term</em> to add a term to the new "
"vocabulary. In the <em>Name</em> field, enter the term name (for "
"example \"Butter\"). Click <em>Save</em>. You will receive a "
"confirmation about the term you created. You may optionally continue "
"to add more terms."
msgstr ""
"Sakliyane, klik <em>Add term</em> kanggo nambah tembung ing kosakata "
"anyar. Ing kolom <em>Name</em>, ketik jeneng tembung (contone "
"\"Butter\"). Klik <em>Save</em>. Sampeyan bakal nampa konfirmasi "
"babagan tembung sing wis digawe. Sampeyan uga bisa nerusake kanggo "
"nambah tembung liyane."

msgid ""
"If you have the Field UI module installed, follow the instructions on "
"the related <em>Adding a reference field to an entity sub-type</em> "
"topic to add a taxonomy reference field to the entity type of your "
"choice. The settings page will allow you to choose the "
"<em>Vocabulary</em> that you created as the vocabulary to reference."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan wis nginstal modul Field UI, tindakake pandhuan ing topik "
"<em>Adding a reference field to an entity sub-type</em> sing "
"gegandhengan kanggo nambah lapangan referensi taksonomi menyang jinis "
"entitas sing sampeyan pilih. Kaca setelan bakal ngidini sampeyan milih "
"<em>Vocabulary</em> sing wis sampeyan nggawe minangka vocabulary sing "
"arep direferensikake."

msgid ""
"You may also want to configure the display and form display of the new "
"field (see related topics)."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel tampilan lan tampilan formulir saka kolom "
"anyar iki (deleng topik terkait)."

msgid "Managing taxonomy"
msgstr "Ngatur taksonomi"

msgid "What is taxonomy?"
msgstr "Apa iku taksonomi?"

msgid ""
"<em>Taxonomy</em> is used to classify website content. One common "
"example of taxonomy is the tags used to classify or categorize posts "
"in a blog website; a cooking website could use an ingredients taxonomy "
"to classify recipes. Individual taxonomy items are known as "
"<em>terms</em> (the blog tags or recipe ingredients in these "
"examples); and a set of terms is known as a <em>vocabulary</em> (the "
"set of all blog post tags, or the set of all recipe ingredients in "
"these examples). Technically, taxonomy terms are an entity type and "
"the entity subtypes are the vocabularies; see @content_structure_topic "
"for more on content entities. Like other entities, taxonomy terms can "
"have fields attached; for instance, you could set up an image field to "
"contain an icon for each term."
msgstr ""
"<em>Taksonomi</em> digunakake kanggo nglompokaké isi situs web. Salah "
"siji conto umum saka taksonomi yaiku tag sing digunakake kanggo "
"nglompokaké utawa ngategorikaké tulisan ing situs web blog; situs "
"web masak bisa nggunakake taksonomi bahan kanggo nglompokaké resep. "
"Item taksonomi individu dikenal minangka <em>term</em> (tag blog utawa "
"bahan resep ing conto iki); lan sakumpulan term dikenal minangka "
"<em>kosakata</em> (sakumpulan tag tulisan blog, utawa sakumpulan bahan "
"resep ing conto iki). Secara teknis, term taksonomi iku jinis entitas "
"lan subtype entitas yaiku kosakata; delengen @content_structure_topic "
"kanggo luwih lanjut babagan entitas isi. Kaya entitas liyane, term "
"taksonomi bisa nduwèni kolom sing dipasang; contone, sampeyan bisa "
"nyetel kolom gambar kanggo ngandhut ikon kanggo saben term."

msgid ""
"An individual vocabulary can organize its terms in a hierarchy, or it "
"could be flat. For example, blog tags normally have a flat structure, "
"while a recipe ingredients vocabulary could be hierarchical (for "
"example, tomatoes could be a sub-term of vegetables, and under "
"tomatoes, you could have green and red tomatoes)."
msgstr ""
"Saben vocabulary individu bisa nyusun istilah-istilahé kanthi "
"piramida, utawa bisa uga datar. Contoné, tag blog biasané nduwèni "
"struktur datar, déné vocabulary bahan resep bisa waé hierarkis "
"(contone, tomat bisa dadi sub-istilah saka sayuran, lan ing ngisor "
"tomat, sampeyan bisa nduwèni tomat ijo lan abang)."

msgid ""
"Taxonomy terms are normally attached as reference fields to other "
"content entities, which is how you can use them to classify content. "
"When you set up a taxonomy reference field, you can let users enter "
"terms in two ways:"
msgstr ""
"Istilah taksonomi biasane dipasang minangka lapangan referensi kanggo "
"entitas isi liyane, sing nggawe sampeyan bisa nggunakake istilah "
"kasebut kanggo ngelompokake isi. Nalika sampeyan nyetel lapangan "
"referensi taksonomi, sampeyan bisa ngidini pangguna mlebu istilah "
"kanthi rong cara:"

msgid "New terms can be created right on the content editing form."
msgstr "Istilah anyar bisa digawe langsung ing formulir pangowahan konten."

msgid "Fixed list of terms"
msgstr "Daftar istilah sing wis ditemtokake"

msgid ""
"The list of terms is curated and managed outside the content editing "
"form, and users can only select from the existing list when editing "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar istilah disusun lan dikelola ing njaba formulir suntingan isi, "
"lan pangguna mung bisa milih saka dhaptar sing wis ana nalika nyunting "
"isi."

msgid "Overview of managing taxonomy"
msgstr "Gambaran babagan ngatur taksonomi"

msgid ""
"The core Taxonomy module allows you to create and edit taxonomy "
"vocabularies and taxonomy terms. The core Field UI module provides a "
"user interface for adding fields to entities, including the taxonomy "
"reference field, and configuring field editing and display. See the "
"related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Taxonomy ngidini sampeyan nggawe lan nyunting vocabulary "
"taxonomy lan term taxonomy. Modul inti Field UI nyedhiyakake antar "
"muka pangguna kanggo nambah lapangan ing entitas, kalebu lapangan "
"referensi taxonomy, lan nyetel panyuntingan lan tampilan lapangan. "
"Delengen topik terkait sing kadhaptar ing ngisor iki kanggo "
"tugas-tugas tartamtu."

msgid ""
"<em>Page settings</em>, <em>Block settings</em>, etc.: settings "
"specific to the display type, such as the URL for a page display. Most "
"display types support an <em>Access</em> setting, where you can choose "
"a Permission or Role that a user must have in order to see the view."
msgstr ""
"<em>Setelan kaca</em>, <em>Setelan blok</em>, lsp.: setelan sing "
"khusus kanggo jinis tampilan, kaya URL kanggo tampilan kaca. "
"Kasesebabe, sapérangan jinis tampilan ndhukung setelan "
"<em>Akses</em>, ing ngendi sampeyan bisa milih Ijin utawa Peran sing "
"kudu diduwèni pangguna supaya bisa ndeleng tampilan kasebut."

msgid "What are bulk operations?"
msgstr "Apa iku operasi bulk?"

msgid "Adding a bulk operations form to a view"
msgstr "Nambahake formulir operasi massal menyang pandelengan"

msgid "Who can edit views?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nyunting views?"

msgid ""
"The core Views UI module will need to be installed and you will need "
"<em>@views_permissions</em> permission in order to edit a view."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Views UI kudu dipasang lan sampeyan kudu duwe ijin "
"<em>@views_permissions</em> supaya bisa ngowahi tampilan."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@views</em>. A list of all views is shown."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@views</em>. Dhaptar kabeh views bakal "
"ditampilake."

msgid ""
"If there is not already an <em>Operations bulk form</em> in the "
"<em>Fields</em> list for the view, click <em>Add</em> in the "
"<em>Fields</em> section to add it. (The exact name of the bulk form "
"field will vary, and may contain keywords like \"bulk update\", \"form "
"element\" or \"operations\" -- not to be confused with <em>operations "
"links</em>, which are applied to each item in a row.) If the bulk "
"operations field already exists, click the field name to edit its "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Yen durung ana <em>Operations bulk form</em> ing dhaptar "
"<em>Fields</em> kanggo tampilan, klik <em>Add</em> ing bagean "
"<em>Fields</em> kanggo nambah. (Jeneng persis saka kolom form bulk iki "
"bisa beda-beda, lan bisa ngemot tembung kunci kaya \"bulk update\", "
"\"form element\" utawa \"operations\" -- aja nganti kleru karo "
"<em>operations links</em>, sing diterapake kanggo saben item ing "
"baris.) Yen kolom operations bulk wis ana, klik jeneng kolom kanggo "
"ngedit setelan kasebut."

msgid ""
"Check the action(s) you want to make available in the <em>Selected "
"actions</em> list and click <em>Apply (all displays)</em>."
msgstr ""
"Centhang tumindak sing arep sampeyan sediaake ing dhaptar <em>Selected "
"actions</em> banjur klik <em>Apply (all displays)</em>."

msgid ""
"Verify that the <em>Access</em> settings for the view are at least as "
"restrictive as the permissions necessary to perform the bulk "
"operations. People with permission to see the view, but who don't have "
"permission to do the bulk operations, will experience problems."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa setelan <em>Access</em> kanggo tampilan paling ora padha "
"ketat karo ijin sing dibutuhake kanggo nindakake operasi massal. Wong "
"sing nduweni ijin kanggo ndeleng tampilan, nanging ora nduweni ijin "
"kanggo nindakake operasi massal, bakal ngalami masalah."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Save</em>. The action(s) will be available as bulk "
"operations in the view."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Simpen</em>. Tumindak bakal kasedhiya minangka operasi massal "
"ing tampilan."

msgid ""
"Create and download an archive containing all your site's "
"configuration, exported as YAML files. See @config_overview_topic for "
"more information about configuration."
msgstr ""
"Gawe lan undhuh arsip sing ngemot kabeh konfigurasi situs sampeyan, "
"diekspor minangka file YAML. Delengen @config_overview_topic kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"Export a single configuration item to a file. See "
"@config_overview_topic for more information about configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ekspor siji item konfigurasi menyang file. Deleng "
"@config_overview_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan "
"konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"Import the complete configuration of your site from an archive file, "
"such as one that was previously exported (see @export_full_topic). See "
"@config_overview_topic for more information about configuration."
msgstr ""
"Impor konfigurasi lengkap saka situs sampeyan saka file arsip, kaya "
"sing wis diekspor sadurunge (deleng @export_full_topic). Delengen "
"@config_overview_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan "
"konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"Import a single configuration item in YAML format, such as one that "
"was previously exported (see @export_single_topic). See "
"@config_overview_topic for more information about configuration."
msgstr ""
"Impor siji item konfigurasi ing format YAML, kaya sing wis diekspor "
"sadurunge (delengen @export_single_topic). Delengen "
"@config_overview_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan "
"konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"Translate your site configuration to another language. See "
"@language_add_topic if you need to add a new language."
msgstr ""
"Terjemahake konfigurasi situs sampeyan menyang basa liyane. Delengen "
"@language_add_topic yen sampeyan perlu nambah basa anyar."

msgid ""
"Find either the configuration entity type or the simple configuration "
"item that you want to translate in the <em>Label</em> column of the "
"list. Click <em>List</em> under <em>Operations</em> for a "
"configuration entity, or <em>Translate</em> for simple configuration. "
"(See @config_overview_topic to learn more about types of configuration "
"and configuration entities.)"
msgstr ""
"Goleki jinis entitas konfigurasi utawa item konfigurasi prasaja sing "
"arep sampeyan terjemahake ing kolom <em>Label</em> saka dhaptar. Klik "
"<em>List</em> ing ngisor <em>Operations</em> kanggo entitas "
"konfigurasi, utawa <em>Translate</em> kanggo konfigurasi prasaja. "
"(Delengen @config_overview_topic kanggo sinau luwih lengkap babagan "
"jinis konfigurasi lan entitas konfigurasi.)"

msgid ""
"The contact form will always have <em>Subject</em> and "
"<em>Message</em> fields. If you want to add more fields, follow the "
"steps in @adding_fields_topic."
msgstr ""
"Form kontak mesthi bakal nduwèni kolom <em>Subject</em> lan "
"<em>Message</em>. Yen sampeyan pengin nambah kolom liyane, tindakake "
"langkah-langkah ing @adding_fields_topic."

msgid ""
"Change the workflow state of a particular entity. See "
"@workflows_overview_topic for an overview of workflows, and "
"@content_structure_topic for an overview of content entities."
msgstr ""
"Ganti status alur kerja saka entitas tartamtu. Deleng "
"@workflows_overview_topic kanggo gambaran umum alur kerja, lan "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo gambaran umum entitas konten."

msgid ""
"Create or edit a workflow with various workflow states (for example "
"<em>Concept</em>, <em>Archived</em>, etc.) for moderating content. See "
"@workflows_overview_topic for more information on workflows."
msgstr ""
"Gawe utawa sunting workflow karo macem-macem status workflow (contone "
"<em>Concept</em>, <em>Archived</em>, lsp.) kanggo mediasi isi. "
"Delengen @workflows_overview_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap "
"babagan workflows."

msgid ""
"Decide which roles should have permissions to make each transition; "
"see @user_overview_topic for an overview of roles and permissions."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan peran sing kudu duwe ijin kanggo nggawe saben transisi; waca "
"@user_overview_topic kanggo ringkesan peran lan ijin."

msgid ""
"Decide which <em>entity types</em> and subtypes the workflow should "
"apply to. Only entity types that support revisions are possible to "
"define workflows for. See @content_structure_topic for more "
"information on content entities and fields."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan <em>jeneng entitas</em> lan subjenenge sing kudu ditrapake "
"workflow. Mung jeneng entitas sing ndhukung revisi sing bisa "
"ditentokake workflow-e. Deleng @content_structure_topic kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan entitas konten lan kolom-kolome."

msgid ""
"Configure language and translation settings for one or more content "
"entity types (see @content_structure_topic for an overview of content "
"entities). To do this, you must have at least two languages "
"configured. Afterwards, you will have a <em>Translate</em> operation "
"available for your content entities, either as a tab or link when you "
"are viewing or editing content, or on content administration pages."
msgstr ""
"Atur setelan basa lan terjemahan kanggo siji utawa luwih jinis entitas "
"isi (deleng @content_structure_topic kanggo gambaran umum babagan "
"entitas isi). Kanggo nindakake iki, sampeyan kudu wis nyetel minimal "
"rong basa. Sawise kuwi, sampeyan bakal duwe operasi <em>Translate</em> "
"sing kasedhiya kanggo entitas isi sampeyan, bisa dadi tab utawa "
"pranala nalika sampeyan nonton utawa nyunting isi, utawa ing kaca "
"administrasi isi."

msgid ""
"A <em>layout</em> is a template that defines where blocks and other "
"pieces of content should be displayed. The core Layout Discovery "
"module allows modules and themes to register layouts, and the core "
"Layout Builder module provides a visual interface for placing fields "
"and blocks in layouts for entity sub-types and individual entity items "
"(see @content_structure_topic for more on entities and fields)."
msgstr ""
"<em>Layout</em> iku sawijining templat sing nemtokake panggonan blok "
"lan potongan isi liyane kudu ditampilake. Modul inti Layout Discovery "
"ngidini modul lan tema kanggo ndhaptar layout, lan modul inti Layout "
"Builder nyedhiyakake antarmuka visual kanggo nyelehake kolom lan blok "
"ing layout kanggo sub-jenis entitas lan item entitas individu (waca "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo luwih lengkap babagan entitas lan "
"kolom)."

msgid ""
"Core media items include audio, images, documents, and videos. You can "
"add other media types, such as social media posts, through the use of "
"contributed modules. Media items may be files located in your site's "
"file system, or remote items referenced by a URL. Media items are "
"content entities, and they are divided into media types (which are "
"entity sub-types); media types can have fields. See "
"@content_structure_topic for more information on content entities and "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Item media inti kalebu audio, gambar, dokumen, lan video. Sampeyan "
"bisa nambah jinis media liyane, kayata kiriman media sosial, liwat "
"panggunaan modul sing kontribusi. Item media bisa dadi file sing ana "
"ing sistem file situs sampeyan, utawa item jarak jauh sing dirujuk "
"dening URL. Item media iku entitas konten, lan dipérang dadi jinis "
"media (sing dadi sub-jinis entitas); jinis media bisa duwe kolom. "
"Delengen @content_structure_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap "
"babagan entitas konten lan kolom."

msgid ""
"Content (blocks, content items, etc.) can be written in English or "
"another language, and can be translated into additional languages. See "
"@content_structure_topic to learn more about content."
msgstr ""
"Isi (blok, item isi, lsp.) bisa ditulis nganggo basa Inggris utawa "
"basa liyane, lan bisa diterjemahake menyang basa tambahan. Delengen "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo luwih ngerti babagan isi."

msgid ""
"Many configuration items also include text that can be translated. "
"Default configuration provided by your site's software is provided in "
"English; you can also download community-provided translations. See "
"@config_overview_topic to learn more about configuration."
msgstr ""
"Akeh barang konfigurasi uga kalebu teks sing bisa diterjemahake. "
"Konfigurasi standar sing disedhiyakake dening piranti lunak situs "
"sampeyan diwenehake ing basa Inggris; sampeyan uga bisa ngundhuh "
"terjemahan saka komunitas. Deleng @config_overview_topic kanggo sinau "
"luwih lengkap babagan konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"Exposes <em>entities</em> to other applications using a fully "
"compliant implementation of the <a "
"href=\"https://jsonapi.org\">JSON:API Specification</a>. See "
"@content_structure_topic for more information on content entities and "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Ngewatakaké <em>entitas</em> menyang aplikasi liyané nggunakake "
"implementasi sing patuh kanthi lengkap marang <a "
"href=\"https://jsonapi.org\">Spesifikasi JSON:API</a>. Delengen "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan "
"entitas isi lan lapangan."

msgid ""
"Configure a text format so that when a user is editing text and "
"selects this text format, a text editor installed on your site is "
"shown. Configure the text editor, such as choosing which buttons and "
"functions are available. See @filter_overview_topic for more about "
"text formats."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasèkaké format tèks supaya nalika pangguna ngrubah tèks "
"lan milih format tèks iki, editor tèks sing dipasang ing situs "
"sampeyan ditampilaké. Konfigurasèkaké editor tèks, kaya milih "
"tombol lan fungsi sing kasedhiya. Deleng @filter_overview_topic kanggo "
"luwih ngerti babagan format tèks."

msgid ""
"Follow the steps on @filter_overview_topic to add a new text format or "
"configure an existing text format; when you reach the step about text "
"editors, return to this topic."
msgstr ""
"Tindakake langkah-langkah ing @filter_overview_topic kanggo nambah "
"format teks anyar utawa ngatur format teks sing wis ana; nalika tekan "
"langkah babagan editor teks, bali maneh menyang topik iki."

msgid ""
"Return to @filter_overview_topic to complete the text format "
"configuration, and be sure to save the text format."
msgstr ""
"Bali menyang @filter_overview_topic kanggo ngrampungake konfigurasi "
"format teks, lan priksa manawa nyimpen format teks kasebut."

msgid ""
"Add a field to an entity sub-type; see @content_structure_topic for an "
"overview of entity types and sub-types, as well as an overview of "
"field types."
msgstr ""
"Tambahi lapangan menyang sub-tipe entitas; delengen "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo ringkesan jinis entitas lan sub-tipe, "
"uga ringkesan jinis lapangan."

msgid ""
"In <em>Add a new field</em>, select the type of field you want to add; "
"see @content_structure_topic for an overview of field types."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Add a new field</em>, pilih jinis kolom sing arep ditambahake; "
"delengen @content_structure_topic kanggo ringkesan babagan jinis-jinis "
"kolom."

msgid ""
"Configure the <em>formatters</em> used to display the fields of an "
"entity sub-type, their order in the display, and the formatter "
"settings. See @content_structure_topic for background information."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikna <em>formatters</em> sing digunakake kanggo nampilake "
"lapangan saka sub-tipe entitas, urutané ing tampilan, lan setelan "
"formatter. Delengen @content_structure_topic kanggo informasi latar "
"mburi."

msgid ""
"Configure the <em>widgets</em> used to edit the fields of an entity "
"sub-type, their order on the form, and the widget settings. See "
"@content_structure_topic for background information."
msgstr ""
"Ngonfigurasi <em>widgets</em> sing digunakake kanggo ngedit kolom saka "
"sub-jinis entitas, urutane ing formulir, lan setelan widget. Delengen "
"@content_structure_topic kanggo informasi latar mburi."

msgid ""
"Add an entity reference field to an entity sub-type; see "
"@content_structure_topic for more information on entities and "
"reference fields."
msgstr ""
"Tambahaké kolom referènsi entitas menyang sub-jinis entitas; "
"delengen @content_structure_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap "
"babagan entitas lan kolom referènsi."

msgid ""
"Check the indexing status of the Help search page. If it is not fully "
"indexed, see @cron_topic about how to run Cron until indexing is "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"Priksa status indeks kaca panelusuran Bantuan. Yen durung kanthi "
"lengkap diindeks, waca @cron_topic babagan cara mbukak Cron nganti "
"indeksisasi rampung."

msgid ""
"In the future, you can click <em>Rebuild search index</em> on this "
"page, or @cache_topic, in order to force help topic text to be "
"reindexed for searching. This should be done whenever a module, theme, "
"language, or string translation is updated."
msgstr ""
"Ing mangsa ngarep, sampeyan bisa ngeklik <em>Rebuild search index</em> "
"ing kaca iki, utawa @cache_topic, supaya teks topik bantuan dipaksa "
"kanggo diindeks maneh kanggo panelusuran. Iki kudu ditindakake saben "
"ana modul, tema, basa, utawa terjemahan string sing dianyari."

msgid ""
"Add a new image style, which can be used to process and display "
"images. See @media_topic for an overview of image styles."
msgstr ""
"Tambah gaya gambar anyar, sing bisa digunakake kanggo ngolah lan "
"nampilake gambar. Delengen @media_topic kanggo gambaran umum babagan "
"gaya gambar."

msgid ""
"Configure an entity sub-type to have its fields displayed using a "
"layout (see @content_structure_topic for more on entities and fields)."
msgstr ""
"Ngonfigurasi sub-tipe entitas supaya kolom-kolome ditampilake nganggo "
"tata letak (delengen @content_structure_topic kanggo luwih lengkap "
"babagan entitas lan kolom)."

msgid ""
"A layout consists of one or more <em>sections</em>. Each section can "
"have from one to four <em>columns</em>. You can place blocks, "
"including special blocks for the fields on the entity sub-type, in "
"each column of each section (see @block_overview_topic for more on "
"blocks)."
msgstr ""
"Siji tata letak dumadi saka siji utawa luwih <em>bagian</em>. Saben "
"bagian bisa nduwèni saka siji tekan papat <em>kolom</em>. Kowé bisa "
"nempataké blok, kalebu blok khusus kanggo lapangan ing sub-tipe "
"entitas, ing saben kolom saka saben bagian (delok "
"@block_overview_topic kanggo wacan luwih lengkap babagan blok)."

msgid ""
"Add a new media type that can be referenced in Media reference fields; "
"media types are a content entity type. See @media_topic for an "
"overview of media items and media types, and @content_structure_topic "
"for more information on content entities and fields."
msgstr ""
"Tambahake jinis media anyar sing bisa direferensikake ing kolom "
"referensi Media; jinis media iku jinis entitas isi. Delengen "
"@media_topic kanggo gambaran umum babagan item media lan jinis media, "
"lan @content_structure_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan "
"entitas isi lan kolom."

msgid ""
"Migrate data into a new, empty site, as part of an upgrade from an "
"older version of Drupal. See @migrate_overview_topic for an overview "
"of migrating and upgrading."
msgstr ""
"Migrate data menyang situs anyar sing kosong, minangka bagian saka "
"upgrade saka versi Drupal sing luwih lawas. Delengen "
"@migrate_overview_topic kanggo gambaran babagan migrasi lan upgrade."

msgid ""
"Configure a responsive image style, which can be used to display "
"images at different sizes on different devices. See @media_topic for "
"an overview of responsive image styles, and @breakpoint_overview_topic "
"for an overview of breakpoints."
msgstr ""
"Ngonfigurasi gaya gambar responsif, sing bisa digunakake kanggo "
"nampilake gambar kanthi ukuran sing beda-beda ing piranti sing beda. "
"Delengen @media_topic kanggo ringkesan gaya gambar responsif, lan "
"@breakpoint_overview_topic kanggo ringkesan breakpoint."

msgid ""
"Select a <em>Fallback image style</em> to use when none of the other "
"styles apply. See @image_style_topic if you need to add a new style."
msgstr ""
"Pilih <em>Gaya gambar cadangan</em> sing digunakake nalika ora ana "
"gaya liyane sing cocog. Delengen @image_style_topic yen sampeyan perlu "
"nambah gaya anyar."

msgid ""
"The <em>Content</em> and <em>Help</em> search types provided by the "
"core software pre-index their content and store the results in several "
"database tables that are collectively called the <em>search "
"index</em>. The process of indexing renders the content and breaks it "
"up into words, which can then be matched more efficiently with keyword "
"queries when users perform searches. Search indexing happens during "
"cron runs; see @cron_topic for more information about cron."
msgstr ""
"Tipe panelusuran <em>Content</em> lan <em>Help</em> sing disedhiyakake "
"dening piranti lunak inti ngetokake isi kasebut sadurunge lan nyimpen "
"asile ing sawetara tabel basis data sing padha dijenengi <em>search "
"index</em>. Proses indeksasi iki ngowahi isi dadi teks lan mecahake "
"dadi tembung-tembung, sing banjur bisa dicocogake luwih efisien karo "
"query tembung kunci nalika pangguna nindakake panelusuran. Indeksasi "
"panelusuran kedadeyan nalika cron mlaku; delengen @cron_topic kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan cron."

msgid ""
"Follow the steps in @cron_topic to make sure a cron task has been "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Tindakake langkah-langkah ing @cron_topic kanggo mesthekake yen tugas "
"cron wis dikonfigurasi."

msgid ""
"In order to configure site search using the core Search module, you "
"will need to configure one or more search pages. You will also need to "
"verify or alter permissions so that the desired user roles can search "
"the site. (See @user_overview_topic for more information about roles "
"and permissions.) For content search, you will also need to make sure "
"that the search index is configured and that the site is fully "
"indexed. Finally, you may wish to place the <em>Search form</em> block "
"on pages of your site, or add the search page to a navigation menu, to "
"give users easy access to search. See the related topics listed below "
"for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nyetel panelusuran situs nggunakake modul Search inti, sampeyan "
"kudu nyetel siji utawa luwih kaca panelusuran. Sampeyan uga kudu "
"mriksa utawa ngganti ijin supaya peran pangguna sing dikarepake bisa "
"nggoleki situs kasebut. (Delengen @user_overview_topic kanggo info "
"luwih lengkap babagan peran lan ijin.) Kanggo panelusuran isi, "
"sampeyan uga kudu manawa indeks panelusuran wis disetel lan situs wis "
"diindeks kanthi lengkap. Pungkasan, sampeyan bisa nyetel blok "
"<em>Search form</em> ing kaca-kaca situsmu, utawa nambah kaca "
"panelusuran menyang menu navigasi, supaya pangguna gampang ngakses "
"panelusuran. Delengen topik-topik sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki "
"kanggo tugas-tugas tartamtu."

msgid "Clear the site cache. See @cache_topic for instructions."
msgstr "Resikna cache situs. Delengen @cache_topic kanggo pandhuan."

msgid ""
"Uninstall a module. Your site should be in <em>maintenance mode</em> "
"when you uninstall modules. See @maintenance_topic for details."
msgstr ""
"Copot modul. Situs sampeyan kudu ing <em>mode pangopènan</em> nalika "
"sampeyan nyopot modul. Deleng @maintenance_topic kanggo rincian."

msgid ""
"Follow the steps in @view_edit_topic to edit the other settings for "
"the display."
msgstr ""
"Tindakake langkah-langkah ing @view_edit_topic kanggo ngowahi setelan "
"liyane kanggo tampilan."

msgid ""
"Find the section whose settings you want to change, such as "
"<em>Format</em> or <em>Filter criteria</em>. (See "
"@views_overview_topic for more information.)"
msgstr ""
"Goleki bagean sing pangaturane pengin sampeyan ganti, kaya ta "
"<em>Format</em> utawa <em>Filter criteria</em>. (Delengen "
"@views_overview_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap.)"

msgid ""
"The core software allows you to configure workflows in which each "
"transition has an associated permission that can be granted to a "
"particular role. See @configuring_workflows_topic for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Piranti lunak inti ngidini sampeyan ngatur alur kerja ing ngendi saben "
"transisi duwe ijin sing gegandhengan sing bisa diwenehake marang peran "
"tartamtu. Delengen @configuring_workflows_topic kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap."

msgid ""
"Users with sufficient permissions can change the workflow state of a "
"particular entity. See @changing_states_topic for more information."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduweni ijin cukup bisa ngganti status workflow saka "
"sawijining entitas tartamtu. Delengen @changing_states_topic kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"Remote oEmbed providers could not be retrieved due to error: @error. "
"Using previously stored data. This may contain out of date "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Penyedhiya oEmbed jarak jauh ora bisa dijupuk amarga kesalahan: "
"@error. Nggunakake data sing wis disimpen sadurunge. Iki bisa ngemot "
"informasi sing wis kadaluwarsa."

msgid ""
"Remote oEmbed providers database returned invalid or empty list. Using "
"previously stored data. This may contain out of date information."
msgstr ""
"Basis data panyedhiya oEmbed jarak adoh mbalekake daftar ora sah utawa "
"kosong. Nganggo data sing wis disimpen sadurunge. Iki bisa ngemot "
"informasi sing wis kadaluwarsa."

msgid "Block type settings"
msgstr "Setelan jinis blok"

msgid "Navigation logo"
msgstr "Logo navigasi"

msgid "@bundle_type is not @bundles or @last"
msgstr "@bundle_type dudu @bundles utawa @last"

msgid "@bundle_type is not @bundle"
msgstr "@bundle_type dudu @bundle"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the @entity-type %label from the "
"%region region?"
msgstr ""
"Apa sampeyan yakin pengin mbusak @entity-type %label saka wilayah "
"%region?"

msgid ""
"This will remove the block placement. You will need to <a "
"href=\":url\">place it again</a> in order to undo this action."
msgstr ""
"Iki bakal mbusak panggonan blok. Sampeyan kudu <a "
"href=\":url\">nempatake maneh</a> supaya bisa mbatalake tumindak iki."

msgid "The @entity-type %label has been removed from the %region region."
msgstr "@entity-type %label wis dicopot saka wilayah %region."

msgid "Destination file \"%file\" exists"
msgstr "Berkas tujuan \"%file\" wis ana"

msgid ""
"The file could not be uploaded because the destination "
"\"%destination\" is invalid."
msgstr "Berkas ora bisa diunggah amarga tujuan \"%destination\" ora valid."

msgid ""
"For more information see the <a href=\":html-specifications\">HTML "
"Living Standard</a> or use your favorite search engine to find other "
"sites that explain HTML."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap delengen <a "
"href=\":html-specifications\">HTML Living Standard</a> utawa gunakna "
"mesin telusur favoritmu kanggo golek situs liyane sing nerangake HTML."

msgid "Converts an image to a format (such as JPEG)."
msgstr "Ngowahi gambar dadi format (kaya JPEG)."

msgid ""
"Determines the content language from the request parameter named "
"'language_content_entity'."
msgstr ""
"Nemtokake basa isi saka parameter panyuwunan sing dijenengi "
"'language_content_entity'."

msgid "The source field definition for the %type media type is missing."
msgstr "Definisi lapangan sumber kanggo jinis media %type ora ana."

msgid "Author/owner name"
msgstr "Jeneng pangarang/pemilik"

msgid "Author/owner URL"
msgstr "URL Panganggit/pemilik"

msgid "Media item default name"
msgstr "Jeneng standar barang media"

msgid "Thumbnail local URI"
msgstr "URI lokal thumbnail"

msgid "Resource source URL"
msgstr "URL sumber sumber daya"

msgid "Resource width"
msgstr "Ambane sumber daya"

msgid "Resource height"
msgstr "Dhuwur sumber daya"

msgid "Resource HTML representation"
msgstr "Representasi HTML Sumber Daya"

msgid ""
"For more detailed information, see the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/updating-drupal\">Updating Drupal "
"guide</a>. If you are unsure what these terms mean you should probably "
"contact your hosting provider."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi sing luwih rinci, delengen <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/updating-drupal\">Pandhuan Nganyari "
"Drupal</a>. Yen sampeyan durung paham apa makna istilah-istilah iki, "
"luwih becik sampeyan hubungi panyedhiya hosting sampeyan."

msgid "Defined on the <a href=\"@appearance\">Appearance Settings</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Didefinisikake ing kaca <a href=\"@appearance\">Setelan "
"Penampilan</a>."

msgid "Save and go to list"
msgstr "Simpen lan menyang dhaptar"

msgid ""
"Automatic updating of Drupal core is not supported. See the <a "
"href=\":update-guide\">Updating Drupal guide</a> for information on "
"how to update Drupal core manually."
msgstr ""
"Nganyari otomatis inti Drupal ora didhukung. Delengen <a "
"href=\":update-guide\">Pandhuan Nganyari Drupal</a> kanggo informasi "
"babagan cara nganyari inti Drupal kanthi manual."

msgid "Other permissions pages"
msgstr "Kaca idin liyane"

msgid ""
"The main Permissions page can be overwhelming, so each module that "
"defines permissions has its own page for setting them. There are links "
"to these pages on the <a href=\":modules\">Extend page</a>. When "
"editing a content type, vocabulary, etc., there is also a Manage "
"permissions tab for permissions related to that configuration."
msgstr ""
"Kaca Ijin utama bisa dadi kakehan, mula saben modul sing nemtokake "
"ijin duwe kaca dhewe kanggo nyetel ijin kasebut. Ana pranala menyang "
"kaca-kaca kasebut ing <a href=\":modules\">Kaca Extend</a>. Nalika "
"nyunting jinis isi, kosakata, lsp., uga ana tab Manage permissions "
"kanggo ijin sing gegandhengan karo konfigurasi kasebut."

msgid "Account %name has been disabled."
msgstr "Akun %name wis dinonaktifake."

msgid ""
"Delete the account and make its content belong to the %anonymous-name "
"user. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Busak akun lan gawe isine dadi kagungan panganggo %anonymous-name. "
"Tumindak iki ora bisa dibalèkaké."

msgid "Delete the account and its content. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Mbusak akun lan isine. Tumindak iki ora bisa dibalekake."

msgid ""
"To log in to this site, your browser must accept cookies from the "
"domain %domain."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo mlebu menyang situs iki, browser sampeyan kudu nampa cookies "
"saka domain %domain."

msgid "Cancellation method"
msgstr "Cara mbatalake"

msgid ""
"This view will be displayed by visiting this path on your site. You "
"may use \"%\" or named route parameters like \"%node\" in your URL to "
"represent values that will be used for contextual filters: For "
"example, \"node/%node/feed\" or \"view_path/%\". Named route "
"parameters are required when this path matches an existing path. For "
"example, paths such as \"taxonomy/term/%taxonomy_term\" or "
"\"user/%user/custom-view\"."
msgstr ""
"Pancèn tampilan iki bakal ditampilaké kanthi ngunjungi jalur iki ing "
"situsmu. Kowé bisa nganggo \"%\" utawa parameter jalur sing dijenengi "
"kaya \"%node\" ing URL kanggo makili nilai-nilai sing bakal "
"digunakaké kanggo filter kontekstual: Contoné, \"node/%node/feed\" "
"utawa \"view_path/%\". Parameter jalur sing dijenengi dibutuhaké "
"nalika jalur iki cocog karo jalur sing wis ana. Contoné, jalur kaya "
"\"taxonomy/term/%taxonomy_term\" utawa \"user/%user/custom-view\"."

msgid "Sort field identifier"
msgstr "Identifikasi lapangan urut"

msgid ""
"This will appear in the URL after the ?, as value of 'sort_by' "
"parameter, to identify this sort field. Cannot be blank. Only letters, "
"digits and the dot ('.'), hyphen ('-'), underscore ('_'), and tilde "
"('~') characters are allowed."
msgstr ""
"Iki bakal muncul ing URL sawise ?, minangka nilai parameter 'sort_by', "
"kanggo ngenali kolom urutan iki. Ora kudu kosong. Mung huruf, angka, "
"lan karakter titik ('.'), tanda hubung ('-'), garis ngisor ('_'), lan "
"tilde ('~') sing diijini."

msgid "This identifier is already used by %label sort handler."
msgstr "Pangidentifikasi iki wis digunakake dening %label sort handler."

msgid "Switch to this workspace"
msgstr "Pindhah menyang workspace iki"

msgid "Workspace changes"
msgstr "Owahan papan kerja"

msgid "This workspace has no changes."
msgstr "Workspace iki ora duwe owah-owahan."

msgid "@entity_type_label: @entity_bundle_label"
msgstr "@entity_type_label: @entity_bundle_label"

msgid "admin/reports/dblog/event/{{ wid }}"
msgstr "admin/laporan/dblog/acara/{{ wid }}"

msgid "admin/content/files/usage/{{ fid }}"
msgstr "admin/content/files/usage/{{ fid }}"

msgid "@interval"
msgstr "@interval"

msgid "Code Block"
msgstr "Blok Kode"

msgid ""
"The CKEditor 5 module provides a highly-accessible, highly-usable "
"visual text editor and adds a toolbar to text fields. Users can use "
"buttons to format content and to create semantically correct and valid "
"HTML. The CKEditor module uses the framework provided by the <a "
"href=\":text_editor\">Text Editor module</a>. It requires JavaScript "
"to be enabled in the browser. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">online documentation for the CKEditor 5 module</a> "
"and the <a href=\":cke5_url\">CKEditor 5 website</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul CKEditor 5 nyedhiyakake editor teks visual sing gampang diakses "
"lan gampang digunakake, uga nambah toolbar ing kolom teks. Panganggo "
"bisa nggunakake tombol kanggo maringi format isi lan nggawe HTML sing "
"semantis lan valid. Modul CKEditor nggunakake kerangka kerja sing "
"disedhiyakake dening <a href=\":text_editor\">modul Text Editor</a>. "
"Modul iki mbutuhake JavaScript aktif ing browser. Kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":doc_url\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul CKEditor 5</a> lan <a href=\":cke5_url\">situs web CKEditor "
"5</a>."

msgid "Enabling CKEditor 5 for individual text formats"
msgstr "Ngaktifake CKEditor 5 kanggo format teks individu"

msgid ""
"When CKEditor 5 is chosen from the <em>Text editor</em> drop-down "
"menu, its toolbar configuration is displayed. You can add and remove "
"buttons from the <em>Active toolbar</em> by dragging and dropping "
"them. Separators and rows can be added to organize the buttons."
msgstr ""
"Nalika CKEditor 5 dipilih saka menu gulung mudhun <em>Text "
"editor</em>, konfigurasi toolbaré bakal ditampilaké. Kowé bisa "
"nambahaké lan mbusak tombol saka <em>Active toolbar</em> kanthi narik "
"lan nyelepaké. Separator lan baris uga bisa ditambahaké kanggo "
"ngatur tombol-tombol kuwi."

msgid "Filtering HTML content"
msgstr "Nyaring isi HTML"

msgid ""
"Unlike other text editors, plugin configuration determines the tags "
"and attributes allowed in text formats using CKEditor 5. If using the "
"<em>Limit allowed HTML tags and correct faulty HTML</em> filter, this "
"filter's values will be automatically set based on enabled plugins and "
"toolbar items."
msgstr ""
"Beda karo editor teks liyane, konfigurasi plugin nemtokake tag lan "
"atribut sing diijini ing format teks nganggo CKEditor 5. Yen "
"nggunakake filter <em>Limit allowed HTML tags and correct faulty "
"HTML</em>, nilai filter iki bakal disetel kanthi otomatis adhedhasar "
"plugin lan item toolbar sing diaktifake."

msgid "Developing CKEditor 5 plugins in Drupal"
msgstr "Ngembangaké plugin CKEditor 5 ing Drupal"

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\":dev_docs_url\">online documentation</a> for "
"detailed information on developing CKEditor 5 plugins for use in "
"Drupal."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <a href=\":dev_docs_url\">dokumentasi online</a> kanggo "
"informasi rinci babagan pangembangan plugin CKEditor 5 sing digunakake "
"ing Drupal."

msgid ""
"The built in WYSIWYG editor (CKEditor 5) comes with a number of "
"accessibility features. CKEditor 5 comes with built in <a "
"href=\":shortcuts\">keyboard shortcuts</a>, which can be beneficial "
"for both power users and keyboard only users."
msgstr ""
"Editor WYSIWYG sing wis ana (CKEditor 5) nduwèni pirang-pirang fitur "
"aksesibilitas. CKEditor 5 wis dilengkapi karo <a "
"href=\":shortcuts\">pintasan keyboard</a>, sing bisa migunani kanggo "
"pangguna sing trampil lan uga pangguna sing mung nggunakake keyboard."

msgid ""
"To support multilingual page content, CKEditor 5 can be configured to "
"include a language button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ndhukung isi kaca multibasa, CKEditor 5 bisa dikonfigurasi "
"kanggo nyakup tombol basa ing toolbar."

msgid ""
"With CKEditor 5 this is a\n"
"          read-only field. The allowed "
"HTML tags and attributes are determined\n"
"          by the CKEditor 5 "
"configuration. Manually removing tags would break\n"
"          enabled "
"functionality, and any manually added tags would be removed by\n"
"      "
"    CKEditor 5 on render."
msgstr ""
"Kanthi CKEditor 5 iki minangka\n"
"          lapangan mung-wacan. Tag "
"HTML lan atribut sing diijini ditemtokake\n"
"          dening "
"konfigurasi CKEditor 5. Nganggo mbusak tag kanthi manual bakal\n"
"      "
"    ngrusak fungsi sing diaktifake, lan tag sing ditambahake sacara "
"manual bakal dicopot dening\n"
"          CKEditor 5 nalika ditampilake."

