msgstr "Tombol @name wis dicopot saka toolbar aktif."

msgid ""
"The <em>Source Editing</em> plugin was enabled to support tags and/or "
"attributes that are not explicitly supported by any available CKEditor "
"5 plugins."
msgstr ""
"Plugin <em>Source Editing</em> diaktifake kanggo ndhukung tag "
"lan/utawa atribut sing ora sacara eksplisit didhukung dening plugin "
"CKEditor 5 sing kasedhiya."

msgid ""
"These are the headings that will appear in the headings dropdown. If a "
"heading is not chosen here, it does not necessarily mean the "
"corresponding tag is disallowed in the text format."
msgstr ""
"Iki minangka judhul-judul sing bakal muncul ing dropdown judhul. Yen "
"judhul ora dipilih ing kene, ora mesthi tegese tag sing cocog ora "
"diijini ing format teks."

msgid "Manually editable HTML tags"
msgstr "Tag HTML sing bisa diedit kanthi manual"

msgid ""
"A list of HTML tags that can be used while editing source. It is only "
"necessary to add tags that are not already supported by other enabled "
"plugins. For example, if \"Bold\" is enabled, it is not necessary to "
"add the <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> tag, but it may be necessary to "
"add <code>&lt;dl&gt;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;dd&gt;</code> in a format that does "
"not have a definition list plugin, but requires definition list "
"markup."
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar tag HTML sing bisa digunakake nalika nyunting sumber. Mung "
"perlu nambah tag sing durung didhukung dening plugin liyane sing wis "
"diaktifake. Contone, yen \"Bold\" wis diaktifake, ora perlu nambah tag "
"<code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, nanging bisa dadi perlu nambah "
"<code>&lt;dl&gt;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;dd&gt;</code> ing format sing ora duwe "
"plugin daftar definisi, nanging mbutuhake markup daftar definisi."

msgid "CKEditor 5 toolbar configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi toolbar CKEditor 5"

msgid "Press the down arrow key to add to the toolbar."
msgstr "Pencet tombol panah mudhun kanggo nambah menyang toolbar."

msgid ""
"Move this button in the toolbar by pressing the left or right arrow "
"keys. Press the up arrow key to remove from the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Pindhahake tombol iki ing toolbar kanthi mencet tombol panah kiwa "
"utawa tengen. Pencet tombol panah munggah kanggo mbusak saka toolbar."

msgid "Invalid toolbar value."
msgstr "Nilai toolbar ora valid."

