"nggunakake PostgreSQL. Delengen <a href=\":requirements\">syarat "
"server database Drupal</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "Drupal could not check for the pg_trgm extension: @error."
msgstr "Drupal ora bisa mriksa ekstensi pg_trgm: @error."

