msgid ""
"Package Manager is a framework for updating Drupal core and installing "
"contributed modules and themes via Composer. It has no user interface, "
"but it provides an API for creating a temporary copy of the current "
"site, making changes to the copy, and then syncing those changes back "
"into the live site."
msgstr ""
"Package Manager iku sawijining kerangka kanggo nganyari inti Drupal "
"lan masang modul lan tema kontribusi liwat Composer. Iki ora nduweni "
"antarmuka panganggo, nanging nyedhiyakake API kanggo nggawe salinan "
"sementara saka situs saiki, nggawe owah-owahan ing salinan kasebut, "
"banjur nyinkronake owah-owahan kasebut bali menyang situs sing aktif."

msgid ""
"Package Manager dispatches events before and after various operations, "
"and external code can integrate with it by subscribing to those "
"events. For more information, see "
"<code>package_manager.api.php</code>."
msgstr ""
"Pengatur Paket ngluncurake acara sadurunge lan sawisé macem-macem "
"operasi, lan kode eksternal bisa nyambung karo iku kanthi nyambut gawe "
"karo acara-acara kasebut. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen "
"<code>package_manager.api.php</code>."

msgid ""
"Modules cannot be uninstalled while Package Manager is applying staged "
"changes to the active code base."
msgstr ""
"Modul ora bisa dicopot nalika Package Manager lagi ngetrapake "
"owah-owahan sing wis ditemtokake ing basis kode aktif."

msgid "Post updating @extension"
msgstr "Nganyari kiriman @extension"

msgid "Press the down arrow key to activate"
msgstr "Pencet tombol panah mudhun kanggo ngaktifake"

msgid "Decorative image"
msgstr "Gambar hiasan"

msgid "Add missing alternative text"
msgstr "Tambahaké teks alternatif sing kurang"

msgid "Change image alternative text"
msgstr "Ganti teks alternatif gambar"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid ""
"Source editing should only use otherwise unavailable tags and "
"attributes"
msgstr ""
"Source editing kudu mung nggunakake tag lan atribut sing ora bisa "
"diakses kanthi cara liya"

msgid ""
"The following @element_type(s) are already supported by enabled "
"plugins and should not be added to the Source Editing \"Manually "
"editable HTML tags\" field: %overlapping_tags."
msgstr ""
"@element_type(s) ing ngisor iki wis didhukung dening plugin sing wis "
"diaktifake lan ora kudu ditambahake menyang lapangan Source Editing "
"\"Tag HTML sing bisa diedit kanthi manual\": %overlapping_tags."

msgid ""
"The following @element_type(s) are already supported by available "
"plugins and should not be added to the Source Editing \"Manually "
"editable HTML tags\" field. Instead, enable the following plugins to "
"support these @element_types: %overlapping_tags."
msgstr ""
"@element_type(s) ing ngisor iki wis didhukung dening plugin sing "
"kasedhiya lan ora kudu ditambahake menyang kolom \"Manually editable "
"HTML tags\" ing Source Editing. Nanging, aktifake plugin-plugin ing "
"ngisor iki kanggo ndhukung @element_types iki: %overlapping_tags."

msgid "There is no staged configuration."
msgstr "Ora ana konfigurasi sing wis dipentasake."

msgid "The staged configuration is identical to the active configuration."
msgstr "Konfigurasi sing disiapake padha karo konfigurasi sing aktif."

msgid ""
"The main way to change the overall appearance of your site is to "
"switch the default theme. The core Layout Builder and Layout Discovery "
"modules allow you to define layouts for your site's content, and the "
"core Breakpoint module helps themes change appearance for "
"different-sized devices. See the related topics listed below for "
"specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Cara utama kanggo ngganti tampilan sakabèhé situs sampeyan yaiku "
"kanthi ngganti tema standar. Modul inti Layout Builder lan Layout "
"Discovery ngidini sampeyan nemtokake tata letak kanggo isi situs "
"sampeyan, lan modul inti Breakpoint mbantu tema ngganti tampilan "
"kanggo piranti kanthi ukuran beda-beda. Delengen topik sing "
"gegandhèngan ing ngisor iki kanggo tugas-tugas tartamtu."

msgid "Using in-line (quick) settings editing"
msgstr "Nggunakake panyuntingan setelan baris (cepet)"

msgid "Edit settings in place."
msgstr "Sunting setelan langsung ing panggonan."

msgid ""
"The core Settings Tray module provides the ability to quickly edit "
"settings inline. It requires the core Contextual Links module in order "
"to expose the links that let you edit in place."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Settings Tray nyedhiyakake kemampuan kanggo nyunting "
"setelan kanthi cepet ing panggonan. Iku mbutuhake modul inti "
"Contextual Links supaya bisa nampilake pranala sing ngidini sampeyan "
"nyunting langsung ing panggonan kasebut."

msgid "Who can edit settings in place?"
msgstr "Sapa sing bisa nyunting setelan langsung ing panggonan?"

msgid ""
"In order to follow these steps to edit settings in place, the core "
"Settings Tray module must be installed. Also, either the core Toolbar "
"module or a contributed replacement must be installed. You will need "
"to have <em>Use contextual links</em> permission, as well as "
"permission to edit the particular content or settings."
msgstr ""
"Supaya bisa ngetutake langkah-langkah iki kanggo nyunting setelan "
"langsung, modul inti Settings Tray kudu dipasang. Uga, kudu dipasang "
"modul inti Toolbar utawa panggantos sing wis digawé komunitas. "
"Sampeyan kudu nduwé ijin <em>Gunakake pranala kontekstual</em>, uga "
"ijin kanggo nyunting konten utawa setelan sing tartamtu."

msgid ""
"Find and visit a page on your site that has the settings that you "
"would like to edit."
msgstr ""
"Golek lan bukak kaca ing situs sampeyan sing nduwèni setelan sing "
"pengin sampeyan sunting."

msgid ""
"Click the link to open the contextual links menu, and click <em>Quick "
"edit</em>. An editing form for the settings should appear on the page."
msgstr ""
"Klik pranala kanggo mbukak menu pranala kontekstual, lan klik "
"<em>Quick edit</em>. Formulir suntingan kanggo setelan bakal katon ing "
"kaca."

msgid ""
"In-place or <em>quick</em> editing. In-place editing of configuration "
"is provided by the core Settings Tray module. See @settings_tray_topic "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ngowahi langsung utawa <em>cepet</em>. Ngowahi konfigurasi langsung "
"diwenehake dening modul inti Settings Tray. Delengen "
"@settings_tray_topic kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"Exposes entities and other resources to other applications using a <a "
"href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Representational_state_transfer\">REST</a> "
"implementation. Data is exchanged using a serialization format such as "
"JSON, and transferred using an authentication method such as HTTP "
"Basic Authentication."
msgstr ""
"Nggawé entitas lan sumber liyane kacekel kanggo aplikasi liyane "
"kanthi nggunakake implementasi <a "
"href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Representational_state_transfer\">REST</a>. "
"Data ditukarke nganggo format serialisasi kaya JSON, lan dipindhah "
"nganggo cara autentikasi kaya HTTP Basic Authentication."

msgid "Image loading settings"
msgstr "Setelan muat gambar"

msgid "Loading attribute"
msgstr "Muat atribut"

msgid "Image loading"
msgstr "Loading gambar"

msgid ""
"Lazy render images with native image loading attribute "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). This improves performance by allowing "
"browsers to lazily load images."
msgstr ""
"Render gambar kanthi alon nganggo atribut muatan gambar asli "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). Iki nambah kinerja kanthi ngidini browser "
"kanggo muat gambar kanthi alon."

msgid "Lazy (<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>)"
msgstr "Malas (<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>)"

msgid "Eager (<em>loading=\"eager\"</em>)"
msgstr "Eager (<em>loading=\"eager\"</em>)"

msgid "Image loading attribute"
msgstr "Atribut muat gambar"

msgid ""
"Select the loading attribute for images. <a href=\":link\">Learn more "
"about the loading attribute for images.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pilih atribut loading kanggo gambar. <a href=\":link\">Sinau luwih "
"lengkap babagan atribut loading kanggo gambar.</a>"

msgid ""
"Delays loading the image until that section of the page is visible in "
"the browser. When in doubt, lazy loading is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Nundha ngundhuh gambar nganti bagean kaca kasebut katon ing "
"panyungging. Yen ragu-ragu, disaranake nggunakake lazy loading."

msgid ""
"Force browsers to download an image as soon as possible. This is the "
"browser default for legacy reasons. Only use this option when the "
"image is always expected to render."
msgstr ""
"Mbayangno browser supaya langsung ndownload gambar saiki uga. Iki "
"minangka standar browser amarga alasan warisan. Gunakake pilihan iki "
"mung yen gambar kasebut mesthi dikarepake kanggo ditampilake."

msgid "Image loading: @attribute"
msgstr "Muat gambar: @attribute"

msgid ""
"Your PHP installation is too old. Drupal requires at least PHP "
"%version. It is recommended to upgrade to PHP version %recommended or "
"higher for the best ongoing support. See <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/supported-versions.php\">PHP's version support "
"documentation</a> and the <a href=\":php_requirements\">Drupal PHP "
"requirements</a> page for more information."
msgstr ""
"Instalasi PHP sampeyan wis kadaluwarsa. Drupal mbutuhake minimal PHP "
"%version. Disaranake kanggo nganyari menyang versi PHP %recommended "
"utawa luwih anyar supaya entuk dukungan paling apik sing "
"terus-terusan. Delengen <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/supported-versions.php\">dokumentasi dukungan "
"versi PHP</a> lan kaca <a href=\":php_requirements\">panyuwunan PHP "
"Drupal</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"It is recommended to upgrade to PHP version %recommended or higher for "
"the best ongoing support.  See <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/supported-versions.php\">PHP's version support "
"documentation</a> and the <a href=\":php_requirements\">Drupal PHP "
"requirements</a> page for more information."
msgstr ""
"Disarankan kanggo nganyari menyang versi PHP %recommended utawa luwih "
"dhuwur kanggo dhukungan sing paling apik lan terusan. Delengen <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/supported-versions.php\">dokumen dhukungan versi "
"PHP</a> lan kaca <a href=\":php_requirements\">syarat PHP Drupal</a> "
"kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "View information on the @lifecycle status of the theme @theme"
msgstr "Delengen informasi babagan status @lifecycle saka tema @theme"

msgid "Drupal multisite is not supported by Package Manager."
msgstr "Drupal multisite ora didhukung déning Package Manager."

msgid ""
"Cannot update because the following project version is not in the list "
"of installable releases."
msgid_plural ""
"Cannot update because the following project versions are not in the "
"list of installable releases."
msgstr[0] ""
"Ora bisa nganyari amarga versi proyek ing ngisor iki ora ana ing "
"dhaptar rilis sing bisa dipasang.  \n"
"Ora bisa nganyari amarga "
"versi-versi proyek ing ngisor iki ora ana ing dhaptar rilis sing bisa "
"dipasang."

msgid ""
"Xdebug is enabled, which may have a negative performance impact on "
"Package Manager and any modules that use it."
msgstr ""
"Xdebug wis diaktifake, sing bisa nduwe pengaruh negatif marang kinerja "
"Package Manager lan modul-modul sing nggunakake."

msgid "Allow reverse list"
msgstr "Wenangake dhaptar mbalikke"

msgid "Allow start index"
msgstr "Ijini indeks wiwitan"

msgid "Allow the user to reverse an ordered list"
msgstr "Ngidini pangguna mbalikke dhaptar sing wis diatur"

msgid "Allow the user to specify the start index of an ordered list"
msgstr "Ngidini pangguna nemtokake indeks wiwitan saka daftar sing diurutake"

msgid ""
"Check <a href=\":handbook\">this handbook page</a> for details about "
"compatibility issues of contrib modules."
msgstr ""
"Priksa <a href=\":handbook\">kaca handbook iki</a> kanggo rincian bab "
"masalah kompatibilitas modul kontrib."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Source Editing should never allow self-XSS."
msgstr "Source Editing ora kena ngidini self-XSS."

msgid ""
"The following tag in the Source Editing \"Manually editable HTML "
"tags\" field is a security risk: %dangerous_tag."
msgstr ""
"Tag ing ngisor iki ing kolom Source Editing \"Manually editable HTML "
"tags\" iku risiko keamanan: %dangerous_tag."

msgid "Enabled Alignments"
msgstr "Alignments sing Diaktifake"

msgid "Alignment type"
msgstr "Jinis penjajaran"

msgid "Allow view mode override"
msgstr "Ijini pangalihan mode tampilan"

msgid ""
"These are the alignment types that will appear in the alignment "
"dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Iki jinis-jinis penyelarasan sing bakal muncul ing menu dropdown "
"penyelarasan."

msgid "Allow the user to override the default view mode"
msgstr "Ngidhentasi pangguna kanggo ngowahi mode tampilan default"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "CKEditor 5 Media plugin in sync with filter settings"
msgstr "Plugin Media CKEditor 5 ing sinkron karo setelan filter"

msgid ""
"You can choose to send email only if a security update is available, "
"or to be notified about all newer versions. If there are updates "
"available of Drupal core or any of your installed modules and themes, "
"your site will always print a message on the <a "
"href=\":status_report\">status report</a> page. If there is a security "
"update, an error message will be printed on administration pages for "
"users with <a href=\":update_permissions\">permission to view update "
"notifications</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa milih mung ngirim email yen ana pembaruan keamanan sing "
"kasedhiya, utawa kanggo kabari babagan kabèh versi luwih anyar. Yen "
"ana pembaruan sing kasedhiya kanggo inti Drupal utawa modul lan tema "
"sing wis dipasang, situs sampeyan bakal tansah nampilake pesen ing "
"kaca <a href=\":status_report\">laporan status</a>. Yen ana pembaruan "
"keamanan, pesen kesalahan bakal ditampilake ing kaca administrasi "
"kanggo pangguna sing duwe <a href=\":update_permissions\">ijin kanggo "
"ndeleng kabar pembaruan</a>."

msgid "Congratulations and welcome to the Drupal community."
msgstr "Sugeng rawuh lan sugeng gabung ing komunitas Drupal."

msgid ""
"The %plugin plugin needs another plugin to create "
"<code>@non_creatable_tag</code>, for it to be able to create the "
"following attributes: <code>@attributes_on_tag</code>. Enable a plugin "
"that supports creating this tag. If none exists, you can configure the "
"Source Editing plugin to support it."
msgstr ""
"Plugin %plugin butuh plugin liyane kanggo nggawe "
"<code>@non_creatable_tag</code>, supaya bisa nggawe atribut-atribut "
"kaya ing ngisor iki: <code>@attributes_on_tag</code>. Aktifake plugin "
"sing ndhukung nggawe tag iki. Yen ora ana, sampeyan bisa nyetel plugin "
"Source Editing supaya ndhukung iki."

msgid "Olivero Color Scheme Settings"
msgstr "Setelan Skema Warna Olivero"

msgid ""
"These settings adjust the look and feel of the Olivero theme. Changing "
"the color below will change the base hue, saturation, and lightness "
"values the Olivero theme uses to determine its internal colors."
msgstr ""
"Setelan iki ngatur tampilan lan raos tema Olivero. Ngganti warna ing "
"ngisor iki bakal ngganti warna dasar, jenuh, lan cahya sing digunakake "
"tema Olivero kanggo nemtokake warna internalé."

msgid "Olivero Color Scheme"
msgstr "Skema Warna Olivero"

msgid "Derivatives will be formed from this color."
msgstr "Turunan bakal digawe saka warna iki."

msgid "Base Primary Color"
msgstr "Werna Primer Dhasar"

msgid "@fieldName has changed to @fieldValue"
msgstr "@fieldName wis diganti dadi @fieldValue"

msgid "Unable to uninstall the %module module because: @reason."
msgstr "Ora bisa mbusak modul %module amarga: @reason."

msgid ""
"Unable to install the %theme theme since it requires the "
"%required_module module."
msgstr "Ora bisa masang tema %theme amarga butuh modul %required_module."

msgid ""
"If the <em>Source</em> button is available in the toolbar, users can "
"click this button to disable the visual editor and edit the HTML "
"source directly. After toggling back, the visual editor uses the HTML "
"tags allowed via plugin configuration (and not explicity disallowed by "
"filters) to format the text. Tags not enabled via plugin configuration "
"will be stripped out of the HTML source when the user toggles back to "
"the text editor."
msgstr ""
"Yen tombol <em>Source</em> ana ing toolbar, pangguna bisa ngeklik "
"tombol iki kanggo mateni editor visual lan langsung ngedit sumber "
"HTML. Sawise mbalikke maneh, editor visual nggunakake tag HTML sing "
"diijini liwat konfigurasi plugin (lan ora secara eksplisit dilarang "
"dening filter) kanggo format teks. Tag sing ora diaktifake liwat "
"konfigurasi plugin bakal dibusak saka sumber HTML nalika pangguna "
"mbalikke maneh menyang editor teks."

msgid "@theme theme"
msgstr "@theme tema"

msgid ""
"The <code>update_fetch_with_http_fallback</code> setting must be "
"disabled."
msgstr "Setelan <code>update_fetch_with_http_fallback</code> kudu dipatèni."

msgid ""
"Resolve all issues below to continue the installation. For help "
"configuring your database server, see the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/installing-drupal\">installation "
"handbook</a>, or contact your hosting provider."
msgstr ""
"Rampungna kabèh masalah ing ngisor iki kanggo nerusaké instalasi. "
"Kanggo pitulungan konfigurasi server basis data, delengen <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/installing-drupal\">pandhuan "
"instalasi</a>, utawa hubungi panyedhiya hosting panjenengan."

msgid ""
"Updating to Drupal @current_major is only supported from Drupal "
"version @required_min_version or higher. If you are trying to update "
"from an older version, first update to the latest version of Drupal "
"@previous_major. (<a href=\":url\">Drupal upgrade guide</a>)"
msgstr ""
"Nganyari menyang Drupal @current_major mung didhukung saka versi "
"Drupal @required_min_version utawa luwih anyar. Yen sampeyan nyoba "
"nganyari saka versi lawas, sepisan nganyari dhisik menyang versi "
"paling anyar saka Drupal @previous_major. (<a href=\":url\">Pandhuan "
"nganyari Drupal</a>)"

msgid "Migrating an Existing Text Format to CKEditor 5"
msgstr "Migrasi Format Teks Sing Wis Ana menyang CKEditor 5"

msgid ""
"When switching an existing text format to use CKEditor 5, an automatic "
"process is initiated that helps text formats switching to CKEditor 5 "
"from CKEditor 4 (or no text editor) to do so with minimal effort and "
"zero data loss."
msgstr ""
"Nalika ngalih format teks sing wis ana kanggo nggunakake CKEditor 5, "
"proses otomatis diwiwiti sing mbantu pangalihan format teks saka "
"CKEditor 4 (utawa tanpa editor teks) menyang CKEditor 5 kanthi usaha "
"sing minimal lan tanpa ana kehilangan data."

msgid ""
"This process is designed for there to be no data loss risk in "
"switching to CKEditor 5. However some of your editor's functionality "
"may not be 100% equivalent to what was available previously. In most "
"cases, these changes are minimal. After the process completes, status "
"and/or warning messages will summarize any changes that occurred, and "
"more detailed information will be available in the site's logs."
msgstr ""
"Proses iki dirancang supaya ora ana risiko ilang data nalika ngalih "
"menyang CKEditor 5. Nanging, sawetara fungsi editor sampeyan bisa uga "
"ora 100% padha karo sing sadurunge ana. Ing umume kasus, owah-owahan "
"iki minimal. Sawise proses rampung, status lan/utawa pesen peringatan "
"bakal nyimpulake owah-owahan sing kedadeyan, lan informasi luwih rinci "
"bakal kasedhiya ing log situs."

msgid ""
"CKEditor 5 will attempt to enable plugins that provide equivalent "
"toolbar items to those used prior to switching to CKEditor 5. All core "
"CKEditor 4 plugins and many popular contrib plugins already have "
"CKEditor 5 equivalents. In some cases, functionality that required "
"contrib modules is now built into CKEditor 5. In instances where a "
"plugin does not have an equivalent, no data loss will occur but "
"elements previously provided via the plugin may need to be added "
"manually as HTML via source editing."
msgstr ""
"CKEditor 5 bakal nyoba ngaktifake plugin sing nyedhiyakake item "
"toolbar sing padha karo sing digunakake sadurunge ngalih menyang "
"CKEditor 5. Kabeh plugin inti CKEditor 4 lan akeh plugin kontribusi "
"populer wis duwe padanan ing CKEditor 5. Ing sawetara kasus, fungsi "
"sing biyen mbutuhake modul kontribusi saiki wis kalebu ing CKEditor 5. "
"Ing kahanan yen plugin ora duwe padanan, ora bakal ana data sing ilang "
"nanging unsur sing biyen disedhiyakake liwat plugin mungkin kudu "
"ditambahake kanthi manual minangka HTML liwat suntingan sumber."

msgid ""
"Additional migration considerations for text formats with restricted "
"HTML"
msgstr ""
"Pertimbangan migrasi tambahan kanggo format teks kanthi HTML sing "
"diwatesi"

msgid ""
"The “Allowed HTML tags\" field in the “Limit allowed HTML tags and "
"correct Faulty HTML\" filter is now read-only"
msgstr ""
"Lapangan \"Allowed HTML tags\" ing filter \"Limit allowed HTML tags "
"and correct Faulty HTML\" saiki mung bisa diwaca wae."

msgid ""
"This field accurately represents the tags/attributes allowed by a text "
"format, but the allowed tags are based on which plugins are enabled "
"and how they are configured. For example, enabling the Underline "
"plugin adds the &lt;u&gt; tag to “Allowed HTML tags\"."
msgstr ""
"Lapangan iki kanthi tepat nggambarake tag/atribut sing diidini dening "
"format teks, nanging tag sing diidini adhedhasar plugin sing "
"diaktifake lan cara konfigurasine. Contone, ngaktifake plugin "
"Underline nambah tag &lt;u&gt; menyang \"Allowed HTML tags\"."

msgid ""
"The &lt;p&gt; and &lt;br &gt; tags will be automatically added to your "
"text format."
msgstr ""
"Tag &lt;p&gt; lan &lt;br &gt; bakal otomatis ditambahake menyang "
"format teks sampeyan."

msgid ""
"CKEditor 5 requires the &lt;p&gt; and &lt;br &gt; tags to achieve "
"basic functionality. They will be automatically added to “Allowed "
"HTML tags\" on formats that previously did not allow them."
msgstr ""
"CKEditor 5 mbutuhake tag &lt;p&gt; lan &lt;br&gt; supaya bisa "
"nindakake fungsi dasar. Tag-tag kasebut bakal otomatis ditambahake "
"menyang “Allowed HTML tags” ing format-format sing sadurunge ora "
"ngidini tag-tag iki."

msgid ""
"Tags/attributes that are not explicitly supported by any plugin are "
"supported by Source Editing"
msgstr ""
"Tags/atribut sing ora sacara cetha didhukung dening plugin apa wae "
"didhukung dening Source Editing"

msgid ""
"When a necessary tag/attribute is not directly supported by an "
"available plugin, the \"Source Editing\" plugin is enabled. This "
"plugin is typically used for by passing the CKEditor 5 UI and editing "
"contents as HTML source. In the settings for Source Editing, "
"tags/attributes that aren't available via other plugins are added to "
"Source Editing's \"Manually editable HTML tags\" setting so they are "
"supported by the text format."
msgstr ""
"Nalika tag/atribut sing dibutuhake ora didhukung langsung dening "
"plugin sing kasedhiya, plugin \"Source Editing\" diaktifake. Plugin "
"iki biasane digunakake kanthi ngliwati antarmuka CKEditor 5 lan "
"ngowahi isi minangka sumber HTML. Ing setelan Source Editing, "
"tag/atribut sing ora kasedhiya liwat plugin liyane ditambahake menyang "
"setelan \"Manually editable HTML tags\" ing Source Editing supaya "
"didhukung dening format teks."

msgid ""
"To maintain the capabilities of this text format, <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":ck_migration_url\">the CKEditor 5 migration</a> did the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"Kanggo njaga kemampuan format teks iki, <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":ck_migration_url\">migrasi CKEditor 5</a> nindakaké "
"perkara-perkara ing ngisor iki:"

msgid ""
"To maintain the capabilities of this text format, the CKEditor 5 "
"migration did the following:"
msgstr ""
"Kanggo njaga kemampuan format teks iki, migrasi CKEditor 5 nindakake "
"perkara-perkara ing ngisor iki:"

msgid "Enabled these plugins: (%plugins)."
msgstr "Ngaktifake plugin iki: (%plugins)."

msgid ""
"Added these tags/attributes to the Source Editing Plugin's <a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\":source_edit_url\">Manually editable HTML "
"tags</a> setting: @tag_list"
msgstr ""
"Nambahaké tag/atribut iki menyang setelan <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":source_edit_url\">Tag HTML sing Bisa Diedit Manual</a> saka "
"Plugin Pangowahan Sumber: @tag_list"

msgid ""
"Added these tags/attributes to the Source Editing Plugin's Manually "
"editable HTML tags setting: @tag_list"
msgstr ""
"Nambahaké tag/atribut iki menyang setelan Tags HTML sing Bisa Diedit "
"Manual ing Plugin Suntingan Sumber: @tag_list"

msgid ""
"Additional details are available <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":dblog_url\">in your logs</a>."
msgstr ""
"Rincian tambahan kasedhiya <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":dblog_url\">ing log sampeyan</a>."

msgid "Additional details are available in your logs."
msgstr "Rincian tambahan kasedhiya ing log sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Updating to CKEditor 5 added support for some previously unsupported "
"tags/attributes."
msgstr ""
"Nganyari menyang CKEditor 5 nambah dhukungan kanggo sawetara "
"tag/atribut sing sadurunge ora didhukung."

msgid "A plugin introduced support for the following:"
msgstr "Siji plugin ngenalake dukungan kanggo perkara ing ngisor iki:"

msgctxt "Ckeditor 5 tag list"
msgid "for"
msgstr "kanggo"

msgid ""
"The @tag tag was added because it is <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":fundamental_tag_link\">required by CKEditor 5</a>."
msgid_plural ""
"The @tag tags were added because they are <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":fundamental_tag_link\">required by CKEditor 5</a>."
msgstr[0] ""
"Tag @tag ditambahake amarga iku <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":fundamental_tag_link\">dibutuhake déning CKEditor 5</a>.  "
"\n"
"Tag @tag ditambahake amarga iku <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":fundamental_tag_link\">dibutuhake déning CKEditor 5</a>."

msgid "The @tag tag was added because it is required by CKEditor 5."
msgid_plural "The @tag tags were added because they are required by CKEditor 5."
msgstr[0] ""
"Tag @tag ditambahake amarga dibutuhake dening CKEditor 5.  \n"
"Tag @tag "
"ditambahake amarga dibutuhake dening CKEditor 5."

msgid "The tag %tags;"
msgid_plural "The tags %tags;"
msgstr[0] ""
"Tag %tags;  \n"
"Tag-tag %tags;"

msgid "This attribute: %attributes;"
msgid_plural "These attributes: %attributes;"
msgstr[0] ""
"Atribut iki: %attributes;  \n"
"Atribut-atribut iki: %attributes;"

msgid "The migration of %text_format to CKEditor 5 has been saved."
msgstr "Migrasi %text_format menyang CKEditor 5 wis kasimpen."

msgid ""
"Date range (Datetime range module): Stores time/date periods with a "
"start and an end"
msgstr ""
"Jangka wektu (modul Jangka Wektu Dhèréngan): Nyimpen wektu/tanggal "
"kanthi wiwitan lan pungkasan"

msgid ""
"Find the view that you would like to edit, and click <em>Edit</em> "
"from the dropdown button. Note that bulk operations work best in a "
"view with a Page display, and a Table format."
msgstr ""
"Goleki tampilan sing pengin sampeyan sunting, banjur klik "
"<em>Edit</em> saka tombol dropdown. Elinga yen operasi massal paling "
"apik digunakake ing tampilan sing nganggo tampilan Kaca, lan format "
"Tabel."

msgid ""
"Note that anonymous users with this permission are able to edit any "
"content created by any anonymous user."
msgstr ""
"Elinga yen panganggo anonim sing duwe idin iki bisa nyunting isi apa "
"wae sing digawe dening panganggo anonim liyane."

msgid ""
"Note that anonymous users with this permission are able to delete any "
"content created by any anonymous user."
msgstr ""
"Elinga manawa panganggo anonim sing nduweni ijin iki bisa mbusak isi "
"apa wae sing digawe dening panganggo anonim liyane."

msgid ""
"The fallback image style is typically the smallest size image you "
"expect to appear in this space. The fallback image should only appear "
"on a site if an error occurs."
msgstr ""
"Gaya gambar fallback biasane ukuran gambar sing paling cilik sing "
"sampeyan antisipasi bakal muncul ing papan iki. Gambar fallback mung "
"kudu muncul ing situs yen ana kesalahan."

msgid ""
"The %relationship_name relationship used in %handler_type %handler is "
"not present in the %display_name display."
msgstr ""
"Hubungan %relationship_name sing digunakake ing %handler_type %handler "
"ora ana ing tampilan %display_name."

msgid "Configure @type @current of @total: @item"
msgstr "Atur @type @current saka @total: @item"

msgid "Heading Level"
msgstr "Tingkatan Heading"

msgid ""
"Updates failed for the entity type %entity_type, for %entity_ids. "
"Check the logs."
msgstr ""
"Anyar ora kasil kanggo jinis entitas %entity_type, kanggo %entity_ids. "
"Priksa log."

msgid ""
"Unable to update %entity_type %view due to error @message %function "
"(line %line of %file). <pre>@backtrace_string</pre>"
msgstr ""
"Ora bisa nganyari %entity_type %view amarga kesalahan @message "
"%function (baris %line saka %file). <pre>@backtrace_string</pre>"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Block content entity changed"
msgstr "Entitas isi blok wis diganti"

msgid "Style label"
msgstr "Label gaya"

msgid "Style tag + classes"
msgstr "Tag gaya + kelas-kelas"

msgid ""
"A list of classes that will be provided in the \"Style\" dropdown. "
"Enter one or more classes on each line in the format: "
"element.classA.classB|Label. Example: h1.title|Title. Advanced "
"example: h1.fancy.title|Fancy title.<br />These styles should be "
"available in your theme's CSS file."
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar kelas sing bakal disedhiyakake ing dropdown \"Style\". "
"Lebokake siji utawa luwih kelas ing saben baris nganggo format: "
"element.classA.classB|Label. Conto: h1.title|Title. Conto lanjut: "
"h1.fancy.title|Fancy title.<br />Gaya-gaya iki kudu kasedhiya ing file "
"CSS tema sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Line @line-number does not contain a valid value. Enter a valid CSS "
"selector containing one or more classes, followed by a pipe symbol and "
"a label."
msgid_plural ""
"Lines @line-numbers do not contain a valid value. Enter a valid CSS "
"selector containing one or more classes, followed by a pipe symbol and "
"a label."
msgstr[0] ""
"Baris @line-number ora ngemot nilai sing valid. Lebokake selector CSS "
"sing valid sing ngemot siji utawa luwih kelas, diikuti dening simbol "
"pipa lan label.  \n"
"Baris @line-numbers ora ngemot nilai sing valid. "
"Lebokake selector CSS sing valid sing ngemot siji utawa luwih kelas, "
"diikuti dening simbol pipa lan label."

msgid ""
"The following tag is missing the required attribute "
"<code>@required_attribute_name</code>: <code>@provided_element</code>."
msgstr ""
"Tag ing ngisor iki ora nduwèni atribut wajib "
"<code>@required_attribute_name</code>: <code>@provided_element</code>."

msgid ""
"The following tag does not have the minimum of "
"@min_attribute_value_count allowed values for the required attribute "
"<code>@required_attribute_name</code>: <code>@provided_element</code>."
msgstr ""
"Tag ing ngisor iki ora duwe nilai minimal saka "
"@min_attribute_value_count sing diijini kanggo atribut wajib "
"<code>@required_attribute_name</code>: <code>@provided_element</code>."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Styles can only be specified for already supported tags."
msgstr "Gaya mung bisa ditemtokake kanggo tag sing wis didhukung."

msgid ""
"A style can only be specified for an HTML 5 tag. <code>@tag</code> is "
"not an HTML5 tag."
msgstr ""
"Sajeroning gaya mung bisa ditetepake kanggo tag HTML 5. "
"<code>@tag</code> dudu tag HTML5."

msgid ""
"A style must only specify classes not supported by other plugins. The "
"<code>@classes</code> classes on <code>@tag</code> are already "
"supported by the enabled %plugin plugin."
msgstr ""
"Saben gaya mung kudu nemtokake kelas sing ora didhukung dening plugin "
"liyane. Kelas <code>@classes</code> ing <code>@tag</code> wis "
"didhukung dening plugin %plugin sing aktif."

msgid ""
"A style must only specify classes not supported by other plugins. The "
"<code>@classes</code> classes on <code>@tag</code> are supported by "
"the %plugin plugin. Remove this style and enable that plugin instead."
msgstr ""
"Salah siji gaya kudu mung nemtokake kelas sing ora didhukung dening "
"plugin liyane. Kelas <code>@classes</code> ing <code>@tag</code> "
"didhukung dening plugin %plugin. Copot gaya iki lan aktifake plugin "
"kuwi tinimbang."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Unique label in list"
msgstr "Label unik ing dhaptar"

msgid "The label %label is not unique."
msgstr "Label %label ora unik."

msgid ""
"The Text Editor module provides a framework that other modules (such "
"as <a href=\":ckeditor5\">CKEditor5 module</a>) can use to provide "
"toolbars and other functionality that allow users to format text more "
"easily than typing HTML tags directly. For more information, see the "
"<a href=\":documentation\">online documentation for the Text Editor "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Text Editor nyedhiyakake kerangka kerja sing bisa digunakake "
"modul liyane (kaya <a href=\":ckeditor5\">modul CKEditor5</a>) kanggo "
"nyedhiyakake toolbar lan fungsi liya sing ngidini pangguna supaya "
"luwih gampang nformat teks tinimbang ngetik tag HTML langsung. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":documentation\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Text "
"Editor</a>."

msgid ""
"To search help, you will need to install the core Search module, "
"configure a search page, and add a search block to the Help page or "
"another administrative page. (A search page is provided automatically, "
"and if you use the core Claro administrative theme, a help search "
"block is shown on the main Help page.) Then users with search "
"permissions, and permission to view help, will be able to search help. "
"See the <a href=\":search_help\">Search module help page</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nggoleki pitulungan, kowe kudu nginstal modul core Search, "
"ngonfigurasi kaca telusuran, lan nambah blok telusuran ing kaca "
"Pitulungan utawa kaca administrasi liyane. (Kaca telusuran wis "
"disedhiyakake kanthi otomatis, lan yen kowe nggunakake tema "
"administrasi core Claro, blok telusuran pitulungan bakal ditampilake "
"ing kaca Pitulungan utama.) Banjur pangguna sing duwe ijin telusuran "
"lan ijin kanggo ndeleng pitulungan bakal bisa nggoleki pitulungan. "
"Delengen <a href=\":search_help\">kaca pitulungan modul Search</a> "
"kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"A base theme is a theme that is not meant to be used directly on a "
"site, but instead acts as a scaffolding for building other themes. The "
"core Stable 9 theme is one example; other base themes can be "
"downloaded from the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_theme\">Download &amp; "
"Extend page on drupal.org</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tema dhasar yaiku tema sing ora diwenehi panggunaan langsung ing "
"situs, nanging luwih dadi rangka kanggo nggawe tema liyane. Tema "
"Stable 9 inti iku siji conto; tema dhasar liyane bisa didownload saka "
"<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_theme\">Download "
"&amp; Extend page on drupal.org</a>."

msgid ""
"The core Filter, Responsive Image, and Path modules provide settings "
"and display options for entities and fields."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Filter, Responsive Image, lan Path nyedhiyakake setelan lan "
"pilihan tampilan kanggo entitas lan lapangan."

msgid ""
"A text editor is software (typically, a JavaScript library) that "
"provides buttons and other command mechanisms to make editing HTML "
"text easier. Some editors are called <em>visual</em> or <em>WYSIWYG "
"(What You See Is What You Get)</em> editors; these editors hide the "
"details of HTML from the user, and instead show formatted output on "
"the screen. The core Text Editor module provides a framework for "
"deploying text editors on your site. The core CKEditor 5 module "
"provides CKEditor 5, which is a widely-used JavaScript text editor "
"that creates clean and valid HTML; the module also enforces the HTML "
"tag restrictions in the associated text format. Various contributed "
"modules provide other editors; to install a new editor, besides "
"installing the module, you may need to download the editor library "
"from a third-party site."
msgstr ""
"Editor teks iku piranti lunak (biasane, sawijining perpustakaan "
"JavaScript) sing nyedhiyakake tombol lan mekanisme perintah liyane "
"supaya ngowahi teks HTML dadi luwih gampang. Sawetara editor dijenengi "
"<em>visual</em> utawa <em>WYSIWYG (What You See Is What You Get)</em>; "
"editor-editor iki nyumputake rincian HTML saka pangguna, lan luwih "
"nuduhake output sing wis diformat ing layar. Modul Inti Text Editor "
"nyedhiyakake kerangka kerja kanggo masang editor teks ing situs "
"sampeyan. Modul inti CKEditor 5 nyedhiyakake CKEditor 5, sing dadi "
"editor teks JavaScript sing akeh digunakake lan nggawe HTML sing resik "
"lan valid; modul iki uga ngetrapake watesan tag HTML sing ana ing "
"format teks sing gegandhengan. Sawetara modul kontribusi nyedhiyakake "
"editor liyane; kanggo masang editor anyar, saliyane masang modulé, "
"sampeyan bisa uga kudu ngundhuh perpustakaan editor saka situs pihak "
"katelu."

msgid ""
"Select <em>CKEditor 5</em> as the <em>Text editor</em>, or another "
"text editor that you have installed. The rest of these steps assume "
"you selected <em>CKEditor 5</em>."
msgstr ""
"Pilih <em>CKEditor 5</em> minangka <em>Text editor</em>, utawa editor "
"teks liyane sing wis sampeyan instal. Langkah-langkah liyane iki "
"nganggep sampeyan milih <em>CKEditor 5</em>."

msgid ""
"Under <em>Toolbar configuration</em>, drag buttons between "
"<em>Available buttons</em> and <em>Active toolbar</em>; only buttons "
"in <em>Active toolbar</em> will be shown to the user. Focusing or "
"hovering over a button will display a tooltip explaining what the "
"button does."
msgstr ""
"Ing <em>Konfigurasi Toolbar</em>, seret tombol antara <em>Tombol sing "
"Kasedhiya</em> lan <em>Toolbar Aktif</em>; mung tombol sing ana ing "
"<em>Toolbar Aktif</em> sing bakal ditampilake marang pangguna. Yen "
"tombol dipilih utawa dilewati cursor, bakal ditampilake tooltip sing "
"nerangake fungsi tombol kasebut."

msgid ""
"Drag buttons within <em>Active toolbar</em> to the desired order, and "
"group buttons by dragging them between group identifiers; drag <em>a "
"new group identifier</em> to the toolbar to add additional groups."
msgstr ""
"Seret tombol ing <em>Active toolbar</em> menyang urutan sing "
"dikarepake, lan kelompokake tombol kanthi nyeret ing antarane "
"pangidentifikasi kelompok; seret <em>a new group identifier</em> "
"menyang toolbar kanggo nambah kelompok tambahan."

msgid ""
"If you add buttons that require configuration, the <em>CKEditor 5 "
"plugin settings</em> section will be visible, and provide their "
"respective configuration forms."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan nambah tombol sing mbutuhake konfigurasi, bagean "
"<em>setelan plugin CKEditor 5</em> bakal katon, lan nyedhiyakake "
"formulir konfigurasi sing cocog."

msgid ""
"Click the link for your administrative theme (such as the core Claro "
"theme), near the top of the page, and verify that there is already a "
"search block for help located in the Help region. If not, follow the "
"steps in the related topic to place the <em>Search form</em> block in "
"the Help region. When configuring the block, choose <em>Help</em> as "
"the search page, and in the <em>Pages</em> tab under "
"<em>Visibility</em>, enter <em>/admin/help</em> to make the search "
"form only visible on the main <em>Help</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Klik pranala kanggo tema administratif sampeyan (kaya tema Claro "
"inti), cedhak sisih ndhuwur kaca, lan priksa manawa wis ana blok "
"panelusuran kanggo bantuan sing ditemtokake ing wilayah Bantuan. Yen "
"durung, tindakake langkah-langkah ing topik sing gegandhengan kanggo "
"nyelehake blok <em>Search form</em> ing wilayah Bantuan. Nalika ngatur "
"blok, pilih <em>Help</em> minangka kaca panelusuran, lan ing tab "
"<em>Pages</em> ing ngisor <em>Visibility</em>, ketik "
"<em>/admin/help</em> supaya formulir panelusuran mung katon ing kaca "
"utama <em>Help</em>."

msgid ""
"Click the shortcut link to add the page to your shortcut list -- in "
"the core Claro administrative theme, the link looks like a star, and "
"is displayed next to the page title. However, if the page is already "
"in your shortcut set, clicking the shortcut link will remove it from "
"your shortcut set."
msgstr ""
"Klik pranala pintasan kanggo nambah kaca menyang dhaptar pintasanmu -- "
"ing tema administratif Claro sing dadi inti, pranala kasebut kaya "
"lintang, lan ditampilake ing sacedhake judhul kaca. Nanging, yen kaca "
"wis ana ing set pintasanmu, ngeklik pranala pintasan bakal mbusak saka "
"set pintasanmu."

msgid ""
"The Shortcut module creates an add/remove link for each page on your "
"site; the link lets you add or remove the current page from the "
"currently-enabled set of shortcuts (if your theme displays it and you "
"have permission to edit your shortcut set). The core Claro "
"administration theme displays this link next to the page title, as a "
"gray or yellow star. If you click on the gray star, you will add that "
"page to your preferred set of shortcuts. If the page is already part "
"of your shortcut set, the link will be a yellow star, and will allow "
"you to remove the current page from your shortcut set."
msgstr ""
"Modul Shortcut nggawe pranala tambah/ilang kanggo saben kaca ing situs "
"sampeyan; pranala iki ngidini sampeyan nambah utawa ngilangi kaca "
"saiki saka set shortcut sing saiki wis diaktifake (yen tema sampeyan "
"nampilake lan sampeyan duwe ijin kanggo ngowahi set shortcut "
"sampeyan). Tema administrasi inti Claro nampilake pranala iki ing "
"jejere judhul kaca, minangka lintang warna abu-abu utawa kuning. Yen "
"sampeyan ngeklik lintang abu-abu, sampeyan bakal nambah kaca kasebut "
"menyang set shortcut pilihan sampeyan. Yen kaca kasebut wis dadi "
"bagean saka set shortcut sampeyan, pranala bakal dadi lintang kuning, "
"lan bakal ngidini sampeyan mbusak kaca saiki saka set shortcut "
"sampeyan."

msgid "Grid - Responsive"
msgstr "Grid - Responsif"

msgid "Maximum number of columns"
msgstr "Jumlah kolom paling akeh"

msgid "Minimum cell width"
msgstr "Ambané sel minimal"

msgid "The maximum number of columns that will be displayed within the grid."
msgstr "Jumlah kolom maksimal sing bakal ditampilake ing jero grid."

msgid "Minimum grid cell width"
msgstr "Ambané minimal sel grid"

msgid ""
"The minimum width of the grid cells. If the grid container becomes "
"narrow, the grid cells will reflow onto the next row as needed."
msgstr ""
"Jembar minimal saka sel grid. Yen wadah grid dadi sempit, sel grid "
"bakal ngalir maneh menyang baris sabanjure miturut kabutuhan."

msgid "Grid gutter spacing"
msgstr "Spasi selokan grid"

msgid "The spacing between the grid cells."
msgstr "Jarak antarane cell grid."

msgid ""
"Because Package Manager modifies the current site's code base, it is "
"intentionally limited in certain ways to prevent unexpected changes to "
"the live site:"
msgstr ""
"Amarga Package Manager ngganti basis kode situs saiki, iku diwatesi "
"kanthi tujuan ing sawetara cara supaya ora ana owah-owahan sing ora "
"dikarepake ing situs sing urip:"

msgid "It does not support Drupal multi-site installations."
msgstr "Iki ora ndhukung instalasi multi-site Drupal."

msgid ""
"It does not automatically perform version control operations, e.g., "
"with Git. Site administrators are responsible for committing updates."
msgstr ""
"Iki ora nindakake operasi kontrol versi kanthi otomatis, contone, "
"nganggo Git. Administrator situs tanggung jawab kanggo nggawe komitmen "
"panganyaran."

msgid ""
"It can only maintain one copy of the site at any given time. If a copy "
"of the site already exists, another one cannot be created until the "
"existing copy is destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Iku mung bisa njaga siji salinan situs ing wektu tartamtu. Yen salinan "
"situs wis ana, salinan liyane ora bisa digawe nganti salinan sing ana "
"kasebut dibusak."

msgid ""
"It associates the temporary copy of the site with the user or session "
"that originally created it, and only that user or session can make "
"changes to it."
msgstr ""
"Iki ngubungake salinan sementara saka situs karo pangguna utawa sesi "
"sing nggawe asline, lan mung pangguna utawa sesi kuwi sing bisa nggawe "
"owah-owahan marang kasebut."

msgid ""
"It does not allow modules to be uninstalled while syncing changes into "
"live site."
msgstr ""
"Iku ora ngidini modul kanggo dicopot nalika nyelarasake owah-owahan "
"menyang situs live."

msgid ""
"The new package @package will be installed in the directory @path, "
"which already exists but is not managed by Composer."
msgstr ""
"Paket anyar @package bakal dipasang ing direktori @path, sing wis ana "
"nanging ora dikelola déning Composer."

msgid ""
"@message See <a href=\":package-manager-help\">the help page</a> for "
"information on how to resolve the problem."
msgstr ""
"@message Waca <a href=\":package-manager-help\"> kaca pitulung</a> "
"kanggo informasi babagan carane ngrampungake masalah iki."

msgid "Failed to download remote thumbnail file due to \"%error\"."
msgstr "Gagal ngundhuh file thumbnail adoh amarga \"%error\"."

msgid "Package Manager is not supported by your environment."
msgstr "Package Manager ora didhukung dening lingkungan sampeyan."

msgid "CKEditor 5 plugin settings"
msgstr "Setelan plugin CKEditor 5"

msgid ""
"Enter a value like \"512\" (bytes), \"80 KB\" (kilobytes) or \"50 MB\" "
"(megabytes) in order to restrict the allowed file size. If left empty "
"the file sizes could be limited only by PHP's maximum post and file "
"upload sizes (current limit <strong>%limit</strong>)."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna nilai kaya \"512\" (bytes), \"80 KB\" (kilobytes) utawa \"50 "
"MB\" (megabytes) kanggo mbatesi ukuran file sing diijini. Yen "
"dikosongake, ukuran file mung bakal diwatesi dening wates maksimal "
"unggahan post lan file PHP (wates saiki <strong>%limit</strong>)."

