msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, navigate menyang "
"<em>People</em> &gt; <em>@permission_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administration menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>System</em> &gt; <em>@cron_link</em>. "
"Note the <em>Last run</em> time on the page."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>System</em> &gt; <em>@cron_link</em>. "
"Cathet wektu <em>Last run</em> ing kaca kasebut."

msgid "What are security advisories?"
msgstr "Apa kuwi saran keamanan?"

msgid ""
"A security advisory is a public announcement about a reported security "
"problem in the core software. Contributed projects with a shield icon "
"and \"Stable releases for this project are covered by the security "
"advisory policy\" on their project page are also covered by Drupal's "
"security advisory policy. Security advisories are managed by the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/drupal-security-team\">Drupal Security "
"Team</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pangandikan keamanan yaiku pangumuman umum babagan masalah keamanan "
"sing dilaporake ing piranti lunak inti. Proyek kontribusi kanthi ikon "
"tameng lan \"Rilis stabil kanggo proyek iki dilindhungi dening "
"kabijakan pangandikan keamanan\" ing kaca proyek kasebut uga kalebu "
"ing kabijakan pangandikan keamanan Drupal. Pangandikan keamanan diatur "
"dening <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/drupal-security-team\">Tim "
"Keamanan Drupal</a>."

msgid ""
"<a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/drupal-security-team/security-advisory-process-and-permissions-policy\">Security "
"advisory process and permissions policy</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/drupal-security-team/security-advisory-process-and-permissions-policy\">Proses "
"nasihat keamanan lan kabijakan hak akses</a>"

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Content Authoring</em> &gt; "
"<em>@overview_link</em>. The <em>Text editor</em> column in the table "
"shows the text editor that is currently connected to each text format, "
"if any."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Content Authoring</em> &gt; "
"<em>@overview_link</em>. Kolom <em>Text editor</em> ing tabel nuduhake "
"editor teks sing saiki nyambung karo saben format teks, yen ana."

msgid ""
"Navigate to the page for managing the entity sub-type you want to add "
"the field to. For example, to add a field to a content type, in the "
"<em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> "
"&gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Navigasi menyang kaca kanggo ngatur sub-tipe entitas sing pengin "
"sampeyan tambahake kolom. Contone, kanggo nambahake kolom menyang "
"jinis isi, ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."

msgid ""
"Navigate to the page for managing the entity type you want to add the "
"field to. For example, to add a field to a content type, in the "
"<em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> "
"&gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Pindhah menyang kaca kanggo ngatur jinis entitas sing pengin sampeyan "
"tambahake kolom. Contone, kanggo nambah kolom ing jinis konten, ing "
"menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang <em>Structure</em> "
"&gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Content Authoring</em> &gt; "
"<em>@overview_link</em>. If you do not have the core Text Editor "
"module installed, the menu link and page title will instead be "
"<em>Text formats</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Content Authoring</em> &gt; "
"<em>@overview_link</em>. Yen sampeyan durung nginstal modul Text "
"Editor inti, pranala menu lan judhul kaca bakal diganti dadi <em>Text "
"formats</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@help_link</em>. Verify that the search block is visible, and try "
"a search."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, bukak menyang "
"<em>@help_link</em>. Priksa manawa blok panelusuran katon, lan cobanen "
"nggoleki."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Media</em> &gt; @styles_link."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Media</em> &gt; @styles_link."

msgid ""
