msgstr ""
"Navigasi menyang kaca kanggo ngatur jinis entitas sing arep sampeyan "
"tambahake kolom. Contone, kanggo nambah kolom menyang jinis isi, ing "
"menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; @content_types_link."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>@translation_updates_link</em>. This report "
