msgid "Edit %label block type"
msgstr "Sunting jinis blok %label"

msgid "Block type %label has been updated."
msgstr "Jinis blok %label wis dianyari."

msgid "Block type %label has been added."
msgstr "Tipe blok %label wis ditambahake."

msgid "Add %type content block"
msgstr "Tambah blok isi %type"

msgid "Content block ID"
msgstr "ID blok isi"

msgid "The content block ID."
msgstr "ID blok isi."

msgid "The content block UUID."
msgstr "UUID blok isi."

msgid "The content block language code."
msgstr "Kode basa blok isi."

msgid "The time that the content block was last edited."
msgstr "Wektu nalika blok konten pungkasan diedit."

msgid "content block"
msgstr "blok isi"

msgid "content blocks"
msgstr "blok isi"

msgid "block type"
msgstr "jinis blok"

msgid "block types"
msgstr "jinis blok"

msgid ""
"%label is used by 1 content block on your site. You can not remove "
"this block type until you have removed all of the %label blocks."
msgid_plural ""
"%label is used by @count content blocks on your site. You may not "
"remove %label until you have removed all of the %label content blocks."
msgstr[0] ""
"%label digunakake dening 1 blok isi ing situs sampeyan. Sampeyan ora "
"bisa mbusak jinis blok iki nganti sampeyan wis mbusak kabeh blok "
"%label.  \n"
"%label digunakake dening @count blok isi ing situs "
"sampeyan. Sampeyan ora bisa mbusak %label nganti sampeyan wis mbusak "
"kabeh blok isi %label."

msgid ""
"Block with uuid %uuid does not exist. <a href=\":url\">Add content "
"block</a>."
msgstr "Blok karo uuid %uuid ora ana. <a href=\":url\">Tambah blok isi</a>."

msgid "Input format of the content block/box content."
msgstr "Format input saka isi blok/kothak isi."

msgid "Add a <a href=\":url\">content block</a>."
msgstr "Tambah <a href=\":url\">blok isi</a>."

msgid "Provides the CKEditor 5 rich text editor."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake editor teks sugih CKEditor 5."

msgid "Language label"
msgstr "Label basa"

msgid "Images can only be uploaded."
msgstr "Gambar mung bisa diunggah."

msgid "Images can only be added by URL."
msgstr "Gambar mung bisa ditambahake liwat URL."

msgid ""
"A list of programming languages that will be provided in the \"Code "
"Block\" dropdown. Enter one value per line, in the format key|label. "
"Example: php|PHP."
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar basa pemrograman sing bakal disedhiyakake ing dropdown \"Code "
"Block\". Lebokake siji nilai saben baris, kanthi format key|label. "
"Conto: php|PHP."

msgid ""
"Line @line-number does not contain a valid value. Enter a valid "
"language key followed by a pipe symbol and a label."
msgid_plural ""
"Lines @line-numbers do not contain a valid value. Enter a valid "
"language key followed by a pipe symbol and a label."
msgstr[0] ""
"Baris @line-number ora ngemot nilai sing sah. Lebokake kunci basa sing "
"sah dilanjutake kanthi simbol pipa lan label.  \n"
"Baris @line-numbers "
"ora ngemot nilai sing sah. Lebokake kunci basa sing sah dilanjutake "
"kanthi simbol pipa lan label."

msgid "Allows importing and exporting configuration changes."
msgstr "Ngidini ngimpor lan ngekspor owah-owahan konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"Content Moderation allows you to apply <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> to content, content blocks, and "
"other <a href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with "
"background on content entities\">content entities</a>, to provide more "
"fine-grained publishing options. For example, a Basic page might have "
"states such as Draft and Published, with allowed transitions such as "
"Draft to Published (making the current revision \"live\"), and "
"Published to Draft (making a new draft revision of published content)."
msgstr ""
"Content Moderation ngidini sampeyan kanggo nerapake <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> marang isi, blok isi, lan <a "
"href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with background on "
"content entities\">entitas isi</a> liyane, kanggo nyedhiyakake opsi "
"penerbitan sing luwih rinci. Contone, kaca Basic bisa nduweni status "
"kayata Draft lan Published, kanthi transisi sing diidini kayata saka "
"Draft menyang Published (nggawe revisi saiki \"urip\"), lan saka "
"Published menyang Draft (nggawe revisi draft anyar saka isi sing wis "
"diterbitake)."

msgid ""
"Provides additional publication states that can be used by other "
"modules to moderate content."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake status publikasi tambahan sing bisa digunakake dening "
"modul liyane kanggo moderasi konten."

msgid ""
"The Content Translation module allows you to translate content, "
"comments, content blocks, taxonomy terms, users and other <a "
"href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with background on "
"content entities\">content entities</a>. Together with the modules <a "
"href=\":language\">Language</a>, <a "
"href=\":config-trans\">Configuration Translation</a>, and <a "
"href=\":locale\">Interface Translation</a>, it allows you to build "
"multilingual websites. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":translation-entity\">online documentation for the Content "
"Translation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Content Translation ngidini sampeyan nerjemahake isi, komentar, "
"blok isi, istilah taksonomi, pangguna lan <a href=\":field_help\" "
"title=\"Field module help, with background on content "
"entities\">entitas isi</a> liyane. Bareng karo modul <a "
"href=\":language\">Language</a>, <a "
"href=\":config-trans\">Configuration Translation</a>, lan <a "
"href=\":locale\">Interface Translation</a>, modul iki ngidini sampeyan "
"mbangun situs web multibasa. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, waca <a "
"href=\":translation-entity\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Content "
"Translation</a>."

msgid "Defines field types for storing dates and times."
msgstr "Nemtokake jinis lapangan kanggo nyimpen tanggal lan wektu."

msgid ""
"When enabled, images can only be uploaded. When disabled, images can "
"only be added by URL."
msgstr ""
"Nalika diaktifake, gambar mung bisa diunggah. Nalika dipatèni, gambar "
"mung bisa ditambahaké nganggo URL."

msgid ""
"The Text Editor module provides a framework for managing editors. To "
"use it, you also need to install a text editor. This can either be the "
"core <a href=\":ckeditor5\">CKEditor5 module</a>, which can be "
"installed on the <a href=\":extend\">Extend page</a>, or a contributed "
"module for any other text editor. When installing a contributed text "
"editor module, be sure to check the installation instructions, because "
"you will most likely need to download an external library as well as "
"the Drupal module."
msgstr ""
"Modul Text Editor nyedhiyakake kerangka kerja kanggo ngatur editor. "
"Kanggo nggunakake, sampeyan uga kudu nginstal editor teks. Iki bisa "
"dadi modul inti <a href=\":ckeditor5\">CKEditor5</a>, sing bisa "
"diinstal ing <a href=\":extend\">Kaca Extend</a>, utawa modul "
"kontribusi kanggo editor teks liyane. Nalika nginstal modul editor "
"teks kontribusi, priksa priksa pandhuan instalasi, amarga sampeyan "
"kemungkinan kudu ngundhuh perpustakaan eksternal saliyane modul "
"Drupal."

msgid ""
"Provides a framework to associate text editors (like WYSIWYGs) and "
"toolbars with text formats."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake kerangka kanggo nyambungake editor teks (kaya WYSIWYG) "
"lan toolbar karo format teks."

msgid "Text editors"
msgstr "Panyunting teks"

msgid ""
"Ensures that the latest versions of images uploaded via a Text Editor "
"are displayed, along with their dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Njamin manawa versi paling anyar saka gambar sing diunggah liwat "
"Editor Teks ditampilake, bebarengan karo dimensine."

msgid ""
"The website's content and configuration is managed using "
"<em>entities</em>, which are grouped into <em>entity types</em>. "
"<em>Content entity types</em> are the entity types for site content "
"(such as the main site content, comments, content blocks, taxonomy "
"terms, and user accounts). <em>Configuration entity types</em> are "
"used to store configuration information for your site, such as "
"individual views in the Views module, and settings for your main site "
"content types."
msgstr ""
"Isi lan konfigurasi situs web dikelola nganggo <em>entities</em>, sing "
"digolongake dadi <em>entity types</em>. <em>Content entity types</em> "
"yaiku jinis entitas kanggo isi situs (kaya isi situs utama, komentar, "
"blok isi, istilah taksonomi, lan akun pangguna). <em>Configuration "
"entity types</em> digunakake kanggo nyimpen informasi konfigurasi "
"kanggo situs sampeyan, kaya tampilan individu ing modul Views, lan "
"setelan kanggo jinis isi situs utama sampeyan."

msgid "Provides the capabilities to add fields to entities."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake kemampuan kanggo nambah lapangan menyang entitas."

msgid ""
"Once you have created a field, you can use it again in other sub-types "
"of the same entity type. For instance, if you create a field for the "
"article content type, you can also use it for the page content type, "
"but you cannot use it for content blocks or taxonomy terms. If there "
"are fields available for re-use, after clicking <em>Add field</em> "
"from the <em>Manage fields</em> page, you will see a list of available "
"fields for re-use. After selecting a field for re-use, you can "
"configure the sub-type-level settings."
msgstr ""
"Sakwise sampeyan nggawe sawijining kolom, sampeyan bisa nggunakake "
"maneh ing jinis sub-tipe liyane saka jinis entitas sing padha. "
"Contone, yen sampeyan nggawe kolom kanggo jinis isi artikel, sampeyan "
"uga bisa nggunakake kanggo jinis isi kaca, nanging sampeyan ora bisa "
"nggunakake kanggo blok isi utawa istilah taksonomi. Yen ana kolom sing "
"kasedhiya kanggo digunakake maneh, sawise ngeklik <em>Add field</em> "
"saka kaca <em>Manage fields</em>, sampeyan bakal weruh dhaptar kolom "
"sing kasedhiya kanggo digunakake maneh. Sawise milih kolom kanggo "
"digunakake maneh, sampeyan bisa nyetel konfigurasi tingkat sub-tipe."

msgid "Provide a pre-filled value for the editing form."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake nilai sing wis diisi awal kanggo formulir suntingan."

msgid "You need to select a field type."
msgstr "Sampeyan kudu milih jinis lapangan."

msgid ""
"You can re-use a field from other sub-types of the same entity type. "
"Re-using a field creates another usage of the same field storage."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nggunakake maneh lapangan saka sub-tipe liya sing padha "
"jinis entitasé. Nganggo maneh lapangan nggawe panggunaan liyane saka "
"panyimpenan lapangan sing padha."

msgid "Filter by field or field type"
msgstr "Saring miturut lapangan utawa jinis lapangan"

msgid "Used in: @list"
msgstr "Digunakake ing: @list"

msgid "Re-use"
msgstr "Gunakake maneh"

msgid "Reuse @field_name"
msgstr "Gunakake maneh @field_name"

msgid "There was a problem reusing field %label: @message"
msgstr "Ana masalah nalika nggunakake maneh kolom %label: @message"

msgid "Single value"
msgid_plural "Multiple values: @cardinality"
msgstr[0] "Nilai siji"
msgstr[1] "Nilai akeh: @cardinality"

msgid "Create a new field"
msgstr "Gawé lapangan anyar"

msgid ""
"Provides a field type for files and defines a \"managed_file\" Form "
"API element."
msgstr ""
"Menyedhiyakake jinis kolom kanggo file lan nemtokake elemen Form API "
"\"managed_file\"."

msgid "Filters text content in preparation for display."
msgstr "Nyaring isi teks minangka persiapan kanggo ditampilake."

msgid "Lazy load images"
msgstr "Muat gambar kanthi alon-alon"

msgid ""
"Instruct browsers to lazy load images if dimensions are specified. Use "
"in conjunction with and place after the 'Track images uploaded via a "
"Text Editor' filter that adds image dimensions required for lazy "
"loading. Results can be overridden by <code>&lt;img "
"loading=&quot;eager&quot;&gt;</code>."
msgstr ""
"Parintahkan panyungging supaya muat gambar kanthi santai yen ukuran "
"wis ditemtokake. Gunakake bebarengan lan pasang sawise filter 'Track "
"images uploaded via a Text Editor' sing nambahake ukuran gambar sing "
"dibutuhake kanggo muat gambar kanthi santai. Hasil bisa diowahi "
"nganggo <code>&lt;img loading=&quot;eager&quot;&gt;</code>."

msgid "Generates help pages and provides a Help block with page-level help."
msgstr ""
"Ngasilake kaca pitulung lan nyedhiyakake blok Pitulung kanthi pitulung "
"tingkat kaca."

msgid "What are content blocks?"
msgstr "Apa iku blok isi?"

msgid ""
"Content blocks are blocks whose content you can edit. You can define "
"one or more <em>block types</em>, and attach fields to each block "
"type. Content blocks can be placed just like blocks provided by other "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"Blok isi iku blok sing isi-e bisa kowe sunting. Kowe bisa nemtokake "
"siji utawa luwih <em>jinis blok</em>, lan nempelaké kolom-kolom "
"marang saben jinis blok. Blok isi bisa dipasang kaya blok sing "
"disediakake déning modul-modul liyane."

msgid "Overview for managing blocks"
msgstr "Ringkesan kanggo ngatur blok"

msgid ""
"The <em>Block</em> module allows you to place blocks in regions of "
"your installed themes, and configure block settings. The <em>Block "
"Content</em> module allows you to manage block types and content "
"blocks. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Modul <em>Block</em> ngidini sampeyan nempatake blok ing wilayah tema "
"sing wis dipasang, lan nyetel setelan blok. Modul <em>Block "
"Content</em> ngidini sampeyan ngatur jinis blok lan isi blok. Delengen "
"topik sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki kanggo tugas-tugas tartamtu."

msgid "Creating a content block"
msgstr "Nggawe blok isi"

msgid "Create a content block, which can later be placed on the site."
msgstr "Gawé blok konten, sing bisa dipasang mengko ing situs."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Content</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Content</em>."

msgid "Open the @library_link tab."
msgstr "Bukak tab @library_link."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Add content block</em>. If you have more than one block type "
"defined on your site, click the name of the type you want to create."
msgstr ""
"Klik <em>Add content block</em>. Yen sampeyan duwe luwih saka siji "
"jinis blok sing wis ditemtokake ing situs sampeyan, klik jeneng jinis "
"sing pengin digawe."

msgid "Defining a block type"
msgstr "Nemtokake jinis blok"

msgid "Define a block type and its fields."
msgstr "Nemtokake jinis blok lan kolom-kolomé."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@types_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@types_link</em>."

msgid "Click  <em>Add block type</em>."
msgstr "Klik <em>Tambah jinis blok</em>."

msgid ""
"A comment is a piece of content, typically posted by a website "
"visitor, which provides discussion or commentary on other content like "
"blog posts and news articles. Comments are a type of content entity, "
"and can have fields that store text, HTML markup, and other data. "
"Comments are attached to other content entities via Comment fields. "
"See @content_structure_topic for more about content entities and "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Komentar iku sawijining bagean isi, biasane diposting déning "
"pengunjung situs web, sing nyedhiyakake diskusi utawa komentar babagan "
"isi liyane kaya kiriman blog lan artikel berita. Komentar iku jinis "
"entitas isi, lan bisa nduwèni kolom-kolom sing nyimpen teks, markup "
"HTML, lan data liyane. Komentar ditempelake marang entitas isi liyane "
"liwat kolom Komentar. Delengen @content_structure_topic kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan entitas isi lan kolom."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@config_translation_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@config_translation_link</em>."

msgid ""
"Both personal and site-wide contact forms will always have "
"<em>Subject</em> and <em>Message</em> fields. You can add additional "
"fields for users to fill out if desired. Note that if you want to "
"display other content on a form page, such as text or images, you can "
"use a content block."
msgstr ""
"Bojone formulir kontak pribadi lan situs bakal tansah duwe kolom "
"<em>Subject</em> lan <em>Message</em>. Sampeyan bisa nambah kolom "
"tambahan kanggo diisi pangguna yen dikarepake. Elinga yen sampeyan "
"pengin nampilake isi liyane ing kaca formulir, kaya teks utawa gambar, "
"sampeyan bisa nggunakake blok isi."

msgid ""
"Users with <em>content moderation permissions</em> can change workflow "
"states. There are separate permissions for each transition. See "
"Permissions &gt; <em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> to "
"configure content moderation permissions."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé <em>ijin moderasi konten</em> bisa ngowahi status "
"alur kerja. Ana ijin sing kapisah kanggo saben transisi. Delengen Ijin "
"&gt; <em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> kanggo nyetel ijin "
"moderasi konten."

msgid ""
"Find the entity that you want to moderate in either the content "
"moderation view page, if you created one, or the appropriate "
"administrative page for managing that type of entity (such as the "
"administration page for content items; see @content_link)."
msgstr ""
"Golek entitas sing arep sampeyan moderasi ing kaca tampilan moderasi "
"isi, yen sampeyan nggawe siji, utawa kaca administratif sing cocog "
"kanggo ngatur jinis entitas kasebut (kayata kaca administrasi kanggo "
"item isi; delengen @content_link)."

msgid ""
"Users with <em>workflows permissions</em> (typically administrators) "
"can configure workflows. See Permissions &gt; "
"<em>@workflows_permissions_link</em> to configure workflows "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna kanthi <em>izin workflows</em> (biasane administrator) bisa "
"ngatur workflows. Delengen Izin &gt; "
"<em>@workflows_permissions_link</em> kanggo ngatur izin workflows."

msgid ""
"To implement your plan, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, "
"navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Workflow</em> &gt; "
"<em>@workflows_link</em>. A list of workflows is shown, including the "
"default workflow <em>Editorial</em> that you can adapt."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngetrapake rencanamu, ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, "
"pindhah menyang <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Workflow</em> &gt; "
"<em>@workflows_link</em>. Dhaptar workflow bakal ditampilake, kalebu "
"workflow standar <em>Editorial</em> sing bisa kok adaptasi."

msgid ""
"Under <em>This workflow applies to:</em>, find the entity type that "
"you want this workflow to apply to, such as Content revisions, Content "
"block revisions, or Taxonomy term revisions. Click <em>Select</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor <em>This workflow applies to:</em>, goleki jinis entitas "
"sing arep sampeyan terapake workflow iki, kaya Data isi revisi, Blok "
"isi revisi, utawa Revisi istilah taksonomi. Klik <em>Select</em>."

msgid ""
"Follow the steps in @user_permissions_topic to assign permissions for "
"each transition to roles. The permissions are listed under the "
"<em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> section; there is one "
"permission for each transition in each workflow."
msgstr ""
"Tindakna langkah-langkah ing @user_permissions_topic kanggo nemtokake "
"ijin saben transisi marang peran. Ijin-ijin kasebut kapacak ing bagean "
"<em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em>; ana siji ijin kanggo "
"saben transisi ing saben workflow."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@translation_settings_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@translation_settings_link</em>."

msgid ""
"A <em>content entity</em> (or more commonly, <em>entity</em>) is an "
"item of content data, which can consist of text, HTML markup, images, "
"attached files, and other data. Content entities are grouped into "
"<em>entity types</em>, which have different purposes and are displayed "
"in very different ways on the site. Most entity types are also divided "
"into <em>entity sub-types</em>, which are divisions within an entity "
"type to allow for smaller variations in how the entities are used and "
"displayed. For example, the <em>Content item</em> entity type that "
"stores page-level content is divided into <em>content type</em> "
"sub-types; the <em>Content block</em> entity type has <em>block "
"types</em>; but the <em>User</em> entity type (for user profile "
"information) does not have sub-types."
msgstr ""
"<em>Entitas isi</em> (utawa luwih asring disebut <em>entitas</em>) iku "
"sawijining barang data isi, sing bisa nyakup teks, markup HTML, "
"gambar, file sing dipasang, lan data liyane. Entitas isi diklompokaké "
"dadi <em>jinis entitas</em>, sing nduwé tujuan beda-beda lan "
"ditampilaké kanthi cara sing béda banget ing situs kasebut. Kakehan "
"jinis entitas uga dibagi dadi <em>sub-jinis entitas</em>, sing dadi "
"divisi ing njero jinis entitas kanggo ngijini variasi sing luwih cilik "
"babagan cara entitas iku digunakaké lan ditampilaké. Contoné, jinis "
"entitas <em>Barang isi</em> sing nyimpen isi tingkat kaca dipérang "
"dadi sub-jinis <em>jinis isi</em>; jinis entitas <em>Blok isi</em> "
"nduwé <em>jinis blok</em>; nanging jinis entitas <em>Pangguna</em> "
"(kanggo informasi profil pangguna) ora nduwé sub-jinis."

msgid ""
"Depending on the core and contributed modules that you currently have "
"installed on your site, the related topics below and other topics "
"listed on the main help page (see @help_link) will help you with tasks "
"related to content structure."
msgstr ""
"Miturut modul inti lan modul kontribusi sing saiki wis dipasang ing "
"situs sampeyan, topik-topik sing gegandhengan ing ngisor iki lan "
"topik-topik liyane sing kadhaptar ing kaca bantuan utama (delengen "
"@help_link) bakal mbantu sampeyan karo tugas-tugas sing gegandhengan "
"karo struktur konten."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"@languages_link."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"@languages_link."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>Languages</em> &gt; @detection_link."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>Languages</em> &gt; @detection_link."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>User "
"interface translation</em> &gt; @import_link."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>User "
"interface translation</em> &gt; @import_link."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"@translate_link."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, buka <em>Configuration</em> "
"&gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; @translate_link."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"@language_link."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"@language_link."

msgid ""
"When users visit the main search page (see @search_link), they will "
"see the configured search pages that they have access to. Each search "
"page has a search form on it, and the page will display search results "
"after the user enters keywords into the form and clicks the search "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Nalika pangguna ngunjungi kaca panelusuran utama (delengen "
"@search_link), padha bakal weruh kaca panelusuran sing wis "
"dikonfigurasi lan bisa diakses. Saben kaca panelusuran nduwèni "
"formulir panelusuran ing njero, lan kaca bakal nampilake asil "
"panelusuran sawise pangguna ngetik tembung kunci ing formulir lan "
"ngeklik tombol panelusuran."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@performance_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@performance_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>System</em> &gt; "
"<em>@information_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>System</em> &gt; "
"<em>@information_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@regional_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@regional_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@datetime_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@datetime_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Error pages</em> section, enter the URL for your 403/404 "
"pages, starting after the site home page URL. For example, if your "
"site URL is <em>https://example.com</em> and your 404 page is "
"<em>https://example.com/not-found</em>, you would enter "
"<em>/not-found</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing bagean <em>Error pages</em>, ketik URL kanggo kaca 403/404 "
"panjenengan, diwiwiti sawise URL kaca ngarep situs. Contone, yen URL "
"situs panjenengan <em>https://example.com</em> lan kaca 404 "
"panjenengan <em>https://example.com/not-found</em>, sampeyan kudu "
"ngetik <em>/not-found</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@log_settings_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@log_settings_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@maintenance_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@maintenance_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@extend_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>@extend_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Extend</em> &gt; <em>@uninstall_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Extend</em> &gt; <em>@uninstall_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>@status_link</em> to see a report that "
"summarizes the health and status of your site. If there are any "
"warnings or errors, you will need to fix them. Take note of any "
"upcoming highly critical security releases that may impact your site."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>@status_link</em> kanggo ndeleng laporan "
"sing ngringkes kesehatan lan status situs sampeyan. Yen ana peringatan "
"utawa kesalahan, sampeyan kudu ndandani. Cathet uga rilis keamanan "
"kritis sing bakal teka sing bisa mengaruhi situs sampeyan."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@themes_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administratif <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang "
"<em>@themes_link</em>."

msgid ""
"Click the <em>Uninstall</em> link to uninstall the theme. If there is "
"not an <em>Uninstall</em> link, the theme cannot be uninstalled "
"because it is either being used as the site default theme, being used "
"as the <em>Administration theme</em>, or is the base theme for another "
"installed theme."
msgstr ""
"Klik pranala <em>Uninstall</em> kanggo mbusak tema. Yen ora ana "
"pranala <em>Uninstall</em>, tema ora bisa dibusak amarga tema kasebut "
"lagi digunakake minangka tema bawaan situs, digunakake minangka "
"<em>Administration theme</em>, utawa dadi tema dasar kanggo tema "
"liyane sing wis diinstal."

msgid ""
"Taxonomy reference fields can be added to any entity, such as user "
"accounts, content blocks, or regular content items. If you use them to "
"classify regular content items, your site will automatically be set up "
"with taxonomy listing pages for each term; each of these pages lists "
"all of the content items that are classified with that term."
msgstr ""
"Field referensi taksonomi bisa ditambahake menyang entitas apa wae, "
"kayata akun panganggo, blok konten, utawa item konten biasa. Yen "
"sampeyan nggunakake kanggo nglompokake item konten biasa, situs "
"sampeyan bakal otomatis disetel karo kaca dhaptar taksonomi kanggo "
"saben istilah; saben kaca kasebut ngemot dhaptar kabeh item konten "
"sing diklasifikasikake kanthi istilah kasebut."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@people_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>@people_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>People</em> &gt; <em>@roles_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang <em>People</em> "
"&gt; <em>@roles_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>People</em> &gt; <em>@permissions_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang <em>People</em> "
"&gt; <em>@permissions_link</em>."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>People</em> &gt; "
"<em>@account_settings_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>People</em> &gt; "
"<em>@account_settings_link</em>."

msgid ""
"Views using a table display format can include a bulk operations form, "
"which allows users with sufficient permission to select one or more "
"items from the view and apply an administrative action to them. The "
"bulk actions available are specific to the base data type of the view; "
"for example, a view of content items could support bulk publishing and "
"unpublishing actions. If you have the core Actions UI module "
"installed, see the related topic \"Configuring actions\" for more "
"about actions."
msgstr ""
"Views sing nggunakake format tampilan tabel bisa nyakup formulir "
"operasi massal, sing ngidini pangguna kanthi ijin sing cukup kanggo "
"milih siji utawa luwih item saka tampilan lan ngetrapake tindakan "
"administratif marang item-item kasebut. Tindakan massal sing kasedhiya "
"khusus kanggo jinis data dhasar saka tampilan kasebut; contone, "
"tampilan isi konten bisa ndhukung tindakan massal kanggo nerbitake lan "
"mbatalake terbit. Yen sampeyan wis masang modul Actions UI inti, "
"delengen topik sing gegandhengan \"Ngonfigurasi tindakan\" kanggo info "
"luwih lengkap babagan tindakan."

msgid ""
"If you are not already editing your view, in the <em>Manage</em> "
"administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; "
"<em>@views_link</em>. Find the view you want to edit, and click its "
"<em>Edit</em> link."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan durung ngowahi tampilan (view) panjenengan, ing menu "
"administrasi <em>Manage</em>, pindhah menyang <em>Structure</em> &gt; "
"<em>@views_link</em>. Goleki tampilan sing arep diowahi, banjur klik "
"pranala <em>Edit</em> sing ana."

msgid ""
"Add one or more existing actions as bulk operations to an existing "
"table-style view. If you have the core Actions UI module installed, "
"see the related topic \"Configuring actions\" for more information "
"about actions."
msgstr ""
"Tambah siji utawa luwih aksi sing wis ana minangka operasi massal ing "
"tampilan gaya tabel sing wis ana. Yen sampeyan wis nginstal modul core "
"Actions UI, delengen topik sing gegandhengan \"Ngonfigurasi aksi\" "
"kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan aksi."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@views_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ing menu administrasi <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@views_link</em>."

msgid ""
"Records which content users have viewed and marks it as new or "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"Ngetrek rekaman isi sing wis dideleng pangguna lan menehi tandha "
"minangka anyar utawa wis diupdate."

msgid ""
"Layout Builder allows you to use layouts to customize how content, "
"content blocks, and other <a href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module "
"help, with background on content entities\">content entities</a> are "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"Layout Builder ngidini sampeyan nggunakake layout kanggo ngatur cara "
"tampilan konten, blok konten, lan <a href=\":field_help\" "
"title=\"Field module help, with background on content "
"entities\">entitas konten</a> liyane."

msgid "Create and edit content blocks"
msgstr "Gawé lan ngowahi blok isi"

msgid "Add a new content block"
msgstr "Tambah blok isi anyar"

msgid "Provides a field type for internal and external URLs."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake jinis kolom kanggo URL internal lan eksternal."

msgid "Updated default configuration to %langcode"
msgstr "Konfigurasi standar sing wis diupdate dadi %langcode"

msgid ""
"Allows users to translate interface text and to switch between "
"interface languages."
msgstr ""
"Mallows pangguna kanggo nerjemahake teks antarmuka lan kanggo ngalih "
"antarane basa antarmuka."

msgid "oEmbed loading settings"
msgstr "Setelan muat oEmbed"

msgid "oEmbed loading"
msgstr "ngundhuh oEmbed"

msgid ""
"Lazy render oEmbed with native loading attribute "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). This improves performance by allowing "
"browsers to lazily load assets."
msgstr ""
"Lazy render oEmbed nganggo atribut loading asli "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). Iki ningkatake performa kanthi ngidini "
"browser kanggo mbukak aset kanthi cara lazy."

msgid "oEmbed loading attribute"
msgstr "atribut loading oEmbed"

msgid ""
"Select the loading attribute for oEmbed. <a href=\":link\">Learn more "
"about the loading attribute for oEmbed.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pilih atribut loading kanggo oEmbed. <a href=\":link\">Sinau luwih "
"lengkap babagan atribut loading kanggo oEmbed.</a>"

msgid ""
"Delays loading the resource until that section of the page is visible "
"in the browser. When in doubt, lazy loading is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Nundha muat sumber daya nganti bagean kaca kasebut katon ing "
"panyungging. Yen ragu-ragu, disaranake nggunakake lazy loading."

msgid ""
"Force browsers to download a resource as soon as possible. This is the "
"browser default for legacy reasons. Only use this option when the "
"resource is always expected to render."
msgstr ""
"Mboten dipunwantos browser ngundhuh sumber daya kanthi cepet. Iki "
"minangka setelan standar browser kanggo alesan lawas. Gunakake pilihan "
"iki mung yen sumber daya kasebut mesthi diarepake kanggo ditampilake."

msgid "Loading attribute: @attribute"
msgstr "Muat atribut: @attribute"

msgid "Content of this type can be placed in the selected menus."
msgstr "Isi jinis iki bisa dilebokake ing menu sing wis dipilih."

msgid "Provides a user interface for managing menus."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake antarmuka panganggo kanggo ngatur menu."

msgid "Provides a framework for migrating data to Drupal."
msgstr "Nawakake kerangka kerja kanggo migrasi data menyang Drupal."

msgid ""
"Provides a framework to migrate data from previous versions of Drupal "
"into the site."
msgstr ""
"Nyediakake kerangka kerja kanggo nransfer data saka versi Drupal "
"sadurunge menyang situs."

msgid "This is not supported by Drupal."
msgstr "Iki ora didhukung déning Drupal."

msgid "The recommended level for Drupal is \"READ COMMITTED\"."
msgstr "Tingkat sing disaranake kanggo Drupal yaiku \"READ COMMITTED\"."

msgid ""
"For this to work correctly, all tables must have a primary key. The "
"following table(s) do not have a primary key: @tables."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo iki bisa mlaku kanthi bener, kabeh tabel kudu nduwèni tombol "
"utama. Tabel ing ngisor iki ora nduwèni tombol utama: @tables."

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\":performance_doc\">setting MySQL transaction "
"isolation level</a> page for more information."
msgstr ""
"Delengen kaca <a href=\":performance_doc\">nyetel tingkat isolasi "
"transaksi MySQL</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "Transaction isolation level"
msgstr "Tingkat isolasi transaksi"

msgid "Provides the MySQL database driver."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake driver basis data MySQL."

msgid "READ COMMITTED"
msgstr "WACANA DIPALAKI"

msgid "REPEATABLE READ"
msgstr "Wacan Balenan"

msgid "Use database default"
msgstr "Gunakake database standar"

msgid ""
"The recommended database transaction level for Drupal is \"READ "
"COMMITTED\". For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":performance_doc\">setting MySQL transaction isolation "
"level</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Tingkat transaksi basis data sing disaranake kanggo Drupal yaiku "
"\"READ COMMITTED\". Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":performance_doc\">nyetel tingkat isolasi transaksi MySQL</a>."

msgid ""
"Manages the creation, configuration, and display of the main site "
"content."
msgstr "Ngatur panyiptaan, konfigurasi, lan tampilan isi utama situs."

msgid ""
"Defines field types with select lists, checkboxes, and radio buttons "
"to select values from fixed lists of options."
msgstr ""
"Nemtokake jinis lapangan kanthi dhaptar pilihan, kothak centhang, lan "
"tombol radio kanggo milih nilai saka dhaptar opsi sing wis "
"ditemtokake."

msgid "Allows users to create custom URLs for existing paths on the site."
msgstr "Ngidini pangguna nggawe URL khusus kanggo path sing wis ana ing situs."

msgid "Provides the PostgreSQL database driver."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake driver database PostgreSQL."

msgid "Password Compatibility"
msgstr "Kecocokan Sandi"

msgid ""
"While you have the option to provide only one image style per "
"breakpoint, the sizes attribute allows you to provide more options to "
"browsers as to which image file it can display. If using sizes field "
"and art direction, all selected image styles should use the same "
"aspect ratio to avoid content shifting. Breakpoints are defined in the "
"configuration files of the theme."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan duwe pilihan kanggo menehi mung siji gaya gambar saben "
"breakpoint, atribut sizes ngidini sampeyan menehi luwih akeh pilihan "
"marang browser babagan file gambar sing bisa ditampilake. Yen "
"nggunakake kolom sizes lan arahan seni, kabeh gaya gambar sing dipilih "
"kudu nggunakake rasio aspek sing padha supaya konten ora obah-ubah. "
"Breakpoint ditemtokake ing file konfigurasi tema."

msgid ""
"The sizes attribute paired with the srcset attribute provides "
"information on how much space these images take up within the viewport "
"at different browser breakpoints, but the aspect ratios should remain "
"the same across those breakpoints. Once the sizes option is selected, "
"you can let the browser know the size of this image in relation to the "
"site layout, using the <em>Sizes</em> field. For a hero image that "
"always fills the entire screen, you could simply enter 100vw, which "
"means 100% of the viewport width. For an image that fills 90% of the "
"screen for small viewports, but only fills 40% of the screen when the "
"viewport is larger than 40em (typically 640px), you could enter "
"\"(min-width: 40em) 40vw, 90vw\" in the Sizes field. The last item in "
"the comma-separated list is the smallest viewport size: other items in "
"the comma-separated list should have a media condition paired with an "
"image width. <em>Media conditions</em> are similar to a media query, "
"often a min-width paired with a viewport width using em or px units: "
"e.g. (min-width: 640px) or (min-width: 40em). This is paired with the "
"<em>image width</em> at that viewport size using px, em or vw units. "
"The vw unit is viewport width and is used instead of a percentage "
"because the percentage always refers to the width of the entire "
"viewport."
msgstr ""
"Atribut sizes sing dikombinasikake karo atribut srcset maringi "
"informasi babagan sepira ruang sing dipangan gambar-gambar iki ing "
"jero viewport ing pirang-pirang breakpoint browser, nanging rasio "
"aspek kudu tetep padha ing kabeh breakpoint kasebut. Sawise pilihan "
"sizes dipilih, sampeyan bisa ngandhani browser ukuran gambar iki ing "
"hubungan karo tata letak situs, nggunakake kolom <em>Sizes</em>. "
"Kanggo gambar hero sing tansah ngisi kabeh layare layar, sampeyan bisa "
"mung ngetik 100vw, sing tegesé 100% saka ambané viewport. Kanggo "
"gambar sing ngisi 90% saka layar kanggo viewport cilik, nanging mung "
"ngisi 40% saka layar nalika viewport luwih gedhe saka 40em (biasane "
"640px), sampeyan bisa ngetik \"(min-width: 40em) 40vw, 90vw\" ing "
"kolom Sizes. Item pungkasan ing daftar sing dipisah nganggo koma yaiku "
"ukuran viewport sing paling cilik: item-item liyane ing daftar koma "
"kudu duwe syarat media sing digandhengake karo ambané gambar. "
"<em>Syarat media</em> padha kaya media query, asring min-width "
"digandhengake karo ambané viewport nggunakake unit em utawa px: "
"contoné (min-width: 640px) utawa (min-width: 40em). Iki digandhengake "
"karo <em>ambané gambar</em> ing ukuran viewport kasebut nggunakake "
"unit px, em utawa vw. Unit vw yaiku ambané viewport lan digunakake "
"gantiné persentase amarga persentase mesthi nuduhaké ambané kabeh "
"viewport."

msgid ""
"Provides functionality to output responsive images using the HTML5 "
"picture tag."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake fungsi kanggo ngasilake gambar responsif nggunakake tag "
"HTML5 picture."

msgid ""
"Select the image style you wish to use as the style when a browser "
"does not support responsive images."
msgstr ""
"Pilih gaya gambar sing pengin sampeyan gunakake minangka gaya nalika "
"browser ora ndhukung gambar responsif."

msgid ""
"Lazy render images with native image loading attribute "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). This improves performance by allowing "
"browsers to lazily load images. See <a href=\"@url\">Lazy loading</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nglambatake render gambar nganggo atribut loading gambar asli "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). Iki nambah kinerja kanthi ngidini browser "
"kanggo nglambatake muat gambar. Delengen <a href=\"@url\">Nglambatake "
"muat</a>."

msgid "Lazy"
msgstr "Males"

msgid "Eager"
msgstr "Semangat"

msgid "Lazy loading attribute"
msgstr "Atribut lazy loading"

msgid ""
"Select the lazy loading attribute for images. <a href=\":link\">Learn "
"more.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pilih atribut lazy loading kanggo gambar. <a href=\":link\">Sinau "
"luwih lengkap.</a>"

msgid ""
"In order to use REST on a website, you need to install modules that "
"provide serialization and authentication services. You can use the "
"Core module <a href=\":serialization\">serialization</a> for "
"serialization and <a href=\":basic_auth\">HTTP Basic "
"Authentication</a> for authentication, or install a contributed or "
"custom module."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nggunakake REST ing situs web, sampeyan kudu masang modul sing "
"nyedhiyakake layanan serialisasi lan autentikasi. Sampeyan bisa "
"nggunakake modul Core <a href=\":serialization\">serialisasi</a> "
"kanggo serialisasi lan <a href=\":basic_auth\">HTTP Basic "
"Authentication</a> kanggo autentikasi, utawa masang modul kontribusi "
"utawa modul khusus."

msgid "Provides a framework for exposing REST resources."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake kerangka kerja kanggo mbukak sumber daya REST."

msgid "Allows discovery and rendering of self-contained UI components."
msgstr "Ngidini panyelidikan lan rendering komponèn UI sing mandiri."

msgid "All Components"
msgstr "Kabeh Komponen"

msgid ""
"Provides a service for converting data to and from formats such as "
"JSON and XML."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake layanan kanggo ngowahi data menyang lan saka format "
"kayata JSON lan XML."

msgid "Allows users to create sets of shortcuts within the site."
msgstr "Ngidini pangguna nggawe set shortcut ing jero situs."

msgid "Provides the SQLite database driver."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake driver database SQLite."

msgid "Logs events to the web server's system log."
msgstr "Mencathet kedadeyan menyang log sistem server web."

msgid "The base URL of the site, currently: @base_url"
msgstr "URL dhasar situs, saiki: @base_url"

msgid "The base path of the site, currently: @base_path"
msgstr "Path dhasar situs, saiki: @base_path"

msgid ""
"The URL of the site's front page with the language prefix, if it "
"exists."
msgstr "URL kaca ngarep situs kanthi awalan basa, yen ana."

msgid ""
"Obsolete extensions found: %extensions. Obsolete extensions are "
"provided only so that they can be uninstalled cleanly. You should "
"immediately <a href=\":uninstall_url\">uninstall these extensions</a> "
"since they may be removed in a future release."
msgstr ""
"Ekstensi kadaluwarsa ditemokake: %extensions. Ekstensi kadaluwarsa "
"disedhiyakake mung supaya bisa diuninstall kanthi resik. Sampeyan kudu "
"langsung <a href=\":uninstall_url\">nguninstall ekstensi iki</a> "
"amarga bisa wae bakal dibusak ing rilis mbesuk."

msgid "PHP APCu available caching"
msgstr "Caching nganggo PHP APCu sing kasedhiya"

msgid ""
"APCu is using over 90% of its allotted memory (@apcu_actual_size). To "
"improve APCu performance, consider increasing this limit."
msgstr ""
"APCu nggunakake luwih saka 90% saka memori sing dialokasèkaké "
"(@apcu_actual_size). Kanggo nambah kinerja APCu, pikirna kanggo nambah "
"wates iki."

