msgstr "Fitur Tanda Sistem"

msgid "Enable the menu linkset endpoint"
msgstr "Ngaktifake titik pungkasan menu linkset"

msgid ""
"Use this utility to update your database whenever a module, theme, or "
"the core software is updated."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake alat iki kanggo nganyari database sampeyan saben ana modul, "
"tema, utawa piranti lunak inti sing dianyari."

msgid "Update your files (as described in the handbook page linked above)."
msgstr ""
"Nganyari file sampeyan (kaya sing diterangake ing kaca handbook sing "
"disambungake ing ndhuwur)."

msgid "Optimized assets file system path"
msgstr "Jalur sistem file aset sing wis dioptimalake"

msgid ""
"A local file system path where optimized assets files will be stored. "
"This directory must exist and be writable by Drupal. This directory "
"must be relative to the Drupal installation directory and be "
"accessible over the web. This must be changed in settings.php"
msgstr ""
"Sistem file lokal path ing ngendi file aset sing wis dioptimize bakal "
"disimpen. Direktori iki kudu ana lan bisa ditulis dening Drupal. "
"Direktori iki kudu relatif marang direktori instalasi Drupal lan bisa "
"diakses liwat web. Iki kudu diganti ing settings.php"

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\"@docs-link\">decoupled menus documentation</a> for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <a href=\"@docs-link\">dokumentasi menu decoupled</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"<strong class=\"error\">Set up the <a href=\":file-system\">optimized "
"assets file system path</a> to make these optimizations "
"available.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"error\">Tata <a href=\":file-system\">path sistem file "
"aset sing dioptimalake</a> supaya optimalisasi iki bisa "
"digunakake.</strong>"

msgid "Specify a relative URL to display as the front page."
msgstr "Tentukan URL relatif kanggo ditampilake minangka kaca ngarep."

msgid ""
"The path %path requires a leading forward slash when used with the "
"Pages setting."
msgstr ""
"Path %path mbutuhake garis miring ngarep nalika digunakake karo "
"setelan Kaca."

msgid "The image toolkit '@toolkit' can not process image '@image'."
msgstr "Toolkit gambar '@toolkit' ora bisa ngolah gambar '@image'."

msgid ""
"The image toolkit '@toolkit' failed loading image '@image'. Reported "
"error: @class - @message"
msgstr ""
"Toolkit gambar '@toolkit' gagal ngemu gambar '@image'. Kesalahan sing "
"dilaporake: @class - @message"

msgid ""
"The image toolkit '@toolkit' failed saving image '@image'. Reported "
"error: @class - @message"
msgstr ""
"Piranti gambar '@toolkit' gagal nyimpen gambar '@image'. Kedadeyan "
"kesalahan: @class - @message"

msgid "The raw vocabulary ID."
msgstr "ID kosakata mentahan."

msgid "Defines field types for short and long text with optional summaries."
msgstr ""
"Nemtokake jinis lapangan kanggo teks cendhak lan dawa kanthi ringkesan "
"opsional."

msgid "Allowed text formats"
msgstr "Format teks sing diijini"

msgid "The selected text format is not allowed."
msgstr "Format teks sing dipilih ora diijini."

msgid ""
"Select the allowed text formats. If no formats are selected, all "
"available text formats will be displayed to the user."
msgstr ""
"Pilih format teks sing diijini. Yen ora ana format sing dipilih, kabeh "
"format teks sing kasedhiya bakal ditampilake marang pangguna."

msgid "Text editors may override this setting."
msgstr "Editor teks bisa mbatalake setelan iki."

msgid ""
"Provides an administration toolbar to display links provided by "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake toolbar administrasi kanggo nampilake pranala sing "
"disedhiyakake dening modul."

msgid ""
"Regularly review <a href=\":updates\">available updates</a> and update "
"as required to maintain a secure and current site. Always run the <a "
"href=\":update-php\">update script</a> each time you update software."
msgstr ""
"Rutin mriksa <a href=\":updates\">pembaruan sing kasedhiya</a> lan "
"gawe apdet yen perlu supaya situs tetep aman lan anyar. Tansah lakoni "
"<a href=\":update-php\">skrip pembaruan</a> saben sampeyan nganyari "
"piranti lunak."

msgid ""
"Permissions let you control what users can do and see on your site. "
"You can define a specific set of permissions for each role. (See the "
"<a href=\":role\">Roles</a> page to create a role.) Any permissions "
"granted to the Authenticated user role will be given to any user who "
"is logged in to your site. On the <a href=\":settings\">Role "
"settings</a> page, you can make any role into an Administrator role "
"for the site, meaning that role will be granted all permissions. You "
"should be careful to ensure that only trusted users are given this "
"access and level of control of your site."
msgstr ""
"Izin ngidini sampeyan ngontrol apa sing bisa ditindakake lan dideleng "
"dening pangguna ing situs sampeyan. Sampeyan bisa nemtokake set izin "
"tartamtu kanggo saben peran. (Delengen kaca <a "
"href=\":role\">Peran</a> kanggo nggawe peran.) Saben izin sing "
"diwenehake kanggo peran Panganggo Sah bakal diwenehake marang sapa wae "
"pangguna sing mlebu ing situs sampeyan. Ing kaca <a "
"href=\":settings\">Setelan peran</a>, sampeyan bisa nggawe peran apa "
"wae dadi peran Administrator kanggo situs, sing tegese peran kasebut "
"bakal diwenehi kabeh izin. Sampeyan kudu ngati-ati supaya mung "
"pangguna sing dipercaya sing diwenehi akses lan tingkat kontrol "
"kasebut marang situs sampeyan."

msgid ""
"Allows users to register and log in, and manages user roles and "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"Ngidini pangguna kanggo ndhaptar lan mlebu, uga ngatur peran lan ijin "
"pangguna."

msgid "This role will be automatically granted all permissions."
msgstr "Peran iki bakal otomatis diwenehi kabeh ijin."

msgid ""
"Provides a framework to fetch information from the database and to "
"display it in different formats."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake kerangka kerja kanggo njupuk informasi saka basis data "
"lan kanggo nampilake ing format-format sing beda."

msgid "Use the administration theme when rendering the view page"
msgstr "Gunakake tema administrasi nalika nampilake kaca tampilan"

msgid "Yes (admin path)"
msgstr "Ya (jalur admin)"

msgid "Use the administration theme when rendering this display."
msgstr "Gunakake tema administrasi nalika nampilake tampilan iki."

msgid "Use the administration theme"
msgstr "Gunakake tema administrasi"

msgid "Paths starting with \"@admin\" always use the administration theme."
msgstr ""
"Jalur sing diwiwiti nganggo \"@admin\" mesthi nggunakake tema "
"administrasi."

msgid "No %title option selected."
msgstr "Ora ana opsi %title sing dipilih."

msgid ""
"The view %id failed to load an entity of type %entity_type at row "
"%index for field %field"
msgstr ""
"Tampilan %id gagal mbukak entitas jinis %entity_type ing baris %index "
