msgid "Perform actions on the selected items in the %view_title view"
msgstr "Nglakokake tumindak ing barang sing dipilih ing tampilan %view_title"

msgid "Find and manage content blocks."
msgstr "Golek lan ngatur blok konten."

msgid "There are no content blocks available."
msgstr "Ora ana blok isi sing kasedhiya."

msgid "Create and edit content blocks."
msgstr "Gawe lan sunting blok isi."

msgid ""
"Field %field_name exists but is missing a corresponding field "
"definition and may be misconfigured."
msgstr ""
"Field %field_name ana nanging ora duwe definisi field sing cocog lan "
"bisa uga salah konfigurasi."

msgid "Enter 0 to show all comments."
msgstr "Lebokake 0 kanggo nampilake kabeh komentar."

msgid "Viewing Drupal announcements"
msgstr "Ndelok pangumuman Drupal"

msgid "What are Drupal announcements?"
msgstr "Apa sing dimaksud karo pengumuman Drupal?"

msgid ""
"A feed of announcements about the Drupal project and Drupal "
"Association programs."
msgstr "Siji feed kabar babagan proyek Drupal lan program Drupal Association."

msgid ""
"The purpose of this feed is to provide a channel for outreach directly "
"to Drupal site owners. This content must be highly relevant to site "
"owners interests, serve the strategic goals of the project, and/or "
"promote the sustainability of the project and the Drupal Association."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan saka feed iki yaiku kanggo nyedhiyakake saluran komunikasi "
"langsung marang para pemilik situs Drupal. Isi iki kudu banget relevan "
"karo kapentingan para pemilik situs, nglayani tujuan strategis saka "
"proyek, lan/utawa ngedukung kelestarian saka proyek lan Asosiasi "
"Drupal."

msgid ""
"The module sources its content from a JSON feed generated from <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/about/announcements\">here</a>. The "
"governance policy for the content is documented <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/node/3274085\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul iki njupuk isi saka feed JSON sing digawé saka <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/about/announcements\">kene</a>. "
"Kebijakan tata kelola kanggo isi kasebut didokumentasèkaké <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/node/3274085\">kene</a>."

msgid "How can I see the Announcements in my site?"
msgstr "Kepiye carane aku bisa ndeleng Pengumuman ing situsku?"

msgid ""
"If you have the toolbar module enabled, you will see a direct link to "
"them in the toolbar. If the toolbar module is not enabled, the content "
"can always be accessed in the <em>@actions_link</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan ngaktifake modul toolbar, sampeyan bakal weruh pranala "
"langsung menyang dheweke ing toolbar. Yen modul toolbar ora "
"diaktifake, isi kasebut bisa tansah diakses ing kaca "
"<em>@actions_link</em>."

msgid "Who can see the Announcements?"
msgstr "Sapa sing isa ndelok Pengumuman?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@permissions_link</em> permission can view Drupal "
"announcements."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé <em>@permissions_link</em> idin bisa ndeleng "
"pengumuman Drupal."

msgid "Announcement module overview"
msgstr "Ringkesan modul Announcement"

msgid "Twig development mode"
msgstr "Mode pangembangan Twig"

msgid ""
"Twig development mode settings are turned on. Go to @link to disable "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Setelan mode pangembangan Twig wis diuripaké. Bukak @link kanggo "
"mateni setelan kasebut."

msgid "Markup caching disabled"
msgstr "Markup caching dipatèni"

msgid ""
"Render cache, dynamic page cache, and page cache are bypassed. Go to "
"@link to enable them."
msgstr ""
"Render cache, dynamic page cache, lan page cache ora digunakake. Bukak "
"@link kanggo ngaktifake."

msgid "Configure theme development settings"
msgstr "Atur setelan pangembangan tema"

msgid ""
"These settings should only be enabled on development environments and "
"never on production."
msgstr ""
"Setelan iki mung kudu diaktifake ing lingkungan pangembangan lan ora "
"tau ing produksi."

msgid "Exposes Twig development settings."
msgstr "Nampilake setelan pangembangan Twig."

msgid ""
"Provides Twig's <code>dump()</code> function for debugging, outputs "
"template suggestions to HTML comments, and automatically recompile "
"Twig templates after changes."
msgstr ""
"Nyediakke fungsi <code>dump()</code> saka Twig kanggo debugging, "
"nampilake saran template ing komentar HTML, lan otomatis ngrekompilasi "
"template Twig sawise ana owah-owahan."

msgid "Disable Twig cache"
msgstr "Pateni cache Twig"

msgid "Twig templates are not cached and are always compiled when rendered."
msgstr ""
"Tema Twig ora disimpen ing cache lan tansah dikompilasi nalika "
"dirender."

msgid "Do not cache markup"
msgstr "Aja nyimpen markup ing cache"

msgid "Disables render cache, dynamic page cache, and page cache."
msgstr "Mateni render cache, dynamic page cache, lan page cache."

msgid ""
"Your Drupal site's <code>composer.json</code> file must be valid "
"according to <code>composer validate</code>. See <a "
"href=\":url\">Composer's documentation</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"File <code>composer.json</code> situs Drupal panjenengan kudu bener "
"miturut <code>composer validate</code>. Delengen <a "
"href=\":url\">dokumentasi Composer</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":url\">online documentation "
"for the Package Manager module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":url\">dokumentasi "
"online kanggo modul Package Manager</a>."

msgid "FAQs related to Composer"
msgstr "Pitakonan sing Asring Ditakokake babagan Composer"

msgid ""
"What if it says the <code>proc_open()</code> function is disabled on "
"your PHP installation?"
msgstr ""
"Yen ngomong <code>proc_open()</code> fungsi wis dipatèni ing "
"instalasi PHP panjenengan, piye?"

msgid ""
"Ask your system administrator to remove <code>proc_open()</code> from "
"the <a href=\":url\">disable_functions</a> setting in "
"<code>php.ini</code>."
msgstr ""
"Takon marang administrator sistem sampeyan kanggo mbusak "
"<code>proc_open()</code> saka setelan <a "
"href=\":url\">disable_functions</a> ing <code>php.ini</code>."

msgid "What if it says the <code>composer</code> executable cannot be found?"
msgstr ""
"Yen ngomong <code>composer</code> executable ora bisa ditemokake, "
"piye?"

msgid "What if it says the detected version of Composer is not supported?"
msgstr "Yen ujar manawa versi Composer sing dideteksi ora didhukung, piye?"

msgid "What if it says the <code>composer validate</code> command failed?"
msgstr "Yen ketoke <code>composer validate</code> perintah gagal, piye?"

msgid ""
"Composer detected problems with your <code>composer.json</code> and/or "
"<code>composer.lock</code> files, and the project is not in a "
"completely valid state. See <a href=\":url\">the Composer "
"documentation</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Composer nemokake masalah karo file <code>composer.json</code> "
"lan/utawa <code>composer.lock</code> panjenengan, lan proyek iki ora "
"ana ing kahanan sing bener-bener valid. Waca <a "
"href=\":url\">dokumentasi Composer</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "Using rsync"
msgstr "Nggunakake rsync"

msgid "Enabling PHP-TUF protection"
msgstr "Ngaktifake proteksi PHP-TUF"

msgid ""
"Package Manager requires <a href=\":php-tuf\">PHP-TUF</a>, which "
"implements <a href=\":tuf\">The Update Framework</a> as a way to help "
"secure Composer package downloads via the <a "
"href=\":php-tuf-plugin\">PHP-TUF Composer integration plugin</a>. This "
"plugin must be installed and configured properly in order to use "
"Package Manager."
msgstr ""
"Package Manager mbutuhake <a href=\":php-tuf\">PHP-TUF</a>, sing "
"ngetrapake <a href=\":tuf\">The Update Framework</a> minangka cara "
"kanggo mbantu njamin keamanan download paket Composer liwat <a "
"href=\":php-tuf-plugin\">plugin integrasi PHP-TUF Composer</a>. Plugin "
"iki kudu diinstal lan dikonfigurasi kanthi bener supaya bisa "
"nggunakake Package Manager."

msgid ""
"To install and configure the plugin as needed, you can run the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nginstal lan nyetel plugin miturut kabutuhan, sampeyan bisa "
"mbukak printah-printah ing ngisor iki:"

msgid ""
"Installation or removal of <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> via "
"Package Manager is not supported. You can install or remove it "
"manually by running Composer commands in your site root."
msgstr ""
"Instalasi utawa mbusak <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> liwat "
"Paket Manager ora didhukung. Sampeyan bisa nginstal utawa mbusak "
"kanthi manual kanthi mlakuake perintah Composer ing root situs "
"sampeyan."

msgid "composer.lock not found in @dir."
msgstr "composer.lock ora ketemu ing @dir."

msgid ""
"The detected Composer version, @version, does not satisfy "
"<code>@constraint</code>."
msgstr ""
"Versi Composer sing kacathet, @version, ora cocog karo "
"<code>@constraint</code>."

msgid ""
"Any packages other than the implicitly allowed packages are not "
"allowed to scaffold files. See <a href=\":url\">the scaffold "
"documentation</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Paket apa wae kajaba paket sing secara implisit diijini ora diijini "
"kanggo nggawe file scaffold. Delengen <a href=\":url\">dokumentasi "
"scaffold</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "<code>@name</code>"
msgstr "<code>@name</code>"

msgid ""
"<code>@name</code> is supported, but only version "
"<code>@supported_version</code>, found "
"<code>@installed_version</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code>@name</code> didhukung, nanging mung versi "
"<code>@supported_version</code>, ditemokake "
"<code>@installed_version</code>."

msgid ""
"Composer cannot be used because the <code>proc_open()</code> function "
"is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Composer ora bisa digunakake amarga fungsi <code>proc_open()</code> "
"dipatèni."

msgid "Unable to determine Composer <code>@key</code> setting."
msgstr "Ora bisa nemtokake setelan Composer <code>@key</code>."

msgid "TLS must be enabled for HTTPS Composer downloads."
msgstr "TLS kudu diaktifake kanggo undhuhan Composer liwat HTTPS."

msgid ""
"@message See <a href=\":url\">the help page</a> for more information "
"on how to configure Composer to download packages securely."
msgstr ""
"@message Delengen <a href=\":url\">kaca pitulungan</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan cara nyetel Composer supaya bisa "
"ngundhuh paket kanthi aman."

msgid ""
"@message See <a href=\":url\">the Composer documentation</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"@message Waca <a href=\":url\">dokumentasi Composer</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"You should also check the value of <code>secure-http</code> and make "
"sure that it is set to <code>true</code> or not set at all."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan uga kudu mriksa nilai saka <code>secure-http</code> lan "
"mesthekake yen wis diatur dadi <code>true</code> utawa ora diatur sama "
"sekali."

msgid "HTTPS must be enabled for Composer downloads."
msgstr "HTTPS kudu diaktifake kanggo undhuhan Composer."

msgid "Composer settings don't satisfy Package Manager's requirements."
msgstr "Setelan Composer ora nyukupi syarat Manager Paket."

msgid "'@name' @type (provided by <code>@package</code>)"
msgstr "'@name' @type (disedhiyakake dening <code>@package</code>)"

msgid ""
"The update cannot proceed because the following enabled Drupal "
"extension was removed during the update."
msgid_plural ""
"The update cannot proceed because the following enabled Drupal "
"extensions were removed during the update."
msgstr[0] ""
"Update ora bisa dilanjutaké amarga ekstensi Drupal sing aktif iki wis "
"dibusak nalika update.  \n"
"Update ora bisa dilanjutaké amarga "
"ekstensi-ekstensi Drupal sing aktif iki wis dibusak nalika update."

msgid "<a href=\":url\">@message</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":url\">@message</a>"

msgid ""
"The OpenSSL extension is not enabled, which is a security risk. See <a "
"href=\":url\">the PHP documentation</a> for information on how to "
"enable this extension."
msgstr ""
"Ekstensi OpenSSL durung diaktifake, sing dadi risiko keamanan. "
"Delengen <a href=\":url\">dokumentasi PHP</a> kanggo informasi babagan "
"cara ngaktifake ekstensi iki."

msgid ""
"The active directory is not protected by PHP-TUF, which is required to "
"use Package Manager securely."
msgstr ""
"Direktori aktif ora dilindhungi dening PHP-TUF, sing dibutuhake kanggo "
"nggunakake Package Manager kanthi aman."

msgid "The <code>@plugin</code> plugin is not installed."
msgstr "Plugin <code>@plugin</code> durung dipasang."

msgid ""
"@message See <a href=\":url\">the help page</a> for more information "
"on how to install the plugin."
msgstr ""
"@message Waca <a href=\":url\">kaca pitulung</a> kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap babagan carane nginstal plugin."

msgid "The <code>@plugin</code> plugin is not listed as an allowed plugin."
msgstr ""
"<code>@plugin</code> plugin ora kadhaptar minangka plugin sing "
"diijini."

msgid ""
"@message See <a href=\":url\">the help page</a> for more information "
"on how to configure the plugin."
msgstr ""
"@message Delengen <a href=\":url\">kaca pitulungan</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan cara ngatur plugin."

msgid ""
"@message See <a href=\":url\">the help page</a> for more information "
"on how to set up this repository."
msgstr ""
"@message Delengen <a href=\":url\">kaca pitulungan</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan carane nyetel repositori iki."

msgid ""
"@message See the <a href=\":url\">Package Manager help</a> for more "
"information on how to resolve this."
msgstr ""
"@message Delengen <a href=\":url\">Pandhuan Manajer Paket</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan cara ngatasi iki."

msgid "<code>rsync</code> is not available."
msgstr "<code>rsync</code> ora kasedhiya."

msgid "@project_name (@package_name) @version"
msgstr "@project_name (@package_name) @version"

msgid ""
"The Password Compatibility module provides the password checking "
"algorithm for user accounts created with Drupal prior to version "
"10.1.0. For more information, see the <a href=\":phpass\">online "
"documentation for the Password Compatibility module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Password Compatibility nyedhiyakake algoritma mriksa sandhi "
"kanggo akun pangguna sing digawe nganggo Drupal sadurunge versi "
"10.1.0. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":phpass\">dokumèn online kanggo modul Password "
"Compatibility</a>."

msgid ""
"Drupal 10.1.0 and later use a different algorithm to compute the "
"hashed password. This provides better security against brute-force "
"attacks. The hashed passwords are different from the ones computed "
"with Drupal versions before 10.1.0."
msgstr ""
"Drupal 10.1.0 lan versi sabanjure nggunakake algoritma sing beda "
"kanggo ngitung sandhi sing wis di-hash. Iki menehi keamanan sing luwih "
"apik nglawan serangan brute-force. Sandhi sing wis di-hash iki beda "
"karo sing diitung nganggo versi Drupal sadurunge 10.1.0."

msgid ""
"When the Password Compatibility module is installed, a user can log in "
"with a username and password created before Drupal 10.1.0. The first "
"time these credentials are used, a new hash is computed and saved. "
"From then on, the user will be able to log in with the same username "
"and password whether or not this module is installed."
msgstr ""
"Nalika modul Password Compatibility diinstal, pangguna bisa mlebu "
"nganggo jeneng pangguna lan sandhi sing digawe sadurunge Drupal "
"10.1.0. Kaping pisan pangguna nggunakake kredensial iki, hash anyar "
"bakal diitung lan disimpen. Saka wektu iku, pangguna bakal bisa mlebu "
"nganggo jeneng pangguna lan sandhi sing padha, ora preduli modul iki "
"wis diinstal utawa ora."

msgid ""
"Passwords created before Drupal 10.1.0 <strong>will not work</strong> "
