msgid "Concept: Paths, Aliases, and URLs (Drupal User Guide)"
msgstr "Konsep: Path, Alias, lan URL (Pandhuan Panganggo Drupal)"

msgid "Number of items to index per run"
msgstr "Jumlah item sing bakal diindeks saben proses"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of items processed per indexing run. If necessary, "
"reduce the number of items to prevent timeouts and memory errors while "
"indexing. Some search page types may have their own setting for this."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah maksimum item sing diproses saben proses indeksasi. Yen perlu, "
"suda jumlah item kanggo nyegah timeout lan kesalahan memori nalika "
"indeksasi. Sawetara jinis kaca telusur bisa uga duwe setelan dhewe "
"kanggo iki."

msgid ""
"Changing these settings will cause the default search index to be "
"rebuilt to reflect the new settings. Searching will continue to work, "
"based on the existing index, but new content will not be indexed until "
"all existing content has been re-indexed."
msgstr ""
"Ngowahi setelan iki bakal nyebabake indeks panelusuran standar "
"dibangun maneh kanggo nggambarake setelan anyar. Panelusuran bakal "
"tetep bisa digunakake, adhedhasar indeks sing wis ana, nanging isi "
"anyar ora bakal diindeks nganti kabeh isi sing wis ana diindeks maneh."

msgid "Enter some keywords."
msgstr "Lebokaké sawetara tembung kunci."

msgid ""
"Make sure that the core Shortcut module is installed, and that you "
"have a role with <em>Edit current shortcut set</em> or <em>Administer "
"shortcuts</em> permission. Also, make sure that a toolbar module is "
"installed (either the core Toolbar module or a contributed module "
"replacement)."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa modul Shortcut inti wis diinstal, lan sampeyan duwe "
"peran kanthi ijin <em>Edit current shortcut set</em> utawa "
"<em>Administer shortcuts</em>. Uga, priksa manawa modul toolbar wis "
"diinstal (bisa modul Toolbar inti utawa modul pengganti saka "
"kontributor)."

msgid "Output Buffering"
msgstr "Buffering Output"

msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.ob-start.php\">Output "
"buffering</a> is not enabled. This may degrade Drupal's performance. "
"You can enable output buffering by default <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/outcontrol.configuration.php#ini.output-buffering\">in "
"your PHP settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.ob-start.php\">Output "
"buffering</a> durung diaktifake. Iki bisa ngurangi kinerja Drupal. "
"Sampeyan bisa ngaktifake output buffering sacara bawaan <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/outcontrol.configuration.php#ini.output-buffering\">ing "
"setelan PHP sampeyan</a>."

msgid ""
"Multibyte string input conversion in PHP is active and must be "
"disabled. Check the php.ini <em>mbstring.encoding_translation</em> "
"setting. Refer to the <a href=\"http://php.net/mbstring\">PHP mbstring "
"documentation</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Konversi input string multibyte ing PHP aktif lan kudu dipatèni. "
"Priksanen setelan php.ini <em>mbstring.encoding_translation</em>. "
"Delengen <a href=\"http://php.net/mbstring\">dokumentasi PHP "
"mbstring</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

