msgid ""
"If checked, multiple values for this field will be shown in the same "
"row. If not checked, each value in this field will create a new row. "
"If using group by, make sure to group by \"Entity ID\" for this "
"setting to have any effect."
msgstr ""
"Yen dicenthang, pirang-pirang nilai kanggo kolom iki bakal ditampilake "
"ing baris sing padha. Yen ora dicenthang, saben nilai ing kolom iki "
"bakal nggawe baris anyar. Yen nggunakake group by, priksa manawa "
"kanggo ngelompokake miturut \"Entity ID\" supaya setelan iki bisa duwe "
"pengaruh."

msgid ""
"This will appear in the URL after the ? to identify this filter. "
"Cannot be blank. Only letters, digits and the dot (\".\"), hyphen "
"(\"-\"), underscore (\"_\"), and tilde (\"~\") characters are allowed. "
"@reserved_identifiers are reserved words and cannot be used."
msgstr ""
"Iki bakal muncul ing URL sawisé tanda ? kanggo ngenali filter iki. "
"Ora kena kosong. Mung aksara, digit, lan titik (\".\"), tanda "
"penghubung (\"-\"), garis ngisor (\"_\"), lan karakter tilde (\"~\") "
"sing diijini. @reserved_identifiers iku tembung sing dilindhungi lan "
"ora bisa digunakake."

