msgid ""
"CKEditor 5 has to be installed and configured separately for "
"individual text formats from the <a href=\":formats\">Text formats and "
"editors page</a> because the filter settings for each text format can "
"be different. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":text_editor\">Text Editor help page</a> and <a "
"href=\":filter\">Filter help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"CKEditor 5 kudu dipasang lan dikonfigurasi kanthi misah kanggo saben "
"format teks saka <a href=\":formats\">Kaca format teks lan "
"penyunting</a> amarga setelan filter kanggo saben format teks bisa "
"beda-beda. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":text_editor\">Kaca bantuan Penyunting Teks</a> lan <a "
"href=\":filter\">Kaca bantuan Filter</a>."

msgid "The <code>@tag</code> tag is not yet supported by the Style plugin."
msgstr "Tag <code>@tag</code> durung didhukung déning plugin Style."

msgid ""
"Comment functionality can be enabled for any entity sub-type (for "
"example, a <a href=\":content-type\">content type</a>) by adding a "
"<em>Comments</em> field on its <em>Manage fields page</em>. Adding or "
"removing commenting for an entity through the user interface requires "
"the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI</a> module to be installed, even "
"though the commenting functionality works without it. For more "
"information on fields and entities, see the <a href=\":field\">Field "
"module help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi komentar bisa diaktifake kanggo sembarang sub-tipe entitas "
"(contone, <a href=\":content-type\">tipe konten</a>) kanthi nambah "
"<em>Comments</em> ing <em>Kaca Ngatur Fields</em>-e. Nambah utawa "
"mbusak komentar kanggo entitas liwat antarmuka panganggo mbutuhake "
"modul <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI</a> supaya diinstal, senadyan "
"fungsi komentar tetep bisa digunakake tanpa modul iki. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan fields lan entitas, delengen <a "
"href=\":field\">Kaca bantuan modul Field</a>."

msgid ""
"Commenting settings can be configured by editing the <em>Comments</em> "
"field on the <em>Manage fields page</em> of an entity type if the "
"<em>Field UI module</em> is installed. Configuration includes the "
"label of the comments field, the number of comments to be displayed, "
"and whether they are shown in threaded list. Commenting can be "
"configured as: <em>Open</em> to allow new comments, <em>Closed</em> to "
"view existing comments, but prevent new comments, or <em>Hidden</em> "
"to hide existing comments and prevent new comments. Changing this "
"configuration for an entity type will not change existing entity "
"items."
msgstr ""
"Setelan komentar bisa disetel kanthi nyunting kolom <em>Comments</em> "
"ing <em>Manage fields page</em> saka jinis entitas yen modul <em>Field "
"UI module</em> wis diinstal. Konfigurasi kalebu label kolom komentar, "
"jumlah komentar sing bakal ditampilake, lan apa komentar kasebut "
"ditampilake kanthi daftar beruntun. Komentar bisa disetel minangka: "
"<em>Open</em> kanggo ngidini komentar anyar, <em>Closed</em> mung "
"kanggo ndeleng komentar sing wis ana, nanging ora ngidini komentar "
"anyar, utawa <em>Hidden</em> kanggo ndhelikake komentar sing wis ana "
"lan nyegah komentar anyar. Ngganti konfigurasi iki kanggo jinis "
"entitas ora bakal ngowahi item entitas sing wis ana."

msgid ""
"If you have the <a href=\":toolbar\">Toolbar module</a> installed, "
"clicking the contextual links button in the toolbar (which looks like "
"a pencil) will make all contextual links buttons on the page visible. "
"Clicking this button again will toggle them to invisible."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan wis nginstal <a href=\":toolbar\">modul Toolbar</a>, "
"ngeklik tombol pranala kontekstual ing toolbar (sing katon kaya "
"pensil) bakal nggawe kabeh tombol pranala kontekstual ing kaca katon. "
"Ngeklik tombol iki maneh bakal nggawe tombol-tombol kasebut ora katon."

msgid ""
"The Field module provides the infrastructure for fields; the field "
"types, formatters, and widgets are provided by Drupal core or "
"additional modules. Some of the modules are required; the optional "
"modules can be installed from the <a href=\":modules\">Extend "
"administration page</a>. Additional fields, formatters, and widgets "
"may be provided by contributed modules, which you can find in the <a "
"href=\":contrib\">contributed module section of Drupal.org</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Field nyedhiyakake infrastruktur kanggo field; jinis field, "
"formatter, lan widget diwenehake dening inti Drupal utawa modul "
"tambahan. Sawetara modul dibutuhake; modul opsional bisa diinstal saka "
"<a href=\":modules\">kaca administrasi Extend</a>. Field, formatter, "
"lan widget tambahan bisa uga disedhiyakake dening modul kontribusi, "
"sing bisa sampeyan temokake ing <a href=\":contrib\">bagian modul "
"kontribusi ing Drupal.org</a>."

msgid ""
"Here is a list of the currently installed field, formatter, and widget "
"modules:"
msgstr ""
"Iki dhaptar modul field, formatter, lan widget sing saiki wis "
"diinstal:"

msgid ""
"The Field UI module provides an administrative user interface (UI) for "
"managing and displaying fields. Fields can be attached to most content "
"entity sub-types. Different field types, widgets, and formatters are "
"provided by the modules installed on your site, and managed by the "
"Field module. For background information and terminology related to "
"fields and entities, see the <a href=\":field\">Field module help "
"page</a>. For more information about the Field UI, see the <a "
"href=\":field_ui_docs\">online documentation for the Field UI "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Field UI nyedhiyakake antarmuka pangguna administratif (UI) "
"kanggo ngatur lan nampilake kolom. Kolom bisa ditempelake ing meh "
"kabeh sub-tipe entitas konten. Macem-macem jinis kolom, widget, lan "
"formatter disedhiyakake dening modul sing dipasang ing situs sampeyan, "
"lan diatur dening modul Field. Kanggo informasi latar lan istilah sing "
"gegandhengan karo kolom lan entitas, deleng <a href=\":field\">kaca "
"pitulung modul Field</a>. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan Field "
"UI, deleng <a href=\":field_ui_docs\">dokumentasi online modul Field "
"UI</a>."

msgid ""
"There are two reports available that list the fields defined on your "
"site. The <a href=\":entity-list\" title=\"Entities field list "
"report\">Entities</a> report lists all your fields, showing the field "
"machine names, types, and the entity types or sub-types they are used "
"on (each sub-type links to the Manage fields page). If the <a "
"href=\":views\">Views</a> and <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI</a> "
"modules are installed, the <a href=\":views-list\" title=\"Used in "
"views field list report\">Used in views</a> report lists each field "
"that is used in a view, with a link to edit that view."
msgstr ""
"Ana loro laporan sing kasedhiya sing ndhaptar lapangan sing wis "
"ditemtokake ing situs sampeyan. Laporan <a href=\":entity-list\" "
"title=\"Entities field list report\">Entities</a> ndhaptar kabeh "
"lapangan sampeyan, nuduhake jeneng mesin lapangan, jinis, lan jinis "
"entitas utawa sub-jinis sing digunakake (saben sub-jinis nduweni "
"pranala menyang kaca Manage fields). Yen modul <a "
"href=\":views\">Views</a> lan <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI</a> wis "
"diinstal, laporan <a href=\":views-list\" title=\"Used in views field "
"list report\">Used in views</a> ndhaptar saben lapangan sing "
"digunakake ing view, kanthi pranala kanggo ngowahi view kasebut."

msgid ""
"You can create and edit text formats on the <a href=\":formats\">Text "
"formats page</a> (if the Text Editor module is installed, this page is "
"named Text formats and editors). One text format is included by "
"default: Plain text (which removes all HTML tags). Additional text "
"formats may be created during installation. You can create a text "
"format by clicking \"<a href=\":add_format\">Add text format</a>\"."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nggawe lan nyunting format teks ing <a "
"href=\":formats\">kaca Format Teks</a> (yen modul Editor Teks wis "
"dipasang, kaca iki dijenengi Format Teks lan Editor). Siji format teks "
"wis kasedhiya kanthi bawan: Teks Biasa (sing mbusak kabeh tag HTML). "
"Format teks tambahan bisa digawe nalika instalasi. Sampeyan bisa "
"nggawe format teks kanthi ngeklik \"<a href=\":add_format\">Tambah "
"format teks</a>\"."

msgid ""
"<strong>Enable additional functionality</strong> Next, visit the <a "
"href=\":modules\">Extend page</a> and install modules that suit your "
"specific needs. You can find additional modules at the <a "
"href=\":download_modules\">Drupal.org modules page</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Aktifake fungsi tambahan</strong> Sabanjure, bukak <a "
"href=\":modules\"> kaca Extend</a> lan pasang modul sing cocog karo "
"kabutuhan sampeyan. Sampeyan bisa nemokake modul tambahan ing <a "
"href=\":download_modules\"> kaca modul Drupal.org</a>."

msgid ""
"Help topics provided by modules and themes are also part of the Help "
"module. If the core Search module is installed, these topics are "
"searchable. For more information, see the <a href=\":online\">online "
"documentation, Help Topic Standards</a>."
msgstr ""
"Topik bantuan sing diwènèhaké déning modul lan tema uga kalebu "
"pérangan saka modul Bantuan. Yen modul Search inti wis diinstal, "
"topik-topik iki bisa digoleki. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":online\">dokumentasi online, Standar Topik "
"Bantuan</a>."

msgid ""
"A few of the settings for image fields are defined once when you "
"create the field and cannot be changed later; these include the choice "
"of public or private file storage and the number of images that can be "
"stored in the field. The rest of the settings can be edited later; "
"these settings include the field label, help text, allowed file "
"extensions, image dimensions restrictions, and the subdirectory in the "
"public or private file storage where the images will be stored. The "
"editable settings can also have different values for different entity "
"sub-types; for instance, if your image field is used on both Page and "
"Article content types, you can store the files in a different "
"subdirectory for the two content types."
msgstr ""
"Sawetara setelan kanggo kolom gambar ditemtokake nalika nggawe kolom "
"lan ora bisa diganti mengko; iki kalebu pilihan panyimpenan file umum "
"utawa pribadi lan jumlah gambar sing bisa disimpen ing kolom kasebut. "
"Setelan liyane bisa diedit mengko; setelan iki kalebu label kolom, "
"teks bantuan, ekstensi file sing diidini, watesan ukuran gambar, lan "
"subdirektori ing panyimpenan file umum utawa pribadi ing endi gambar "
"bakal disimpen. Setelan sing bisa diedit uga bisa nduweni nilai beda "
"kanggo sub-jinis entitas sing beda; contone, yen kolom gambar sampeyan "
"digunakake ing jinis konten Kaca lan Artikel, sampeyan bisa nyimpen "
"file ing subdirektori sing beda kanggo rong jinis konten kasebut."

msgid ""
"You can also configure a minimum and/or maximum dimensions for "
"uploaded images. Images that are too small will be rejected. Images "
"that are to large will be resized. During the resizing the <a "
"href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchangeable_image_file_format\">EXIF "
"data</a> in the image will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan uga bisa nyetel ukuran minimal lan/utawa maksimal kanggo "
"gambar sing diunggah. Gambar sing kakehan cilik bakal ditolak. Gambar "
"sing kakehan gedhe bakal diowahi ukurane. Sakwisé diowahi ukurané, "
"<a "
"href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchangeable_image_file_format\">data "
"EXIF</a> ing gambar bakal ilang."

msgid "Minimum image dimensions"
msgstr "Dimensi gambar minimal"

msgid ""
"The Language module allows you to configure the languages used on your "
"site, and provides information for the <a href=\":content\">Content "
"Translation</a>, <a href=\":interface\">Interface Translation</a>, and "
"<a href=\":configuration\">Configuration Translation</a> modules, if "
"they are installed. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">online documentation for the Language module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Basa ngidini sampeyan nyetel basa sing digunakake ing situs "
"sampeyan, lan nyedhiyakake informasi kanggo modul <a "
"href=\":content\">Terjemahan Isi</a>, <a "
"href=\":interface\">Terjemahan Antarmuka</a>, lan <a "
"href=\":configuration\">Terjemahan Konfigurasi</a>, yen modul-modul "
"kasebut wis dipasang. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":doc_url\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Basa</a>."

msgid ""
"You can add languages on the <a href=\":language_list\">Languages</a> "
"page by selecting <em>Add language</em> and choosing a language from "
"the drop-down menu. This language is then displayed in the languages "
"list, where it can be configured further. If the <a "
"href=\":interface\">Interface translation module</a> is installed, and "
"the <em>translation server</em> is set as a translation source, then "
"the interface translation for this language is automatically "
"downloaded as well."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nambah basa ing kaca <a href=\":language_list\">Basa</a> "
"kanthi milih <em>Tambah basa</em> lan milih basa saka menu gulung "
"mudhun. Basa iki banjur bakal ditampilake ing daftar basa, ing ngendi "
"bisa dikonfigurasi luwih lanjut. Yen <a href=\":interface\">modul "
"terjemahan antarmuka</a> wis dipasang, lan <em>server terjemahan</em> "
"disetel minangka sumber terjemahan, banjur terjemahan antarmuka kanggo "
"basa iki bakal otomatis diundhuh uga."

msgid ""
"If the Block module is installed, then you can add a language switcher "
"block on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout</a> page to allow users "
"to switch between languages."
msgstr ""
"Yen modul Block wis diinstal, sampeyan bisa nambah blok switcher basa "
"ing kaca <a href=\":blocks\">Tata Letak Blok</a> kanggo ngidini "
"pangguna ngalih antarane basa."

msgid ""
"If the Block module is installed, then the Language module allows you "
"to set the visibility of a block based on selected languages on the <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Block layout</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Yen modul Block wis diinstal, mula modul Language ngidini sampeyan "
"nyetel visibilitas blok adhedhasar basa sing dipilih ing kaca <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Tata letak Blok</a>."

msgid ""
"Translation files with translated interface text are imported "
"automatically when languages are added on the <a "
"href=\":languages\">Languages</a> page, or when modules or themes are "
"installed. On the <a href=\":locale-settings\">Interface translation "
"settings</a> page, the <em>Translation source</em> can be restricted "
"to local files only, or to include the <a href=\":server\">Drupal "
"translation server</a>. Although modules and themes may not be fully "
"translated in all languages, new translations become available "
"frequently. You can specify whether and how often to check for "
"translation file updates and whether to overwrite existing "
"translations on the <a href=\":locale-settings\">Interface translation "
"settings</a> page. You can also manually import a translation file on "
"the <a href=\":import\">Interface translation import</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Berkas terjemahan kanthi teks antarmuka sing wis diterjemahake diimpor "
"kanthi otomatis nalika basa ditambahake ing kaca <a "
"href=\":languages\">Languages</a>, utawa nalika modul utawa tema "
"dipasang. Ing kaca <a href=\":locale-settings\">Interface translation "
"settings</a>, <em>Translation source</em> bisa diwatesi mung kanggo "
"berkas lokal, utawa uga kalebu <a href=\":server\">Drupal translation "
"server</a>. Sanajan modul lan tema bisa uga ora diterjemahake kanthi "
"lengkap ing kabeh basa, terjemahan anyar asring kasedhiya. Sampeyan "
"bisa nemtokake apa lan sepira kerepe mriksa kanggo pembaruan berkas "
"terjemahan lan apa kudu nimpah terjemahan sing wis ana ing kaca <a "
"href=\":locale-settings\">Interface translation settings</a>. Sampeyan "
"uga bisa kanthi manual ngimpor berkas terjemahan ing kaca <a "
"href=\":import\">Interface translation import</a>."

msgid ""
"Interface translations are automatically imported when a language is "
"added, or when new modules or themes are installed. The report <a "
"href=\":update\">Available translation updates</a> shows the status. "
"Interface text can be customized in the <a href=\":translate\">user "
"interface translation</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Terjemahan antarmuka bakal otomatis diimpor nalika basa ditambahake, "
"utawa nalika modul anyar utawa tema dipasang. Laporan <a "
"href=\":update\">Pembaruan terjemahan sing kasedhiya</a> nuduhake "
"statusé. Teks antarmuka bisa disesuaikan ing kaca <a "
"href=\":translate\">terjemahan antarmuka pangguna</a>."

msgid ""
"Translation files are automatically downloaded and imported when <a "
"title=\"Languages\" href=\":language\">languages</a> are added, or "
"when modules or themes are installed."
msgstr ""
"Berkas terjemahan bakal otomatis diundhuh lan diimpor nalika <a "
"title=\"Languages\" href=\":language\">basa</a> ditambahaké, utawa "
"nalika modul utawa tema dipasang."

msgid ""
"Use <em>Media</em> reference fields for most files, images, audio, "
"videos, and remote media. Use <em>File</em> or <em>Image</em> "
"reference fields when creating your own media types, or for legacy "
"files and images created before installing the Media module."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake <em>Media</em> reference fields kanggo umume file, gambar, "
"audio, video, lan media jarak jauh. Gunakake <em>File</em> utawa "
"<em>Image</em> reference fields nalika nggawe jinis media dhewe, utawa "
"kanggo file lan gambar warisan sing digawe sadurunge masang modul "
"Media."

msgid "%type_name: View any media revision pages"
msgstr "%type_name: Delengen kaca revisi media apa wae"

msgid "Revert %type_name: Revert media revisions"
msgstr "Balikake %type_name: Balikake revisi media"

msgid "Delete %type_name: Delete media revisions"
msgstr "Mbusak %type_name: Mbusak revisi media"

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":drupal-org-help\">online "
"documentation for the Custom Menu Links module</a>. If you install the "
"Menu UI module, it provides an interface for managing menus and menu "
"links."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a "
"href=\":drupal-org-help\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Custom Menu "
"Links</a>. Yen sampeyan nginstal modul Menu UI, modul kasebut "
"nyedhiyakake antarmuka kanggo ngatur menu lan pranala menu."

msgid ""
"If you have the Block module installed, then each menu that you create "
"is rendered in a block that you enable and position on the <a "
"href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>. In some <a "
"href=\":themes\">themes</a>, the main menu and possibly the secondary "
"menu will be output automatically; you may be able to disable this "
"behavior on the <a href=\":themes\">theme's settings page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan wis nginstal modul Block, mula saben menu sing digawe "
"bakal ditampilake ing blok sing sampeyan aktifake lan posisikan ing <a "
"href=\":blocks\">kaca tata letak Block</a>. Ing sawetara <a "
"href=\":themes\">tema</a>, menu utama lan bisa uga menu sekunder bakal "
"otomatis ditampilake; sampeyan bisa uga bisa mateni prilaku iki ing <a "
"href=\":themes\">kaca setelan tema</a>."

msgid ""
"You need to install all modules on this site that are installed on the "
"previous site. For example, if you have used the Book module on the "
"previous site then you must install the Book module on this site for "
"that data to be available on this site."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan kudu nginstal kabeh modul ing situs iki sing wis diinstal ing "
"situs sadurunge. Contone, yen sampeyan wis nganggo modul Book ing "
"situs sadurunge, sampeyan kudu nginstal modul Book ing situs iki "
"supaya data kasebut kasedhiya ing situs iki."

msgid ""
"The RESTful Web Services module provides a framework for exposing REST "
"resources on your site. It provides support for content entity types "
"such as the main site content, comments, content blocks, taxonomy "
"terms, and user accounts, etc. (see the <a href=\":field\">Field "
"module help page</a> for more information about entities). REST "
"support for content items of the Node module is installed by default, "
"and support for other types of content entities can be enabled. Other "
"modules may add support for other types of REST resources. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":rest\">online documentation for the "
"RESTful Web Services module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul RESTful Web Services nyedhiyakake kerangka kerja kanggo mbukak "
"sumber daya REST ing situs sampeyan. Modul iki nyedhiyakake dukungan "
"kanggo jinis entitas konten kaya isi situs utama, komentar, blok "
"konten, istilah taksonomi, lan akun pangguna, lan liya-liyane. "
"(delengen <a href=\":field\">kaca bantuan modul Field</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan entitas). Dukungan REST kanggo item "
"konten saka modul Node wis diinstal sacara bawaan, lan dukungan kanggo "
"jinis entitas konten liyane bisa diaktifake. Modul liyane uga bisa "
"nambah dukungan kanggo jinis sumber daya REST liyane. Kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":rest\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"modul RESTful Web Services</a>."

msgid ""
"Modules providing search page plugins generally ensure that "
"content-related actions on your site (creating, editing, or deleting "
"content and comments) automatically cause affected content items to be "
"marked for indexing or reindexing at the next cron run. When content "
"is marked for reindexing, the previous content remains in the index "
"until cron runs, at which time it is replaced by the new content. "
"However, there are some actions related to the structure of your site "
"that do not cause affected content to be marked for reindexing. "
"Examples of structure-related actions that affect content include "
"deleting or editing taxonomy terms, installing or uninstalling modules "
"that add text to content (such as Taxonomy, Comment, and "
"field-providing modules), and modifying the fields or display "
"parameters of your content types. If you take one of these actions and "
"you want to ensure that the search index is updated to reflect your "
"changed site structure, you can mark all content for reindexing by "
"clicking the \"Re-index site\" button on the <a "
"href=\":search-settings\">Search pages page</a>. If you have a lot of "
"content on your site, it may take several cron runs for the content to "
"be reindexed."
msgstr ""
"Modul sing nyedhiyakake plugin kaca panelusuran umume njamin yen "
"tumindak sing gegayutan karo isi ing situs sampeyan (nggawe, nyunting, "
"utawa mbusak isi lan komentar) kanthi otomatis nggawe barang isi sing "
"kena pengaruh ditandhani kanggo diindeks utawa diindeks maneh nalika "
"cron kaping sabanjure mlaku. Nalika isi ditandhani kanggo diindeks "
"maneh, isi sadurunge tetep ana ing indeks nganti cron mlaku, nalika "
"kuwi diganti karo isi anyar. Nanging, ana sawetara tumindak sing "
"gegayutan karo struktur situs sampeyan sing ora nggawe isi sing kena "
"pengaruh ditandhani kanggo diindeks maneh. Tuladhane tumindak sing "
"gegayutan karo struktur sing mengaruhi isi kalebu mbusak utawa "
"nyunting istilah taksonomi, masang utawa mbusak modul sing nambah teks "
"menyang isi (kaya modul Taxonomy, Comment, lan modul sing nyedhiyakake "
"lapangan), lan ngowahi lapangan utawa parameter tampilan jinis isi "
"sampeyan. Yen sampeyan nindakake salah siji tumindak kasebut lan "
"pengin njamin yen indeks panelusuran dianyari kanggo nggambarake "
"struktur situs sampeyan sing wis diowahi, sampeyan bisa nandhani kabeh "
"isi kanggo diindeks maneh kanthi ngeklik tombol \"Re-index site\" ing "
"<a href=\":search-settings\">kaca Search pages</a>. Yen situs sampeyan "
"duwe isi akeh, bisa uga butuh sawetara kali mlaku cron supaya isi "
"kasebut bisa diindeks maneh."

msgid ""
"The Search module includes a block, which can be enabled and "
"configured on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>, if you "
"have the Block module installed; the default block title is Search, "
"and it is the Search form block in the Forms category, if you wish to "
"add another instance. The block is available to users with the <a "
"href=\":search_permission\">Use search</a> permission, and it performs "
"a search using the configured default search page."
msgstr ""
"Modul Search nyakup blok, sing bisa diaktifake lan dikonfigurasi ing "
"<a href=\":blocks\">Kaca tata letak Blok</a>, yen sampeyan wis masang "
"modul Blok; judhul blok standar yaiku Search, lan iku blok formulir "
"Search ing kategori Forms, yen sampeyan pengin nambah instansi liyane. "
"Blok iki bisa diakses kanggo pangguna sing nduweni ijin <a "
"href=\":search_permission\">Gunakake panelusuran</a>, lan nindakake "
"panelusuran nggunakake kaca panelusuran standar sing wis "
"dikonfigurasi."

msgid "The current date in 'short' format. (%date)"
msgstr "Tanggal saiki ing format 'pendek'. (%date)"

msgid "The current date in 'medium' format. (%date)"
msgstr "Tanggal saiki ing format 'medium'. (%date)"

msgid "The current date in 'long' format. (%date)"
msgstr "Tanggal saiki ing format 'dawa'. (%date)"

msgid ""
"The current date in a custom format. See <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\">the "
"PHP documentation</a> for details."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal saiki ing format khusus. Delengen <a "
"href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\">dokumentasi "
"PHP</a> kanggo rincian."

msgid "The current date in 'time-since' format. (%date)"
msgstr "Tanggal saiki kanthi format 'waktu-saka'. (%date)"

msgid "The current date in UNIX timestamp format (%date)"
msgstr "Tanggal saiki ing format timestamp UNIX (%date)"

msgid ""
"The installed version of at least one of your modules or themes has "
"been revoked and is no longer available for download. Upgrading or "
"uninstalling is strongly recommended!"
msgstr ""
"Versi sing wis diinstal saka paling ora siji modul utawa tema sampeyan "
"wis dicabut lan ora kasedhiya maneh kanggo diundhuh. Apgrade utawa "
"copot disaranake banget!"

msgid ""
"The installed version of at least one of your modules or themes is no "
"longer supported. Upgrading or uninstalling is strongly recommended. "
"See the project homepage for more details."
msgstr ""
"Versi sing wis diinstal saka paling ora siji modul utawa tema sampeyan "
"ora didhukung maneh. Disaranake banget kanggo nganyari utawa mbusak "
"instalasi kasebut. Delengen kaca proyek kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap."

msgid ""
"<em>Roles</em> are used to group and classify users; each user can be "
"assigned one or more roles. Typically there are two pre-defined roles: "
"<em>Anonymous user</em> (users that are not logged in), and "
"<em>Authenticated user</em> (users that are registered and logged in). "
"Depending on how your site was set up, an <em>Administrator</em> role "
"may also be available: users with this role will automatically be "
"assigned any new permissions whenever a module is installed. You can "
"create additional roles on the <a href=\":roles\">Roles administration "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Peran</em> digunakake kanggo ngelompokake lan nglasifikasikake "
"pangguna; saben pangguna bisa diwenehi siji utawa luwih peran. Biasane "
"ana loro peran sing wis ditemtokake: <em>Pangguna anonim</em> "
"(pangguna sing ora mlebu), lan <em>Pangguna sing wis diotentikasi</em> "
"(pangguna sing wis kadhaptar lan mlebu). Gumantung saka cara situs "
"sampeyan disetel, peran <em>Administrator</em> uga bisa kasedhiya: "
"pangguna kanthi peran iki bakal otomatis diwenehi hak akses anyar "
"kapan wae modul dipasang. Sampeyan bisa nggawe peran tambahan ing <a "
"href=\":roles\">Kaca administratif Peran</a>."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":accounts\">Account settings page</a> allows you to "
"manage settings for the displayed name of the Anonymous user role, "
"personal contact forms, user registration settings, and account "
"cancellation settings. On this page you can also manage settings for "
"account personalization, and adapt the text for the email messages "
"that users receive when they register or request a password recovery. "
"You may also set which role is automatically assigned new permissions "
"whenever a module is installed (the Administrator role)."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":accounts\">Kaca setelan Akun</a> ngidini sampeyan ngatur "
"setelan kanggo jeneng sing ditampilake saka peran pangguna Anonim, "
"formulir kontak pribadi, setelan registrasi pangguna, lan setelan "
"pembatalan akun. Ing kaca iki sampeyan uga bisa ngatur setelan kanggo "
"personalisasi akun, lan nyetel teks kanggo pesen email sing ditampa "
"pangguna nalika ndhaptar utawa njaluk pemulihan sandhi. Sampeyan uga "
"bisa nyetel peran sing otomatis diwenehi idin anyar saben modul "
"dipasang (peran Administrator)."

msgid ""
"In order to create and modify your own views using the administration "
"and configuration user interface, you will need to install either the "
"Views UI module in core or a contributed module that provides a user "
"interface for Views. See the <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI module "
"help page</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nggawe lan ngowahi tampilan sampeyan dhewe nggunakake antarmuka "
"pangguna administrasi lan konfigurasi, sampeyan kudu nginstal modul "
"Views UI sing ana ing inti utawa modul sing disumbangake sing "
"nyedhiyakake antarmuka pangguna kanggo Views. Delengen <a "
"href=\":views-ui\">kaca pitulung modul Views UI</a> kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"The following @element_type(s) can optionally be supported by enabled "
"plugins and should not be added to the Source Editing \"Manually "
"editable HTML tags\" field: %overlapping_tags."
msgstr ""
"@element_type(s) ing ngisor iki bisa sacara opsional didhukung dening "
"plugin sing wis diaktifake lan ora kudu ditambahake ing kolom Source "
"Editing \"Tag HTML sing bisa diedit manual\": %overlapping_tags."

msgid ""
"The following paths in @project_root aren't recognized as part of your "
"Drupal site, so to be safe, Package Manager is excluding them from all "
"stage operations. If these files are not needed for Composer to work "
"properly in your site, no action is needed. Otherwise, you can disable "
"this behavior by setting the "
"<code>package_manager.settings:include_unknown_files_in_project_root</code> "
"config setting to <code>TRUE</code>.\n"
"\n"
"@list"
msgstr ""
"Path-path ing @project_root iki ora dianggep minangka bagean saka "
"situs Drupal sampeyan, mula kanggo aman, Package Manager ora kalebu "
"path-path iki ing kabeh operasi tahap. Yen file-file iki ora "
"dibutuhake supaya Composer bisa digunakake kanthi bener ing situs "
"sampeyan, ora perlu ana tindakan. Yen ora, sampeyan bisa mateni "
"prilaku iki kanthi nyetel setelan konfigurasi "
"<code>package_manager.settings:include_unknown_files_in_project_root</code> "
"dadi <code>TRUE</code>.\n"
"\n"
"@list"

