msgstr "Profil instalasi '@profile_name' mbutuhake '@module_name'"

msgid ""
"Ideal for exact counts and measures (prices, temperatures, distances, "
"volumes, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Cocok kanggo cacah lan ukuran sing tepat (rega, suhu, jarak, volume, "
"lsp.)"

msgid "Stores a number in the database in a fixed decimal format"
msgstr "Nyimpen nomer ing basis data kanthi format desimal sing tetep"

msgid ""
"For example, 12.34 km or € when used for further detailed "
"calculations (such as summing many of these)"
msgstr ""
"Contone, 12.34 km utawa € nalika digunakake kanggo perhitungan luwih "
"rinci (kaya nglumpukake akeh iki)"

msgid ""
"In most instances, it is best to use Number (decimal) instead, as "
"decimal numbers stored as floats may contain errors in precision"
msgstr ""
"Ing umume kasus, luwih becik nggunakake Number (decimal) tinimbang, "
"amarga angka desimal sing disimpen minangka float bisa ngandhut "
"kesalahan presisi"

msgid ""
"This type of field offers faster processing and more compact storage, "
"but the differences are typically negligible on modern sites"
msgstr ""
"Jinis kolom iki nawakake proses sing luwih cepet lan panyimpenan sing "
"luwih padhet, nanging bedane biasane ora pati krasa ing situs modern."

msgid ""
"For example, 123.4 km when used in imprecise contexts such as a "
"walking trail distance"
msgstr ""
"Contone, 123,4 km nalika digunakake ing konteks sing ora cetha kaya "
"jarak jalur mlaku-mlaku"

msgid "Number without decimals"
msgstr "Nomor tanpa desimal"

msgid "For example, 123"
msgstr "Contone, 123"

msgid "Ideal for titles and names"
msgstr "Cocog kanggo irah-irahan lan jeneng-jeneng"

msgid "Efficient storage for short text"
msgstr "Panyimpenan sing efisien kanggo teks cekak"

msgid "Requires specifying a maximum length"
msgstr "Mbutuhake nemtokake dawa maksimum"

msgid "Good for fields with known or predictable length"
msgstr ""
"Apik kanggo lapangan kanthi dawa sing wis dingerteni utawa bisa "
"diprediksi"

msgid "Ideal for longer texts, like body or description"
msgstr "Cocog kanggo teks sing luwih dawa, kaya isi utawa katrangan"

msgid "Supports long text without specifying a maximum length"
msgstr "Ndukung teks dawa tanpa nemtokake dawa maksimal"

msgid "May use more storage and be slower for searching and sorting"
msgstr ""
"Bisa nggunakake panyimpenan luwih akeh lan luwih alon kanggo nggoleki "
"lan ngurutaké"

msgid "Ideal for using date and time calculations or comparisons"
msgstr "Cocog kanggo nggunakake itungan utawa perbandingan tanggal lan wektu"

msgid ""
"Date and time stored in the form of seconds since January 1, 1970 "
"(UTC)"
msgstr "Tanggal lan wektu disimpen ing wangun detik wiwit 1 Januari 1970 (UTC)"

msgid "Compact and efficient for storage, sorting and calculations"
msgstr "Compact lan efisien kanggo panyimpenan, nyortir, lan perhitungan"

msgid ""
"The user %username does not have administrator access. For more "
