"href=\"@secure-user-1-docs\">securing the admin super user</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna %username ora nduwèni aksès administrator. Kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap, delengen dokumentasi babagan <a "
"href=\"@secure-user-1-docs\">njaga pangguna super admin</a>."

