msgstr ""
"Cocok kanggo nyimpen durasi sing kasusun saka tanggal wiwitan lan "
"pungkasan (lan wektu)"

msgid ""
"Choose between setting both date and time, or date only, for each "
"duration"
msgstr ""
"Pilih antara nyetel loro tanggal lan wektu, utawa tanggal wae, kanggo "
"saben durasi"

msgid ""
"The system automatically validates that the end date (and time) is "
"later than the start, and both fields are completed"
msgstr ""
"Sistem sacara otomatis mriksa manawa tanggal pungkasan (lan wektu) "
"luwih telat tinimbang tanggal wiwitan, lan loro kolom wis diisi kanthi "
"lengkap."

msgid "File already locked for writing."
msgstr "Berkas wis dikunci kanggo nulis."

msgid "Bytes (KB, MB, ...)"
msgstr "Bytes (KB, MB, ...)"

msgid "For uploading files"
msgstr "Kanggo ngunggah berkas"

msgid ""
"Can be configured with options such as allowed file extensions and "
"maximum upload size"
msgstr ""
"Bisa dikonfigurasi nganggo pilihan kaya ekstensi file sing diijini lan "
"ukuran unggahan maksimal"

msgid "Temporary file data for could not be written"
msgstr "Data file sementara kanggo ora bisa ditulis"

msgid "Temporary file could not be opened for file upload"
msgstr "File sementara ora bisa dibukak kanggo unggahan file"

msgid ""
"No image toolkit is configured on the site. Check PHP installed "
"extensions or add a contributed toolkit that doesn't require a PHP "
"extension. Make sure that at least one valid image toolkit is "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana toolkit gambar sing dikonfigurasi ing situs iki. Priksa "
"ekstensi PHP sing wis diinstal utawa tambahake toolkit kontribusi sing "
"ora mbutuhake ekstensi PHP. Pasthekake yen paling ora ana siji toolkit "
"gambar sing bener-bener terinstal."

msgid "For uploading images"
msgstr "Kanggo ngunggah gambar"

msgid ""
"Allows a user to upload an image with configurable extensions, image "
"dimensions, upload size"
msgstr ""
"Ngidini pangguna ngunggah gambar nganggo ekstensi sing bisa disetel, "
"dimensi gambar, ukuran unggahan"

msgid ""
"Can be configured with options such as allowed file extensions, "
"maximum upload size and image dimensions minimums/maximums"
msgstr ""
"Bisa dikonfigurasi nganggo pilihan kaya ekstensi file sing diidini, "
"ukuran unggahan maksimal, lan dimensi gambar minimal/maksimal"

msgid "Missing file with ID %id."
msgstr "Berkas karo ID %id ora ketemu."

msgid ""
"The \"@name\" at \"@target_entity_type_id:@target_bundle\" references "
"the \"@entity_type_id:@bundle\" entity type that does not exist."
msgstr ""
"\"@name\" ing \"@target_entity_type_id:@target_bundle\" ngrujuk "
"menyang jinis entitas \"@entity_type_id:@bundle\" sing ora ana."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":href\">online documentation "
"for the Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":href\">dokumentasi "
"online kanggo modul Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks</a>."

msgid "Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks"
msgstr "Layout Builder Mbukak Kabeh Blok Field"

msgid ""
"When enabled, this module exposes all fields for all entity view "
"displays. When disabled, only entity type bundles that have layout "
"builder enabled will have their fields exposed. Enabling this module "
"could significantly decrease performance on sites with a large number "
"of entity types and bundles."
msgstr ""
"Nalika diaktifake, modul iki ngetokake kabeh kolom kanggo kabeh "
"tampilan entitas. Nalika dipatèni, mung jenis entitas sing nganggo "
"layout builder sing bakal ngetokake kolom-kolomé. Ngaktifake modul "
"iki bisa nyuda kinerja kanthi signifikan ing situs sing nduwèni "
"jumlah jinis entitas lan bundel sing akèh."

msgid "Could not retrieve the remote URL (@url): %error"
msgstr "Ora bisa njupuk URL jarak jauh (@url): %error"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Media Mapping Constraint"
msgstr "Watesan Pemetaan Media"

msgid ""
"It is not possible to map the source field @source_field_name of a "
"media type."
msgstr ""
"Ora bisa kanggo ngetokake lapangan sumber @source_field_name saka "
"jinis media."

msgid "Migration messages"
msgstr "Pesen Migrasi"

msgid "View the migration messages."
msgstr "Delengen pesen migrasi."

msgid "View migration messages"
msgstr "Delengen pesen migrasi"

msgid "There are no migration message tables."
msgstr "Ora ana tabel pesen migrasi."

msgid "No migration messages available."
msgstr "Ora ana pesen migrasi sing kasedhiya."

msgid "The message table is missing for this migration."
msgstr "Tabel pesan ora kasedhiya kanggo migrasi iki."

msgid ""
"When there is an error processing a row, the migration system saves "
"the error message but not the source ID(s) of the row. That is why "
"some messages in this table have 'Not available' in the source ID "
"column(s)."
msgstr ""
"Nalika ana kesalahan nalika ngolah baris, sistem migrasi nyimpen pesen "
"kesalahan nanging ora nyimpen ID sumber saka baris kasebut. Mulané "
"sawetara pesen ing tabel iki nduwéni kolom ID sumber sing nulis 'Ora "
"kasedhiya'."

msgid ""
"The upgrade process may log messages about steps that require user "
"action or errors. This page allows you to view these messages"
msgstr ""
"Proses upgrade bisa ngetokake pesen babagan langkah-langkah sing butuh "
"tindakan saka pangguna utawa kesalahan. Kaca iki ngidini sampeyan "
"kanggo ndeleng pesen-pesen kasebut."

msgid "Review the detailed upgrade log."
msgstr "Priksa log upgrade sing rinci."

msgid ""
"Enter credentials for the database of the Drupal site you want to "
"upgrade, not the new site."
msgstr ""
"Lebokake kredensial kanggo database situs Drupal sing pengin sampeyan "
"upgrade, dudu situs anyar."

msgid "Check whether there is translated content of these types:"
msgstr "Priksa manawa ana isi sing wis diterjemahake saka jinis-jinis iki:"

msgid ""
"Possible ID conflicts for translations are not automatically detected "
"in the current version of Drupal. Refer to the <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">Upgrading Drupal handbook</a> for "
"instructions on how to avoid ID conflicts with translated content."
msgstr ""
"Konflik ID sing mungkin ana kanggo terjemahan ora dideteksi sacara "
"otomatis ing versi Drupal saiki. Delengen <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">Pandhuan Nganyari Drupal</a> kanggo "
"pandhuan carane ngindhari konflik ID karo konten sing wis "
"diterjemahake."

msgid ""
"<strong>Install all modules on this new site</strong> that are enabled "
"on the old site. For example, if the old site uses the Book module, "
"then install the Book module on this new site so that the existing "
"data can be imported to it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Pasang kabeh modul ing situs anyar iki</strong> sing wis "
"diaktifake ing situs lawas. Contone, yen situs lawas nggunakake modul "
"Book, banjur pasang modul Book ing situs anyar iki supaya data sing "
"wis ana bisa diimpor menyang situs kasebut."

msgid ""
"The Navigation module provides a left-aligned, collapsible, vertical "
"sidebar navigation."
msgstr ""
"Modul Navigation nyedhiyakake navigasi sidebar vertikal sing sejajar "
"kiwa lan bisa dilipat."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":docs\">online documentation "
"for the Navigation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":docs\">dokumentasi "
"online kanggo modul Navigasi</a>."

msgid ""
"This layout builder tool allows you to configure the blocks in the "
"navigation toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Piranti pembangun layout iki ngidini sampeyan nyetel blok-blok ing "
"toolbar navigasi."

msgid "Toolbar and Navigation modules are both installed"
msgstr "Modhul Toolbar lan Navigasi loro-lorone wis dipasang"

msgid ""
"The Navigation module is a complete replacement for the Toolbar module "
"and disables its functionality when both modules are installed. If you "
"are planning to continue using Navigation module, you can uninstall "
"the Toolbar module now."
msgstr ""
"Modhul Navigation iku panggantos lengkap kanggo modhul Toolbar lan "
"mateni fungsi saka modhul Toolbar nalika loro modhul mau dipasang. Yen "
"sampeyan ngrancang kanggo terus nggunakake modhul Navigation, sampeyan "
"bisa nyopot modhul Toolbar saiki."

msgid "Navigation Top Bar"
msgstr "Bantalan Navigasi Ndhuwur"

msgid "Saved navigation blocks"
msgstr "Blok navigasi sing disimpen"

msgid "Navigation Shortcuts"
msgstr "Panganggoan Navigasi"

msgid "Navigation flag"
msgstr "Bendera navigasi"

msgid "Values stored are floating-point numbers"
msgstr "Nilai sing disimpen iku angka floating-point"

msgid "For example, 'Fraction': 0 => 0, .25 => 1/4, .75 => 3/4, 1 => 1"
msgstr "Contone, 'Fraction': 0 => 0, .25 => 1/4, .75 => 3/4, 1 => 1"

msgid "Values stored are numbers without decimals"
msgstr "Nilai sing disimpen yaiku angka tanpa desimal"

msgid ""
"For example, 'Lifetime in days': 1 => 1 day, 7 => 1 week, 31 => 1 "
"month"
msgstr "Contone, 'Umur ing dina': 1 => 1 dina, 7 => 1 minggu, 31 => 1 sasi"

msgid "Values stored are text values"
msgstr "Nilai sing disimpen iku nilai teks"

msgid "For example, 'US States': IL => Illinois, IA => Iowa, IN => Indiana"
msgstr "Contone, 'Negara Bagian AS': IL => Illinois, IA => Iowa, IN => Indiana"

msgid ""
"Specify the existing path you wish to alias. For example: /node/28, "
"/media/1, /taxonomy/term/1."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan path sing wis ana sing pengin sampeyan aliasi. Contone: "
"/node/28, /media/1, /taxonomy/term/1."

msgid "Install the Help module for more information on the sizes attribute."
msgstr ""
"Pasang modul Help kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan atribut "
"sizes."

msgid ""
"This theme requires the listed modules to operate correctly. They must "
"first be installed by a user with permissions to do so."
msgstr ""
"Tema iki mbutuhake modul-modul sing kasebut supaya bisa mlaku kanthi "
"bener. Modul-modul kasebut kudu dipasang dhisik dening pangguna sing "
"duwe ijin kanggo nindakake iku."

msgid ""
"This theme requires the listed modules to operate correctly. They must "
"first be installed via the <a href=\":modules_url\">Extend page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tema iki mbutuhake modul-modul sing kasebut supaya bisa mlaku kanthi "
"bener. Modul-modul iki kudu dipasang dhisik liwat <a "
