msgid ""
"This module allows a site to automatically provide structured "
"metadata, aka \"meta tags\", about the site and individual pages."
msgstr ""
"Modul iki ngidini situs kanggo kanthi otomatis nyedhiyakake metadata "
"sing terstruktur, sing uga dikenal minangka \"meta tags\", babagan "
"situs lan kaca individu."

msgid ""
"The module uses <a href=\":tokens\">\"tokens\"</a> to automatically "
"fill in values for different meta tags. Specific values may also be "
"filled in."
msgstr ""
"Modul iki nggunakake <a href=\":tokens\">\"tokens\"</a> kanggo kanthi "
"otomatis ngisi nilai kanggo macem-macem tag meta. Nilai khusus uga "
"bisa diisi."

msgid "The best way of using Metatag is as follows:"
msgstr "Cara paling apik nggunakake Metatag yaiku kaya ing ngisor iki:"

msgid ""
"Customize the <a href=\":defaults\">global defaults</a>, fill in the "
"specific values and tokens that every page should have."
msgstr ""
"Atur <a href=\":defaults\">setelan global</a>, isi kanthi nilai lan "
"token sing spesifik sing kudu ana ing saben kaca."

msgid ""
"<a href=\":add\">Add more default configurations</a> as necessary for "
"different entity types and entity bundles, e.g. for different content "
"types or different vocabularies."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":add\">Tambah konfigurasi standar liyane</a> yen perlu "
"kanggo jinis entitas lan bundel entitas sing beda, contone kanggo "
"jinis konten utawa kosa kata sing beda."

msgid ""
"To override the meta tags for individual entities, e.g. for individual "
"nodes, add the \"Metatag\" field via the field settings for that "
"entity or bundle type."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngowahi tag meta kanggo entitas individu, contone kanggo node "
"individu, tambahake kolom \"Metatag\" liwat setelan kolom kanggo "
"entitas utawa jinis bundle kasebut."

msgid ""
"If the top-level configuration is not specific enough, additional "
"default meta tag configurations can be added for a specific entity "
"type or entity bundle, e.g. for a specific content type."
msgstr ""
"Yen konfigurasi tingkat paling dhuwur ora cukup spesifik, konfigurasi "
"tag meta standar tambahan bisa ditambahake kanggo jinis entitas "
"tartamtu utawa bundel entitas, contone kanggo jinis konten tartamtu."

msgid ""
"Meta tags can be further refined on a per-entity basis, e.g. for "
"individual nodes, by adding the \"Metatag\" field to that entity type "
"through its normal field settings pages."
msgstr ""
"Tag meta bisa luwih dipertajam saben entitas, contone kanggo node "
"individu, kanthi nambahake kolom \"Metatag\" menyang jinis entitas "
"kasebut liwat kaca setelan kolom sing biasa."

