msgid ""
"Administrators can add a <em>Paragraph</em> field to content types or "
"other entities, and configure which <em>Paragraphs types</em> to "
"include. When users create content, they can then add one or more "
"paragraphs by choosing the appropriate type from the dropdown list. "
"Users can also dragdrop these paragraphs. This allows users to add "
"structure to a page or other content (for example by adding an image, "
"a user reference, or a differently formatted block of text) more "
"easily then including it all in one text field or by using fields in a "
"pre-defined order."
msgstr ""
"Administrator bisa nambahake kolom <em>Paragraph</em> ing jinis konten "
"utawa entitas liyane, lan nyetel jinis <em>Paragraphs</em> sing arep "
"dilebokake. Nalika pangguna nggawe konten, dheweke bisa nambah siji "
"utawa luwih paragraf kanthi milih jinis sing cocog saka dhaptar "
"dropdown. Pangguna uga bisa nggeser-letakkan paragraf-paragraf iki. "
"Iki ngidini pangguna nambah struktur ing kaca utawa konten liyane "
"(umpamane kanthi nambah gambar, referensi pangguna, utawa blok teks "
"sing diformat beda) kanthi luwih gampang tinimbang nambahake kabeh ing "
"siji kolom teks utawa nggunakake kolom kanthi urutan sing wis "
"ditemtokake."

