msgid "Joined path"
msgstr "Gabung dalan"

msgid ""
"The array values each cleaned by Pathauto and then joined with the "
"slash into a string that resembles an URL."
msgstr ""
"Nilai-nilai array saben diresiki dening Pathauto lan banjur digabung "
"nganggo garis miring dadi string sing mirip URL."

msgid "Selection criteria"
msgstr "Kriteria pilihan"

msgid "Bulk generate"
msgstr "Nggawe akeh sekaligus"

msgid "Selection logic"
msgstr "Logika pilihan"

msgid "Pattern type"
msgstr "Tipe pola"

msgid "Delete options"
msgstr "Mbusak pilihan"

msgid "All of your %label path aliases have been deleted."
msgstr "Kabeh alias path %label sampeyan wis dibusak."

msgid "See <a href=\":pathauto-help\">Pathauto help</a> for details."
msgstr ""
"Delengen <a href=\":pathauto-help\">bantuan Pathauto</a> kanggo "
"rinciyan."

msgid ""
"Maximum length of aliases to generate. 100 is the recommended length. "
"@max is the maximum possible length."
msgstr ""
"Dawa maksimal saka alias sing bakal digawe. 100 iku dawa sing "
"dianjurake. @max iku dawa maksimal sing bisa."

msgid ""
"Maximum text length of any component in the alias (e.g., [title]). 100 "
"is the recommended length. @max is the maximum possible length."
msgstr ""
"Dawa maksimal teks saka sembarang komponèn ing alias (contone, "
"[title]). 100 iku dawa sing disaranake. @max yaiku dawa maksimal sing "
"bisa ana."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":url\">Redirect module settings</a> affect whether a "
"redirect is created when an alias is deleted."
msgstr ""
"Setelan <a href=\":url\">modul Redirect</a> mengaruh apa redirect "
"digawe nalika alias dihapus."

msgid ""
"Considering installing the <a href=\":url\">Redirect module</a> to get "
"redirects when your aliases change."
msgstr ""
"Nimbangake kanggo masang <a href=\":url\">modul Redirect</a> supaya "
"entuk pangalihan nalika aliasmu owah."

msgid ""
"Uncheck this to create a custom alias below. <a "
"href=\"@admin_link\">Configure URL alias patterns.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Copot centhang iki kanggo nggawe alias khusus ing ngisor iki. <a "
"href=\"@admin_link\">Atur pola alias URL.</a>"

msgid "Selection condition"
msgstr "Kondisi pilihan"

msgid ""
"Entity of type @type was not processed. It defines the following "
"patterns: @patterns"
msgstr ""
"Entitas saka jinis @type ora diproses. Iki nemtokake pola-pola ing "
"ngisor iki: @patterns"

msgid ""
"Unrecognized entity bundle @entity:@bundle was not processed. It "
"defines the following patterns: @patterns"
msgstr ""
"Bundel entitas @entity:@bundle sing ora dikenal ora diproses. Iki "
"nemtokake pola-pola ing ngisor iki: @patterns"

msgid "Add Pathauto pattern"
msgstr "Tambah pola Pathauto"

msgid "Pathauto pattern config"
msgstr "Konfigurasi pola Pathauto"

msgid "Pathauto state"
msgstr "Status Pathauto"

msgid "Whether an automated alias should be created or not."
msgstr "Apa alias otomatis kudu digawe utawa ora."

msgid "Pathauto pattern"
msgstr "Polatan pathauto"

msgid ""
"Check to which types this pattern should be applied. Leave empty to "
"allow any."
msgstr ""
"Priksa jinis-jinis endi sing kudu diterapake pola iki. Ditinggal "
"kosong supaya bisa kanggo kabeh jinis."

msgid ""
"Check to which languages this pattern should be applied. Leave empty "
"to allow any."
msgstr ""
"Priksa basa apa wae sing kudu dilebokake pola iki. Tinggalake kosong "
"kanggo ngidini sembarang basa."

msgid "@label being aliased"
msgstr "@label sing lagi dialihaké jenengnya"

msgid "Updated alias for %label @id."
msgstr "Alias sing wis dianyari kanggo %label @id."

msgid "Updated 1 %label URL alias."
msgid_plural "Updated @count %label URL aliases."
msgstr[0] ""
"Dianyari 1 alias URL %label.  \n"
"Dianyari @count alias URL %label."

msgid ""
"When a pattern includes certain characters (such as those with "
"accents) should Pathauto attempt to transliterate them into the "
"US-ASCII alphabet?"
msgstr ""
"Nalika pola ngemot karakter tartamtu (kaya sing nganggo aksen), apa "
"Pathauto kudu nyoba transliterasi dadi alfabet US-ASCII?"

msgid ""
"This page provides a list of all patterns on the site and allows you "
"to edit and reorder them."
msgstr ""
"Kaca iki nyedhiyakake dhaftar kabeh pola ing situs lan ngidini "
"sampeyan sunting lan ngatur urutane."

msgid ""
"The %element-title is using the following invalid characters: "
"@invalid-characters."
msgstr ""
"%element-title nggunakake karakter sing ora sah ing ngisor iki: "
"@invalid-characters."

msgid "Convert token values to lowercase."
msgstr "Ngonversi nilai token dadi huruf cilik."

msgid "Are you sure you want to disable the pattern %label?"
msgstr "Apa sampeyan yakin pengin mateni pola %label?"

msgid "Disabled patterns are ignored when generating aliases."
msgstr "Polah sing dipatèni ora dianggep nalika nggawe alias."

msgid "Disabled pattern %label."
msgstr "Pola %label wis dipatèni."

msgid "Are you sure you want to enable the pattern %label?"
msgstr "Apa sampeyan yakin pengin ngaktifake pola %label?"

msgid "Enabled pattern %label."
msgstr "Pola %label wis diaktifake."

msgid "Update URL alias of an entity"
msgstr "Nganyari alias URL saka sawijining entitas"

msgid ""
"The Pathauto module provides a mechanism to automate the creation of "
"<a href=\"path\">path</a> aliases. This makes URLs more readable and "
"helps search engines index content more effectively.  For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for "
"Pathauto</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Pathauto nyedhiyakake mekanisme kanggo otomatis nggawe alias <a "
"href=\"path\">path</a>. Iki nggawe URL luwih gampang diwaca lan mbantu "
"mesin telusur ngindeks isi luwih efektif. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":online\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"Pathauto</a>."

msgid ""
"Pathauto is accessed from the tabs it adds to the list of <a "
"href=\":aliases\">URL aliases</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pathauto bisa diakses saka tab sing ditambahake ing dhaptar <a "
"href=\":aliases\">alias URL</a>."

msgid "Creating Pathauto Patterns"
msgstr "Nggawe Pola Pathauto"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":pathauto_pattern\">\"Patterns\"</a> page is used to "
"configure automatic path aliasing.  New patterns are created here "
"using the <a href=\":add_form\">Add Pathauto pattern</a> button which "
"presents a form to simplify pattern creation thru the use of <a "
"href=\"token\">available tokens</a>. The patterns page provides a list "
"of all patterns on the site and allows you to edit and reorder them. "
"An alias is generated for the first pattern that applies."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <a href=\":pathauto_pattern\">\"Patterns\"</a> digunakake kanggo "
"nyetel alias path otomatis. Pola anyar digawe ing kene nganggo tombol "
"<a href=\":add_form\">Tambah Pola Pathauto</a> sing nyedhiyakake "
"formulir kanggo nggampangake nggawe pola liwat panggunaan <a "
"href=\"token\">token sing kasedhiya</a>. Kaca pola nyedhiyakake "
"dhaptar kabeh pola sing ana ing situs lan ngidini sampeyan ngowahi lan "
"ngatur maneh. Alias digawe kanggo pola pisanan sing ditrapake."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":settings\">\"Settings\"</a> page is used to customize "
"global Pathauto settings for automated pattern creation."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <a href=\":settings\">\"Setelan\"</a> digunakake kanggo ngatur "
"setelan Pathauto global kanggo nggawe pola otomatis."

msgid "Bulk Generation"
msgstr "Generasi Massal"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":pathauto_bulk\">\"Bulk Generate\"</a> page allows you "
"to create URL aliases for items that currently have no aliases. This "
"is typically used when installing Pathauto on a site that has existing "
"un-aliased content that needs to be aliased in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Halaman <a href=\":pathauto_bulk\">\"Bulk Generate\"</a> ngidini "
"sampeyan nggawe alias URL kanggo item sing saiki durung duwe alias. "
"Iki biasane digunakake nalika masang Pathauto ing situs sing wis duwe "
"konten tanpa alias sing kudu dialiase kanthi massal."

msgid "Delete Aliases"
msgstr "Mbusak Aliases"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":pathauto_delete\">\"Delete Aliases\"</a> page allows "
"you to remove URL aliases from items that have previously been "
"assigned aliases using pathauto."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <a href=\":pathauto_delete\">\"Busak Alias\"</a> ngidini sampeyan "
"mbusak alias URL saka barang-barang sing wis tau diwenehi alias "
"nganggo pathauto."

msgid ""
"You need to select a pattern type, then a pattern and filter, and a "
"label. Additional types can be enabled on the <a "
"href=\":settings\">Settings</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan kudu milih jinis pola, banjur pola lan saringan, lan label. "
"Jinis tambahan bisa diaktifake ing kaca <a "
"href=\":settings\">Setelan</a>."

msgid "Enabled entity types"
msgstr "Jenis entitas sing diaktifake"

msgid ""
"Enable to add a path field and allow to define alias patterns for the "
"given type. Disabled types already define a path field themselves or "
"currently have a pattern."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake kanggo nambahake kolom path lan paring ijin kanggo netepake "
"pola alias kanggo jinis sing diwenehake. Jinis sing wis dipatèni "
"biasane wis netepake kolom path dhewe utawa saiki wis duwe pola."

msgid "Broken type"
msgstr "Tipe rusak"

msgid "AliasType"
msgstr "AliasType"

msgid ""
"Bulk generation can be used to generate URL aliases for items that "
"currently have no aliases. This is typically used when installing "
"Pathauto on a site that has existing un-aliased content that needs to "
"be aliased in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Panganggone bulk generation bisa digunakake kanggo nggawe alias URL "
"kanggo barang-barang sing saiki durung nduweni alias. Iki biasane "
"digunakake nalika masang Pathauto ing situs sing nduweni isi tanpa "
"alias sing kudu dialiase kanthi bulk."

msgid ""
"It can also be used to regenerate URL aliases for items that have an "
"old alias and for which the Pathauto pattern has been changed."
msgstr ""
"Uga bisa digunakake kanggo ngasilake maneh alias URL kanggo item-item "
"sing duwe alias lawas lan sing pola Pathauto-e wis diganti."

msgid ""
"Note that this will only affect items which are configured to have "
"their URL alias automatically set. Items whose URL alias is manually "
"set are not affected."
msgstr ""
"Mesthekake yen iki mung bakal mengaruhi item-item sing dikonfigurasi "
"supaya alias URL-e disetel kanthi otomatis. Item-item sing alias URL-e "
"disetel kanthi manual ora kena pengaruh."

msgid "The %element-title doesn't allow the patterns ending with whitespace."
msgstr "%element-title ora ngidini pola sing pungkasan nganggo spasi."

msgid "Select the types of paths for which to generate URL aliases"
msgstr "Pilih jinis dalan kanggé nggawe alias URL"

msgid "Select which URL aliases to generate"
msgstr "Pilih alias URL sing arep digawe"

msgid "Generate a URL alias for un-aliased paths only"
msgstr "Nggawe alias URL mung kanggo path sing durung duwe alias"

msgid ""
"<a href=\":url\">Pathauto settings</a> are set to ignore paths which "
"already have a URL alias. You can only create URL aliases for paths "
"having none."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":url\">Setelan Pathauto</a> disetel kanggo nglirwakake path "
"sing wis duwe alias URL. Sampeyan mung bisa nggawe alias URL kanggo "
"path sing durung nduweni."

msgid "Update the URL alias for paths having an old URL alias"
msgstr "Nganyari alias URL kanggo jalur sing duwe alias URL lawas"

msgid "Regenerate URL aliases for all paths"
msgstr "Nggawe maneh alias URL kanggo kabeh path"

msgid "A short name to help you identify this pattern in the patterns list."
msgstr "Jeneng cekak kanggo mbantu sampeyan ngenali pola iki ing dhaptar pola."

msgid "Only delete automatically generated aliases"
msgstr "Mung mbusak alias sing digawe sacara otomatis"

msgid ""
"When checked, aliases which have been manually set are not affected by "
"this mass-deletion."
msgstr ""
"Nalika dipriksa, alias sing wis disetel kanthi manual ora kena "
"pengaruh dening panghapusan massal iki."

msgid "Bulk deleting URL aliases"
msgstr "Mbusak alias URL kanthi massal"

msgid "All of your automatically generated path aliases have been deleted."
msgstr "Kabeh alias path sing digawe otomatis wis dihapus."

msgid ""
"All of your automatically generated %label path aliases have been "
"deleted."
msgstr "Kabeh alias path %label sing digawe otomatis wis dibusak."

msgid "Tokens that are safe to use and do not need to be cleaned."
msgstr "Token sing aman digunakake lan ora perlu dibersihake."

msgid "Safe tokens"
msgstr "Token aman"

msgid ""
"List of tokens that are safe to use in alias patterns and do not need "
"to be cleaned. For example urls, aliases, machine names. Separated "
"with a comma."
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar token sing aman digunakake ing pola alias lan ora perlu "
"dibersihake. Contone url, alias, jeneng mesin. Dipisah nganggo koma."

msgid "Pattern %label saved."
msgstr "Pola %label wis disimpen."

msgid "Duplicate Pathauto pattern"
msgstr "Polatan Pathauto duplikat"

msgid "Choose the action to perform."
msgstr "Pilih tindakan sing arep ditindakake."

msgid ""
"Invalid action argument \"@invalid_action\". Please use one of: "
"@valid_actions"
msgstr ""
"Argumen tumindak \"@invalid_action\" ora sah. Mangga gunakake salah "
"siji saka: @valid_actions"

msgid ""
"Invalid type argument \"@invalid_types\". Please choose from the "
"following: @valid_types"
msgstr ""
"Argumen jinis \"@invalid_types\" ora valid. Mangga pilih saka ing "
"ngisor iki: @valid_types"

msgid "Generate a URL alias for un-aliased paths only."
msgstr "Nggawe alias URL mung kanggo jalur sing durung duwe alias."

msgid "Update the URL alias for paths having an old URL alias."
msgstr "Nganyari alias URL kanggo path sing nduwéni alias URL lawas."

msgid "Regenerate URL aliases for all paths."
msgstr "Nggawe maneh alias URL kanggo kabeh path."

msgid "The name of the pattern's variable."
msgstr "Jeneng variabel saka pola kasebut."

msgid "The value of the pattern's variable."
msgstr "Nilai saka variabel pola kasebut."

msgid ""
"The <strong>maximum alias length</strong> and <strong>maximum "
"component length</strong> values default to 100 and have a limit of "
"@max from Pathauto. You should enter a value that is the length of the "
"\"alias\" column of the path_alias database table minus the length of "
"any strings that might get added to the end of the URL. The "
"recommended and default value is 100."
msgstr ""
"Nilai <strong>daerah alias maksimum</strong> lan <strong>daerah "
"komponen maksimum</strong> defaulté 100 lan nduwèni wates @max saka "
"Pathauto. Sampeyan kudu ngetik nilai sing padha karo dawa kolom "
"\"alias\" ing tabel basis data path_alias dikurangi dawa saka "
"sembarang string sing bisa ditambahaké ing pungkasan URL. Nilai sing "
"disaranake lan defaulté yaiku 100."

msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> there is no confirmation. Be sure of your "
"action before clicking the \"Delete aliases now!\" button.<br />You "
"may want to make a backup of the database and/or the path_alias and "
"path_alias_revision tables prior to using this feature."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Cathetan:</strong> ora ana konfirmasi. Priksa tenan tindakmu "
"sadurunge ngeklik tombol \"Delete aliases now!\"<br />Sampeyan bisa "
"uga pengin nggawe serep basis data lan/utawa tabel path_alias lan "
"path_alias_revision sadurunge nggunakake fitur iki."

msgid "General settings"
msgstr "Sétingan umum"

msgid "Widget settings"
msgstr "Setelan widget"

msgid "reCAPTCHA"
msgstr "reCAPTCHA"

msgid "Secret key"
msgstr "Kunci rahasia"

msgid "Defines which theme to use for reCAPTCHA."
msgstr "Nemtokake tema sing bakal digunakake kanggo reCAPTCHA."

msgid "Site key"
msgstr "Kunci situs"

msgid "@error"
msgstr "@error"

msgid "Image (default)"
msgstr "Gambar (bawaan)"

msgid "Administer the Google No CAPTCHA reCAPTCHA web service."
msgstr "Ngatur layanan web Google No CAPTCHA reCAPTCHA."

msgid "Administer reCAPTCHA"
msgstr "Ngatur reCAPTCHA"

msgid "Normal (default)"
msgstr "Normal (default)"

msgid "Light (default)"
msgstr "Cahya (standar)"

msgid "The type of CAPTCHA to serve."
msgstr "Jinis CAPTCHA sing bakal digunakake."

msgid "Enable fallback for browsers with JavaScript disabled"
msgstr "Aktifake fallback kanggo browser sing JavaScript-e dipatèni"

msgid ""
"If JavaScript is a requirement for your site, you should "
"<strong>not</strong> enable this feature. With this enabled, a "
"compatibility layer will be added to the captcha to support non-js "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Yen JavaScript dadi syarat kanggo situs sampeyan, sampeyan kudu "
"<strong>ora</strong> ngaktifake fitur iki. Kanthi fitur iki "
"diaktifake, lapisan kompatibilitas bakal ditambahake menyang captcha "
"kanggo ndhukung pangguna sing ora nganggo js."

msgid "The secret parameter is missing."
msgstr "Parameter rahasia ora ana."

msgid "The secret parameter is invalid or malformed."
msgstr "Parameter rahasia ora valid utawa ora wujud kanthi bener."

msgid "The response parameter is missing."
msgstr "Parameter response ora ana."

msgid "The response parameter is invalid or malformed."
msgstr "Paramèter responsé ora sah utawa mbentuké salah."

msgid ""
"Protect your website from spam and abuse while letting real people "
"pass through with ease."
msgstr ""
"Lindhungi situs web sampeyan saka spam lan panyalahgunaan nalika "
"ngidini wong asli mlebu kanthi gampang."

msgid "The json response is invalid or malformed."
msgstr "Respon json ora bener utawa rusak."

msgid ""
"Google <a href=\":url\">reCAPTCHA</a> is a free service to protect "
"your website from spam and abuse. reCAPTCHA uses an advanced risk "
"analysis engine and adaptive CAPTCHAs to keep automated software from "
"engaging in abusive activities on your site. It does this while "
"letting your valid users pass through with ease."
msgstr ""
"Google <a href=\":url\">reCAPTCHA</a> iku layanan gratis kanggo "
"nglindhungi situs web sampeyan saka spam lan penyalahgunaan. reCAPTCHA "
"nggunakake mesin analisis risiko sing maju lan CAPTCHA adaptif kanggo "
"nyegah piranti lunak otomatis supaya ora melu kegiatan nyalahake ing "
"situs sampeyan. Iki dilakoni kanthi ngidini pangguna sing sah bisa "
"mlebu kanthi gampang."

msgid "Administer reCAPTCHA settings."
msgstr "Ngatur setelan reCAPTCHA."

msgid "reCAPTCHA settings"
msgstr "setelan reCAPTCHA"

msgid "The size of CAPTCHA to serve."
msgstr "Ukuran CAPTCHA sing bakal digunakake."

msgid "@info"
msgstr "@info"

msgid "Protects and defends"
msgstr "Ngayomi lan mbela"

msgid ""
"reCAPTCHA is built for security. Armed with state of the art "
"technology, it always stays at the forefront of spam and abuse "
"fighting trends. reCAPTCHA is on guard for you, so you can rest easy."
msgstr ""
"reCAPTCHA digawe kanggo keamanan. Kanthi teknologi paling anyar, "
"reCAPTCHA tansah dadi sing paling ngarep ing perang nglawan spam lan "
"penyalahgunaan. reCAPTCHA siap nglindhungi kowe, supaya kowe bisa "
"tentrem."

msgid ""
"You will now find a reCAPTCHA tab in the CAPTCHA administration page "
"available at: Administration > Configuration > People > CAPTCHA module "
"settings > reCAPTCHA"
msgstr ""
"Saiki sampeyan bakal nemokake tab reCAPTCHA ing kaca administrasi "
"CAPTCHA sing kasedhiya ing: Administrasi > Konfigurasi > Wong > "
"Setelan modul CAPTCHA > reCAPTCHA"

msgid ""
"Register your web site at <a "
"href=\":url\">https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin/create</a>"
msgstr ""
"Daftarin situs web sampeyan ing <a "
"href=\":url\">https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin/create</a>"

msgid "Input the site and private keys into the reCAPTCHA settings."
msgstr "Lebokna kunci situs lan kunci pribadi menyang setelan reCAPTCHA."

msgid ""
"Visit the Captcha administration page and set where you want the "
"reCAPTCHA form to be presented: Administration > Configuration > "
"People > CAPTCHA module settings"
msgstr ""
"Bukak kaca administrasi Captcha lan atur panggonan ing ngendi sampeyan "
"pengin formulir reCAPTCHA ditampilake: Administration > Configuration "
"> People > CAPTCHA module settings"

msgid "Local domain name validation"
msgstr "Validasi jeneng domain lokal"

msgid ""
"Checks the hostname on your server when verifying a solution. Enable "
"this validation only, if <em>Verify the origin of reCAPTCHA "
"solutions</em> is unchecked for your key pair. Provides crucial "
"security by verifying requests come from one of your listed domains."
msgstr ""
"Mriksa hostname ing server sampeyan nalika mriksa solusi. Aktifake "
"validasi iki mung yen <em>Verify the origin of reCAPTCHA "
"solutions</em> ora dicenthang kanggo pasangan kunci sampeyan. "
"Nyedhiyakake keamanan penting kanthi mriksa yen panjalukan asalé saka "
"salah siji domain sing kadhaptar."

msgid "Expected action did not match."
msgstr "Tindakan sing diarepake ora cocog."

msgid "Expected APK package name did not match."
msgstr "Jeneng paket APK sing dikarepake ora cocog."

msgid "Did not receive a 200 from the service."
msgstr "Ora nampa 200 saka layanan kasebut."

msgid "The request is invalid or malformed."
msgstr "Panjaluk ora valid utawa ora bener formaté."

msgid "Challenge timeout."
msgstr "Wektu tantangan wis entek."

msgid "Could not connect to service."
msgstr "Ora bisa nyambung menyang layanan."

msgid "Expected hostname did not match."
msgstr "Jeneng host sing diarepake ora cocog."

msgid "Score threshold not met."
msgstr "Ambang skor ora ketemu."

msgid "Not a success, but no error codes received!"
msgstr "Ora sukses, nanging ora ana kode kesalahan sing ditampa!"

msgid "The challenge response timed out or was already verified."
msgstr "Wektu tanggapan tantangan wis kadaluwarsa utawa wis diverifikasi."

msgid "Use reCAPTCHA globally"
msgstr "Gunakake reCAPTCHA sacara global"

msgid ""
"Enable this in circumstances when \"www.google.com\" is not "
"accessible, e.g. China."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake iki nalika kahanan \"www.google.com\" ora bisa diakses, "
"contone ing China."

msgid "Enable reCAPTCHA and CAPTCHA modules in Administration > Extend"
msgstr "Aktifake modul reCAPTCHA lan CAPTCHA ing Administrasi > Perluas"

msgid ""
"The site key given to you when you <a href=\":url\" "
"target=\"_blank\">register for reCAPTCHA</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kunci situs sing diwenehake marang sampeyan nalika sampeyan <a "
"href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">ndaftar kanggo reCAPTCHA</a>."

msgid ""
"The secret key given to you when you <a href=\":url\" "
"target=\"_blank\">register for reCAPTCHA</a>."
