"Allows elements with options (i.e. select, checkboxes, and radios) to "
"have option specific submission limits."
msgstr ""
"Ngginakaké unsur karo pilihan (contone pilih, kotak centhang, lan "
"radio) supaya nduwèni watesan kiriman khusus kanggo saben pilihan."

