msgstr "Sesuaikan tabel bawaan"

msgid ""
"Below you can customize your dedicated results table, which is "
"displayed only to you."
msgstr ""
"Ing ngisor iki sampeyan bisa ngatur tabel asil khusus sampeyan, sing "
"mung ditampilake kanggo sampeyan."

