"href=\":href\">PSA-XXXXX</a>)"

msgid "Enable form sharing"
msgstr "Aktifake nuduhake formulir"

msgid "Enable form sharing for webform nodes"
msgstr "Aktifake bagéan form kanggo nodus webform"

msgid "Shared form theme"
msgstr "Tema formulir sing dienggo bareng"

msgid "Display shared form title"
msgstr "Tampilake judhul formulir sing dienggo bareng"

msgid "Shared form page attributes"
msgstr "Atribut kaca formulir sing dienggo bareng"

msgid "Default shared form theme"
msgstr "Tema form bebarengan standar"

msgid "Allows webforms to be shared on other websites using an iframe."
msgstr ""
"Ngidini webforms kanggo dibagi ing situs web liyane kanthi nggunakake "
"iframe."

msgid "Code copied to clipboard…"
msgstr "Kode wis disalin menyang clipboard…"

msgid ""
"To test anonymous user access to the below embedded webform, please "
"log out or open the below link in a new private or incognito window."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nyoba akses panganggo anonim ing webform sing disisipake ing "
"ngisor iki, mangga metu saka akun utawa bukak tautan ing ngisor iki "
"ing jendhela anyar sing pribadi utawa incognito."

msgid ""
"Choose how you want to embed the webform and then copy-n-paste the "
"below code snippet directly into the HTML source of any webpage."
msgstr ""
"Pilih cara sampeyan pengin nyelipake webform lan banjur salin-tempel "
"snippet kode ing ngisor iki langsung menyang sumber HTML saka "
"sembarang kaca web."

msgid ""
"Resizing iframe -- The embedded webform will be responsive and "
"adjusted to fit within the page using an iframe and JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Ngowahi ukuran iframe -- Webform sing disematake bakal responsif lan "
"disetel supaya pas ing kaca nggunakake iframe lan JavaScript."

msgid ""
"Fixed iframe -- The embedded webform will be a fixed size on the page "
"using an iframe with a scrollbar."
msgstr ""
"Iframe tetep -- Webform sing disisipake bakal nduwèni ukuran tetep "
"ing kaca kanthi nggunakake iframe sing duwe scrollbar."

msgid "Resizing iframe code"
msgstr "Ngowahi ukuran kode iframe"

msgid "Form sharing enabled"
msgstr "Form sharing aktif"

msgid "Form sharing is enabled for all webforms."
msgstr "Bageyan formulir diaktifake kanggo kabeh webform."

msgid "If checked, form sharing will be enabled for this webform."
msgstr "Yen dipriksa, pangiriman formulir bakal diaktifake kanggo webform iki."

msgid "If checking, form sharing will be enabled for all webform nodes."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, nuduhake formulir bakal diaktifake kanggo kabeh node "
"webform."

msgid "Select the theme that will be used to render all shared webforms."
msgstr ""
"Pilih tema sing bakal digunakake kanggo nampilake kabeh webform sing "
"dienggo bebarengan."

msgid "Sort the options by their (translated) labels."
msgstr "Urutake pilihan miturut labélé (sing wis diterjemahaké)."

msgid "Share webform variants"
msgstr "Barengake varian webform"

msgid ""
"Provides an element that generates or loads a file that can be "
"attached to a submission or email."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake unsur sing ngasilake utawa ngundhuh file sing bisa "
"dipasangake menyang kiriman utawa email."

msgid "Share variants"
msgstr "Bareng varian-varian"

