msgid "Disable the tracking of user IP address"
msgstr "Mateni pelacakan alamat IP pangguna"

msgid "Disable the tracking of user IP addresses for all webforms"
msgstr "Mateni pelacakan alamat IP pangguna kanggo kabeh webform"

msgid "If checked, a user's IP address will not be recorded for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, alamat IP pangguna ora bakal direkam kanggo kabeh "
"webform."

msgid "Webforms for Everyone"
msgstr "Webforms kanggo Kabeh Wong"

msgid ""
"This presentation explores how site owners, site builders, and "
"developers can leverage the Webform module for Drupal 8 to build "
"complex and robust forms for their end-users."
msgstr ""
"Presentasi iki njelajahake carane para pemilik situs, pembangun situs, "
"lan pangembang bisa nggunakake modul Webform kanggo Drupal 8 kanggo "
"nggawe formulir sing kompleks lan kuat kanggo pangguna pungkasané."

msgid "Broken/missing webform variant plugin."
msgstr "Plugin varian webform sing rusak/ilang."

msgid "<code>:htmldecode</code> decodes HTML entities in returned value."
msgstr ""
"<code>:htmldecode</code> ngdecode entitas HTML ing nilai sing "
"dibalekake."

msgid "Hide the next button when auto-forwarding"
msgstr "Nyumputaké tombol sabanjuré nalika ngirim otomatis"

msgid "Default delete button label"
msgstr "Label tombol hapus standar"

msgid ""
"Check if Webform Clientside Validation module is installed when using "
"the Clientside Validation module"
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa modul Webform Clientside Validation wis diinstal nalika "
"nggunakake modul Clientside Validation"

msgid "Webform: Clientside validation"
msgstr "Webform: Validasi sisi klien"

msgid "Webform Clientside Validation module installed."
msgstr "Modul Validasi Klien Webform wis dipasang."

msgid "Webform Clientside Validation module not installed."
msgstr "Modul Validasi Klien Webform durung dipasang."

msgid ""
"The Webform Clientside Validation module helps support Webform "
"Clientside Validation integration. <a href=\":href\">Disable Webform "
"Clientside Validation warning</a>"
msgstr ""
"Modul Webform Clientside Validation mbantu ndhukung integrasi Webform "
"Clientside Validation. <a href=\":href\">Pateni peringatan Webform "
"Clientside Validation</a>"

msgid "Helps support Webform Clientside Validation integration."
msgstr "Mbantu ndhukung integrasi Validasi Klien Webform."

msgid "Show add element button"
msgstr "Tampilaké tombol tambah elemen"

msgid "If unchecked, the add button will be removed from each table row."
msgstr "Yen ora dipriksa, tombol tambah bakal dihapus saka saben baris tabel."

msgid "If left blank all webforms will be listed in the select menu."
msgstr "Yen dibiarkan kosong, kabeh webform bakal kadhaptar ing menu pilih."

msgid ""
"This is displayed after a draft or submission has been saved to the "
"database. The delete button is also included within the submission "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Iki ditampilake sawisé draf utawa kiriman wis disimpen ing basis "
"data. Tombol hapus uga kalebu ing informasi kiriman."

msgid "Open delete confirmation form in a modal dialog."
msgstr "Mbukak formulir konfirmasi hapus ing dialog modal."

msgid "<code>:clear</code> removes the token when it is not replaced."
msgstr "<code>:clear</code> mbusak token nalika ora diganti."

msgid "Navigate between cards when the left or right arrow is pressed"
msgstr "Pindhah antar kartu nalika panah kiwa utawa tengen dipencet"

msgid "Include submission data"
msgstr "Kalebu data kiriman"

msgid "Display webforms as a top-level item in toolbar"
msgstr "Tampilake webforms minangka item tingkat paling ndhuwur ing toolbar"

msgid "Navigate between cards using left or right arrow keys"
msgstr "Pindhah antarane kartu nganggo tombol panah kiwa utawa tengen"

msgid ""
"If checked, users will be able to move between cards using the left or "
"right arrow keys."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, panganggo bakal bisa pindhah antar kertu nganggo tombol "
"panah kiwa utawa tengen."

msgid ""
"Display Webforms as a top-level administration menu item in the "
"toolbar"
msgstr ""
"Tampilaké Webforms minangka item menu administrasi tingkat paling "
"dhuwur ing toolbar"

msgid ""
"If checked, the Webforms section will be displayed as a top-level "
"administration menu item in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Yen dicenthang, bagean Webforms bakal ditampilake minangka item menu "
"administrasi tingkat ndhuwur ing toolbar."

msgid ""
"Computing complex or multiple values with or without Ajax can be "
"resource intensive and may have performance implications. When "
"possible try limiting or combining computations or consider using "
"custom Twig functions, JavaScript, or PHP."
msgstr ""
"Nglakoni perhitungan nilai komplek utawa luwih saka siji, nganggo "
"utawa tanpa Ajax, bisa mbutuhake sumber daya sing gedhe lan bisa "
"nduweni pengaruh marang kinerja. Yen bisa, coba watesi utawa gabungake "
"perhitungan, utawa gunakake fungsi Twig khusus, JavaScript, utawa PHP."

msgid "Include submission properties"
msgstr "Kalebu properti pangiriman"

msgid "Submitted properties and values are:"
msgstr "Properti lan nilai sing dikirimake yaiku:"

msgid "Include submission properties:"
msgstr "Kalebu properti kiriman:"

msgid "Select the webform that you would like to display in this block."
msgstr "Pilih webform sing pengin sampeyan tampilkake ing blok iki."

msgid "You can also use paragraphs tokens."
msgstr "Sampeyan uga bisa nggunakake token paragraf."

msgid "Submit %title form"
msgstr "Kirim formulir %title"

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the element is never displayed. The element will only be "
"visible within the form builder and hidden from all other displays "
"including submission details, results, and download."
msgstr ""
"Yen ora dicenthang, elemen kasebut ora bakal tau ditampilake. Elemen "
"mung bakal katon ing jero form builder lan disumputake saka kabeh "
"tampilan liyane kalebu rincian pengiriman, asil, lan undhuhan."

msgid "Webform: jQuery UI Datepicker"
msgstr "Webform: jQuery UI Datepicker"

msgid "Form elements attributes"
msgstr "Atribut elemen formulir"

msgid "Protect all webforms with Antibot"
msgstr "Lindhungi kabeh webform nganggo Antibot"

msgid "Provided by the @plugin_id mail plugin."
msgstr "Disedhiyakake déning plugin mail @plugin_id."

msgid ""
"Entered text will be displayed on the handlers administrative page and "
"replace this handler's default description."
msgstr ""
"Teks sing dilebokaké bakal ditampilaké ing kaca administrasi "
"pangolah lan nggantèkaké katrangan bawaan pangolah iki."

msgid "Entered text will be displayed on the variants administrative page."
msgstr "Teks sing dilebokake bakal ditampilake ing kaca administrasi varian."

msgid "Provides a form element to collect height in feet and inches."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake elemen formulir kanggo nglumpukake dhuwur ing sikil lan "
"inci."

msgid "Allows users to view the Webform module's help page."
msgstr "Ngidini pangguna kanggo ndeleng kaca pitulungan modul Webform."

msgid "Delete (token) URL"
msgstr "Mbusak URL (token)"

msgid ""
"The URL that can used to delete the webform submission. The webform "
"must be configured to allow users to delete a submission using a "
"secure token."
msgstr ""
"URL sing bisa digunakake kanggo mbusak kiriman webform. Webform kudu "
"dikonfigurasi supaya pangguna bisa mbusak kiriman nganggo token sing "
"aman."

msgid "Allow deleting a submission using token"
msgstr "Ngidini mbusak kiriman nganggo token"

msgid ""
"If checked users will be able to delete a submission using the "
"webform's URL appended with the submission's (secure) token."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, pangguna bakal bisa mbusak kiriman nggunakake URL "
"webform sing dilebokake token (aman) saka kiriman kasebut."

msgid ""
"Only webforms that are open to new submissions can be deleted using "
"the secure token."
msgstr ""
"Mung webform sing isih mbukak kanggo kiriman anyar sing bisa dibusak "
"kanthi nggunakake token aman."

