msgid "Enable hoverIntent"
msgstr "Aktifake hoverIntent"

msgid ""
"Provides a workaround for the common problem that users with 'Use the "
"administration pages and help' permission see menu links they don't "
"have access permission for. Deprecated from Drupal 10.3 and above."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake solusi kanggo masalah umum sing dialami pangguna sing "
"duwe ijin 'Gunakake kaca administrasi lan pitulung' nanging weruh "
"pranala menu sing ora duwe ijin akses. Wis ora dianjurake wiwit Drupal "
"10.3 lan versi sabanjure."

msgid "Admin Toolbar Search (Alt+a)"
msgstr "Panelusuran Admin Toolbar (Alt+a)"

msgid "Enable keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Aktifake tombol pintasan keyboard"

msgid "Enable keyboard shortcut (Alt + a)"
msgstr "Aktifake pintasan keyboard (Alt + a)"

msgid "Enable toggle toolbar keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Aktifake tombol pintas keyboard kanggo nguripake toolbar"

msgid "hoverIntent behavior"
msgstr "tindakan hoverIntent"

msgid "hoverIntent timeout"
msgstr "waktu tundha hoverIntent"

msgid "Hide Toolbar (Alt+p)"
msgstr "Sembunyikake Toolbar (Alt+p)"

msgid "Toolbar sticky behavior"
msgstr "Prilaku toolbar lengket"

msgid "Toolbar hoverIntent behavior"
msgstr "Tingkah laku hoverIntent Toolbar"

msgid "hoverIntent timeout (ms)"
msgstr "watesan wektu hoverIntent (ms)"

msgid "Maximum depth of displayed nested menu items."
msgstr "Kadalaman maksimal saka item menu njero sing ditampilake."

msgid "<a href=\":hoverintent_src_url\" target=\"_blank\">hoverIntent</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":hoverintent_src_url\" target=\"_blank\">hoverIntent</a>"

msgid ""
"The features of the <em>Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter</em> module "
"are included in Drupal core since version 10.3 and therefore "
"<strong>it should be uninstalled</strong>.<br>Since the module is no "
"longer needed, it <em>will</em> be removed in future releases of "
"<em>Admin Toolbar</em> when support for versions lower than 10.3 is "
"dropped.<br>\n"
"See issues: <a href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> and <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."
msgstr ""
"Fitur saka modul <em>Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter</em> wis kalebu "
"ing inti Drupal wiwit versi 10.3 lan mulane <strong>kudu "
"diuninstall</strong>.<br>Amarga modul iki ora dibutuhake maneh, modul "
"iki <em>bakal</em> diilangake ing rilis sabanjure saka <em>Admin "
"Toolbar</em> nalika dhukungan kanggo versi sing luwih murah tinimbang "
"10.3 dihentikan.<br>\n"
"Delengen masalah: <a "
"href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> lan <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."

msgid ""
"If set, the search input will be focused when the user presses the "
"keys: \"Alt + a\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with any "
"existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"Yen disetel, input panelusuran bakal difokusake nalika pangguna mencet "
"tombol: \"Alt + a\".<br>Jupuk mateni setelan iki yen bertentangan karo "
"konfigurasi keyboard sing wis ana."

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar module provides a better user experience for the "
"default Drupal Toolbar.<br>It is a drop-down menu that allows quicker "
"access to all the administration pages in a more efficient way, with "
"fewer clicks and less scrolling.<br><br>The following settings mostly "
"provide advanced configuration of the JavaScript behavior of the "
"Toolbar sticky and hoverIntent."
msgstr ""
"Modul Admin Toolbar nyedhiyakake pengalaman panganggo sing luwih apik "
"kanggo Toolbar Drupal standar.<br>Iki minangka menu dropdown sing "
"ngidini akses luwih cepet menyang kabeh kaca administrasi kanthi cara "
"sing luwih efisien, kanthi klik luwih sithik lan nggulung luwih "
"sithik.<br><br>Setelan ing ngisor iki umume nyedhiyakake konfigurasi "
"maju babagan prilaku JavaScript saka Toolbar sticky lan hoverIntent."

msgid ""
"By default, the Admin Toolbar sticky behavior is <em>enabled</em> so "
"it stays at the top of the browser window when scrolling up or "
"down.<br>Select <em>Disabled</em> to disable Admin Toolbar's sticky "
"behavior so it stays at the top of the page when scrolling up/down and "
"does not follow the browser window."
msgstr ""
"Miturut standar, prilaku sticky Admin Toolbar iku <em>aktif</em> "
"supaya tetep ana ing pucuk jendhela browser nalika nggulung munggah "
"utawa mudhun.<br>Pilih <em>Dipatèni</em> kanggo matèni prilaku "
"sticky Admin Toolbar supaya tetep ana ing pucuk kaca nalika nggulung "
"munggah/mudhun lan ora mèlu jendhela browser."

msgid ""
"If set, the toolbar will be hidden or visible when the user presses "
"the keys: \"Alt + p\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with "
"any existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"Yen diatur, toolbar bakal didhelikake utawa katon nalika pangguna "
"mencet tombol: \"Alt + p\".<br>Mateni setelan iki yen bentrok karo "
"konfigurasi keyboard sing wis ana."

msgid ""
"Provides a smoother user experience, where only menu items which are "
"paused over are expanded, to avoid accidental activations.<br>Disable "
"@hoverintent_source_link to use module's default basic JavaScript "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake pengalaman panganggo sing luwih lancar, ing ngendi mung "
"item menu sing dilengkapi kursor sing bakal dikembangake, supaya ora "
"kedadeyan aktivasi sing ora disengaja.<br>Mateni "
"@hoverintent_source_link kanggo nggunakake prilaku JavaScript dhasar "
"bawaan modul."

msgid ""
"Sets the hoverIntent trigger timeout (steps of 250).<br>The higher the "
"value, the longer the menu dropdown stays visible, after the mouse "
"moves out (default: 500ms)."
msgstr ""
"Nentokake wektu tundha trigger hoverIntent (langkah saben 250).<br>Yen "
"nilaine luwih gedhe, menu dropdown bakal tetep katon luwih suwe "
"sawisé mouse mandheg ngeklik (default: 500ms)."

msgid "CKEditor Anchor Link"
msgstr "Tautan Anchore CKEditor"

msgid "CKEditor Web link"
msgstr "Tautan Web CKEditor"

msgid ""
"This plugin module adds the better link dialog and anchor related "
"features to CKEditor in Drupal 9"
msgstr ""
"Modul plugin iki nambahake dialog pranala sing luwih apik lan "
"fitur-fitur sing gegandhengan karo anchor menyang CKEditor ing Drupal "
"9"

msgid "#@anchor_link"
msgstr "#@anchor_link"

msgid "Anchor links (within the same page)"
msgstr "Tautan jangkar (ing kaca sing padha)"

msgid "CKEditor Anchor link"
msgstr "Tautan Anchor CKEditor"

msgid "Add a note to the backup"
msgstr "Tambahna cathetan menyang cadangan"

msgid "was due @time ago"
msgstr "wis kadaluwarsa @time kepungkur"

msgid "Created the %label Settings Profile."
msgstr "Wis digawe Profil Setelan %label."

msgid "Saved the %label Settings Profile."
msgstr "Nyimpen Profil Setelan %label."

msgid "Label for the Backup Source."
msgstr "Label kanggo Sumber Cadangan."

msgid ""
"%title must contain only letters, numbers, dashes (-) and underscores "
"(_). And Site Tokens."
msgstr ""
"%title kudu ngemot mung aksara, angka, tanda pisah (-) lan garis "
"ngisor (_). Lan Site Tokens."

msgid "Use <a href=\"http://php.net/date\">PHP Date formatting</a>."
msgstr "Gunakake <a href=\"http://php.net/date\">format Tanggal PHP</a>."

msgid "Label for the Backup Destination."
msgstr "Label kanggo Tujuan Backup."

msgid ""
"The number of backups to retain. Once this number is reached, the "
"oldest backup will be deleted to make room for the most recent backup. "
"Leave blank to keep all backups."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah backup sing bakal disimpen. Yen jumlah iki wis tekan, backup "
"sing paling tuwa bakal dihapus kanggo menehi papan kanggo backup sing "
"paling anyar. Kosongi supaya kabeh backup tetep disimpen."

msgid ""
"In order to encrypt backup files, please install the Defuse "
"PHP-encryption library via Composer with the following command: "
"<code>composer require defuse/php-encryption</code>. See the <a "
"href=\"@docs\">Defuse PHP Encryption Documentation Page</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngènkripsi file cadangan, mangga pasang perpustakaan Defuse "
"PHP-encryption liwat Composer nganggo printah ing ngisor iki: "
"<code>composer require defuse/php-encryption</code>. Delengen <a "
"href=\"@docs\">Kaca Dokumentasi Defuse PHP Encryption</a> kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "All backups"
msgstr "Kabeh serep"

msgid "Restore completed at @time"
msgstr "Pangembalian rampung ing @time"

msgid "Schedules Tab"
msgstr "Tab Jadwal"

msgid "Download Backup"
msgstr "Download Cadangan"

msgid "Choose the backup source."
msgstr "Pilih sumber cadangan."

msgid "Choose the backup settings profile."
msgstr "Pilih profil setelan cadangan."

msgid "Choose the destination."
msgstr "Pilih tujuan."

msgid "Choose the schedule backup you want to run."
msgstr "Pilih jadwal cadangan sing pengin sampeyan lakoni."

msgid "Backup finished with failure"
msgstr "Backup rampung nanging gagal"

msgid "Exception Message: "
msgstr "Pesen Éksèpsi:"

msgid ""
"The Backup Destination \"Download\" does not support taking the site "
"offline during backup."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan Cadangan \"Download\" ora ndhukung njupuk situs offline nalika "
"nggawe cadangan."

msgid ""
"Keep CAPTCHA related counters in the <a href=\":statusreport\">status "
"report</a>. Note that this comes with a performance penalty as "
"updating the counters results in clearing the variable cache."
msgstr ""
"Tansah simpen penghitung sing gegayutan karo CAPTCHA ing <a "
"href=\":statusreport\">laporan status</a>. Elinga yen iki nduweni "
"pengaruh marang kinerja amarga nganyari penghitung bakal nyebabake "
"variabel cache dibusak."

msgid ""
"Note that the CAPTCHA module interacts with page caching (see <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">performance settings</a>). Because the "
"challenge should be unique for each generated form, the caching of the "
"page it appears on is prevented. Make sure that these forms do not "
"appear on too many pages or you will lose much caching efficiency. For "
"example, if you put a CAPTCHA on the user login block, which typically "
"appears on each page for anonymous visitors, caching will practically "
"be disabled. The comment submission forms are another example. In this "
"case you should set the <em>Location of comment submission form</em> "
"to <em>Display on separate page</em> in the comment settings of the "
"relevant <a href=\":contenttypes\">content types</a> for better "
"caching efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Elinga yen modul CAPTCHA sesambungan karo caching kaca (deleng <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">setelan performa</a>). Amarga tantangan "
"kudu unik kanggo saben formulir sing digawe, caching kaca sing "
"nampilake iku dicegah. Pasthekake manawa formulir-formulir iki ora "
"muncul ing kakehan kaca utawa sampeyan bakal ilang akeh efisiensi "
"caching. Contone, yen sampeyan pasang CAPTCHA ing blok login pangguna, "
"sing biasane muncul ing saben kaca kanggo pengunjung anonim, caching "
"sacara praktis bakal dipatèni. Formulir pengiriman komentar uga dadi "
"conto liyane. Ing kéné, sampeyan kudu nyetel <em>Lokasi formulir "
"pengiriman komentar</em> menyang <em>Tampilake ing kaca kapisah</em> "
"ing setelan komentar saka <a href=\":contenttypes\">jenis konten</a> "
"sing relevan kanggo efisiensi caching sing luwih apik."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> <a href=\":perm\">permission</a> "
"won't be offered a challenge. Be sure to grant this permission to the "
"trusted users (e.g. site administrators). If you want to test a "
"protected form, be sure to do it as a user without the <em>Skip "
"CAPTCHA</em> permission (e.g. as anonymous user)."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwèni <em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> <a "
"href=\":perm\">ijin</a> ora bakal diwènèhi tantangan. Priksa manawa "
"wis maringi ijin iki marang pangguna sing dipercaya (contone, "
"administrator situs). Yen sampeyan arep nyoba formulir sing "
"dilindhungi, priksa manawa nindakake minangka pangguna tanpa ijin "
"<em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> (contone, minangka pangguna anonim)."

msgid ""
"CAPTCHA session reuse attack detected on @form_id <br/>Posted CAPTCHA "
"token: @posted_captcha_token <br/>Expected captcha token: "
"@expected_captcha_token"
msgstr ""
"Serangan panggunaan ulang sesi CAPTCHA terdeteksi ing @form_id "
"<br/>Token CAPTCHA sing dikirim: @posted_captcha_token <br/>Token "
"CAPTCHA sing diarepake: @expected_captcha_token"

msgid ""
"%form_id post blocked by CAPTCHA module: challenge %challenge (by "
"module %module)."
msgstr ""
"%form_id kiriman dicegah déning modul CAPTCHA: tantangan %challenge "
"(déning modul %module)."

msgid ""
"Configurable error message that the user gets when it enters an "
"incorrect CAPTCHA answer."
msgstr ""
"Pesen kesalahan sing bisa diatur sing diduweni pangguna nalika mlebu "
"jawaban CAPTCHA sing salah."

msgid ""
"Lower and upper IP addresses should be different. Please correct range "
"%ip_range."
msgstr ""
"Alamat IP ngisor lan ndhuwur kudu beda. Mangga benerna rentang "
"%ip_range."

msgid ""
"A CAPTCHA can be added to virtually any Drupal form, through adding an "
"affiliated <em>CAPTCHA Point</em>. Some default <em>CAPTCHA "
"Points</em> are already provided in the <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> "
"section, but arbitrary forms can be easily added and managed."
msgstr ""
"CAPTCHA bisa ditambahake ing meh kabeh formulir Drupal, kanthi "
"nambahake <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> sing gegandhengan. Sawetara "
"<em>CAPTCHA Points</em> standar wis kasedhiya ing bagean <em>CAPTCHA "
"Point</em>, nanging formulir sembarang bisa kanthi gampang ditambahake "
"lan diatur."

msgid ""
"Enter one IP-address per row in the format XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX. "
