msgid "DOMPurify is already present at @path. No download required."
msgstr "DOMPurify wis kasedhiya ing @path. Ora perlu diundhuh."

msgid ""
"Drush was unable to download the DOMPurify library from @remote. "
"@exception"
msgstr ""
"Drush ora bisa ngundhuh perpustakaan DOMPurify saka @remote. "
"@exception"

msgid "Error: unable to unzip DOMPurify file."
msgstr "Kesalahan: ora bisa mbukak file DOMPurify."

msgid "The DOMPurify library has been successfully downloaded to @path."
msgstr "Pustaka DOMPurify wis kasil diundhuh menyang @path."

msgid "Drush was unable to load the DOMPurify library"
msgstr "Drush ora bisa mbukak perpustakaan DOMPurify"

msgid ""
"The DOMPurify library is not installed. The Colorbox module uses this "
"library to sanitize HTML captions. Without this library, all captions "
"will be treated as plain text. If you intend to have HTML captions in "
"Colorbox content, download the <a href=\"@url\">DOMPurify library</a>, "
"extract it, and copy the dist directory into the /libraries/DOMPurify "
"folder in your Drupal installation directory. Specifically, the system "
"looks for /libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js. <br /><br /> To "
"avoid potential security issues, please only install the dist "
"directory, and not any other files from the archive.<br /><br /> If "
"you do not intend to use HTML captions, you can suppress this warning "
"on the <a href=\"@config\">Colorbox configuration page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pustaka DOMPurify durung dipasang. Modul Colorbox nggunakake pustaka "
"iki kanggo nyaring caption HTML. Yen ora ana pustaka iki, kabeh "
"caption bakal dianggep minangka teks biasa. Yen sampeyan arep nduwe "
"caption HTML ing isi Colorbox, undhuh <a href=\"@url\">pustaka "
"DOMPurify</a>, ekstrak, lan salin direktori dist menyang folder "
"/libraries/DOMPurify ing direktori instalasi Drupal sampeyan. Sistem "
"iki khusus nggoleki /libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js. <br /><br "
"/> Kanggo ngindhari masalah keamanan, mangga pasang mung direktori "
"dist, lan aja masang file-file liyane saka arsip kasebut.<br /><br /> "
"Yen sampeyan ora arep nggunakake caption HTML, sampeyan bisa nyetop "
"peringatan iki ing <a href=\"@config\">kaca konfigurasi Colorbox.</a>"

msgid ""
"The DOMPurify library is installed. This library will sanitize HTML in "
"Colorbox captions."
msgstr ""
"Pustaka DOMPurify wis diinstal. Pustaka iki bakal nyaring HTML ing "
"caption Colorbox."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\"@dompurify_link\">DOMPurify</a> library is not "
"installed. This library is necessary if you want to use HTML in "
"Colorbox captions. Without it, all captions will be treated as plain "
"text."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@dompurify_link\">Perpustakaan DOMPurify</a> durung "
"diinstal. Perpustakaan iki perlu yen sampeyan pengin nggunakake HTML "
"ing caption Colorbox. Tanpa iku, kabeh caption bakal dianggep minangka "
"teks biasa."

msgid ""
"By default, a warning appears on Drupal's status report if this "
"library is missing. Check this box to suppress the warning."
msgstr ""
"Kanthi standar, peringatan bakal muncul ing laporan status Drupal yen "
"perpustakaan iki ora ana. Centhang kothak iki kanggo nyegah peringatan "
"kasebut."

