msgid ""
"A unique machine-readable name for this @entity_type. It must only "
"contain lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores."
msgstr ""
"Asma mesin unik sing bisa diwaca kanggo @entity_type iki. Mung kudu "
"ngemot aksara cilik, angka, lan garis ngisor."

msgid "Entity Mask"
msgstr "Entity Mask"

msgid ""
"Allows an entity type to borrow the fields and display configuration "
"of another entity type."
msgstr ""
"Ngidini jinis entitas kanggo njupuk lapangan lan konfigurasi tampilan "
"saka jinis entitas liyane."

msgid "Chaos Tools Views"
msgstr "Chaos Tools Views"

msgid ""
"This suite is primarily a set of APIs and tools to improve the "
"developer experience. It also contains a module called the Page "
"Manager whose job is to manage pages. In particular it manages panel "
"pages, but as it grows it will be able to manage far more than just "
"Panels."
msgstr ""
"Suite iki utamane sawijining kumpulan API lan piranti kanggo nambah "
"pengalaman pangembang. Uga ngemot modul sing dijenengi Page Manager "
"sing tugase kanggo ngatur kaca. Khususé, modul iki ngatur kaca panel, "
"nanging nalika berkembang, bakal bisa ngatur luwih akeh tinimbang mung "
"Panel."

msgid ""
"Plugins -- tools to make it easy for modules to let other modules "
"implement plugins from .inc files."
msgstr ""
"Plugins -- piranti kanggo nggampangake modul supaya modul liyane bisa "
"nglakokake plugins saka file .inc."

msgid ""
"Exportables -- tools to make it easier for modules to have objects "
"that live in database or live in code, such as \"default views\"."
msgstr ""
"Exportables -- piranti kanggo nggawe luwih gampang modul nduweni obyek "
"sing urip ing basis data utawa urip ing kode, kaya \"default views\"."

msgid ""
"AJAX responder -- tools to make it easier for the server to handle "
"AJAX requests and tell the client what to do with them."
msgstr ""
"AJAX responder -- piranti kanggo nggawe luwih gampang server nangani "
"panyuwunan AJAX lan ngandhani klien apa sing kudu ditindakake karo "
"kuwi."

msgid "Form tools -- tools to make it easier for forms to deal with AJAX."
msgstr ""
"Piranti formulir -- piranti kanggo nggawe formulir luwih gampang "
"ngatasi AJAX."

msgid ""
"Object caching -- tool to make it easier to edit an object across "
"multiple page requests and cache the editing work."
msgstr ""
"Caching obyek -- piranti kanggo nggampangake nyunting obyek ing "
"pirang-pirang panjalukan kaca lan nyimpen asil nyunting kasebut ing "
"cache."

msgid ""
"Contexts -- the notion of wrapping objects in a unified wrapper and "
"providing an API to create and accept these contexts as input."
msgstr ""
"Konsep Konteks -- gagasan nglebokaké objek ing sawijining pembungkus "
"sing padha lan nyedhiyakake API kanggo nggawe lan nampa "
"konteks-konteks iki minangka input."

msgid ""
"Modal dialog -- tool to make it simple to put a form in a modal "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Dialog modal -- piranti kanggo nggawe luwih gampang nempatake formulir "
"ing dialog modal."

msgid ""
"Dependent -- a simple form widget to make form items appear and "
"disappear based upon the selections in another item."
msgstr ""
"Dependent -- sawijining widget formulir sing sederhana kanggo nggawe "
"barang-barang formulir katon lan ilang gumantung saka pilihan ing "
"barang liyane."

msgid ""
"Content -- pluggable content types used as panes in Panels and other "
"modules like Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Isi -- jinis isi sing bisa dipasang minangka papan ing Panels lan "
"modul liyane kaya Dashboard."

msgid "Form wizard -- an API to make multi-step forms much easier."
msgstr ""
"Form wizard -- sawijining API kanggo nggawe formulir multi-langkah "
"dadi luwih gampang."

msgid ""
"CSS tools -- tools to cache and sanitize CSS easily to make user-input "
"CSS safe."
msgstr ""
"Piranti CSS -- piranti kanggo nyimpen lan nyaring CSS kanthi gampang "
"supaya CSS sing dimasukkan pangguna dadi aman."

msgid "Exposed filter values"
msgstr "Nilai filter sing katampil"

