msgid ""
"The breakpoint group typically only needs a single breakpoint with an "
"empty media query in order to do <em>viewport sizing.</em> Multiple "
"breakpoints are used for changing the crop or aspect ratio of images "
"at different viewport sizes, which is often referred to as <em>art "
"direction.</em> A new breakpoint group should be created for each "
"aspect ratio to avoid content shift. Once you select a breakpoint "
"group, you can choose which breakpoints to use for the responsive "
"image style. By default, the option <em>do not use this "
"breakpoint</em> is selected for each breakpoint. See the <a "
"href=\":breakpoint_help\">help page of the Breakpoint module</a> for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Kelompok breakpoint biasane mung butuh siji breakpoint kanthi media "
"query kosong kanggo nindakake <em>viewport sizing.</em> Akeh "
"breakpoint digunakake kanggo ngganti crop utawa rasio aspek gambar ing "
"ukuran viewport sing beda-beda, sing kerap disebut <em>art "
"direction.</em> Kelompok breakpoint anyar kudu digawe kanggo saben "
"rasio aspek supaya isi ora ngalami ganti posisi. Sawise sampeyan milih "
"kelompok breakpoint, sampeyan bisa milih breakpoint sing arep "
"digunakake kanggo gaya gambar responsif. Secara standar, pilihan "
"<em>do not use this breakpoint</em> dipilih kanggo saben breakpoint. "
"Delengen <a href=\":breakpoint_help\">halaman bantuan modul "
"Breakpoint</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"Composer must be configured for secure downloads. This means that <a "
"href=\":disable-tls\">the <code>disable-tls</code> option</a> must be "
"<code>false</code>, and <a href=\":secure-http\">the "
"<code>secure-http</code> option</a> must be <code>true</code> in the "
"<code>config</code> section of your <code>composer.json</code> file. "
"If these options are not set in your <code>composer.json</code>, "
"Composer will behave securely by default. To set these values at the "
"command line, run the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Composer kudu dikonfigurasi supaya undhuhan aman. Iki ateges <a "
"href=\":disable-tls\">opsi <code>disable-tls</code></a> kudu "
"<code>false</code>, lan <a href=\":secure-http\">opsi "
"<code>secure-http</code></a> kudu <code>true</code> ing bagean "
"<code>config</code> saka file <code>composer.json</code> sampeyan. Yen "
"opsi-opsi iki ora disetel ing <code>composer.json</code>, Composer "
"bakal prilaku kanthi aman sacara default. Kanggo nyetel nilai-nilai "
"iki liwat command line, lakokna perintah-perintah ing ngisor iki:"

