msgid ""
"The Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks module is a Feature Flag "
"module which exposes all fields on all bundles as field blocks for use "
"in Layout Builder."
msgstr ""
"Modul Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks iku modul Feature Flag "
"sing mbukak akses kabeh kolom ing kabeh bundles minangka blok kolom "
"kanggo digunakake ing Layout Builder."

msgid ""
