"href=\":workflows\"> kaca Workflows</a>, sawisé sampeyan nginstal "
"modul sing nggunakake API kaya modul Content Moderation."

msgid ""
"A workflow requires at least two states. States can be added when you "
"add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sak workflow mbutuhake paling ora loro status. Status bisa ditambahake "
"nalika sampeyan nambah utawa ngowahi workflow ing <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Kaca Workflows</a>."

msgid ""
"A transition defines in which state an item can be save as next. It "
"has one destination state, but can have several states <em>from</em> "
"which the transition can be applied. Transitions can be added when you "
"add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Saklumpukan nemtokake ing kahanan endi sawijining item bisa disimpen "
"minangka sabanjure. Iki nduwèni siji kahanan tujuan, nanging bisa "
"nduwèni pirang-pirang kahanan <em>saka</em> ngendi saklumpukan bisa "
"ditrapake. Saklumpukan bisa ditambahake nalika sampeyan nambah utawa "
"ngedit workflow ing <a href=\":workflows\">kaca Workflows</a>."

msgid ""
"The UploadProgress PHP extension must be enabled to configure the "
"progress indicator. Check the <a href=\":status\">status report</a> "
