"without sandboxing them first. This can be risky and is not "
"recommended for production environments. For safety, your site will be "
"put into maintenance mode while dependencies are updated."
msgstr ""
"Mode tulis langsung wis diaktifake, sing artine owah-owahan bakal "
"ditindakake tanpa disandox dhisik. Iki bisa mbebayani lan ora "
"disaranake kanggo lingkungan produksi. Kanggo keamanan, situs sampeyan "
"bakal dilebokake menyang mode pangopènan nalika panganggone gumantung "
"lagi dianyari."

msgid "The sandbox directory is a subdirectory of the active directory."
msgstr "Direktori sandbox iku subdirektori saka direktori aktif."

msgid "The pg_trgm PostgreSQL extension is present."
msgstr "Ekstensi pg_trgm PostgreSQL wis ana."

msgid "%profile_name (%profile%version)"
msgstr "%profile_name (%profile%version)"

msgid ""
"Drupal is unable to generate highly randomized numbers, which means "
"certain security features like password reset URLs are not as secure "
"as they should be. Instead, only a slow, less-secure fallback "
"generator is available. The most likely cause is that open_basedir "
"restrictions are in effect and /dev/urandom is not on the allowed "
"list. See the <a href=\":drupal-php\">system requirements</a> page for "
"more information. %exception_message"
msgstr ""
"Drupal ora bisa nggawe nomer sing acak banget, sing tegese fitur "
"keamanan tartamtu kaya URL reset sandhi ora sepenuhe aman kaya kudune. "
"Nanging, mung generator fallback sing alon lan kurang aman sing "
"kasedhiya. Sebab sing paling mungkin yaiku yen watesan open_basedir "
"aktif lan /dev/urandom ora ana ing dhaftar sing diijini. Delengen kaca "
"<a href=\":drupal-php\">syarat sistem</a> kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap. %exception_message"

msgid ""
"Update notifications are not enabled. It is <strong>highly "
"recommended</strong> that you install the Update Status module from "
"the <a href=\":module\">module administration page</a> in order to "
"stay up-to-date on new releases. For more information, <a "
"href=\":update\">Update status handbook page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pemberitahuan update durung diaktifake. Sampeyan <strong>kudu "
"banget</strong> kanggo nginstal modul Update Status saka <a "
"href=\":module\">kaca administrasi modul</a> supaya tetep ngerti "
"rilisan anyar. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, bukak <a "
"href=\":update\">kaca handbook status update</a>."

msgid ""
"If you have the core Update Status module installed, in the "
"<em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Reports</em> &gt; "
"<em>Available updates</em> to see a report of the updates that are "
"available for your site software. If <em>Last checked</em> is far in "
"the past, click <em>Check manually</em> to update the report. Scan the "
"report; if the core software or any modules or themes have security "
"updates available, you should update them as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan wis masang modul inti Update Status, ing menu "
"administrasi <em>Manage</em>, navigasi menyang <em>Reports</em> &gt; "
"<em>Available updates</em> kanggo ndeleng laporan babagan pembaruan "
"sing kasedhiya kanggo piranti lunak situs sampeyan. Yen <em>Last "
"checked</em> wis suwe banget, klik <em>Check manually</em> kanggo "
"nganyari laporan kasebut. Priksa laporan kasebut; yen piranti lunak "
"inti utawa modul utawa tema apa wae duwe pembaruan keamanan sing "
"kasedhiya, sampeyan kudu nganyari secepat-cepaté."

msgid ""
"Regularly review available updates and update as required to maintain "
"a secure and current site. Always run the <a "
"href=\":update-php\">update script</a> each time a module is updated. "
"Install the <a href=\":update-status\">Update Status module</a> to see "
"a report of available releases for Drupal Core and contributed modules "
"and themes."
msgstr ""
"Sasampuné kanthi rutin priksa pembaruan sing kasedhiya lan nganyari "
"miturut kabutuhan kanggo njaga situs supaya aman lan paling anyar. "
"Tansah lakokna <a href=\":update-php\">skrip pembaruan</a> saben "
"modhul diupdate. Instal <a href=\":update-status\">modul Status "
"Pembaruan</a> kanggo ndeleng laporan babagan rilisan sing kasedhiya "
"kanggo Drupal Core lan modhul lan tema kontribusi."

msgid "Update Status settings"
msgstr "Nganyari setelan Status"

msgid ""
"The Update Status module periodically checks for new versions of your "
"site's software (including contributed modules and themes), and alerts "
"administrators to available updates. The Update Status system is also "
"used by some other modules to manage updates and downloads; for "
"example, the Interface Translation module uses the Update Status to "
"download translations from the localization server. Note that whenever "
"the Update Status system is used, anonymous usage statistics are sent "
"to Drupal.org. If desired, you may uninstall the Update Status module "
"from the <a href=\":modules\">Extend page</a>; if you do so, "
"functionality that depends on the Update Status system will not work. "
"For more information, see the <a href=\":update\">online documentation "
"for the Update Status module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Update Status sacara periodik mriksa versi anyar saka piranti "
"lunak situs sampeyan (kalebu modul lan tema sing disumbangake), lan "
"ngandhani administrator babagan pembaruan sing kasedhiya. Sistem "
"Update Status uga digunakake dening sawetara modul liya kanggo ngatur "
"pembaruan lan unduhan; contone, modul Interface Translation nggunakake "
"Update Status kanggo ngundhuh terjemahan saka server lokalisasi. "
"Elinga yen saben nggunakake sistem Update Status, statistik panggunaan "
"anonim dikirim menyang Drupal.org. Yen dikarepake, sampeyan bisa "
"nyopot modul Update Status saka <a href=\":modules\">kaca Extend</a>; "
"yen sampeyan nindakake iki, fungsi sing gumantung marang sistem Update "
"Status ora bakal bisa digunakake. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":update\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul Update "
"Status</a>."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":update-report\">Available updates report</a> displays "
"core, contributed modules, and themes for which there are new releases "
"available for download. On the report page, you can also check "
"manually for updates. You can configure the frequency of update "
"checks, which are performed during cron runs, and whether "
"notifications are sent on the <a href=\":update-settings\">Update "
"Status settings page</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":update-report\">Laporan pembaruan sing kasedhiya</a> "
"nampilake inti, modul sumbangan, lan tema sing nduwe rilis anyar sing "
"bisa diundhuh. Ing kaca laporan, sampeyan uga bisa mriksa pembaruan "
"kanthi manual. Sampeyan bisa nyetel frekuensi mriksa pembaruan, sing "
"ditindakake nalika cron mlaku, lan apa kabar dikirimake ing <a "
"href=\":update-settings\">kaca setelan Status Pembaruan</a>."

msgid ""
"The core User module allows users to register, log in, and log out, "
"and administrators to manage user roles and permissions. Depending on "
"which modules you have installed on your site, the related topics "
"below will help you with tasks related to managing user accounts and "
"visitors."
msgstr ""
"Modul User inti ngidini pangguna kanggo ndaftar, mlebu, lan metu, lan "
"administrator kanggo ngatur peran lan idin pangguna. Gumantung modul "
"sing wis sampeyan pasang ing situs sampeyan, topik sing gegandhengan "
"ing ngisor iki bakal mbantu sampeyan karo tugas-tugas sing ana "
"gandhengane karo ngatur akun pangguna lan pengunjung."

msgid "Table class"
msgstr "Kelas tabel"

msgid "@label view mode"
msgstr "@label mode tampilan"

