msgstr "Tanggal %field ora sah. Tanggal kudu ana ing wates taun %min-%max."

msgid "Composer was found at %path, but could not be made read-only."
msgstr "Composer ditemokake ing %path, nanging ora bisa digawe mung diwaca."

msgid ""
"If the <code>composer</code> executable's path cannot be automatically "
"determined, you will need to add Composer to your project by running "
"the following command: <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>:"
msgstr ""
"Yen dalan executable <code>composer</code> ora bisa ditemtokake kanthi "
"otomatis, sampeyan kudu nambah Composer menyang proyek sampeyan kanthi "
"mbukak printah iki: <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>:"

msgid ""
"The version of the <code>composer</code> executable must satisfy "
"<code>@version</code>. See the <a href=\":url\">the Composer "
"documentation</a> for more information, or use this command to add "
"Composer to your project: <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>"
msgstr ""
"Versi saka <code>composer</code> sing bisa dieksekusi kudu cocog karo "
"<code>@version</code>. Delengen <a href=\":url\">dokumentasi "
"Composer</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, utawa gunakake prentah "
"iki kanggo nambahake Composer menyang proyek sampeyan: <code>composer "
"require \"composer/composer:@version\"</code>"

msgid ""
"The path to Composer is set in configuration, which is no longer "
"supported. To fix this, add <code>composer/composer</code> to your "
"project's dependencies by running <code>composer require "
"'composer/composer:@version'</code>, <em>or</em> add the following "
"line to <code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_composer_path'] = "
"'@composer_path';</code>. See <a href=\":url\">this change record</a> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Path kanggo Composer wis disetel ing konfigurasi, sing saiki wis ora "
"didhukung maneh. Kanggo ndandani iki, tambahi "
"<code>composer/composer</code> menyang dependensi proyek panjenengan "
"kanthi mbukak <code>composer require "
"'composer/composer:@version'</code>, <em>utawa</em> tambahake baris "
"ing ngisor iki ing <code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_composer_path'] = "
"'@composer_path';</code>. Waca <a href=\":url\">cathetan owah-owahan "
"iki</a> kanggo informasi luwih lengkap."

msgid "Path to <code>rsync</code> is configured"
msgstr "Path menyang <code>rsync</code> wis dikonfigurasi"

msgid ""
"The path to <code>rsync</code> is set in configuration, which is no "
"longer supported. To fix this, add the following line to "
"<code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_rsync_path'] = '@rsync_path';</code>. "
"See <a href=\":url\">this change record</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Dalane menyang <code>rsync</code> wis disetel ing konfigurasi, sing "
"saiki wis ora didhukung maneh. Kanggo ndandani iki, tambahi baris ing "
"ngisor iki menyang <code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_rsync_path'] = '@rsync_path';</code>. "
"Delengen <a href=\":url\">rekaman owah-owahan iki</a> kanggo informasi "
"luwih lengkap."

msgid ""
"A unique machine-readable name. Can only contain lowercase letters, "
