msgid "Block Content storage body field"
msgstr "Lapangan isi awak panyimpenan Konten Blok"

msgid "When enabled, this module adds a default block content body field."
msgstr ""
"Nalika diaktifake, modul iki bakal nambahake lapangan isi badan blok "
"baku."

msgid ""
"The Block Content module manages the creation, editing, and deletion "
"of content blocks. Content blocks are field-able content entities "
"managed by the <a href=\":field\">Field module</a>. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":block-content\">online documentation "
"for the Block Content module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modul Block Content ngatur nggawe, ngowahi, lan mbusak blok isi. Blok "
"isi iku entitas isi sing bisa diwenehi kolom lan diatur dening <a "
"href=\":field\">modul Field</a>. Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, "
"delengen <a href=\":block-content\">dokumentasi online kanggo modul "
"Block Content</a>."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Administer block types</em> permission can create "
"and edit block types with fields and display settings, from the <a "
"href=\":types\">Block types</a> page under the Structure menu. For "
"more information about managing fields and display settings, see the "
"<a href=\":field-ui\">Field UI module help</a> and <a "
"href=\":field\">Field module help</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduwé ijin <em>Administer block types</em> bisa nggawe "
"lan nyunting jinis blok kanthi lapangan lan setelan tampilan, saka "
"kaca <a href=\":types\">Block types</a> ing menu Struktur. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap babagan ngatur lapangan lan setelan tampilan, "
"waca <a href=\":field-ui\">bantuan modul Field UI</a> lan <a "
"href=\":field\">bantuan modul Field</a>."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Administer block content</em> or <em>Create new "
"content block</em> permissions for an individual block type are able "
"to add content blocks. These can be created on the <a "
"href=\":add-content-block\">Add content block page</a> or on the "
"<em>Place block</em> modal on the <a href=\":block-layout\">Block "
"Layout page</a> and are reusable across the entire site. Content "
"blocks created in Layout Builder for a content type or individual node "
"layouts are not reusable and also called inline blocks."
msgstr ""
"Pangguna sing nduweni ijin <em>Administer block content</em> utawa "
"<em>Create new content block</em> kanggo jinis blok individu bisa "
"nambah blok konten. Iki bisa digawe ing <a "
"href=\":add-content-block\">Kaca Tambah Blok Konten</a> utawa ing "
"modal <em>Place block</em> ing <a href=\":block-layout\">Kaca Tata "
"Letak Blok</a> lan bisa digunakake maneh ing sakabehe situs. Blok "
"konten sing digawe ing Layout Builder kanggo jinis konten utawa tata "
"letak node individu ora bisa digunakake maneh lan uga disebut blok "
"inline."

msgid "Allow list style type"
msgstr "Ijin jinis gaya dhaptar"

msgid "Allow the user to choose a list style type"
msgstr "Wenehi pangguna pilihan kanggo milih jinis gaya dhaptar"

msgid ""
"Available list style types for ordered lists: letters and Roman "
"numerals instead of only numbers. Available list style types for "
"unordered lists: circles and squares instead of only discs."
msgstr ""
"Jinis gaya dhaptar sing kasedhiya kanggo dhaptar urut: aksara lan "
"angka Romawi tinimbang mung angka. Jinis gaya dhaptar sing kasedhiya "
"kanggo dhaptar ora urut: bunderan lan segi papat tinimbang mung "
"cakram."

msgid "Add new comment to %label"
msgstr "Tambahaké komentar anyar kanggo %label"

msgid "The file (%uri) associated with file entity %name does not exist."
msgstr "Berkas (%uri) sing gegandhengan karo entitas berkas %name ora ana."

msgid ""
"The core Node, Comment, Content Block, Custom Menu Links, User, File, "
"Image, Media, and Taxonomy modules all provide content entity types."
msgstr ""
"Modul inti Node, Comment, Content Block, Custom Menu Links, User, "
"File, Image, Media, lan Taxonomy kabeh nyedhiyakake jinis entitas "
"konten."

