"action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Saben owah-owahan ing tata letak kanggo %label sing durung disimpen "
"bakal dibuwang. Tumindak iki ora bisa dibatalake."

msgid ""
"Any unsaved changes to the layout will be discarded. This action "
"cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Sakabehe owah-owahan sing durung disimpen ing tata letak bakal "
"dibuwang. Tumindak iki ora bisa dibatalake."

