"MariaDB or equivalent database using the mysqli PHP extension. For "
"more information, see the <a href=\":mysqli\">online documentation for "
"the MySQLi module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modhul MySQLi nyedhiyakake sambungan antarane Drupal lan database "
"MySQL, MariaDB utawa sing padha nggunakake ekstensi PHP mysqli. Kanggo "
"informasi luwih lengkap, delengen <a href=\":mysqli\">dokumentasi "
"online kanggo modhul MySQLi</a>."

