msgid ""
"The topic of the resource. Typically, the subject will be represented "
"using keywords, key phrases, or classification codes. Recommended best "
"practice is to use a controlled vocabulary. To describe the spatial or "
"temporal topic of the resource, use the Coverage element."
msgstr ""
"Topik saka sumber daya. Biasane, subjek bakal digambarake nggunakake "
"tembung kunci, frasa kunci, utawa kode klasifikasi. Praktik sing "
"paling dianjurake yaiku nggunakake kosa kata sing terkontrol. Kanggo "
"njlentrehake topik ruang utawa wektu saka sumber daya, gunakake unsur "
"Coverage."

msgid ""
"An account of the resource. Description may include but is not limited "
"to: an abstract, a table of contents, a graphical representation, or a "
"free-text account of the resource."
msgstr ""
"Akun sumber daya. Deskripsi bisa kalebu nanging ora winates marang: "
"abstrak, tabel isi, representasi grafis, utawa akun teks bebas saka "
"sumber daya kasebut."

msgid ""
"An entity responsible for making the resource available. Examples of a "
"Publisher include a person, an organization, or a service. Typically, "
"the name of a Publisher should be used to indicate the entity."
msgstr ""
"Saperangan sing tanggung jawab kanggo nggawe sumber daya bisa diakses. "
"Conto saka Publisher kalebu wong, organisasi, utawa layanan. Biasane, "
"jeneng Publisher sing digunakake kanggo nuduhake entitas kasebut."

msgid ""
"An entity responsible for making contributions to the resource. "
"Examples of a Contributor include a person, an organization, or a "
"service. Typically, the name of a Contributor should be used to "
"indicate the entity."
msgstr ""
"Siji entitas sing tanggung jawab kanggo menehi kontribusi marang "
"sumber daya. Conto saka Kontributor kalebu wong, organisasi, utawa "
"layanan. Biasane, jeneng saka Kontributor kudu digunakake kanggo "
"nuduhake entitas kasebut."

msgid ""
"A point or period of time associated with an event in the lifecycle of "
"the resource. Date may be used to express temporal information at any "
"level of granularity.  Recommended best practice is to use an encoding "
"scheme, such as the W3CDTF profile of ISO 8601 [W3CDTF]."
msgstr ""
"Titik utawa periode wektu sing gegandhengan karo sawijining kedadeyan "
"ing siklus urip sumber daya. Tanggal bisa digunakake kanggo "
"ngandharake informasi temporal ing sembarang tingkat rincian. Praktik "
"sing paling disaranake yaiku nggunakake skema enkoding, kaya profil "
"W3CDTF saka ISO 8601 [W3CDTF]."

msgid ""
"The file format, physical medium, or dimensions of the resource. "
"Examples of dimensions include size and duration. Recommended best "
"practice is to use a controlled vocabulary such as the list of "
"Internet Media Types [MIME]."
msgstr ""
"Format file, media fisik, utawa dimensi saka sumber daya. Conto "
"dimensi kalebu ukuran lan dawa wektu. Praktik sing disaranake yaiku "
"nggunakake kosa kata sing dikendhaleni kaya dhaptar Tipe Media "
"Internet [MIME]."

msgid ""
"An unambiguous reference to the resource within a given context. "
"Recommended best practice is to identify the resource by means of a "
"string conforming to a formal identification system."
msgstr ""
"Referensi sing cetha marang sumber daya ing konteks sing ditemtokake. "
"Praktik paling apik sing disaranake yaiku ngenali sumber daya kanthi "
"cara nggunakake string sing manut sistem identifikasi resmi."

msgid ""
"A related resource from which the described resource is derived. The "
"described resource may be derived from the related resource in whole "
"or in part. Recommended best practice is to identify the related "
"resource by means of a string conforming to a formal identification "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Sumber sing gegandhengan sing dadi asal saka sumber sing diterangake. "
"Sumber sing diterangake bisa dijupuk saka sumber sing gegandhengan iku "
"sacara sakabehe utawa sebagian. Praktik paling apik sing disaranake "
"yaiku ngenali sumber sing gegandhengan nganggo cara string sing cocog "
"karo sistem identifikasi formal."

msgid ""
"A related resource. Recommended best practice is to identify the "
"related resource by means of a string conforming to a formal "
"identification system."
msgstr ""
"Sumber sing gegandhengan. Praktik sing paling disaranake yaiku ngenali "
"sumber sing gegandhengan kanthi cara nggunakake string sing cocog karo "
"sistem identifikasi formal."

msgid ""
"The spatial or temporal topic of the resource, the spatial "
"applicability of the resource, or the jurisdiction under which the "
"resource is relevant. Spatial topic and spatial applicability may be a "
"named place or a location specified by its geographic coordinates. "
"Temporal topic may be a named period, date, or date range. A "
"jurisdiction may be a named administrative entity or a geographic "
"place to which the resource applies. Recommended best practice is to "
"use a controlled vocabulary such as the Thesaurus of Geographic Names "
"[TGN]. Where appropriate, named places or time periods can be used in "
"preference to numeric identifiers such as sets of coordinates or date "
"ranges."
msgstr ""
"Topik spasial utawa temporal saka sumber daya, aplikasi spasial saka "
"sumber daya, utawa yurisdiksi ing ngendi sumber daya kasebut relevan. "
"Topik spasial lan aplikasi spasial bisa dadi panggonan sing dijenengi "
"utawa lokasi sing ditemtokake dening koordinat geografis. Topik "
"temporal bisa dadi periode wektu sing dijenengi, tanggal, utawa "
"rentang tanggal. Yurisdiksi bisa dadi entitas administratif sing "
"dijenengi utawa panggonan geografis sing dadi cakupan sumber daya "
"kasebut. Praktik sing dianjurake yaiku nggunakake kosakata terkendali "
"kaya Thesaurus of Geographic Names [TGN]. Yen cocog, panggonan sing "
"dijenengi utawa periode wektu bisa digunakake minangka pilihan "
"tinimbang pangidentifikasi numerik kaya set koordinat utawa rentang "
"tanggal."

