msgid ""
"Some older mobile browsers will expect this meta tag to be set to "
"'true' to indicate that the site has been designed with mobile "
"browsers in mind."
msgstr ""
"Sawetara panyungsi seluler lawas bakal ngarepake tag meta iki disetel "
"dadi 'true' kanggo nuduhake menawa situs iki dirancang kanthi tujuan "
"panggunaan panyungsi seluler."

msgid ""
"A custom string for deeplinking to an iOS mobile app. Should be in the "
"format 'itunes_id/scheme/host_path', e.g. "
"123456/example/hello-screen'. The 'ios-app://' prefix will be included "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"String khusus kanggo deeplinking menyang aplikasi mobile iOS. Kudu "
"nganggo format 'itunes_id/scheme/host_path', contone "
"123456/example/hello-screen'. Prefiks 'ios-app://' bakal kalebu kanthi "
"otomatis."

msgid ""
"Using the value 'width' tells certain mobile Internet Explorer "
"browsers to display as-is, without being resized. Alternatively a "
"numerical width may be used to indicate the desired page width the "
"page should be rendered in: '240' is the suggested default, '176' for "
"older browsers or '480' for newer devices with high DPI screens."
msgstr ""
"Nganggo nilai 'width' ngandhani sawetara browser Internet Explorer "
"seluler kanggo nampilake kaya asline, tanpa diowahi ukurané. "
"Alternatifé, bisa uga nganggo nilai angka kanggo nuduhake amba kaca "
"sing dikarepake supaya kaca kasebut dirender: '240' iku bawaan "
"disaranake, '176' kanggo browser lawas utawa '480' kanggo piranti "
"anyar sing nduwèni layar DPI dhuwur."

msgid ""
"Allows tasks to be defined on child domains of the fully qualified "
"domain name associated with the pinned site. Should be either 'true' "
"or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Ngidini tugas-tugas ditemtokake ing domain anak saka jeneng domain "
"lengkap sing gegandhengan karo situs sing dipiteni. Kudu 'true' utawa "
"'false'."

msgid ""
"Should contain the full URL to a <a "
"href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Browser "
"configuration schema</a> file that further controls tile "
"customizations."
msgstr ""
"Kudu ngemot URL lengkap menyang <a "
"href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Browser "
"configuration schema</a> sing luwih ngatur kustomisasi tile."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string containing 'polling-uri=' (required), "
"'polling-uri2=', 'polling-uri3=', 'polling-uri4=' and 'polling-uri5=' "
"to indicate the URLs for notifications. May also contain a "
"'frequency=' value to specify how often (in minutes) the URLs will be "
"polled; limited to 30, 60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default). May also "
"contain the value 'cycle=' to control the notifications cycle."
msgstr ""
"String dipisah nganggo semi-titik koma sing ngemot 'polling-uri=' "
"(kudu ana), 'polling-uri2=', 'polling-uri3=', 'polling-uri4=' lan "
"'polling-uri5=' kanggo nuduhake URL notifikasi. Bisa uga ngemot nilai "
"'frequency=' kanggo nemtokake sepira kerepe (ing menit) URL bakal "
"dipolling; winates ing 30, 60, 360, 720 utawa 1440 (default). Bisa uga "
"ngemot nilai 'cycle=' kanggo ngatur siklus notifikasi."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string defining the 'jump' list task. Should "
"contain the 'name=' value to specify the task's name, the "
"'action-uri=' value to set the URL to load when the jump list is "
"clicked, the 'icon-uri=' value to set the URL to an icon file to be "
"displayed, and 'window-type=' set to either 'tab' (default), 'self' or "
"'window' to control how the link opens in the browser."
msgstr ""
"String sing dipisah nganggo titik koma sing nemtokake tugas dhaptar "
"'jump'. Kudu ngemot nilai 'name=' kanggo nemtokake jeneng tugas, nilai "
"'action-uri=' kanggo nyetel URL sing bakal dimuat nalika dhaptar jump "
"diklik, nilai 'icon-uri=' kanggo nyetel URL menyang file ikon sing "
"bakal ditampilake, lan 'window-type=' disetel dadi 'tab' (default), "
"'self' utawa 'window' kanggo ngatur cara link mbukak ing browser."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated value that controls the dimensions of the "
"initial window. Should contain the values 'width=' and 'height=' to "
"control the width and height respectively."
msgstr ""
"Nilai sing dipisah nganggo semi-kolon sing ngontrol dimensi jendhela "
"awal. Kudu ngemot nilai 'width=' lan 'height=' kanggo ngontrol ambane "
"lan dhuwure kanthi masing-masing."

msgid "Metatag: Open Graph Products"
msgstr "Metatag: Produk Open Graph"

msgid ""
"In the context of search engine optimization, providing an extensive "
"set of meta tags may help improve the site's and pages' rankings, thus "
"may aid with achieving a more prominent display of the content within "
"search engine results. They can also be used to tailor how content is "
"displayed when shared on social networks. For additional information, "
"see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for Metatag</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ing konteks optimasi mesin telusur, nyedhiyakake set meta tag sing "
"jembar bisa mbantu nambah peringkat situs lan kaca, saengga bisa "
"nulungi entuk tampilan konten sing luwih kenthel ing asil mesin "
"telusur. Meta tag uga bisa digunakake kanggo ngatur carane konten "
"ditampilake nalika dibagi ing jaringan sosial. Kanggo informasi luwih "
"lengkap, delengen <a href=\":online\">dokumentasi online kanggo "
"Metatag</a>."

msgid ""
"Override each of the <a href=\":defaults\">other defaults</a>, fill in "
"specific values and tokens that each item should have by default. This "
"allows e.g. for all nodes to have different values than taxonomy "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"Ngalihake saben <a href=\":defaults\">standar liyane</a>, isi nilai "
"lan token tartamtu sing kudu diduweni saben item kanthi standar. Iki "
"ngidini contone kabeh node duwe nilai sing beda saka istilah "
"taksonomi."

msgid ""
"These meta tags are designed to point visitors to versions of the "
"current page in other languages."
msgstr ""
"Meta tag iki dirancang kanggo nuduhake pengunjung menyang versi kaca "
"saiki ing basa liyane."

msgid "Sitename"
msgstr "Jeneng Situs"

msgid ""
"Meta tag patterns are passed down from one level to the next unless "
"they are overridden. To view a summary of the individual meta tags and "
"the pattern for a specific configuration, click on its name below."
msgstr ""
"Pola tag meta diterusake saka siji tingkat menyang tingkat sabanjure "
"kajaba yen diganti. Kanggo ndeleng ringkesan tag meta siji-siji lan "
"pola kanggo konfigurasi tartamtu, klik jenengé ing ngisor iki."

msgid ""
"The URL of an video which should represent the content. For best "
"results use a source that is at least 1200 x 630 pixels in size, but "
"at least 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum. Object types "
"supported include video.episode, video.movie, video.other, and "
"video.tv_show."
msgstr ""
"URL saka video sing kudu nggambarake isi kasebut. Kanggo asil paling "
"apik, gunakake sumber sing ukurane paling ora 1200 x 630 piksel, "
"nanging paling ora 600 x 316 piksel minangka minimal sing disaranake. "
"Jinis objek sing didhukung kalebu video.episode, video.movie, "
"video.other, lan video.tv_show."

msgid ""
"The type of video referenced above. Should be either  video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other, and video.tv_show. Note: there should be one "
"value for each video, and having more than there are videos may cause "
"problems."
msgstr ""
"Jinis video sing kasebut ing ndhuwur. Kudu salah siji video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other, utawa video.tv_show. Cathetan: kudu ana siji "
"nilai kanggo saben video, lan yen luwih saka jumlah video, bisa "
"nyebabake masalah."

msgid "Provides views integration for metatags."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake integrasi views kanggo metatag."

msgid "Metatags for @view : @display have been saved."
msgstr "Metatags kanggo @view : @display wis disimpen."

msgid "Edit @language translation for %view: %display metatags"
msgstr "Sunting terjemahan @language kanggo %view: %display metatags"

msgid "Metatag display extender"
msgstr "Metatag display extender"

msgid "Metatag settings for this view."
msgstr "Setelan Metatag kanggo tampilan iki."

msgid ""
"A link to the preferred page location or URL of the content of this "
"page, to help eliminate duplicate content penalties from search "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"Pranala menyang lokasi kaca sing dipilih utawa URL saka isi kaca iki, "
"kanggo mbantu ngilangi paukuman isi duplikat saka mesin telusur."

msgid ""
"The text to display in the title bar of a visitor's web browser when "
"they view this page. This meta tag may also be used as the title of "
"the page when a visitor bookmarks or favorites this page, or as the "
"page title in a search engine result. It is common to append "
"'[site:name]' to the end of this, so the site's name is automatically "
"added. It is recommended that the title is no greater than 55 - 65 "
"characters long, including spaces."
msgstr ""
"Teks sing ditampilake ing bar judhul browser web pengunjung nalika "
"padha ndeleng kaca iki. Meta tag iki uga bisa digunakake minangka "
"judhul kaca nalika pengunjung marcakake utawa nambahake kaca iki ing "
"favorit, utawa minangka judhul kaca ing asil mesin telusur. Biasane "
"ditambahi '[site:name]' ing pungkasan iki, supaya jeneng situs "
"otomatis ditambahake. Disaranake supaya judhul ora luwih saka 55 - 65 "
"karakter, kalebu spasi."

msgid "URL for a version of this page in %langcode"
msgstr "URL kanggo versi kaca iki ing %langcode"

msgid "Hreflang per language"
msgstr "Hreflang saben basa"

msgid ""
"<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Sets a "
"cookie</a> on the visitor's browser. Can be in either NAME=VALUE "
"format, or a more verbose format including the path and expiration "
"date; see the link for full details on the syntax."
msgstr ""
"<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Nggantos "
"cookie</a> ing panyungging pengunjung. Bisa nganggo format NAME=VALUE, "
"utawa format sing luwih rinci kalebu path lan tanggal kadaluwarsa; "
"waca pranala kanggo rincian lengkap babagan sintaksis."

msgid "Enables metatags for custom routes"
msgstr "Ngaktifaké metatags kanggo rute kustom"

msgid "Add meta tag for custom route"
msgstr "Tambahake meta tag kanggo rute khusus"

msgid "Add custom metatag"
msgstr "Tambahaké metatag kustom"

msgid "The path must begin with /"
msgstr "Path kudu diwiwiti karo /"

msgid "The admin routes should not have metatags."
msgstr "Rute admin ora kudu duwe metatags."

msgid "There are already metatags created for this route."
msgstr "Wis ana metatags sing wis digawe kanggo rute iki."

msgid "The path does not exist as an internal Drupal route."
msgstr "Path kasebut ora ana minangka rute internal Drupal."

msgid "Created metatags for the path: @url. Internal route: @route."
msgstr "Metatags wis digawe kanggo path: @url. Rute internal: @route."

msgid "The metatags could not be created for the path: @url."
msgstr "Metatags ora bisa digawe kanggo path: @url."

msgid "Dublin Core: Instructional Method"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Cara Pembelajaran"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Format Of"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Iku Format Saka"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Part Of"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Kalebu Bagéan Saka"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Referenced By"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Dirujuk Déning"

msgid ""
"Information about who can access the resource or an indication of its "
"security status. Access Rights may include information regarding "
"access or restrictions based on privacy, security, or other policies."
msgstr ""
"Informasi babagan sapa sing bisa ngakses sumber daya utawa pratandha "
"babagan status keamanané. Hak Akses bisa kalebu informasi ngenani "
"akses utawa watesan adhedhasar privasi, keamanan, utawa kabijakan "
"liyane."

msgid ""
"A bibliographic reference for the resource. Recommended practice is to "
"include sufficient bibliographic detail to identify the resource as "
"unambiguously as possible."
msgstr ""
"Referensi bibliografi kanggo sumber daya. Praktek sing disaranake "
"yaiku nyakup rincian bibliografi sing cukup kanggo ngenali sumber daya "
"kanthi cetha tanpa kebingungan."

msgid ""
"Date of acceptance of the resource. Examples of resources to which a "
"Date Accepted may be relevant are a thesis (accepted by a university "
"department) or an article (accepted by a journal)."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal ditampa sumber daya. Conto sumber daya sing bisa ana "
"gandhengane karo Tanggal Ditampa yaiku tesis (ditampa dening "
"departemen universitas) utawa artikel (ditampa dening jurnal)."

msgid ""
"Date of submission of the resource. Examples of resources to which a "
"Date Submitted may be relevant are a thesis (submitted to a university "
"department) or an article (submitted to a journal)."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal pengiriman sumber daya. Tuladha sumber daya sing bisa ana "
"gandhengan karo Tanggal Pengiriman yaiku tesis (sing dikirim menyang "
"departemen universitas) utawa artikel (sing dikirim menyang jurnal)."

msgid ""
"A process, used to engender knowledge, attitudes and skills, that the "
"described resource is designed to support. Instructional Method will "
"typically include ways of presenting instructional materials or "
"conducting instructional activities, patterns of learner-to-learner "
"and learner-to-instructor interactions, and mechanisms by which group "
"and individual levels of learning are measured. Instructional methods "
"include all aspects of the instruction and learning processes from "
"planning and implementation through evaluation and feedback."
msgstr ""
"Proses sing digunakake kanggo ngasilake kawruh, sikap, lan "
"katrampilan, sing sumber sing diterangake dirancang kanggo ndhukung. "
"Cara Instruksional biasane kalebu cara nyedhiyakake bahan "
"instruksional utawa nindakake kegiatan instruksional, pola interaksi "
"antarane murid siji lan murid liyane uga antarane murid lan "
"instruktur, lan mekanisme kanggo ngukur tingkat sinau kelompok lan "
"individu. Cara instruksional nyakup kabeh aspek saka proses instruksi "
"lan sinau wiwit saka perencanaan lan pelaksanaan nganti evaluasi lan "
"umpan balik."

msgid ""
"A related resource of which the described resource is a version, "
"edition, or adaptation. Changes in version imply substantive changes "
"in content rather than differences in format."
msgstr ""
"Sumber sing gegandhengan sing dadi versi, edhisi, utawa adaptasi saka "
"sumber sing diterangake. Owah-owahan ing versi nuduhake owah-owahan "
"isi sing substansial tinimbang bedane format."

msgid ""
"An entity that mediates access to the resource and for whom the "
"resource is intended or useful. In an educational context, a mediator "
"might be a parent, teacher, teaching assistant, or care-giver."
msgstr ""
"Salah sawijining entitas sing ngantara akses menyang sumber daya lan "
"kanggo sapa sumber daya iku ditujokake utawa migunani. Ing konteks "
"pendidikan, mediator bisa dadi wong tuwa, guru, asisten guru, utawa "
"pangurus."

msgid ""
"A statement of any changes in ownership and custody of the resource "
"since its creation that are significant for its authenticity, "
"integrity, and interpretation. The statement may include a description "
"of any changes successive custodians made to the resource."
msgstr ""
"Pernyataan babagan owah-owahan kepemilikan lan pangreksan sumber daya "
"wiwit digawe sing penting kanggo keasliane, integritas, lan "
"interpretasine. Pernyataan kasebut bisa uga nyakup gambaran babagan "
"owah-owahan sing digawe dening pangreksa-pangreksa sakteruse marang "
"sumber daya kasebut."

msgid "Spatial Coverage"
msgstr "Jangkauan Spasial"

msgid ""
"Links a book to an author's Facebook profile, should be either URLs to "
"the author's profile page or their Facebook profile IDs."
msgstr ""
"Nggandhengaké buku karo profil Facebook panganggit, kudu dadi URL "
"menyang kaca profil panganggit utawa ID profil Facebooké."

msgid ""
"The URL of an image which should represent the content. The image must "
"be at least 200 x 200 pixels in size; 600 x 316 pixels is a "
"recommended minimum size, and for best results use an image least 1200 "
"x 630 pixels in size. Supports PNG, JPEG and GIF formats. Should not "
"be used if og:image:url is used. Note: if multiple images are added "
"many services (e.g. Facebook) will default to the largest image, not "
"specifically the first one."
msgstr ""
"URL saka gambar sing kudu nggambarake isi konten. Gambar kasebut kudu "
"paling ora nduweni ukuran 200 x 200 piksel; ukuran minimal sing "
"disaranake yaiku 600 x 316 piksel, lan kanggo asil paling apik "
"gunakake gambar sing paling ora ukuran 1200 x 630 piksel. Ndhukung "
"format PNG, JPEG, lan GIF. Ora kena digunakake yen og:image:url wis "
"digunakake. Cathetan: yen akeh gambar ditambahake, akèh layanan "
"(conto: Facebook) bakal milih gambar paling gedhe kanthi otomatis, ora "
"mesthi gambar sing pisanan."

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price amount"
msgstr "Open Graph Produk: Jumlah rega"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price currency"
msgstr "Open Graph Produk: Mata uang rega"

msgid "Metatag: Pinterest"
msgstr "Metatag: Pinterest"

msgid "Provides support for Pinterest's custom meta tags."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake dhukungan kanggo tag meta khusus Pinterest."

msgid "Pinterest: Description"
msgstr "Pinterest: Katrangan"

msgid "Pinterest: ID"
msgstr "Pinterest: ID"

msgid "Pinterest: Media"
msgstr "Pinterest: Media"

msgid "Pinterest: No hover"
msgstr "Pinterest: Ora ana hover"

msgid "Pinterest: No pin"
msgstr "Pinterest: Ora ana pin"

msgid "Pinterest: URL"
msgstr "Pinterest: URL"

msgid ""
"A set of meta tags used to control how the site's content is consumed "
"by <a href='https://pinterest.com/'>Pinterest</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sakumpulan meta tag sing digunakake kanggo ngontrol carane isi situs "
"kasebut dikonsumsi dening <a "
"href='https://pinterest.com/'>Pinterest</a>."

msgid "The Canonical Pinterest object to pin."
msgstr "Objek Pinterest Canonical kanggo dipin."

msgid "The URL of media which should represent the content."
msgstr "URL saka media sing kudu makili isi konten."

msgid ""
"Do not show hovering Save or Search buttons, generated by the "
"Pinterest browser extensions."
msgstr ""
"Aja nampilake tombol Save utawa Search sing muncul nalika hover, sing "
"digawe dening ekstensi browser Pinterest."

msgid "No pin"
msgstr "Ora ana pin"

msgid ""
"Do not pin anything from this page. When selected, this option will "
"take precedence over all options below."
msgstr ""
"Aja pin apa-apa saka kaca iki. Nalika dipilih, pilihan iki bakal duwe "
"prioritas luwih dhuwur tinimbang kabeh pilihan ing ngisor iki."

msgid "Do not allow Pinterest visual search to happen from this page."
msgstr "Aja ngidini panelusuran visual Pinterest saka kaca iki."

msgid "The URL which should represent the content."
msgstr "URL sing kudu makili isi konten kasebut."

msgid ""
"The custom admin pages for managing Views meta tags at "
"/admin/config/search/metatag/views have been disabled for now, "
"hopefully they'll be back in a future release. Until then, the meta "
"tags can be managed directly on each individual view via the \"Meta "
"tags\" section."
msgstr ""
"Kaca admin khusus kanggo ngatur meta tag Views ing "
"/admin/config/search/metatag/views saiki wis dinonaktifake sementara, "
"muga-muga bakal bali maneh ing versi sing bakal teka. Nganti wektu "
"kuwi, meta tag bisa diatur langsung ing saben tampilan individu liwat "
"bagean \"Meta tags\"."

msgid ""
"To view a list of displays with meta tags set up, click on a view "
"name. To view a summary of meta tags configuration for a particular "
"display, click on the display name. If you need to set meta tags for a "
"specific view, choose Add views meta tags. Reverting the meta tags "
"removes the specific configuration and falls back to defaults."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ndeleng dhaptar tampilan kanthi tag meta sing wis disetel, klik "
"jeneng tampilan. Kanggo ndeleng ringkesan konfigurasi tag meta kanggo "
"tampilan tartamtu, klik jeneng tampilan kasebut. Yen sampeyan perlu "
"nyetel tag meta kanggo tampilan tartamtu, pilih Tambah tag meta "
"tampilan. Mbatalake tag meta bakal ngilangake konfigurasi tartamtu lan "
"bali menyang setelan standar."

msgid "Do you want to revert meta tags for @view_name : @display_name?"
msgstr "Apa kowe pengin mbalekake meta tags kanggo @view_name : @display_name?"

msgid ""
"You are about to revert the custom meta tags for the %display_name "
"display on the %view_name view. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan arep mbalekake tag meta khusus kanggo tampilan %display_name "
"ing tampilan %view_name. Tumindak iki ora bisa dibatalake."

msgid "Reverted meta tags for @view_name : @display_name"
msgstr "Meta tag kanggo @view_name : @display_name wis dibalekake"

msgid "Mobile: Web Manifest"
msgstr "Seluler: Web Manifest"

msgid "Web Manifest"
msgstr "Web Manifest"

msgid "Image 'alt'"
msgstr "Gambar 'alt'"

msgid ""
"A description of what is in the image, not a caption. If the page "
"specifies an og:image it should specify og:image:alt."
msgstr ""
"A description of what is in the image, not a caption. Yen kaca kasebut "
"nemtokake og:image, kudu nemtokake og:image:alt."

msgid "Provides metatag support for Page Manager variants."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake dhukungan metatag kanggo variasi Page Manager."

msgid ""
"Identify which metatag groups should be available on which entity type "
"/ bundle combination. Unselected groups will not appear on the "
"configuration form for that entity type, reducing the size of the form "
"and increasing performance. If no groups are selected for a type, all "
"groups will appear."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi grup metatag endi sing kudu kasedhiya ing gabungan tipe "
"entitas / bundel sing tartamtu. Grup sing ora dipilih ora bakal muncul "
"ing formulir konfigurasi kanggo tipe entitas kasebut, supaya ukuran "
"formulir dadi luwih cilik lan nambah kinerja. Yen ora ana grup sing "
"dipilih kanggo siji tipe, kabeh grup bakal ditampilake."

msgid ""
"This meta tag communicates with Google. There are currently two "
"directives supported: 'nositelinkssearchbox' to not to show the "
"sitelinks search box, and 'notranslate' to ask Google not to offer a "
"translation of the page. Both options may be added, just separate them "
"with a comma. See <a "
"href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>meta "
"tags that Google understands</a> for further details."
msgstr ""
"Meta tag iki komunikasi karo Google. Saiki ana loro arahan sing "
"didhukung: 'nositelinkssearchbox' kanggo ora nampilake kothak "
"panelusuran sitelinks, lan 'notranslate' kanggo nyuwun Google supaya "
"ora nawakake terjemahan kaca kasebut. Karo loro opsi iki bisa "
"ditambahake bebarengan, pisahake nganggo koma. Delengen <a "
"href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>meta "
"tag sing dimangerteni Google</a> kanggo rincian luwih lengkap."

msgid "SVG icon"
msgstr "ikon SVG"

msgid "Pocket"
msgstr "Saku"

msgid ""
"Warning: disabling the Global default metatag will prevent any "
"metatags from being used."
msgstr ""
"Peringatan: mateni metatag default Global bakal nyegah panggunaan "
"metatag apa wae."

msgid ""
"Set the maximum size of an image preview for this page in a search "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Setel ukuran maksimal pratayang gambar kanggo kaca iki ing asil "
"panelusuran."

msgid "Standard - a default image preview may be shown."
msgstr "Standard - pratayang gambar standar bisa dituduhake."

msgid ""
"Large - a larger image preview, up to the width of the viewport, may "
"be shown."
msgstr ""
"Gedhe - pratayang gambar sing luwih gedhe, nganti ambane viewport, "
"bisa ditampilake."

msgid "Metatag: Favicons"
msgstr "Metatag: Favicons"

msgid ""
"Provides an absolute URL to a specially formatted version of the "
"current page designed for 'feature phones', mobile phones that do not "
"support modern browser standards. See the <a "
"href='https://developers.google.com/webmasters/mobile-sites/mobile-seo/other-devices?hl=en#feature_phones'>official "
"Google Mobile SEO Guide</a> for details on how the page should be "
"formatted."
msgstr ""
"Menehi URL absolut menyang versi kaca saiki sing wis diformat khusus "
"kanggo 'feature phones', telpon seluler sing ora ndhukung standar "
"browser modern. Deleng <a "
"href='https://developers.google.com/webmasters/mobile-sites/mobile-seo/other-devices?hl=en#feature_phones'>Pandhuan "
"SEO Mobile Google resmi</a> kanggo rincian babagan cara kaca kasebut "
"kudu diformat."

msgid "Open Graph: Video duration"
msgstr "Open Graph: Dawa vidio"

msgid ""
"The date this content will expire, with an optional time value. Needs "
"to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal konten iki bakal kadaluwarsa, kanthi nilai wektu opsional. "
"Kudu nganggo format <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>."

msgid ""
"The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal isi iki pungkasan dimodifikasi, kanthi nilai wektu opsional. "
"Kudu nganggo format <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>."

msgid ""
"The date this content was published on, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal kontèn iki diterbitaké, karo nilai wektu sing opsional. Kudu "
"nganggo format <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a>."

msgid ""
"The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format. Can be the same as the 'Article modification date' "
"tag."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal isi iki pungkasan diowahi, karo nilai wektu opsional. Kudu "
"nganggo format <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a>. Bisa padha karo tag 'Tanggal owah-owahan Artikel'."

msgid ""
"Preferred page location or URL to help eliminate duplicate content for "
"search engines, e.g., <em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."
msgstr ""
"Lokasi kaca utawa URL sing dipilih kanggo mbantu ngilangi isi duplikat "
"kanggo mesin telusur, contone, "
"<em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."

msgid "All meta tags in the \"@group\" group."
msgstr "Kabeh meta tag ing grup \"@group\"."

msgid ""
"Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not "
"commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Pragma meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Digunakaké kanggo ngontrol apa browser nyimpen kaca tartamtu sacara "
"lokal. Ora lumrah digunakaké. Kudu digunakaké bebarengan karo tag "
"meta Pragma."

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='next' link."
msgstr ""
"Digunakake kanggo isi sing dipaginasèkaké kanthi nyedhiyakake URL "
"nganggo pranala rel='next'."

msgid ""
"Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not "
"commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Cache-Control "
"meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Digunakake kanggo ngatur apa browser nyimpen kaca tartamtu sacara "
"lokal. Ora asring digunakake. Kudu digunakake bebarengan karo tag meta "
"Cache-Control."

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='prev' link."
msgstr ""
"Digunakake kanggo isi sing dipérang kaca kanthi nyedhiyakake URL "
"nganggo pranala rel='prev'."

msgid ""
"Provides the fifteen <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Element Set 1.1</a> meta tags from the <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr ""
"Menyedhiyakake limalas <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Element Set 1.1</a> meta tag saka <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."

msgid ""
"Provides forty additional meta tags from the <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nyedhiyakake patang puluh meta tag tambahan saka <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."

msgid "Metatag: Hreflang"
msgstr "Metatag: Hreflang"

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string that must contain the 'polling-uri=' "
"value with the full URL to a <a "
"href='https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkID=314019'>Badge Schema "
"XML file</a>. May also contain 'frequency=' value set to either 30, "
"60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default) which specifies (in minutes) how often "
"the URL should be polled."
msgstr ""
"String sing dipisah nganggo semi-kolon sing kudu ngemot nilai "
"'polling-uri=' kanthi URL lengkap menyang <a "
"href='https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkID=314019'>file Badge "
"Schema XML</a>. Uga bisa ngemot nilai 'frequency=' sing disetel dadi "
"30, 60, 360, 720 utawa 1440 (default) sing nemtokake (ing menit) pira "
"kerepe URL kasebut kudu dipolling."

msgid "Metatag: Page Manager"
msgstr "Metatag: Manajer Kaca"

msgid "If checked, the field will be placed in the sidebar on entity forms."
msgstr ""
"Yen diceklis, lapangan bakal dipasang ing sidebar ing formulir "
"entitas."

msgid "Use sidebar: Yes"
msgstr "Gunakake sidebar: Ya"

msgid ""
"Control when the browser's internal cache of the current page should "
"expire. The date must to be an <a "
"href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a>-compliant "
"date string that is represented in Greenwich Mean Time (GMT), e.g. "
"'Thu, 01 Sep 2016 00:12:56 GMT'. Set to '0' to stop the page being "
"cached entirely."
msgstr ""
"Kontrol kapan cache internal browser kanggo kaca saiki kudu "
"kadaluwarsa. Tanggal kudu dadi string tanggal sing cocog karo <a "
"href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a> "
"lan diwakili ing Greenwich Mean Time (GMT), contone 'Kam, 01 Sep 2016 "
"00:12:56 GMT'. Setel dadi '0' kanggo mandhegake kaca kasebut disimpen "
"ing cache sacara lengkap."

msgid ""
"The number of seconds to wait before refreshing the page. May also "
"force redirect to another page using the format '5; "
"url=https://example.com/', which would be triggered after five "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah detik kanggo ngenteni sadurunge nyegarkan kaca. Uga bisa meksa "
"ngarahake menyang kaca liyane nganggo format '5; "
"url=https://example.com/', sing bakal ditindakake sawisé limang "
"detik."

msgid ""
"The secure URL to an audio file that complements this object. All "
"'http://' URLs will automatically be converted to 'https://'."
msgstr ""
"URL sing aman kanggo file audio sing nambahaké objek iki. Kabeh URL "
"'http://' bakal otomatis diowahi dadi 'https://'."

msgid "Metatag Extended Permissions"
msgstr "Izin Metatag Sing Diperluas"

msgid "Access %tag in %group"
msgstr "Akses %tag ing %group"

msgid ""
"A color in hexadecimal format, e.g. '#0000ff' for blue; must include "
"the '#' symbol. Used by some browsers to control the background color "
"of the toolbar, the color used with an icon, etc."
msgstr ""
"Warna ing format heksadesimal, contone '#0000ff' kanggo warna biru; "
"kudu kalebu simbol '#'. Digunakake dening sawetara browser kanggo "
"ngatur warna latar toolbar, warna sing digunakake karo ikon, lan "
"liya-liyane."

msgid ""
"The <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are used to "
"control how Facebook, Pinterest, LinkedIn and other social networking "
"sites interpret the site's content.<br><br>The Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's "
"shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr ""
"<a href='https://ogp.me/'>Tag meta Open Graph</a> digunakake kanggo "
"ngontrol carane Facebook, Pinterest, LinkedIn lan situs jejaring "
"sosial liyane nerjemahake isi situs.<br><br>Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> ngidini sampeyan ndeleng pratayang carane isi sampeyan "
"bakal katon nalika dibagi menyang Facebook lan ngatasi masalah apa wae "
"karo tag Open Graph sampeyan."

msgid ""
"These <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are for "
"describing products.<br><br>The Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's "
"shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr ""
"Iki <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> kanggo "
"nerangake produk.<br><br>Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> ngidini sampeyan ndeleng pratayang konten sampeyan nalika "
"dibagi menyang Facebook lan mbenerake masalah apa wae karo tag Open "
"Graph sampeyan."

msgid ""
"The URL to a unique image representing the content of the page. Do not "
"use a generic image such as your website logo, author photo, or other "
"image that spans multiple pages. Images larger than 120x120px will be "
"resized and cropped square based on longest dimension. Images smaller "
"than 60x60px will not be shown. If the 'type' is set to Photo then the "
"image must be at least 280x150px."
msgstr ""
"URL kanggo gambar unik sing makili isi kaca. Aja nggunakake gambar "
"umum kaya logo situs web, foto panganggit, utawa gambar liya sing "
"nyebar ing pirang-pirang kaca. Gambar sing luwih gedhe saka 120x120px "
"bakal digawe ulang ukuran lan dipotong dadi bunderan adhedhasar "
"dimensi paling dawa. Gambar sing luwih cilik saka 60x60px ora bakal "
"ditampilake. Yen 'type' disetel dadi Photo, gambar kudu paling ora "
"280x150px."

msgid ""
"The full URL for an MP4 video (h.264) or audio (AAC) stream, takes "
"precedence over the other media player field."
msgstr ""
"URL lengkap kanggo video MP4 (h.264) utawa audio (AAC) stream, "
"nduwèni prioritas luwih dhuwur tinimbang kolom media player liyane."

msgid ""
"To use tokens to image fields, the image field on that entity bundle "
"(content type, term, etc) must have the \"Token\" display settings "
"enabled, the image field must not be hidden, and it must be set to "
"output as an image, e.g. using the \"Thumbnail\" field formatter. It "
"is also recommended to use an appropriate image style that resizes the "
"image rather than output the original image; see individual meta tag "
"descriptions for size recommendations."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nggunakake token ing kolom gambar, kolom gambar ing bundle "
"entitas kasebut (tipe konten, istilah, lsp) kudu diaktifake setelan "
"tampilan \"Token\", kolom gambar ora kena disumputake, lan kudu "
"disetel kanggo nampilake minangka gambar, contone nganggo format kolom "
"\"Thumbnail\". Uga disaranake kanggo nggunakake gaya gambar sing cocog "
"sing ngganti ukuran gambar tinimbang nampilake gambar asli; delengen "
"katrangan meta tag saben-saben kanggo rekomendasi ukuran."

msgid ""
"This will be able to extract the URL from an image field if the field "
"is configured properly."
msgstr ""
"Iki bakal bisa ngambil URL saka lapangan gambar yen lapangan kasebut "
"wis dikonfigurasi kanthi bener."

msgid ""
"Used to rate content for audience appropriateness. This tag has little "
"known influence on search engine rankings, but can be used by "
"browsers, browser extensions, and apps. The <a "
"href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>most common "
"options</a> are general, mature, restricted, 14 years, safe for kids. "
"If you follow the <a "
"href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>RTA "
"Documentation</a> you should enter RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA"
msgstr ""
"Digunakake kanggo ngukur isi supaya cocog karo pamirsa. Tanda iki ora "
"duwe pengaruh sing gedhe marang peringkat mesin telusur, nanging bisa "
"digunakake dening panyungging, ekstensi panyungging, lan aplikasi. <a "
"href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>Pilihan sing paling "
"umum</a> yaiku umum, dewasa, diwatesi, 14 taun, aman kanggo bocah. Yen "
"sampeyan ngetutake <a "
"href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>Dokumentasi "
"RTA</a> sampeyan kudu mlebu RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA"

msgid "@label of @type"
msgstr "@label saka @type"

msgid "@label of @type @entity-type-label"
msgstr "@label saka @type @entity-type-label"

msgid "This plugin will be cloned from these settings for each custom tag."
msgstr "Plugin iki bakal dikloning saka setelan iki kanggo saben tag kustom."

msgid "Place field in collapsed details container"
msgstr "Tempataké kolom ing wadhah rincian sing disengkuyung"

msgid "Trim method for trimmable tags."
msgstr "Cara trim kanggo tag sing bisa dipotong."

msgid "Tag-specific maximum length"
msgstr "Dawane maksimal khusus tag"

msgid "Tag maximum length in characters"
msgstr "Dawa maksimum tag ing karakter"

msgid ""
"Adds individual permissions for each meta tag, allowing for "
"fine-grained access to the meta tags. Note: this may lead to "
"performance issues on the permissions admin page, please see the "
"included README.txt file for details."
msgstr ""
"Nambahake ijin individu kanggo saben meta tag, supaya akses marang "
"meta tag bisa diatur kanthi luwih rinci. Cathetan: iki bisa nyebabake "
"masalah kinerja ing kaca admin ijin, mangga delengen file README.txt "
"sing kasedhiya kanggo rincian luwih lengkap."

msgid "Mask icon color"
msgstr "Werna ikon topeng"

msgid ""
"Color attribute for SVG (mask) icon in hexadecimal format, e.g. "
"'#0000ff'. Setting it will break HTML validation. If not set macOS "
"Safari ignores the Mask Icon entirely, making the Icon: SVG completely "
"useless."
msgstr ""
"Atribut warna kanggo ikon SVG (masker) nganggo format heksadesimal, "
"contone '#0000ff'. Yen disetel, iki bakal nggawe validasi HTML gagal. "
"Yen ora disetel, macOS Safari bakal nglirwakake Mask Icon kanthi "
"sakabehe, nggawe Ikon: SVG dadi ora ana gunane."

msgid "Mask icon (SVG)"
msgstr "Ikon topeng (SVG)"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price availability"
msgstr "Open Graph Produk: Kasedhiyan rega"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Product condition"
msgstr "Open Graph Produk: Kahanan produk"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Retailer Item ID"
msgstr "Open Graph Product: ID Barang Pengecer"

msgid "Product condition"
msgstr "Kahanan produk"

msgid "The condition of the product."
msgstr "Kahanan produk."

msgid "Retailer Item ID"
msgstr "ID Barang Pengecer"

msgid "The ID of the product as provided by the retailer."
msgstr "ID saka produk sing diwènèhaké déning pengecer."

msgid ""
"Empty update script to clear the site's caches so the new token "
"replacement functionality will work."
msgstr ""
"Skrip pembaruan kosong kanggo mbusak cache situs supaya fungsi "
"panggantos token anyar bisa mlaku kanthi bener."

msgid "Metatag Trimming Options"
msgstr "Pilihan Pangkas Metatag"

msgid ""
"Many Meta-Tags can be trimmed on a specific length for search engine "
"optimization.<br/>If the value is set to '0' or left empty, the whole "
"Metatag will be untrimmed."
msgstr ""
"Akeh Meta-Tag bisa dipangkas kanthi dawa tartamtu kanggo optimisasi "
"mesin panelusuran.<br/>Yen nilaine diatur dadi '0' utawa dibiarkan "
"kosong, kabeh Metatag ora bakal dipangkas."

msgid "Meta Tags:"
msgstr "Meta Tags:"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag after the word on the given value"
msgstr "Potong Tag Meta sawisé tembung ing nilai sing diwènèhaké"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag on the given value"
msgstr "Ngirit Meta Tag saka nilai sing diwenehake"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag before the word on the given value"
msgstr "Potong Meta Tag sakdurunge tembung ing nilai sing diwenehake"

msgid "Wrap the meta tags in a collapsed details container."
msgstr "Bungkus tag meta nganggo kontainer details sing dilipat."

msgid ""
"If checked, the contents of the field will be placed inside a "
"collapsed details container."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, isi saka lapangan bakal dilebokake nang jero kontainer "
"rincian sing dilipat."

msgid "Use details container: Yes"
msgstr "Gunakake container rincian: Ya"

msgid "Use details container: No"
msgstr "Gunakake kontainer rincian: Ora"

msgid ""
"Geo-spatial information in 'latitude; longitude' format, e.g. "
"'50.167958; -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' "
"aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate "
"system'>see Wikipedia for details</a>."
msgstr ""
"Informasi geo-spasial ing format 'lintang; bujur', contone '50.167958; "
"-97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' "
"aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate "
"system'>delengen Wikipedia kanggo rincian luwih lengkap</a>."

msgid ""
"Geo-spatial information in 'latitude, longitude' format, e.g. "
"'50.167958, -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see "
"Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>see Wikipedia for "
"details</a>."
msgstr ""
"Informasi geo-spasial ing format 'lintang, bujur', contone '50.167958, "
"-97.133185'; <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' "
"aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>delengen "
"Wikipedia kanggo rincian</a>."

msgid "Token Or"
msgstr "Token Utawa"

msgid "Add max height value"
msgstr "Tambahaké nilai dhuwur maksimal"

msgid "Metatag Custom Routes (Paths)"
msgstr "Rute Metatag Kustom (Jalur)"

msgid "Route / Path"
msgstr "Rute / Dalane"

msgid ""
"Enter the route (path) for this new configuration, starting with a "
"leading slash.<br />Note: this must already exist as a path in Drupal."
msgstr ""
"Lebokna rute (jalur) kanggo konfigurasi anyar iki, diwiwiti karo garis "
"miring ing ngarep.<br />Cathetan: iki kudu wis ana minangka jalur ing "
"Drupal."

msgid "Site validation: SIWECOS"
msgstr "Validasi situs: SIWECOS"

msgid "Google Site Verification"
msgstr "Verifikasi Situs Google"

msgid "SIWECOS"
msgstr "SIWECOS"

msgid "Metatag widget options"
msgstr "Pilihan widget Metatag"

msgid ""
"Various options for the field widget used on entity forms, e.g. on "
"content type forms."
msgstr ""
"Macem-macem pilihan kanggo widget kolom sing digunakake ing formulir "
"entitas, contone ing formulir jinis konten."

msgid "Scroll maximum height"
msgstr "Gulung dhuwur maksimum"

msgid "eg 500px or 8rem"
msgstr "umpamane 500px utawa 8rem"

msgid ""
"To enable scrolling please enter a value and its units, e.g. 500px, "
"8rem, etc. Removing this value will remove the scroll."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo ngaktifake gulung, mangga lebokake nilai lan unité, umpama "
"500px, 8rem, lsp. Nglangi nilai iki bakal ngilangake gulungan."

msgid "Define the author of a page."
msgstr "Tentukan panganggit sawijining kaca."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\"@module\">Token OR module</a> is suggested for when the "
"basic content tokens are not flexible enough, e.g. to make a meta tag "
"show the contents of one field if it is filled in or another if the "
"first one is empty."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@module\">Token UTawa module</a> disaranake nalika token "
"konten dhasar ora cukup fleksibel, contone kanggo nggawe tag meta "
"nampilake isi saka siji kolom yen wis diisi utawa liyane yen sing "
"pisanan kosong."

msgid "Href per language"
msgstr "Href saben basa"

msgid ""
"This was expected to be an array but it is not: \n"
"%value"
msgstr ""
"Iki diarepake dadi array nanging iki dudu: \n"
"%value"

msgid ""
"This could not be unserialized: \n"
"%value"
msgstr ""
"Iki ora bisa di-unserialize: \n"
"%value"

msgid "Metatag Field Diff"
msgstr "Metatag Bedane Kolom"

msgid "Use Maxlength module to force these limits?"
msgstr "Gunakake modul Maxlength kanggo memaksa watesan iki?"

msgid "Install the Maxlength module to enable this option."
msgstr "Instal modul Maxlength kanggo ngaktifake pilihan iki."

msgid "Intended workflow"
msgstr "Alur kerja sing diarepake"

msgid ""
"Allows assigning meta tags to be used on custom routes, equivalent to "
"custom paths."
msgstr ""
"Ngidini menehi tag meta kanggo digunakake ing rute khusus, padha karo "
"jalur khusus."

msgid ""
"Indicate to search engines and other page scrapers whether or not "
"links should be followed. See <a "
"href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>the W3C "
"specifications</a> for further details. Note: this serves the same "
"purpose as the HTTP header by the same name."
msgstr ""
"Tandhani marang mesin telusur lan scraper kaca liyane apa link kudu "
"dituruti utawa ora. Delengen <a "
"href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>spesifikasi "
"W3C</a> kanggo rincian luwih lengkap. Cathetan: iki nduweni tujuan "
"sing padha kaya header HTTP kanthi jeneng sing padha."

msgid "Max Snippet"
msgstr "Max Potongan"

msgid ""
"Use a number character as a textual snippet for this search result. "
"\"0\" equals \"nosnippet\". \"-1\" will let the search engine decide "
"the most effective length."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake karakter angka minangka potongan teks kanggo asil telusuran "
"iki. \"0\" tegese \"nosnippet\". \"-1\" bakal ngidini mesin telusur "
"mutusake dawa sing paling efektif."

msgid ""
"Use a maximum of number seconds as a video snippet for videos on this "
"page in search results. \"0\" will use a static a image. \"-1\" means "
"there is no limit."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake maksimal jumlah detik minangka cuplikan video kanggo video "
"ing kaca iki ing asil panelusuran. \"0\" bakal nggunakake gambar "
"statis. \"-1\" tegese ora ana watesan."

msgid "Max Image Preview"
msgstr "Pratayang Gambar Maksimum"

msgid "Unavailable after date"
msgstr "Ora kasedhiya sawise tanggal"

msgid "Do not show this page in search results after the specified date"
msgstr ""
"Aja nampilake kaca iki ing asil panelusuran sawisé tanggal sing wis "
"ditemtokake"

msgid ""
"There were no overridden Metatag records that needed to be updated to "
"store the data using JSON."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana cathetan Metatag sing wis ditindhes sing perlu dianyari kanggo "
"nyimpen data nggunakake JSON."

msgid ""
"Processed @processed of @total updating Metatag records with the "
"Publisher or Name meta tags."
msgstr ""
"Wis diproses @processed saka @total nganyari rekaman Metatag kanthi "
"tag meta Publisher utawa Name."

msgid "There were no Metatag records to update."
msgstr "Ora ana cathetan Metatag sing perlu dianyari."

msgid "Removed meta tags from the @config Metatag configuration."
msgstr "Mbusak meta tag saka konfigurasi Metatag @config."

msgid "Metatag: Google Plus is not enabled, nothing to do."
msgstr "Metatag: Google Plus ora diaktifake, ora ana sing kudu ditindakake."

msgid "Metatag: Google Plus has been uninstalled."
msgstr "Metatag: Google Plus wis dicopot."

msgid ""
"Corrected the Twitter Card \"type\" value in the @config Metatag "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Nggantos nilai \"type\" Twitter Card ing konfigurasi @config Metatag "
"kanthi bener."

msgid "The computed meta tags for the entity."
msgstr "Tag meta sing wis diitung kanggo entitas kasebut."

