msgid "Separator used with multiple values"
msgstr "Pemisah sing digunakake karo nilai luwih saka siji"

msgid ""
"Controls the separator used when a meta tag allows multiple values. "
"Multiple characters can be used together, it does not have to be one "
"single character long. Defaults to \":default\"."
msgstr ""
"Ngontrol separator sing digunakake nalika tag meta ngidini "
"pirang-pirang nilai. Pirang-pirang karakter bisa digunakake "
"bebarengan, ora kudu siji karakter siji wae. Defaulté yaiku "
"\":default\"."

msgid ""
"Multiple values may be used, separated by `:delimiter`. Note: Tokens "
"that return multiple values will be handled automatically."
msgstr ""
"Bisa digunakake nilai ganda, dipisah nganggo `:delimiter`. Cathetan: "
"Token sing mbalekake nilai ganda bakal ditangani sacara otomatis."

msgid ""
"The full URL for loading a media player, specifically an iframe for an "
"embedded video rather than the URL to a page that contains a player. "
"Required when using the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"URL lengkap kanggo mbukak pemutar media, khususé iframe kanggo video "
"sing disisipaké tinimbang URL menyang kaca sing ngemot pemutar. "
"Dibutuhake nalika nggunakake jinis Player Card."

msgid ""
"The height of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using "
"the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Dhuwur iframe pemuter media, ing piksel. Dibutuhake nalika nggunakake "
"jinis Kertu Pemuter."

msgid ""
"The width of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using "
"the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Ambane iframe pemuter media, ing piksel. Diperlukan nalika nggunakake "
"jinis Player Card."

msgid ""
"This will be truncated to a maximum of %max characters after any "
"tokens are processed."
msgstr ""
"Iki bakal dipunpotong nganti maksimal %max karakter sawisé sembarang "
"token diproses."

msgid ""
"Because of how tokens are processed in meta tags, use of the Maxlength "
"module may not provide an accurate representation of the actual "
"current length of each meta tag, so it may cause more problem than it "
"is worth."
msgstr ""
"Amarga carane token diproses ing meta tag, panggunaan modul Maxlength "
"bisa uga ora nyedhiyakake gambaran sing akurat babagan dawa nyata "
"saiki saka saben meta tag, mula bisa nyebabake luwih akeh masalah "
"tinimbang keuntungan sing dipikolehi."

msgid ""
"Control the Metatag settings pages. Does not control access to the "
"Metatag field on content forms, etc, use the Field Permissions module "
"or hook_form_alter()."
msgstr ""
"Ngontrol kaca setelan Metatag. Ora ngontrol akses menyang kolom "
"Metatag ing formulir konten, lsp., gunakna modul Field Permissions "
"utawa hook_form_alter()."

