msgstr "Sunting tag Kustom @label"

msgid ""
"These custom tags are designed to use the custom purpose on the "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Tag khusus iki dirancang kanggo nggunakake tujuan khusus ing situs "
"web."

msgid "The entities routes metatags must be added by fields."
msgstr "Entities routes metatags kudu ditambahake dening fields."

msgid "Trimming options"
msgstr "Pilihan motong"

msgid ""
"A list of characters to trim at the end of all metatags. Provide a "
"single string without any separators, e.g. \"|,.\" (instead of \"| , "
".\"). Note that spaces, tabs, new lines, carriage returns and vertical "
"tabs (\" \\n"
"\\r\\t\\v\") will be trimmed automatically and do not "
"need to be listed in this field. The trimming is applied at the very "
"end after the tag is trimmed for length, and after the trimming option "
"was executed."
msgstr ""
"Dhaptar karakter sing bakal dipotong ing pungkasan kabeh metatag. "
"Wenehake siji string tanpa pemisah, contone \"|,.\" (tinimbang \"| , "
".\"). Elinga yen spasi, tab, baris anyar, carriage return, lan "
"vertical tab (\" \\n"
"\\r\\t\\v\") bakal dipotong kanthi otomatis lan "
"ora perlu didaftarake ing kolom iki. Potongan iki ditindakake ing "
"pungkasan banget sawisé tag dipotong miturut dawa, lan sawisé opsi "
"trimming dilaksanakake."

msgid "Configuration instance"
msgstr "Instansi konfigurasi"

msgid ""
"Meta tag configuration, stored as either a serialized array or a "
"JSON-encoded string."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi tag meta, disimpen minangka array sing diserialisasi utawa "
"string sing di-encode nganggo JSON."

msgid "Expected an array but got null or other type for group: @group_name"
msgstr ""
"Ngajèkaké array nanging entuk null utawa jinis liya kanggo grup: "
"@group_name"

msgid "Optional suffix to add"
msgstr "Suffix opsional kanggo ditambahake"

msgid "Element of the HTML tag. e.g. meta, link, etc."
msgstr "Elemen saka tag HTML. umpama meta, link, lsp."

msgid ""
"The name of the html value attribute. e.g. content, href, charset, "
"etc."
msgstr "Jeneng saka atribut nilai html. contone content, href, charset, lsp."

msgid ""
"Enter a unique identifier for this custom tag. This identifier can "
"contain lowercase letters, numbers and underscores. This is only used "
"internally, it is not used in the actual HTML output."
msgstr ""
"Lebokake identifier unik kanggo tag kustom iki. Identifier iki bisa "
"ngemot huruf cilik, angka, lan garis ngisor. Iki mung digunakake "
"sacara internal, ora digunakake ing output HTML sing nyata."

msgid ""
"Select the Value attribute of the Custom tag. This determines which "
"HTML attribute will contain the user-provided content."
msgstr ""
"Pilih atribut Value saka tag Custom. Iki nemtokake atribut HTML sing "
"bakal ngemot isi sing diwenehake pangguna."

msgid ""
"Define the HTML attributes for this custom meta tag. The first "
"attribute serves as the primary identifier and is required. Additional "
"attributes are optional and provide fixed values for all instances of "
"this tag."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan atribut HTML kanggo meta tag khusus iki. Atribut pisanan "
"nduwèni fungsi minangka pangidentifikasi utama lan kudu ana. Atribut "
"tambahan bersifat opsional lan menehi nilai tetep kanggo kabèh "
"instansi tag iki."

msgid "Primary attribute (Required)"
msgstr "Atribut utama (Kudu)"

msgid "Additional attribute @num"
msgstr "Atribut tambahan @num"

msgid "This attribute identifies the meta tag and is required."
msgstr "Atribut iki ngenali tag meta lan dibutuhake."

msgid "This attribute provides a fixed value for all instances of this tag."
msgstr "Atribut iki nyedhiyakake nilai tetep kanggo kabeh instansi tag iki."

msgid "Common values: name, property, rel, http-equiv, itemprop."
msgstr "Nilai umum: name, property, rel, http-equiv, itemprop."

msgid "Additional attribute name (e.g., type, sizes)."
msgstr "Jeneng atribut tambahan (contone, type, sizes)."

msgid ""
"For new tags, defaults to the machine name. For existing tags, this "
"identifies the specific meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo tag anyar, otomatis nganggo jeneng mesin. Kanggo tag sing wis "
"ana, iki kanggo ngenali meta tag sing spesifik."

msgid "Fixed value for this attribute."
msgstr "Nilai tetep kanggo atribut iki."

msgid ""
"\n"
"        <h4>Common Examples:</h4>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Basic meta tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: name = \"description\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"name=\"description\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Open Graph tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: property = \"og:title\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"property=\"og:title\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Twitter Card:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: name = \"twitter:card\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Link with type:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: rel = \"icon\"<br>\n"
"            Additional attribute: type "
"= \"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;link rel=\"icon\" "
"type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"        "
"</ul>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"<h4>Conto Umum:</h4>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"          <li><strong>Tag meta "
"dasar:</strong><br>\n"
"            Atribut utama: name = "
"\"description\"<br>\n"
"            Asil: &lt;meta name=\"description\" "
"content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          <li><strong>Tag Open "
"Graph:</strong><br>\n"
"            Atribut utama: property = "
"\"og:title\"<br>\n"
"            Asil: &lt;meta property=\"og:title\" "
"content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          <li><strong>Kartu "
"Twitter:</strong><br>\n"
"            Atribut utama: name = "
"\"twitter:card\"<br>\n"
"            Asil: &lt;meta "
"name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Link karo jinis:</strong><br>\n"
"            Atribut utama: "
"rel = \"icon\"<br>\n"
"            Atribut tambahan: type = "
"\"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n"
"            Asil: &lt;link rel=\"icon\" "
"type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"        "
"</ul>"

