msgstr "peta situs"

msgid "generating"
msgstr "ngasilake"

msgid ""
"Uncheck this if you intend to only regenerate the sitemaps manually or "
"via drush."
msgstr ""
"Copot centhang iki yen sampeyan mung arep ngasilake sitemap maneh "
"kanthi manual utawa liwat drush."

msgid "Default sitemap generator"
msgstr "Generator sitemap standar"

msgid "Generates a standard conform hreflang sitemap of your content."
msgstr "Ngasilake sitemap hreflang standar sing cocog karo isi sampeyan."

msgid "Generating XML sitemaps"
msgstr "Nggawe sitemap XML"

msgid "Progress of sitemap regeneration"
msgstr "Kemajuan regenerasi sitemap"

msgid "Sitemaps"
msgstr "Peta Situs"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap PHP extensions"
msgstr "Extension PHP Sitemap XML Sederhana"

msgid ""
"In order to be able to generate sitemaps, the Simple XML Sitemap "
"module requires the <em>xmlwriter</em> PHP extension to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo bisa nggawe sitemap, modul Simple XML Sitemap mbutuhake "
"ekstensi PHP <em>xmlwriter</em> sing wis diaktifake."

msgid "Include a stylesheet in the sitemaps for humans"
msgstr "Kalebu stylesheet ing sitemap kanggo manungsa"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap (Views)"
msgstr "Simple XML Sitemap (Views)"

msgid ""
"Provides integration of the Simple XML Sitemap module with the Views "
"module."
msgstr "Nyedhiyakake integrasi modul Simple XML Sitemap karo modul Views."

msgid ""
"No view displays are set to be indexed yet. <a href=\"@url\">Edit a "
"view.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Durung ana tampilan view sing disetel kanggo diindeks. <a "
"href=\"@url\">Sunting tampilan.</a>"

msgid "The priority this display will have in the eyes of search engine bots."
msgstr ""
"Prioritas sing bakal diduweni tampilan iki ing mripat bot mesin "
"panelusuran."

msgid "Maximum display variations"
msgstr "Variasi tampilan maksimal"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of link variations to be indexed for this display. "
"If left blank, each argument will create link variations for this "
"display. Use with caution, as a large number of argument values​can "
"significantly increase the number of sitemap links."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah maksimum variasi pranala sing bakal diindeks kanggo tampilan "
"iki. Yen dikosongi, saben argumen bakal nggawe variasi pranala kanggo "
"tampilan iki. Gunakake kanthi ati-ati, amarga jumlah nilai argumen "
"sing akeh banget bisa nambah kanthi signifikan jumlah pranala sitemap."

msgid "Resume generation"
msgstr "Generasi riwayat urip"

msgid "Add styling and sorting to sitemaps"
msgstr "Tambah gaya lan sortir menyang peta situs"

msgid ""
"If checked, sitemaps will be displayed as tables with sortable entries "
"and thus become much friendlier towards human visitors. Search engines "
"will not care."
msgstr ""
"Yen dicenthang, sitemap bakal ditampilake minangka tabel kanthi entri "
"sing bisa diurutake lan dadi luwih ramah marang pengunjung manungsa. "
"Mesin telusur ora bakal peduli."

msgid ""
"If checked, entity links are generated exclusively for languages the "
"entity has been translated to as long as the language is not excluded "
"below.<br>Otherwise entity links are generated for every language "
"installed on the site apart from languages excluded below.<br>Bear in "
"mind that non-entity paths like homepage will always be generated for "
"every non-excluded language."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, pranala entitas mung digawe kanggo basa sing entitas wis "
"diterjemahake sajrone basa kasebut ora kalebu ing ngisor iki.<br>Yen "
"ora, pranala entitas digawe kanggo saben basa sing wis diinstal ing "
"situs kajaba basa sing kalebu ing ngisor iki.<br>Eleng, dalan sing "
"dudu entitas kaya kaca ngarep bakal tansah digawe kanggo saben basa "
"sing ora kalebu ing ngisor iki."

msgid ""
"On some hosting providers it is impossible to pass parameters to cron "
"to tell Drupal which URL to bootstrap with. In this case the base URL "
"of sitemap links can be overridden here.<br>Example: <em>@url</em>"
msgstr ""
"Ing sawetawis panyedhiya hosting ora bisa ngeterake parameter menyang "
"cron kanggo ngandhani Drupal URL endi sing kudu di-bootstrap. Ing "
"kahanan iki, URL dhasar saka pranala sitemap bisa diganti ing "
"kene.<br>Conto: <em>@url</em>"

msgid ""
"The maximum duration <strong>in seconds</strong> the generation task "
"can run during a single cron run or during one batch process "
"iteration.<br>The higher the number, the quicker the generation "
"process, but higher the risk of PHP timeout errors."
msgstr ""
"Maksimal dawane <strong>ing detik</strong> tugas generasi bisa mlaku "
"sajrone siji kront cron utawa sajrone siji iterasi proses "
"batch.<br>Yen nomer luwih dhuwur, proses generasi bakal luwih cepet, "
"nanging risiko kesalahan timeout PHP uga luwih dhuwur."

msgid ""
"Administer Simple XML Sitemap settings, alter inclusion settings of "
"content and generate sitemaps on demand."
msgstr ""
"Ngatur setelan Simple XML Sitemap, ngganti setelan kalebu isi, lan "
"nggawe sitemap miturut panjalukan."

msgid "Regenerate all sitemaps after hitting <em>Save</em>"
msgstr "Nggawe maneh kabèh sitemap sawise pencet <em>Save</em>"

msgid "Otherwise the sitemaps will be regenerated during a future cron run."
msgstr "Yen ora, sitemap bakal digawe ulang nalika cron mbesuk mlaku."

msgid ""
"The priority this <em>@bundle</em> entity will have in the eyes of "
"search engine bots."
msgstr ""
"Prioritas sing bakal diduweni entitas <em>@bundle</em> iki ing mripat "
"bot mesin telusur."

msgid ""
"The frequency with which this <em>@bundle</em> entity changes. Search "
"engine bots may take this as an indication of how often to index it."
msgstr ""
"Kerapatan owah-owahan entitas <em>@bundle</em> iki. Bot mesin telusur "
"bisa nganggep iki minangka pratandha sepira kerepe kudu ngindeks."

msgid ""
"Determines if images referenced by this <em>@bundle</em> entity should "
"be included in the sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Nentokake apa gambar sing dirujuk dening entitas <em>@bundle</em> iki "
"kudu kalebu ing sitemap."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap (Search engines)"
msgstr "Sitemap XML Gampang (Mesin panelusur)"

msgid "Search engine ID"
msgstr "ID mesin telusur"

msgid "Last submitted"
msgstr "Pungkasan dikirimkeun"

msgid "Sitemap search engine submission settings"
msgstr "Setelan pangiriman mesin telusur Sitemap"

msgid "Sitemap submission enabled"
msgstr "Pengiriman Sitemap wis diaktifake"

msgid "Sitemap submission frequency"
msgstr "Frekuensi panyerahake Sitemap"

msgid "Sitemap search engine submission"
msgstr "Pengiriman sitemap menyang mesin panelusur"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of links one sitemap can hold. If more links are "
"generated than set here, a sitemap index will be created and the links "
"split into several sub-sitemaps.<br>50 000 links is the maximum Google "
"will parse per sitemap, but choosing a lower value may be needed to "
"avoid PHP memory errors on huge sites.<br>If left blank, all links "
"will be shown on a single sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah tautan maksimum sing bisa dicekel siji sitemap. Yen tautan sing "
"digawé luwih akeh tinimbang sing disetel ing kene, sitemap indeks "
"bakal digawe lan tautan kasebut dipérang dadi sawetara "
"sub-sitemap.<br>50.000 tautan iku maksimum sing bakal diparse Google "
"saben sitemap, nanging milih nilai luwih cilik bisa dibutuhake kanggo "
"ngindhari kesalahan memori PHP ing situs gedhe.<br>Yen dikosongi, "
"kabeh tautan bakal ditampilake ing siji sitemap."

msgid "Configure, add content to and generate XML sitemaps."
msgstr "Konfigurasi, tambah isi, lan gawe XML sitemap."

msgid "Disable language hreflang"
msgstr "Pateni hreflang basa"

msgid "Remove hreflang markup in HTML"
msgstr "Mbusak markup hreflang ing HTML"

msgid ""
"Google recommends displaying hreflang definitions either in the HTML "
"markup or in the sitemap, but not in both places.<br>If checked, "
"hreflang definitions created by the language module will be removed "
"from the markup reducing its size."
msgstr ""
"Google nyaranake supaya definisi hreflang ditampilake ing markup HTML "
"utawa ing sitemap, nanging ora loro-lorone.<br>Yen dicenthang, "
"definisi hreflang sing digawe dening modul basa bakal dibusak saka "
"markup supaya ukurane luwih cilik."

msgid "published on @time"
msgstr "dipun terbitake ing @time"

msgid "published on @time, regenerating"
msgstr "diterbitaké ing @time, mbangun manèh"

msgid ""
"The number of entities to process in each queue item.<br>Increasing "
"this number will use more memory but will result in less queries "
"improving generation speed."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah entitas sing bakal diproses ing saben item "
"antrian.<br>Nambahake jumlah iki bakal nggunakake memori luwih akeh "
"nanging bakal ngurangi jumlah query supaya proses generasi luwih "
"cepet."

msgid "@indexed out of @total total queue items have been processed."
msgstr "@indexed saka @total total item antrian wis diproses."

msgid ""
"All variants belonging to the built-in \"Default hreflang\" sitemap "
"type have been converted to entities. Custom sitemap types added via "
"plugins will have to be recreated manually. See "
"simple_sitemap.type.default_hreflang.yml. The sitemaps need to be "
"regenerated now."
msgstr ""
"Kabeh varian sing kagolong ing jinis sitemap \"Default hreflang\" "
"bawaan wis diowahi dadi entitas. Jinis sitemap khusus sing ditambahake "
"liwat plugin kudu digawe maneh kanthi manual. Delengen "
"simple_sitemap.type.default_hreflang.yml. Sitemap saiki kudu digawe "
"ulang."

