msgstr "Notifikasi IndexNow wis diaktifake"

msgid "IndexNow notification disabled"
msgstr "Notifikasi IndexNow dipatèni"

msgid "IndexNow"
msgstr "IndexNow"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap IndexNow"
msgstr "Simple XML Sitemap IndexNow"

msgid "Verification key in Drupal State"
msgstr "Kunci verifikasi ing Drupal State"

msgid "Verification key not available"
msgstr "Kunci verifikasi ora kasedhiya"

msgid ""
"In order to generate a verification key for the IndexNow service and "
"choose which sitemaps are to be submitted to search engines, visit <a "
"href=\"@url\">this</a> configuration page."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo nggawe tombol verifikasi layanan IndexNow lan milih sitemap "
"sing arep dikirim menyang mesin telusur, bukak kaca konfigurasi <a "
"href=\"@url\">iki</a>."

msgid ""
"Submits sitemaps to search engines and notifies IndexNow compatible "
"engines about changes to entities."
msgstr ""
"Ngirim sitemap menyang mesin telusur lan ngabari mesin sing kompatibel "
"karo IndexNow babagan owah-owahan entitas."

msgid "Index entity on save"
msgstr "Indeks entitas nalika nyimpen"

msgid ""
"Allows optionally sending a change notice to IndexNow compatible "
"search engines on entity form save."
msgstr ""
"Ngidini kanthi opsional ngirim kabar owah-owahan menyang mesin "
"panelusuran sing kompatibel karo IndexNow nalika nyimpen formulir "
"entitas."

msgid "IndexNow URL"
msgstr "IndexNow URL"

msgid "IndexNow bundle settings"
msgstr "Setelan paket IndexNow"

msgid "IndexNow submission enabled"
msgstr "IndexNow pangiriman diaktifake"

msgid "Selected engine for IndexNow submissions"
msgstr "Mesin sing dipilih kanggo kiriman IndexNow"

msgid "IndexNow on entity save"
msgstr "IndexNow nalika nyimpen entitas"

msgid "No search engines supporting sitemap submission have been found."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana mesin telusur sing ndhukung pangiriman sitemap sing "
"ditemokake."

msgid "Sitemap submission is disabled."
msgstr "Pengiriman sitemap dipatèni."

msgid ""
"The last IndexNow submission was <em>@entity</em> to @engine_label on "
"@time"
msgstr ""
"Pengiriman IndexNow pungkasan yaiku <em>@entity</em> menyang "
"@engine_label ing @time"

msgid "IndexNow settings can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr "Setelan IndexNow bisa dikonfigurasi <a href=\"@url\">kene</a>."

msgid "No search engines supporting IndexNow have been found."
msgstr "Ora ana mesin telusur sing ndhukung IndexNow sing ditemokake."

msgid "IndexNow submission is disabled."
msgstr "Pengiriman IndexNow wis dipatèni."

msgid "Notify IndexNow search engines of changes <em>by default</em>"
msgstr ""
"Wenehi kabar marang mesin telusur IndexNow babagan owah-owahan "
"<em>kanthi standar</em>"

msgid "Notify IndexNow search engines of changes <em>now</em>"
msgstr ""
"Beri kabar marang mesin telusur IndexNow babagan owah-owahan "
"<em>sakniki</em>"

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting entity forms of this type.<br/>Changes include creating, "
"deleting and updating of an entity. This setting can be overridden on "
"the entity form."
msgstr ""
"Kirim kabar owah-owahan menyang mesin telusur sing kompatibel karo "
"IndexNow langsung sawise ngirim formulir entitas jinis iki.<br/>Owahan "
"kalebu nggawe, mbusak, lan nganyari entitas. Setelan iki bisa diganti "
"ing formulir entitas."

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting this form."
msgstr ""
"Kirim kabar owah-owahan menyang mesin telusur sing kompatibel karo "
"IndexNow sakwise ngirim formulir iki."

msgid "Sitemap submission settings"
msgstr "Setelan kiriman peta situs"

msgid "Submit sitemaps to search engines"
msgstr "Kirim sitemap menyang mesin telusur"

msgid "IndexNow settings"
msgstr "Setelan IndexNow"

msgid "Submit changes to IndexNow capable engines"
msgstr "Kirim owah-owahan menyang mesin sing ndhukung IndexNow"

msgid "Preferred IndexNow engine"
msgstr "Mesin IndexNow sing Dipilih"

msgid ""
"All IndexNow requests will be sent to the engine selected here. Only "
"one engine needs to be notified, as it will notify other IndexNow "
"compatible engines for you.<br/>For the sake of equality of "
"opportunity, <strong>consider leaving this at "
"<em>Random</em></strong>, so a random engine can be picked on each "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Kabeh panjalukan IndexNow bakal dikirim menyang mesin sing dipilih ing "
"kene. Mung siji mesin sing perlu diberitahu, amarga mesin kasebut "
"bakal ngandhani mesin IndexNow sing kompatibel liyane kanggo "
"sampeyan.<br/>Kanggo njaga kesempatan sing padha, <strong>kajaba luwih "
"becik tetep ing <em>Random</em></strong>, supaya mesin acak bisa "
"dipilih saben ngirim."

msgid "Index on every entity save operation"
msgstr "Indeks saben operasi nyimpen entitas"

msgid ""
"If checked, all entity save operations for <a "
"href=\"@inclusion_url\">included entities</a> will trigger "
"notification of IndexNow search engines.<br/>If unchecked, this will "
"only be possible by adding/altering/deleting an entity through a "
"form.<br/>This should be unchecked if there are mass operations "
"performed on entities that are irrelevant to indexing."
msgstr ""
"Yen dicenthang, kabeh operasi nyimpen entitas kanggo <a "
"href=\"@inclusion_url\">entitas sing kalebu</a> bakal ngaktifake "
"notifikasi kanggo mesin telusur IndexNow.<br/>Yen ora dicenthang, iki "
"mung bisa ditindakake kanthi nambah/ngowahi/mbusak entitas liwat "
"formulir.<br/>Iki kudu ora dicenthang yen ana operasi massal sing "
"ditindakake ing entitas sing ora ana gandhengane karo indeksasi."

msgid ""
"The IndexNow verification key is saved in <em>Drupal state</em>. "
"Consider defining it in <em>settings.php</em> like so:<br/>@code"
msgstr ""
"Kunci verifikasi IndexNow disimpen ing <em>Drupal state</em>. Pikirna "
"nentokake ing <em>settings.php</em> kaya ngene:<br/>@code"

msgid ""
"An IndexNow verification key needs to be generated and optionally "
"added to <em>settings.php</em> in order for IndexNow engines to get "
"notified about changes. This warning only applies to the production "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Kunci verifikasi IndexNow perlu digawé lan opsional ditambahaké "
"menyang <em>settings.php</em> supaya mesin IndexNow bisa kabar babagan "
"owah-owahan. Peringatan iki mung ditrapaké ing lingkungan produksi."

msgid ""
"Simple XML Sitemap settings will be added only to entity forms of "
"entity types enabled here. Settings for specific entity bundles (e.g. "
"<em>page</em>) can be adjusted here or on the bundle pages."
msgstr ""
"Setelan Simple XML Sitemap bakal ditambahake mung ing formulir entitas "
"saka jinis entitas sing diaktifake ing kene. Setelan kanggo bundel "
"entitas tartamtu (umpamane <em>page</em>) bisa disetel ing kene utawa "
"ing kaca bundel."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap settings"
msgstr "Setelan Sitemap XML Sing Gampil"

msgid ""
"A sitemap index which lists all other sitemaps is now available and "
"can be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Indeks sitemap sing nyathet kabeh sitemap liyane saiki wis kasedhiya "
"lan bisa diaktifake."

msgid "IndexNow notification"
msgstr "Notifikasi IndexNow"

msgid "IndexNow notification checkbox"
msgstr "Kotak centhang kabar IndexNow"

msgid "Remove verification key from state"
msgstr "Mbusak tombol verifikasi saka status"

msgid "Generate verification key"
msgstr "Nggawe kunci verifikasi"

msgid "The IndexNow verification key is saved in <em>settings.php</em>: @key"
msgstr "Kunci verifikasi IndexNow disimpen ing <em>settings.php</em>: @key"

msgid ""
"The IndexNow verification key is defined in <em>Drupal state</em>: "
"@key"
msgstr "Kunci verifikasi IndexNow ditemtokake ing <em>status Drupal</em>: @key"

msgid ""
"The IndexNow verification key is saved in <em>settings.php</em> and "
"can be safely removed from <em>Drupal state</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kunci verifikasi IndexNow disimpen ing <em>settings.php</em> lan bisa "
"kanthi aman dicopot saka <em>Drupal state</em>."

msgid "Include this sitemap during generation"
