msgstr "Setelan Webform @label wis disimpen."

msgid ""
"Form is being posted using a custom method. Confirmation page must be "
"handled by the <a href=\":href\">custom form action</a>."
msgstr ""
"Form tengah dikirim nganggo cara khusus. Kaca konfirmasi kudu diatur "
"nganggo <a href=\":href\">tindakan form khusus</a>."

msgid ""
"Saving of submissions is disabled, submission settings, submission "
"limits, purging and the saving of drafts is disabled. Submissions must "
"be sent via an email or handled using a <a href=\":href\">custom "
"webform handler</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nyimpen kiriman wis dipateni, setelan kiriman, watesan kiriman, "
"ngresiki lan nyimpen draf uga dipateni. Kiriman kudu dikirim liwat "
"email utawa diolah nggunakake <a href=\":href\">handler webform "
"khusus</a>."

msgid "Required message"
msgstr "Pesen sing dibutuhake"

msgid ""
"Specifies the legal number intervals. Leave blank to support any "
"number interval. Decimals are supported."
msgstr ""
"Nemtokake interval nomer legal. Priksa supaya kosong kanggo ndhukung "
"sembarang interval nomer. Desimal uga didhukung."

msgid ""
"You can set sub-element properties using a double underscore between "
"the sub-element's key and sub-element's property "
"(subelement__property). For example, you can add custom attributes or "
"states (conditional logic) to the title sub-element using "
"'title__attributes' and 'title__states'."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nyetel properti sub-elemen nganggo garis ngisor kaping "
"pindho antarane kunci sub-elemen lan properti sub-elemen "
"(subelement__property). Contone, sampeyan bisa nambah atribut khusus "
"utawa status (logika kondisional) menyang sub-elemen judhul nganggo "
"'title__attributes' lan 'title__states'."

msgid ""
"Elements that collect multiple option values include multi-select, "
"checkboxes, and toggles."
msgstr ""
"Elemen sing nglumpukake pirang-pirang nilai opsi kalebu multi-select, "
"kotak centhang, lan toggle."

msgid "Limit settings"
msgstr "Setelan watesan"

msgid ""
"Descriptions, which are only applicable to radios and checkboxes, can "
"be delimited using ' -- '."
msgstr ""
"Deskripsi, sing mung ditrapake kanggo radio lan checkbox, bisa dipisah "
"nganggo ' -- '."

msgid "<strong>@title @version</strong> (Installed)"
msgstr "<strong>@title @version</strong> (Wis dipasang)"

msgid ""
"<span class=\"color-warning\"><strong>@title @version</strong> "
"(CDN).</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"color-warning\"><strong>@title @version</strong> "
"(CDN).</span>"

msgid "<strong>@title @version</strong> (CDN)."
msgstr "<strong>@title @version</strong> (CDN)."

msgid "<a href=\":href\">Disable CDN warning</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":href\">Pateni pratandha CDN</a>"

msgid ""
"@total libraries (@installed installed; @excluded excluded; @missing "
"CDN)"
msgstr ""
"@total perpustakaan (@installed wis dipasang; @excluded ora kalebu; "
"@missing CDN)"

msgid "Drupal Association"
msgstr "Asosiasi Drupal"

msgid ""
"The below requirements are checked by the <a href=\":href\">Status "
"report</a>."
msgstr ""
"Syarat-syarat ing ngisor iki dipriksa dening <a href=\":href\">Laporan "
"Status</a>."

msgid ""
"If unchecked, all warnings about Webform SPAM protection will be "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Yen ora dicenthang, kabeh peringatan babagan proteksi SPAM Webform "
"bakal dinonaktifake."

msgid "Check that all entered values for this element are unique."
msgstr "Priksa manawa kabeh nilai sing wis dilebokake kanggo elemen iki unik."

msgid ""
"Check that entered values for this element is unique for the current "
"source entity."
msgstr ""
"Priksa manawa nilai sing mlebu kanggo unsur iki unik kanggo entitas "
"sumber saiki."

msgid "Time step"
msgstr "Langkah wektu"

