msgid "Contact URL"
msgstr "URL Kontak"

msgid "Webforms: Submissions log"
msgstr "Webforms: Log pangiriman"

msgid "Default wizard confirmation label"
msgstr "Label konfirmasi wizard bawaan"

msgid "Default more title"
msgstr "Judhul liyane standar"

msgid "Default section title tag"
msgstr "Tag judhul bagean standar"

msgid "Wizard confirmation label"
msgstr "Label konfirmasi wizard"

msgid "Track wizard progress in the URL"
msgstr "Nglacak kemajuan wizard ing URL"

msgid "Schedule emails for all existing submissions"
msgstr "Jadwalaké email kanggo kabèh kiriman sing wis ana"

msgid "Webforms: Templates"
msgstr "Webforms: Templat"

msgid "Emailing & handling submissions"
msgstr "Emailing & nangani kiriman"

msgid "Collecting webform submissions"
msgstr "Ngumpulake kiriman webform"

msgid "Understanding a webform submission"
msgstr "Mangerteni pangiriman webform"

msgid "Attaching webforms to nodes"
msgstr "Nggandhengake webform menyang node"

msgid "Placing webforms as blocks"
msgstr "Nempatake webform minangka blok"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Templates</strong> page lists reusable templates that can "
"be duplicated and customized to create new webforms."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Templates</strong> nampilaké dhaptar template sing bisa "
"digunakaké bola-bali lan dikustomisasi kanggo nggawe webform anyar."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Forms configuration</strong> page allows administrators to "
"manage form settings, behaviors, labels, messages and CSS classes."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Konfigurasi Formulir</strong> ngidini administrator "
"kanggo ngatur setelan formulir, prilaku, label, pesen, lan kelas CSS."

msgid "Configuration: Elements"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Elemen"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Elements configuration</strong> page allows administrators "
"to enable/disable element types and manage element specific settings, "
"properties, behaviors and formatting."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Konfigurasi Elemen</strong> ngidini administrator kanggo "
"ngaktifake/nonaktifake jinis elemen lan ngatur setelan, properti, "
"prilaku, lan format khusus elemen."

msgid "Configuration: Options"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Pilihan"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Options configuration</strong> page lists reusable "
"predefined options/values available for select menus, radio buttons, "
"checkboxes and Likert elements."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Konfigurasi Pilihan</strong> nyantumaké pilihan/nilai "
"prasetel sing bisa dijupuk manèh kanggo menu pilih, tombol radio, "
"kothak centhang, lan unsur Likert."

msgid "Configuration: Submissions"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Pangiriman"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to manage submissions settings, behaviors and messages."
msgstr ""
"Halaman <strong>Konfigurasi Submisi</strong> ngidini administrator "
"kanggo ngatur setelan, prilaku, lan pesen submisi."

msgid "Configuration: Handlers"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Pengatur"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Handlers configuration</strong> page allows administrators "
"to enable/disable handlers and configure default email settings and "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Konfigurasi Handlers</strong> ngidini administrator "
"kanggo ngaktifake/menonaktifake handlers lan nyetel setelan email "
"standar lan pesen."

msgid ""
"<strong>Handlers</strong> are used to route submitted data to external "
"applications and send notifications & confirmations."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Handlers</strong> digunakake kanggo ngarahake data sing "
"dikirim menyang aplikasi eksternal lan ngirim kabar & konfirmasi."

msgid "Configuration: Exporters"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Exporters"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Exporters configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to enable/disable exporters and configure default "
"export settings."
msgstr ""
"The <strong>Exporters configuration</strong> kaca ngidini para "
"administrator kanggo ngaktifake/mateni exporters lan nyetel setelan "
"ekspor standar."

msgid ""
"<strong>Exporters</strong> are used to export results into a "
"downloadable format that can be used by MS Excel, Google Sheets and "
"other spreadsheet applications."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Exporters</strong> digunakake kanggo ngekspor asil menyang "
"format sing bisa diundhuh sing bisa digunakake déning MS Excel, "
"Google Sheets, lan aplikasi spreadsheet liyane."

msgid "Configuration: Libraries"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Pustaka"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Libraries configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to enable/disable libraries and define global custom "
"CSS/JavaScript used by all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Konfigurasi Libraries</strong> ngidini administrator "
"kanggo ngaktifake/ngmateni pustaka lan nemtokake CSS/JavaScript kustom "
"global sing digunakake dening kabeh webform."

msgid "Configuration: Libraries: Help"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Perpustakaan: Bantuan"

msgid "Configuration: Advanced"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Majeng"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Advanced configuration</strong> page allows an "
"administrator to enable/disable UI behaviors, manage requirements and "
"define data used for testing webforms."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Konfigurasi Lanjutan</strong> ngidini administrator "
"kanggo ngaktifake/mateni prilaku UI, ngatur sarat, lan nemtokake data "
"sing digunakake kanggo nguji webform."

msgid "Configuration: Translate"
msgstr "Konfigurasi: Terjemahake"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Translate configuration</strong> page allows webform "
"messages and labels to be translated into multiple languages."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Translate configuration</strong> ngidini pesen lan label "
"webform diterjemahake menyang pirang-pirang basa."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Element plugins</strong> overview page lists all available "
"webform element plugins."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Element plugins</strong> nyedhiyakake dhaptar kabeh "
"plugin elemen webform sing kasedhiya."

msgid ""
"<strong>Webform Element</strong> plugins are used to enhance existing "
"render/form elements. Webform element plugins provide default "
"properties, data normalization, custom validation, element "
"configuration form and customizable display formats."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Plugin Elemen Webform</strong> digunakake kanggo nambahake "
"elemen render/form sing wis ana. Plugin elemen webform nyedhiyakake "
"properti standar, normalisasi data, validasi khusus, formulir "
"konfigurasi elemen, lan format tampilan sing bisa dikustomisasi."

msgid "Plugins: Emails/Handlers"
msgstr "Plugins: Email/Pangatur"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Handler plugins</strong> overview page lists all available "
"webform handler plugins."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Handler plugins</strong> nyedhiyakake dhaptar kabeh "
"plugin handler webform sing kasedhiya."

msgid "Plugins: Exporters"
msgstr "Plugins: Eksporter"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Exporter plugins</strong> overview page lists all "
"available results exporter plugins."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Exporter plugins</strong> nyedhiyakake dhaptar kabeh "
"plugin exporter asil sing kasedhiya."

msgid ""
"The (View) <strong>Source</strong> page allows developers to edit a "
"webform's render array using YAML markup."
msgstr ""
"Kaca (View) <strong>Source</strong> ngidini para pangembang nyunting "
"array render webform nganggo markup YAML."

msgid ""
"Developers can use the (View) <strong>Source</strong> page to alter a "
"webform's labels quickly, cut-n-paste multiple elements, reorder "
"elements, as well as  add custom properties and markup to elements."
msgstr ""
"Para pangembang bisa nggunakake kaca (View) <strong>Source</strong> "
"kanggo ngowahi label webform kanthi cepet, nyalin-pasangake "
"pirang-pirang elemen, ngatur ulang elemen, uga nambahake properti lan "
"markup khusus kanggo elemen-elemen kasebut."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Test</strong> form allows a webform to be tested using a "
"customizable test dataset."
msgstr ""
"Bentuk <strong>Test</strong> ngidini webform dites nganggo dataset "
"test sing bisa disesuaikan."

msgid ""
"The <strong>API</strong> form allows developers to test a webform's "
"API."
msgstr ""
"Bentuk <strong>API</strong> ngidini para pangembang nyoba API formulir "
"web."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Translate</strong> page allows a webform's configuration "
"and elements to be translated into multiple languages."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Translate</strong> ngidini konfigurasi lan unsur webform "
"diterjemahake menyang pirang-pirang basa."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Elements</strong>  page allows users to add, update, "
"duplicate and delete elements and wizard pages."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Elements</strong> ngidini pangguna kanggo nambah, "
"nganyari, nglipatake, lan mbusak elemen lan kaca wizard."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Emails/Handlers</strong> page allows additional actions "
"and behaviors to be processed when a webform or submission is created, "
"updated, or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Emails/Handlers</strong> ngidini tumindak lan prilaku "
"tambahan sing bisa diproses nalika webform utawa kiriman digawe, "
"dianyari, utawa dibusak."

msgid "Settings: General"
msgstr "Setelan: Umum"

msgid ""
"The <strong>General</strong> settings page allows a webform's "
"administrative information, paths, behaviors and third-party settings "
"to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Kaca setelan <strong>Umum</strong> ngidini informasi administrasi "
"webform, path, prilaku, lan setelan pihak katelu bisa diatur kanthi "
"kustom."

msgid "Settings: Form"
msgstr "Setelan: Formulir"

msgid "Settings: Submissions"
msgstr "Setelan: Pangiriman"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions</strong> settings page allows a submission's "
"labels, behaviors, limits and draft settings to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Kaca pangaturan <strong>Submissions</strong> ngidini panandha, "
"prilaku, watesan, lan pangaturan draf saka sawijining kiriman bisa "
"disesuaikan."

msgid "Settings: Confirmation"
msgstr "Setelan: Konfirmasi"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Confirmation</strong> settings page allows the submission "
"confirmation type, message and URL to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Halaman setelan <strong>Konfirmasi</strong> ngidini jinis konfirmasi "
"pangiriman, pesen, lan URL bisa dikustomisasi."

msgid "Settings: Assets"
msgstr "Setelan: Aset"

msgid ""
"The <strong>CSS/JS</strong> settings page allows site builders to "
"attach custom CSS and JavaScript to a webform."
msgstr ""
"Kaca setelan <strong>CSS/JS</strong> ngidini pangembang situs "
"nyambungake CSS lan JavaScript khusus menyang webform."

msgid "Settings: Access"
msgstr "Setelan: Akses"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions</strong> page lists all incoming submissions "
"for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Submissions</strong> nampilake kabeh kiriman mlebu kanggo "
"kabeh webform."

msgid "Submissions: Log"
msgstr "Pengiriman: Log"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions log</strong> page tracks all submission events "
"for all webforms that have submission logging enabled. Submission "
"logging can be enabled globally or on a per webform basis."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Cathetan Pengiriman</strong> nglacak kabeh kedadeyan "
"pengiriman kanggo kabeh webform sing nduweni logging pengiriman sing "
"wis diaktifake. Logging pengiriman bisa diaktifake sacara global utawa "
"adhedhasar saben webform."

msgid "Results: Submissions"
msgstr "Asile: Pangiriman"

msgid "Results: Log"
msgstr "Asil: Log"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Results Log</strong> lists all webform submission events "
"for the current webform."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Logasil Asil</strong> ngetokake kabeh acara kiriman webform "
"kanggo webform saiki."

msgid "Results: Download"
msgstr "Asil: Download"

msgid "Submission: View"
msgstr "Kiriman: Deleng"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Data (YAML)</strong> page displays a submission's raw data "
"as YAML."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Data (YAML)</strong> nunjukaké data mentahan saka "
"kiriman minangka YAML."

msgid "Submission: Log"
msgstr "Pengiriman: Log"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Log</strong> page shows all events and transactions for a "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Log</strong> nuduhake kabeh kedadeyan lan transaksi "
"kanggo sawijining kiriman."

msgid "Submission: Edit"
msgstr "Pengiriman: Sunting"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Edit</strong> form allows the administrator to update a "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Bentuk <strong>Edit</strong> ngidini administrator kanggo nganyari "
"kiriman."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Edit all</strong> form allows administrator to update all "
"values for submission create from a multi-step form."
msgstr ""
"<form><strong>Edit all</strong> nduweni fungsi kanggo administrator "
"supaya bisa nganyari kabeh nilai kanggo kiriman sing digawe saka "
"formulir multi-langkah.</form>"

msgid "Submission: Resend"
msgstr "Kirim Maneh"

msgid "Submission: Notes"
msgstr "Kirim: Cathetan"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Notes</strong> form allows administrator to flag and "
"annotate a submission."
msgstr ""
"Form <strong>Cathetan</strong> ngidini administrator kanggo menehi "
"tandha lan nyatet ing sawijining kiriman."

msgid "Devel: Export"
msgstr "Devel: Ekspor"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Schema</strong> page displays an overview of a webform's "
"elements and specified data types, which can be used to map webform "
"submissions to an external API."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Schema</strong> nampilake gambaran umum elemen webform "
"lan jinis data sing wis ditemtokake, sing bisa digunakake kanggo map "
"webform submissions menyang API eksternal."

msgid ""
"A <strong>Webform Node</strong> allows webforms to be fully integrated "
"into a website as nodes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Webform Node</strong> ngidini webform supaya bisa digabungake "
"kanthi lengkap menyang sawijining situs web minangka node."

msgid "Webform Node: References"
msgstr "Webform Node: Referensi"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Reference</strong> pages displays an overview of a "
"webform's references and allows you to quickly create new references "
"(a.k.a Webform nodes)."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Reference</strong> nampilake ringkesan saka referensi "
"webform lan ngidini sampeyan nggawe referensi anyar kanthi cepet (sing "
"uga dikenal minangka node Webform)."

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Submissions"
msgstr "Webform Node: Asil: Pangiriman"

msgid "Submissions can be reviewed, updated, flagged and annotated."
msgstr ""
"Pangiriman bisa dideleng, diperbarui, diwenehi tandha, lan diwenehi "
"cathetan."

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Log"
msgstr "Webform Node: Asil: Log"

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Download"
msgstr "Webform Node: Asil: Undhuh"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Download</strong> page allows a webform node's submissions "
"to be exported into a customizable CSV (Comma Separated Values) file "
"and other common data formats."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Download</strong> ngidini kiriman node webform diekspor "
"menyang file CSV (Comma Separated Values) sing bisa disesuaikan lan "
"format data umum liyane."

msgid ""
"A <strong>Webform Block</strong> allows a webform to be placed "
"anywhere on a website."
msgstr ""
"A <strong>Webform Block</strong> ngidini webform dipasang nang endi "
"wae ing situs web."

msgid "Message: Webform UI Disabled"
msgstr "Pesen: Antarmuka Webform Dipatèni"

msgid ""
"Please enable the <strong>Webform UI</strong> module if you would like "
"to add easily add and manage elements using a drag-n-drop user "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Mangga aktifake modul <strong>Webform UI</strong> yen sampeyan "
