msgid "Webform Submission Log"
msgstr "Log Pangiriman Formulir Web"

msgid "Dedicated logging and reporting for webform submissions."
msgstr "Logging lan pelaporan khusus kanggo kiriman webform."

msgid "The element key %name on line @line_number is a reserved key."
msgstr "Elemen kunci %name ing baris @line_number iku kunci sing wis dipesen."

msgid ""
"The webform submission log will track more detailed user information "
"including email addresses and subjects."
msgstr ""
"Log kiriman webform bakal ngawasi informasi pangguna sing luwih rinci "
"kalebu alamat email lan subyek."

msgid ""
"Enable the 'Webform Submission Log' module to better track and "
"permanently store submission logs."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake modul 'Webform Submission Log' kanggo luwih apik nglacak lan "
"nyimpen log pengiriman kanthi permanen."

msgid "Required elements defaults to: %required"
msgstr "Unsur sing dibutuhake dadi standar: %required"

msgid "Optional elements defaults to: %optional"
msgstr "Elemen opsional standar dadi: %optional"

msgid "Counter minimum or maximum is required."
msgstr "Minimum utawa maksimum counter dibutuhake."

msgid ""
"Use x-www-form-urlencoded if unsure, as it is the default format for "
"HTML webforms. You also have the option to post data in <a "
"href=\"http://www.json.org/\">JSON</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake x-www-form-urlencoded yen ora yakin, amarga iku format "
"standar kanggo formulir web HTML. Sampeyan uga duwe pilihan kanggo "
"ngirim data ing format <a href=\"http://www.json.org/\">JSON</a>."

msgid "@label text / description"
msgstr "@label teks / katrangan"

msgid "Select what happens when a user is denied access to this webform."
msgstr ""
"Pilih apa sing kedadeyan nalika pangguna ditolak akses menyang webform "
"iki."

msgid ""
"Go to <a href=\":href\">submission settings</a> to select what happens "
"when a user is denied access to submissions."
msgstr ""
"Mlebu menyang <a href=\":href\">setelan kiriman</a> kanggo milih apa "
"sing kedadeyan nalika pangguna ditolak akses menyang kiriman."

msgid "Select what happens when a user is denied access to a submission."
msgstr "Pilih apa sing kedadeyan nalika pangguna ora diidini ngakses kiriman."

msgid ""
"Go to <a href=\":href\">form settings</a> to select what happens when "
"a user is denied access to a webform."
msgstr ""
"Mlebu menyang <a href=\":href\">setelan formulir</a> kanggo milih apa "
"sing kedadeyan nalika pangguna ditolak akses menyang webform."

msgid "Wrap long lines of text"
msgstr "Bungkus baris teks sing dawa"

msgid "200 OK"
msgstr "200 OK"

msgid ""
"Please make sure to enable 'Include files as attachments' for each "
"email handler that you want to send this attachment."
msgstr ""
"Mangga priksa manawa ngaktifake 'Include files as attachments' kanggo "
"saben pengolah email sing sampeyan arep ngirimake lampiran iki."

msgid ""
"Please enter the attachment's file name with a file extension. The "
"file extension will be used to determine the attachment's content "
"(mime) type."
msgstr ""
"Mangga lebokake jeneng file lampiran kanthi ekstensi file. Ekstensi "
"file bakal digunakake kanggo nemtokake jinis isi (mime) saka lampiran "
"kasebut."

msgid ""
"Make sure the attachment URL/Path is publicly accessible. The "
"attachment's URL/path will never be displayed to end users."
msgstr ""
"Pasthekake URL/Path lampiran bisa diakses sacara umum. URL/path "
"lampiran ora bakal tau ditampilake marang pangguna pungkasan."

msgid ""
"Webforms must first be <a href=\":href\">created</a> before "
"referencing them."
msgstr ""
"Webforms kudu luwih dhisik <a href=\":href\">digawe</a> sadurunge "
"dirujuk."

msgid "Sending webform email attachments"
msgstr "Ngirim lampiran email webform"

msgid ""
"This presentation shows how to set up and add email attachments via an "
"email handler."
msgstr ""
"Presentasi iki nuduhake carane nyetel lan nambah lampiran email liwat "
"email handler."

msgid "How to send email attachments? | Drupal.org"
msgstr "Kepriye carane ngirim lampiran email? | Drupal.org"

msgid ""
"Multiple test submissions can be created using the Devel generate "
"module."
msgstr "Akeh kiriman tes bisa digawe nggunakake modul Devel generate."

msgid "Form access denied settings"
msgstr "Setelan akses formulir ditolak"

msgid "Form preview settings"
msgstr "Setelan pratilik formulir"

msgid "Form custom settings"
msgstr "Setelan khusus formulir"

