msgstr "Setelan tampilan kiriman"

msgid "Form confirmation settings"
msgstr "Setelan konfirmasi formulir"

msgid "Form dialog settings"
msgstr "Setelan dialog formulir"

msgid ""
"The HTML to display for a single element value. You may include HTML "
"or <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission "
"as per the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"HTML sing bakal ditampilake kanggo nilai unsur siji. Sampeyan bisa "
"nambah HTML utawa <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Sampeyan bisa mlebu data "
"saka pengiriman miturut \"variables\" ing ngisor iki."

msgid ""
"The text to display for a single element value. You may include <a "
"href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission as per "
"the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"Teks sing ditampilake kanggo siji nilai elemen. Sampeyan bisa nyakup "
"<a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Sampeyan bisa ngetik data saka kiriman "
"miturut \"variabel\" ing ngisor iki."

msgid ""
"The HTML to display for multiple element values. You may include HTML "
"or <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission "
"as per the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"HTML kanggo nampilake nilai elemen sing akeh. Sampeyan bisa nyakup "
"HTML utawa <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Sampeyan bisa mlebu data saka "
"kiriman sesuai karo \"variabel\" ing ngisor iki."

msgid ""
"The text to display for multiple element values. You may include <a "
"href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission as per "
"the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"Teks sing bakal ditampilake kanggo nilai elemen sing luwih saka siji. "
"Sampeyan bisa nambah <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Sampeyan bisa mlebu "
"data saka kiriman miturut \"variabel\" ing ngisor iki."

msgid ""
"Editing webform source code allows users to alter and possibly break a "
"webform's render array."
msgstr ""
"Ngowahi kode sumber webform menehi pangguna bisa ngowahi lan bisa uga "
"ngrusak array render webform."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Upload</strong> page allows a CSV (comma separated values) "
"file or URL to be uploaded, converted, and imported into webform "
"submissions."
msgstr ""
"Kaca <strong>Upload</strong> ngidini file CSV (nilai pisah koma) utawa "
"URL kanggo diunggah, diubah, lan diimpor menyang kiriman webform."

msgid "Provides the ability to export and import submissions."
msgstr "Mènèhi kemampuan kanggo ngekspor lan ngimpor kiriman."

msgid "Unable to locate source entity (@entity_type:@entity_id)"
msgstr "Ora bisa nemokake entitas sumber (@entity_type:@entity_id)"

msgid ""
"The upload directory %directory for the file element %name could not "
"be created or is not accessible. A newly uploaded file could not be "
"saved in this directory as a consequence, and the upload was canceled."
msgstr ""
"Direktori unggah %directory kanggo elemen file %name ora bisa digawe "
"utawa ora bisa diakses. File sing anyar diunggah ora bisa disimpen ing "
"direktori iki, lan unggahan dibatalake."

msgid "Importing submissions is a new and experimental feature."
msgstr "Ngimpor kiriman iku fitur anyar lan eksperimental."

msgid ""
"Please test and review your imported submissions using a "
"development/test server."
msgstr ""
"Mangga priksa lan review kiriman sing wis diimpor nganggo server "
"pangembangan/testing."

msgid "All submission properties and data is optional."
msgstr "Kabeh properti lan data kiriman iku opsional."

msgid "If UUIDs are included, existing submissions will always be updated."
msgstr "Yen UUID kalebu, kiriman sing wis ana bakal tansah dianyari."

msgid ""
"If UUIDs are not included, already imported and unchanged records will "
"not create duplication submissions."
msgstr ""
"Yen UUID ora kalebu, cathetan sing wis diimpor lan ora berubah ora "
"bakal nggawe pengiriman duplikat."

msgid ""
"File uploads must use publicly access URLs which begin with http:// or "
"https://."
msgstr ""
"Unggah file kudu nggunakake URL sing bisa diakses umum lan diwiwiti "
"karo http:// utawa https://."

msgid "Entity references can use UUIDs or entity IDs."
msgstr "Referensi entitas bisa nggunakake UUID utawa ID entitas."

msgid ""
"Composite (single) values are annotated using double underscores. "
"(e.g. ELEMENT_KEY__SUB_ELEMENT_KEY)"
msgstr ""
"Nilai komposit (siji) diwenehi anotasi nganggo garis ngisor dobel. "
"(umpamane ELEMENT_KEY__SUB_ELEMENT_KEY)"

msgid ""
"Multiple composite values are formatted using <a href=\":href\">inline "
"YAML</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nilai komposit majemuk diformat nganggo <a href=\":href\">inline "
"YAML</a>."

msgid "Import maximum execution time limit is @time."
msgstr "Wates wektu eksekusi maksimal impor yaiku @time."

msgid ""
"<a href=\":href_view\">View</a> or <a "
"href=\":href_download\">download</a> an example submission CSV."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":href_view\">Delengen</a> utawa <a "
"href=\":href_download\">unduh</a> conto file CSV kang dikirimake."

msgid "Import data source"
msgstr "Impor sumber data"

msgid "Upload Submission CSV file"
msgstr "Unggah file CSV Kiriman"

msgid "Enter Submission CSV remote URL"
msgstr "Lebokake URL Jarak Jauh CSV Pangiriman"

msgid "Remote URL could be a <a href=\":href\">published Google Sheet</a>."
msgstr ""
"URL Jauh bisa dadi <a href=\":href\">Google Sheet sing wis "
"diterbitake</a>."

msgid "Submission CSV (Comma Separated Values) file"
msgstr "Berkas CSV (Nilai Dipisah Koma) kanggo Pangiriman"

msgid "Are you sure you want to import @submissions?"
msgstr "Apa sampeyan yakin pengin ngimpor @submissions?"

msgid ""
"No UUID or token was found in the source (CSV). A unique hash will be "
"generated for the each CSV record. Any changes to already an imported "
"record in the source (CSV) will create a new submission."
msgstr ""
"Ora ana UUID utawa token sing ditemokake ing sumber (CSV). Saben "
"rekaman CSV bakal digawe hash unik. Owah-owahan apa wae ing rekaman "
"sing wis diimpor ing sumber (CSV) bakal nggawe kiriman anyar."

msgid "Import mapping"
msgstr "Impor peta"

msgid "Importing submissions"
msgstr "Ngimpor kiriman"

msgid "Imported @count of @total submissions…"
msgstr "Diimpor @count saka @total kiriman…"

msgid ""
"Submission import completed. (total: @total; created: @created; "
"updated: @updated; skipped: @skipped)"
msgstr ""
"Impor kiriman wis rampung. (total: @total; digawe: @created; dianyari: "
"@updated; dilalekake: @skipped)"

msgid "Webform module now supports importing submissions | Drupal.org"
msgstr "Modul Webform saiki ndhukung ngimpor kiriman | Drupal.org"

msgid ""
"Batch import size is used when submissions are being "
"imported/uploaded."
msgstr "Ukuran impor batch digunakake nalika pengiriman lagi diimpor/diupload."

msgid "If checked, users will be able search/filter images by their labels."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, pangguna bakal bisa nggoleki/nyaring gambar miturut "
"labele."

msgid "Filter placeholder label"
msgstr "Label panggonan saringan"

msgid "Filter single item label"
msgstr "Saring label barang siji"

msgid "Filter plural items label"
msgstr "Label saringan barang jamak"

msgid "Filter no results label"
msgstr "Label filter ora ana asil"

msgid ""
"CSV data that can't be converted to submission data will display a "
"warning. If checked, these warnings will be treated as errors and "
"prevent the submission from being created."
msgstr ""
"Data CSV sing ora bisa diowahi dadi data kiriman bakal nampilake "
"peringatan. Yen dicenthang, peringatan iki bakal dianggep minangka "
"kesalahan lan nyegah kiriman supaya ora bisa digawe."

