msgid ""
"Here is a detailed feature-comparison of Webform and Contact Storage "
"8.x-1.x.&nbsp;It's worth noting that Contact Storage relies on the "
"Contact module which in turn relies on the Field UI; Contact Storage "
"out of the box is a minimalistic solution with limited (but useful!) "
"functionality. This means it can be extended with core mechanisms such "
"as CRUD entity hooks and overriding services; also there's a greater "
"chance that a general purpose module will play nicely with it (eg. the "
"Conditional Fields module is for entity form displays in general, not "
"the Contact module)."
msgstr ""
"Mangkene perbandingan fitur sing rinci saka Webform lan Contact "
"Storage 8.x-1.x.&nbsp;Penting kanggo dicathet yen Contact Storage "
"gumantung marang modul Contact sing banjur gumantung marang Field UI; "
"Contact Storage saka kothak iku solusi minimalis kanthi fungsi sing "
"winates (nanging migunani!). Iki tegese bisa diperluas nganggo "
"mekanisme inti kaya CRUD entity hooks lan overriding services; uga ana "
"kasempatan luwih gedhe yen modul kanggo tujuan umum bisa cocog karo "
"iku (contona modul Conditional Fields kanggo tampilan formulir entitas "
"sacara umum, ora khusus modul Contact)."

