msgid "Use a lazy builder to render the form after the page is built/loaded."
msgstr ""
"Gunakake lazy builder kanggo ngetokake formulir sawisé kaca rampung "
"dibangun/dimuat."

msgid ""
"If checked, the form will be loaded after the page has been built and "
"cached. Lazy builders work best when using the <a "
"href=\":href\">BigPipe</a> module."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, formulir bakal dimuat sawise kaca wis dibangun lan "
"disimpen ing cache. Lazy builders paling apik digunakake nalika "
"nggunakake modul <a href=\":href\">BigPipe</a>."

msgid "The URL where the user submitted the webform submission."
msgstr "URL ing endi pangguna ngirimake kiriman webform."

msgid ""
"Click OK to submit the form without finishing the file upload or "
"cancel to return to form."
msgstr ""
"Klik OK kanggo ngirim formulir tanpa ngrampungake unggahan berkas "
"utawa batal kanggo bali menyang formulir."

msgid ""
"The automatic saving of drafts only applies to previewing when using "
"cards. Please try using the <a href=\":href\">Webform autosave "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nyimpen konsep kanthi otomatis mung ditrapake kanggo nyoba tampilan "
"nalika nggunakake kertu. Mangga coba nggunakake <a "
"href=\":href\">modul Webform autosave</a>."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Forms</strong> management page lists all available "
"webforms, which can be filtered by the following: keyword (including "
"title, description, elements, user name, or role), category, and "
"status."
msgstr ""
"Kaca manajemen <strong>Forms</strong> nampilaké kabèh webform sing "
"kasedhiya, sing bisa disaring nganggo kriteria kaya ing ngisor iki: "
"tembung kunci (kalebu judhul, katrangan, unsur, jeneng pangguna, utawa "
"peran), kategori, lan status."

msgid ""
"Hiding the %label button can cause unexpected issues. If checked, make "
"sure there is another 'Submit button(s)' element in your form."
msgstr ""
"Nyumputake tombol %label bisa nyebabake masalah sing ora dikarepake. "
"Yen wis dipilih, priksa manawa ana unsur 'Tombol Kirim' liyane ing "
"formulirmu."

