msgid "Webform"
msgstr "Webform"

msgid "Default confirmation robots noindex"
msgstr "Konfirmasi default robots noindex"

msgid ""
"If checked, a meta tag robots noindex directive  will be added to the "
"confirmation page of all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Yen dipriksa, directive meta tag robots noindex bakal ditambahake ing "
"kaca konfirmasi saka kabeh webform."

msgid "Webform submissions can only be unlocked programmatically."
msgstr "Pengiriman webform mung bisa dibukak kunci kanthi cara program."

msgid ""
"An error occurred while trying to validate the submission. Please save "
"your work and reload this page."
msgstr ""
"Ana kesalahan nalika nyoba mriksa validitas kiriman. Mangga simpen "
"pakaryanmu lan muat ulang kaca iki."

msgid "@label (Users, custom email addresses, Administrators)"
msgstr "@label (Pangguna, alamat email khusus, Administrator)"

msgid ""
"If you enjoy and value Drupal and the Webform module consider <a "
"href=\":href_involved\">getting involved in the Drupal community</a>, "
"<a href=\":href_join\">joining the Drupal Association</a>, and <a "
"href=\":href_opencollective\">contributing funds to the Webform "
"module's Open Collective</a>."
msgstr ""
"Yen sampeyan seneng lan ngregani Drupal lan modul Webform, coba <a "
"href=\":href_involved\">melu melu ing komunitas Drupal</a>, <a "
"href=\":href_join\">gabung karo Asosiasi Drupal</a>, lan <a "
"href=\":href_opencollective\">nyumbang dana menyang Open Collective "
"modul Webform</a>."

msgid "This behavior is not supported when Ajax is enabled."
msgstr "Tingkah laku iki ora didhukung nalika Ajax diaktifake."

msgid ""
"If checked, the browser back button will submit the previous page and "
"navigate back emulating the behavior of user clicking a wizard or "
"preview page's back button."
msgstr ""
"Yen dicenthang, tombol bali browser bakal ngirim kaca sadurunge lan "
"bali kanthi niru prilaku pangguna nalika ngeklik tombol bali ing "
"wizard utawa kaca pratinjau."

msgid "@name must be %max @type but is currently %length @type long."
msgstr "@name kudu %max @type nanging saiki dawane %length @type."

msgid "@name must be at least %min @type but is currently %length @type long."
msgstr ""
"@name kudu paling ora %min @type nanging saiki duwé dawa %length "
"@type."

