"dikirim."

msgid ""
"The <em>Context</em> module lets users define conditions for when "
"certain reactions should take place."
msgstr ""
"Modul <em>Context</em> ngidini pangguna nemtokake kahanan kapan "
"tanggapan tartamtu kudu kedadeyan."

msgid ""
"An example of a condition could be when viewing a certain node type "
"and blocks should be placed as a reaction when viewing a page with "
"this node type."
msgstr ""
"Conto saka sawijining kondisi bisa dadi nalika ndeleng jinis node "
"tartamtu lan blok-blok kudu dipasang minangka reaksi nalika ndeleng "
"kaca kanthi jinis node iki."

msgid "Managing Context"
msgstr "Ngatur Konteks"

msgid ""
"Users with <em>Administer contexts</em> permission can add contextual "
"conditions and reactions for different portions of their site. For "
"each context, they can choose the conditions that trigger this context "
"to be active and choose different aspects of their site that should "
"react to this active context."
msgstr ""
"Panganggo sing duwe ijin <em>Ngatur konteks</em> bisa nambah syarat "
"kontekstual lan reaksi kanggo bagean-bagean situs sing beda. Kanggo "
"saben konteks, dheweke bisa milih syarat sing nyebabake konteks iki "
"dadi aktif lan milih aspek-aspek situs sing kudu nanggapi konteks "
"aktif iki."

msgid "Adding new custom reactions"
msgstr "Nambah reaksi khusus anyar"

msgid ""
"Reactions for the context module are defined trough the new <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/developing/api/8/plugins\">Drupal 8 "
"Plugin API</a>."
msgstr ""
"Reaksi kanggo modul konteks ditemtokake liwat <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/developing/api/8/plugins\">Drupal 8 "
"Plugin API</a> sing anyar."

msgid ""
"The Context module defines a plugin type named ContextReaction that "
"users can extend when creating their own plugins."
msgstr ""
"Modul Context nemtokake jinis plugin sing diarani ContextReaction sing "
"bisa diperluas dening pangguna nalika nggawe plugin dhewe."

msgid ""
"A context reaction requires a configuration form and execute method. "
"The execution of the plugin is also something that will have to be "
"handled by the author of the reaction."
msgstr ""
"Reaksi konteks mbutuhake formulir konfigurasi lan metode eksekusi. "
"Eksekusi plugin uga dadi perkara sing kudu diatur dening pangripta "
"reaksi kasebut."

