msgid ""
"Set this context on the basis of other active contexts. Put each "
"context on a separate line. The condition will pass if <em>any</em> of "
"the contexts are active. You can use the <code>*</code> character "
"(asterisk) as a wildcard and the <code>~</code> character (tilde) to "
"prevent this context from activating if the listed context is active. "
"Other contexts which use context conditions can not be used to exclude "
"this context from activating."
msgstr ""
"Setel konteks iki adhedhasar konteks aktif liyane. Saben konteks "
"dilebokake ing baris kapisah. Kahanan bakal lolos yen <em>salah "
"siji</em> saka konteks kasebut aktif. Sampeyan bisa nggunakake "
"karakter <code>*</code> (asterisk) minangka wildcard lan karakter "
"<code>~</code> (tilde) kanggo nyegah konteks iki saka aktif yen "
"konteks sing didaftar aktif. Konteks liyane sing nggunakake kahanan "
"konteks ora bisa digunakake kanggo ngeculake konteks iki supaya ora "
"aktif."

