msgid ""
"Exclude individual content that has the Robots meta tag with "
"<em>Prevents search engines from indexing this page</em>."
msgstr ""
"Aja kalebu isi individu sing nduweni tag meta Robots kanthi "
"<em>Nglanggar mesin telusur kanggo ora ngindeks kaca iki</em>."

msgid ""
"The minimum amount of time that will elapse before the sitemaps are "
"regenerated. The sitemaps will also only be regenerated on cron if any "
"links have been added, updated, or deleted.<br />Recommended value: "
"<em>1 day</em>."
msgstr ""
"Wektu minimal sing bakal kliwat sadurunge sitemap dibangun maneh. "
"Sitemap uga mung bakal dibangun maneh nalika cron yen ana pranala sing "
"wis ditambahake, dianyari, utawa dihapus.<br />Nilai sing disaranake: "
"<em>1 dina</em>."

msgid ""
"Exclude individual items that has the Robots meta tag set to "
"<em>Prevents search engines from indexing this page</em>."
msgstr ""
"Kecualèkaké barang siji-siji sing nduwèni tag meta Robots disetel "
"menyang <em>Njaga mesin telusur ora ngindeks kaca iki</em>."

msgid ""
"Note this will ignore default metatags, only when items have "
"overridden the Robots meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Cathetan iki bakal nglirwakake metatag standar, mung nalika item wis "
"ngowahi tag meta Robots."

msgid ""
"This can be disabled if other methods are being used to generate the "
"sitemap files, i.e. the <code>drush xmlsitemap:regenerate</code> "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Iki bisa dipateni yen cara liya digunakake kanggo nggawe file sitemap, "
"contone perintah <code>drush xmlsitemap:regenerate</code>."

msgid ""
"XML Sitemap automatically creates a sitemap that conforms to the "
"sitemaps.org specification. This helps search engines keep their "
"search results up to date."
msgstr ""
"XML Sitemap sacara otomatis nggawe sitemap sing cocog karo spesifikasi "
"sitemaps.org. Iki mbantu mesin panelusur supaya asil panelusuran tetep "
"dianyari."

msgid ""
"You can adjust the settings for your site's sitemap at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap. Your can view your site's sitemap at "
"http://yoursite.com/sitemap.xml."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nyetel setelan kanggo sitemap situs sampeyan ing "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap. Sampeyan bisa ndeleng sitemap situs "
"sampeyan ing http://yoursite.com/sitemap.xml."

msgid ""
"When is necessary you can rebuild your sitemap at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/rebuild."
msgstr ""
"Nalika perlu, sampeyan bisa mbangun maneh sitemap panjenengan ing "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/rebuild."

msgid ""
"You can configure all Custom Entities Settings at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/entities/settings"
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bisa nyetel kabeh Setelan Entitas Khusus ing "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/entities/settings"

msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that you have clean URLs enabled for this "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Disaranake banget supaya sampeyan ngaktifake URL sing resik kanggo "
"proyek iki."

msgid ""
"This action rebuilds your site's XML Sitemap and regenerates the "
"cached files, and may be a lengthy process. If you just installed XML "
"Sitemap, this can be helpful to import all your site's content into "
"the sitemap. Otherwise, this should only be used in emergencies."
msgstr ""
"Tindakan iki mbangun maneh XML Sitemap situs sampeyan lan nggawe ulang "
"file cache, lan bisa dadi proses sing dawa. Yen sampeyan anyar wae "
"masang XML Sitemap, iki bisa migunani kanggo ngimpor kabeh isi situs "
"menyang sitemap. Saliyane, iki kudu mung digunakake ing kahanan "
"darurat."

msgid ""
"XML Sitemap settings have been modified and the files should be "
"regenerated. You can <a href=\"@run-cron\">run cron manually</a> to "
"regenerate the cached files."
msgstr ""
"Setelan XML Sitemap wis diowahi lan file-file kudu digawe maneh. "
"Sampeyan bisa <a href=\"@run-cron\">mbukak cron kanthi manual</a> "
"kanggo nggawe maneh file-file sing wis disimpen ing cache."

msgid ""
"One or more problems were detected with your XML Sitemap "
"configuration: @messages"
msgstr ""
"Siji utawa luwih masalah wis dideteksi karo konfigurasi XML Sitemap "
"panjenengan: @messages"

msgid ""
"Creates an XML Sitemap conforming to the <a "
"href=\"http://sitemaps.org/\">sitemaps.org protocol</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nggawe XML Sitemap sing cocog karo <a "
"href=\"http://sitemaps.org/\">protokol sitemaps.org</a>."

msgid ""
"Configure XML Sitemap settings, select which links are included in "
"sitemap."
msgstr "Atur setelan XML Sitemap, pilih tautan sing kalebu ing sitemap."

msgid "XML Sitemap entity bundle settings"
msgstr "Setelan bundel entitas XML Sitemap"

msgid "Starting XML Sitemap generation. Memory usage: @memory-peak."
msgstr "Miwiwiti generasi XML Sitemap. Panggunaan memori: @memory-peak."

msgid ""
"Finished XML Sitemap generation in @elapsed. Memory usage: "
"@memory-peak."
msgstr ""
"Rampung nggawe XML Sitemap ing @elapsed. Panggunaan memori: "
"@memory-peak."

msgid ""
"Generated by the <a href=\"@link-xmlsitemap\">Drupal XML Sitemap "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Digawe dening <a href=\"@link-xmlsitemap\">modul Drupal XML "
"Sitemap</a>."

msgid "Label for the XML Sitemap."
msgstr "Label kanggo XML Sitemap."

msgid "There are currently no XML Sitemap contexts available."
msgstr "Saiki ora ana konteks XML Sitemap sing kasedhiya."

msgid "@bundle XML Sitemap settings"
msgstr "@bundle setelan XML Sitemap"

msgid "XML Sitemap settings for the %bundle have been saved."
msgstr "Setelan XML Sitemap kanggo %bundle wis kasimpen."

msgid ""
"A rebuild is not necessary. If you are just wanting to regenerate the "
"XML Sitemap files, you can <a href=\"@link-cron\">run cron "
"manually</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ora perlu mbangun maneh. Yen sampeyan mung pengin nggawe maneh file "
"XML Sitemap, sampeyan bisa <a href=\"@link-cron\">mlakokake cron "
"kanthi manual</a>."

msgid ""
"When enabled, this will add formatting and tables with sorting to make "
"it easier to view the XML Sitemap data instead of viewing raw XML "
"output. Search engines will ignore this."
msgstr ""
"Nalika diaktifake, iki bakal nambah format lan tabel karo penyortiran "
"supaya luwih gampang ndeleng data XML Sitemap tinimbang ndeleng output "
"XML mentah. Mesin telusur bakal nglirwakake iki."

msgid ""
"Subdirectory where the sitemap data will be stored. This folder "
"<strong>must not be shared</strong> with any other Drupal site or "
"install using XML Sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Subdirektori sing bakal nyimpen data sitemap. Folder iki <strong>ora "
"kena dibagi</strong> karo situs Drupal liyane utawa instalasi sing "
"nggunakake XML Sitemap."

msgid "Override XML sitemap link settings"
msgstr "Ngganti setelan pranala sitemap XML"

msgid "Override XML sitemap settings for individual links/entities."
msgstr "Nglampahi setelan XML sitemap kanggo pranala/entitas siji-siji."

